jayadrathayāmalam
tṛtīyaṣaṭkam

(1a)

(oṃ namaḥ śivādibhyo) gurubhyaḥ ।।

vedodgārapratodaṃ pravararadharanaṃ brahmaśīrṣaṃ samudya-
cchitvā pāṇau dadhānā tadarucasumahadghorakaṅkālavīṇām ।
kālākāraprayātairavanujagadidaṃ vādayantī sukālī
viṣṇorudre tadīśo tadarucasuśivo kālanaikāntacaṇḍā ।।

śrutvā dvādaśasāhasraṃ jayadra(thama)dhīśvarī ।
punaḥ provāca viśveśaṃ praṇipatya yathārthavat ।।

devyuvāca ।।

śrutaṃ mayā devadeva taṃtramantrottamottamaṃ ।
sarahasyaṃ mahādīptaṃ suguptaṃ sarvasiddhidam ।।

nimittamāttadeveṃdrasiṃdhūrājā janeśvaraḥ ।
evamuddiśya devā (ye) proktaṃ vistaratastvayā ।।

tatra paya - samaye tvayākhyātaṃ surārcitam ।
yathā brāhmaṇamuddiśya naranārāyaṇārthināṃ ।।

vasiṣṭhahetorbhaga{va}n proktaṃ vakṣyāmi tedhunā ।
kathaṃ brāhmaṇamuddiśya taṃtrametajjayadrathaṃ ।।

vasiṣṭhahetau sampannaṃ naranārāyaṇā(rtha)nāt ।
saṃjñādvayamidaṃ kasmāt taṃtrasyāsya tvayā kṛtam ।।

etadādiśa me deva sarahasyaṃ salakṣaṇaṃ ।
yena niḥsaṃśayo bhūtvā taṃtramākarṇayāmyahaṃ ।।

evamākarṇya sahasāt prabuddhakumudekṣaṇaḥ ।
uvācedaṃ smitajyotsnā bhāsayañjagadīśvaraḥ ।। 4 ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

śṛṇu suśroṇi vakṣyāmi rahasyamidamadbhūtaṃ ।
yathā purātane vṛttaṃ brahmaṇaḥ śāktacodanāt ।।

yathābhāvi priye vastuśaktiṃ vyaktisamīritām ।

(1b)
tattathoddeśanirdeśādbhavaṃtyeva na saṃśaya(ḥ) ।।

nimittamātrametacca brahmā sindhupatistathā ।
tvamahaṃ ca tathā cānye devā munivarāstathā ।।

śaktaya: parameśasya tathā vyaktiṃ prayāṃti hi ।
ākārabhedasampatyā śāstrametadanābhi * (g) ।।

vyaktaṃ tvanugrahārthāya sarvāṇūnāṃ maheśvarā{t} ।
evaṃ sarvāṇi śāstrāṇi guruparvakrameṇa ca ।।

anādirūpāṇyeveha śaktivyaktyāgatāni ca ।
vaktṛśrotrikramo yastu śaktyāveśavaśātsthitaḥ ।।

taccodanānusāreṇa vyaktimāyāṃnyanekadhā ।
śāstrāṇyanādīni sadāśivāt paramakāraṇā{t} ।।

etasmātkāraṇāddevi guruparvakramāvaraḥ ।
nimittaṃ mātramatrārthe pravicāryamanīṣibhiḥ ।।

tasmātsamāveśavaśā(sindhū)rājaṃ pratipriya ।
brahmaṇaśca tathāvyaktaṃ taṃtrametajjayadrathaṃ ।।

vasturonādimacchāstra śivaproktaṃ sanātanaṃ ।
praśnottarapadervākyaiḥ śive naivāvatāritaṃ ।।

svayaṃ śiṣyamukhe chitvā praśnā{n}kurutabhṛ{śan} ।
guruvaktragato bhūtvā praśnāṃ vyākurute svayaṃ ।।

evaṃ kramaḥ samākhyātau mukhyaseko na hetunā ।
vakṣyāmi tava yadvṛttaṃ purā brahmaṇa eva tu ।।

ekadā brahmalokastho brahmā lokeśvaraḥ prabhuḥ ।
devaiḥ sāṅgopani(ṣa)dairvidyāsthānaissamāvṛtaḥ ।।

mahāvibhūtisaṃyukto jñānaniṣṭhaḥ sujājvalaḥ ।
yadṛcchayā tatra {de}vi sākṣāddevīsarasvatī ।।

śivalokādāgatā sā śrutvā māhātmyamuttamaṃ ।
yogeśvaryā devadevi tadbīryabṛhitā satī ।।

(2a)
tāṃ dṛṣṭvā dīptavapuṣā brahmā prāha suhṛṣṭava{t} ।
kutastvamāgatā bhadre tejoyuktā subhāsurā ।।

pradīptā ghoravapuṣā maṃtra - - pabṛṃhitā ।
etadākhyāhi suśroṇi tejokāraṇamadbhutaṃ ।।

evamākarṇya sā devī vāgeśī vāgviśāradā ।
prāha brahmāṇamevoccai śivaloke mayā śrutaṃ ।।

devyā rahasyamatulaṃ yena saṃtuṣṭamānasā ।
āgatāsmi paritṛptā prasādāt pārameśvarā{t} ।।

vyākhyānasamayaṃ tatra varttate pārameśvara ।
evaṃ śrutvā tadā brahmā hṛṣṭaromābhavat priye ।।

tatra gaṃtuṃ matiṃ cakre sabhṛtyā balavāhanaḥ ।
svajñānadarpitātmāsau rathamāśu yuyoja ha ।।

caturosau mahāvedāḥ kṛtvā (svā)ne vasāṃgikāṃ ।
pretodaṃ praṇavaṃ kṛtvā ātmā āccāra - rvasa ।।

pragrahaṃ cātra gāyatrī sāvitrī ca dhvajaṃ varaṃ ।
tābhyāṃ saṃdhitrayāveśaṃ cittavṛttikrameṇa hi ।।

yojya yoktraṃ catu(syā)traṃ tatau yūpamayau jayet ।
tatrāsthito paraṃvṛtyā praṇavaḥ pañcadaivataḥ ।।

upagrahāstathā rasmyo yattadvaibhavamuttamaṃ ।
devadevo jajaṃ sarvaṃ devadevo yuyoja ha ।।

sāṃkhyayogaṃ tathādhyātmaṃ dharaṇākramameva hi ।
heraṇyagarbhaṃ vibhrājaṃ rathadikṣvakarottadā ।।

evaṃ mahārathaṃ divyaṃ nāmnā brahmarathaṃ śubhaṃ ।
prāṇāpāṇo rathe bāhau sa tadā cādyakalpayat ।।

evaṃ devagaṇaiḥ sarvairvaṃdyamānaṃ pitāmahaṃ ।
śriyā paramayā juṣṭamāruroha rathottamaṃ ।।
(2b)
praviveśya tathāsatvaṃ vaibhavaṃ prapitāmahaḥ ।
javamuttamamāsthāya prapayau yatra śaṃkaraḥ ।।

gacchamānassa ca tadā viṣṇulokamupākramaṃ ।
tamo kramayato tasya tejasoṣṭāṃ samāhara{n} ।।

viṣṇureva rathāttasmātmahāmāyāmayaḥ prabhuḥ ।
tatastu gamyamānasya brahmaṇo rathamuttamaṃ ।।

rudralokaṃ yathābhraṣṭaṃ papāta sahasā ttadā ।
tana(yī)kaṃ bhraṣṭavīryaṃ vītāsvaṃ vipratodakaṃ ।।

taṃ dṛṣṭvā naṣṭasaṃkalpaṃ brahmāṇamabhavettadā ।
menire somyamātmānaṃ śaktijñānavivarjitaṃ ।।

mandabhāgyamatho kṛtvā (kṣudhā) ca bhṛ(śaṃ) duḥkhitaḥ ।
dhigastu mama dehena mandabhāgyena sarvadā ।।

yadahaṃ śaktivijñānaṃ na yogyaḥ śastu vaktrage ।
evaṃ saniṃdya cātmānaṃ brahmā lokapitāmahaḥ ।।

tadā suniścitātmāsau vyānenākṛti(mai)śvarīṃ ।
kalpayitvā prapūjyevaṃ stotreṇānena sāṃprataṃ ।।

tutoṣa parameśānaṃ brahmā sarvajagatprabhuṃ ।। ।।

brahmovāca ।।

namaste devadevāya śivāyāvyayamūrttaye ।
mahogrāya pracaṇḍāya trailokyoddharaṇaujase ।।

śuddhahārendudehāya umākāntāya te namaḥ ।
nīlakaṃṭhāya raudrāya rudrāyāvyaktatejase ।।

namo bhairavadehāya śmaśānanilayāya ca ।
galanāya sugūḍhāya guhāvāsāya te namaḥ ।।

hṛdaṃbujodarasthāya parahaṃsasvarūpiṇe ।
mohādvyatītavapuṣe namo nityaṃ kapardine ।।

vedottarāya devāya vedāntāya mahaujase ।
namo dhāmāntarasthāya prāṇāpānarathāya ca ।।

(3a)
sūryāya dhīravapuṣe vyaktāvyaktāya tena saḥ ।
triguṇavyaktadehāya brahmopendraprabho sadā ।।

magnosmi mohagahane saṃsāre ghorasaṅkaṭe ।
nāgādi - śava - ladustare bhavasāgare ।।
manamuddharadeveśa karuṇārasanirbhara ।
saṃsāradāvajalada yāśaplośaikapāvaka ।।

viṣayāśīviṣādagradhvaṃsanaikaguru(tmane) ।
ajñānadhvāntasūryendo mṛtyudhvaṃsasudhādhvaye ।।

vighnāghatimirodāramahāmārttaṇḍamūrttaye ।
pāhi māṃ parameśānaśaraṇāgatavatsala ।।

patitasyātidīnasya trastasya viṣayārṇavā{t} ।
samayācāraluptasya trāṇaṃ kuru vṛṣadhvaja ।।

ajñānato mayā deva rathametatprakalpitaṃ ।
tasmātkṣamasva me deva mūḍhabuddherdurātmanaḥ ।।

evaṃ yāvanmahātejā brahmā stotramudīraya{n} ।
tāvadevāsya sahasāddarśanaṃ śūlapāṇinā ।।

mayā vitīrṇaṃ subhage brahmaṇastuṣṭacetasā ।
uvācohaṃ tatastasya brahmaṇo bhūritejasaḥ ।।

uttiṣṭha padmāsana hemā mohaṃ vrajadaṇḍadhṛ{k} ।
tuṣṭosmi tava deveṃdra stavenānena sāmprataṃ ।।

vada kiṃkaravānyeṣa varādohaṃ tvayi sthitaḥ ।
evamākarṇya sahasā ddaṇḍavaddharaṇīṃ gataḥ ।।

brahmā vaṃvande caraṇau provāca praṇato mama ।
nātha divyo ratho mahyaṃ vinaṣṭaḥ parikalpitaḥ ।।

tena naṣṭena naṣṭosmi sabiṃdasmaparicchadaḥ ।
śuśrūṣaḥ śāktavijñānaṃ āgaccha tvatpadāṃtikaṃ ।।

atimohasamāviṣṭaḥ pramādārddarśitaḥ śiva ।
tasmādrathavaraṃ mahyaṃ mādṛk {dṛ}ṣṭaṃ tathāstu taṃ ।।
(3b)
prasādāttavadeveśa jayo mestu tavāgrataḥ ।
śaktijñānaṃ yogyatāstu śrotuṃ mama maheśvara ।।

evaṃ śrutvā tatastasmai mayā proktaṃ sumadhya(maṃ) ।
satprasādādrathasyāsya jayostu tava sāṃprataṃ ।।

etasmātkīraṇādbrahmaṃ taṃtraṃ tava jayadrathaṃ ।
nāmato vastuto loke svaya vakṣyāmi sāṃprataṃ ।।

śiracchedeti vai (cā)sya saṃjñā cānyā bhaviṣyati ।
evaṃ taṃtravaraṃ maṃtrya gaṇaḥ śāpāttu bhṛṃginaḥ ।।

gaṃdhamādanasaṃkṣustu jayadratha iti śrutaḥ ।
kathayiṣyatyasaṃdehā - - - taṃtramuttamaṃ ।।

madājñayā tu madvakrācchrutvā cātirahasyakaṃ ।
tasmātvamehi mallokaṃ tatra taṃtraṃ vadāmyaham ।।

śāktaṃ rahasya saṃyuktaṃ ghoraṃvā(raghorā)rcitaṃ ।
evaṃ śrutvā mayā sārddhaṃ mallokaṃ cāgatastadā ।।

tatropaviṣṭaḥ sa tadā madagre jagadīśvaraḥ ।
tadā mayā devadevi pūjitaṃ ca gurukramaṃ ।।

prāpyayaṃ cāmṛtaṃ sāraṃ smṛtaṃ tadrāviṇīkulaṃ ।
mudrāṃ tu rāviṇīṃ badhvā smṛtādevī karaṃkiṇī ।।

tadākampata mallokaṃ brahmāṇḍaṃ hūhukaissaha ।
(vavarṣastā)yarūpeṇa gaganāddhavyavāhanaṃ ।।

yāvadevaṃ tāvadeva brahmaṇaḥ paṃcamaṃ śiraḥ ।
bhavedoddhāravajjalaṃ ghoraṃ kalpakṣayopamaṃ ।।

vikarā(ṭṭalaṃmahādaṃṣṭraṃ) matroddharaṇatatparaṃ ।
mahārāvamato kṛtvā tāvaddevī karaṃkiṇī ।।

samāgatā ghoratarā jagatkavalanodyatā ।
pañcavakrā ghoradaṃṣṭrā aṣṭādaśabhujālvaṇā ।।
(4a)
kṣayamārttaṃḍakoṭyābhā bhayasyāpi bhayānakī ।
samāveśavaśādyattadbrahmaṇo nirgataṃ śiraḥ ।।

tamutkṛtvaiva sahasādvedo(ddhā)ravirāvi(ṇī) ।
payorūdhiramevātra devadevī karaṃkiṇī ।।

tadā mayā sā dṛṣṭvaiva bhīmabhītena cetasā ।
stutā sā vividhaistotrairdevadevī kṛśodarī ।।

(tatontarddhāna)magamatparituṣṭā maheśvarī ।
upaśāṃtaṃ mahākṣobhaṃ jagatyasminsudussahaṃ ।।

mayā samāśvasyamānaṃ brahmāṇamamṛtāsavaiḥ ।
kadarthato labhe(tsūkṣmaṃ)divyavarṣaśatena saḥ ।।

tatodatiṣṭhadbrahmāṇaṃ madagre vedapāragaṃ ।
ladhvasaṃjñasya tasyāśu devyā taṃtramanuttamaṃ ।।

sasahaśrākṣarādyantu kathitaṃ viśvadurlabhaṃ ।
mayā tadā devadevī maṃtravīryasamanvitaṃ ।।

śrutvā saṃpūjya māṃ bhaktyā brahmā lokapitāmahaḥ ।
svarlokamagamattuṣṭo pūjyamānaḥ surottamaiḥ ।।

tataḥ prabhṛti kālāśca taṃtrametadanuttamaṃ ।
śiracchedeti vikhyātaṃ jayadrathamiti śrutaṃ ।।

tataḥ kadāciddeveśi śaktipātātsamīritau ।
naranārāyaṇau nāma munīṃdrā bhāvitātmakau ।।

jijñāsū śāktavijñānaṃ tapaṃ ghoraṃ samāsthitau ।
divyaṃ varṣasahasraṃ tu vāyubhakṣo nirāśanau ।।

tadobhābhyāṃ tuṣṭamanā brahmā svayamupāgamaṃ ।
madājñayā devadevi varadaścāgrataḥ sthitaḥ ।।

tayorvṛtastadā brahmā varametadanuttamaṃ ।
yā sahasrākṣarā devī vedāmnāyeṣu gīyate ।।
(4b)
tāmākhyāhi samāsena yathāpūrvaṃ tvayā śrutā ।
evamukte tatastābhyāṃ brahmā lokapitāmahaḥ ।।

ācakhyau devadeveśī yā sahasrākṣarā smṛtā ।
guruśiṣyakrameṇaiva tatastāvāgatau kṣitiṃ ।।

himavatparvate tatra vaśiṣṭhasyāśramaṃ prati ।
saṃcarato tatastatra tadā sa munisattamaḥ ।।

valā(vālā)gataṃ nyastvā pāpātsatvaṃ kumaṃḍale ।
arghapādyaṃ tayordātuṃ samīpaṃ samupāgataḥ ।।

tāvarcya sa munivyāghraṃ prāktanasye namo balān ।
samāviṣṭastadā (bhūmau) tenāpasmṛtinā tadā ।।

taṃ dṛṣṭvā kliṣṭamānantu muninārāyaṇo bhavaṃ ।
kṛpānvito mahābhāgastena pāpena bhūyasā ।।

catuṣṣaṣṭiprakāraṃ taṃ smṛtvā (vi)dyāṃ durāsadāṃ ।
samālokitavāṃ samyaktamṛṣiṃ sa munīśvaraḥ ।।
vināśayāmāsa tasmai samālokanamātmanaḥ ।।

tadā vipāpmā hṛṣṭātmā vasiṣṭhastuṣṭamātmanaḥ ।
vaṃdye tau tu punastatra praṣṭukāmobhyu(kta) vaha ।।

yuṣmatprasādānmuktosmi mahāpāpātsradāruṇā{t} ।
tasmātprasādato mahyamucyatāṃ yadrahasyakaṃ ।।

kena maṃtrabalenāhaṃ bhavadbhiḥ kalmaṣārṇavā ।
vimocitaḥ susaṃtapto kṛpayā munisattamaḥ ।
evamākarṇyato samyagvasiṣṭhādṛṣisattamāḥ ।।

provā(ca) tu yathātathyaṃ devīmaṃtramahārthadaṃ ।
yā sahasrākṣarā devī maṃtravīryopavṛṃhitā ।।

nārāyaṇe tadākhyātā vasiṣṭhāya mahātmane ।
tenaitatpūrvamākhyātaṃ vasiṣṭhotra nimittakaṃ ।।
(5a)
śivohari brahmaṇo yā vasiṣṭhasyādya nāśanī ।
taṃtresmi{n}sā pratijñātā sarahasyā sumadhyame ।।

tridhā padaprabhedena śiracchidi jayadrathe ।
etattava samākhyātaṃ yathāhaṃ coditastvayā ।।

iti sureṃdraśiromaṇicaṃdrikācchuritapādayuge bhavabhāṣitaṃ ।
kimaparaṃ vadava(smya)hamaṃjasā sakalara(mya)taraṃ bhavatārakaṃ ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasiddhividyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale caturviṃśatisāhasre vasiṣṭhābhidhāne tṛtīyaṣaṭke praśnāvatārapūrvapaṭalaḥ prathamaḥ ।।

evamākarṇyagirijā rahasyaṃ parameśvarā{t} ।
punaḥ papraccha deveṃdraṃ kā - maṃtramahārṇavaṃ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

devadeva triśūlāṃka śaraṇāgatavatsale ।
sarvajña sarvaga vibho trailokyatrāṇatatpara ।।

ākhyāhi mama deveśa yā sā brahmaśiro harī ।
ghorā sarvakṣayakarā sahasrākṣaramālitā ।।

yayā na bhūyo śocanti sādhakā mokṣakākṣiṇaḥ ।
sarvvasiddhipradā yā sā taṃtresminprā(k tvayo)ditā ।।

evaṃ śrutvā devadevo gaṃbhīrārthamidaṃ vacaḥ ।
pratyuvāca prahṛṣṭātmā smṛtvā devīṃ kṛśodarīṃ ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

śṛṇu priye pravakṣyāmi vidyākāmadughāparā ।
ghorā brahmāṇḍadalanī brahmaṇo śīrṣahāriṇī ।।

yasyā ghoratarā nānyā vidyate bhuvanodare ।
vāmāpyaiva na śocanti sādhakā vigatāmayāḥ ।।
(5b)
sarvavīryamayā śuddhā sarvamaṃtramayāparā ।
sarvayogamayī sūkṣmā sarvacakkraprabhedinī ।।

sarvamaṃtrogradalanī sarvāstu prativāraṇī ।
sarvasaṃpatpradā śreṣṭhā sarvaduṣkṛtanāśanī ।।

sukhasaubhāgyajananī bhūtāpasmāraghātinī ।
brahmamūṃḍadharī raudrā mahāpretakṛtāsanā ।।

brahmakaṃkālasadvīṇā kālakaṅkālaghaṭṭanaiḥ ।
yāvā dayati viśveśī tāṃ śṛṇuṣva yaśasvini ।।

mātriveśmani giryagre śmaśānetha gṛhottame ।
ācāryaḥ suprasannātmā vīrācāraparāyaṇaḥ ।।

kaṅkālaghṛṣṭāṃ vasudhā mahāsṛgupalepitāṃ ।
kṛtvā puṣpāvakīrṇaṃ tu pañcāmṛtapavitritāṃ ।।

tatra hutimahāyastu madirānaṃdanaṃditaḥ ।
sudhūpitaḥ sutāṃbūlo digdhāsā saṃyateṃdriyaḥ ।।

vajradhāvasthitāṃ pūjyā devadevī karaṃkiṇī ।
prastaredvajragarbhasthāṃ pañcārttā varṇamātri(kā) ।।

caturaśraṃ puraṃ kṛtvā navakoṣṭhavibhājitaṃ ।
dvayaṃ dvayaṃ vilopyeta vāmadakṣiṇagaṃ kramaṃ ।।

yāvatkaṃṭhasthamekaṃ syāttatorddhaṃ tadvadeva ca ।
prāntāsi(tā)grau kurvīta navāṃteṣvatra koṣṭhakau ।।

ekapaṃcāśadevaṃ tu koṣṭhakāssamudāhṛtāḥ ।
evaṃ vajrasya niṣpattistījñāgrasya prakīrttitā ।।

atra varṇavidhirdevi kathamānasya me śṛṇu ।
pūrvāgrau praṇavau deyaṃ sarvamantrānalaṃ śubhaṃ ।।

īśānakoṣṭhādārabhya yāvadvāhnaṃ tu koṣṭhakaṃ ।
ādayo navadeyāni svarāṇi sa mahāṃti vai ।।
(6a)
tasyādho yatra yaḥ koṣṭhāḥ koṇasthā cāruhasini ।
madhyamaṃ varjayitvā tu tathādhogakoṇagāḥ ।।

catvāro koṣṭhakā ye ca teṣāmanyānsvarān li{khet} ।
yāva(tṣo)ḍaśamaṃ devi tato kādyāṃ vilomataḥ ।।

jāntaṃ yāvadvadhūbhāgaṃ navake saṃlikhetkramā{t} ।
uparyuparikoṇeṣu triṣvanyeṣu paritriṣu ।।

ḍhāntaṃ yāvallikheddevi varṇānita tu madhyame ।
tataḥ paṃcaivayaṃ koṣṭhā navadhāḥ saṃvyavasthitāḥ ।।

teṣāṃ likhetkramāddevi ṇādyaṃ dhāntaṃ ca paṃcakaṃ ।
tasyādhaḥ koṇakoṣṭhoya ekāranikaṭe sthitaḥ ।।

nakārastatra dātavyo tudhnetre budhnatastuṣaḥ ।
phakārādīni varṇāni yāntāni kramaśastataḥ ।।

deyāni paṃcakoṣṭhānāṃ (ā)budhnasthānāṃ sumadhyame ।
tasya dakṣiṇa digbhāge ekaṃ koṣṭhagataṃ likhe{t} ।।

ūrddheḍa dakṣapārśvasthau lavavarṇau vilekhayet ।
vasyādhassaṃsamālikhyagra(ntā)haṃ sākṣaraṃ likhe{t} ।।

tasya budhnemṛtaṃ śa(śva)tpaścāsraukṣasamālikhe{t} ।
mātṛkāvajramevaṃ syātsarvavarṇavibhūṣitaṃ ।।

saṃpūjya vidhivacchaktyā suramāṃsāsavādibhiḥ ।
sarvavīropacāreṇa tato vidyāṃ samuddharet ।।

acchidraṃ kalpayitvā tu jagataḥ saparicchade ।
pūrvvaśṛṃgāgragaṃ cādau proddharetparameśvari ।।

vajragraṃthitataḥ paścāccaturthapūrvvamālayā ।
sadakṣiṇamathoddhṛtya tadayena vibhūṣitaṃ ।।

varṇasūryapurākāraṃ dvitīyaṃ parikīrttitaṃ ।
adhasthānāṃtakāddevi vāyukoṇastha muddhare{t} ।।
(6b)
nairṛtasthena tadyuktaṃ tṛtīyaṃ varṇanāyakaṃ ।
padametanmahāraudraṃ trailokyakṣayakārakaṃ ।।

vajragranthiṃ punardeyaṃ tasyā(dya)sthaṃ mahābalaṃ ।
tasyādhasthena sahitaṃ pūrvātūryavibhūṣitaṃ ।।

phāntena bhūṣitaṃ mūrddhnā piṇḍaṃ sūryāyutopamaṃ ।
aṃkārasyādyamuddhṛtya sakārasyādyaśīrṣagaṃ ।।

sānte saṃpuṭitaṃ kṛtvā bījamatyantadāruṇaṃ ।
aṃkārasya punaścādyaṃ sāntrasthaṃ kuru bhairavi ।।

nāntena lāñchitaṃ mūddhnī phāntenaiva vibhūṣitaṃ ।
piṃḍametatsamākhyātaṃ kṣaṇādāveśakārakaṃ ।।

punarvāyusthamāhāryamadhasthanavakātpriye ।
na nairṛtevasaṃyuktaṃ varṇametaddurāsadaṃ ।।

punareva tathā de(va) aṃkārādyaṃ punardadet ।
nāntena saṃyutaṃ mūrddhā punarvāntaṃ dadetkramā{t} ।।

sādyasasvaramevādya deyaṃ mantraprapūraṇaṃ ।
saptākṣaraṃ padaṃ hyetaṃ dvitīyaṃ sarvvagha(ṭṭa)naṃ ।।

punarvāntaṃ tu nāntena yuktaṃ deyaṃ vipaścitaiḥ ।
vajramadhyaṃ tato deyaṃ yāntasyopari saṃsthitaṃ ।।

sāntena bhūṣitaṃ budhyātpurvāturyeṇa lāñchitaṃ ।
phā(ntenā)malitaṃ kṛtvā piṃḍaṃ māyāntaḍhāhūna ।।

vāntamuddhṛtya deveśi sādyasyopari saṃsthitaṃ ।
sāntena sampuṭīkṛtya piṇḍaṃ kālānalopamaṃ ।।

vajramadhyaṃ (puna)rddeyaṃ pūrvācchaṣṭhasamanvitaṃ ।
phāntena saṃyutaṃ mūrddhādbījakālānalāntakaṃ ।।

dhāntaṃ punastato deyaṃ māntasasvaramuddhare{t} ।
pañcākṣaraṃ padaṃ ghoraṃ tṛtīyaṃ parikīrttitaṃ ।।
(7a)
yādyamuddhṛtya deveśi (sā)ntasthaṃ ca mahābalaṃ ।
mūrddhāccaturthasahitaṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

punarvāntaṃ samuddhṛtya sādyasasvaramuddhare{t} ।
dvyakṣaraṃ padametaddhi caturthaṃ viśrakālanaṃ ।।

aṃkārādya punarddeyaṃ nāntenaiva vibhūṣitaṃ ।
phāntena citritaṃ mūrddhnā bījaṃ kālāgnivarcasaṃ ।।

(ṭaḍā)madhyasamuddhṛtya thādyasthaṃ tatprakalpaye(t) ।
śāntasthaṃ kalpayitvā tu punarjhāntaṃ sthitaṃ kuru ।
pūrvvā dvitīyaśirasaṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

vāntaṃ sādyaṃ cāsvarasyātpadaṃ brahmāṇḍapātanaṃ ।
tryarṇamahāghoravaraṃ devatrāsanatatparaṃ ।।

vajrāṇḍaṃ yojayedbhūyo pūrvaṣaṣṭhasthitaṃ maha{t} ।
phāntena citritaṃ kṛtvā (chā)dyaṃ paścātsamuddharet ।।

kāntena saṃyutaṃ kāryaṃ punarvāntaṃ samuddharet ।
śāntena sampuṭaṃ kṛtvā sādyasasvaramuddhare{t} ।।

tryarṇaṃ ṣaṣṭhaṃ padaṃ ghoraṃ daityavijñāvaṇātmakaṃ ।
kādyakāntaṃ samāpraktaṃ varṇasarvakṣayāvahaṃ ।।

tameva śāntasaṃrūḍhaṃ jāntayukpūrvaṣaṣṭhakaṃ ।
phāntena citritaṃ kṛtvā piṇḍaṃ mārttaṇḍabhakṣakaṃ ।।

vāntaṃ śāntaṃ puṭaṃ kṛtvā sādyasasvarameva tat ।
tryarṇaṃ saptasamuddiṣṭaṃ padaṃ sūryāṃṇḍapātanaṃ ।।

pūrvāśrigaṃ punarbhūyo paścimāśrigataṃ punaḥ ।
pūrvādvitīyasahitaṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

chādyaṃ tu kevalaṃ bhūyo yāntāburddhādhasaṃsthitau ।
vāntapūrvaṃ tṛtīyāṅkaṃ yāntadeyaṃ punaḥ priye ।।

sāntena mastakākrāntaṃ vajrāṇḍaṃ nāntasaṃyutaṃ ।
(7b)
dhāntasyānte sādyavarṇaṃ sasvaraṃ kuru bhairavi ।।

padamaṣṭaṃ samuddiṣṭaṃ sarvabrahmāṇḍamohakaṃ ।
aṣṭārṇaṃ devadeveśi sarvasaubhāgyavarddhanaṃ ।।

māntantu kevalaṃ dadyāllāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
jāṃtau vilomasampiṃḍau khāntaṃ (ḍā)ntasthitaṃ kuru ।।

pūrvvatṛtīyakhacitaṃ vajrāṃḍaṃ punaruddharet ।
śāntasthaṃ pūrvavatkuryā phāṃtenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

dhānte sādyasasvaraṃ syātpadaṃ navasamuddhṛtaṃ ।
ṣaḍakṣaraṃ mahāghoraṃ saṃsārocchedakaṃ smṛtaṃ ।।

yāntamuddhṛtya varṇeśaṃ phāntabhūṣitaśīrṣakaṃ ।
khāntaṃ samuddharedbhūyo śāntasthaṃ sāntabhūṣitaṃ ।।

phāntena citritaṃ kuryādbījaṃ trailokyakarṣakaṃ ।
asyādyaṃ punaruddhṛtya yāntaṃ sāntasamanvitaṃ ।।

vajrāṇḍaṃ punaruddhṛtya cāntaṃ pūrvatribhūṣitaṃ ।
abhyāsādyaṃ punardeyaṃ vajrāṇḍaṃ nāntasaṃyutaṃ ।।

vāntaṃ sāntapuṭaṃ datvā sādyasasvaramuddhare{t} ।
daśamaṃ padamuddiṣṭaṃ navārṇaṃ viśvamohakaṃ ।।

punarvajrāṇḍamuddhṛtya yāntasthaṃ pūrvapaṃcamaṃ ।
kāntena bhūṣitaṃ kṛtvā piṇḍaṃ tatveśvarāntakaṃ ।।

asyādyaṃ tu punardeyaṃ varṇakālāntakopamaṃ ।
padamekādaśaṃ jñeyaṃ dvyakṣaraṃ ghoramuttamaṃ ।।

ṭaḍaumadhyaṃ samuddhṛtya sāntaṣaṣṭhavibhūṣitaṃ ।
phāntaṃ saṃcitritaṃ kuryāt vāntasādyaṃ tu cāsvaraṃ ।।

dvādaśaṃ padamatyugraṃ dvyarṇaṃ caṃdrasya kīlanaṃ ।
māntamuddhṛtya deveśi pūrvapañcamasaṃsthitaṃ ।।

phāntena bhūṣitaṃ kṛtvā punareva tathā kuru ।
(8a)
bhūyastathāvidhaṃ deyaṃ kiṃtu lāñchanavarjitaṃ ।।

ṇaḍantasthau piṇḍabhūtau nāṃtenoparibhūṣitau ।
vāntaṃ dade(cca) tasyādyaṃ nirjīvaṃ parameśvari ।।

paṃcārṇṇapadamuddiṣṭaṃ trayodaśamidaṃ mahat ।
ṭaḍau madhyaṃ thādimasthaṃ sāntasāntasthitaṃ kuru ।।

pūrvadvitīyakhacitaṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
ādyapiṇḍasya pa(ñcā)dyaṃ taṃ bhūyopi samuddharet ।।

dvyakṣaraṃ padamuddiṣṭaṃ caturdaśamidaṃ mayā ।
devāsuranarāntānāṃ mantrānāṃ trāsanaṃ mahat ।।

punarvajrāṃḍamadhyasthaṃ pūrvapaṃcamasaṃsthitaṃ ।
phāntena bhūṣitaṃ mūrddhnā asyādyaṃ punaruddharet ।।

dvyakṣaraṃ padametaddhi sarvapātāladāraṇaṃ ।
daśapaṃcasamuddiṣṭaṃ ṣaṭcakkrapravikāśakaṃ ।।

gakamadhyaṃ punardatvā kāntena paridīpitaṃ ।
asyādyamuddharedbhūyo dvyakṣaraṃ ṣoḍaśe padaṃ ।।

vaaṃmadhyaṃ punardadyānnāntaphāntavibhūṣita ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ sāntasahitaṃ pūrvaturyasaphāṃtimaṃ ।।

sāntaṃ vānte piṇḍabhūtaṃ sādyasasvaramuddhare{t} ।
tryarṇṇasaptadaśaṃ jñeyaṃ padaṃ māyā prapāṭanaṃ ।।

yāntaṃ samuddhareddevi vajrāṃḍaṃ āntasaṃyutaṃ ।
chaṅaṃmadhyaṃ punarddeyaṃ ḍhāntaṃ lādyasamanvitaṃ ।।

sāntaṃ māntasamāyuktaṃ ghakhamadhyaṃ samuddhare{t} ।
nāṃtena lāṃchitaṃ mūrddhnā rāntaṃ lāntavibhūṣitaṃ ।।

sāntapūrvatṛtīyāṅkaṃ vāntaṃ sāntena lāñchitaṃ ।
mādyaṃ nirjīvamuddhṛtya padamaṣṭādaśaṃ smṛtaṃ ।।

navārṇaṃ ghoravapuṣaṃ sadāyogeśvarārcitaṃ ।
thādyaṃ samuddharetpūrvaṃ sāntaṃ turyavibhūṣitaṃ ।।

(8b)
phāntena bhūṣitaṃ mūrddhnā asyādyaṃ punaruddhare ।
unaviṃśatimaṃ varṇaṃ padametadurāsadaṃ ।।

jhaḍaumadhyaṃ samuddhṛtya sāntaṃ turyavibhūṣitaṃ ।
phāntaṃ saṃbhūṣitaṃ kṛtvā cāsya pūrvaṃ punardade{t} ।।

padaṃ viśatimaṃ jñeyaṃ dvyakṣaraṃ ghoradāruṇa ।
tadamadhyaṃ samuddhṛtya pūrvavallāchitaṃ kuru ।।

pūrvapātaṃ punardeyaṃ punarlāchanavarjitaṃ ।
tryakṣaraṃ ghoramuddiṣṭaṃ padaṃ viṃśaikasaṃjñitaṃ ।।

vajrāṃḍapiṇḍaṃ sāntasthaṃ turyakāṃtavibhūṣitaṃ ।
punarvajrāṇḍamuddhṛtya nāntanoparibhūṣitaṃ ।।

gakamadhyaṃ punardatvā saśamadhyaṃ punardadet ।
punarvajrāṇḍapiṃḍaṃ tu nāṃtenoparibhūṣitaṃ ।।

ṭhaemadhyaṃ kevalaṃ syāḍḍatamadhyaṃ (sa)saṃyutaṃ ।
vāntaṃ sāntāṅkitaṃ kṛtvā sādyasasvaramuddhare{t} ।।

dvāviṃśatimametaddhi padaṃ rāvakuleśvaraṃ ।
aṣṭavarṇṇaṃ samuddiṣṭaṃ brahmāṇḍaśataghaṭṭane ।।

vajrāṃḍapiṇḍaṃ tu puna{ḥ} sāntaṃ caiva dvidhā punaḥ ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ phāntasaṃyuktaṃ vajragraṃthiṃ saṣaṣṭhakaṃ ।।

phāntayuktaṃ dvidhā kāryaṃ chādyakāntena bhūṣitaṃ ।
iaṃ madhyasāntayuktaṃ taṃ ca nirjīvamuddharet ।।

tridhā kṛtvā padaṃ devi trayoviṃśamudāhṛtaṃ ।
brahmāṃḍakaṃpanaṃ ghoraṃ daśārṇaṃ parikīrttitaṃ ।।

gacchamadhyaṃ punadeyaṃ nāṃtarivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
punastameva varṇeśaṃ phāṃtenaiva vibhūṣitaṃ ।।

vajrāṃḍaṃ nāntasaṃyuktaṃ yādyaṃ phāntavicitritaṃ ।
dvidhā kṛtvā sureśāni tṛtīyaṃ āntacitritaṃ ।।
(9a)
vaemadhyaṃ samuddhṛtya pūrvā tṛtayasaṃyutaṃ ।
dhāntasāntāṅkitaṃ kṛtvā sādyaṃ nirjīvamuddhare{t} ।।

caturviṃśatimaṃ jñeyaṃ padaṃ ca svarṇamujjalaṃ ।
punarvajrāṃḍamuddhṛtya saṣaṣṭhaṃ phāntabhūṣitaṃ ।।

vāntaṃ sāntāṅkitaṃ deyasādyaṃ nirjīvamuddharet ।
punastamuddhareddevi paṃcaviṃśaṃ padaṃ smṛtaṃ ।।

tryakṣaraṃ paramaṃ proktaṃ trailokyaiśvaryadāyakaṃ ।
pūrvātprathamamuddhṛtya vāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃ kuru ।।

pūrvatṛtayasaṃyuktaṃ punarllāntaṃ tu nāntagaṃ ।
vāntaṃ sāntāṅkitaṃ bhūyā sādyaṃ nirjīvamuddhare{t} ।।

ṣaḍviṃśatimaye taddhi caturarṇaṃ mahāpadaṃ ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ sāntaṃ turyaṅkaṃ phāṃtenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

vāntaṃ sādyaṃ tu nirjīvaṃ saptāviṃśaṃ padottamaṃ ।
dvyarṇaṃ mahābalaṃ proktaṃ sādātrailokyaḍāmaraṃ ।।

gakamadhyaṃ varṇṇavaraṃ mādyāsāntasthitaṃ kuru ।
turyaphāntagataṃ murddhnā vāntaṃ sāṃtāṅkitaṃ punaḥ ।।

sādyaṃ nirjīvamuddhṛtya evaṃ devi dvidhā dadet ।
yabhamadhyaṃ ca vajrāṃḍaṃ pūrvāddvitayabhūṣitaṃ ।।

yabhamadhyaṃ dvitīyāṅkaṃ sāntatṛtayacitritaṃ ।
vāntasāntahataṃ kṛtvā sādyaṃ nirjīvamuddharet ।।

aṣṭāviṃśapadaṃ jñeyaṃ vasvarṇaṃ viśvanāśanaṃ ।
vāntaṃ punaḥ samuddhṛtya sādyaṃ khāntasamanvitaṃ ।।

pūrvāntasaṃyutaṃ kṛtvā sāntatṛtayalāñchitaṃ ।
ḍhatamadhyaṃ mathoddhṛtya pūrvatṛtayaśobhitaṃ ।।

chādyaṃ kāṃtayutaṃ deyaṃ vāntaṃ sāṃtāṃkitaṃ punaḥ ।
sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ deyaṃ ṣaṭvarṇaṃ padanāyakaṃ ।।

ekonatriṃśamaṃ jñeyaṃ codanāstrasya jīvitaṃ ।
(9b)
lanamadhyaṃ samuddhṛtya sāśamadhyaṃ samuddhare{t} ।
caghamadhyaṃ samuddhṛtya khādyaṃstha tatprakīrttitaṃ ।।

vāntasāṃtau tato deyau punarvāntatadantayu(k) ।
vāntaṃ sāntahataṃ deyaṃ sādyaṃ nirjīvamuddhare{t} ।।

triṃśatsaṃkhyākamevaṃ syāt padaṃ sarvārthasiddhidaṃ ।
saptākṣarasamākhyātaṃ punarvāntaṃ samuddhare{t} ।।

ḍhāntaṃ lādyaṃ tathā ṇādyaṃ nāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
punarlāñchanahīnaṃ tadvāntaṃ sāntāṃkitaṃ punaḥ ।।

nirjīvaṃ sādyamuddhṛtya caturarṇaikatriśamaṃ ।
padametatsamākhyātaṃ saptāṃbhānidhiśoṣakaṃ ।
gakamadhyaṃ kevalaṃ syāntaṃ sāntasthaṃ ca sāntagaṃ ।।

phāntena cihnitaṃ murddhnāṃ punarādyaṃ tathā dadet ।
pañcamaṃ ḍavamadhyaṃ ca khāṃtaṃ mādyadvayāṃkitaṃ ।।

yabhamadhyaṃ paṃcamasthaṃ gakamadhyaṃ tricihnitaṃ ।
pūrvaṃ tu kevalaṃ deyaṃ ḍhatamadhyaṃ tricihnitaṃ ।।

chaṅamadhyaṃ kevalaṃ ca bhaghamadhyantataḥ {punaḥ} ।
sthitaṃ khāntapaṃcamaṃ ca ḍhatamadhyaṃ trayāṃkitaṃ ।।

sāntaṃ paṃcamasaṃrūḍhaṃ ṣāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ kuru ।
sāntaṃ dvayāṃkitaṃ kāryaṃ chādyaṃ sāntena bhūṣitaṃ ।।

rāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃ kuryāccāntaṃ tṛtayacihnitaṃ ।
taṃ paṃcamasthitaṃ kuryā{t}vādyaṃ sāntasthitaṃ dviyuk ।।

ḍhatamadhyaṃ dvitīyāṃkaṃ vāntaṃ sāntapuṭaṃ kuru ।
sānirjīvamevātra dvātriṃśaṃ padamuttamaṃ ।।

rudrāṃḍapātanaṃ ghoraṃ dvātriṃśatyakṣarānvitaṃ ।
vajragrathiṃ saṣaṣṭhaṃ ca phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

ṭhāntaṃ sāntāṃkitaṃ sādyaṃ sajīvaṃ taddvidhā bhavet ।
(10a)
tryakṣaraṃ syāttrayastriṃśaṃ padametanmahābalaṃ ।।

vāntaṃ nāntena saṃyuktaṃ khāntaṃ ca dvipuraṃ dadet ।
pūrvvāddvitayasaṃyuktaṃ sāntaṃ trisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।।

yabhamadhyadvitīyākaṃ tatpūrvamatha co(ddha)re{t} ।
vāntaṃ sāntaṃ puṭaṃ kṛtvā sādyaṃ nirjīvamuddhare{t} ।।

catustriṃśatimaṃ deyaṃ ṣaṭvarṇaṃ mārakaṃ padaṃ ।
vajrāṃḍaṃ nāṃtakhacitaṃ vāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃ kuru ।।

pāntenaiva śirākrāntaṃ punarvāntaṃ sasāntakaṃ ।
nāntena cihnitaṃ mūrddhnā punareva dade(cca) taṃ ।।

rāntaṃ vāntaṃ punardadyātkhāntaṃ dvitayabhūṣitaṃ ।
ḍāntaṃ samuddharedbhūyo khāntaṃ sāntaṃ tataḥ punaḥ ।।

caghamadhyaṃ khāntarūḍhaṃ bhapamadhyaṃ sapaṃcamaṃ ।
gāntaṃ tritayasaṃyuktaṃ punargāntaṃ sakāntagaṃ ।।

vāntaṃ sādyaṃ ca nirjīvaṃ daśapaṃcākṣaraṃ padaṃ ।
pañcatriśaṃtimaṃ ghoraṃ brahmāṃḍakavalolvanaṃ ।।

vajrāṇḍaṃ ṣaṣṭhamaṃ yuktaṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
vāntaṃ sādyaṃ ca nirjīvaṃ ṣaṭtriśaṃ dvyakṣaraṃ padaṃ ।।

gakamadhyaṃ samuddhṛtya ḍavamadhyaṃ saṣaṣṭhagaṃ ।
dhāntatṛtīyakhacitaṃ vāntaṃ sādyamajīvakaṃ ।।

turyarṇaṃ saptatriṃśaṃ sā(stya)dametaddurāsadam ।
pūrvātsaptamamuddhṛtya dhāntaṃ māntaṃ samuddharet ।।

pūrvātpadādādyabhūtaṃ varṇaṃ trayamathoddharet ।
vāntaṃ samuddharedbhūyo ḍāntaṃ ghāntasapaṃcamaṃ ।।

śāṃtaṃ dvitayasaṃyuktaṃ thādyaṃ sāntasthitaṃ kuru ।
nāntena cihnitaṃ kuryātkhāntaṃ dvitayabhūṣitaṃ ।।

ḍāntaṃ samuddharedbhūyo sāntaṃ dvitayabhūṣitaṃ ।
(10b)
thādyasāntasthitaṃ bhūyo tṛtīyena samanvitaṃ ।।

dvidhā kuryātpadaṃ caitaccaturakṣaramuttamaṃ ।
gāntaṃ samuddharedbhūyo lādyaṃ ghāntasthitaṃ kuru ।।

nāntena saṃyutaṃ kṛtvā dvidhā kuryātpadottamaṃ ।
khāntaṃ samuddhareddevi ḍāntaṃ punarapi priye ।।

dvidhā kuryātpade caitatpañcamaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
jaṅāṃto piṃḍabhūtau calāntasthaṃ dvitayāṅkitaṃ ।।

ṭaḍaumadhyagataṃ yojya gāntaṃ tadanudāpaye(t) ।
ḍāntaṃ samuddharedbhūyo ṣaṣṭhasthaṃ parameśvari ।।

ḍhāntaṃ tṛtīyaśirasaṃ punaṣṭhāṃtaṃ tu kevalaṃ ।
sādyaṃ mādyena saṃyuktaṃ sānte naivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

ghāntaṃ tricitritaṃ kuryāḍḍhāntaṃ turyāṅkitaṃ kuru ।
rayamadhyaṃ samuddhṛtya lāṃtasyopari suṃdari ।।

sāntaṃ tribiṃdukhacitaṃ vāntaṃ sāntāṃkitaṃ kuru ।
sādya nirjīvamuddhṛtya padametanmaholvanaṃ ।।

catvāriṃśattathekonā varṇāṣṭātriṃśasaṃsmṛtaṃ ।
chādyaṃ samuddhareddevi punastaṃ phāṃtacitritaṃ ।।

khādyaṃ sāntasthitaṃ deyaṃ kāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
vāntaṃ sāntapuṭaṃ deyaṃ sādyaṃ nirjīvamuddharet ।।

ekonaṃ devadeveśi catvāriṃśatimaṃ smṛtaṃ ।
caturakṣarametatsyātsarvasiddhipradaṃ padaṃ ।।

yabhamadhyasamuddhṛtya vajrāṃḍaṃ dvitayāṃkitaṃ ।
māntaṃ samuddharedbhūyo ṣāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

sāntaṃ lāntaṃ punardeyaṃ tṛtīyāṃkitamūrddhajaṃ ।
asya varṇa{sya} yaṃpūrvapunareva samuddhare{t} ।।

lāntaṃ nāṃtena saṃyuktaṃ rāntaṃ lāṃtasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
sāntaṃ tritayasaṃyuktaṃ vāntaṃ sāntavibhūṣitaṃ ।।
(11a)
sādyaṃ nirjīvamuddhṛtya rudrārṇṇaṃ padamuddhṛtaṃ ।
catvāriṃśatimaṃ ghoraṃ mahābhairavapūjitaṃ ।।

dāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ bhūyo turyāṅkaphāṃtacihnitaṃ ।
sāntaṃ syātkevalaṃ bhūyo ḍhāntaṃ lādyasthitaṃ kuru ।।

punarsāntaṃ dvitīyāṃkaṃ chādyaṃ trisvarabhūṣitaṃ ।
ḍāntaṃ sāntapuṭaṃ sādyaṃ nirjīvaṃ ca ṣaḍakṣaraṃ ।।

catvāriṃśaikasaṃyuktaṃ padaṃ paṃcasurāntakaṃ ।
vāntaṃ nāntena saṃyuktaṃ chādyaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

sāntaṃ nāntena saṃyuktaṃ chādyaṃ ṣāṃtāṅkitaṃ kuru ।
yabhamadhyasthitaṃ devi tṛtīyasvaralāṃchitaṃ ।।

vāntaṃ nāntena saṃyuktaṃ rāntaṃ lāntaṃ sthitaṃ kuru ।
sāntaṃ trisvarasaṃyuktaṃ taṃ kāntaṃ paribhūṣitaṃ ।।

ḍaemadhyaṃ samuddhṛtya sādyaṃ nirjīvamuddharet ।
vāntaṃ sāntapuṭaṃ kṛtvā sādyaṃ nirjīvamāharet ।।

ekādaśārṇṇamuddiṣṭaṃ dvācatvāriṃśakaṃ padaṃ ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ turyaśirasaṃ yādyaṃ paṃcamasaṃsthitaṃ ।।

dhāntaṃ sāntāṅkitaṃ kṛtvā nirjīvaṃ sādyamuddhare{t} ।
tricatvāriṃśamaṃ jñeyaṃ padaṃ tryarṇṇamahābalaṃ ।।

khāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ kāryaṃ sāntaṃ phāntavibhūṣitaṃ ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ ṣaṣṭhaphāntāṅkaṃ vāntaṃ nāntena cihnitaṃ ।।

vajrāṃḍaṃ pañcaphāntāṅkaṃ vāntaṃ sādyamajīvakaṃ ।
paṃcārṇṇapadamuddiṣṭaṃ catvāriṃśaṃ caturyutaṃ ।।

vajrāṃḍaṃ phāntaturyāṅkaṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
vāntaṃ sāntāṅkitaṃ bhūyo sādyasasvaramuddharet ।।

dvyarṇṇapaṃcādhikaṃ proktaṃ catvāriṃśatimaṃ padaṃ ।
vāntaṃ nāntāṅkitaṃ bhūyo taṃ catṛsvaralāñchanaṃ ।।

khāntaṃ dviguṇamuddhṛtya dvitīyenāṃkitaṃ śirā ।
(11b)
sāntaṃ tribiṃdukhacitaṃ ḍhāntaṃ tenaiva lāṃchitaṃ ।।

ṭaḍaumadhyaṃ punardeyaṃ cāntaṃ khāntaṃ tathaikataḥ ।
sāntaṃ tribiṃdusaṃyuktaṃ vāntaṃ ḍhāntasthitaṃ kuru ।।

tribiṃdulāṃchitaṃ kṛtvā vāntaṃ deyaṃ punaḥ priye ।
tameva sāntakhacitaṃ bhūyo sāntamajīvakaṃ ।।

ekādaśārṇṇamuddiṣṭaṃ ṣaṭcatvāriṃśakaṃ padaṃ ।
vāntaṃ nāntena khacitaṃ vāntaṃ sāntavicitritaṃ ।।

sādyasasvaramuddhṛtya catvāriśaṃ sasaptakaṃ ।
dvyakṣaraṃ padametatsyātsarvvakāmasamṛddhidaṃ ।।

vajrāṇḍaṃ māntasaṃyuktaṃ yabhamadhyaṃ ca kevalaṃ ।
vajrāṃḍaṃ dvisvarākrāṃtaṃ yabhamadhyaṃ tathaiva hi ।।

sāntaṃ trisūryakhacitaṃ punaḥ prāgarṇṇamuddhare{t} ।
khāntaṃ dvitīyasaṃyuktaṃ ḍavamadhya ca kevalaṃ ।।

ṭaḍomadhyaṃ samuddhṛtya ca ghāntaṃ khāntasaṃsthitaṃ ।
sāntaṃ trisūryakhacitaṃ vāntaṃ ḍhāntasthitaṃ kuru ।।

pūrvvātṛtīyasaṃyuktaṃ vāntaṃ tenaiva lāṃchitaṃ ।
a(sya) pūrvvalāṃcha(ne)na hīnasāntasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

yabhamadhyadvitīyāṅkaṃ ḍāntaṃ nāntena cihnitaṃ ।
turyaṃ sānta tathā ḍhāntaṃ pāntaṃ sāntaṃ saphāntinaṃ ।।

ekatra dāpa(yet) piḍaṃ yathāvakramayogataḥ ।
sāntaṃ ṭhāntaṃ tathā sādhyaṃ nirjīvaṃ kārayettataḥ ।।

aṣṭādaśārṇṇamuddiṣṭaṃ catvāriṃśaṃ sa cāṣṭamaṃ ।
padametanmahāraudraṃ trailaukyakṣayakārakaṃ ।।

phāntaṃ turyaṃ savajrāḍaṃ sāntasthaṃ piṇḍamekataḥ ।
asya pūrvvaṃ punardeyaṃ padametaddvirakṣaraṃ ।।

ekāntapañcāśattamaṃ mahāmāyā vighaṭṭana ।
evaṃ viṣaṃ padaṃ bhūyo sāntasthaṃ kiṃtu mātarā{t} ।।
(12a)
dvyakṣaraṃ padametaddhi pañcāśaṃ sarvvasiddhidaṃ ।
phāntaṃ turyaṃ tathā sāntaṃ chādyaṃ yādyaṃ sasāntimaṃ ।।

piṃḍametanmahāghoraṃ sarvvatatvai(śva)rāntakaṃ ।
phāntaṃ turyaṃ tathā vāntaṃ sasāntaṃ piṇḍamekataḥ ।।

ṭhāntaṃ sādye ca patitaṃ tryarṇṇaṃ padamudāhṛdaṃ ।
ekapaṃcāśamaṃ jñeyaṃ padaṃ tatvai(śva)rāntakaṃ ।।

khāntaṃ sāntasvarupeṇa cāntaṃ khāntaṃ tathaikataḥ ।
yāntaṃ pañcamasaṃrūḍhaṃ gāntaṃ trisvaralāñchitaṃ ।।

thādyaṃ svarūpato deyaṃ lādyaṃ trisvaraśobhitaṃ ।
vāntaṃ yāntaṃ sapañcasthaṃ gāntaṃ khāntaṃ ca sāntimaṃ ।।

caghamadhyaṃ khāntarūḍhaṃ tribiṃdukhacitaṃ śirā ।
vāntaṃ tenaiva khacitaṃ thāntaṃ mādyaṃ tribiṃduyuk ।।

thādyaṃ nāṃtena khacitaṃ lādyaṃ dvisvaracihnitaṃ ।
va(jrā)ṇḍaṃ sāntasaṃyuktaṃ vajrāṃḍaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

sāntaṃ śāntantathā ghāntaṃ lāntaṃ varṇṇāḥ krameṇa tu ।
thādyaṃ tribiṃdukhacitaṃ māntaṃ keva{la}muddhare{t} ।।

tādyaṃ lādyasthitaṃ kuryātturyāṅkaṃ parameśvari ।
sāntamāntena saṃyuktaṃ lāntaṃ trisvararodhitaṃ ।।

pūrvvaṃ samuddharetpaścātsādyamātmasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
māntaṃ sāntaṃ saṣaṣṭhaṃ ca lādyaṃ trisvaracihnitaṃ ।।

ṭhāntaṃ sāntapuṭaṃ bhūyo sādyaṃ patitamuddhare{t} ।
caturvviṃśākṣaraṃ jñeyaṃ dvāpaṃcāśapadottamaṃ ।।

sarvvakṣayakaraṃ jñeyaṃ mahāmelāpasiddhidaṃ ।
vāntaṃ nāntena saṃyuktaṃ gāntaṃ sāntasaṭhāntayuk ।।

tryakṣaraṃ padametacca tripaṃcāśaṃ prakīrttitaṃ ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ sāntasaṃrūḍhaṃ turyaṃ phāntavicitritaṃ ।।

(12b)
ṭhāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ bhūyo nāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
gāntaṃ kāntena saṃyuktaṃ tryakṣaraṃ padamuttamaṃ ।।

catuṣpaṃcāśamaṃ jñeyaṃ bhūyasīsiddhidāyakaṃ ।
pañcamaṃ ca tathā ḍāntaṃ khāntasthaṃ dvitayāṃkitaṃ ।।

yāntaṃ paṃcamasaṃyuktaṃ gāntaṃ trisvarabhūṣitaṃ ।
tameva kevalaṃ bhūyo ṭhaemadhyaṃ samuddhare{t} ।।

sāntenaivāmalaṃ mūrddhnā ḍāntaṃ khānta sthitaṃ kuru ।
nāntena cihnitaṃ mūrddhnā gāntaṃ tredhā punardadet ।।

tṛtīyaṃ dvisvarākrāntaṃ vajrāṇḍaṃ trisvarāṅkitaṃ ।
ṭhāntaṃ sāntapuṭaṃ bhūyo sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ punaḥ ।।

dvādaśārṇṇamidaṃ ghoraṃ sūryalokaprapūjitaṃ ।
paṃcapañcāśamaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvvatejo prabhakṣakaṃ ।।

vajrāṇḍaṃ ḍāntamaṃ rūḍhaṃ sāntena puṭitaṃ kuru ।
pāntaṃ phāntena khacitaṃ piṃḍe kālāmalopamaṃ ।।

chādyaṃ tribiṃdukhacitaṃ vajrāṇḍaṃ lāntasaṃsthitaṃ ।
nāntena cihnitaṃ mūrddhnā ḍhāntaṃ sāntena lāṃchitaṃ ।।

sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ kṛtvā caturarṇṇapadottamaṃ ।
ṣaṭpaṃcāśakametaddhi mayā te saṃprakāśita ।।

vajrāṃḍaṃ yāti mūrddhnisthaṃ ḍāntasthaṃ sāntasaṃsthitaṃ ।
turyaphāntaśirākrāntaṃ sāntadvisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।।

sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ datvā padametaddvirakṣaraṃ ।
saptapaṃcāśamaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvvasiddhipravarttakaṃ ।।

vajrāṃḍaṃ sāntasaṃrūḍhaṃ kāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
ṭhāntaṃ sāṃtāṅkitaṃ bhūyo sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ punaḥ ।।

dvyakṣaraṃ padametatsyādaṣṭapañcāśamaṃ priye ।
sāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyuktaṃ paścima (śṛṃ)gagaṃ punaḥ ।।

ṭāntaṃ nāntena khacitaṃ rāntaṃ lāntavyavasthitaṃ ।
(13a)
sāṃtaṃ tribiṃdukhacitaṃ ḍāntaṃ sāntaṃ vicitritaṃ ।।

sāntaṃ tribiṃdukhacitaṃ ṭhāntaṃ sādyamajīvakaṃ ।
caturddhā dāpayeddevi varṇṇametanmahābalaṃ ।।

tra(yo)daśākṣaraṃ jñeyaṃ ekonaṃ ṣaṣṭhamaṃ smṛtaṃ ।
mahābalaṃ nairṛtyeṃdralokyakṣayakārakaṃ ।।

ṭhāntaṃ nāntena saṃyuktaṃ phāntenaiva vibhūṣitaṃ ।
chādyaṃ tasyāṃtimaṃ gṛhya phāṃntenaiva vicitritaṃ ।।

ṭhāntaṃ sāntena puṭitaṃ sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ punaḥ ।
tryakṣaraṃ ṣaṣṭhamaṃ jñeyaṃ padametaddurāsadaṃ ।।

vajrāntaṃ sāntamaṃ rūḍhaṃ turyaphāntavicitritaṃ ।
ṭaḍaumadhyaṃ kevalaṃ syāllāntaṃ sāntāṃkitaṃ punaḥ ।।

sāntena cihnitaṃ mūrddhnā thādyamātmasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
yāntaṃ nāntāṃṅkitaṃ kṛtvā ṭhāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipātitaṃ ।।

ṣaḍarṇṇamekaṣaṣṭhaṃ syātpadaṃ sarvvottamottamaṃ ।
khāntaṃ paṃcamasaṃrūḍhaṃ ḍāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

yāntaṃ nāntena khacitaṃ lāntaṃ thādyasanāntimaṃ ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ ṣaṣṭhasahitaṃ phānte{nai}vāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

vajrāṇḍaṃ sāntasaṃrūḍhaṃ turyaphāntavicitritaṃ ।
ṭhādyaṃ sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ padaṃ dvāṣaṣṭhamaṃ smṛtaṃ ।।

aṣṭhākṣaraṃ kuleśānaṃ kulānāmuttamottamaṃ ।
(khā)ntaṃ samuddharedbhūyo khāntaṃ dviguṇamuddharet ।।

sāntasthitaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā sāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।
chādyaṃ nāntāṃkitaṃ bhūyo rāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃ kuru ।।

sāntaṃ tribindukhacitaṃ vajrāṇḍaṃ sāntasaṃsthitaṃ ।
turyaphāntākitaṃ mūrddhnā śāntaṃ kevalamuddhare{t} ।।

vāṃntaṃ thādyaṃ tathā sāntamekatra viniyoja(ye)t ।
(13b)
yāntaṃ dvisvaraya(dbhi)nnaṃ thādyaṃ nāntena cihnitaṃ ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ ḍāntasaṃrūḍhaṃ sāntenādho vicitritaṃ ।।

turyaphāntāṃkitaṃ mūrddhnā ṭhāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipātitaṃ ।
trayodaśākṣaraṃ dīptaṃ triṣaṣṭhapadamuddhare{t} ।।

sarvvapātālamathanaṃ sarvvayaṃtraviyothakaṃ ।
kādyaṃ rādyasya saṃrūḍhaṃ dvitīyasvaralāṃchitaṃ ।।

vāntaṃ rāntaṃ kevalaṃ syātkhāntaṃ thādyasthitaṃ kuru ।
trisvareṇāṅkitaṃ mūrddhnā dhāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ kuru ।।

nāntaṃ phāntorddhakhacitaṃ vāntaṃ sādyamajīvakaṃ ।
ṣaḍakṣaraṃ padaṃ jñeyaṃ catuṣaṣṭhaṃ mahārthadaṃ ।।

prā - - gaṃ punardeyaṃ pūrvvasmādādimadvayaṃ ।
nāntaṃ tribiṃdukhacitaṃ gāntaṃ nāntena cihnitaṃ ।।

ṭhāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ padaṃ jñānapravarttakaṃ ।
paṃcaṣaṣṭhaṃ samākhyātaṃ ṣaḍarṇṇaṃ sarvvakāmadaṃ ।।

vajrāṃḍaṃ paṃcamayutaṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
asya pūrvvaṃ punardeyaṃ dvyakṣaraṃ padamuttamaṃ ।।

ṣaṭṣaṣṭatamametaddhi sarvvagraṃthivipāṭanaṃ ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ sāntasaṃruḍhaṃ turyaṃ phāntaṃ vicitritaṃ ।।

yabhamadhyaṃ ca vajrāṇḍaṃ dvitīyasvaracihnitaṃ ।
yabhamadhyaṃ ca tenāṅkaṃ mādyaṃ nāntena bhūṣitaṃ ।।

ṭhāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ ṣaḍarṇṇasaptamaṣṭamaṃ ।
padaṃ māyāntakaṃ proktaṃ sarvvatrailokyaḍāmaraṃ ।।

śāntaṃ sāntaṃ tathā yāntaṃ vajrāṇḍaṃ phāntacihnitaṃ ।
ṭaḍaumadhyaṃ nāntacitraṃ vajrāṇḍaṃ kāntasaṃyutaṃ ।।

ṭhāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ padaṃ ṣaṣṭāṣṭamaṃ smṛtaṃ ।
saptākṣaraṃ bodharūpaṃ haṃsacakraratheśvaraṃ ।।

sarvvapūrvva ṭaḍaumadhyaṃ tṛtīyenaivalāṃchitaṃ ।
dāntaṃ dvitīyakhacitaṃ sāntaṃ nāṃtena bhūṣitaṃ ।।

yabhamadhyaṃ (sā)ntapuṭaṃ turyaphāntavicitritaṃ ।
(14a)
ṭhāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ padamekonataptati ।।

ṣaḍakṣaraṃ mahāghoraṃ khaḍgarāvaṇasaṃjñakaṃ ।
vajrāṃḍaṃ sāntasaṃrūḍhaṃ turyaphāntavibhūṣitaṃ ।।

lāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya ṭāntaṃ paṃcamasaṃsthitaṃ ।
dāntaṃ dvitīyakhacitaṃ sāntaṃ nāntena saṃsthitaṃ ।।

punarādyaṃ dadedbījaṃ yāntamatra dvidhā kuru ।
(aṃ)timaṃ ṣaṣṭhasaṃyuktaṃ sāntathādyasthitaṃ triyuk ।।

ṭhāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ padaṃ saptatimaṃ smṛtaṃ ।
dhānaśvaratvadaṃ jñeyaṃ daśārṇṇaṃ nidhikarṣakaṃ ।।

ṭaḍaumadhyaṃ samuddhṛtya sāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃ dviyu{k} ।
rāntaṃ vāntaṃ trikhacitaṃ vajrāṇḍaṃ ḍāntasaṃsthitaṃ ।।

sapañcaṃkāntaṃ khacitaṃ ṭhāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipātitaṃ ।
ekasapta(ti)maṃ jñeyaṃ sarvvabhakṣa{tva}siddhidaṃ ।।

ṣaḍarṇṇaṃ devadeveśi ta(ta)sti yanna sādhaye{t} ।
gāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ kuryā turyaṃ phāntavicitritaṃ ।।

yādyaṃ tadvatkṛtaṃ bhūyo ṭaḍaumadhyaṃ punardadet ।
yāntapaṃcamasaṃrūḍhaṃ thāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

lāntaṃ nāntena khacitaṃ tadvaddrāntaṃ prakalpaye{t} ।
ṭhāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ padaṃ dvāsaptatiṃ smṛtaṃ ।।

aṣṭārṇṇaṃ kṣobhakaṃ jñeyaṃ saptasāgaraśoṣaṇaṃ ।
ṭhāntaṃ nāntena khacitaṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

punastamevamuddhṛtya nāntahīnaṃ sakāṃtimaṃ ।
kevalaṃ taṃ samuddhṛtya sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ punaḥ ।।

tryakṣaraṃ padametaddhi devadevyā trisaptati ।
lāntaṃ nāntena khacitaṃ thādyaṃ dvisvarabhūṣitaṃ ।।

vāntaṃ trisvarasaṃbhinnaṃ ṭāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
sāntaṃ lāntena khacitaṃ ṭhāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipātitaṃ ।।
(14b)
ṣaḍakṣaraṃ padaṃ ghoraṃ catuḥsaptatimaṃ priye ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ sāntasaṃrūḍhaṃ turyaṃ phāntavicitritaṃ ।।

lāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃbhinnaṃ ghāntaṃ nāntena saṃyutaṃ ।
rāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃ bhūyo sāntaṃ trisvara(lā)ñchitaṃ ।।

vāntaṃ sādyaṃ ni{pati}taṃ ṣaḍarṇṇapadamuttamaṃ ।
vāgeśvaryapradaṃ jñeyaṃ pañcasaptatimaṃ śubhaṃ ।।

śāntaṃ sāntaṃ tathā śāntaṃ thādyaṃ saptamasaṃsthitaṃ ।
ṭhāntaṃ tādyasthitaṃ nāntaṃ cihnitaṃ tvekataḥ kuru ।।

bhāntaṃ tāntasthitaṃ kuryātturyaphāntavicitritaṃ ।
ṭhāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ tṛṣṇāpāśanipāṭanaṃ ।।

saptākṣaraṃ mahāguhyaṃ ṣaṭsaptatimamuttamaṃ ।
lāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ kuryāddvitīya(sva)ralāñchitaṃ ।।

dāntaṃ trisvarasaṃyuktaṃ sāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।
chādyaṃ nāntena khacitaṃ rāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃ kuru ।।

sāntaṃ tribiṃdukhacitaṃ vajrāṃṇḍaṃ sāntasaṃsthitaṃ ।
turyaphāntāṃkitaṃ mūrddhnā gādyaṃ phāntāṃkitaṃ punaḥ ।।

tameva sāntakhacitaṃ sāntaṃ kevalamuddhare{t} ।
thāntaṃ phāntāṃkitaṃ mūrddhnā ṭhāntaṃ sādyasthitaṃ kuru ।।

sāntasthitaṃ nāntayuktaṃ ṭhāntaṃ sādya nipātitaṃ ।
trayodaśākṣaraṃ dīptaṃ sarvvavyādhiprabhakṣakaṃ ।।

saptasaptatimaṃ khyātaṃ padaṃ sarvvā(rtha)siddhidaṃ ।
ṣādyaṃ sāntaṃ sthitaṃ kuryā - ntaṃ trisvarabhūṣitaṃ ।।

lāntaṃ samuddharedbhūyo ṭānte ca punaruddhare(t) ।
yāntaṃ ṣaṣṭhasthitaṃ bhūyo sāntaṃ thādyasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

(lā)ntaṃ rāntena khacitaṃ - ṭāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ kuru ।
(15a)
dvitīyasvarasaṃbhinnaṃ vajrāṇḍaṃ tena saṃyutaṃ ।।

vāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ padaṃ sūryaprapūjitaṃ ।
daśākṣaraṃ mahāraudraṃ aṣṭāsaptatimaṃ śubhaṃ ।।

śāntaṃ tṛtīyasahitaṃ thādyaṃ saptamasaṃyutaṃ ।
sāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya thāntaṃ nāntena bhūṣitaṃ ।।

ṭāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃ bhūyo dāntaṃ dvisvarabhūṣitaṃ ।
rāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ bhūyo turyaphāntavicitritaṃ ।।

dhāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ pitruttāraṃ padottamaṃ ।
aṣṭākṣaraṃ tvekahīnaṃ aśītitamameva hi ।।

ṭhāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya tādyaṃ turyāṃkitaṃ kuru ।
rāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃ bhūyo sāntaṃ trisvaralāñchitaṃ ।।

ṭāntaṃ paṃcamasaṃyuktaṃ sāntaṃ dvisvarasāyutaṃ ।
dāntaṃ tenaiva saṃyuktaṃ sāntaṃ (cā)ntena saṃyutaṃ ।।

phāntaṃ turyaṃ tathā chādyaṃ ṭāntaṃ lāntaṃ tathaikataḥ ।
ṭhāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ daśārṇṇaṃ padamuttamaṃ ।।

aśītimaṃ samākhyātaṃ sarvvanāgaprabhakṣaṇaṃ ।
ṭaḍaumadhyaṃ samuddhṛtya sāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

dvitīyasvarasaṃyuktaṃ śāntaṃ jhāntasthitaṃ kuru ।
dvisvareṇaiva saṃyuktaṃ sāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

dāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyuktaṃ sāntaṃ nāntena bhūṣitaṃ ।
vajrāṃḍaṃ ṣaṣṭhasaṃyuktaṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

ṭhāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ aṣṭārṇṇaṃ caikaśītimaṃ ।
āpyāyanī smṛtā caiṣā mṛtasaṃjīvanīti ca ।।

sarvvapūrvvaṃ punardeyaṃ sāntaṃ ṣaṣṭhena saṃyutaṃ ।
ṭhāntaṃ sāntaṃ trisaṃyuktaṃ ṭāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

sāntasthaṃ punarapyenaṃ turyaphāntavicitritaṃ ।
(15b)
ṭhāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ ṣaḍarṇṇaṃ sarvvaśāṃtidaṃ ।।

dvyāśītitamametaddhi śāntipuṣṭikaraṃ sadā ।
sāntaṃ tathā ca vajrāṃḍaṃ ṭāntaṃ jāntasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

sāntaṃ trisvara me bhinnaṃ thāntaṃ sāntaṃ sthanāntayuk ।
pūrvvaśṛṃgaṃ svarūpeṇa ṭhāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipātitaṃ ।।

trayāśītaṃ ca saptārṇṇapadaṃ sarvvajñasiddhidaṃ ।
śāntaṃ sāntaṃ tathā yāntaṃ dāntaṃ dvisvarabheditaṃ ।।

sāntaṃ tribiṃdukhacitaṃ ḍhāntaṃ tenaiva cihnitaṃ ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ ṣaṣṭhasaṃyuktaṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

ṭhāntaṃ sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ vasvarṇṇayogabhūtidaṃ ।
caturāśītimaṃ jñeyaṃ ṣaṇmāsātsarvvasiddhidaṃ ।।

vāntaṃ yāntaṃ tathā rāntaṃ jāntasyaivoparisthitaṃ ।
vāntaṃ thāntasthitaṃ deyaṃ ṭāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।।

sāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ bhūyo ghāṃtaṃ dvisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।
jhāntaṃ tu kevalaṃ bhūyo thādyaṃ sāntatribiṃduyuk ।।

vajrāṇḍaṃ ṣaṣṭhasaṃyuktaṃ phāntaśīrṣaṃ mahābalaṃ ।
vāntasyādho nipatitaṃ sādyaṃ piṃḍaṃvaduddhare{t} ।।

ekādaśīrṇṇamuddiṣṭaṃ paṃcāśītitamaṃ padaṃ ।
sarvvapūrvvaṃ punarbhūyo ṭāntaṃ trisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।।

dāntaṃ disvaramūrddhnānaṃ sāntaṃ nāntena saṃyutaṃ ।
sarvvapūrvvaṃ punarbhūyo ghāntaṃ dhāntasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

tṛtīyasvarasambhinnaṃ rāntaṃ tenaiva lāñchitaṃ ।
gāntaṃ lāṃtena khacitaṃ lāntaṃ trisvara(vi)tritaṃ ।।

rāntalāntasthitaṃ bhūyo sāntaṃ ṣaṣṭhasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
śāntaṃ sāntena saṃyuktaṃ ṭhāntaṃ sāntapuṭaṃ punaḥ ।।

nāntaṃ phāntena khacitaṃ punaḥ pūrvvapadāntimaṃ ।
caturdaśākṣaraṃ dīptaṃ ṣaḍāśītimakaṃ padaṃ ।।
(16a)
khāntaṃ punassamuddhṛtya sāntaṃ ḍhāntasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
dvitīyasvarasaṃyuktaṃ yāntaṃ sāntena bhūṣitaṃ ।।

sādyaṃ trisvarasaṃbhinnaṃ kādyaṃ sāntaṃ sasāntimaṃ ।
turyaphāntāṅkitaṃ mūrddhnā lāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।।

sāntaṃ tenaiva khacitaṃ vajrāṇḍaṃ trisvarāṃkitaṃ ।
pūrvvapātāntimaṃ cāntaṃ navārṇṇapadamuttamaṃ ।।

saptāśītitamaṃ jñeyaṃ sukhasaubhāgyasiddhidaṃ ।
phāntaṃ turyaṃ ca vajrāṃḍaṃ sāntasthaṃ piṃḍamuddhare{t} ।।

ḍāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya pāntaṃ bhāntaṃ tribiṃduyuk ।
khāntaṃ nāntena khacitaṃ pūrvvāntaṃ punarantataḥ ।।

aṣṭāśīti tamaṃ proktaṃ śivapūrvvaṃ mahābalaṃ ।
ṣaḍakṣaraṃ padaṃ devi ajarāmarakārakaṃ ।।

vāntaṃ thāntena khacitaṃ phāntacitrasayāntimaṃ ।
sāntasthaṃ piṇḍarājānaṃ pūrvvāntaṃ punarantataḥ ।।

dvyakṣaraṃ padametaddhi ekāntanavataṃ śubhaṃ ।
ṭāntaṃ trisvaramurddhnānaṃ thalinto piṇḍasaṃsthito ।।

pūrvvāntaṃ turya{na}ścānte tryakṣaraṃ padamuttamaṃ ।
etannavatisaṃjñeyaṃ siddhacakreśvaratvadaṃ ।।

chādyaṃ jāntaṃ nāntacitraṃ pūrvvaphāntena raṅkitaṃ ।
pūrvvasyāntaṃ punaścānte caturarṇṇaṃ padottamaṃ ।।

navatyekaṃ tathā jñeyaṃ padaṃ sarvvasu{khā}vahaṃ ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ punarevaṃ syātpaṃcasthaṃ phāntacihnitaṃ ।।

punarlāṃchanahīnaṃ taṃ ḍhāntaṃ lāghasthītaṃ punaḥ ।
yāntaṃ paṃcamasaṃrūḍhaṃ gāntaṃ trisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।।

gāntaṃ phāntāṅkitaṃ bhūyo pūrvvasyāntaṃ tathāntataḥ ।
etatsaptākṣaraṃ bhūyo padaṃ dvānavataṃ tathā ।।

sāntaṃ ṣasya samārūḍhaṃ turyaphāntavicitritaṃ ।
(16b)
khāntaṃ vāntena khacitaṃ yāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।।

sāntaṃ trisvarasaṃyuktaṃ pūrvvāsyāntantathāntataḥ ।
paṃcavarṇṇatrinavataṃ padaṃ sarvvottamottamaṃ ।।

phāntaṃ turyaṃ ca vajrāṇḍaṃ ḍāntaṃ sāntaṃ tathaikataḥ ।
ṣāṃtaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya vāntaṃ thāntaṃ sasāntimaṃ ।।

tṛtīyasvarasaṃyuktaṃ piṃḍībhūtaṃ samuddhare{t} ।
pūrvvasyāntaṃ punaścāṃntaṃ turyarṇṇaṃ padamuttamaṃ ।।

śrīpadaṃ navataṃ jñeyaṃ caturbhiradhikaṃ priye ।
śāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyuktaṃ lāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

khāntaṃ trisvarasaṃyuktaṃ śāntaṃ {śānta}puṭaṃ kuru ।
turyaphāntavicitraṃ tatpūrvvāntaṃ cāntatosya tu ।।

paṃcārṇṇaṃ paṃcanavataṃ padaṃ pāvakivācakaṃ ।
sāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyuktaṃ pāntamādyasthitaṃ kuru ।।

nāntena khacitaṃ mūrddhnā vajrāṃḍaṃ ṣaṣṭhasaṃyutaṃ ।
punaḥ pūrvvamahāpātaṃ caturarṇṇaṃ padottamaṃ ।।

ṣaḍbhira(syā)dhikaṃ jñeyaṃ yaṃ etatnavatimaṃ sadā ।
vāntaṃ thāntena khacitaṃ sāntaṃ saptamasaṃsthitaṃ ।।

thādyaṃ trisvaramūrddhnānaṃ pūrvvapātaṃ punardade{t} ।
saptānavatimaṃ jñeyaṃ caturakṣairakaṃ padaṃ ।।

kāntamādyasthitaṃ bhūyo phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
pūrvvapāntaṃ punaścānte dvyarṇṇamaṣṭādhikaṃ priye ।।

sadā navatimaṃ jñeyaṃ kulaparvvatacālanaṃ ।
lāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyuktaṃ sāntaṃ pañcamasaṃsthitaṃ ।।

ḍhāntaṃ trisūryakhacitaṃ vajrāṇḍaṃ lāntasaṃsthitaṃ ।
phāntaṃ turyavicitraṃ tatpūrvvapātamahāntagaṃ ।।
(17a)
navānavatimaṃ jñeyaṃ paṃcārṇṇapadamuttamaṃ ।
sāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ jñeyaṃ māntaṃ kevalamuddhare{t} ।।

rādyaṃ chādyaṃ sthitaṃ proktaṃ dhāntaṃ trisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।
māntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya rādyaṃ chādyasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

sāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya pūrvvapātaṃ punaḥ kuru ।
aṣṭākṣaraṃ ca śatamaṃ padamatyuttamottamaṃ ।।

paścimāśṛṃgasaṃbhūyo nāntaṃ phāntavicitritaṃ ।
sāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya paścimaṃ śṛṅgagaṃpunaḥ ।।

nāntena khacitaṃ mūrddhnā rāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃpunaḥ ।
sāntaṃ trisvarasaṃyuktaṃ gāntaṃ sāntapuṭaṃ bhavet ।।

turyaphāntāṅkitaṃ mūrddhnā pūrvvapātaṃ tatontagaṃ ।
saptākṣaratvekaśataṃ padaṃ ṛddhipradaṃ sadā ।।

ṭatamadhyaṃ sāntaṃ citraṃ yāntaṃ sāntāsanāntimaṃ ।
chādyaṃ nāntena khacitaṃ rāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

sāntaṃ tribiṃdukhacitaṃ vajrāṃḍaṃ sāntasaṃsthitaṃ ।
turyaṃ phāntāṅkitaṃ mūrddhnā pūrvvapātaṃ punaḥ kuru ।।

aṣṭākṣaraṃ tu dvyadhikaṃ śataṃ proktaṃ padottamaṃ ।
vajrāṃḍaṃ paṃcamayutaṃ phānte naivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

ṣāntaṃ tu kevalaṃ bhūyo nāntaṃ dvisvarabhūṣitaṃ ।
vāntaṃ trisvarasaṃyuktaṃ gāntaṃ kevalamuddhare{t} ।।

pūrvvapātaṃ punardeyaṃ ṣaḍarṇṇaṃ tryadhikaṃśata ।
padānāṃ devadeveśi vyākhyānaṃ te yathārthataḥ ।।

ghāntaṃ pāntena khacitaṃ sāntaṃ trisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।
lāntaṃ tenaiva khacitaṃ rāntaṃ kevalamuddhare{t} ।।

pādyaṃ sāntaṃ sthitaṃ bhūyo turyaṃ phāntavibhūṣitaṃ ।
pūrvvapātaṃ punardatvā caturbhiradhikaśataṃ ।।
(17b)
ṣaḍakṣaraṃ padaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvvakarmmakaraṃ śubhaṃ ।
māntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyuktaṃ ṭāntaṃ khāntasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

sāntaṃ trisvarasaṃbhinnaṃ māntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।
ṭaḍaumadhyaṃ punardadyātjhāntaṃ kevalamuddhare{t} ।।

khāntaṃ dvisvaramurddhānaṃ ḍāntaṃ kevalamuddhare{t} ।
yāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyuktaṃ thādyaṃ yāṃtasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

ghāntaṃ pāntasthitaṃ sāntasaṃsthitaṃ pāntasaṃyutaṃ ।
phāntasaṃcihnitaṃ piṃḍaṃ trailokyagrāsaghasmaraṃ ।।

vāntaṃ sāntena puṭitaṃ sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ punaḥ ।
dvādaśārṇṇaṃ samuddiṣṭaṃ padaṃ paṃcādhikaṃ śataṃ ।।

rāntaṃ paṃcamasaṃbhinnaṃ ṭhāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃ kuru ।
nāntena bhūṣitaṃ kṛtvā ṭāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

lāntaṃ tu kevalaṃ bhūyo yāṃntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।
taṃtu kevalinaṃ bhūyo taṃ ca saptamasaṃyutaṃ ।।

thādyaṃ phāntena khacitaṃ vāntaṃ paṃcamabhūṣitaṃ ।
kāntena saṃyutaṃ kṛtvā vajrāṇḍaṃ sāntasaṃsthitaṃ ।।

turyaphāntaṃ vici - -  tpunarvvāntaṃ saḍāntimaṃ ।
paṃcamasthañca kāṃtena bhūṣitaṃ paramaṃ padaṃ ।।

ekādaśārṇṇaṃ vijñeyaṃ ṣaḍbhiścaivādhikaṃ śataṃ ।
padametatsamākhyātaṃ paramāmṛtapūrakaṃ ।।

nādyaṃ ṣāntena khacitaṃ vāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।
sāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya khāṃtaṃ trisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।।

lāntaṃ tenaiva khacitaṃ ṭāntaṃ vāntasthitaṃ kuru ।
dvitīyasvarasaṃbhinnaṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

thāntaṃ vajrāṃḍakaṃ caiva ghāntaṃ sānta(pu)ṭaṃ kuru ।
sāntaṃ ṣaṣṭhasthitaṃ bhūyo pāntaphāntavicitritaṃ ।।
(18a)
ṭhāntaṃ sāntāṃkitaṃ bhūyo tasyādhaḥ sādya pātitaṃ ।
daśākṣaraṃ padaṃ proktaṃ sadā saptādhikaṃ śataṃ ।।

sarvvavighnoghadalanaṃ duṣṭāriṣṭaprabhaṃjanaṃ ।
paścimaṃ śṛṃgagaṃ bhūyo sāntasthaṃ turyalāñchitaṃ ।।

kāntena khacitaṃ paścāllāntaṃ vāntena dīpitaṃ ।
vāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya thādyaṃ nāntena bhūṣitaṃ ।।

sāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya chādyaṃ nāntena bhūṣitaṃ ।
vajrāṃḍaṃ ṣaṣṭhasaṃyuktaṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

vajrāṇḍaṃ lāntasaṃrūḍhaṃ kāntena khacitaṃ punaḥ ।
aṣṭavarṇṇaṃ māhāghoraṃ śatamaṣṭādhikaṃ pada ।।

sarvvanāgakṣayakaraṃ viṣabhūtagrahāntakaṃ ।
vajrāṃḍaṃ sāntasaṃrūḍhaṃ phāntaturyavibhūṣitaṃ ।।

ṭhāntaṃ sādyasthitaṃ kṛtvā nirjīvaṃ piṇḍataḥ priye ।
dvyakṣaraṃ padametacca navādhikaśataṃ smṛtaṃ ।।

sāntaṃ sāntena saṃbhinnaṃ khādyaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
dhāntaṃ trisvaramūrddhnānaṃ thāntaṃ sāntaṃ sanāntimaṃ ।।

pūrvvāntṛtīyamuddhṛtya chādyaṃ dhāntasthitaṃ tathā ।
ṭāntaṃ paṃcamasaṃrūḍhaṃ sāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

māntaṃ sāntena saṃyuktaṃ chādyaṃ kevalameva hi ।
vāntaṃ trisvarasaṃbhinnaṃ yāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

vajrāṃḍaṃ dvisvarākrāntaṃ yāntaṃ pāntavibhūṣitaṃ ।
ṭāntaṃ kevalamevātra ḍāntaṃ trisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।।

phādyaṃ rādyaṃ ca vajrāṃḍaṃ yāntaṃ ḍāntaṃ sasāntimaṃ ।
sāntaṃ ca ṣaṣṭhasaṃyuktaṃ piṇḍamekatra yojaye{t} ।।

ṭhāntaṃ sāntapuṭaṃ bhūyo sādyarūḍhamajīvakaṃ ।
aṣṭādaśākṣaraṃ proktaṃ daśādhikaśataṃ padaṃ ।।

ṭhāntaṃ nāntena saṃbhinnaṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
(18b)
sāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya khāntaṃ thādyaṃ sanāntimaṃ ।।

kāntaṃ samuddharedbhūyo sāntaṃ yāntasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
yāntaṃ paṃcamasaṃrūḍhaṃ ḍhāntaṃ lādyaṃ tathaikataḥ ।।

nāntena khacitaṃ mūrddhnā yāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ dvisvarākrāṃtaṃ sāntaṃ sāntavi{ci}tritaṃ ।।

sāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya cāntaṃ dvisvaralāñchitaṃ ।
sāntatrisūryakhacitaṃ ṭāntaṃ tenaiva cihnitaṃ ।।

nāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya thāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
khāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyuktaṃ {ḍāntaṃ} trisvaralāñchitaṃ ।।

vajrāṇḍaṃ sāntasaṃrūḍhaṃ ḍāntaṃ sāntavibhūṣitaṃ ।
sāntaṃ trisūryakhacitaṃ sarvvapūrvvaṃ punardadet ।।

lāntathādyaṃ tathā sāntaṃ kevalā varṇṇanāyakāḥ ।
ṭāntaṃ thādya sthitaṃ sāntaṃ phāntadvisvarabhūṣitaṃ ।।

ṭhāntaṃ sādya sthitaṃ kṛtvā nirjīvapātamuttamaṃ ।
saptāviṃśākṣaraṃ ghoraṃ śatamekādaśāntaraṃ ।।

padametatsamākhyātaṃ mahāraktaughakarṣaṇaṃ ।
gāntaṃ nāntena khacitaṃ chāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

sāntaṃ trisvarasaṃyuktaṃ rāntaṃ tenaiva lāñchitaṃ ।
lāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyuktaṃ ṭhāntaṃ ṣaṣṭhasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

thādyaṃ tṛtīyasaṃbhinnaṃ ṭhāntanāntena saṃyutaṃ ।
chādyaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya ṭhāntaṃ sāntapuṭaṃ punaḥ ।।

sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ bhūyo daśārṇṇapadamuddhṛtaṃ ।
śataṃ dvādaśasaṃpūrṇṇaṃ padānānte prakīrttitaṃ ।।

khāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃbhinnaṃ ḍāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
sāntaṃ dvisvaramūrddhānaṃ thādyaṃ sāntasthitaṃ kuru ।।

trisvarā(laṃ)kṛtaṃ mūrddhnā taṃ ca dvisvarabhūṣitaṃ ।
(19a)
vajrāṃḍaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ padametaddvidhā kuru ।।

vajrāṇḍaṃ paṃcamayutaṃ phāṃtenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
ṭhāntaṃ sādyasthitaṃ kuryā(nni)rjīvaṃ parameśvari ।।

daśākṣaraṃ padaṃ hyetadyamakoṭiprabhakṣakaṃ ।
trayodaśādhikaṃ jñeyaṃ śatametatsamāsataḥ ।।

nā(ntaṃ) kevalamuddhṛtya vajrāṇḍaṃ sā(nta)saṃsthitaṃ ।
pūrvveṇaivāmalībhūtaṃ vajrāṇḍaṃ trisvarāṃkitaṃ ।।

śāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ bhūyo lāntaṃ trisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।
rāntaṃ kevalinaṃ bhūyo padametaddvidhā ku(ru) ।।

(khā)ntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyuktaṃ ṣāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
thāntaṃ paṃcamasaṃyuktaṃ sādyanāntena saṃyutaṃ ।।

rāṃtaṃ tasya sthitaṃ kuryātturyaphāntavicitritaṃ ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ lāntasaṃrūḍhaṃ pūrvvaṃ taccitritaṃ kuru ।।

lāntaṃ pāṃtena khacitaṃ ṭhāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ cānte sarvvāśāpratipūrakaṃ ।।

saptādaśārṇṇamuddiṣṭaṃ caturda{śa}śatādhikaṃ ।
punarvvajrāṃḍapiṇḍaṃ tu sāntasthaṃ turyadīpitaṃ ।।

phāntena cihnitaṃ mūrddhnā chāntaṃ trisvaradīpitaṃ ।
vāntaṃ thādyasthitaṃ kṛtvā dvitīyasvaralāṃchitaṃ ।।

yāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya ṭāntaṃ trisvarabhūṣitaṃ ।
śāṃtaṣaṣṭhayutaṃ kṛtvā (sā)ntaṃ sāntaṃ ca kevalau ।।

dvidhā padaṃ samālikhya yāntaṃ dvisvaraphāntayuk ।
punarādyaṃ dadetpiṇḍaṃ sāntaṃ phāntena dīpitaṃ ।।

gāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya dhāntaṃ sānta(pu)ṭaṃ punaḥ ।
sādyaṃ nipatitaṃ cānte padaṃ sarvvārthasiddhidaṃ ।।

ṣoḍaśākṣarakaṃ jñeyaṃ cintitārthaphalapradaṃ ।
(19b)
daśapaṃcādhikaṃ proktaṃ śatametanmaheśvari ।।

punaḥ khāntadvisvarāṃkaṃ ḍāntaṃ tadvatsamuddhare{t} ।
vāṃtaṃ thādyasthitaṃ bhūyo vāntaṃ trisvarayojitaṃ ।।

khāntaṃ saptamasaṃrūḍhaṃ vāntaṃ thādyasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
vāntaṃ tṛtīyasaṃyuktaṃ padasyādyaṃ punardade{t} ।।

ḍāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya ṭāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
cāntaṃ khāntasthitaṃ bhūyo sāntaṃ trisvarayojitaṃ ।।

tenaivāṃkitamūrddhānaṃ dhāntaṃ ḍhāntasthitaṃ kuru ।
yāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya vajrāṃḍaṃ dvisvarāṃkitaṃ ।।

punaryāntaṃ dvisvarāṃkaṃ sāntaṃ trisvarabhūṣitaṃ ।
punardvidhā tamevasyāte naivāṃkaṭaḍauntagaṃ ।।

lānta(rūḍhaṃ) mahāvarṇṇaṃ sāntāṅkaṃ ṭhāntamuddharet ।
sādyarūḍhaṃ tu nirjīvaṃ padaṃ sarvvakṣayāvahaṃ ।।

saṣoḍaśaṃ śataṃ jñeyaṃ mahāsiddhipradāyakaṃ ।
ekaviṃśativarṇṇaṃ tu tava devi prakāśitaṃ ।।

vajrāṇḍaṃ punaruddhārya sāntasthaṃ turyabhūṣitaṃ ।
phāntena cihnitaṃ mūrddhnā ṭhāntaṃ nānta sahāntimaṃ ।।

punareva hitaṃ varṇṇaṃ chādyaṃ kāntavibhūṣitaṃ ।
ḍāṃtaṃ sādyasthitaṃ kṛtvā nirjīvaṃ pāvamadbhutaṃ ।।

paṃcāntaṃ saptadaśabhiryutaṃ śatamidaṃ smṛtaṃ ।
asyaiva devadeveśi padasyādyaṃ punardade{t} ।।

pūrvvasyādyaṃ punaścāṃte padaṃ dvyakṣaramuddhṛtaṃ ।
aṣṭādaśottaraśataṃ tavākhyātaṃ yathārthataḥ ।।

pādyaṃ phāntāṃkitaṃ kāryaṃ sarvvasyāntaṃ punardade{t} ।
pūrvvasaṃkhyamekahīnaṃ śataṃviṃśādhikaṃ padaṃ ।।

turyaṃ vajrāṃḍaṃ sāntasthaṃ kāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
(20a)
pūrvvāntaṃ punarasyānte taṃ caretkayuṭaṃ punaḥ ।।

tryakṣaraṃ viṃśatiyutaṃ padānāṃ tu śataṃ smṛtaṃ ।
phāntaṃ sāntaṃ ca vajrāṇḍaṃ pādyaṃ sāntaṃ saṣaṣṭhakaṃ ।।

piṇḍametanmahāghoraṃ yāntaṃ kevalamuddhare{t} ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ dvisvarākrāntaṃ phāṃtenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

vāntaṃ tribiṃdukhacitaṃ rāntaṃ tadvatprakīrttita ।
ghāntaṃ vādyaṃ sa turyāṅkaṃ phāṃte bhūṣitaśekharaṃ ।।

gāntaṃ phāntena sahitaṃ ṭhāntaṃ sādyasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
nirjīvaṃ devadeveśi aṣṭārṇṇaṃ padamuttama ।।

ekaviśontaraśataṃ samya(kca)veniveditaṃ ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ paṃcamayutaṃ phāṃtenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

pūrvvasyāntaṃ punaścānte padametaddvirakṣaraṃ ।
śataṃdvāviṃśatiyutaṃ saṃkhyayā bhavavarṇṇitaṃ ।।

vajrāṇḍaṃ sāntasaṃrūḍhaṃ turyaphāntavicitritaṃ ।
ṭāṃtaṃ dvisvarasaṃyuktaṃ lāntaṃ trisvarabheditaṃ ।।

thādyaṃ sāntasthitaṃ kṛtvā pūrvvalāṃchanalāṃchitaṃ ।
vāṃtaṃ kevalinaṃ bhūyo yāṃtaṃ kāṃtaṃ vicitritaṃ ।।

ṣaḍarṇṇaṃ vedapātākhyaṃ trayoviṃśādhikaṃ śataṃ ।
ṭāntaṃ sāntaṃ sthitaṃ lānte punarādyaṃ dadetpriye ।।

śāntaṃ dāntaṃ sthitaṃ bhūyo vāntaṃ trisvaraśobhitaṃ ।
vajrāṃḍaṃ ṣaṣṭhasahitaṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

dhāntaṃ sādyasthitaṃ kṛtvā nirjīvaṃ varavarṇṇini ।
caturvviṃśādhikaśataṃ saptārṇṇaṃ padamuddhṛtaṃ ।।

punarvvajrāṇḍamadhyasthaṃ phāntaṃ paṃcamacitritaṃ ।
pūrvvasyāntaṃ dvidhā cānte tryakṣaraṃ padamuttamaṃ ।।

paṃcaviṃśādhikaśataṃ saṃkhyayā tava kīrttitaṃ ।
(20b)
ṣāntaṃ rāntaṃ dvisvarāṃkaṃ vāntaṃ trisvarabhūṣitaṃ ।।

sāntaṃ vajrāṃḍasaṃrūḍhaṃ dhāntāsāntasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
nāntaphāntāṅkitaṃ mūrddhnā piṃḍaṃ kālānalāntakaṃ ।।

khāntaṃ pañcamasaṃrūḍhaṃ vāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
ṭāṃtaṃ phāntena saṃyuktaṃ punaḥ pūrvvaṃ tu yugmakaṃ ।।

punastameva yugale antimaṃ nāntacihnitaṃ ।
vāntathāntaṃ sāntarūḍhaṃ nāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

rāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃ bhūyo sāntaṃ trisvaralāṃchitaṃ ।
vāntaṃ dvisvaramūrddhānaṃ sāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

ṭaḍaumadhyaṃ śāṃtacitraṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ pūrvvāntaṃ cāntimasya ca ।।

ekonaviṃśavarṇṇaṃ syātsaṣaḍviṃśatikaṃ śataṃ ।
yatametatsamākhyātaṃ ghorayaṃtraprabhaṃjanaṃ ।।

sāntaṃ chādyasthitaṃ kāryaṃ yādyasthaṃ ṭhāntasaṃsthitaṃ ।
punaḥ sāntasthitaṃ kāryaṃ turyaṃ phāntavicitritaṃ ।।

piṇḍametanmahāghoraṃ trailokyagrasanākulaṃ ।
kāntaṃ ṭhāntaṃ punaḥ sāntaṃ sādyasthaṃ jīvavarjitaṃ ।।

dvyakṣaraṃ padamākhyātaṃ saptāviṃśottaraṃśataṃ ।
kādyaṃ dvidhā samuddhṛtya phāntacitramahāprabhaṃ ।।

khādyaṃ kevalinaṃ bhūyo ṣāntaṃ dvisvarayojitaṃ ।
sāntaṃ paṃcamasaṃrūḍhaṃ thāntau dvau pṛṣṭhanudhnagau ।।

nāntena cijñi(taṃ) kāryaṃ rāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
kāntaṃ trisvaramūrddhānaṃ gāntaṃ sāntaṃ sthitaṃ kuru ।।

punarsāntasthitaṃ kṛtvā phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
ṭhāntaṃ sādyasthitaṃ bhūyo nirjīvaṃ devi dāpayet ।।
(21a)
daśārṇṇapadametaddhi śataṃviṃśāṣṭamaṃ yutaṃ ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ sāntasaṃrūḍhaṃ sāntasthaṃ phāntacihnitaṃ ।।

turyāṅkitaṃ mahāpiṃḍaṃ yāntakevalamuddharet ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ dvisvarākrāntaṃ yāntaṃ tenaiva śobhitaṃ ।।

māntaṃ nāntena khacitaṃ ṭhāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
turyasāntāṅkitaṃ kṛtvā padametaṣaḍakṣaraṃ ।।

ekonatriṃśadadhikaṃ śatametatprakīrttitaṃ ।
ṭhāntaṃ nāntāṅkitaṃ bhūyotphāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

kādyaṃ rādyasthitaṃ kṛtvā nāntenaiva śirāhataṃ ।
sāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya śāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ kuru ।।

nāntaṃ nāntena saṃyuktaṃ vajrāṇḍaṃ ṣaṣṭhasaṃyutaṃ ।
phāntenaivāmalībhūtaṃ pūrvvādristhaṃ punardadet ।।

khāntaṃ dvisvaramūrddhānaṃ yāntaṃ trisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।
vāntaṃ tenāṅkitaṃ bhūyo ṭhāntaṃ sādyasthitaṃ dade{t} ।।

patitaṃ devadeveśi rudrārṇṇaṃ padamuddhṛtaṃ ।
śataṃtriṃśatsamadhikaṃ tavākhyātaṃ yathārthataḥ ।।

punaḥ chādyaṃ nāntarūḍhaṃ ṣāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
ekārādyaṃ kevalinaṃ rāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

khāntaṃ thādya samārūḍhaṃ trisvarālaṃkṛtaṃ kuru ।
pūrvvasyāṃtaṃ punaścānte padaṃ pañcārṇṇamuttamaṃ ।।

ekatriṃśādhikaṃ proktaṃ śatametatsamāsataḥ ।
vajrāṃḍaṃ sāntapuṭitaṃ turyaphāntavicitritaṃ ।।

chādyaṃ rādyaṃ samārūḍhaṃ nāntenaivāṅkitaṃ śirā ।
sāntaṃ kevalinaṃ bhūyo rāntaṃ trisvarayojitaṃ ।।

kādyaṃ nāntena khacitaṃ pūrvvapātāntimaṃ punaḥ ।
ṣaḍakṣarapadaṃ proktaṃ śataṃ dvātriṃśaduttamaṃ ।।

vajrāṃḍaṃ ṣaṣṭhasaṃyu्ktaṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
(21b)
vajrāṇḍaṃ kāntasahitaṃ punareva dadetpriye ।।

dvyakṣaraṃ padamākhyātaṃ trayastriṃśottaraṃ śataṃ ।
punarvvajrāṇḍamuddhṛtya sāntasthaṃ turyalāñchitaṃ ।।

phāntena cihnitaṃ mūrddhnā ṭhāntaṃ sādyasthitaṃ kuru ।
nirjīvaṃ devadeveśi padaṃ dvyakṣaramuttamaṃ ।।

catustriṃśādhikaśataṃ tava proktaṃ maheśvari ।
chādyaṃ turyāṅkitaṃ bhūyo lāṃtaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

chāntaṃ kevalinaṃ paścātkhāntaṃ dviguṇamuddhare{t} ।
sāntarūḍhaṃ nāntacihnaṃ kṛtvā caivaṃ suyojaye{t} ।।

rāntaṃ rāntasthitaṃ kāryaṃ sāntaṃ trisvarasaṃyutaṃ ।
ṭāntaṃ tu kevalaṃ bhūyo sāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

dāntaṃ lāntasamārūḍhaṃ thādyaṃ trisvarabhūṣaṇaṃ ।
vajrāṃḍaṃ sāntasaṃrūḍhaṃ turyaphāntavibhūṣitaṃ ।।

tṛtīyaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ vajrāṃḍaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
asya pūrvvapunardeyaṃ khāntaṃ dvisvaracitritaṃ ।।

ḍāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya ṭāntaṃ phāntena bhūṣitaṃ ।
khāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya sāntaṃ trisvaralāñchanaṃ ।।

ṭhāntaṃ ḍhāntasthitaṃ kṛtvā tribiṃduśirasāhataṃ ।
yāntaṃ trisvaramūrddhānaṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।।

śāntaṃ sāntasthitaṃ bhūyo nāntaṃ trisvarayojitaṃ ।
rāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya yāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

vajrāṇḍaṃ dvisvarākrāṃtaṃ punaryāntaṃ tadaṅkitaṃ ।
sāntaṃ trisvaramūrddhānaṃ ṭhāntaṃ nāntaśirāhataṃ ।।

pūrvvapātaṃ punaścānte padasyāsya prakīrttitaṃ ।
paṃcatriṃśādhikaṃ proktaṃ śatametanmayā tava ।।

triṃśa(trya)kṣarasaṃkhyātaṃ sarvvakāmaphalapradaṃ ।
(22a)
vāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyuktaṃ sāntaṃ tenaiva bhūṣitaṃ ।।

sāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya ḍhāntaṃ trisvaraśobhitaṃ ।
chādyaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya vajrāṇḍaṃ ṣaṣṭhasaṃyutaṃ ।।

pūrvvapātaṃ punaścānte padasyāsya prakīrttitaṃ ।
saptākṣaraṃ samākhyātaṃ śataṃ ṣaṭtriśaduttaraṃ ।।

pūrvvāśri(taṃ) punardeyaṃ tṛtīyaṃ punaruddhare{t} ।
kevalaṃ vrajramadhyasthaṃ punastaṃ trisvarāṅkitaṃ ।।

yāntaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya vajrāṇḍaṃ dvisvarāṅkitaṃ ।
śāntaṃ sāntaṃ kevalaṃ turyāntaṃ kevalamuddhare{t} ।।

(lā)ntaṃ trisvaramūrddhānaṃ ṭāntaṃ ḍhāntasapaṃcamaṃ ।
yāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyuktaṃ jāntaṃ nānteṃna lāñchitaṃ ।।

yāntaṃ ca kevalaṃ bhūyo vajrāṃḍaṃ dvisvarāṅkitaṃ ।
lāntaṃ gāntena saṃbhinnaṃ ṭhāntaṃ ḍhāntasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

lāntaṃ trisvarasaṃyuktaṃ sāntaṃ sāntena bhūṣitaṃ ।
ghāntaṃ turyāṅkitaṃ bhūyo rāntaṃ lāntasthitaṃ kuru ।।

sāntaṃ trisvaramūrddhānaṃ yāntaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
vajrāṇḍaṃ dvisvarākrāntaṃ chādyaṃ rādyasthanāntagaṃ ।।

sāntaṃ nāntākitaṃ kāryaṃ padametanmahābalaṃ ।
ṭhāntaṃ nāntāṅkitaṃ bhūyo carame pūrvvapā(na)rā ।।

saptāviṃśādhikaśataṃ pādānāṃ parikīrttitaṃ ।
aṣṭāviṃśatibhirvvarṇṇe dīpitaṃ ghoraḍāmaraṃ ।।

vajrāṇḍaṃ sāntasaṃrūḍhaṃ turyaphāntavibhūṣitaṃ ।
pūrvvapātaṃ punaścāsya paryante viniyojaye{t} ।।

dvyakṣaraṃ padametaddhi aṣṭatriṃśaṃśatottaraṃ ।
yādyaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya phāntāṅkaṃ pūrvvapātayuk ।।
(22b)
dvyakṣaraṃ padametatsyāccatvāriṃśaśamuttaraṃ ।
ekahīnaṃ mahābhāge yogabhūtibharāvahaṃ ।।

punarvvajrāṇḍapiṇḍaṃ tu sāntasthaṃ turyalāñchitaṃ ।
kāntayuktaṃ samākhyātaṃ punaḥ kādyaṃ sanāṃtimaṃ ।।

kādyaṃ tadantasaṃyuktaṃ tryakṣaraṃ padamuddhṛtaṃ ।
catvāriṃśādhikaṃ proktaṃ padānāṃ śatamuttamaṃ ।।

punarvvajrāṇḍapiṇḍaṃ syātturyāntaṃ sāntapṛṣṭhagaṃ ।
pūrvvapātāṃkitaṃ kuryādvyakṣaraṃ padamuddhṛtaṃ ।।

catvāriṃśantathaikaṃ sā śatametadudāhṛtaṃ ।
vajrāṃḍaṃ ṣaṣṭhasaṃyuktaṃ phāntāṅkaṃpūrvvapātayuk ।।

dvyakṣaraṃ padametaddhi catvāriṃśa yutakyataṃ ।
sāntaṃ caturddhā saṃsthāpya dvayamādyaṃ sapaṃcakaṃ ।।

dvisvarāṅkaṃ saphāntāṅkamanyaṃ kāntavibhūṣitaṃ ।
caturakṣarametaddhi tricatvāriṃśaduttaraṃ ।।

śatametanmayākhyātaṃ padānāṃ vīravaṃdite ।
thādyaṃ sāntasthitaṃ kṛtvā kāntāṃkaṃ tvekavarṇṇakaṃ ।।

padaṃ śatottaraṃ proktaṃ catvāriṃśaccaturyutaṃ ।
vajrāṃḍaṃ sāntasaṃrūḍhaṃ turyaphāntaviśodhitaṃ ।।

pūrvvapātaṃ punaścānte dvyakṣaraṃ padanāyakaṃ ।
catvāriṃśaṃ sapaṃcāṅkaṃ śataṃ te varṇṇitaṃ mayā ।।

vajrāṇḍaṃ sāntasaṃrūḍhaṃ puna(ḥ) sāntasthitaṃ kuru ।
kāntāṅkitaṃ punaḥ kṛtvā pūrvvapātayutaṃ punaḥ ।।

dvyakṣaraṃ padamuddiṣṭaṃ ṣaṭcatvāriṃśakaṃ śataṃ ।
punarvvajrāṃḍaṃ piṃḍaṃ tu paṃcamasthaṃ ca pūrvvayuk ।।

etat dvyakṣaramuddiṣṭaṃ catvāriṃśaṃ sasaptakaṃ ।
(23a)
śataṃ padānāmuddiṣṭaṃ trailokyagrāsaghasmaraṃ ।।

khāntaṃ sāntasthasāntāṅkaṃ phāntenaivāmalīkṛtaṃ ।
pūrvvapātaṃ punardeyaṃ dvyakṣaraṃ padamuddhṛtaṃ ।।

catvāriśaṃ sacāṃṣṭaṃ ca śatametadudāhṛtaṃ ।
punarvvāntaṃ sāntayuktaṃ sakāntaṃ nāntasaṃyutaṃ ।।

pūrvvapātaṃ punardadyādvyakṣaraṃ padameva hi ।
catvāriśaṃ navāṅkasthaṃ śatametadudāhṛtaṃ ।।

vajrāṇḍaṃ phāntakhacitaṃ vajrāṇḍaṃ chādya saṃsthitaṃ ।
punaḥ sāntasthitaṃ kṛtvā saṣaṣṭhaṃ pāntaphāntayuk ।।

piṇḍaṃsyāsya punardeyaṃ pūrvvapātaṃ mahābalaṃ ।
tryakṣaraṃ padame(ta)ddhi sārddhaśatamudāhṛtaṃ ।।

punaḥ khāntaṃ sāntayutaṃ sāntāṅkaṃ phāntacitritaṃ ।
pūrvvapātaṃ punardeyaṃ padaṃ dvyakṣaramuddhṛtaṃ ।।

ekapaṃcāśadadhikaṃ śatametadudāhṛtaṃ ।
punaḥ pūrvvāśrigaṃ deyaṃ padamekārṇṇamuttamaṃ ।।

dvipaṃcāśādhikaśataṃ punarvvāntaṃ samuddhare{t} ।
sāntaṃ saṃpuṭitaṃ kṛtvā sakāntaṃ caikavarṇṇakaṃ ।।

padaṃ (śaṃ)tottaraṃ jñeyaṃ tripaṃcāśaṃ mahābalaṃ ।
aṃkārādyaṃ punardadyāt śāntena puṭitaṃ punaḥ ।।

sādyāsanasthaṃ nirjīvaṃ padametadudāhṛtaṃ ।
trailokyaḍāmaraṃ nāma varṇṇaikena udāhṛtaṃ ।।

catuṣpaṃcāśadadhikaṃ padānāṃ śatamuttamaṃ ।
kīrttitaṃ tava deveśi samāsāntaṃ tu vistarā{t} ।।

sahasrama(kṣa)rāṇāṃ ca ṣaṭcatvāriṃśatiryutaṃ ।
navākhyātā mahāvidyā brahmaṇo śīrṣakṛttanī ।।

trailokyaḍāmarā nāmnī sarvvakarmakarī śubhā ।
sarvvapra(dā) ca dalanī duṣkṛtaughanikṛntanīṃ ।।
(23b)
devāsuramanuṣyānāṃ bhayadābhayahāriṇī ।
sakṛtsmṛtā devadevī vidyā trailokyaḍāmarā ।।

tannāsti yanna kurute tannāstiyanna sādhaye{t} ।
tannāsti yanna dadate tannāstiyanna dīpaye ।।

tannāstiryanna dahate tannāstiryanna bhakṣaye{t} ।
tannāsti yanna dalate devadevyā prabhāvataḥ ।।

sarvvamaṃtryogradalanī sarvvamaṃtrāgranāyakī ।
sarvvamaṃtrāraṇī ghorā sarvvasaṃhārabhairavī ।।

sarvvamudrāstradalanī sarvvamaṇḍalaghaṭṭanī ।
sarvvanāgakṣayakarī sarvvāsuranikṛntanī ।।

sarvvakāraṇadarpaghnī sarvvaduṣṭakṣa(yaṃka)rī ।
sarvvacakreśvarī ghorā sarvvayaṃtrograśātanī ।।

sarvvamaṃtramayā dīptā sarvvavidyārṇṇamaṃḍitā ।
sarvvaiśvaryapradā devī pāṭhamātrāt prasiddhyati ।।

yasyaiṣā vakragā tiṣṭhedbrahmaṇo śīrṣahāriṇī ।
sadevo bhairavaḥ sākṣāddarśanānmokṣadaḥ smṛtaḥ ।।

yasya nāvatareddevi sadāmuktaḥ prakīrttitaḥ ।
padaṃ padārthaṃ vā(yusya) mukhe tiṣṭhati bhairavi ।।

sa vīreṃdro jagadvaṃdyā darśanātkalmaṣāpahaḥ ।
khecaryo devadeveśyo bhairaveyastuvaṃti hi ।।

tadīyāḥ pāṃ sarvvo devi pādosthaḥ sarvvadevatāḥ ।
kāṃkṣaṃte mūrddhi niyataṃ yasyaiṣā vakragā sthitā ।।

taṃ tīrthaṃ taṃ mahāmaṃtraṃ taṃ devaṃ taṃ mahāmakhaṃ ।
taṃ jyeṣṭhaṃ taṃ sadā pūjyaṃ yasyaiṣā vakragā bhave{t} ।।

taṃ jñānaṃ taṃ tapo jyeṣṭhaṃ taṃ yogaṃ pīṭhamuttamaṃ ।
(24a)
taṃ gatissamatirddhanyā yasyaiṣā vakragā sthitā ।।

eṣāpi maṃtracakkreśī likhitā yopi dhāraye{t} ।
sa pūjyā sarvvadevānāṃ khecarīṇāṃ sadā bhave{t} ।।

yatra tiṣṭhatyasau devi tamāyatanamuttamaṃ ।
etadeveha deveśyāḥ pratyahaṃ pāṭhamātrataḥ ।।

yadraśmicakkramakhilaṃ vyaktimeti svadehagaṃ ।
padoccāraṇamātreṇa liṃgotpāṭādikānaghā ।।

nāśayeddevadeveśī devi nāstyatrasaṃśayaḥ ।
asyābhidhānakathanāttrailokyaṃ vepate bhṛ(śaṃ) ।।

tenaiṣā maṃtracakreśaṃ jñeyā trailokyaḍāmara ।
yasya śrotrapathe yātā likhitā yena vīkṣitā ।।

pustake yena vā dṛṣṭā sa naro matsamaḥ priye ।
dīkṣitassarvvataṃtreṣu sabhavetyatiruttamaḥ ।।

priye yāvanti taṃtrāṇi catuṣpīṭhasthitāni ca ।
nistaraṃgātimātrāṇi kulakaulamukhāni ca ।।

tāvatsu devi taṃtreṣu yadvīryaṃ maṃtrasaṃjñitaṃ ।
vidyākhyaṃ{maṇḍalākhyaṃ vā raudraṃ svābhāvikaṃ ca yat ।।

tadgrastamanayā sarvvaṃ tena sarvvottamottamā ।
atha kiṃ bahunoktena nāsyā ghoratarāparā ।।}

vidyate maṃtrasarvvasve catuṣpīṭhavinirgate ।
asyāḥ prabhāva vīryaṃ ca vyāptirjñaptiḥ parākramaṃ ।।

rūpakaṃ varṇṇavibhavaṃ cāroccārakramādikaṃ ।
sampradāyādikaṃ sarvvaṃ sādākhyairvvatsarāyutaiḥ ।।

na śakyate varṇṇayituṃ cakkrāṇāmayutaiḥ {priye} ।
yasyākhyāgrahaṇādeva vātākrāntālateva hi ।।

brahmāṇḍaṃ vepate sarvvaṃ kastāṃvarṇṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।
īṣaddhṛtyudayādyasyā jvalaṃti kakubhokhilāḥ ।।

pataṃte meghavṛkṣāni kastāṃ varṇṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।
kiṃcidvyaktivicāreṇa yasyāste kulaparvvatāḥ ।।
(24b)
jvalanti bhasmasātyoti kastāṃ varṇṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।
padaikakavirāmāṃte yasyā vīryāvalokanaṃ ।।

kṛtaṃ nirdahate sarvvakastāṃ varṇṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।
yasyāḥ pragrānti yogena meruparvvatasannibhāḥ ।।

pataṃtyaṃgāranikarāḥ kastāṃ varṇṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।
yasyā vyādhunanā devabrahmāṇḍābhāḥ sphuliṃgakāḥ ।।

nirgacchaṃti mahāgnyutvāḥ kastāṃ varṇṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।
yasyāḥ padavibhāgoktivicārādeva nihnuti ।।

jagadetatprayāva kastāṃ varṇṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।
īśadvirāmayogena yā smṛtāṃ siddhisaṃtatiṃ ।।

nipātayati ghoreśī kastāṃ varṇṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।
yasyāssaṃ(ghaṭu)yogotthavicārādeva bhairavi ।।

nipatetkhecarakulaṃ kastāṃ varṇṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।
yasyāḥ saṃkocamātreṇa kālāgnirbhasmasādvraje{t} ।।

ekādhṛtiḥ prayogena kastāṃ varṇṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।
yasyāḥ kuṃḍalinīcakre śaktiḥ padavikāsanā{t} ।।

brahmaśīrṣaṃ nipatate kastāṃ varṇṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।
yasyāḥ spaṃdodaradarī vīryavyaktikalāśrayā{t} ।।

nipatedvaiṣṇavaṃ cakkraṃ kastāṃvarṇṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।
yasyā lampaṭalolatvasaṃghaṭṭoccāraṇātpriye ।।

raudraṃ kulaṃ nipatate kastāṃ varṇṇayitu kṣamaḥ ।
yasyāścatuṣpathāpīḍe kalāpīḍaprabhakṣaṇā{t} ।।

nipātavaiśvaraṃ cakkraṃ kastāṃ varṇṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।
yasyāḥ phetkāranikarairmahāpātapraghaṭṭanaiḥ ।।
(25a)
sadāśiva nipatate kastāṃ varṇṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।
yasyā mahārāvaravairvvilāpya(kta)macoditaiḥ ।।

nipate bhairavakulaṃ kastāṃ varṇṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।
yasyāśca - - rāpīḍaiḥ piṃḍodbhrāntivighūrṇṇa(naiḥ) ।।

patanti śakticakkrasthāḥ kastāṃ varṇṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।
yasyā kalanayogena kulakaṅkālakālanaṃ ।।

mahākālaṃ nipatate kastāṃ varṇṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।
yasmātkalāntaṃ saṃhāre dvādaśārkāstrayognayaḥ ।।

patanti svapadāttūrṇṇaṃ kastāṃ varṇṇayitaṃ kṣamaḥ ।
viṣāgnibodhanaṃ devi kṛtamadya mayā bhṛṣaṃ ।।

yatkīrttitā mahāvidyā jagadgrāsaikaghasmarā ।
svastirastu samastasya viśvasyāsyā prasādataḥ ।।

evaṃ śrutvādyasubhage nirvṛtābhava sāṃprataṃ ।
adya jātāsi suśroṇi adya tṛptāsi bhairavi ।।

adya yogyāsi subhage adya netravikāsanaṃ ।
yataṃte devadeveśi devadevyāḥ prasādataḥ ।।

gaganandamahonmattāsphūrjajñānāsavolvanā ।
sollāsā bhava cārvvaṃgi sodṛktā sasphurā bhava ।।

adya jīvasi suśroṇī adya te sumahotsavaḥ ।
asyā puraya tatvaṃgi śudhoṅgārādvisāribhiḥ ।
maṃtrasārairjagadidaṃ jayadrathahitaiṣiṇi ।।

itthaṃ surāsuraśiromaṇiratnarāji,
saṃrājitāṃ hi yugale kathitaṃ yathāva{t} ।
devyā rahasyamakhilāgamasārabhūtaṃ,
saṃsāradāvajaladaṃ jagatāṃ hitāya ।।

yaṃ prāpya śocasi na jātu ca devadevi,
(25b)
tṛptāsi pūrṇṇavibhavāsi mahotkaṭāsi ।
yogyāsi vīrabhuvi pūjyatamāsi subhru,
kiṃ cāpaṃraṃ tava vadāmi vadasva śīghraṃ ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe mahātaṃtre jayadrathayāmale caturvviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
trailokyaḍāmarācakkre maṃtroddhāradvitīyaḥ paṭalaḥ ।।

evaṃ śrutvā haramukhājjagadvaṃdyā gaṇāṃbikā ।
romāṃcāṃcitagātrā sā punaḥ provāca śaṃkaraṃ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

devadeva mahādeva sarvvamaṃtrogranāyaka ।
sarveśvaramahāghoramaṃtramūrttasureśvara ।।

mahāmāyā kṣayakara mahāsaṃhārabhairava ।
trailokyarakṣānipunajagaduddharaṇātmaka ।।

paritṛptāsmi bhagavaṃnirvṛtāsmi yathāsukhaṃ ।
tvatprasādātsurārātivināśanamahojase ।।

idānīṃ śrotumicchā{mi} yathānyāsaṃ surādhipa ।
yathādhyānaṃ yathāvyāptiryathāmaṃḍalapūjanaṃ ।।

yathādīkṣābhiṣekaśca sādhanaṃ samayādi kiṃ ।
tathāhaṃ śrotumicchāmi sarahasyaṃ maheśvara ।।

guhyādguhyataraṃ bhūyo trailokyoddharaṇakṣamaṃ ।
etatsarvvaṃ samāsena vada bhūtahitāya me ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣāmi yathāhaṃ coditastvayā ।
nyāsaṃ brahmaśiro bhāryā yathāvadanupūrvvaśaḥ ।।

śubhe manorame deśe nyāsametatsamācare{t} ।
paritaḥ saṃprapūjyaiva raṇe(śaṃ) ca gurukramaṃ ।।

(26a)

paścātparyetapātena karau saṃśodhayedgiriḥ ।
ādyaṃ padaṃ tatonyasya karayorgandhadigdhayoḥ ।।

paścāddiśaḥ prabaṃdheta vidiśaścāpi suṃdari ।
anaṃtaraṃ svakaṃ dehaṃ badhvā muṃdrāṃ subhīṣaṇāṃ ।।

cidāvamarṣaṃ yogena śodhayet parameśvari ।
vīrāvarimathotpādya saṃkocya ca surārcite ।।

ṣaṭkāreṇa kulaṃ sarvvavyaktamānaṃdayogataḥ ।
kṛtvā sudhāmrapūrṇṇaṃ taṃ kramavyu{t}kramabhedataḥ ।।

paścāccidrūpasaṃghaṭṭe biṃdunādāntasaṃpuṭe ।
vilīnavṛttau saṃpūrṇṇe sarvvato kṣīṇasaṃsthitau ।।

akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākāre saśāntārṇṇavasanibhe ।
viśramya suciraṃ kālaṃ yāvadbhucchanatā bhavet ।।

tāvadvidyāṃ smarenmaṃtrī vikāsākuṃcanoditāṃ ।
tayārabhantare yattadānaṃdarasanirbharaṃ ।।

tatroditā bhairavī sā kramaṃ tatparikīrttitaṃ ।
ullāsānaṃdabharitaṃ śuviśrāṃte padoditaṃ ।।

vyutkramaṃ tatra saṃkocaṃ layapralayabhāsuraṃ ।
tatrānulomātparato vilomāṃte smarecchivāṃ ।।

evaṃ prasarasaṃkocairmahāmudrā prakāśitā ।
anayā vinyaseddevi vidyāśaktiśivānugā ।।

evamabhyantaraṃ nyāsaṃ ṣaḍaṅgaṃ tadbhaviṣyati ।
sarvvajñatādi ye proktāḥ ṣaḍaṃgāstanumadhyame ।।

(ta)tra vyaktimupāyānti saṃkocaprasarātmakāḥ ।
śive līnāḥ svasāmarthyāvyaktau vyaktāḥ sadaiva te ।।

tasmācchaḍaṃgametaddhi nyāsaṃ varṇṇālakaṃ na hi ।
(26b)
evaṃ varṇṇeśvaro bhūtvā varṇṇavidvarṇṇavigrahaḥ ।।

varṇṇāntaraṃgo varṇṇātmā nyasyedvarṇṇakulaṃ tataḥ ।
padāntaraṃgāsvapade padeśopadabhāvakāḥ ।।

padavyaktipadārūḍho padanyāsaṃ samācare{t} ।
evaṃ nyāsavaraṃ kṛtvā paścāt sthūlakrameṇa hi ।।

mahāmudrāprayogena sṛṣṭisaṃhārabhedataḥ ।
śiraḥ prabhṛti pādāntaṃ nyasyetpādācchirovadhi ।।

vidyā samuddhareddevi padaṃ vā tatsamudbhavaṃ ।
evaṃ nyāsaḥ samākhyātaḥ sabāhyābhyantaraṃ tava ।।

anena rahitāḥ sarvve mṛtpiṃḍābhāḥ prakīrttitāḥ ।
vidyāsamūhāḥ subhage na siddhiphaladā smṛtāḥ ।।

evaṃ vinyāsamātreṇa kṛtena tanumadhyame ।
-vatmabhairavākāro sādhakaḥ paramārthavi{t} ।।

yathā vidyesvarī proktā ghorā trailokyaḍāmarā ।
śiroharī brahmaṇo sā tadvadeva bhavatyasau ।।

durnirīkṣya dūrādharṣā bahunā kathitena kiṃ ।
nyāsamātrāddevadevi puroktāṃ guṇapaddhatiṃ ।।

bhavatyeva na saṃdehaṃ vacastvavitathaṃ mama ।
ityākhyātaṃ nyāsaṃ tava devi mayā rahasya saṃvalitaṃ ।
adhunā dhyānaṃ vakṣye tridaśeṃdrasudurlabhaṃ gauri ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrautasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturvviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
trailokyaḍāmarācakre nyāsavidhitṛtīyaḥ paṭalaḥ ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

yatnakasya cidākhyātaṃ tadadya kathayāmi te ।
(27a)
pūrvvanyāsena santadvau viśranya svakulārṇṇave ।।

nisvabhāve nirākāre nirdvaṃdve vigatāmaye ।
yato vikāsamāyānti tattvāstatteśvareśvarāḥ ।।

viśanti yatra subhage yasmātsthitisamanvitāḥ ।
bhavanti bhūyaḥ paṃcaite svacārācārayogataḥ ।।

biṃdunādātmakaṃ sarvvaṃ cakkrādhārakulaṃ hi ya{t} ।
indriyārthendriyayutaṃ viṣayābhogabhāśuraṃ ।।

muhurmuhuryato devi sa{śu}ddhamatitattvataḥ ।
yato viṣati tatsarvvaṃ yatra yāti ca tatpriye ।।

taṃ svabhāvaṃ svasvarūpaṃ sakhaṃḍānaṃdanirbharaṃ ।
tatrārūḍhaḥ sādhakeṃdro vīryabhāsākalodaye ।।

cintayetsthūlarūpeṇa mahābhairavabhāsurān ।
anekavaktranayanāmanekabhujabhīṣaṇā ।।

anekodarasaṅgrīvā jaṃghācaraṇabhairavā ।
valgacchiroruhajvālā pradīpitadigeśvarāḥ ।।

prabhramadvaktrasaṃdoha niryadvahniśikhākulā ।
ghorabhrūbhaṃgavikṣepanirdāritabhavāṃḍakāḥ ।।

vidyutkodhvatkaṭāṭopabhīṣaṇādbhrūlatolvaṇā ।
śrotrāntarodvamajvālājvalitākhiladikkulā ।।

mahānikhātasaṃkāśakūpanetrotkaṭāvaṭāṃ ।
rudrāṇḍaśataduṣpūraghorakhātāṃtaroditaiḥ ।।

kalpakṣayāgnisadṛśaistārakairbhāsurānanā ।
vasatkalpāṃtasajvālā vrātasatkekarekṣaṇā ।।

tuṅgaśuṣkānanottānagaṃḍotkaṭasubhairavā ।
brahmāṇḍakhaṇḍalakṣābhamahāhanudurāsadā ।।
(27b)
gaṃbhīragho(ṇā)raṃdhrotthajvalanajvalitāṃvarāṃ ।
ghorādhmātā mahāvātabhagnabrahmāṃḍakarparāṃ ।।

kulādriśatasaṃkāśadaśanaśreṇidu(rddha)rāṃ ।
utkaṭakrodhaniṣpeṣaniṣputradaśanāgnikāṃ ।।

ghoradaṃṣṭāntarālīnasamagravibudhottamāṃ ।
samagrabhairaveśānakṛtaṃ karṇṇāvataṃsakāṃ ।।

ṣaṭkāraṇamahāmuṃḍavirājitasuśekharāṃ ।
muktakeśakaṭaprāntarmārttaṇḍāpīṃḍabhūṣaṇāṃ ।।

ghorarjihvāśatodagramāyāṃḍavilalāpanīṃ ।
caṇḍāṃśottaṃśasaṃghaṭṭuṃ vibhavāṇḍakṣayaṃkarāṃ ।।

ghoradordaṇḍalakṣaughavirājitaśarīriṇīṃ ।
gaṃbhīramaṃtrasaṃdhānaghoraghargharagarbhiṇīṃ ।।

grīvāṃ bibhartti cakkreśaśatasallīna- -tāṃ ।
vaktrāvaṭamahārāvavirāvitakulāṃḍakāṃ ।।

siṃhasūkarasadvaktraghorastanavilambinīṃ ।
brahmāṇḍalakṣasaddāhaśmaśānavibhavakṣamā ।।

śu(ṣkāṃ)trasnāyuniṣpītagaṃbhīrodarabhā{su}rāṃ ।
viśālakaṭisatkoṭikuṭilāṣīviṣolvaṇīṃ ।।

surāricarmāsachannaguhyāgādhabhayānakāṃ ।
sarvvakāraṇakaṃkālamekhalādāmamaṇḍitāṃ ।।

sumerudagdhalakṣābhaghorūrupravirājitāṃ ।
kalpavṛkṣaśatastaṃbhadagdhabhāsurajaṃghikāṃ ।।

pādāpānavighātotthadhyānasarjjaḍitāṃvarāṃ ।
samagravivudhāpīḍanūpurāṃ bhairavānanāṃ ।।

kopolvaṇamahākālamuṃḍadaṃtaikapādikāṃ ।
ghoraherukakaṅkālanyastapādadvitīyakāṃ ।।
(28a)
krodharājāṣṭakaṃ bhīmabhairaveṃdratathāgatāḥ ।
saṃcūrṇṇayaṃtī sā ghorapādāghātairbhayānakāṃ ।।

kulanāgeṃdrasaṃbhāraśobhitāvayavolvaṇāṃ ।
kāraṇāṃtraśirohastaracitasragvibhūṣaṇāṃ ।।

kṣayamārttaṇḍalakṣāṇāṃ kandalaiḥ kṛtakaṃṭhikāṃ ।
taleśvarāmṛguddāmabiṃducarcitavigrahāṃ ।।

brahmakaṃkālasadvīṇāvādanaikavinoditāṃ ।
satkaṃdalavinikṣiptasarvvāsṛkyānalampaṭāṃ ।।

brahmāṇḍakoṭilakṣaughakhaṭvāṃgabharabhāsurāṃ ।

kaiścitkarairbhairavamuṇḍadhāriṇī kaiścirmahākāla śivānti bhartti sā ।
kaiścijjvaladvahnikalāpamuccakairadhārayatkaiścidihorageśvarā ।।

kaiścitkarairbrahmakulaṃ samagraṃ niṣpīḍayaṃtī bhṛśamārttarāvaṃ ।
kaiścinmahāviṣṇukulaṃ pracaṇḍaṃ nirloṭhayaṃtī karagarbhasaṃsthaṃ ।।

kaiścicca rudrormikulaṃ pradīptaṃ nirṣṣeṣayaṃtī bhṛṣamunnataṃ sā ।
kaiścitkaraireśvaracakkramugraṃ pracūrṇṇayaṃtī madhugolavatsā ।।

kaiścitsadāśivakulaṃ śakalaṃ pradīptaṃ,
drākṣāphalevavinipīḍayatī karaughaiḥ ।
kaiścitkarairakhilabhaira{va}bhīmacakkraṃ,
krandaṃti cūrṇṇayati ghorakarālacaṃḍā ।।

kaiścittathāgatakulaṃ nikhilaṃ mahograi-
rmathnāti tīkṣṇakaravālanibhaiḥ karaughaiḥ ।
kaiścitkuyārkaśatapannagacakkramuṃgraṃ,
graṃstaṃ tayā karavaraiḥ vinipīḍya sarvvaṃ ।।
(28b)

kaiścighorāstracakrakramakulavivalatprasphuraṃtaṃ samantāṃ ।
vaktravaktrakṣipaṃtī pratidiśamaniśaṃ kālarātrī karālā ।।
hastairghoraiśca kaiścijjaladana(la kulabhakṣaya)ntī samastāṃ ।
kaiścidvrahmāṇḍalakṣānyaviralavigaladvaktrakuṃḍe kṣipantī ।।

(kaiścicakrai)viṇirya(tpa)lapaśikhiśikhāghorarūpaṃ kṛśānuṃ ।
kaiścighorāgradaṃṣṭrākrakanavidalanoddāmavidyutsagarbhaiḥ ।।
(sā)rāvairbhīṣayantī - - (kṣaya)samayamahāghorasaṃvarttacaṃḍaiḥ ।
kaiścighorā(ṭṭa)hāsādvasadanalaśikhā bhīṣaṇairvvaktraṣaṃḍaiḥ ।।

rodantī kaiściduccairupahasanaparaiḥ ka - du - - dadbhiḥ ।
gāyadbhiḥ kaiścideva tridaśavaranutāvaktrakuṃḍai{rvvi}ciṃtyā ।।
kṣaṇaṃ mahārāvaravaiḥ prakurmatkṣaṇaṃ virautīva samastava(ktrau) ।
(tatkṣaṇaṃ) sakopāpralayakṣapātākṣaṇaṃ pramattākṣaṇamunmanā ca ।।

kṣaṇaṃ rudantī kṣaṇamunnadaṃtī kṣaṇaṃ mahāhāsyavilāsamattā ।
kṣaṇaṃ jagadgrāsa(ra)tā kṣaṇaṃ ca bhayasya kolāhalasannikāśā ।।

kṣaṇaṃ surūpā vikṛtā kṣaṇaṃ ca kṣaṇaṃ ca sā karpūritasvakāntiḥ ।
kṣaṇaṃ sahasrākṣaṇa(maṃka)rūpā (kṣaṇaṃ ra)sā viśvavapurvvilāsā ।।

kṣaṇaṃ ca tatveśvaracakravaṃdyā kṣaṇaṃ ca tadvāsaratā mahogrā ।
kṣaṇaṃ papāta kṣaṇamutpapāta kṣaṇaṃ samastārṇṇava - (syarūpā) ।।

(29a)
kṣaṇaṃ pravaṃdyaṃ kṣaṇameva dhāvaṃ kṣaṇaṃ mahāsthānunibhāviciṃtyā ।
kṣaṇena sā vaktrasahasracitrā kṣaṇena sā bāhusahasrayuktā ।।

kṣaṇena (sarvvā)yudhaghorahastā kṣaṇena santāḍanatatparā ca ।
sā paṃcavaktrā kṣaṇameva ciṃtyā kṣaṇena sā vaktraśatena yuktā ।।

kṣaṇena mārjārasahasrava(ktrā) kṣaṇena sā jaṃbukavaktracitrā ।
kṣaṇena paṃcānanalakṣavaktrā kṣaṇena sā ṛkṣamukhāṃkitāṃgī ।।

kṣaṇena hālāhalakoṭivaktrā kṣaṇaṃ śivā(duti)mukhāyutaughā ।
kṣaṇaṃ gajeṃdrānanalakṣayuktā mahāśvavaktrā kṣaṇameva ciṃtyā ।।

kṣaṇena cillāmukhacitritāṃgī kṣaṇena sā kauśikalakṣavaktrā ।
samantravaktrāpi samantanetrā samantapādādhisamantahastā ।।

samantajānūrukaṭisthalā sā samantavakṣodaranāsikogrā ।
samantarūpā susamantatejā samantabhāsā susamantarāvā ।
samantakarṇṇātha samantajihvā samantaghorādhisamantasaumyā ।।

evaṃ ghoratarā kṣayaikarasikā ciṃtyā sadā bhairavī ।
nānārūpadharā yathābhirucitā ciṃtyāthavā sarvvadā ।।
kastāṃ ciṃtayituṃ kṣamaḥ parataraṃ daivanmahābhairavā ।
vyātunātsahaṃteha kaścidapara(staṃ) varjayitvā priye ।।

aṣṭādaśabhujoddīmāṃ vakrapaṃcakabhāsurāṃ ।
mahāyudhadharāṃ dīptāṃ cintayedvātha suṃdari ।।

yathābhimatarūpaṃ vā pretaskadhanivāsinīṃ ।
(29b)
cakkranātau viciṃtyā sā sarvve tatveśvarāṃtakī ।।

sāmastekamidaṃ dhyāne vyasta śṛṇu sureśvari ।
vādyāpadyāya(saivai)ttā devadevī kṛ(po)darī ।।

tathāpi sarvvapadagā {bhittā}bhittevavatpuna ।
vyaktā sāmarthyasaṃyuktā sarvvātraivaikarūpiṇī ।।

bhedamatravijñeyaṃ paramā(rtho) na bhairavi ।
yathāntyakā tathā sarvvā yathāssarvvāstathaikikā ।।

sarvvāstāścintayeddevyā hyekarūpā sudurddharāḥ ।
ekavaktrāścāṣṭabhujā devyāḥ sa(ddṛśarū)pakāḥ ।।

cakkrārakeṣu saṃrūḍhāḥ kapālāṃkuśadhārikāḥ ।
khaḍgakhaṭvāṅgahṛtpadmamuṇḍaśūlakarodyatāḥ ।।

mahāḍamaruhastāgranetratretāgnisanni(bhā) ।
kiṃ vā paraṃ varṇṇayiṣye devā vyaktā svarūpataḥ ।।

nānavaṃ maṃtravikṣipaṃ paramārthena bhairavi ।
yathāruci tathādhyāyedyathāruci tathārcayet ।।

vyastaṃ (vā ma)saṃmastaṃ vā padenaikena vā priye ।
yathāpūjā tathādhyānaṃ yathādhyānaṃ tathārcanaṃ ।।

evametāṃ dhyāyamānāṃ vīrarāṭsādhakeśvaraḥ ।
tasya kiṃ ba(hunoktena) śṛṇu saṃkṣepataḥ priye ।
devyākāraṃ bhavetsākṣāt kimataḥ paramucyate ।।

iti hi vividhavāyoddāma sakṣoṇicakkra ।
kṣapaṇamidamudāraṃ va(rṇṇitaṃ) te yathā vā ।।
nikhilavibudhavaṃdyā dhyānamuktaṃ mayā te ।
kimaparamadhunā te vacmi vīreṃdravaṃdye ।। ।।

(30a)
।।  iti mahābhairavasrotasi siddhividyāpīṭhe (śira)cchede (ja)yadrathamāmale mahātaṃtre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
taulokyaḍāmarācakkre dhyānapaṭalaḥścaturthaḥ ।।

evaṃ śrutvā devadevī vismitā bhaya(vihva)lā ।
kathaṃcidupasaṃlebhe saṃjñāmapi jayadrathaḥ ।।

samāśrāsya ca sā devī mahādevo mahābalaḥ ।
jayadrathaṃ sāṃntayitvā bhairavo bāhyamabravīt ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

sādhu devi mahābhāge sarvvavīreṃdravaṃdite ।
yadutsahitametaddhi ghoraṃ dhyānaṃ bhayāvahaṃ ।।

sādhu siṃdhupate sādhu yastvaṃmatyaṃśa(raurajaḥ) ।
devīsvarūpakathane yastvaṃ na kṣayamāgataḥ ।।

bhāvinorthasya vāsamya(ktva)tprasādānuvedhanā ।
na naṣṭosi prabuddhosi dhṛtosīha mayā sutaḥ ।।

(mā)hutā sā mayā devī nārūḍhohaṃ hi tatpade ।
tadā prabuddhau yugapadbhavato kimataḥ paraṃ ।।

purā yadā brahmaṇaḥ sā īṣadvṛttisamāśrayā{t} ।
vaktrakāmā(sti)subhage tadā brahmāṇḍamaṃḍalaṃ ।।

sarvvaṃ jvalitamatyāgraṃ brahmaṇo ghātitaṃ śiraḥ ।
punaḥ praśasya (su)bhage tasya sāleśato mayā ।।

kathitā na hi saṃpūrṇṇā bhayātparvvatanaṃditi ।
yathārthatodya kathitā yuṣmabhyaṃ taṃtramadhyataḥ ।।

saṃśāṃtena hi rūpeṇa nodagreṇa sumadhyame ।
tasmādasmānmahāghorātsaṅkaṭājjagadadbhutaṃ ।।

bhavaṃtau ca mahābhāge kṣemetottaritāḥ sphuṭaṃ ।
eṣāmārī mahāghorā kālarātrī bhayānakā ।।

śramanī mohanī kāṃtā hyaṭṭahāsasamāśritā ।
(30b)
śrīdhṛtā ghoracaktreśī hyaghorahṛdayāntagā ।।

tadvarṇṇahṛdayoddāmā mahāmātriśatānatā ।
kālālikokilanibhā harakaṃṭhopamā hi sā ।।

siṃhadaṃṣṭrāsthidaśanā nānākiṅkininūpurā ।
siṃharāmovarttacakrā laṃbastanabhagaśriyā ।।

caṃdrārka{ka}rṇṇābharaṇā yogaṃḍāyutamālikā ।
yogaṇḍapātrā subhujā jvalanajvalitānanā ।।

nānāśvaryaśatādhārā nānāśvaryanidarśanā ।
nānāsaṃkalpakāmeśī nānāmaṃtrāstravigrahā ।।

vidyākoṭisamādhārā dvātriṃśaddhṛdayottamā ।
dūtīnāṃ siddhijananī vīrāṇāmagrasiddhidā ।।

kulaśaṃkulacakkrāḍhyā vīrakhecaryasiddhidā ।
sarvvottamā hi bhūtānāṃ kulānāṃ kuladevatā ।।

cakkrāṇāṃ cakrarājeśī yaṃtrāṇāṃ mātrikā smṛtā ।
bhai{ra}vānāṃ parāśa(kti)ryā(ge)śīnāṃ parā smṛtā ।।

asurāṇāṃ mahāmāyā hiṃsā sā yakṣarakṣasāṃ ।
(sū)rāṇāmasidhārā sā vasudhārāmareṣvapi ।।

nimnagānāṃ mūrttibhūtā meghānāmaśaniḥparā ।
sāgarāṇāṃ mahābelā vetālānāṃ mahāsvanā ।।

dvi(padānāṃ) parāvā(co) tṛṣṇā sarvvacatuṣpadā ।
vyādhīnāṃ hi parācintā sā daṃṣṭrā sarvvadaṃṣṭriṇā ।।

svāhākhyā devakoṭīnāṃ pitṛṇāṃ ca svadhāparā ।
sudhākhyā sarvva(nāgā)nāṃ bījānāmoṣadhīparā ।।

rahasyaṃ maṃtravidyānāṃ yogināṃ dhāraṇāparā ।
gāyatrī sarvvachaṃdānāṃ vahnīnāṃ ca parā śikhā ।।

viśvarūpā hi rudrāṇāṃ karṇṇamoḍhā marudgaṇā ।
(31a)
pitṛṇāmapi vārāhī sādhyānāṃ laṃbikā smṛtā ।।

siddhākhyā sarvvasiddhānāṃ dvipadeṣu jayā smṛtā ।
ucchuṣmāṇāṃ kuṇḍamukhī kaumārī bāla(mā)tarā ।।

sarvvāstrāṇāṃ smṛtā hyaiṃdrī vasūnāṃ pāvakī smṛtā ।
kiṃkarāṇāṃ smṛtā yāmyā nairṛtī sarvvarakṣasāṃ ।।

vāruṇī sāgarāṇāṃ sā vāyavī dānave(dya)pi ।
(ra)kṣāṇāṃ dhanadā proktā rudrāṇāṃ saumikā smṛtā ।।

īśānī guhyakānāṃ śā gaurī sarvvagaṇeṣvapi ।
grahāṇāṃ bhāskarī proktā śu - khyā sarvvasomayā ।।

vaināyakī hi daityānāṃ dūtīnāṃ bhujagāśanī ।
nidrākhyā sarvvasarpāṇāṃ nāgāṇāṃ mausalā smṛtā ।।

bhairavāṇāṃ carmamuṇḍā bhadrakālī prajeśva(rā) ।
preṣakānāṃ śivādūtī kālarātrī kṣayācarā ।।

ṛtūnāṃ kāmadhenurvvai cintāmaṇinidhīśvarā ।
nārāyaṇīmareṃdrāṇāṃ ādityānāṃ ca vaiṣṇavī ।।

niśā sā devakanyānāṃ sāvitrī sarvvatāpasā ।
saptarṣīṇāṃ smṛtā saṃdhyā īśvarī nadiparvvatā ।।

nārasiṃhī kuledrāṃṇāṃ (ca)kreśānāṃ gadā smṛtā ।
śākinīnāṃ mahāmāyā śaktiyogeśvarī kule ।।

dīptiḥ sā maṃtravidyānāṃ kāminīnāṃ priyāparā ।
śikhāśaktirbrahmadhruve jīvacakre sarasvatī ।।

buddhissā sarvvabhūtānāṃ sadevāsuramānuṣā ।
saṃharanti yadā hyete tadāmārīti sā smṛtā ।।

evaṃ sā maṃtravidyānāṃ śāstrāstrakuladevatā ।
mātarā sarvvamātṛṇāṃ vyāpakatvena saṃsthitā ।।
(31b)
asyāḥ svadehagā vyāptiḥ kīrttitā kīrtyatedhunā ।
yayā vyāptā sureśāni samyaksiddhimupāvahe ।।

dhyā(tvā ca) vilādhāraṃ dhārayeta dhvane mukhaṃ ।
sukhaṃ sadvilamāvitya praviśennāḍisatkalā ।।

kalānādaninādāntaṃ antarodhvakalākṣarā ।
varṇṇanāḍika(sā)dhāramādhārokṣarasaṃpuṭaṃ ।।

puṭapadmārddhasaṃrāvaṃ rāvaṇaṃ turyaraśmibhiḥ ।
raśmibhirvvāyunāḍyantamantraṃ yāto(bja)mālikāṃ ।।

mālikā vāyusa(dhāra) - praviśe)ccā)gninairatā ।
ghaṭana(ccā)kṣisaṃjaptaṃ dīptaṃ buddherataḥ paraṃ ।।

paraṃ mahādi saṃdīpya dīpyamārī mahākṣaraṃ ।
akṣarodhvaṃ mahānālī nā(lī)nāḍyakṣaraṃ punaḥ ।।

{puna}rnākhyā mahāmārī mārīcāraśriyāṃ vruṣe{t} ।
juṣaṃ yuktā vyāpticakkre yojyā mārīkṣaraśriyā ।।

evaṃ saṃhāragavyāpti varṇṇi(tā pā)rameśvarī ।
evamākarṇya deveśī sa ca rājā jayadrathaḥ ।।

punaḥ punardaṇḍavatau dharaṇīṃ sumupāgatau ।
* trairnānāvidhairdevaṃ toṣayitvā (punaḥ) punaḥ ।
ūcaturdevadeveśī sarvveśa parameśvaraṃ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।

tvatprasādāṃna naṣṭāsmi devī dhyānāvalokanā ।
la - saṃjñāsmi sutarāṃ rājānāpi jayadrathaḥ ।
tvatprasādājjagannātha na naṣṭo la(bdha)cetanaḥ ।। ।।

(32a)
।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale ma(hātaṃtre) tṛtīyaṣaṭke
vyāptipaṭalaḥ paṃcamaḥ ।। ।।

śrutvā vyāptiṃ tadā devī labdhasaṃjñā sureśvarī ।
punaḥ papraccha subhagā rahasyamidamu(ttamaṃ) ।।

(devyuvāca ।।)

śrutaṃ rahasyamakhilaṃ tvatprasādānmayā vibho ।
na śrutaṃ devadeveśa pratyayo cihnameva ca ।।

uddhārakāle bhagavanna(ḍgādvāra na) saṃśrutaṃ ।
de(vī)nāṃ nāmadheyāni saṃśrutāni mayā na hi ।
etadākhyā hi bhagavaṃbhujaṃgavarabhūṣaṇaṃ ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

śṛṇuṣva saṃpravakṣyāmi rahasyaṃ paramādbhutaṃ ।
ya(nna) kasya (ci)dākhyātaṃ tadadya kathayāmi vaḥ ।।

uddhārasamaye devi cintānyetāni lakṣaye{t} ।
bhūkampaṃ piṇḍacalanaṃ praveśā romaharṣaṇa ।।

siddhādyapakṣivacanaṃ anākāṃkṣyadhanāgamaṃ ।
ekaikaṃ paśubaṃdhāgre sudūrāḥ sukṛsaṃgamaṃ ।।

madirāmadyahastā vā śrutiśāstrāṇyatho(ṅgiriṃ) ।
bālahastāstriyo vātha ślathakeśā supuṣpitā ।।

prasthitā devakanyārthaṃ bhūṣitā vāgrato yayau ।
haḍḍaśilpā tu vaiśyāstrī dhvajachatrakarastathā ।।

rathanāgāśca jānavāṃ yasyā jīvāmṛtaṃ bhave{t} ।
dadhimadhūstilolājā ghṛtadūrvvātha gaumayaṃ ।।

iṣṭāgre varakāntā vā puṣpahastātha puṣpitā ।
anyakāmā kāmaratā kāmāntā kāmaṅkathā ।।

saṅkalpakā kāmamukhā sanmukhā siddhisanmukhā ।
bhavaṃte sādhakasyaivaṃ cihnā vai pūrvvacoditāḥ ।।
(32b)
iha cāmutraphaladāḥ praśastāḥ śubhalakṣaṇāḥ ।
vidyolkāyasyoddharaṇe grahaṇaṃ caṃdrasūryayoḥ ।।

sphoṭanaṃ kālameghasya duṣṭavarṣāsyavarjitaḥ ।
janādhikāṃgāchinnāṅgāchidrāḥ paṃgū (sa)kuṣṭhinaḥ ।।

sadhūmāgnidaṇḍabhujāḥ kṛṣṇavastrāgragāstu ye ।
viruddha- -duṣṭā ye nadrāḥ kṣūdracatuṣpadāḥ ।।

govṛṣā viṣāṇabhagnā viparītaviyontikāḥ ।
vairaṃ (sne)havairavai(jñā) viruddhācāradurmukhāḥ ।।

varjayannagnabhūtāni prāyaścitte japecchivāṃ ।
vṛṣagomārjanākhūnāṃ viḍvarohakharoṣṭrayoḥ ।।

prāyaścittākhyadhūpaivaṃ yuktā maṃtrātsamuddhare(t) ।
ekākṣarādyekatarā ayugmārṇṇāḥ pṛtha(k)pṛthak ।।

antimāstu śataṃpūrṇṇaṃ proktā varṇṇāstrayodhikāḥ ।
yathā tāsāṃ ca nāmāni viśeṣeṇa pṛtha{kpṛ}thak ।।

tathā pravakṣyāmyakhilaṃ vidyā nāmāṃ tu pūrvva(śaḥ) ।
mahāmāri brahmamārī kālarātristathāparā ।।

kālasaṃkarṣaṇi parā aparā kālamekhalā ।
bhañjanī mohanī caiva bhagnosthāva mahābalā ।।

yogeśvariḥ parā cānyā proktānyā kharaheṣikā ।
jharjhariśca tathā ḍhāḍho rudrarāveśvari{sta}thā ।।

karaṃkamukhī hyaparā tathā (haṭu)tpalūṣikā ।
bhairaveśvarītyaparā tathā ḍhakkāriṇī parā ।।

vidyarājīśvariścānya tathā ha(ḍa)bherūḍikā ।
(33a)
rākṣaseśvarītyaparā tathā sarvvottamā parā ।।

mahāmāyā tathā cānyā parāvāgīśvarī smṛtā ।
viśvakarmātyaparā viśvarūpā tathā parā ।।

tathokuṇḍamukhiścānyā romarājeśvariḥ parā ।
cāmuṃḍākhyāparā proktā tathā cintāmaṇī parā ।।

kālāntakṛntanīkṛtyā kularājeśvariḥ parā ।
jīvacakreśvariścānyā viśvalakṣmīti viśrutā ।।

viśvamūrttiḥ kvacitproktā kvacitprakṛtisaṃjñitā ।
iti nāmavibhedena mahāmārī mahābalā ।।

saṃkari(syā)bhidhanākhyā mayā te kīrttitā priye ।
ata ūrddhaṃ pravakṣyāmi yathāvadanupūrvvaśaḥ ।।

aṃgānāṃ nirṇṇayaṃ devi mahāsiddhiphalapradaṃ ।
pūrvvavanmātrikāṃ pūjya kiṃtu prastāravarjitā ।।

kharāśca naracarmmadācuvaviṣṭau samuddhare{t} ।
aṃgāni devadeveśyā śiṣyācāryo prahṛṣṭava{t} ।।

sarvvavidyeśvarasyāgne praṇavaṃnatīsaṃsmare ।
paramaṃ śivasaṃruddho śiva umāgragaṃ smare{t} ।।

mahāyogeśvarāddhṛtya vīranāthāgra saṃsmare{t} ।
viparītaṃ cāragyrastho mahābhairavamuddhare{t} ।।

kālānisūdanākrānte tataḥ kālamukhikramā{t} ।
khāhiśabdo dvidhā yuktā dvidhā bhojyena cakkrame ।।

bhojye jahi jvaraṃ yuktā mahiśabdaṃ punardvidhā ।
atogre ca dvidhāvarma ūhāruddhaṃ niyojaye{t} ।।

tarjanaṃ ca dvidhā yuktā mahocchuṣmāgrasaṃsmare{t} ।
(33b)
kirātarājeśvarāgreṃ graṃthīśo saṃdhyabhāgragaḥ ।।

paṭhegnimadhyādbhūyo hāhaparāghrātabiṃdunā ।
sakhaḍgo lūkhaloddhṛtyamusalāveśa--taṃ ।।

śalarasaṃ ca tvabījapaśuṃ nibaṃdhanamuddhṛtaṃ ।
dvidhātheti ekatvena manalānanacāparaṃ ।।

aparemitatejāgreṅkaro sāgnistridhā punaḥ ।
biṃduśaktitrayaṃ yuktvā (ca)lacālaya vai dvidhā ।।

jalpaharadvidhāyugmau parameśvaramadhyagau ।
rahacānilaśaktogre caṃdrākau ca tatottare ।।

garjanaṃ ca tathā vyūho gaṃthīśo ca dvidhindunā ।
ādyuttarau preṣyavarau madhyāntādyastraduḥsahau ।।

evaṃ śivatamākhyeṣā hṛdayaṃ sarvvakāmadaṃ ।
akṣarāṇāṃ (śa)taṃ sārddhaṃ pātrāveśini yojayet ।।

oṃkāraṃ sanamoyuktaṃ bhagavategryagaṃ smare ।
sadāśivāyeti pūrṇṇaṃ padaṃ hrasvaniyojaye ।।

trayamīhye hītyu(ddhṛtya) hrasvāntaṃ bhagavaṃtathā ।
hrasvayuktaṃ brahmaśivaṃ vaṣaṭkāraṃ tathā punaḥ ।।

sahrasvaṃ coṅkāramukhaṃ paramaṃ vyomameva hi ।
hrasvavyomaśarīraṃ ca vyomaṃ (sa)vyāpine tathā ।।

vyomarūpaṃ tathā hrasvaṃ sarvvaṃ ca vyāpine tathā ।
nirupamanirvvikārau hrasvaṃ ca nidhanaṃ tathā ।।

hrasvaṃ ca nidhane yuktā nidhanā bhavameva hi ।
niraṃjananirābhāsau padasadma sa cākṣarāḥ ।।

hrasvenānanya ojaśca anantarūpakevala ।
hrasvena sarvvasā(nni)dhyaṃ tathā sarvvaniketanaṃ ।।

hra(sva)śivanisudano śivasatyau dhruvākṣarau ।
(34a)
hrasvo guhyātiguhyaśca guhānivāsa eva ca ।।

sadbrahmabrahmarāśegre śeṣatalpāgragaṃ smare ।
visvedarasū(pta)kālā ālayone bhavo pṛthak ।।

bhava nirbhavakārānyasvaro dharmararājayuk ।
svareṇa yajñapuruṣo {ṣa}ḍadhvaradaṃpunaḥ ।।

pṛtha(g)brahmaśāntau ca ta(thā) viśvedaraṃ pṛthak ।
nārāyaṇāviśvamukhā śāntātiśāntau pṛthak ।।

pṛthagevāvikārastu prakṛtirvvikāraṃ pṛthak ।
mahāparaṃmeva paro prakṛtyaṃntapṛthakpṛthak ।।

pṛthaguparimitaśca anavasthaśca vai pṛthak ।
pṛthacchaktyadhvasaṃcinte pṛthakchūnyamukhastathā ।।

khare kharau pṛthakcityaṃ mahābhūtāyuṣaṃ pṛthak ।
pṛthagakṣayārakṣaśca tathā nityodayaṃ pṛthak ।।

svargaogrena stamitamaheśvarapadaṃ pṛthak ।
dhvanideśikāṃte jīvasākṣihaṃvye bhūjā pṛthak ।।

mahādevasahasrākṣī pṛthageva svarāntarau ।
mahāparameśvarānte sarvvavāsapadaṃ pṛthak ।।

vāsudevajñānavṛkṣayathājñeyaphalaṃ punaḥ ।
sarvvarasānvatavasau pṛthaksākṣapadaṃ pṛthak ।।

anādimadhyāvasāno svarāntaṃ padameva hi ।
paramamukhapradaivaṃ svarānāṃ tu padaṃ punaḥ ।।

bhāskareti padasyāgre agniṣomā tu vai pṛthak ।
prasīdeti paramātmasuṃnatyoṃkārajīvadhṛk ।।

ityakṣaraśatātrīṇi ṣaḍakṣara{sa}mādhikāḥ ।
ekāśītipadādhārā śiro devyā hyanuttamam ।।
(34b)
nāmnā brahmaśirākhyastu brahmavyāpitricāṃtare ।
abhyāsādasya niyataṃ ṣaṇmāsātkhalu mucyate ।।

uṃkāro bhavaśaktiśca padaṃ caṇḍe tithau pṛthak ।
kapāliniḥ prate devi jahābījamataḥpara ।
jagaśca prajvalaścaiva hinti chinti padau pṛthak ।।

hinti bhinti padau yuktā(ni) japecca dvidhā punaḥ ।
granthāgre gṛhnamoḍau ca jambhi ostambhi oṃ namaḥ ।।

mohi ovaṃdhi opyevaṃ jaṃbhayaivaṃ punaḥ punaḥ ।
paramacaṃḍeti paścācchīghramānaya vai punaḥ ।।

bhūyaḥ pratodaṃ savyūhā mahocchūṣme tathā punaḥ ।
bhavacchaktimato yuṃktvā namaskāreṇa rodhaye{t} ।।

saptasaptativarṇṇaiṣā śikhā devyā mahābalā ।
divyastrīṇāṃ sadā yojyā vaśyārthe nāgakanyakāṃ ।।

uṃkāro bhavaśaktiśca bhīmapāṇimataḥ para ।
bhagavatyagre ehyehi mahāmāri ataḥ para ।।

astrāgre devatānāmetaraturupadau dvidhā ।
savisargaṃ ca graṃthīśo dvidhā prasphārajahayuk ।।

pharīmaṃ me(gha)māleti mahāmāye punaḥ kramā{t} ।
māyeśvari samuddhṛtya vidyucchabdasamuddhare{t} ।।

kaṭākṣeti trayaṃ dadyāduddharetkṣapayatrayaṃ ।
udariśca padaṃ (guhyāṃ)bhāsvarūpaniveśaye(t) ।।

rūpeśvaryaṃ te sacchaktivirūpeti tadagrataḥ ।
jvaleta mukhetyagrasthe caṇḍeśvarisamuddhare{t} ।।

śūnyavīthau ghoranā(śo) tadagre vīranāyakaṃ ।
(35a)
hā hā bharūṭetyagrasthā bhāruṭiścāpyanusmare{t} ।।

haṭṭāyudhā gṛharmmeti tarjane ca tadagrataḥ ।
vajraśarīretyagrasthā dhā - ṇiśca niveśaye{t} ।।

cakrarājeśvariścānyo hīmahī bhṛ - yaṃ punaḥ ।
nisvanyagre kālāṃbudabhagnaśabdaṃ tatogrataḥ ।।

hanayugmaṃ dvidhā datvā tadagre tarja(nī) punaḥ ।
bhīmāstrāgre pratodaṃ ca tarjanaṃ ca tatogrataḥ ।।

mukhiśabdastadagre vai hraṇḍaśabdaṃ tatogrataḥ ।
ityakṣaraśataṃ pūrṇṇacatvāriṃśatrayo(dhikaṃ) ।।

viśvaiśvaryānātravarau āvāhanavidhau smare{t} ।
sacchaktivajramadhyā vaitārī bhīmāstrasaṃpuṭā ।।

mahāśabdaṃ kirātaśca caṇḍālatrayameka(taḥ) ।
dvidhāvatāretyudvṛtya āvāhanamukhaṃ smare{t} ।।

kṣalajamapiṃḍavaro bhaṃḍīrathasamuddhare{t} ।
caturddhātarakādevaṃ vajrasāramukhaṃ smare{t} ।।

sarvvāvarttamukhāgrasthāmacchaktiśca samuddharet ।
dvidhā jahāni vaktavyaṃ kalikālapadadvayaṃ ।।

vidhvaṃsanakaro(ddhṛ)tya preṣyayugāmanukramāt ।
tarjanakṣaraemaṃ ca ṣaḍā vai vajrasaṃsthitaṃ ।।

ādyaṃtau biṃdvākarṣāḍhyau kramātsaṃyojya yojayet ।
khamanalastvathakāro graṃthirāmantaraṃ smare{t} ।।

vajrānilāsane yuṃktā bhīmāstreṇa nirodhitaṃ ।
ityeṣa kavaco ghoraḥ śisvāsaṃdhyārṇṇadīpitaḥ ।।

yojayecchatrunāśāya pātālākāśasiddhaye{t} ।
dvidhā gacchettrayaṃ dattvā tridhā bhūryaṃ tadagragaṃ ।।
(35b)
cakkrāṃ rājeśvaroddhṛtya mahāśabdāgragaṃ smare{t} ।
ritaśabdaṃ dvidhā datvā romaṃ ca halamākṣara ।।

jvaladvidhā mahāraudraroṣikānalataḥ pada ।
dvidhā tapatāpayaivaṃ ka(ḍṭai)vaṃ daha eva hi ।।

ghorācārasamuddhṛtya mahāghoraniyojaye{t} ।
vāḍavāgnisamuddhṛ(tya) prasannaiva dvidhā punaḥ ।।

jvala evaṃ samuddhṛtya tathā jvālaya eva hi ।
anilonalamadhyastho biṃduśaktipuṭaṃ smare{t} ।।

śūnyavīṣyanalānilau pūrvvaḥ (dravya)mataḥ para ।
ṣoḍaśena samuddhṛtya yojayet paramāṃtima ।।

aparaḥ preṣako datvā kālāstra tu samuddhare{t} ।
ityeṣāstravaro devyā aṣṭāśī(tya)kṣaraiḥ sama ।।

aiṣīkākhyamahāghoraṃ sarvvaduṣṭakṣayaṃ smare{t} ।
aṃgānāṃ nirṇṇaye devi yathāvadanupūrvvaśaḥ ।
vidyeśvaryā tavākhyātaṃ sarvvasiddhiphalaprada ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre tṛtīyaṣaṭke caturvviṃśatisāhasre
trailokyāḍāmarāca(kkre aṃgoddhāraṃ) ṣaṣṭhaḥ paṭalaḥ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

ata ūrddha samākhyāhi yajanaṃ sarvvakāmada ।
sādhanaṃ devadeveśyā suranāthamaheśvara ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi devyā yajanamuttama ।
ekāṃte nirjane ghore śmaśānā vā bhayāvahe ।।

devodyāne tavādivya(saṃgame vā suridvare) ।
(36a)
viśrute vā nageṃdre vai sāgarasya taṭethavā ।।

sughore śūnyagehe vā divye vā mātrikāspade ।
yathā vā snāpayogena liṃgādau (puraṇājire) ।।

tasyāgrataḥ svagehastho devadevīṃ yajeṃniśi ।
devyāpadāṃ prāgdiśistho vāruṇyāśāmasasukhaḥ ।।

śodhayedbhūmivivaraṃ trayo(rajataśaṃkunā) ।
(hāhū)maśaktipātre vā kṣiptvā samyaktripuṣkaraṃ ।।

tathaivaṃ chādayitvā tu uddhārecchaktimaṃdiraṃ ।
ekahastaṃ dvihastaṃ vā caturaṣṭyaigha - pi vā ।।

hastāḥ ṣoḍaśadvātriṃśaḥ kāmato vā yathecchayā ।
sudṛḍhaṃ ṣaḍguṇaṃ divyaṃ divyārāmasamudbhava ।।

suślakṣṇaṃ susamaṃ snigdhaṃ sūtraṃ kṛtvā (likhetpu)ra ।
rajairdivyaiḥ samaiḥ śuddheḥ sitapītākaṇānvitaiḥ ।।

caturaśraṃ caturdvāraṃ ghaṃṭācāmarabhūṣitaṃ ।
etākādarśachatrādyaṃ savitā(naṃ) sa-raṇa ।।

nānākusumasusphītaṃ ālikhenmandirottama ।
tasya ma(dhye) yathā yādṛgdevatā devatāśrayaṃ ।।

nyastavyamerulopena tathāhaṃ kathayāmi (bhāḥ) ।
bhignājanasamākāraṃ jvālānanasubhāṣaṇa ।।

devatākurasaptādyaṃ tanmadhye śūlamālikhe ।
śūlasyorddhalikhe cakkre arādvātriṃśavistaraṃ ।।

dagdhadhanāgnisadṛśaṃ bhavasaṃhāravikrama ।
tanmadhye tu likheccakkrapūrṇṇimākṛtivigraha ।।

navapāleṣasadṛśaṃ kuliśaṃ kulavigraha ।
aṣṭāśraṃ tu (tatau) tepi jvalatpāvakavarcasa ।।
(36b)
kulabhairavaśṛṃgādhyeṃ madhye devyavibhūṣite ।
dhruvāṃkārakṣibhistvāḍhyaṃ nānātejaśarīriṇa ।।

likhedbhinnāja(na)kāravyomacakkrasya bāhyataḥ ।
vyomeva vartuladivyaṃ vyomāṃte bhāskaraprabhaṃ ।।

mahāvīraiśca susphītaṃ bhāskarākhyaṃ likhetpura ।
jāṃbūnadasamā(kāraṃ) rudraikādaśavigraha ।।

vartulaṃ ca tato bāhye vāyavyaṃ puramālikhe(t) ।
tadbāhye tu nabhākārā yuganetra bhujānanā ।।

bhrāṃmayaṃtī vāyugehaṃ (likhe)cchaktiḥ sa vaiśibhiḥ ।
tadbāhye saptadhā māyā gokṣīre samavigrahā ।।

bhūcaryakulasaṃbhinnanānāmaṃtroditā purā ।
dvāreṣvato sakoṇeṣu (upetāve)ntarāmiṣu ।।

lokeṣvaryāsu vinyastva vinyaseddūtikaiṅkarāḥ ।
pūrvvavasūtrapātastu kṛtvā sa ddaiśikena tu ।।

nyastavyā tattvadehāni samasta - stalakṣaṇā ।
gṛhītvā naraśaṃku vai hemaśaṃkurathāpi vā ।।

ālikhettattvarūpāṇi rajataḥ śaṃkunāpi vā ।
āmnāyena yathā tasya tattvabhedena vai pṛthak ।।

vinyāso jñānapīṭhāṃte tacchṛṇuṣva ca vīmite ।
bhaiṣiṇiḥ praṇavasyāṃte astrāgre preṣakaḥ samāḥ ।।

yojayitvā yaṃthānyāyaṃ saptadhā viniveśa(ye) ।
nārāyaṇī madhyaśikhāṃ pārśvābhyāṃ saiḍphisūkarī ।।

māheśvarī caturthī tu śūlabhedī mahābalā ।
śūlasyorddha adho madhya krameṇa kuladevatā ।।

nyasedbrāhmatathāgneyī raudrī hyacchuṣmasaṃjñitā ।
(37a)
śūlasyorddhe tato cakraṃ arādvātriṃśabhāsura ।।

vidyādvātriṃśasaṃyuktaṃ vinyaseddevatātmaka ।
saśaktiśvasamuddhṛtya ghorabhīmau samasmare ।।

jvarohṛrddhasamālagnāṃ biṃdurvvajrasamaṃ punaḥ ।
svātubhāvye kalasamaṃ bhūyoharyasuvigraha ।।

sabhīṣaṇo hyarddhabāhuṃ yuktā ojena ve kramā ।
ādyātsaptamasaṃyuktā sarvve biṃdusamāḥ purāḥ ।।

cāṃdrasyogne nārāyaṇī saiho bhīme tathā punaḥ ।
raudrī caiva tathā saurī brāhmī cānalavigrahā ।।

saptamī kularājeśī śaśāṃkī ca mahābalā ।
mūlahināṣpadkulārṇṇā paṃcadīrghapṛthakpṛthak ।।

bhīmakālāstramadhyasthā dvātriṃśakulasasmṛta ।
aṭṭahāsaharaharā śṛṃkharī madakoṭarā ।।

haranādāmaṇiṃ bhadrā drāgini pilipiñchikā ।
māṃsādarīmatravasanā aṣṭamī ca caturddaśī ।।

pūrṇṇimāsa amāvāsyā bharūdrī khaṃḍamastakā ।
śivarātrī bhadrarātrī kularātrī vibhīṣaṇā ।।

ṣaṣṭhīramarmarātrī ca jñānarātrī khaśekharā ।
{va}(ṅkā)śīvadravaktrā ca kṛttikā kṛkilāsinī ।।

vidyumālā vidyumukhā mahācchuṣmā mahodarī ।
cakkrasya maṃdirāṃte vai kularājñā hyanukramā ।।

tattvarūpasamādhārā nyāsai dvātriśasaṃkulā ।
jīvehavabrahmahī ca kālaṃstrotīṣaṇātmakaḥ ।।

tarjano khecaraścaiva mātribhūtā svasaṃjñitāḥ ।
nṛsiṃhī bhairavānaṃdo siṃhabhīmoṭṭahāsakaḥ ।।
(37b)
mārttaṇḍamatha vārāho śrīghoṇā duṣṭavarṣakaḥ ।
aiṣā nādikoṇeṣu āgneyasya anukramā{t} ।।

tattvarūpavibhedena vinyasedbhairavāṣṭakaṃ ।
kalā(ḍku)śāṅkārānteṣu ekadhā praṇavaṃ punaḥ ।।

sabiṃdumātrikā paścāḍyasegnyaptvāḥ svanojjhitāḥ ।
vyomānte ca dhruvaḥ sākṣātpraṇavaṃ ca tathā punaḥ ।।

ṛṣayo vīrarudrāstu yoginyo vividhātmakāḥ ।
śāṃtārastejamadhye vai paṃcamādirnapuṃsakaiḥ ।।

varjitātraṃ svarāścānye (yognaya)dbiṃdunā tathā ।
śamaiścāva niketaśca haro rudra haro bhṛmi ।।

nivaṃkurokṣa śabdaśca nyasedvīrāṣṭabhāskare ।
svarādyaṃ napuṃsahīnā svarāḥ krodhaḥ prasādhayet ।।

yuktvā niyojayedbiṃdau kramaśastu yathākramaṃ ।
haraśca kṛntivāsaśca viśveśo rukma eva saḥ ।।

ajo paśupatiḥ śastrastathā vai nīlalohita ।
viśvādako hariharo tathā vai bhūtavigrahaḥ ।।

ityekādaśarudrāṇi śatarudraśarīriṇaḥ ।
rudrakoṭisamādhārā nityaṃ (vaṃdyā)lake yaje{t} ।।

bhīṣaṇo(rvvagni) madhye vaikaśāṃtā biṃduvigrahā ।
caturthasvarasaṃyuktā uddhareta pṛthakpṛthak ।।

lampaṭā vimalā krurā kallaṭā ca virūpinī ।
mahodarā mahākāyā vāyasī śivakokilā ।।

hariṇī hāriṇī bhadrā ucchuṣmā cuṇḍacuṃḍikā ।
haṃseśvarī meghanādāṃ duṣṭārādhyā gaṇeśvarī ।।

dhūmrā kāpālinī caiva kaṃkaṭā ca madotkaṭā ।
(38a)
kolāhalī ratnanābhā tathānyā ketumekhalā ।।

aṣṭāviṃśevakoṭyāṃte khecaryaḥ parikīrttitāḥ ।
saptasaptavibhāgena śasyarddhakṣīrasāgare ।।

nānāratnasamādhāre khecaryā śaktigā yaje{t} ।
vimuktā bhīṣaṇenaiva bhūyevaṃ ca visargajā ।।

anukrameṇa vidhiva(dyu)gmaṃ (yu)gmaṃ samuddharet ।
ṛṣabhā । vihagā । {kaṅko ।} kaṅkolī । kālaśarvvarī ।।

visphārī na(u)ṣā niṣṭhā mekhalā musalāyudhā ।
ulūkhalī paṃktibhujā bindujo vitpavitrakā ।।

hala । hālā । khuvadanā । vitrāsīvṛṣadaṃśikā ।
sarasā । kakubhā । kūrmā । dantā । śarmāca । jijakā ।।

kalūṣī । kalikailā ca kaṃdalā । sāgniśekharā ।
bhiṃḍerathī vicitrākṣa prayapā । sṛgbhujāstathā ।।

visphoṭāṃśī । gaṃḍabhujā । lohaliṃgā । narottamā ।
devaraṃ । śāviṣṭacīrāṃ devīmeghā । graṇīstathā ।।

meghamālā । dṛḍhananā । bhūyiṣṭhā । bhūcarī । kṣamā ।
prabhāvatī । bhadravatī । karoṭī । vīraśekharā ।।

śyāmā । hayā । śikhā । rohī । kakāṃśā । kākamekhalā ।
ṣaṭyaṃbā śivaṃmayorddhatattvarūpā hyanekadhā ।।

yaṣṭavyā daiśikodreṇa bhūcaryābhimatārthadāḥ ।
ekadhā jvarapāṇīśo tejamadhye nidhāpayet ।।

svarairdvādaśabhiryuktā yojaye biṃdunā pṛthak ।
kardamo nahuṣo nāparāvaṇo kālaśekharaḥ ।।

dhūrjaṭirvviśvamūrtti (vai) - kakurda tathā śivā ।
(38b)
suśivā ca śivādūtī kāladūtī tathā punaḥ ।।

catvāryeva pratīhāryā catvāryeva tu kiṃkarāḥ ।
maṃdirasya hi koṇāṃte pṛthagdvāreṣu sarvvasu ।।

ekāntarā suvinyastvā madhyadvāreṣu dūtayaḥ ।
madhyamā karabījābhyāṃ astra ca jvalanentarā ।।

astragrāmāṣṭadaśadhā nipātreva pṛthā smare{t} ।
triśūlaṃ paṭṭisaṃ khaḍgaṃ khaṭvāṃgaṃ pāśasaṅgadā ।।

kapālasphoṭakaṃ padmaṃ haloparaśudarpaṇaṃ ।
śaṃkhaṃ caiva tathā cakra dhanudhvajamasistathā ।।

vajrapāśupatāstraṃ ca pinākaṃ cātibhāsu(raṃ) ।
astrabījāni madhyasthā māyābiṃduralaṃkṛtā ।।

mātryastreṇa samāyuktā astramudrā tu saṃkhyayā ।
varggā - aṣṭabījāni tridaśārṇṇe niyojaye{t} ।।

kālabiṃdusamāyuktaṃ lokapālāṣṭakaṃ smare{t} ।
mātṛkā aṣṭavargātmā ṣoḍaśena samanvitā ।।

krameṇa tu yathāmnāya samastavyastatoddharet ।
grahārikṣāstathā hāni pakṣāmāsāstu vatsarāḥ ।।

ṛtavo āyaṇaścaiva saṃkhyā kālotha śarvvarī ।
unmattabhairavā siddhā vrataścaiva anuvratāḥ ।।

yakṣārakṣāḥ piśācāśca vighnā vai guhyakiṃkarāḥ ।
pannagā parvvatādvīpā saritāḥ sāgarāstathā ।।

saṃkarākhyaivānuktānye samastā mātrikātmakāḥ ।
astrādisaṃkarāntā vai caturaśrāsya bāhyataḥ ।।

lāvaṇyasāgarasyānte pūjayetsarvvakāmadā ।
kālāstro kālaśakti (vai) padākhyā caiva dāhikā ।।
(39a)
pratodaṃ cātha ṣaṣṭhī ca khecarīvīranāyakāḥ ।
hayagrīvo tathā siddhā raktā śuṣkākarotpalā ।।

kālarātrī mahāmāyā saṃ(khāṣṭau) sahanidrakā ।
grāhyākhyā mātrikāśakti prāṇākhyā ghorasaṃjñitā ।।

macchaktyāntestu guhyākhyā mudrā caiva mahābalā ।
vikaṭā paṃcavaktrā ca sai - - (ca) lilīmukhā ।।

paṃcamā ūrddhaliṅgākhyā mudreśvaryāmahābalā ।
sacchaktihyekavaktrātmā trivaktrāsu sagrāhyakā ।।

ūrddhavaktrātighorākhyā pratītā(mā)trikātmikā ।
viśvarūpā hi (e)vaṃ vai vaktrabījeryathākrama ।।

anukrameṇa vidhivatsamastamavatāriṣu ।
pūjayeccakkranābho hi guhyamudrāna(laiḥ) saha ।।

saṃkhyaṣṭakāgraparyante bāhye cāṃdrasya sādhakaḥ ।
aṣṭāśrasyāntavīthyagre ṣaḍaṅgaṃ cānupūrvvaśaḥ ।।

kalādvayena saṃyuktaṃ prāgdiśādau nyasetkramāt ।
evaṃ maṃtrārṇṇavaṃ divyaṃ nyastvā devagṛhe purā ।।

anukrameṇākrarddhaṃ vai vinyasenmūladevatā ।
madhye śriyāṭṭahāsasyā aṣṭāśrasyāṃtare pṛthak ।।

dhyāyeta saṃkarivyākhyā vidyābrahmāṇḍadīpitā ।
yathāmnāyaniyogena ta(tsva)rūpaviniścitam ।।

vinyāso śabdarāśiṃsyā śṛṇudhvaṃ pravadāmi bhoḥ ।
jvalajjā - nadākārā sūryakoṭisamaprabhā ।।

nānāśvaryānyābharaṇā (nā)nāhemaśatojjvalā ।
nānāhemāṃvaradharā hemacandraśatottarā ।।

hemābjakalaśahastā hemanūpuranikhanā ।
navasīmantaracitā nīlakuṃcitamūrddhajā ।।
(39b)
sudīrghā veṇiśaraṇā rukmamālā śataujjvalā ।
navavāleyadaśanā sasmitaṃ tu dharānanā ।।

yuganetra bhujādevī muktāhārasumadhyagā ।
sumavaṃ nāmatattvānāṃ kalābjamṛtayauvanā ।।

pūjayeddevatāṃ vāme divyakāmaphalāptaye ।
mahātiphaṇi ārūḍho aṭṭahāseti viśrutam ।।

bhairavo dakṣiṇaṃ devyā dhyāyena jaga(taḥ) pitā ।
daśaśīrṣaśatabhujo sahasraphaṇabhāsuram ।।

śaṃkhacakkragadāpāṇiṃ padmatonāsipādapam ।
sragvīṇāmusalāsphoṭāstriśūlokṣamalodhi vai ।।

phalaḥ kamaṇḍaluḥ pāśo jvālāśaktidhanurddharā ।
sūryāmṛtapuṭaṃ śeṣā navapāleyavarcasāṃm ।।

nananetraṃ hi tatpṛthe śaṃkarastu svarūpiṇam ।
siṃhasūkaraṃ sabhinnaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ tasyorddhavājinam ।।

evaṃ sa aṭṭahāsākhyo viśvamūrttiparākṣaraḥ ।
sāsanāsanamāsīno sūryyakoṭisamaprabhaḥ ।।

yajñamadhyasa - dādhyāye bheravo bhairaveśvaraḥ ।
aṭṭahāsaśriyāmadhyasaṅkariṣī mahāprabhā ।।

varṇṇādyāṣṭrārṇṇavyāghrasthā devī brahmāṃḍavigrahā ।
dīkṣākālasadādhyāye śriyā bhairavamadhyagā ।।

arcākāle jape home ca yomelakalambane ।
saṃkari(styā) pṛtha(gdhyā)yedaṭṭahāsaśriyā pṛthak ।।

trīṇyādyā aṃtimāstrīṇi paṃcāṣṭadaśasaptamā ।
yugaḥ kāluṣyaviśvātmā viśvarūpāstrayodaśaḥ ।।

ṣaṣṭhī caturyanavamāmekādaśayugadvayā ।
(40a)
viśvarūpāṣṭakaḥ pūrvvamekavaktrāgnyaṣoḍaśaḥ ।।

ṣaḍviṃśasaptarātraṃ ca trivaktrādyaṃ trayasya vai ।
caturmukhāmareṃdra(sva)śeṣayu(gsassa)ṣoḍaśaḥ ।।

jñātvevaṃ pravibhāgena vidyākṣaramanuttamam ।
sontamaḥ prakṛtirbhedā vibhedoktavikāriṣu ।।

tatorghapādyaṃ naivedyaṃ evaṃ dhyātvā yathākramam ।
prāḍābhiḥ pūrvvapūrvvādvaudyuḍvāyuṃjeta sabhramam ।।

lepanaṃ sūtrasampātaṃ ṣuraśyātphakṣaṇaṃ tathā ।
pīṭhamārohanaṃ caiva (ne)tramaṃtreṇa kārayet ।।

grahaṇaṃ pekṣaṇaṃ caiva tathā śiṣyapraveśanam ।
karttavyaṃ padmanāthena prā(ya)ścittostradehinām ।।

pavitraṃ madhuparkaṃ ca abhiṣekaṃ hyataḥ kramāt ।
hṛnmaṃtreṇa sukarttavyaṃ naivedyāmūlavidyayā ।।

bhogārpaṇaṃ śivenaiva nāmagotraprakīrttanam ।
adhvaśuddhikrameṇaiva hṛcchirāstrairyathākramam ।।

kṛṣṇakācamayaiḥ pātrairnānākāravikāriṣu ।
nivedayetha naivedyaṃ sragvilepanabhūṣaṇā ।।

śaṃkhaśuktyārghapātre vai pānapātrastathā pṛthak ।
tatpātrājyavarttidīpāṃśca catvāryeva diśāṣṭasu ।।

nānārūtpralalohāni sanālāni tathāṃbujā ।
nivedayeta vyastāni samastānyathanekadhā ।।

nānāmāṃsaprakārāṇi nānāpānānyanekadhā ।
lehyacoṣyānyanekāni annāni vividhāni ca ।।

pūpāni mahadājyāni puṣpālaṅkārakāni ca ।
(40b)
madasajjāsṛpṛktāni samastāni nivedayet ।।

evaṃ devyā supīṭhāṃte pūjayitvā suvistaram ।
pradakṣiṇaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā ātmānaṃ ca nivedayet ।।

atorddhe deśikendreṇa sacopādhipariplutam ।
bhaktibhāvākulotpanno śiṣyastatra praveśayet ।।

kṛtopavāsa(sustato)pītavastreṇa saṃvṛtaḥ ।
maunī dhyānaparo vīro vīrācāryāniketanam ।।

astreṇābhyukṣayecchiṣyo hṛcchiraistu tathā pṛthak ।
miśrestu bhūṣayetpuṣpairghṛtenaiva tu dhūpayet ।।

dhavalena tu vastreṇa pītakṛṣṇena vā punaḥ ।
naitrayostu vidhāne vai kuryādvārāntareṇa tu ।।

nānāpuṣpaistathā ratnairbhūṣaṇaiḥ pravaraistathā ।
prāṅmukhaudaṅmukhau vāpi śiṣyo puṣpaṃ kṣipāpayet ।।

yasmiṃ puṣpāṇi divyāṃte dṛśyaṃte paritāni tu ।
tadaṃkito tadā nāma śa(ktya)ntaṃntasya homayet ।।

(agnā)sya vastraṃ netrābhyāṃ pūjayeddevatā pṛthak ।
madhuparkādividhinā yathākāmaprakāmataḥ ।।

kuryyātpradakṣiṇaṃ devyā śiṣyeṇa guruṇā saha ।
śrāvayetsamayāṃ paścādadāpuṣi yathākramam ।।

bhūyaḥ pradakṣiṇe datvā paśuṃ tatra nivedayet ।
tadarghamadhuparkeṇa śiṣyo devyāṃ yajetpunaḥ ।।

tacchālacodito kaścidyadi bhaktyātithirbhavet ।
sopi tatraiva rugrāhyā saśi(ṣya)tva । ko mahat ।।

asṛṣṭamakulotpatne abhaktaṃ durvviceṣṭitam ।
haṭhātpaśyati yo yajñaṃ tatkṣaṇātsa vinaśyati ।।
(41a)
tasmādguptiṃ tadā kāryā vidyāyogeṣu devatām ।
gūḍhatatvasya satataṃ hastasthaḥ sarvvasiddhayaḥ ।।

saptāhāyajñane devaṃ yaḥ samācarate naraḥ ।
tasya hastagatā siddhi laukikī kāmasiddhidā ।।

māsamekaṃ yajedyastu bhavate saguruṃ preyaḥ ।
nityāviṣṭastadā śiṣyo jāyate nātrasaṃśayaḥ ।।

dvitīyassādhakassiddho siddhavadvicarenmahīm ।
tṛtīye cakkravarttī syādrājarājeśvareśvaraḥ ।।

caturthenāsurāṃbhogāṃ guhyakānāṃ tu paṃcame ।
gaṇādhipatyathaṣvena saptameṃduṃsamo bhavet ।।

aṣṭame brahmatulyosau bhavate ghoravikramaḥ ।
kadratulyastu navame daśame viśvavigrahaḥ ।।

sakariṣṇī sanomaṃtrī yāge hyekādaśakṛte ।
dvādaśe sādhakau yāti iśvarasya padaṃ śubham ।।

yadā maṃtrī layaṃ prāpto vidyāyāgena īśvaram ।
sarvvabaṃdhestadā mukto sakhaprāpnotyanuttamam ।।

evaṃ puṣpapradāneyaṃ daiśikeṃdreṇa dhīmatām ।
yuṃktā prathamataḥ śiṣyai paścāgniśaraṇaṃ nayet ।।

yajñasya dakṣiṇe bhāge pūrvvo pūrvvottareṇa vā ।
guruśiṣyaistato homaṃ karttavyaṃ sarvvadevatām ।।

pratividyā śataṃ sāgraṃ nānātatvaśarīriṇam ।
hutvā tripuṣkareṇaiva paścācchiṣyaṃ viśodhayet ।।

paṃcāmṛtaṃ tilaṃ kṛtvā saṃskṛtvā jātavedasam ।
aṇḍādhvanatataḥ śiṣyo yuktā samyakpraśodhayet ।।

suvyastvāhṛtpadāṃtebhyo pṛthagokāralakṣaṇām ।
vauṣaṭkāreṇāgraśataṃ (kṛ)tvā brahmaśivaṃ hune{t} ।।
(41b)

adhāśuddhiḥ pāśadāho pūryaṣṭakaviśodhanam ।
śikhācchedaḥ pāśadāhaṃ kulaśrāvaṇameva ca ।।

gotranāmaniyoge ca tattvaśuddhirvvi(śe)ṣataḥ ।
kalā māyā niyatyadhvaprakṛtiḥ puruṣādhvabhiḥ ।।

sthūlasūkṣmādhvabhiryuṃktā yathādhvā bhuvanādhvabhiḥ ।
yaṃktā niyuṃjayedbhūyo īśvarādhvagataṃ puram ।।

evaṃ madhyena yogena kramaśastvantarottamam ।
tatvādhvaṃ śuddhamaṃtrāṇāṃ vidhyāsiddhe vrajekṣaram ।।

śiṣyamevaṃ hi guruṇā niyukto śabdamekhalā ।
abhiṣeko na dātasyā{ta}dātavyoṣṭadaśehani ।।

totakaḥ śakalāṃtastho śaktiḥ śakalavigrahā ।
saptabrīha mayā vāpi gaṃdhadārumayāthavā ।।

ekamūrttidharāḥ sarvvā aṭṭahāsaśriyāṃtare ।
yathāvaccakravāreṇa cāreṇa viśvavigrahaḥ ।।

prāguktakamalaṃ divyaṃ dhātubījaiḥ supūjitam ।
nānātīrthodakaṃ divyaṃ nānāgaṃdhaiḥ suvāsitam ।।

ekatvabahubhiḥ puṣpaistathāvāsaḥ subhūṣayet ।
dhūpayedbahubhirddhūpaistathā gaṃdhaiḥ suvāsayet ।।

yuktaivaṃ kalaśavaraṃ yajñasyāntaradiṅmukhaḥ ।
nānāmaṃtravarairdivyaiḥ kalaśaṃ cānumaṃtrayet ।।

evaṃ jñānamayaṃ toyaṃ yuktā mūrttiśivena tu ।
dātavyaṃ mūrddhni divyānāṃ tathā śiṣyasya aṣṭadhā ।।

labdhābhiṣekoścācāryo yathotko viśvamekhalā ।
tadā saṃpūjya ācāryo yacchedājñāguruḥ punaḥ ।।

labdhānujñāthavidhivattato yajñasamācaret ।
(42a)
yaṣṭvā yajñavarormadhyā tadā japyaṃ samārabhet ।।

unmattākhyaṃ vratavaraṃ etamudbhūtakothavā ।
sādyaṃ saṃvatsaraṃ cītvā tato yāgaṃ prakalpayet ।।

athavā rajarūpāḍhyo nānākāravikāriṇam ।
kṣmādyuttārontarādhāro nānāpuṣpāṃvarontaraḥ ।।

saścarodāpacakkrāṃgaṃ mukhamūrttekṣaṇojvalaḥ ।
sameṣayuganetrāḍhyā visame viṣamekṣaṇā ।।

yathāssarvvebhicāreva daityadānavalaṃbhanā{t} ।
caturvvakrā punardṛṣṭvā ṣaḍaṣṭadaśa ānanā ।।

pūrvvapaścimavaktrābhyāṃ dvivaktrāduṣṭameva vā ।
samasta eva yuktavyā netradvayavibhīṣaṇā ।।

evamūdbhūtako nāma vratastrailokyavikramaḥ ।
unmattakā hyevameva nānākṛtyaṃ varolvaṇā ।।

gadāśaktidharāvīro tadā mūktālakassadā ।
carakto vratanāthābhyāṃ maunī(ḍhaṇṭa)ravācakaḥ ।।

paṭāṃte devatā kṛtvā yathāmūrttiparāyaṇāḥ ।
kalaśena samāsūnu japellakṣāṣṭakaṃ purā ।।

puṣkarādyerāputāṣṭikṛtvā paṃcāmṛtaṃ tilam ।
tatpātrastho jñāne dvidvāṃtābhyāṃ pūrṇṇāhutiṃ hunet ।।

vratāṃte ca punaryāgaṃ pūrvvokte hi vidhānataḥ ।
ājyasyāṣṭasahasraṃ tu hutvā karmastrayojayet ।।

evaṃ kṛtvā japennityaṃ juhvaśa(ktyāṃ) tripuṣkaram ।
svadehā vaśago maṃtrī kurvvatyevaṃ bhavetsadā ।।

paṭasyādhe maṃtravaro yathācāraparāyaṇaḥ ।
sādhayetsarvvasiddhānāṃ ātmayoktā yathākramam ।।
(42b)
kalāśatasamāyukto japellakṣeṣṭakaṃ purā ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavastrotasi vidyāpīṭhe siracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturvviṃśatisāhasre
tṛtīyaṣaṭke trailokyaḍāmarācakro yāgādividhiḥ saptamaḥ paṭalaḥ ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

tataḥ śṛṇu priye samyaksarvvadevanamaskṛtāḥ ।
siddhayastu pravakṣyāmi praśastā hyuttarontarāḥ ।।

trīṇi tripuṣkarādyāni pūrvvapātro mṛtāni ca ।
tatkṣaṇā jāyate śāṃti sarvvagrahavimardinī ।।

proktinaṃ puṣkarādhyena yuktyaṣṭasahasraṃ hunet ।
abhīṣṭaṃ sādhayenmaṃtrī mahāhavanavikramāt ।।

āsurī ca mahāreṇḍasutailaṃ abhireṇḍana ।
nirjīvayati daityāni sahaṃsracaharākṣasī ।।

pūrvvaraṇḍasarākanyā mūlāvidyā hi saṃpuṭā ।
pūṣayaṃti pitāputraṃ saptāhe nāthaśaṃkitam ।।

vidyāpuṭaṃ ca prāṃgdravyai likhito emapallavaiḥ ।
saṃcālanyasureṃdrāṇāṃ sahasrahavanādbhṛśam ।।

dīkṣā yajñāṃtare līno vidyātatvāntarānugam ।
kapālarājināntastho pūjyarāgeṇa saṃlikhet ।।

nityarakṣābhave{t} hyeṣā sarvvāmartyo vimucyate ।
saṃgrāme jayamāpnoti sasurāsu{ra}nirjitaḥ ।।

ta eva pātramadhyasthā kṛtayāgāditarpaṇaṃ ।
tatrasthā vadate sarvvaṃ praviṣṭā vā kumārike ।।

tathaivaṃ cakkrakhaṭvāṃge vyomadīpasilānale ।
tṛka{pā}lāguṣṭhāntasthā trailokyaṃ vadate svayam ।।
(43a)
evaṃ karmavibhedena samastā sūtralakṣaṇā ।
suvyastosu tathā tādṛka{śṛ}ṇudhvaṃ pravadāmi te ।।

yadaṃgo viśvarūtpatipaṃcavaktrākhyaviśrutaṃ ।
āmnāyoktena vidhinā dhyayāvastrāntarekhilam ।।

tadagrasthe japaṃ kuryāttatve vratavarottamam ।
vīrāsanavrajedvīrā brahmacaryeṇa varttataḥ ।।

tato vā śaktisāmānyā samaloṣṭāśmakāṃcanaḥ ।
satyasthānasamādhistho bhojyakālagaṃtaphalam ।।

tekaudhvajasatvabudhvā śaktikandalasaṃbhavā ।
akṣamālā hi rūpaivaṃ kṛtvā nityaṃ sadā smaret ।।

dhyānairvvajyā ca home ca japyasnānaṃ ca tarpaṇam ।
niyataṃ niścayaṃ hyevaṃ divārātrau samācaret ।।

vrataikā vratanāthābhyāṃ caryyātvevaṃ yathoditam ।
sādhako līlayā sarvvaṃ yadabhīṣṭaṃ tadāplute ।।

lokasiddhisahasrāṇi vīrasirddhiśatāni ca ।
vratakūṣmāṃḍamāpanno ṣaṇmāsābhimataṃ labhet ।।

taptakṛcchaparādhīno ṣaṇmāsaṃ yāvakena vā ।
caṃdravṛddhyāthavā yukto maṃtrī lokontare labhet ।।

cāturvvarṇyaḥ palaśataṃ kṛtvā palaśataṃ prati ।
taptagomūtrakāhāro maṃḍalāntaṃ na bhuṃjate ।।

tathā jyotpalahavanā pūjyarādyatrikena ca ।
kṣetrapālāni divyāni yaṃtrānyeva anekadhā ।।

hutvā tpalāyutaṃ sāmraṃ sākṣādūtī sa paśyati ।
paśya(tye)vaṃ sakhī kanyā kiṃkarī vābhikāmitā ।।

tadarddhena piśācī (vā) yakṣiṇī kinnarīthavā ।
(43b)
āsurī padahīne ca gaṇakanyāthavā haret ।।

valavālakṣetrāgnyante hutvā cāṣṭasahaśrakam ।
ativṛṣṭiṃ śamayate anāvṛṣṭiḥ phalāni {hi} ।।

śmasūtreṇāśmāvṛṣṭī vai meghavātāśanistathā ।
raktena raktavṛṣṭirvvai parvvatāśaniḥ * * * ।।

darśanānmeghajālāni sparśarddhayakṣa{rākṣa}sam ।
maṃ(tra)jñā līlayā haṃti daityadānavapannagāḥ ।।

gomaśiṃśapavṛkṣā vai nyagrodhādvādasaṃkaṭa ।
hutvā tripuṣkarairlajyaṃ agnyoktaduhitāṃ bhavet ।।

śmaśānaparvvatāvāsī japaṃ saṃvatsaraḥ punaḥ ।
pūrvvendrīḥ prathakārā vajrahutve tripuṣkaram ।।

bibhītakādhe niyataṃ tattvākhyā brahmarajyasaiḥ ।
tadā bhukkurupiṇḍākṣo nāmnā vai brahmarakṣasam ।।

paśyate sādhako nityaṃ japtvā lakṣāṣṭakaṃ niśi ।
tasya vikramayogena devatvaṃ sādhako labhet ।।

athaivaṃ arjjanāsā vai digvāsā hālabhūṣaṇaḥ ।
koṭisaṃkhyā japetmaṃtra juhvaṃ pādau tripuṣkaraiḥ ।।

uktaḥ palaśatānyeva pūrvvoktaparasaṃkhyayā ।
deveṃdratvaṃ labhenmaṃtrī vidyā vikramasāhasāt ।।

taptagomūtrayo maṃtrī kāmāṃ cāpnoti puṣkalām ।
trailokyaṃ tudate maṃtrī kāmaṃ cāpnoti puṣkalam ।।

maṃtrī rudrākṣa(vṛkṣā)vegrī vṛkṣājinaviṣṭare ।
kālāgataṃ samāśnato śatyāyukto mahātapaḥ ।।

sarvvabhūtabhaṣaṃ dantā japellakṣāṇi ṣoḍaśa ।
puṣkalaistilapahoṅgajapārddhārddhasupākam * ।।
(44a)
madhyaśriyā maṃtravaro yuktvā puṣpaiḥ paṭaṃ yajet ।
agnimadhyācchriyāṃ sākṣītsṛṣṭvevaṃ susukhī bhavet ।।

bhuṃjyamānaśriyāṃ bhogāṃ jīveccaṃdrārkatārakām ।
mahāmāyāśrayaṃ paścādyāti ceśvaravigraham ।।

pūrvvavaddaṃpatīnāṃ vai sa vādāyapalāputam ।
kārayeddaśalakṣāṇi modakānāṃ yathākramam ।।

badarīphalamānena hutvā paṃcāṃgakaṃ tilam ।
tripuṣkareṇa vidhivatsapṛktotpalaparvvato ।।

mahākṣetrāṃtare maṃtrī dampatī kṛttikānanam ।
sāgraṃ koṭijapedvidyāṃ digdhāso halabhūṣaṇam ।।

mānī bhairavamādhārā tattvāgreyā paṭāntare ।
pūjayecchaktipuṣpeṇa kṣuradhārādharottamam ।।

pūrvvavadbilvabilvātmā maṃtryārāvaṇaviṣṭaram ।
svabhāvā tu svabhāvātmā bhāvanātmātmanekataḥ ।।

phaṇīṃdro rodaśāṃ mūlāṃmāmūlomūlamaṃjūṣaṃ ।
saṃjuṣaṃ maithunādhāracādhānamapi maithunam ।।

cittojhritasavetātmā bhāvacittaḥ svacetakaḥ ।
yogayukto niyuktātmā sanmānī japataṃ sadā ।।

bhuṃjyamānontavṛṣṭirvvai phalaṃ vā kālacoditam ।
bhaikṣaḥ payoghṛtaṃ toyaṃ anyo vāpi divāniśam ।।

ādadānastadā maṃtrī manoyukte'ṭṭahāsakam ।
ubhayokāśamānena vīreṃdro paśyate svayam ।।

tulyabhūpapramāṇena yogaśaktibalena vā ।
sādhako devatā sārddhe kāloddheneśvaraṃ vrajet ।।

paṃcānvitam ।
(44b)

japacāṃdrāyaṇaṃ caiva paṭādheyaṃ ca lakṣakam ।
tripuṣkarai parvvatilaṃ saṃyuktotpalaparvvate ।।

hutvā sārddhaṃ vadālakṣaṃ viniyogārthabhugbhavet ।
naralohamayaṃ khaṃḍgaṃ kṛtvā saṃgrāmasaṃbhavam ।।

āharenaitabhuvanā samastau pallaparvvatau ।
tābhyāṃ sahatilaṃ pūrvvaṃ yuktā prāguptaviṣṭaram ।।

niyame lakṣamekaṃ tu hu(tvā)pṛthvīśvaro bhavet ।
sa evaṃ khaḍgamādhāya hutvā ṭaṇṭāraṇāmadam ।।

hutvā vibhītagaṃkātotpreṣyamuccārayedrutam ।
tatognimadhyādvittaśo yakṣamūrtti - ropayaḥ ।।

nirgatya sādhakeṃdrasya yathāpuṣpaṃ bhavedvayaḥ ।
chitvevaṃ pādamūlāgraṃ tathānyagrodhaśiṃśayo ।।

brahmarakṣavaśe ttasya tathā sadbhūmidikarau ।
lakṣyātpalaparvvataṃ ca yuktaṃ parvvatilena hi ।।

khaḍgasthorddhapaṭaṃ kṛtvā lakṣārddhaṃ niśi homayet ।
tato kṛtyā mahāghorā siddhavidyādharastriyā ।।

sādhakasya (vaśaṃ)yānti nāgāsuravanaistriyā ।
nāgasya bhavanaṃ gatvā gṛhītvā tilapuṣkarau ।।

sarṣapā saiṃdhave yuktā yojayetāmṛtena tu ।
kruddho dṛgdakṣiṇāgrastho cāṃdrāyaṇaparāyaṇaḥ ।।

lakṣamekaṃ hunedviddhāṃ kravyādāgnau mahāsvanaḥ ।
tato dhyāyettaptānalaṃ śaktirajvāsu maṃtritam ।।

vāmyaṃto dhūmraniryukto jñātoṣamavamātmakam ।
mātmakaṃ cakkramadhyastho śūlenāḍitrayecchubham ।।

śvasanāḍigamādhāro āvāyo viśvavāhinīm ।
vāhasaṃ nāḍipakṣebhyo samāpūto bhavārṇṇavam ।।
(45a)
grastā bhavārṇṇavaṃ dṛṣṭvā sarvvajñānamṛtaṃ jalam ।
tatonmīlya svanayanau muktvānādasubhīṣaṇam ।।

ḍhaṇḍharaṃ ca haredvīro bhojyapreṣyo mahatsvanai ।
tato khaḍgaṃ devatāgrāsaṃgṛhya paṭaśekharam ।।

nirjalaṃ nāgabhavanaṃ saṃviśya ca śanaiḥ śanaiḥ ।
tato phaṇivareṃdrasya svagṛhānāgakanyakā ।।

rasaṃ rasāya(nāṃ) khaḍgaṃ mahārajaṃnapādukām ।
sragvīṇā paṭaho bījāṃ tathā maṇivaraṃgirāt ।।

sarvvasvaṃ vā samāhṛtya svasthānā tu vivāsayet ।
sādhako varakaṃnyābhi yuktāsau bhidyasi kramet ।।

nāgaveśmavaśe nityaṃ (jīvedbra)hmarkatārakāḥ ।
nāmanāmena vā loṣṭaṃ japtvā garbhāntaraṃ kṣipet ।।

tathā śaṃkhādi vai nāgā sādhayaṃti yathepsitam ।
sannirudrontagacchidrāṃ vidyārttānaṃtayojitāḥ ।।

buddhiśaktī{śakti}boddhāntaccito śakticetasaḥ ।
arddharātraṃ japedvidyāṃ madhyamo vatsarādhikam ।।

svasvabhāvāṃtamāpattau ubhayākāśabhāsvaraḥ ।
udayārkasamākāro bhramantāṃ kuṃbhacakkravat ।।

dṛṣṭvevaṃ hṛdguhāvastho aṇimādiguṇaṃ labhet ।
rathacakkravahipadme niyuktā vāḍavaprabham ।।

nirjvalāyāti yaṃtrātmā (yadma)hijvalanaprabhaḥ ।
śūlorddhavaṃ cakkravaro arāśatavibhīṣaṇam ।।

nānājvālā sahasrādyā kāṃcanādrisamaprabhaḥ ।
sahasrāśanisaṃvoḍhu vidyanmālāśatolvaṇaḥ ।।

parasenāṃ dhāvathavaimanyanāgavalethavā ।
sahasravidyunāthasya mahāmeghasya - bhṛṣam ।।
(45b)
nā(nā)daṃṣṭriṣu mūrddhni vā dhyātvā śāṃtiprado bhavet ।
sragvilepanamāhāro vaktrāṃjanamathāparam ।।

bhavitā bhāvanā yasya datvā nāmevaso ca - ḥ ।
japaṃ vā maithunādhāro adharādhārasādhakaḥ ।।

kṣaṇānirnāśayakāntā gaṃdhamāghrāya śoṇitam ।
saṃvattecakkrarājāno kṛtvā yāgaṃ niśāṃtare ।।

dhyā(tvā tu) hṛdguhāsanto bhrāmāṃto kuṃbhacakkravat ।
prasphurāgniśikhākārā sphuradvidyāstrabhāsuram ।।

viśvaśaktyā hi viśvātmā dīpto madhyātma(vāṃguṃ)kā ।
- - śūlanāḍimūrddhasthā daṃśavatkaṃdharāgra tu ।।

niyukto bāhyamevaṃ hi vaṃ brahmāṃḍake vadham ।
dhyātvaiva pūrvvavadvyomaṃ tilaiḥ puṣkaramiśritam ।।

hutvāyutaṃ yathākramaṃ hunetpūrṇṇāhutiṃ kramāt ।
evaṃ kṛte tatastatra sādhakasya vanāntara ।।

pratyakṣaṃ varttate devyāṃ yogeśī cakkramaṃḍalam ।
dṛṣṭvā yo(geśva)rīcakraṃ arcayeta yathākramam ।।

taccittastanmanomaṃtrī khecarīṇāṃ patirbhavet ।
mahākṣetreṣṭamāsāni nājinasthopaṭāgrataḥ ।।

hutvā pūrvvoditaṃ dravyantatpātraiḥ kāṃsyapāvakam ।
ekottareṇa grāsāṣṭau pratimāsopavāsakam ।।

natvā vayaṃ japennityaṃ niryayau jātavedasam ।
ghaṃṭārāvotta(raṃ yā)vadvidhvakṣaṃ vyomapāvakam ।।

saṃyuyuṃjekastaṃbhena dhvanavidyāsuviṣṭaram ।
adhorddhānanasustaṃbhāṃ bhramakuṃbho rathāṃgavat ।।

athaiva pāvakaṃ muṃcasau(ṣṭa) - svabalena ca ।
(46a)
bhrāmayaṃ lokapātālau jvālāyutakaṇitribhiḥ ।।

nirvvahe dhvanisaṃdhānasvavyomābhāri pūrayet ।
tamevevaṃ punaddhyāyecakkrābhyāṃ bāhuu - vakam ।।

evaṃ samānayedvarśyadvipadaṃ ca catuṣpadam ।
raṇasi(ddha)yakṣakanyānāgavidyādharāstriyā ।।

sādhakaṃ svayamāyāṃti devakanyāpsarāstathā ।
aṣṭyaśregnyantaraṃ hyevaṃ bhairavāṣṭasamagrake ।।

samantāstu jvalaṃ vidyādvāhyapuṣkaraviṣṭaram ।
śṛṅgabhairavaśastrāgninānākoṭarabhīṣaṇam ।।

sanādamucchusaṃvidyā jvalaṃ paśyeṇḍamaṇḍalam ।
samākṛṣṇorcyagniśikhāśriyorddhaṃ śaśibhāskarau ।।

taravoṃntajyabhābhāsvaṃstvānayemara(gnya)balāt ।
deveṃdradayitāścaiva phaṇirājastreyā tathā ।।

ānaye suradayitāṃ vidyeśādimahāprabhām ।
lakṣaṇevaṃ kalāsāraṃ sakalastvāśritākṣaram ।।

maṃtro mṛtyuḥ paraṃ yāti yāvadābhūtasaṃplavam ।
saṃdhyā tvevaṃ vrajaśirai aṣṭāgne cottarānalam ।।

cakkrānale corddhamuṃca adhe vajramulūkhalam ।
dhamadhamādyantaṃ sasthau saṃbhrameṇa mahābalo ।।

bhrāmayellokanirmāṇaṃ piṇḍaṃ vāhavakuntavat ।
tadā dṛśadṛśākārā paṇadādimahādhanā ।।

nandapadmākhyanidhayo gṛhamāyāṃti sādhakam ।
kṛtvā tu śrīphalairmālāṃ śrīniketāsane sthitām ।।

śrīsaṃpuṭamahāvidyuvubhukṣu śrīphalottamā(m) ।
(46b)
sa - (kṣapa)ṣṭalakṣāṇi vidhicāṃdrāyaṇāśrayam ।।

sāgratripuṣkare lakṣāṃ hutvātau śrīdhvaneṃdhitaḥ ।
tatognimadhyāvidyeśī caṃdravṛdvyā parāyaṇāḥ ।।

(sādhakā paśyeta sākṣā)dyugapatsuśriyā saha ।
tataḥ prabhṛti śrīputro nānāratnadhanīśvaraḥ ।।

sādhako bhuṃjate bhogāṃ yāvadāhutasaṃplavam ।
(agre vai vadhanaṃsena) vidyābrahmaśikhontare ।।

niyuktvā stambhanaṃ corddhaṃ tālvaṃte śakalāmṛtam ।
svaśrotaṃ śatavāmeva natorddhe kṛtguhāgatam ।।

anu(bhūyasvayaṃ) maṃtrī sākṣārddhaśravaṇaḥ paraṃ ।
śriyāṭṭahāsamadhyasthāṃ tālvorddhasakalontaram ।।

iḍāsuṣumnābhyāṃ tyorddhasamevaḥ śabdamekhalā ।
saka(lārddhaśabdavacca) śatadhāmaiva cocchvasam ।।

saṃpūrayaṃ bhūtanīḍaṃ śabdamārgākṣarākṣaram ।
dṛṣṭādṛṣṭau hi saṃprāpya romakūpamṛtena tu ।।

sāmarasyeva - - - (bhavetsā)rasvataḥ paraḥ ।
śabdatatveva vidyeśī sakalorddhasamuccaret ।।

iḍāsuṣumnā saṃyojya aṭṭahāso śriyā saha ।
catuṣkalaṃ ca tā(lārddha amāvahā)yasātmakam ।।

yuktā vibhedayedvidyāṃ visargāṃtodarāntaraḥ ।
prāṇopānaniyaṃtreṇa samānadhyānamaṃtriṇau ।।

udānorddhasamaṃ - - (bhi)tvā (kālānta)raṃ smaret ।
anenābhyāsayogena dhyātvā cābdamathādhikam ।।

sapiṃḍaḥ plavate maṃtrī yāvatsādāśivaṃ padam ।
sādāśivaṃ padaṃ (hi svaṃ)vrajate sacchivātmakam ।।
(47a)
satśivāśca samuccārya vrajedbhūtaśivākṣaram ।
evaṃ sahṛdaye dhyāyeccaretpūrvvoditaṃ vratam ।।

lakṣatripuṣkare hitvā (pūrvva)yajñaṃ tatoddharet ।
kṛtvā yāgavaraṃ divyaṃ āharetpūrvvamodakāḥ ।।

pūrvvasaṃkhyāsu saṃkalpya bhāvayedvidhipuṣkaraiḥ ।
maṃtrī kṣetrāṃtamāpanno savi - - bhamakṣatām ।।

aṃte vādyādyaṣṭake sutakṣatyasthorddhaviṣṭaram ।
uktāmbarapaṭasyāgre yajaṃto lokada - tī ।।

dampatīṣṭaṃ prabhānarddho sannarddhorddha - - - ṇā ।
tā - dapādimāpanno īśvarāntennavārasam ।।

suśravo vāraṇamukhādamṛtaṃ meghapātavat ।
dhārāsahasramukharaṃ dampatyorddhagavākṛtat ।।

tathaiva viṣṭarāsīnāṃ amṛtākṛtivarcasau ।
cintayetpayabhikṣāśī phalamūlaghṛtāśanaḥ ।।

kaṇāmbutṛṇavāyvādau yāvatsāgraṃ tu vatsaram ।
tatastuṣṭiḥ śivaḥ sākṣādaṭṭahāsaśarīriṇam ।।

saṃkariṣyāgrasampanno sākṣātpaśyati sādhakaḥ ।
yathāntare tathā bāhye veśca vigrahavigrahaḥ ।।

tadvigrahāsamaṃ yāti tyaktvā vā vigraho - mam ।
caturmukhākhyaścakkrevaṃ viniyogena lakṣayet ।।

yugmacakkraṃ trivaktrākhyaṃ krameṇaiva tu sādhayet ।
vaktrāmnāyaviśeṣeṇa samyakjñātvā viśeṣaṇam ।।

sādhayaṃto sukhaṃ lebhe vīreṃdro śūnyakūpagaḥ ।
ekavaktrākhyaṃ yaccakkraṃ viśvacakkrakṣayaṃkaram ।।

khalvaṃva(maviśeṣeṇa viśeṣe)ṇa yathā punaḥ ।
(47b)
tathāhaṃ kīrttayiṣyāmi sarvvāmnāyo kulakṣaṇam ।।

mahāmāyā mahākalpe maśeṣāṃtaṃ tu lakṣaṇam ।
vratobhayena susnātā vīreṃdrā śaktisārathiḥ ।।

bhikṣāśī cāṣṭalakṣāṇi japetprākyaṭamagrataḥ ।
tripuṣkareḥ parvvatilaṃ prāguktavidhināyutam ।।

japapādaṃ (juhā -) dṛṅmaṃtrī bhuṃkte yathoditam ।
divyareṇuḥ palayutaṃ saṃpṛktaṃ viṣarājikā ।।

mahājyena samāloḍya tailaiḥ sarṣapajaistribhiḥ ।
udbhrāmanaṃ saha(sreṇa) dviguṇena tu bhuṃjanam ।।

staṃbhanaṃ mohanaṃ caiva kīlanaṃ bhedanaṃ tathā ।
māraṇaṃ triguṇaṃ naiva tathā vākarṣaṇaṃ smaret ।।

mudraṇaṃ ṣaḍguṇenaiva yogena - mudraṇaṃ tathā ।
kṛtayāgothavā maṃtrī hṛdayena tu mānasam ।।

śaktidaṃḍāgrataścakkro gacchedyogeśvarīkulam ।
arghayitvā svakāśakti(śaktyarghākārapūritā) ।।

praviṣṭo yoginīgehaṃ paṭāṃto mārivigraham ।
tataḥ sā siddhayogeśī dṛṣṭvā sādhakapuṃgavaḥ ।।

svapuṣpaiḥ śaktipuṣpāṇi grāha(yitvā tu sādhakam) ।
udvāryayojayennūnaṃ yuktapātrāmṛtaiḥ saha ।।

tenārgayati yāgāṃte saṃkariṣṭyā tu yoginī ।
phaḍaphepharṛjaḥ śabdaṃ udgiraṃtī nabho(dara) ।।

(grāhyamāṇya)kavrajate śaktyāyuktastu sādhakaḥ ।
tasminlokavare divye svaśaktyā śaktisārathiḥ ।।

yathecchantomṛtaṃ bhuktā paraṃ śivapadaṃ vrajet ।
(48a)
śi(vaśa)ktisamādhārā dhārayaṃto gṛhethavā ।।

śaktyarghapūjayaṃto vai śakteḥ śaktiśikhāsanam ।
svāsanaṃ śaktiyogena śaktiyogena yojayet ।।

japetmṛtyuparaṃkālaṃ tecchayā vrajete śivam ।
śivocāṣṭaśaktyagrato apasavyamupāviśam ।।

śaktitattvakalādhīno sakalodgāramudgiram ।
badhvā tu saihikī mu - skadhayotsavilominī ।।

pu(ṣkarau)rāhareddhūpaṃ śivāgne niśi dīpake ।
vigrahaṃ śaṃkariṣyā tu sughoṣaṃ na hi susvaram ।।

paṭaṃtorddhaśikhābhāge sannastho gāyamuttaraṃ ।
sākṣādyogikulaṃ divyaṃ sādhako paśyave balāt ।।

svādhīno brahmarakṣasya viśvameṣasya dāruṇam ।
dṛṣṭvā samāṅkayecchaktistasmai puṣpāṇi coddharet ।।

puṣpāṃjaliyoga(si)re yuṃktvā cābhimataṃ labhet ।
varayajñaṃ samāva(rtya) ādyarṇṇodaramaṃdire ।।

strīkapālaṃjitāṃtastho nāmamālikhyapuṣkaraiḥ ।
snāśvagnyatile vyomāṃtasaṃjñā vidyāntamaṃ tataḥ ।।

niyokto tu bhavedrakṣā sarvvāpadbhyo vimudhyate ।
phaṇirājapurayāti līlayā kṣodamuttare ।।

samurāsurasaṃgrāme avadhūto jayaṃ labhet ।
tathaivontakapālāṃte savidyuhetirāṃ(ḍli)khet ।।

pūjayetpūrusaiḥ sarvve rūrddhe tu śaśibhāskarau ।
pūjayecchaktipuṣpeṇa pūrvvadhūpena dhūpayet ।।

paṭhetu vigrahaṃ devyā ucconādena susvanam ।
devatā śaktidehe vai saṃviśya ca śanaiḥ śanaiḥ ।।

siṃhanādaṃ (nadedāraṃ) mūrddhamucchusate bhṛśam ।
(48b)
śaktyāṃgātpūjayedbhūyo nānādhūpapalāsavaiḥ ।।

nānāstotrairjayaṃ chabdairnānāpuṣpaphalaiḥ śubhaiḥ ।
marddayanta(tvamālābhiḥ) piṇḍadhātryā tu pūjayet ।।

evaṃ kṛte tadā devī śaktipiṃḍāṃtare sthitā ।
traiṣkālpavārttā vadate darśayeccāṇḍamaṇḍalam ।।

svapnasthā vadate (sarvvakulasaṃ)kulajaṃ yathā ।
hṛdvyomāṃguṣṭhakhaḍgāṃte dīpādeśo ca pātragā ।।

hṛdgataṃ vadate sarvvaṃ muṇḍeśo musalokṣigā ।
utavānara(dgatyā - - - (yā) samudātare ।।

kṛtvā kīkagatāvāṇī sarvvaṃ vadati hṛdgatam ।
hṛdgataṃ tāluśikhayā kālamūrttiśikhāyuṣam ।।

sakalaṃ hṛḍguhāṃ (tadva - ṣṭvā maṃtrīpsi - - ta) ।
hadayādyantagā vidyā hṛdaye hṛdayeśvaram ।।

yuṃktā arkasamākārā manākāre kṛtāvadhau ।
japeta niyatadrātrau (kuṃbhavadbhavatālvagam) ।।

(svatālusta)kalānaddhaṃ kuṃbhake kuṃbhavaddṛḍham ।
dṛṣṭvā bhramantaṃ kālena sadhvayeddhṛdayāspadam ।।

tasmi yuktātsa sadbhāva (micchayā kramate nabham) ।
evaṃ vā tālucittasthā pārthivānte kalontaram ।।

dṛṣṭvā nibaṃdhayettatra sakalau kalayākṣaram ।
pibaṃto tudatarogāṃ (hu - go ca) anekadhā ।।

akṣobhādvuddhimanaso na mṛtyurvvaśamāpnuve ।
athaivaṃ śūlāgralagno rathāṃgeva kalātmakaḥ ।।

yatra yatra kṣayaṃ kuryāttatraiva (lakṣate) kṣayam ।
(49a)
brahmakṣayā brahmanaṃ tu hṛdaye ca dhuraṃdhuraḥ ।।

madhurāgrāṃbumūleva brahmataṃturvvirāḍḍapam ।
jvaṣantamapi yāpantī cintayendrathaca(kkravat) ।।

sarvvaśaḥ kuṃbhacakre ca hṛtpradeśā tu taṃtunā ।
grastvā krodhena hṛdayaṃ hṛdāntaṃ yāva niśvaset ।।

brahmāṇī brahmamūlāṃtādāpādatalamastakam ।
(ākarṣayatīdriyaṃ sāmagrāma)dharbheṇa dharmiṇam ।।

dṛṣṭvā svasthaṃ svadīpena martyo mṛtyuparaṃ vrajet ।
athaivaṃ sadvidheyātmā {kṛtvā} brahmapurau mahām ।।

(vāṇāvāmārisaṃhārākṣu)dbhṛṣāṃ nadate balāt ।
kalāmṛtasamādhāro hṛdayahṛdayākṣaraiḥ ।।

yojayitveha vidyeśī maṃtrī mṛtyoḥ paraṃ vrajet ।
ākṛ(ṣyakṛṣya - vatvantaṃ) taṃtra taṃtra tanantaram ।।

(sintarai) brahmatattvāntaṃ mūlāgrāvākaleśvaram ।
vikalaṃ kalayānaddhaṃ sannaddhārdva vinā vinā ।।

visṛṣṭaścāharetsarvvaṃ śukraṃ piṇḍādijīvitam ।
evaṃ ca dhātumūlādinyastvā pārthivamaṃḍalam ।।

saṃpṛkto krodhaharṣābhyāṃ dhṛṣyaḥ kāsapuṭethavā ।
mārge rajaka(vāṭasmi) mahiṣaṃ tāṃmrasaṃpuṭe ।।

kāṃcasaṃpuṭitaṃ gaṃḍaṃ khaḍgaṃ kanakasaṃpuṭe ।
śaṃkvaṣṭakamathaivaṃ hi sarvvāmnāyoditaṃ purā ।।

dantamme cādi tuṣṭena śivena paramātmanā ।
jñāne naiva yathoktena vidhivaryāsuyojanā ।।

matto bhairavaṃtāṃ yāti martyapiṇḍena sāhasāt ।
śītoṣṇasamacaryasya śa - - - - (saṃdhiṣu) ।।
(49b)
(kuṃbhāṃbu)nā svamūktyātmādiksādhyamaparāsukhaḥ ।
hṛnmūlasatvatattvātmā yuktādhvacaturo vrajet ।।

tasmiṃ sa catura(dvātmā) catu - - - - (yajet) ।
hṛdaye hṛdayānaddho sannaddhorddhaṃ kalāvatā ।।

sāvatāryakalāmūle māmūlacaturādhvagam ।
kalāṃgena suhokṣurvvaissādā(nassakalātmakam) ।।

vikalassakalāvāptaṃ sakalo vikalātmakaḥ ।
tadātmakamathātmānasvasvabhāvaṃ vipaṃcigaḥ ।।

vipaṃcīrṇṇacaraṃhaṃso sā - - - - - (juṣam) ।
kṛtvātmājīvacakkrasya avicāryagamāgamau ।।

gṛhyapādyaṃ madhuparkaṃ ekoddiṣṭena śaṃkunā ।
śūnyakṣayarkaṃ dharāṃ govyaṃ gau - - - - - - ।।

(divyā)ṣṭaṃ tatpaṭāṃstho dhyāyaṃto mārivigraham ।
validhūpākṣagrāmāḍhyo ekākī kṣapajīpakam ।।

suṣantaśaktikusumai pā - - - - - - - ।
tadā nayedaṃburuho yogeṃdrasyāpi yatnataḥ ।।

saṃstutvā hṛdayāṃgena vyaṃgīstroḍyovyapaṃthayet ।
tatastasmiṃ pātramadhya nānā - - - - - - - ।।

dṛśyantaṃ puru(haṃ) ghoraṃ mohayaṃto surāsurān ।
tamarghaye śaktyarghena sattvamālaṃbya cetasā ।।

hṛjjādyaustu tatastutvā mahā - - (dhūpayet) ।
(pūjayitvā) yathākāmaṃ śaktihasto vinikṣipet ।।

taṃ tayāmṛtarasanapācanīyasmṛtāṃ śubhām ।
samyakyāntānatumena - - - - - (kevalam) ।।
(50a)
(uktaśaṃkumaye) pātre pātre rajvānane kṛṣe ।
muṇḍatrayeṇopaviṣṭe digvāsena śaktinā ।।

āhvāraṃ cādhikarttavyaṃ vi - - - - (kiṃkaram) ।
saptārṇṇāḍhyaiḥ samuccārya prethakābhyāṃ ca preṣadhṛk ।।

yathāvadvidhiyogena satvāmaraniyaṃtraṇāt ।
atha tasmintadā - - - - - - (manuttamam) ।।

(avugdhamekaṃ) layānti tatkṣetrāntarinastuyaṃ ।
adhanaṃ sa dinā cānti vyavahāreṇa kenacit ।।

svayemeva hitaṃ - - - - - (śakti)pāṇinā ।
śivāya śivagarbhāya vīrāya ca subhairavāt ।।

kṣetreti yoginīnāṃ ca ghorāṇāṃ kāmadevatā ।
evaṃ niyojya - - - - - - kṛtadhūpakaiḥ ।।

agrato bhojayecchaktiṃ śivākhyeti svayaṃpunaḥ ।
ṣaṭpadmānpathavaṃ bhuktvā mo - te saptame punaḥ ।।

avaśyaṃ devatā (yānti kalpoktāstavanekadhā) ।
saṃprāptānāṃ tathā tatra devatānāmanukramāt ।।

datvārghaṃ ca caruṃ bhuṃktā taiḥ sārddhavrajatena tam ।
ityaṣṭaśaṃkurājānaṃ (yathoktaṃ sāpi) gacchati ।।

ihaivāso bhairavātmā bhinnapiṃḍo śivaṃ bhavet ।
aṣṭaśaṃkuvilopyāśu śaṃkuprākāradakṣiṇam ।।

saṃprāpya caturaṃ dhānaṃ (sakaleṃduparā)mukham ।
(cā)saṃ pitṛvane nityaṃ caturadhvājyapāvakaḥ ।।

saśūlāḍaṃbaraṃ hastā bhikṣārthaṃ vicaretpuram ।
hatvā tu ḍamaraṃ bhikṣāṃ daṃpatīpātrasaṃpuṭa ।।
(50b)
svastīti caṃḍikā yoktvā prīyatāṃ veśmamaṃḍalam ।
ityuktvā preṣayettatra bilvaṃḍamarasusthanaiḥ ।।

preṣayoccaiḥ preṣakātkhyā ḍamaruṃ vahanadbhṛṣam ।
bhairavāhaṃ śaṃkurājā bhairavī śaṃkumālinī ।।

nibaddhā yoginīcakkraṃ prāṇāgniṃ tarpayāmi bhoḥ ।
evaṃ pravadatastatra yaddeyādadhite kvacit ।।

sahatena tu maṃtavyo kavalenāthavā vidhau ।
evaṃ kṛte tadā tatra {śaṃ}kunā piṇḍavigraham ।।

hṛdvyomāṃtarasaṃkāśaṃ dṛṣṭvā nāḍī vibhedayet ।
ayāma(sa)vyāsavyamāmadhyaṃ savyāpasavyake ।।

kevalāntaśaṃkurājā rājñī padākhamucchvasam ।
socchvasaṃtamuṃdānena yuktajñajñānasaṃpuṭam ।।

vidhivadbhrāma(rā)jyaṇḍo maṃtrolūkhalasaṃpuṭam ।
tathaivāntīṃ kuśarājā kālāṇḍakavilaṃbakam ।।

bhrāmayaṃtaṃ yathākāmaṃ sāgniḥ preṣyamudāharam ।
evaṃ maṃtriva(raṃ ku)rvvaṃ vidhivaccetanātmakam ।।

vikkramādyoginīcakkraṃ ānayetsahakiṃkaraiḥ ।
teṣāmarghaṃ yathākāmaṃ pāṭayitvā śikhottaram ।।

catvā vrajati taiḥ sārddha icchayā bhairavātmakam ।
bhairavo bhairavādhyeyo bhairavī bhairavātmakaḥ ।।

bhairivṛttibhairaveṇa bhitvā bhairavabhairavam ।
bhai(ra)bhītsu bhairavastho bhairavāṃkuśasaṃbhavam ।।
(51a)
saṃpṛktā bhairavājyena prācyevaṃ bhairavo bhavet ।
catuṣkalakalāsāraṃ kṛtvā tu sakalāsanam ।।

śiva(syai)vamathorddhaṃ vai dhyāyaṃ prākārabhiṃtu tam ।
śivaśaktyā samāveśya śaktiḥ śivatatuntarāḥ ।।

samuntarontaraṃ dhyātvā paśyetsavyāpasavyakau ।
suvi - tvāgnīṣo meścāntādyāścaturaṃ hunet ।।

hutvā tu madhyaśikhayā śikhā vīrāgragoddharet ।
soddhahaṃsatsvadānena svadānā cāgramagrataḥ ।।

utkramyo(tkramya)tvanalaṃ śikhī vīṇāgravigrahat ।
paśye trikānalābhagnaṃ bhāskaro dehapiṇḍagaḥ ।।

tasmiṃstu savyāpasavyau niyuṃjetsavyasetunā ।
uttarottaramāveśya kalalaikkālalakṣaṇam ।।

sallakṣaṇaṃ nabhamukhaṃ niyuṃjedīviteśvaram ।
antarohye kadā kṛtvā vajrabaṃdhena baṃdhayet ।।

tatkṣaṇāmartyapiṇḍena martyā vrajati puṣkaram ।
guṇāṣṭakasamādhāro yoginīkulajīvikam ।।

bhuṃjamānye rasavarāṃ icchayā vrajate śivam ।
śivaśaktyāharetsāḍhyaṃ vidyācakkrodaye svayam ।।

yojayecchulamūkharā rāvaṇo virarāvaṇam ।
preṣyo satpreṣyapreṣyaṇapreṣakena nirantaram ।।

yoginyo taṃ preṣakena yojayegniśikhāṣamam ।
tatassā yadi siddhātmā śivaśaktisamodayāt ।।

śaktiṃ cakkravandayetvā vīrasyābhimukhaṃ vrajet ।
tasmai datvāśmamatulaṃ (hṛdgataṃ) prārthayetpunaḥ ।।
(51b)
tasyopadeśayogena maṃtrī bhairavatāṃ vrajet ।
hruṃkṛtya puṣkaraṃ kṣetro kravyādagnau mahasvanam ।।

pūrṇṇāhutiṃ samāhūya sakṛdvidyānu(sā)riṇaḥ ।
hṛdayena puṭāvidyā cakkredvyaṣṭārabhāsure ।।

nābhodhyāya ca vidyeśī saṃkulānāsubhāsurā ।
devyo śūlāntare dīptaṃ sakhikiṃkara(bhāsuram) ।।

bhramaṃtaḥ kuṃbhacakkreva pārthivāntasthagaṃ yajet ।
punaḥ puravare dhyāye bhramantarathacakkravat ।।

āyānti devatāssarvvaṃ kṣetrapālānyaneka(dhā) ।
- - (ṣāmantathā) kāmaṃ datvā tu vidhinā yathā ।।

tadvadbhūtaṃ sambhrameṃdraṃ ātmācakkreva bhāvayet ।
tābhyāṃ vidyeśvarīyuṃktvā devatā tatra pūjayet ।।

taṃtre - - kuladevaistathā ca kulabhairavaiḥ ।
saṃkariṣṇīntare pūjya dhruvatārārkavīthigā ।।

vavarṣuścāmṛtaṃ paścāghaṃṭābjenādamadhyagam ।
vāhyayogo - - - - (yācetassā) vratottamam ।।

tābhyāṃ sārddhaṃ tato maṃtrī jitvā kālaḥ śivaṃ vrajet ।
vivarorddhatha evaṃ vā kṛtvā yāgaṃ vicintayet ।।

nirdagddhyavivara - - - - - śaraṇaṃ vrajet ।
tasmiṃ sarṣapayā sārddhapuṣkarāḍhyaṃ ca guggulum ।।

hutvā dvyarddhāyutaṃ gaṃtrāsaṃ śabdanāgnimucchvasam ।
tatogne bhaya saṃtaptābhi - - (vivarāntaram) ।।

daityakanyā vīranāthe prārthayitvā manāhatam ।
ramyaṃ kṣititalaṃ yāṃti daityakanyā manoharam ।।

gṛhītvā sādhakeṃdro vai vidyā te(ja balotkaṭam) ।
(52a)
tasyāsanaṃ maṇivarairnānāścaryanidarśanam ।।

datvāmṛtasamaṃ pāṇaṃ pāyayaṃ{ti} hi sāntvikām ।
sukhaṃ svargāddaśaguṇaṃ yuktvā sādhaka puṃ - - ।।

(nānā)vīraśatārūḍho icchayā vrajate śivam ।
saṅkariṣṇī sirāṃge{na} yojayitvā yathākramam ।।

akiṃcidvidhikurvvāṇo kāleneva svatāṃ vraje(t) ।
(śiraṃ śiraṃ) gataṃ kṛtvā sacchinnodhvādhvabhiparaiḥ ।।

yojayitvā japed vidyāṃ kṛtvā ca sakalāsanam ।
vinedaṃ nādamatulaṃ yāvatkālottarottaram ।।

sa(tvaja)sāgniva(tyo)rddhe yāvajjāyetkhapiṃḍrakam ।
saṃjāto biṃdurityātmā pūjayetpārthivāntaram ।।

tadantamapi cetsvātmā juṣaṃ cāvarttayecchivam ।
(vikalā)ya kalpakaṃ dvāhe dupohaṃ pūrṇṇamāśritam ।।

pītvāmṛtaṃ kālaśire svacchaṃdo śivavad vrajet ।
navakādyāntago vidyā navadvārottarottaram ।।

smare (pūrṇṇeṃ)dusaṃkāśai jvalaccakkrorddhamaṃtritam ।
sorciṣmavyomamudare cintayedvyomamuttaram ।।

tatkṣaṇātplavate yoge siddhena * * taṃ vrajet ।
dvitīye navako (hyevaṃ) sodāraścakkramucchvasam ।।

ātmanasya parasyaivaṃ dvāre dvāre sa cakkrarāṭ ।
astrayoḥ kulasaṃdīpto kulabhiravabhāsuram ।।

saṃkari(ṣya)samūhena sannāpyāsakalannayet ।
śatacaṃdrodarādhāraṃ dhārāśataśatolvaṇam ।।

pibaṃtaṃ sādhyajīvāgraṃ grastātmānātmanaḥ kṣayaḥ ।
yāvatsaṃkhyāsu havanaṃ hārapadmātmanātmani ।।
(52b)
tāvadvarṣasahasrāṇi nītvā śivamukhaṃ vrajet ।
evamevaṃ tṛtīyena niyuṃktātmānamātmani ।।

dhyāyeha pūrṇṇimādhāro cakkrenāṃtarajīvita(m) ।
pṛthakpṛthagūrddhārūḍho muttaraṃ ca śatānanam ।।

aṣṭāṃkuśāsu patito dhārāpātaśatolvaṇam ।
solvaṇaṃ cakkrarājena cūcūkeva samuccayet ।।

niṃyuktā yojayetkālaṃ hṛtpāddorddhamabhīmajam ।
astrābhyāṃ dāhyamadhyaṃ vai śūlaṃ śūlaṃ samantadhṛt ।।

saṃnāpyākṛṣyāśanakairākarṣe ca pṛthakpṛthak ।
kramā(cca)kre majja medo romāsthi snāyu śoṇitaṃ ।।

tvaṅmāṃsoṣṭadhā prakṛtibhūtākṣāsavikāriṇaḥ ।
tathāṃgenārṣabhāvasya rathakuṃbhākṛtī mate ।।

sā snāpayeśratsā)nayetsarvvasvayonāsvāsu śāsayet ।
evaṃ kṛte tadā tatra ṣaṇmāsābhyantareṇa hi ।।

gatasmaro mudritātmāmaśveva vaśago bhavet ।
prati prati ṣaṇmāsaṃ * pibanti paramāmṛtam ।।

icchayā sūtsamaśnaṃto na viśetparamaṃ śivam ।
paraṃ śivasusantāsyā nṛpāduttarate tanum ।।

juṣaṃ caturtha(nnava)ke divyā hṛccakkramuttaram ।
sphurantaṃ pāvakaṃ mucyasādhyavigrahanugrahī ।।

puṃjaprāguktacakkrābhyāṃ smaredrodhuṃ karitrivat ।
tābhyāṃ jagrāhayetsāraṃ (rā)vāptaṃ śaṃkuśaktinā ।।

rathāṃgavasvaśaktyaṃgraṃ grāhya śaktisukhaṃ nadet ।
paramānaṃdayāvejya sodānaṃ punarucchvaset ।।

jīvaṃ śaktyāntaro yuktvā maṃtrī (sva)carago bhavet ।
(53a)
kṣamādipañcapuruṣo vidyā navakapaṃcamā ।।

vikārakambalānadvā prabhekṣmādipuraṃ pṛthak ।
rājārājaśriyāsārddhaṃ santi yuktvā purā - dam ।।

yathā yādṛgrūpabhedādbhedanorddhaṃ khakambalāt ।
tathā tadavadāheva cakkrakuṃbhākṛtirbhramam ।।

śaktirajvā samuddhṛtya piṇḍakūpāṃpa(mūlataḥ) ।
svapiṇḍevaṃ yathākāmaṃ pibanta sṛtamuttamam ।।

saṃsmaretsthalavindvantaṃ śāntavidyā plavātugam ।
jihvāmūlamupāsanto paśutaṃtu(bhirāvṛtam) ।।

saṃpṛtaṃ tu punahyagrai grāhayitvātsvadikṣayāt ।
rauvavamadhumāyaṃnta karitrīvakṣamādiṣu ।।

atu bhūtvā tu bhāvyā vai bhāvayeṃkuśamūlakam ।
mūlamevātmanaḥ siktvā sādhyajīvonubhāvikā ।।

bhāvaye varṣā yutāni saṃpītvā sivamāpnute ।
ṣaḍrasaṃ ṣaḍbhirālīṣu dviṣaṭkalakalā(juṃ)ṣam ।।

vaṇāvakoṣvabhāvyagre saḍkaliṣṇī kuśaṃ spṛśam ।
caṃḍorddha ca nivṛtyaṃśe śāntā vidyātmamādayan ।।

sodayāntaṃ pratiṣṭhā vai dviṣaṭkakalasaṃkalam ।
rauvorvvamadhyasatataṃ acchinno sādhyavigrahaḥ ।।

prāptādhamadhamadhvena sodhvasaṃ ca surodhakam ।
revaye hyatsalamukhaṃ dhumake cocucuṃbakam ।।

kṣobhayitvā mṛtaṃ guhya pūrakenāgataṃ smaret ।
sā sāgraṃ grāvaṇamukhaṃ tanmūlamūlavajjahet ।।

smaretkāle vāṃkuśāgraṃ smaromekatrakoraṇam ।
evaṃ vidhau jīve ca(kraṃ juṣa)jīvanajīvamām ।।
(53b)
maṃtrī khacaratāṃ yāti bhītvā kālo śivaṃ vrajet ।
evamevākṣayākṣobhya śakticakreṇa bhāsvatā ।।

rathakuṃbhaṃ cakkrā - - - saṃtaṃ - (hatināt) ।
kulasaṃkalasodhvato dhūtodhamadhamāyinā ।।

āhatena samāhṛtya ākṛṣya kṛṣya tejasā ।
udbhrāmayedrathāṃgena - (maṃtrāta) - (saṃgrahām) ।।

gṛhyapiṇḍasamukṣipya brahmānīḍāgrasaṃsmaret ।
kamukaḥ kaṇṭhahṛdaye nābhiyugmaṭhayugmake ।।

saptārṇṇasannayuktāśu dārujaṃ (pātulaṃ kṣaṇam) ।
grāhya jīvopajīvātmā sarvveṣāmidriyopagam ।।

niyuṃktvākarṣayetpiṇḍaṃ brahmanīḍāgramutthitaḥ ।
navakassaptame vāya - (dyākṛtyāntarāntaram) ।।

āhṛtya paśupiṇḍaṃ vai śaṃkupadmavidhānavit ।
tarpayetvā{mā}trilokaṃ vīrabhairavabhāsuram ।।

maṃtrī - - paraṃ yā(ti) - (sārddhavicarennabham) ।
saṃkariṣyāṣṭanavakayuktvā padapadātmakam ।।

ekatraṃ maṃtrayitvā tu śaktiṃ cakrāntago smaret ।
sā tu śāstraudayādīpta(ntatra) (bhaira)vatāragam ।।

śūlanāladhruvādhāramādhāraṃ dhārayeddhruvam ।
nānāratnā hi varadā kaṃṭhakūpāmṛtokṣitim ।।

saṃdīptavyomatejena suṣumnā (sā tu) vigraham ।
mārutāṃśuśatādhārā dhārāyāte vacodayam ।।

praviṣṭodgāramukharaṃ ulkāśataśarīriṇam ।
sarvveṃdriyo bhūtanudaṃ bhīmāstreṇa vilo(ṭha)yet ।।
(54a)
tattodhaderddhakālāstraṃ ādhāraṃ ca samāharet ।
datvā grāhyādhārabhāvaṃ svabhāvaṃ bhāvavāsahā ।।

nāḍyānāni samāhṛtya pūrakeṇātmakaṃ smaret ।
rasanārasamūlādhe sakalasyāntaraṃ nayet ।।

tasmiṃ śāntapadaṃ hṛtyā vidyā bhāvena bhāvayet ।
nivṛrttiḥ prati(ṣyā)mukte utpannotpanilaṃmuṃdet ।।

kṛtvā tu samarasoyamātmanyakṣastu cākṣayaḥ ।
yuṃjyamāno maṃtradharmā āharaṃ vā susaṃgraham ।।

maṃtrī mṛtyuḥ paraṃ yāti iccha(pye)veśvaraṃ vrajet ।
(na)vamaṃ na{va}kavidyā padānāmāsusutrataḥ ।।

dvāre dvāre pṛthagyuktvā navadvārāṇi loṭhayet ।
saṃkariṣṇyī vaktraṃ maṃtra hṛtpadmo (rasa)saṃpuṭam ।।

vicintāntā dhyāyamāno sarvvadvārāṇi loṭhayet ।
jaḍaṃ codhvatha viśvānāṃ mahāmāryākhyapaścimam ।।

saṃsmaśru maukṣi(ṇīṃ) kālaṃ caṇḍacaṇḍā - dhontarat ।
evaṃ vaktravibhedena sarvvakarmaṣu yoginaḥ ।।

saṃkariṣṇyā dhyāyamāno līlayābhimataṃ labhet ।
evaṃ hṛdayavyomāntasaṃkari(ṣṇī)ṇḍamekhalaiḥ ।।

dhyāyamānāṃ samastā vai dvārāṇyeva vidārayet ।
pratidvāre dvārestro hi madhastanā camacchvasam ।।

niyuṃktvā pāvakamukhamutprekṣaṃ te khamaṇḍalam ।
punaścaturmukhā devī ādayaṃtīṃdriyāṇi ca ।।

tribhirdvābhyāṃ hṛrṇṇātyaṃte saṃvivaṃtī mṛtaṃ drutam ।
medo majjā śukrajīvo paktiṃ viprāṃgikottamam ।।
(54b)
śaktinālasthavāṃgirā suṣumnadvārasarvvathā ।
jayaṃtī preṣakaḥ preṣyāgrasadvārākṣamaṃḍalam ।।

saṃprāptākaṃmalapuṭaṃ satsvabhāvottaraṃ gatā ।
niyuktvā yojayedbhūyo susthūlākṛtibhīṣaṇā ।।

vika{rā}lā mahāghorāmutprekṣantī svarūpagam ।
bahuvaktraiva vaktrā vā kṣapāṭṭopeva dhūnayet ।।

punaḥ punaḥ paśupiṇḍaṃ utkṣipyotkṣipyavālayet ।
paśuṃ dārvvamaye yuṃktvā pūrvveva paśuyojanā ।।

svāsanasthotha sāntāpyā ekāgraparasaṃsmaret ।
īśvarātmāmāraṇorddhe adhevaiva gavākṛtīm ।।

juṣaṃ yuṃktvāmṛgavaraṃ naye bhāvasvabhāvataḥ ।
vidyodaraḥ paśuvarāṃ sthāpyajyeṣṭhāgramuttare ।।

svaśritya bhūvane divye āhṛtvātpiṃḍanāyakam ।
saṃkariṣṇīsvasthaceto yuktvā santāhya vigrahām ।।

trisaṃdhyaṃ sahaśaktyā vai sarpagotthaṃ mṛtaṃ pibet ।
jyeṣṭhontare paśuṃ badhvā bhīmakālāstrasaṃpuṭam ।।

saṃrudvegaṃ tripāśena kulabhairavaveṣṭitam ।
rudralokontarayuṃktvā - kulādhegraveṣṭaram ।।

mohayitvā tarjanena māyāstreṇa hi gopayet ।
yathecchagopayitvā tu bhavaśaktyā tu bhāvayet ।।

mudrayitvā cakkramudrāṃ vivareta mahītalam ।
kṛtvā rūpaviparyāso sacchaktyāgrāhya yojitam ।।

saṃgṛhya kāmatrairūpyaṃ sārānyāyāyacaṃ kramet ।
lakṣaṇeṇa yathāyogyaṃ samyagdṛṣṭvā paśuṃ paśuḥ ।।
(55a)
taṃ tathāpi samastaṃ vā nyasto cātha samuddharet ।
samastastveṣa vai khyātaṃ piṇḍasyākarṣaṇaṃ yathā ।।

sā rakṣāharaṇaṃ yādṛkśrūyatāṃ prabravīmi bhoḥ ।
vadanākṣīśrotraghrāṇānāniliṃgāśu ca tvayā ।।

medo majjāśukrajīvo māṃse romāṇi śoṇitaṃ ।
snāyuprakṛtibhūtāni vikāreṃdrā sudhā tavaḥ ।।

trayoviṃśatyevaṃ grāhyā vyomajīvopajīvināṃ ।
teṣāṃ tu lakṣaṇaṃ yāvadṛksthānabhedātprajīvanam ।।

tattvabhedaprabhedena samagraṃ prabravīmi bhoḥ ।
kālāstreṇākṣiṇī jagni vadatyā bhīmaśaṃkunā ।।

bhojakābhyāṃ ghrāṇaśrotrau sacchaktyānābhimaṃḍalaṃ ।
tarjanentānaye{t}liṃgaṃ apānaṃ rūhayā haret ।।

tva - yā grāhyamāveśyamadaṃ ca bhavaśaktinā ।
vratodenānayetmajjā siddhyāśukraṃ samāharet ।।

mātryāsteṇoddharejjāvaṃ māṃso jīvo hayā haret ।
aghoṣma{bhīṣma}yo rāsnāṃ śoṇitaḥ sarvvaśaktinā ।।

dohakenāsthisaṃghātasnāyū vai mātriśaktinā ।
āsuryātprakṛtiḥ grāhyā khecaryā hreṃdriyāṇi ca ।।

sarvvāṃgāni ca brahmahā dhātaro madaśaktinā ।
vratodenānayenmajjā pītalā haritā tathā ।।

yojayeta sukṛṣṇā vai viṣayavyaktiyojanā ।
mukhyānilanibhā yojyā āntarā sarvvapītakāṃ ।।

vikārā haritā grāhyā sukṛṣṇāstveva me parā ।
sakrodhanāgnivarṇṇā vai evameva yathecchayā ।।

āhareta yathākāmaṃ sapaśostūpabṛṃhanam ।
(55b)
yojayeta yathā yādṛgdugdhacchaḥ pūrṇṇimāsanam ।।

viddhevaṃ bhuvanasthaṃ ca mahāpaśudharottamam ।
saṃskṛtya vetālagṛhe vetālaṃ vidyate balāt ।।

antaṃ vāmyātha bījena yojayetpaśunāyakam ।
kṛtyāveśesu saṃpūjya kṛtyā phalamavāpnute ।।

avāsyāsyaiva (sa)tpaśo hutvā puṣkaramodakam ।
ayutena tato jihvāṃ samākṛṣya vikarttayet ।।

tameva saṃgṛhītvāśu kṛtaṃ nyāsastu sādhakaḥ ।
vīravidyādaro loke bhaviṣyatyajarāmaraḥ ।।

sa eva śiranāthena vidyākṛtasusaṃpuṭam ।
yathākāmaṃ yojayeta utpalaṃ satyapuṣkaraiḥ ।।

trimātulyaṃ sapañcāṅgaṃ yojayitvā kaduṃbhramam ।
guggulena latāyojya sadrākṣāḥ pacare(vaṃ) ca ।।

ityeṣa sadravī mukhyo paṃcaviṃśadhikārimām ।
modakaḥ paṃcāmṛtākhyo bhojapasatpaśontamam ।।

athaivaṃ bhojakavarau bhojayitvā mahāpaśuḥ ।
tatkṣaṇātsvayuthaṃ lebhe mahāparvvatasannibham ।।

sa evamadhunā siṃca surayā ca śivaṃbunā ।
dhūpayaṃmājirāvarcāpaśuṃ vrajati vai dvidhā ।।

sabhitvā paśupiṇḍaṃ vai kṛtvā nādaṃ subhairavam ।
nirgacchati brahmarākṣā nāmnā vai ketupādapam ।।

ketupādapadājyena maṃtrī vidyābalena ca ।
trailokyaṃ suciraṃ bhuṃktvā citvā kālo śivaṃ vrajet ।।

athaivaṃ pañcapañcāṅgākhaḍgadaṃṣṭriṇaṭīṭṭibhāḥ ।
kṛṣṇaśvānotha (mārjā)ro pañcāgaistu viyojayet ।।
(56a)
gopaśvā jāyate vāsaśvapākāṃścaturuttamā ।
āharedyugmabījāni ajīvena sahaiva tu ।।

śoṇitairbījinā yuṃktvā na - strīmuṃḍasaṃpuṭe ।
tatkośaiṣveva badhvā tu ābhivarcanadhūpayet ।।

ekaviṃśāhamevaṃ vai śatārddhaṃ vāpi vāsarāt ।
upāsya śūnyaveśma vai cintayaṃto (skaṃlavakā) ।।

adhivāsamambumadhye śūnyakupe tapomaye ।
saṃkariṣyaśarīreṇa saśarīreṇa pāśayet ।।

trisaṃdhyaṃ dhūparājena tamaṣṭyadhikaṃ japet ।
upāsayetpātravaraṃ dhyānenaivopavarddhayet ।।

śakticakkraśūlarājaiścaturbhiradharottaraiḥ ।
bhrāmayāpaṃcamūrddhastho samaṃtātmakalodaram ।।

gavākṛtipātraśatrairagradāgnisamukhaṇaiḥ ।
āpūrayaṃ kūpavare madhyapātraṃ nimajjataḥ ।।

evaṃ dvādaśabhirmāsairvvidhidṛṣṭena karmaṇā ।
utpatterbrahmarakṣāṃ vai tatpātotpāvakopamaḥ ।।

niraṃdhakākhyā digvāsā śatārddhabhujabhāsuram ।
śatayojanavistīrṇṇo yojanāyatamucchritam ।।

sahasramāyā raudrātmā śilāpādapa āyudham ।
catuṣpādaḥ śatamukhaṃ virūpākṣo khara - raḥ ।।

sadhūmānalasaṃkāśo socchvasaṃtonalaṃ mukhe ।
halamālāsahasrāḍhyo saudāmaṇiśatojvalam ।।

daṃṣṭrākarālavadano nānāmeghaśatākulam ।
nānā māyāsahasrāḍhyaṃ nānā vidyuśatāyudham ।।

evaṃ sa brahmarākṣeṃdro kṛtanyāsena maṃtriṇā ।
(56b)
saṃkalpayitvāgrayodhī gacchajjaṃtu divaukasām ।।

athaiva brahmarakṣeṇa gupto sādhakapuṃgavaḥ ।
devādhipatyaṃ ku{ru}te jitvā lokatrayaṃ balāt ।।

bhuktvā tu tridivaṃ devyaṃ sahṛtvā brahmarakṣasam ।
sadāśivaparaṃ maṃtrī līlayā eva gacchati ।।

śikhādyaṃtā mahāmārī pūjayitvā kratūttamam ।
prāsitā eva vaśyārthaṃ kṣaṇādāne yate śaciḥ ।।

vastrāñjanau hyantapānau phalamūlotha lepanam ।
ādāyaśo bhavedvaśyo samyagjaptvā niyojitaḥ ।।

gaṃtugaṃtrīsamāveśya viśvāvaśamupānayet ।
gosahasrasadbīje tava mokṣetravaropamam ।।

kṣarayitvā kṣīraphala (āve)śovaśamānayet ।
tarodherddhaṣasannākhyā caturo (yudhamā)raṇam ।।

śatabadhvakṛtiḥ pūrvvaṃ (ba)ddhyādhorasi viṣṭaram ।
atubhāvyāviparyāse na dūrddhaṃ tadbhrumadbhramam ।।

daivāstorddhenātahṛdaye recayegniśikhā(ṅga)tau ।
svasusaṃgrahaṃ svāsu nāmyāmyāsubhāvyā tu bhāvayet ।।

bhāvayaṃtoṣṭasaṃkorddha āhare trividhaṃ paśum ।
evamannāḥ paśuśataṃ samāyā śikhayā saha ।।

maṃtrī nirvvānamāpnoti bhuktvā bhogān{ya}thepsitān ।
evameva krameṇaiva āmnāyoktaḥ kriyāphalam ।।

yojayāṃ tu śikhādevyā saṃkariṣyā tu siddhyate ।
yathānīlenādhvapati pītalena tu jaṃbhayet ।।

ākarṣayati raktena dveṣayetpītakena tu ।
māraye hyañjanākārā dhūmravarṇṇā tu mālayet ।।

dhanāgamo hemanibhā puṣṭyarthahimavarcasā ।
(57a)
yathoddiṣṭā sa hemābhā uparyupari hemahā ।।

svahṛtkokanadākāraṃ dhārāpātaśatolvaṇam ।
cintaye{t}svasvabhāvāntaṃ devī cāmīkaraprabhā ।।

evaṃ ṣaṇmāsayogena maṃtrī sākṣādvanīśvaraḥ ।
evamātmākokanade navapākeyavarcasam ।।

sāṃkari(ṣyā)bhidhānena sākṛtiḥ piṇḍalakṣaṇam ।
vavarṣaḥ kanakaraṃ sasadbhramo biṃdukoṭarāḍha ।।

svadehe devatākāre samantācca plavāgamam ।
cintayedvyomasaṅkāśaṃ dhārāśataśatolvaṇam ।।

āpūrya sādhyamaṃtrātmā dhyāyaṃ kuryājjapaṃ sadā ।
evaṃvidhaṃ prakurvvāṇo vidhinā vatsarontaram ।।

tadā labhati medhāvī sākṣādośanaso bhavet ।
śa - ryāpunahomena tathāṃjanasujīpakaḥ ।।

niśi nityaṃ japamāno dhyāyamānomralakṣaṇam ।
saṃvatsareṇa vidhivaccaṃndravṛdvyāmupoṣitaḥ ।।

vāgeśvareva maṃtrajño bhrājate bhuvi cāparaḥ ।
pyaraṇe kuṃbhacakreva svāsanādhordvaṃ saṃpuṭam ।।

kṣīrābhaṃ sahasantāpyā aśrasaṃgrahasodaram ।
aṣṭāṃkuśāṃtaraṃ gehe vidyā sannaddhavigrahā ।।

yuṃktvā japeta satataṃ juhetpaṃcāmṛtaṃ tilam ।
kṛcchracāṃdrāyaṇādhīno phalamūlāśanothavā ।।

lakṣārddhaṃ cādhunāmaṃtrī japajeva caturguṇam ।
sākṣādvācaspatirloke vāgmī sarvādivaukasām ।।

evaṃ ca niyatābhyāsā sarvvāpadbhyo vimucyate ।
naśyaṃte vyādhayaḥ sarvvā jarayā nābhibhūyate ।।
(57b)
yoginyo melakaṃ labdhā svacchayā vrajate śivam ।
yuktvā netravare nātha saṃkariṣṇī mahābalā ।।

bhaikṣakṣetrāṃtamāsīno pūrvvaṃ vrataparāyaṇaḥ ।
bhikṣārthe vicaredbhrāmaṃ saghoṣeṇārughoṣayan ।।

yathālabdhasamaśnanto na tṛpyeta kadācana ।
tripātrastho pātrabhojī pātra{mā}trīkṣamālinam ।।

satpātrapātrikādheyo pātrī pātrajuṣaṃ niśi ।
madhuparkanṛpadmena yuktaṃ paṃcāmṛtena tu ।।

hutvā śatakravyādāgnau pātrasthā pūrṇṇamāhutī ।
uccainnotra sahavidyā japaṃ sadghoṣaghoṣayan ।।

ānayeta kṣaṇāghoraṃ kṣetrapālaṃ jagāsanam ।
saha tena yutaṃ {yā}gaṃ varttayecchaktisaṃjñitam ।।

satpaśuprokṣayettatra kulārājena bhāsvatā ।
tenārghapuṣpāntapānau yathāvadvidhiyojanā ।।

yojayitvā mṛtenaiva hunetpūrṇṇāhutiṃ yathā ।
tato pratyakṣamāyāti yā ceṣṭā kuladevatā ।।

teṣāmarghaṃ ca pādyaṃ ca yathāvatpūrvvakalpanā ।
yojayitvā paśuḥ śeṣaṃ yaiḥ sārddhavicarennabham ।।

yugāntaraśaraṃ bhuktvā icchayā śivamāpnute ।
evaṃ vibhītakasyādho nyagrodhe kṣīrapādapaḥ ।।

bhīmavṛkṣe kiṃśukādhau vacane phalgunāpyadho ।
tathā parvvatamūrddhastho yajevaṃ vidhi kurvvataḥ ।।

āmnāyoktena vidhinā prati prati paśūttamam ।
niyuṃktāśaktiyogāṃte paśyate bhairavāṣṭakam ।।

taissārddhavicaredyukto aṃte vai praviśecchivam ।
evaṃ vetasārjjanādhena {na}dikule catuṣpathe ।।
(58a)
tālārjjūna - dirodhe śūnyaliṃgethavāśmake ।
vidveṣavidhinākurvvaṃ śāktāḥ paśuniyojakaḥ ।।

bhadratulye vibhavatā ā - vīrāṇi paśyati ।
evaṃ vidhiviśeṣeṇa niyuktā dharmanāyakam ।।

japasva veśyemāryātmā sarvvakāmāṃ samaśnute ।
padabhīṣmodbhītareṣu di(vyā)jyapayasā saha ।।

hutvā sahasraṃ māsārddhaṃ kalpāyuṃtiha - dvalāt ।
trikadukabhistvevamevaṃ ekatraṃ ca śataṃ śatam ।।

nisi hutvā trisaṃdhyaṃ vai māsenāneyate nṛpā(t) ।
yakṣaḥ piṃśācagaṃdharvvānāgavidyādharāpsarāḥ ।।

māsāntareṇānayati yogayoga(mu)khoddhṛtaḥ ।
paṃcāmṛtaṃ guggulena divārātrau hi saṃkhyayā ।।

- bhyāṃ kanyāmānayate (tā)bhyāṃ lokāni bhuṃjati ।
savrato yogamukharo bhīṣmacaryānucārikaḥ ।।

paśyatyekādaśarudrā hyabdāntekāntarāha bhūt ।
bhūcaryevaṃ hi māsena khecaryā māsaṣaṭkake ।।

saṃkulā svakulāccaiva saṃpūrṇṇobde tu paśyati ।
athāṣṭau vā satsaro {patitā} patitothavā ।।

seṃdriyākāṃḍaspṛṣṭā cassālakāssavikāriṇaḥ ।
abhūṣitāṃjitāṃkṣāṃva nare bhāvi na prāvṛtāḥ ।।

mahākṣetre nṛpātrasthā sakhaḍgāṣṭāṣṭasanmukhā ।
tanmadhye viśvarūpākhyaṃ śāktaṃ vāpāṃgamuddharet ।।

mahāyāmalayajñe vā bhāskarākṣothavā yajet ।
tasmiṃ sugaṃdhapuṣpāṇi mahāpātrakṛtāni ca ।।

caturyonyodbhavāmāṃsā dātavyā saṃkhyayānijā ।
śaktyāsahasadghoṣyaṃ hi uccaivigrahamuccaret ।।
(58b)
mahādhūpaṃ dhūmamāno homayetpūrvvasaṃgraham ।
dikpālaistu mahājyena pūrṇṇāhutyaṣṭakaṃ hunet ।।

tato tripuṣkareṇaiva sarvvāmiṣaphalāgrataḥ ।
huneduccaiḥ palāyutaṃ pratidikpālamagrataḥ ।।

sāgraṃ caiva śataṃ paścādvāruṇyāmelakaṃ hunet ।
bhairavaṃ bhairavī yuṃktvā kṛtvā bhairavavigraham ।।

varṇṇabhairavamudrāsya madbhrāmetha sabhairavam ।
bhrāmayaṃto hi bhairavyā varṣabhairavabhairavam ।।

bhairavī paśyate nūnaṃ dhyātvaivaṃ jñeyabhairavam ।
evama(tya)ntare dṛṣṭvā bāhye merunagottamam ।।

nirloṭhayaṃtī sahasā muktvānādaṃ subhairavam ।
tarjayaṃntī paranāthaṃ ulkāyutaśatocchvasam ।।

saṃkṣobhayaṃntī bhutidhīṃ dyotayantī nabhastalam ।
mahāmārī mahākālī saṃkariṣṇīṃḍamekhalā ।।

sādhakasyāgramāyāti saṃyuktā sakhikiṃkaraiḥ ।
bhi(ktā)janasamākārā kṣubdhābdho dadhinisvanā ।।

mahākalpāgnyarkasamādṛṣṭvā vidyuśatojvalā ।
saṃpraṇasyārddhapīṭhasthā vigrahoccaiśvamuccaram ।।

svakaṃ vāmāṃgamu(tpā)dya tadutthena śamadvayam ।
pūrayitvārghasaṃvṛttakusumaissaha puṣkaraiḥ ।।

kālasaṃkariṣṇyārghaivaṃ madhuparkabaliṃ tathā ।
niyojya ca yathākāmaṃ yathāśaktyā suvistaram ।।

mahāṣṭapaśubhiḥ sārddhakṛtvā samyaṅnivedanam ।
tatastuṣṭā mahāmārī saṃkariṣṇyāṇḍavigrahā ।।

pragṛhya sādhako(poṃ)ti svanike(tā)mṛtopamam ।
(59a)
icchayā vāmareṃdratvaṃ kṛtvā kālaṃ yathecchayā ।।

śivaṃ prayāti paramaṃ icchayā vā halāyudham ।
saṃyojyāstraṃ mahāmāryā svagṛhe japatassa(dā) ।।

saṃbhuktvābhimataṃ maṃtrī icchayāpi viśe śivam ।
- rkajerharaudradine yāmyavāruṇavāyave ।।

paryaṭe satpṛṣā bījāṃ kṛtvā pūrvvapaṭaṃ gṛhe ।
yathā prāpya tathā dhyāye maṃtrigaḍyāgamāgamāḥ ।।

niyuktvā rodhayitvā tu ravayetpūrvvakena tu ।
sva - ketu mukhaṃ prāpto saṃpraviśyāṃtaraṃ puṭam ।।

praviṣṭādhyā - nayate tatkṣaṇe narhilīlayā ।
niyukto śaṃkuyogena śukramānayate balāt ।।

a - saṃgraho sāsurvvāsamastaṃ vāṇḍamaṇḍalaṃ ।
tadudbhūtaśmaśā(nmeṣṭo) muktā tadreṇḍanā saha ।।

sa - ryyāgraṃ puravaraṃ ucchṛṣṭau dahate balāt ।
samākarṣyātha santāryyā samudrāvejaghomukam ।।

dhyā - na dahate rūnoḥ krīḍate ca yathecchayā ।
tatsādhyakṣetravalmīkamṛdadevaphalāgrataḥ ।।

vikṛtanakhararomaistu śirarṣaṇena kārayet ।
icchayā pūjaye gehaṃ tadvarcena tu dhūpayet ।।

kravyādāgnau niśi śataṃ juhuyāyutapañcakam ।
tāpapaṃcatrisaṃdhyaṃ vai ajātapaṃcaśataṃ śatam ।।

saṃjñayā nīyate devaṃ deveṃdro bhāryayā saha ।
evaṃ trika(du)nṛśuktai(papa)śodbhūtabhāvitam ।।

kṛtvā navā - suśiraṃ nirastekṣaiva saṃjñayā ।
tasnānakarma me lipto grasto nāryānile śikhe ।।
(59b)
śatruṃ kṣaṇena dahate tāpayato japaṃ niśi ।
pilivāgethavā maṃtraṃ jñātvā śatruṃ mahāyudham ।।

vinyasennisvapatrāntaṃ nirmalaṃ trapuropitam ।
eva(ma)śvattha bilvantaṃ nyastaṃ kiṃśukaśalmalam ।।

jaṃbhayeta staṃbhayeta mohaye{t} bhrāmayettathā ।
kavalaivaṃ payasena bhīṣmavṛkṣeṇa saṃvṛtaḥ ।।

jāyā(patyāṃ) dviṣayate bhrāmayeta mahīdharīm ।
kadruṃ śuktaṃ nṛpaṃ cāṃgaṃ tilaṃ kṛṣṇacaturddaśī ।।

jujuhaṃ nidhipālāśca kṣetrapālāṃśca sādhayet ।
ādi (vinṭhyā)grahavanātsarṣapābhistilaiḥ saha ।।

sādhayed vivaraṃ divyaṃ svarmā(ddaśaṃ) guṇodayam ।
athaivaṃ saha ājyena gu्ggulena tridhā saha ।।

hutvāraṃ sutuṣeḥ sārddha nāgalokabaloddharet ।
śapharyā guggulaiḥ sārddha evameva huneṃnnaraḥ ।।

sākṣādvāgeśvaro matrī samnāyyāścoraso juṣam ।
madhyamena sasamnājyā dhāraṇātmagavākṛtau ।।

niyuṃktvā īśvarābheva dhyāyamānā stripuṣkaram ।
madhyame devatākāraṃgaṃtau gatrīva saṃsmaret ।।

māsenāgraṃ juhuyāna vibudhānudate girau ।
hṛdaye vātha khaḍge vā ghaṭā(ṅku)śajalāvare ।।

trailokyaṃ vadate devī vidyeśī svapnagā tathā ।
sihamudrā mukhaṃ rātrau hathoktaśūnyamaṃdire ।।

japantadeśvānayane yāminyāṃ guhyamātarāḥ ।
vaṭāśvatthaplakṣavaśyānyagrodhakṣīrakiṃśuke ।।
(60a)
dampatibhyāṃ yakṣarakṣopiśācāsuramānayema ।
vidyādharaphaṇīṃdrāṇi juhvevaṃ vidhipūrvvaśaḥ ।।

rātryāṃte hyeva sā hyevaṃ vaśamānayate balāt ।
yuktāstrāmaṃtravijyaśyā bhairavo bhairave juṣam ।।

kṛtvā yāgaṃ hunedraktaṃ samupośya hi vatsaram ।
smaredbhikṣāṃ vratāgrastho sughoṣaścāpi ghoṣayet ।।

nirghoṣya hi sasaptārṇṇa astrāntaṃ vigrahālikā ।
yuṃktā abhimukhaṃ kṣetre vallayeta sughoṣavāt ।।

yāgaṃ pāraṇamāveśya īśvarākṛtisārasam ।
vibhaktāpyathasannāpyā arcayato tripuṣkaram ।।

paśyate daśarudrāṇi samastā sakulaiḥ saha ।
taisyārddha hi yathākāmaṃ kāmayā nāmaraśrayāt ।।

icchayā śivavalloke bhuktvā bhogāṃ śivaṃ vrajet ।
sahakuladevatābhividyā samyanniyojitā ।।

prāptotyabhimatāṃ kāmāṃ icchayekāgrayojitā ।
kulekamekāṃ vidyeśyā yojayitvāyamagrataḥ ।।

śaktyāgra(ma)grabhārājarājakanyāsamajuṣam ।
vidviṣaṃ cakkraparyaṃte samaṃtādhrātu taṃ - dam ।।

samīraṇāṃtaraṃ dhyāye samānīyasvakakṣayam ।
nidhāya pūrvvajyeṣṭhāgre svacakkrāntaravāntagam ।।

sapiṇḍama(pi) ṣaṇmāsā yogasiddhāpi dhārayet ।
saṃkuleva yathākāmamekaikāmapi yājakaḥ ।।

japeta yogacakrastho bhacakrorddha na taṃ juṣam ।
siṃhavīthyāgramukharaṃ - ṣibhiḥ satsukhaṃ dhruvam ।।
(60b)
yuṃktvā govīdhyasādhyātmā yogavīthyāgrasaṃjuṣam ।
(ni)yojyātmānamātmeva gaṃtrī gaṃdhodayaṃ śubham ।।

niyuktvā navapātrorddhe samākṛ(ṣya)karitṛvat ।
evameva niśābhāgaṃ jyeṣṭhāgrapurasanmukhā ।।

samprāpya narapātro vai yogarājena pūjayet ।
atha vai martyapiṃḍātmā śṛṃkhalānāmakṛttikā ।।

sādhakoskaṃdhamāropya yatheṣṭaṃ nayate kṣaṇāt ।
narakinnarasarpāṇāṃ sirddhagaṃdharvvadānavām ।।

kṛtyādhīṣeṇa maṃtrajño adhīṣatvamavāpnute ।
athainakulabhairavā bhairavo bhairavījuṣam ।।

niyojya yāvacakkrauśca juṣantāṃ vāyubhairavā ।
sakalaṃ paurāṇamukhaṃ khamukhaṃ mukhasanmukham ।।

mukhyastrīdriyāsanasthā sakalokṣaramakṣaram ।
dhārāyutanirucchvāsaṃ sakalaṃ khamayākṛtiḥ ।।

gavākṛte svarautyaśyā saṃsthābhirbhāvanā saha ।
sasastramārttevaṃ vidyā japātāṃ bhairavaḥ pṛthak ।।

piba pīyūṣaniyataṃ pūrvvavatsatpaśurbalāt ।
tarpayaḥ sakariṣṇākhyā rājanyatteva sacchivam ।।

śivaṃ prayāṃti vidvāṃsogra(stvā)kālamathecchayā ।
dhruvaṃ ṛṣicakkravarairjapenmārīrmusarmukhā ।।

bhūtvaitvanimādilabhate maheṃdratvamavāpnute ।
mahāvīravīracaryācaraṃ vidyā sacaddharam ।।

sādhāraḥ satridhātasthaṃ sāturobhītasaṃjuṣam ।
jvaladraśmisahasreṇa bhrāmayaṃ yadbhramabhramam ।।
(61a)

jape ca kaṃrṣayecchukraṃmayānenādhvanāḍinā ।
samānaye mukhyamukhaṃmāmūṣyaṃ gaṃtṛbhāvanā ।।

pibaṃ tvevaṃ rasavaro maṃtrī vyomacaro bhavet ।
sakalaṃ bhrūlaḍāntantamantasthaṃ punarucchrasam ।।

saharudrairjapedvidyā niniruddhyākṣakoṭarā(t) ।
kalasārakalā(sāṃrddha) uttarātītabhāvayan ।।

bhāvanābhāvanānastu sakalīrudramaṇḍalam ।
dṛṣṭvā yathāvadbhūtasthaṃ bhuṃkte kālaśiraṃ balāt ।।

guṇāṣṭakabalādhāro icchayā vrajate śivam ।
śaktyārghamadhuparkeṇa śivaṃ śaktiśivāmṛtam ।।

juṣaṃ pipeta bāhyāntaṃ śaktiyoganiyogadhṛt ।
dhṛtaśaktyāsidhārāṃ vai vrataṃ satśaktisādhakaḥ ।।

śaktimāṃ śaktibījātmā śikhāśaktiśikhājuṣam ।
kulaissaṃkuladevyāsi {ṣoḍaśa}ṣṣoḍaśākṣakā ।।

sanniruddhedhorddhoddhau ca sādhyasyālanivāhayet ।
saṃpūjya hṛdaye hyevaṃ mūrddhākṣaṃ cakkramucchvasat ।।

vāpayevaṃ hi sādhyasya vāyvāntā viśvamakṣayoḥ ।
pathakuṃbhākṛtiścakkro bhramaṃ saptākṣare{na} tu ।।

pūrvvavanmudrayitvā tu saveśmaṃ vidhinā nayet ।
athaivaṃ paśupiṃḍena kṛtvā yajñamanuttamam ।।

ākṛṣyo khecarīcakkraṃ pūjayeti vidhau pṛthak ।
tābhyāṃ cakkrāntaraṃ cakkraṃ khacakkraṃ cakkramucchvasam ।।

susamaṃ sannirūpā ca varaṃvekaṃvamobhayoḥ ।
nṛtvā tu khecarī sārddhamātmīyavidhivatsamam ।।

sārddhaṃ prayāti gaganaṃ savyomasvecchayā (śi)śivam ।
(61b)
evameva hi bhūcaryo ekacakkreṇa saṃcaram ।।

caraṃ carantontarhito saṃcaraṃ carate śivam ।
samāyojyāntarantarhi svapratīhāravigrahā ।।

japena maṃtravidyeśī kṛtvā cāgrapaṭaṃ yathā ।
tathārghaye sveśaktyā tu śivapuṣpārghamarghataḥ ।।

śivāṃbunā yathākāmaṃ tābhyāṃ yuṃktvā tripuṣkaram ।
huneta lakṣapādaṃ vai pūrṇṇāhutividhau yathā ।।

tathā hutvā paṭavṛkṣaṃ āśrayetsatpuṭaṃ punaḥ ।
tasmiṃ bhūyo śavaṃ puṣpe saṃyojyāmbaragaṃ śubham ।।

hunetsāgraṃ sahasraṃ vai samagrāpūrṇṇamāhutiṃ ।
tatāṃ vaṭā tatpratimāṃ yakṣarājāmahābalaḥ ।।

nihatya sādhakeṃdrasya yadā puṣpaṃ bhavedva(śaḥ) ।
evaṃ śiśumanyagrodhe vibhītakaharītakaiḥ ।।

dhavakārjunaśokeṣu jīrabilvasaśrīdrumaiḥ ।
trisarṣapatrikaṭukaṃ paratośrasusaṃgraham ।।

paṃcāmṛtaṃ śivapuṣpaṃ amṛtaṃ ca tripuṣkaram ।
asusaṃgrahepyaṃgebhyā pṛthageva śriyāphalaiḥ ।।

śrībrahmājyājyakṣīreṇa homayedbhāyanī saha ।
homayetprativṛkṣādhe lakṣapādaṃ paṭāgraṭaḥ ।।

pratihārādilokāntaṃ yatheṣṭaikāgnayojitaḥ ।
tadāgamasvamātvajñā sākṣāttattvaśarīriṇam ।।

paśyate vidhiyogena vratāṃte yogamagrataḥ ।
gaṇaguhyakagaṃdharvvayakṣarakṣasadānavāḥ ।।

kṣetrapālāmahadbhūtā devakāntāśriyā tathā ।
yādṛgeṣṭotha evoktaṃ samāsādya mahābalaḥ ।।

tādṛgvīryeṇa samyantādhanāpuṣpeṇa sādhakaḥ ।
(62a)
bhuṃjyamā(nā) yathākāmaṃ bhogāneva manepsitān ।।

maṃtrī sālokyamāpnoti śivamūrttiyathecchayā ।
athaivamevaṃ hyastrāṇi devatākārabhāsuraḥ ।।

dhyāyaṃ śāstravidhiṃ dṛṣṭvā parameśvaraśabditaḥ ।
pūrvvatorddhayathākāmaṃ sādhayaṃtveva cecchayā ।।

bhuktvāṇḍakuharaṃ divyaṃ padaṃ sādāśivaṃ vrajet ।
pitṛsāvitri(ñjyeṣṭreṭkau) yāmyarau ca dhāraṇe ।।

guruvarjyāsite pakṣe kṛtvāyāgesu śaṃkunā ।
samabhyarcya yathāśaktipātrayoḥ saṃpuṭāgrataḥ ।।

paryaṭeśasmṛśābhāvāṃ pāktikauśavarodhano ।
yathāprāpyaṃ tathādhyāye sannāyyāpya susaṃgraham ।।

sākṣobhya vidhiyogena svabhāvāśu nirantaram ।
sāntaraṃ ca tathoddhāraṃ dhāyodhamaṃ māyinā ।।

saṃniyojya drodhayitvā yojayetarakena tu ।
svanike tu mukhaṃ prāptā saṃpraviśyāntaraṃ puṭam ।।

dhyāyetpraviṣṭo sannāyyā vidyāruddhāśumudrayā ।
tarodhordve smaretpātraṃ śaktyākāśavibhūṣaṇam ।।

dhāryyenānyayathākāmaṃ līlayā svagṛhā(nna)yet ।
svaśaṃkuśaktiyāgāṃgre vidyādigdevatātmakāḥ ।।

niśikai tripuṣkaraistu uttānaṃ digvideśvaram ।
raikhādvātrikaṭukābhi tripuṣkaraistu puṣkarāḥ ।।

yojayitvā pūrvvatilāṃ kramādagnau kṣitigṛhe ।
digeśvaroddhe lakṣārddhaṃ raśmijvālāntarodayam ।।

ekatra bāhyato yuṃktvā sanntāpyā asusaṃgaham ।
śabdava(rdva)rṣamānopi hāvayedigvideśvarāt ।।
(62b)
sarvvādhipatyamāpnoti kālasyāṃte śivaṃ vrajet ।
ekaikayā guhyamudrā vidyā saṃyojya pūrvvavat ।।

pratiṣṭhayecchaṃ kuvaraṃ ekamekaikamekayā ।
niyojayedbhramaṃ cakkraśaktyāhṛtpadmavārivat ।।

dhamadhamāpūrvvarūrddhaṃ jñānacakramatontaram ।
prāṇā{pā}nāgramagrasthaṃ mandarīśamalūkhalam ।।

bhramaṃ dhamyākarodhena brahmānīḍamimaṃjuṣam ।
punargrastvānarucchvāsaśca sanācāṇḍamaṇḍalam ।।

evamānayate piṇḍaṃ pūrvvavaccāsusaṃgraham ।
jīvāmṛto tathā śukraṃ saṃpuṭa yādṛśasvakam ।।

evaṃ kālaśire bhuktvā śiraṃ vrajati cecchayā ।
saṃkarairdevatāyojya yathā vibhavataḥ pṛthak ।।

tripuṣkaraistilasamaṃ yuktvā kravyādayāvakam ।
kāmayāno yathākāmāṃ kāmatastu niśau hune ।।

vaṣaḍvauṣaṭphaṭsamāsvadhāsvāheti yojitam ।
udbhrāntapaṇaiścalanaṃ bhedanaṃ bhīṣmareṇḍabhiḥ ।।

likhe(dbhu)vaṃ tathā vaśyaṃ hutvā bhavati śiṃśake ।
staṃbhanaṃ śaṃkhacūrṇṇena asthibhirjambhanaṃ bhavet ।।

mohanaṃ ca tilaiḥ kṛṣṇairarca(na)śastrareṇḍabhiḥ ।
kīlanaṃ vadareṇḍabhyāṃ maṃtraviśleṣaṇaṃtuṣaiḥ ।।

mahājyājyena pṛktena śāntipauṣṭāni yojayet ।
viḍgagaṃdhavaṃdhiva(dhi)nadvīpinā sūtrabandhanam ।।

kākamāṃsenākṣibandhaṃ gṛdhramāṃsena mohanam ।
kāṣṭhya - ṣṭhasya havanānmāraṇaṃ viṣarājikā ।।
(63a)
bhūtadarśo mahājyena siddhārthairvvintadarśanam ।
yakṣa(lā)bhaṃ pārvatena piśācāśca śaphaṃtayā ।।

kṣatrapālosthihavanā gardabhai brahmarakṣasam ।
evaṃ pūrvvakramāṇāṃ ca adhīkṛtvā ca rekataḥ ।।

sādhayennṛpayakṣāṇāṃ piśācakṣetrakinnarāṃ ।
siddhagaṃdharvvanāgānāṃ brahmarakṣakṣapācarām ।।

ānayeta(dgṛ)hāṃ kanyāṃ daityānāṃ ca divaukasāṃ ।
athāpsaro yathākāmaṃ brīhapuṣpairddhanaśriyām ।।

sa(va)svatī ca cotpalairlakṣmīpadmeḥ sulohitaiḥ ।
athaivaṃ kṣetrahavanā vidyā sakhisamādayāt ।।

darśayaṃ siddhalakṣāṇi sarvvalokāni bhuṃjati ।
kṣīravṛkṣasamidbhistu prasenā daśadhā yathā ।
paśyata ca pathāviśvaṃ svapne vā yādṛśaṃ matam ।।

svaritaṃ cetyanekāni dhanākarṣamanekadhā ।
līlayā kurute maṃtrī svabhāvaṃ naranāyakām ।।

tathā viśoṣṭā daśadhā paṃcadhā vidhicoditam ।
muṣṭidṛṣṭau nirnudate pibaṃtvevaṃ jalaṃ sakṛt ।।

bhāvayaṃtyo bhāvanābhi ānayitvā yathākramam ।
tripuṣkalaṃstilairyuktvā kravyādāgnau kṣayāṃtare ।।

lakṣārddhena hi pātālapūrvvoktaṃ sādhakaṃ labhet ।
naredratvaṃ dvitīyāyā khecaratvaṃ tṛtīyayā ।।

catuthyāmapi vireśyāṃ yakṣeṃdrakhañcapaṃcamāt ।
bhūcaryaṣṭa tu ṣa(ṣṭhyā)vai kinnaratvāthavā labhet ।।

saptamyāṃ guṇanāthatvaṃ aṣṭamyāṃ vīranāyakam ।
(63b)
tarauvevaṃ vāsyamūlaṃ juṣaṃnāḍigavākṛtau ।।

punarnavaṃ dhānyamukhaṃ kṛtvā sacchaktikoṭaram ।
nyastvādhegre tathā jvālā jvālayejvalanaṃ samam ।।

dhāmyamaṇḍalamadhyastho viviṣantā yathecchataḥ ।
dhyāyakrīḍāsahasrāṇi ambarīṣamulūkhalaiḥ ।।

sorayaṃto nalamukhaṃ kurute nimnagāṃ balāt ।
vikṣobhya pakṣapātena bhokṣayedārṇṇavaṃ balāt ।।

mātaraṃ nirṇḍada - te sākaulkāśanibhāsuram ।
ubhayastu nasanābhyāṃ evameva sahasradhā ।।

vāmyenābhāntayānastu pūrvvaprajñādayodayat ।
tathaiva mocyanirmocyā dīdhateṃdreva dīdhitiḥ ।।

cucukanāmṛtaṃ śukraṃ kośakāreva vigraham ।
vibhaktātmānamātmeva svavaśaṃ kurute jagat ।।

tathaiva kramaśajyavasādayanto tathā purāt ।
na mṛtyorvvaśamāpnoti nī(tvā)kāla śivaṃ vrajet ।।

uddīpyanābhikuharā pāvakaṃ kulasaptabhiḥ ।
ekahīnaistu paṃcāśairnāḍibījaiḥ pradīpayet ।।

ekatastu kulāḥ saptamaśaktontaracchidrakaiḥ ।
nirgatājyarisenāsu pūrvvaprajñāsu bhāvayet ।।

yathā gatāstathā prāptā yojayetsa{pu}ṭāntaraṃ ।
bāhyabāhyatpadmapuṭaṃ jīvapiḍasamāhvayet ।।

tābhyāṃ niyojaye hyātmā ātmasādṛśya sādhayat ।
barhignyantedvannārhito saptamaṃ buddhiraṣṭabhiḥ ।।
(64a)
raśmisvanikaloyānaṃ mattapātītamadhvaram ।
catuṣkalāsano ropya tathaiva purabhāsurā ।।

samyagyuktvā sudādastu krameṇa krodhaharṣaya ।
martyāmṛtaṃ pibaṃtvevaṃ mṛtyumuktomṛtī bhavet ।।

vaktrontare vidyādyaṃte niṃyuktvā pūrvvasaṃkhyayā ।
japaṃ buddhāparvvatāvjo caturddhe caturaśragam ।।

pūjayitvā tadgṛhastho gṛhastho svagṛhe svakam ।
kaṭubhiste cākṣavare padacakkrā hi saṃjñayā ।।

ādevanādahanābhyāṃ padajena viṣena hi ।
śimivarṇṇe likhetvevaṃ nyastvā kṣīraiḥ sahodayaiḥ ।।

tatkardamena saṃlipya kṣetranyaṃgaistu vedhayet ।
tadaṃgaiva papatyevaṃ vidyākālānanāntagam ।।

pratiṣṭhayevaṃ narmyagre dhūpaye varurdaśikaiḥ ।
tasmiṃnagniścaturdikṣu ruktvā saṃpūjyatotpalaiḥ ।।

viṣṭakadrapyaṃgamiśreyāṃ sumasvarayo trayam ।
japeducairmāridehaṃ viniyogākṣaraissamam ।।

japtvā sahasrarātryagre prāgrī digdakṣiṇāmukhaḥ ।
arddharātreśaravaro aṃsubhilīlayā nudet ।।

athavevaṃ hi maṃtrasya vaktrenoktasamastakam ।
preṣakābhyantarādheyo vidheyorddha {caturddha}gam ।।

bhairavaṃ bhairavīgrāhya bhramāṃgaṃ vasubhairavam ।
viraktā grāhayecchaktyā pūrayaṃto bhavaṃ nudet ।।

saṃnāpyevamathānye vai pūrvvadṛṣṭorivigraham ।
dhyāyate vā(rllaṃ) mukharaṃ grāhyavidyā sadā smaret ।।
(64b)
prāptoṣṭraśaṃkumukhāttayāvadāsādyasadrasam ।
rasevontamama paraṃ anubhūyāmṛtaṃ bhavet ।।

paścimevaṃ vaktravaro vidyāyuktyā yugānanām ।
dhyāyaṃ japeta ṣaḍrātraṃ juhvavrīhatripuṣkaram ।।

tripātrapuṣkaroccasthā icchārūpā yathecchayā ।
yāvatṣaṭkontaraṃ mūlaṃ śarvvāpyāstveva ṣaṇmukham ।।

caturadhvādhvagā bhūyo saturyātītavigraham ।
yathāvanmanasā pūjya recayetābhitau yathā ।।

tathā suśukrapiṇḍādi dhātumūlamanekadhā ।
dhyātvā svastho svatrihāntaṃ prāptaḥ paśyati lilayā ।।

uttavārṇṇaḥ saptakevaṃ yuktvā dhyātvā yathākramam ।
śaṃkuvodaramāsādya icchārūpaṃ yathā tathā ।।

tathā sanmīlya nayanaṃ icchā paśyetparasparam ।
tathā rūpāṇi vitate vai parītyājyasaṃkhyaśaḥ ।।

paśuvatkīlake badhvā ekamekadinaṃ dine ।
saṃprokṣya bhakṣya pātestu na mṛtyurvvaśameṣyati ।।

nityameva yathāvāpya saṃkṣetrāmṛtamuttamam ।
maṃtrī seśvaratāṃ yāti dṛṣṭvā santāpya satpatham ।।

(ūrddha)vaktrenū(rddha)gamā divyekā tu yathepsayā ।
yuktyā japeta vidhinā vaktrāntaravidhānataḥ ।।

tathāgnya(rkedu)pureṣu ghoṣāghoṣayathodayam ।
yuktvāṣṭasthūlamudayā subhayānanasodayam ।।

sahasrāraṃ tatorddhaṃ vai śūlavṛṣṭe mahadbhramam ।
jvālāyutasahasrāghaṃ nānānānaladuḥsaham ।।
(65a)
akṣaśataṃ pūrakena dviguṇaṃ kuṃbhakena tu ।
triguṇaṃ racayedūrddhaṃ sāridaṃ haṃsa * hasradhā ।।

dhamārddhamena saṃdhāvyarārontarasurovakam ।
bhramāmarīva pātālo dahevaṃ ca tripuṣkaram ।।

acchinnamūlanālūrddhe mocchusaṃghoṣaghoṣaṇau ।
dhyāyaṃ nayetsamaṃ viśvama(śu)bhilīlayāvaśat ।।

tataścācūcukamiva pūrvvayoganiyojanā ।
samānāyati siddhānāṃ śukrabījādivigraham ।।

pibamāno yathākā(maṃ) siddhaṃ siddhāmṛtottamam ।
martyomṛtatvamāpnoti icchayā paramaṃ padam ।।

gokṣīrasadṛśā devi viśvavigrahavigrahā ।
kālābhiyojayitvā tu sakalāṃte kalādhvagā ।।

tripuṣkarairmatsmalikāṃ samaptairvvāsitaṃ tilam ।
juhvajapecca purasthāṃ caturaśvādhvasadhvajām ।।

dhārārūpakalādhārā dhārāśataśatolvaṇā ।
varṣaṃtī śaṃkurājorddhe cintayebhimatapradā ।।

medhārthe paśasādṛśyo raktaughā puṣṭivarddhane ।
dhanākṛṣṭau hemanibhā jalaughā śaktikarmaṇi ।।

utavābhyaṃtare cakkraṃ saṃskārākhyāmanekadhā ।
caturadhvādhvare dhyāyaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ sahasradhā ।।

urvvīduprāhareṃdredrī badhvā vai hyurddhajiṃgikī ।
japamāno niśāmadhya paśyate kaulikaṃ kulam ।।

tanmato pūrvvayogena yogontarasamodayam ।
mṛtyuryāti paraṃ maṃtrī icchāyā vā adhīśvaram ।।
(65b)
kālī badhvā madhobdhādhve gamagabhau nirāśrame ।
śaṃkṛṣṭayaṃtrayaṃtreṇa ūrddhaliṃgāgamāṃkuśī ।।

nirapekṣasvayāgāgre bhairavyābhairavaṃjuṣam ।
akuśenāmṛtādhāro niryātaḥ khecaro bhavet ।।

śaraṃ vyoma japeja yogī aṃkuśāṃkuśamodayāt ।
dṛṣṭoṣṭaśaṃkvaṃkuśena gatvā cakkroṃḍabhugbhavet ।।

evamāśramabhedena vidyaiṣā gṛhamedhinām ।
guroraṇājñāmāṃlimye abhiṣekantathā punaḥ ।।

nānādhāro hi vikṛtī nānārūpavikāriṇaḥ ।
raktasitabhasmaliptaṃ ajitākṣo śatekṣaṇam ।।

paṃcamudrā saptakulyo kaulamudrī daśāṣṭadhṛk ।
śakticārī śakticaro khaśaktiḥ śaktikhecaram ।।

mūrttikhaṭvāṅgadhṛṅmaunīmadvipaṃcī bhramodhṛtam ।
brahmacārī vibhinnānāṃ vacasthānāṃ samodayāt ।।

naiṣṭhikānāṃ yathāme{va} parivrājakaliginām ।
tathā vakṣyāmi saṃkṣepāt sarvveṣāmavrataṃ tathā ।।

pūrvvoktavidhinā pūrvvaṃ vratayo pāśyavigraha(m) ।
anagnapādau muktaśikho sadraktakṛṣṇavāsasī ।।

śaktikandalamālāḍhyo vyaṃgasūḍītha dikpaṭaḥ ।
prasādanugrahestyakto bhikṣābhikṣe hyanāsiṣam ।।

jalabhasmena vā snāyī trisnāyī cāntamadhyagaḥ ।
divārātrau japedvidyāṃ caren bhikṣārthasusthiram ।।

tāludaṃtāgraṃ sasūttho tālujihvātha susthiram ।
dantajihvāgraviśrāmorāśaṃkālī vimucyate ।।
(66a)

mahākaṃkālakevātha mahākālī mahābalā ।
japeta saṃkariṣṇī vai kālīkālarathottamā ।।

ekāhani caredgrāmāṃ paṃcasaptāha gopure ।
māsorddhamāsatripathe ṣaṇmāsaṃ nadisaṃkaṭe ।।

vatsaro hyekavṛkṣo vai sārddhameva catuṣpathe ।
caturaḥ sarvvakālāṃ vai caturddhe kṣatramudvahet ।।

tasmai paṭe yathecchā vai devyāmūrttiryathoditā ।
prākpaṭotha yathācoktā khecarīyāstathā vidhau ।।

khaṭvāṃgordheśadhvaje vā ghaṃṭākapālabhūṣitā ।
muṃḍāsanasamārūḍhā vrīkṣaṃtī cottarādiśam ।।

tasmai dakṣiṇato devaṃ vṛṣacamontarī yathā ।
lekhayeta svarūpeṇa aṭṭahāsauṃḍavigraham ।।

ghaṃṭācāmarasaṃyuktāṃ vitānādarśabhūṣitām ।
nānāmāṃsāsino devaṃ bhairavādhāraviṣṭarām ।।

ḍhaḍhāṃrābhyāṃ tu purato sarvvagāmūddhni yojitām ।
pratiṣṭhayeta saddoṣā nānākadyasala(ṅka)tāḥ ।।

satyasavoṣṭakāṣṭhāntaṃ nāmakāyudhamānayaḥ ।
tādṛgrūpasamādhāno kulāhvā bhairavo yajet ।।

ebhirmahetsaragate nṛpaśāsanatorjjhitaiḥ ।
aṭṭahāsamahākālī palalohaiḥ samaṃ yajet ।।

vubhukṣutsaiṃdravṛ(dvyā) vai evaṃ vā yācitaṃ kvacit ।
jihvevaṃ ca suviśrāmaṃ śramaviśrāmasuśram ।।

tathottare prāṇamāsā sāmānyaṃ (va)tato(ddha)ret ।
(66b)
khyātāstathā kravyādāṣṭau rathyantaraśataṃ juhet ।।

acchinnaṃ ca mahājyena tadvartryā pātrajī(va)kam ।
nirvvapeta divārātrau gosapharyavimiśritam ।।

evameva daheddhūpaṃ parvvatotpala(mi)śritam ।
japatopāṃśuvidhinā vigrahoccai samuccaram ।।

anuvrato yathā(yā)taṃ snātvā ca dinasaṃkṣaye ।
prāṇāgnividhinā nityaṃ yaṣṭvāgnau jāṭharaṃ yajet ।।

nirvvāpyaṃ cataśeṣeṇa carukaṃ yācitena tu ।
devatābhyāṃ samuddiśya dvidhāheva tu nirvapet ।।

nivaśe{ta} bhojyapātre vā akṣasekṣaṇamuddhṛtam ।
tenaivāgnāhutīhutvā jāṭharāgnau hunetpunaḥ ।।

kulaistu prokṣayedbhūmiṃ āsanaḥ kuladevatā ।
saṃkulaiḥ pātramālabhya bhairavoccāramuccaret ।।

mahāvīraiḥ parāmā(rjye)rbhūcakhecaravigrahaiḥ ।
grāhayetparivāreṇa rudraistvavatu siṃcayet ।।

mudrāstraistu di(śā)pāla śeṣaṃ mātrikavigrahaiḥ ।
yaccainaṃ manasā sarvvasakhibhirdvāraṇākalaiḥ ।।

dhruvādipaṃcavaktrairhṛtatsaṃjñā pūrvvasaṃjñayā ।
āhṛtyāṣṭakamevaṃ hi hutvāntaṃ bhuṃjate yathā ।।

bhuktvatveva savicchinnaṃ jāṭharījaṭharocchvasam ।
dhyātvo sāgramapāyeta (ya)thotpa(nnau) svadevatām ।।

kṛtvārpaṇaṃ tato bāhye kṛtvā samyagjalena tu ।
agnihotraṃ punarhutvā bhūya eva niśāṃ japet ।।

bāhyānyarkendupuragā prāgāvastharathottamāḥ ।
vasudhāreva suptadhā śatacaṃdradiśontare ।।
(67a)
brahmāṇḍādhāranilayā viśvaghaṃṭā mahāsvanā ।
surāraṇī bhūtamātā sahata(ttvā)dinirbharā ।।

grāhyagrāhakabhedena vibhinnādarśapuṣkaram ।
sustadhvā vasudhā tena caturddhā bhramasaṃjuṣā ।।

juṣaṃ tasminna(ṭṭa)hāso paripūrṇṇakalāstu tam ।
paraṃ parejñasvabhāvo viśvātmā nidhanaṃ śivam ।।

sakeconapamādhāracatuṣkalalayodaram ।
sodayodayasaṃbhūyo bhūpa eva śamodayam ।।

apuṃje dvisahaṃtveva taṃtusārevamekataḥ ।
sannirodhya nirodhyena saturudhya ruhoruham ।।

rodhaṃdhamadhamāyena svavidyā svātmasodayā ।
nirodaye punaryuktvā svavidyāsāntaraṃ svapet ।।

nṛpādavasthāmuttīrya turyadhāraṇamuttaram ।
sontaraṃ tu padaṃ dṛṣṭvā śabdarāspadayodayam ।।

tasmiṃ bāhyeśvare viśvaṃ brahmanīḍamathottaram ।
saṃkari(ṣṭyā) pathākrāntaṃ maṃtrajño paṭhyate svayam ।।

dīpyamānā śriyā sārddhamaṭṭahāsavijṛmbhitā ।
ghorarūpā mahāraudrā saumyā prahasitānanā ।।

bhūyaḥ proktaṃ yathāyāgaṃ samyakkṛtvā suvistaram ।
arghayo devatāpiṃḍaṃ piṇḍenaiva tu vaṃdayet ।।

paṭhaṃto māripiṃḍaṃ vai mahākālī mahābalā ।
sādhako hyekamāropya abhīṣṭārthābhiṣiṃcayet ।।

abhiṣikto yathānyāyyaṃ jñātvā divyaṃ tapobalam ।
rudrabhairavadevānāṃ patitvamupayātyasau ।।
(67b)
utavāmāribhuvane bhuṃkte bhogānanekadhā ।
kālontarapadaṃ bhuktvā devyāyuktā śivaṃ vrajet ।।

evaṃ siddhipradā devī ghorā trailokyaḍāmarā ।
padānugatiyogena prativajravibhedanāt ।।

yadā sā bhedayet samyaktadā varṇṇasahasrarā(ḍ) ।
yadā cakkravibhāgena ṣoḍhābhinnā prapūjyate ।।

tadā padānāṃtyādevyo pūrvvamuktāssamāsataḥ ।
catuṣpaṃcāśadadhikaṃ śatamāsāṃ mayā tava ।।

tatra madhya devadevī tāpavāvaraṇasthitā ।
ṣaḍāraṃ prathamaṃ cakkraṃ dvādaśāramato bahiḥ ।।

tadbāhye ṣoḍaśāraṃ syāccaturvviṃśārakaṃ tataḥ ।
dvātriṃśadarakaṃ tasmā tatastadviguṇaṃ smṛtam ।।

evaṃ ṣaṭcakkravinyāsaṃ padabhedagataṃ sthitam ।
ānulomyagatā cātra padaṃ prativibhāgataḥ ।।

pratidevī vibhedena yajetrailokyaḍāmaram ।
evaṃ svāmivibhedena sthānasaṃcārabhedataḥ ।।

padāvaraṇayogācca bhedānāṃ tattvamāpnuyāt ।
prathamasyātra ṣaḍbhedā pratyāvaraṇayogataḥ ।।

dvādaśaiva dvitīyasya tṛtīyasya tadātmakāḥ ।
caturvviṃśārakasyeha caturvviṃśati kīrttitāḥ ।।

dvātriṃśadarakasyātra catuḥṣaṣṭirudā(hṛ)tā ।
paṃcabhedena su(śro)ṇi tathā hṛdayabhedanāt ।।

catuṣaṣṭhyarake cakkre bhedāstāvaṃti kīrttitāḥ ।
evaṃ bhedāni vijñāya paścāccakkrā dhṛtikkramāt ।।

pratiprādhānyayogena śeṣācaraṇabhedataḥ ।
(68a)
anantattvamupāyāti devadevī kṛṣodarī ।।

sahasramatracakkrāṇāmaṣṭabhiryutamuttamam ।
jñātavyaṃ guruṇā nityaṃ cakkresmiṃviśvaḍāmare ।।

ekaiva paramākālirbhedānantavisarpitā ।
yāvaṃti bhedajātāni devadevyā kṛṣodari ।।

tāvasvaikā samākhyātā kriyābhedādvibhidyate ।
vastuto nāsti bhedotra ekavīrāyatāḥ priye ।।

samastāvathavyastā vā padekaṃ vā ca sudari ।
sarvvatulyamihājñeyaṃ netrarāja * yadrathe ।।

niraṃgā vātha sāṃgā vā nāmedenāṃ prayatnataḥ ।
sarasvatyā brahmaṇaśca naranārāyaṇeṣvapi ।।

vasiṣṭhasya ca suśroṇi nākhyātā tattvataḥ priye ।
adyavīryasamopetā sarahasyā prakīrttitā ।।

trailokyaḍāmarāmeyaṃ brahmaṇo śīrṣakṛntanī ।
sarvvavijñānasaṃprāptirjāyate sādhakātmanām ।।

japādasyāḥ sureśāni ṣaṇmāsānnātrasaṃśayaḥ ।
mahābhogapradā siddhā mahāścaryaśatapradā ।।

dhanadhānyakarī nityā nānāsampatpradāyikā ।
nānāsiddhipradākhyātā sarvvasaṃpatpradāyikā ।।

ghorā suvīrā caṃḍogrā bhogamokṣaphalapradā ।
vyāpakāpyāyinī caṃḍā caṇḍapāpakṣayaṃkarī ।।

mahāsamayadoṣaghnī duṣṭadāridryaghātanī ।
mahāmāyāvidalanī sarvvakarmmakarī śivā ।।

evaṃ ghoraṃ cakkraṃ vyākhyā (te) samagrasiddhidaṃ sāram ।
guptaṃ sarvvarahasyaṃ pāṭhānmokṣapradaṃ puṃsām ।।
(68b)
kimaparamadhunā vakṣye vadayante cetasiddhitaṃ gauri ।
nilikhaṃ tantavasubhage sarahasyaṃ sādhakeśāni ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturvviśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
trailokyaḍāmarācakkre sādhanāvidhiraṣṭamaḥ paṭalaḥ ।।

(e)vaṃ śrutvā devadevī vidyāghoraparākramā ।
punaḥ provāca deveśaṃ siṃdhurājārthitā satī ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

śrutaṃ sarvvottamaṃ sāraṃ rahasyaṃ paramādbhutam ।
yaṃ smṛtvā bhūya evāhaṃ hṛṣyāmi ca punaḥ punaḥ ।।

adhunā śrotumicchāmi yā sā pratyaṃ(gi)rāparā ।
sarvvasaṅkaradoṣaghnī sarvvabhāgyāvarohanī ।।

mahāmārī kīrttanāśca mahāśāṃntikarī hi yā ।
sarvvayaṃtrogradalanī nāmākhyā hi yathārthataḥ ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

(śṛṇu) vakṣyāmi suśroṇi rahasyaṃ pāpanāśanam ।
pratyaṃgirāvidhiṃ ghoraṃ sarvvāriṣṭapramardanam ।।

asyā kālyā sureśāni saptāsaptatikoṭayaḥ ।
yaṃtrāṇāṃ dehajāḥ sarvvāstenaiṣā maṃtramātrikā ।।

gatvā girivarodyānaṃ guruśiṣyasamanvitaḥ ।
caṃdanāmurudigdhāṃgo madirā * * naṃditaḥ ।।

prastaranmātrikāṃ tatra yathāvibhavapūjitām ।
tatassamuddharedvidyāṃ dvādaśārkāyutopamām ।।

proddharetpraṇavaṃ pūrvve haṃsamagnisamanvitam ।
biṃduḍaṃbarasaṃyuktaṃ piṃḍaṃ sarvvontamonta * m ।।
(69a)
binduṃ tripadamuddhṛtya dvijihvaṃ bhairavaṃ tataḥ ।
citrabhānusamārūḍhaṃ piṃḍaṃ sūryāyutopamam ।।

haṃsaṃśrītithisaṃrūḍhaṃ biṃdunā samalaṃkṛtam ।
kuṃḍalaṃ vahnisaṃrūḍhaṃ vahnikṣayaśiroṃkitam ।।

biṃdunā yojitaṃ kṛtvā paṃcamaṃ varṇṇamuttamam ।
paśuṃ kevalamuddhṛtya haṃsaṃ dvisvarasaṃyutam ।।

punaḥ paśuṃ tadākrāntaṃ vāyuṃ tenaiva bhūṣitam ।
punastu kevalaṃ kālaṃ vāyumagnikṣayākitam ।।

varuṇāntaṃ sapraṇavaṃ cāpātaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।
aśvāṃtaṃmakuśākrāntaṃ cāpādyaṃ vahnisaṃpuṭam ।।

ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ varuṇāṃtaṃ tadaṃkitam ।
pañcamādyaṃ dvisvarāṃkaṃ varuṇāntaṃ ca kevalam ।।

niṣedhadevadeveśi trisūryoparibhūṣitam ।
paśuṃ kevalamṛddhṛtya haṃsaṃ dvisvarabhūṣaṇam ।।

ṣaṣṭhādyamagnisaṃrūḍhasapta(me)na vibhūṣitam ।
aṃkuśākhyaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ somaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

puruṣaṃ dvisvarākrāntaṃ vahniṃ ṣaṣṭhayutaṃ punaḥ ।
ghṛṇīśaṃ vahniveśmāṅkakhakāraṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

amṛtaṃ varuṇārūḍhaṃ mahāṃkuśavicitritam ।
cādyaṃ khāṃtasamārūḍhaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ punardadet ।।

ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ dvisvarākrāntaṃ maheṃdraṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
asya pūrvvaṃ punardadyād varuṇāntañca kevalam ।।

puruṣaṃ śrītithisthaṃ syāḍgaṇeśaṃ daradāṃkitam ।
vahnihaṃsaṃ kevalaṃ tu somamaṃkuṣṭasaṃyutam ।।

śirātrikāṇaṃ khacitaṃ somaṃ kevalinaṃ punaḥ ।
(69b)
vahniṃ varuṇasaṃrūḍhaṃ vāyukevalamuddharet ।।

niṣedhamaṃkuśaṃ vahnidāruṇā cātrapiṇḍitam ।
aśyaṃ trisūryakacitraṃ kuṇḍalāntāntamuddharet ।।

bhairavāntaṃ dvijihvasthapadametaddvidhā kuru ।
puruṣaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo cāpaṃ ca saśaraṃ punaḥ ।।

dvirabhyastaṃ padaṃ kuryā puna padmāsanādimam ।
ṣaṣṭhayuktaṃtu taṃ kuryā vahnimadhyasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

yakāraṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ padametadvidhā kuru ।
yonipūrvvaṃ punardeyaṃ sūryāntau piṇḍavatpunaḥ ।।

padametaddvirabhyastaṃ sarvvayaṃtravidāraṇam ।
vāyuṃ praṇavasaṃyuktaṃ somaṃ kālasamanvitam ।।

mukhadāraṇāyuktaṃ niṣedhaṃ dantavāhanam ।
varuṇasthaṃtu taṃ kāryaṃ vahnikṣayasamanvitam ।।

amṛtādyaṃ satṛtīyaṃ caṃdrasthaṃ kārayettataḥ ।
kevalaṃ (paṃ)camaṃ deyaṃ bhairavāntasacaṇḍayuk ।।

varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ pavanaṃ bindulācchitam ।
daṃturaṃ varuṇārūḍhaṃ tṛtīyasvaraśobhitam ।।

amṛtākhyaṃ paśusthaṃ syātpaṃcamādyaṃ ca kevalam ।
amṛtaṃ vāyusaṃruḍhaṃ varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

cāpamaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ vāyuṃ kevalamuddharet ।
bhairavāstraṃ tridhodhṛtya vahnibhāryāsamanvitam ।।

eṣā vidyā mahāghorā nāmnā pratyaṃgirā śubhā ।
sarvvasaubhāgyadā jñeyā sarvvamaṃtrapramāthinī ।।

sarvvābhicāradalanī sarvvaduṣkṛtanāśanī ।
(70a)
nānayā sadṛśī vidyā maṃtracakkre prakīrttitā ।।

yadā ghoratamāṃ maṃtrāṃ pūjāhīnāṃ smaredgiriḥ ।
tadā śapaṃti te maṃtrāstata enāṃ smaretsadā ।।

pratyaṃgirati duḥkhāni yaṃtrāṇyābhicarāṇi ca ।
pratyaṃgirā tadā jñeyā mahāyogeśvarī śivā ।।

trailokyadurlabhā gauri taṃtre cāsminprakāśitā ।
navatyarṇṇā samākhyātā sarvvapāpanisūdanī ।।

svacitprasaramadhyasthā kālīkālāntakārikā ।
vyaktāvidvāmamadhyasthā trailokyā(dbhu)taḍāmarā ।।

dhyāyetkalpāntakālāgnilakṣavratimabhīṣaṇām ।
kā(rā)likokilādīnāṃ nibhākāntiṃ subhairavām ।।

caturbhujāmekavīrāṃ netratritayabhāsurām ।
mahāpretasamārūḍhāṃ pātrakhaṭvāṃgadhāriṇīm ।।

pāśamu(dga)rahastāṃ tāṃ vasārudhiralaṃpaṭām ।
mahodagrāṃ mahābhīmāṃ kṣayamārutanisvanām ।।

evaṃvidhāyaṃtranāśe kṛtyā khārkhodamardane ।
cintayet parameśānīṃ abhicārupramardane ।।

śāntike śuddhahāreṃdutuhinā ca (ra)saṃ nibhām ।
pauṣṭikesitaraktābhāṃ śuṣkāṃ śuṣkānanāṃ parām ।।

varśyadāḍimapuṣpābhāṃ kuṃkumodakasannibhām ।
jātihiṃgulakaprakhyāṃ karṣaṇe cintayet sadā ।।

stambhanedrāyudhaprakhyā stobho marakatopamām ।
jambhane hemasadṛśāṃ dahejvālākulopamām ।।

uccāṭe dhūmasadṛśāṃ māraṇe kṛṣṇapiṃgalām ।
(70b)
dhyādhyutyādekarvvuritāṃ mohane śuṣkapiṃcchavat ।।

kākakokilava(rṇṇāṃbhā)melāpārthavicintayet ।
vivarakṣobhane raudrapāvakārvvudasannibhām ।।

khagato pūrvvarūpābhāṃ mokṣe śuddheṃdurūpiṇīm ।
icchārūpadharāṃ dhyāyedyathācintāmaṇīṃ śivām ।।

sugupte gurugehe vā yajeddevīṃ kṛṣodarīm ।
tatrāṣṭadalakaṃ padmaṃ kṛtvā (de)śikasattamaḥ ।।

caturdvāraṃ samaṃ śubhramicchārajavibhūṣitam ।
tatra (madhye) yajeddevīṃ pūrvvoktadhyānamāsthitām ।।

nānāvalyopahāraiśca nānāsavaviśeṣaṇaiḥ ।
nānāgaṃdhisugaṃdhaiśca nānāpuṣpa{śa}tairapi ।।

nānādhūpavaraiścitrai nānāvādyaravaistathā ।
yathā vibhavato pūjya paścāddhomaṃ samācaret ।।

yathābhirucitakuṃḍe vīrakāṣṭedhvanāvṛte ।
vīrānale tu juhuyādyathākarmānurūpataḥ ।।

pūrvvaṣaṭke yathāproktaṃ saṃskārādyaṃ tathātra ca ।
kṛtvā juhetmahāmāṃsamathānyadvā samāhitaḥ ।।

evaṃ hutvā tataḥ śiṣyaṃ praveṣṭavyaṃ vijāna(tā) ।
śucirdakṣaṃ vinītaṃ ca vīrācārābhinaṃdinam ।।

nadvanetraṃ sāṃjalikaṃ prokṣapuṣpāṃkṣipāpayet ।
ekavīre mahāyāge mudrāṃgādivivarjite ।।

paścādagnisamīpe tu dīkṣayet pūrvvavadyathā ।
evaṃ saṃdīkṣayedenaṃ paścāttamabhiṣecayet ।।

abhiṣikte hyatu jñātaḥ paścātsādhanamārabhet ।
(71a)
gatvā girivarodyānaṃ sarvvadvaṃdvavivarjitaḥ ।।

bhikṣāśī saṃganirmukto sādhayenmanasepsitam ।
japellakṣatrayaṃ maṃtrī juhvayāttu daśāṃśataḥ ।।

uttamaṃ ghṛtasaṃyuktaṃ homāntādagnimadhyataḥ ।
samudeti mahālakṣmī sādhakeṃdraṃ dṛḍhavratam ।।

tayā sārddhaṃ vrajetso vai yatra devī karaṃkiṇī ।
lakṣajāpena subhage pā(tāṃ)la tasya siddhyati ।।

mahāmelāpamanvicchettadā kuryādayaṃ vidhiḥ ।
gatvā pitṛvanaṃ bhīmaṃ pragṛhya śavamuttamam ।।

sthālaṃkṛtaṃ prasannātmā vedisthaṃ kārayettadā ।
tatpṛṣṭhārūḍha evāsau japedvidyāmabhītavat ।।

śatoccārā devadevyo samāgacchaṃti suvrate ।
tāsāmarghaṃ pradātavyaṃ bhitvā vāmāṃgamātmanaḥ ।।

tatastāḥ siddhidāḥ sarvvāḥ sādhakāya mahātmane ।
amunaiva vidhāne(na) vetālaṃ sādhayetsadā ।।

matsyatailapradigdhāṅgā vedisthaṃ śavamālabhet ।
tata uttiṣṭhate kṣipraṃ vetālaṃ ghoradarśanam ।।

vajrāṭṭahāsa - - - muktvāhāsya {vravītyasau ।
kimāhutyesmi bruhi kiṃ karavāmi te ।।

rasaṃ rasāyaṇaṃ khaḍgaṃ guṭikāpaṭameva vā ।
pātālaṃ vātha}ṣravīraṃ vidhānaṃ sārvvakāmikam ।।

cintāratnānyanekāni gṛhāṇa manasīpsitam ।
tūṣṇībhūtvā na kiṃcidvai kāmayeta samāhitaḥ ।।

hatvā taṃ khādayedvīrā nirvvikalpena cetasā ।
brahmāyurbhavare{te} maṃtrī māṃsasyāsya prabhakṣaṇāt ।।

sonimādiguṇairyukto mahābalapa(rā)kramaḥ ।
(71b)
akṣapakvāmagāmī ca aṃte nirvvāṇamāpnuyāt ।।

ajastvā kurute sarvvaṃ sāmānyaṃ sādhanaṃ sadā ।
pūrvvoktaṃ devadeveśi śāṃtpādyaṃ māraṇāntikam ।।
yadvā manāsiro cetata(tta)tsādhayate balāt ।

etat sureṃdranamite gaditaṃ yathāvaddevyāvidhānamakhilāgamasārabhūtam ।
siddhipradaṃ śṛṇu rahasyatamaṃ hi cānyatpratyaṃgirā vidhiranantaguṇābhirāmam ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturvviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke pratyaṃgirāvidhirnnavamapaṭalaḥ ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

athānyaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi vidhānamidamuttamam ।
sarvvasiddhipradaṃ sāraṃ nāmnā trailokyasādhanam ।।

paramaṃtragrāsakaraṃ kṛtyā khārkhaudaghaṭṭanam ।
pratyaṃgirā mahākālī sarvvasampatpradāyikā ।।

maṃtraḍāmarikā nāmnī sarvvamaṃtreśvarīparā ।
gatvā pitṛvanaṃ ghoraṃ rātrau vidyāṃ samuddharet ।।

vīropacāreṣu sadā mātrikāṃ pūjya suvrato ।
proddharenmaṃtramatulaṃ paramaṃtraprabhakṣakam ।।

tārakaṃ proddharetpūrvvahaṃsayugmamatho(ddha)ret ।
antimaṃ sṛṣṭisahitaṃ punardīrghayutaṃ dvayam ।।

dvitayaṃ kevalaṃ bhūya catu(rddhā)kāntamu(ddha)ret ।
kāntaṃ dvisvarasaṃyuktaṃ haṃsaṃ trisvarasaṃyutam ।।

padametaddvidhākāryaṃ somaṃ kevalamu(ddha)ret ।
(72a)
vahniṃ varuṇasaṃrūḍhaṃ puruṣaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

niṣedhaṃ pañcamādyasthaṃ vahnibiṃduvibhūṣitam ।
mukhadāraṇayākrāntaṃ vahnisthaṃ ca gaṇeśvaram ।।

somaṃ kevalamu(ddhṛ)tya padametaddvidhā kuru ।
ṣa(ṣvā)dya(ṅke)valaṃ bhūyo vahniṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

yonipūrvvaṃ saptamasthaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ sadāruṇam ।
pavanasthaṃ sureśāni kāntaṃ caiva sadā(ra)ṇam ।।

tameva vahnisaṃdīptaṃ praṇavena vibhūṣitam ।
cāpādyaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
nadaṃtaṃ vāyusaṃrūḍhaṃ mukhakāraṇayāyutam ।।

yonipūrvvaṃ svarūpeṇa vahniṃ kumbhasthamu(ddha)ret ।
astraṃ kevalamu(ddhṛ)tya varuṇaṃ trisvarānvitam ।।

daṃturaṃ varuṇārūḍhaṃ agniveśmasamanvitam ।
kaṃbhaṃ kevalamu(dvṛ)tya puruṣadvisvarāṅkitam ।।

vahniṃ kevalinaṃ bhūyo aśvaṃ sapraṇavaṃ punaḥ ।
caṃḍaṃ svātmasthitaṃ kuryānmukhadāraṇayāyutam ।।

caṃdraṃ kevalameva syānniṣedhaṃ cāṃkuśāhatam ।
daṃturaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ yonipūrvvasabiṃdukam ।।

graṃthīśaṃ dāraṇāyuktaṃ varuṇāntaṃ tu kevalam ।
vāyuṃ kevalamuddhṛtya padametaddvidhā kuru ।।

haṃsamagniṃ ḍamvaraṃrapiṇḍaṃ binduṃ vibhūṣitam ।
kuṇḍalaṃ vahnipuṭitaṃ kālarudrasabiṃdukam ।।

punaḥ kuṇḍaladevaṃ tu vahnisthaṃ tatkṣaṇāṃkitam ।
biṃdunā lāṃcchitaṃ kṛtvā puna kuṇḍalamuddharet ।
(72b)
vahnikālāgnisaṃyuktaṃ bindupravarabhūṣitam ।।

punaḥ kuṇḍaladevaṃ tu śrītithisthaṃ samuddharet ।
savisargaṃ mahābījaṃ dvidhā devi samuddharet ।।

rāvaṃ vahnisamāyuktaṃ visargeṇa samanvitam ।
bhīmaśaṃkuṃ tataścānte padametaddvi * kuru ।।

namaskārāntasahitaṃ maṃtraṃ maṃtraprakālanam ।
sarvvasaṃpatpradākhyātā nāmnā pratyaṃgirottamāṃ ।।

mahāpāpapraśamanī ekavīrā puroktavān ।
hatvā carācaraṃ viśvaṃ brāhmaṇaiḥ paripūritam ।।

kāmatopi mahādevi na sa pāpena lipyate ।
liṃgotpāṭādikāṃ pāpāṃ guruhā pitṛmātṛhā ।।

śuddhyate smaraṇāddevi tridhā vidyeśvareśvarī ।
paramaṃtrapradalanī parayaṃtraprabhakṣaṇī ।।

parābhicāraśamanī paraduṣkṛtanāśanī ।
catuḥṣaṣṭhyakṣarā vidyā maṃtrāṇāmapi pāpanut ।।

kimanyat kathayiṣyāmi śṛṇu padmāsanārcite ।
na cāsyāssadṛśī vidyā mahāpātakanāśanī ।।

vidyate parameśāni kimanyat kathayāmi vā ।
yajedenāṃ parvvatāgre suguptetha gṛhottame ।।

ṣaṭkoṇabhuvanasyāntargandhadigdhasya suvrate ।
tatra madhye nyaseddevīṃ bhīmāṃ maṃtraprabhakṣaṇīm ।।

kālānalāyutanibhāṃ brahmāṇḍaka(va)lodyatām ।
tārikṣapakṣaracitāṃ mahāhikṛtamekhalām ।।

kṣapanīradanirghātaghorarāvāṃ durāsadām ।
(73a)
gṛddhadhvajāṃ pre - saṃsthāṃ gonāsābharaṇairvṛtām ।।

narāṃ - pūrita [pūrita] mukhīṃ taḍitkoṭyayutaprabhām ।
siṃhasūkaravakrāṇi stanābhyāṃ cintayetsadā ।।

suśuṣkāṃ koṭarākṣīṃ (tā) bhaya(syā)pi bhayānakām ।
kākakokilakālāliharakaṃṭhanibhopamām ।।

dīrghakeśāṃ dīrghadaṃṣṭrāṃ dīrghāṃtra sra(kpra)labinīṃ ।
aṣṭāda(śa)bhujoddāmāṃ paṃcavaktrāṃ mahāravāt ।।

sarvvāyudhadharāṃ dīptāṃ viśvarūpāṃ vicintayet ।
kapālakhaṭvāṃgadharāṃ naramuṃḍopaśobhitām ।।

hṛdaṃbujadharāṃ raudrāṃ khaḍgakaṭṭārikodyatām ।
tuṃbuvīṇāvādyaratāṃ gajacarmakarodyatām ।।

śūlaṭaṃkadharāṃ bhīmāṃ dhyātvā kṛcchrīṇi nāśayet ।
evaṃ dhyātvā nyasenmadhyaṃ devadevīṃ kṛśodarīm ।।

sarvvavīropacāreṇa paścāttāmparipūjayet ।
mahāmāṃsāsavairdivye chāgādyaimīnasaṃbhavaiḥ ।।

(rpi)śebhibahubhirbhṛṣṭaiḥ pakvairāmaiśca pūja(ye)t ।
surāmadyāraṇālādiśīdhvaraktāsavādibhiḥ ।।

saṃtarpya devadeveśī nānāsraggaṃdhadhūpanaiḥ ।
lopikāśaṃkhavartyādi bhakṣairnānāvidhaistathā ।।

saṃpūjaye(t) śureśānī vittaśāḍhyavivarjitaḥ ।
paścāddhomaṃ prakuvīta māṃsairjāṃgalajodbhavaiḥ ।।

datvā pūrṇṇāhutiṃ paścācchiṣyaṃ devi praveśayet ।
suvinitaṃ naddhanetraṃ vīrācāra(raṃ)taṃ sadā ।।

puṣpāṃkṣiyāmya deveśā kuṇḍasthānamato nayet ।
tatra pūrvvoktayogena śiṣyaṃ taṃ dīkṣayedguruḥ ।।
(73b)
tatobhiṣeca * tprāgvatsarvvarājopacārakaiḥ ।
labdhājñaḥ sādhakavaraḥ paścātsādhanamārabhet ।।

giryagre vā nadītīre kṛtāvāsavidhiḥ kramaḥ ।
tatropaviśyaṃ prapataḥ kaṃdādhāroditāṃ kalām ।।

vidrumaddaṃḍasaṃkāśāṃ cintayeccakkrabhedakīm ।
tanmadhyagaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ tatsthaḥ svātmanyevaṃ sthitaḥ ।।

lakṣatrayaṃ mahābhāge juhuyānnaraphusphusam ।
daśāṃśena tato vahnirmmadhyāddevī bhayānakā ।।

samudeti mahādevī tayā sārddhavrajedasau ।
tatpūjakastatra sadā sādhakeṃdro bhaviṣyati ।।

atha gatvā giripṛṣṭhe vivaraṃ yatra viśrutam ।
tatra kṛṣṇacaturdaśyāṃ mahārātra upoṣitaḥ ।।

jvālayedvahnikuṃḍaṃ tu juhuyāttatra sādhakaḥ ।
gugguluṃ ghṛtasaṃmiśraṃ yāvadaṣṭasahasrakam ।।

tadāśu kampate bhūmiṃ saśailavanakānanām ।
nirgacchaṃti tataḥ kāṃtāścaruhāsā manoharāḥ ।।

nānārūpadharāḥ sarvvāssarvvābharaṇabhūṣitāḥ ।
mattakuṃjaragāminyaḥ ṣoḍaśābdasamāḥ sadā ।।

vipuladroṇisāṃdohāḥ pīnonnatapayodharāḥ ।
praṇatāvepamānāsnāsādhakasyāgragāḥ priye ।।

vijñāpayaṃti taṃ bhītāḥ sādhakaṃ devavaṃditam ।
ehyehi vīranātheśu pātālaṃ bhogasāgaram ।।

sahāsmākaṃ ramaścātra yāvadābhūmisaṃplavam ।
svarggāddaśaguṇe śubhre sākhikaṃ pānamuttamam ।।
(74a)
pibasva tatra vīreṃdra prayacchānyeṣu vā vibho ।
evaṃ śrutvā tatastāsāṃ sārddheṃ tatra viśennaraḥ ।।

mahāvibhūtisaṃyukto vimānaiḥ kāṃcane sthitaḥ ।
tatrārcayitvā deveṃdraṃ hāṭakeśaṃ mahāśvaram ।।

pītvā tu sātvi(kaṃ)pānaramedācaṃdratārakam ।
kalpāvasāne subhage viśettāmaiśvarī tanum ।।

atha melāpasaṃsiddhyai pūrvvavadviniyojayet ।
pūrvvavatsiddhimāpnoti viśeṣo na vidhīyate ।।

kṛtyotpādanama - graṃ śṛṇu vīreṃdravaṃdite ।
gatvā pītṛvanaṃ bhīmaṃ ghorasaṃbhārasaṃbhṛtaḥ ।।

mahāśūlāṣṭakaṃ gṛhya di(gdhva)jā - prakalpayet ।
paśupiṃḍāṃtra padmāni teṣveva pravilaṃbayet ।।

mūrdhyaruṃdrāṣṭakaṃ datvā mahāṃtrairupavītakam ।
mahāsṛgupaliṃptāgau śavanirmālyabhūṣitam ।।

citāgniṃ dīpayenmadhye tatkāṣṭhaiḥ śavapṛṣṭagaḥ ।
uccainmaṃtrī juhettatra mahāmāṃsaṃ ka - ryutam ।।

śataṃ yāvajuhettāvatkaṃpate sarvvamedinīm ।
dvitīye digvidigdāho kolāhalaravomahām ।।

vidyunirghātanirghoṣā tṛtīye saṃpravarttate ।
tatognimadhyātsahasā ghorarūpā bhayānakā ।।

samudeti mahākṛtyā vidāryāsyaṃ subhairavam ।
vadatyevāṃ sādhakodre kiṃkāryaṃ prakaromi bhoḥ ।।

cūrṇṇayāmi girīturyā śoṣayāmi mahārṇṇavām ।
dārayāmyatha pātālaṃ yatrāṃ saṃcūrṇṇayāmi kaṃ ।।
(74b)
mathnāmi dhanadaṃ kopādyaṃmavā kālameva vā ।
nairṛteṃdramatheṃdraṃ vā vāyumagnimathāpi vā ।।

vadalokāntaragatā - myāḥ kiṃ nāśayāmyaham ।
brahmāṇamānayā(mye)ṣa vada kiṃ karavāni te ।।

kimarthamahamāhūtā vada vīreṃdraniryayam ।
tatastasyāḥ pravaktavyaṃ yathā manasi(rā)citam ।।

tadavighnena sā sarvvaṃ sādhakāya prayacchati ।
evaṃ kṛtyā mahāsiddhā yathāvat saṃprakāśitā ।।

āsādhinā mahāvidyā sarvvasaubhāgyadā smṛtā ।
paramaṃtrāṃgrasa(tpā)śu pararakṣānikṛṃtanī ।।

parābhicāradaśanī sakṛtsaṃsmṛtya suṃdari ।
raktāmṛtamayādevī sukhaśrībhāgyadā smṛtā ।।

va(su)dhārāprayogena dvādaśānte vivarttanām ।
dhanadhānyaṃ pradā jñeyā sādhakasya mahātmanaḥ ।।

kaṃdacakkraviniryātā raśmidvādaśasaṃyutā ।
kalāsau(lī) mahāghorā vidyud(ghā)tayogataḥ ।।

pātayetsiddhavṛṃdāni devi nāstyatra saṃśayaḥ ।
evaṃvidhā somavāre kalāṣo(ḍa)śasaṃyutā ।।

ādhyāpayati vi(dha)sya mṛtasaṃjīvanīparā ।
kāmacakkravikāsena tādyāgā(t) kṣobhanena tu ।।

vaśīkaroti sakalaṃ jagadetaccarā(ca)ram ।
vātaca(kkrā)ntaragato bhramadbhramarayogataḥ ।।

cālayetparvvatāṃ sthānā kiṃ punaḥ śatruvāhinīm ।
vajrapānanibhāraudrāṃ kālacakkroditāṃ parām ।।

mārayedripusaṃghātaṃ tīkṣṇakhaḍgaṃ samo - nām ।
(75a)
śāṃtipuṣṭivaśākarṣasvabhāvabhuvanoditām ।।

svabhāvabhāsāvibhavairbhuvanāpūraṇoditām ।
cintayitvā sarvvakarī devadevī kṛṣodarī ।।

dve tulyo devadeveśyaṃ siddhipratyaṃgire śubhe ।
sādhayaṃti hi kāryāṇi cittasthānīha yāni ca ।।

yathā devī sahasrārṇṇā brahmaṇe śīrṣahāriṇī ।
yathā sā matacakkreśī yathā laṃkeśvarī parā ।।

sahasrākṣaramānāstā(nta)dvadate prakīrttita ।
pratyaṃgirāyugaṃ caitatsarvvasiddhipradaṃ śubham ।
yathārthatatva vā khyātaṃ kiṃ bhūyaḥ paripṛcchasi ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturvviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke pratyaṃgirāvidhirdaśamaḥ paṭalaḥ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

devadeva mahābāho sarvvakāraṇavaṃdita ।
triśūladhara(somāṃkā) bhakta - grahatatpara ।।

matacakkreśvarī devī sahasrākṣaramālinī ।
tathā laṃkeśvarī nātha sahasrākṣaraśobhitā ।।

sūcinā parameśāna tāmākhyāhi prasādataḥ ।
yathā rahasyayogena yuktāsādhanasaṃyutā ।।

prasādāddevadeveśa brūhi me tripurāntaka ।
emāka(rllya)deveśo prācya paṃcāmṛtaṃ carum ।।

vikāsya vīryasadbhāvaṃ prajvālya jvālinīkulam ।
mahākālikulārūḍhaḥ sāṭṭahāsamuvāca ha ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

śṛṇuṣva bhairaveśāni yadāhaṃ coditastvayā ।
(75b)
mahārahasyamatulaṃ brahmāṇḍakṣayakārakam ।।

kṣaṇādāve{śa}karaṇaṃ {kārarṇṇai}dravilāpakam ।
vidhānamidamatyugraṃ bhūtā(pa)smārabhakṣaṇam ।।

kalidusvapnamathanaṃ ityupadravayothanam ।
sarvvasaubhāgyadaṃ sāraṃ mahāmāyāprabhakṣakam ।।

divyāvidhānamatulaṃ śṛṇu saṃkṣepatodhunā ।
paripūrṇṇasya śāntasya dhruvasyāvyayaśālinaḥ ।।

nitya(tṛpta)sya śuddhasya pramāṇairvvarjitasya ca ।
vyāpakasya parānaṃdacitprabho bhairavātmanaḥ ।।

parollāsavikāsā(ḍhyā) sākalā vīryarūpiṇī ।
sahasraraśmikhacitā sahasravibhumālinī ।।

sahasraśakticakkreśī sahasrodyānasuṃdarā ।
sahasrapiṃḍamathanī mūrttilakṣavirājitā ।।

paṃcapānamahāpātā sahasrāpātabhīṣaṇā ।
paṃcaratnavikāsāḍhyā paṃcaratneśvareśvarī ।।

paṃcagrahakarī bhīma pañcagraṃthivipāṭinī(m) ।
paṃcā(tha)dā paṃcaharī nāyakāṃ(kru)lamālinī ।।

vede samyaksamāsnātā sahasrākṣarabhāsurā ।
mateśvarī matārūḍhā caṃḍi kāpāli kālikā ।।

caturddhāvāgvibhedena vyaktā sā kramayogataḥ ।
parāprathamagabhotthā svollāsānaṃdanirbharā ।।

sarvvaprapaṃcarahitā nistaraṃgānikulā * ।
tataḥ paśyanti rūpeṇa triśaktiparimaṃḍitā ।।

kharvvībhūtaṃ trayaṃ tatra icchājñānakriyātmakam ।
nirvvibhāgasthitaṃ yasmājñānāsmi kiṃtu kiṃcana ।
(76a)
tadā paśyaṃti rūpā sā gītādevī kuleśvarī ।।

icchājñānadvayodriktā viviktā madhyamā hi sā ।
vāgudeti sure(sā)ni tasyā vyaktiprabhedataḥ ।।

icchājñānakriyodriktā yadā saiva parākalā ।
vikharatnepi vāpaṃnā sphoṭākhyā vaikharī hi sā ।।

yadā catu - saṃ - ddhaṃ pūrvvavīryaka(lānta)re ।
prakāśānaṃdake cakre ravirāvivicitrite ।।

tatra bhānustasya bhānustatra caṃdraṃ ca tasya tat ।
tatra trayaṃ trayasyāntastacca nityaṃ virājate ।।

savyoma tatra vai vyoma vyomni tatpravijṛṃbhite ।
evaṃ tatra cātatra spharvāga(tra) cāntare yadā ।।

nadā vijṛṃbhate cakkraṃ maṃtrākhyāsanaladyutiḥ ।
sahasrākṣarasa(dvsa)haṃ sahasraravimālitam ।।

sahasraraśmivṛṃdāḍhyaṃ sahasreṃduvirājitam ।
sahasrakālavahnīnāṃ bhābibhartti pṛthak {pṛ}thak ।।

paṃca - galitaṃ tacca paṃcasthānanipātitam ।
paṃcārthakuharārūḍhaṃ paṃcaratneśvareśvaram ।।

taṃ maṃtramatulaṃ ghoraṃ (mā)rttaṇḍayutabhakṣakam ।
tasyo(ddhā)ramahaṃ vakṣye śṛṇu bhairavabhāmini ।।

gatvā pitṛvanaṃ bhīmaṃ mātrigṛhamathāpi vā ।
gurugṛhāmatheśāni dūtiyuktaḥ prasannadhīḥ ।।

svālaṃkṛtāṃ tu tāṃ kṛtvā caṃdanāgurucarcitām ।
palāliparitau dvau tu kṣobhayetkuṃḍagolakau ।।

vidrāvya golakaṃ tatra kuṇḍaṃ ca tanumardhya(maṃ) ।
(76b)
tatthaṃ gṛhya mahādravyaṃ mukhena tanumadhyame ।।

tadvaktragaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā punaḥ kṛtvā svava(ktra)gam ।
pātraṃ nirūpaye(tte)na mahālyavuvimiśritam ।।

tenārghapātraṃ kurvvīta sarvvasiddhiphalapradam ।
tato yajenmahādevīṃ mātrikāṃ maṃtramātarām ।।

avadhūtatanurbhū(tvā) nirācārapadasthitaḥ ।
prastarenmātrikāṃ maṃtrī vargāṣṭakapuraḥsarām ।।

saṃpūjyagaṃdhadhūpādyairnānāvalyopahārakaiḥ ।
tataḥ samuddharedvidyāṃ matacakkreśvarīṃ parām ।।

tārakaṃ pūrvvamu(ddhṛ)tya mahānārāyaṇī tataḥ ।
puruṣaṃ haṃsamuddhṛtya mukhadāraṇayāyutam ।।

tṛtīyādyaṃ svarūpeṇa asvaṃ mulasaṃsthitam ।
vāyuṃ praṇavasaṃyuktaṃ gaṇeśaṃ sāhanāṃkitam ।।

varuṇāṃtaṃ ca tadrūḍhaṃ vahniṃ trisvaralāṃcchitam ।
daśārṇṇapadameta(ddhi) sarvvakāmaphalāvaham ।।

dviji(hvaṃ) varaṇārūvaṃ śakraṃ trisvaralāṃcchitam ।
paṃcamādyaṃ svarūpeṇa puruṣaṃ śrītithisthitam ।।

gaṇeśāṃ tribiṃdvāḍhyaṃ padaṃ paṃcārṇṇamuttamam ।
dvitīyaṃ kīrttitaṃ caitattṛtīyaṃ śṛṇu sāṃpratam ।।

dviji(hvaṃ) varuṇārūḍhaṃmaṃkuśākrāntamastakam ।
śakramaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ jihvilaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।।

haṃsaṃvaruṇasaṃruḍhaṃ praṇavena śirāṃkitam ।
cāpādyaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ vahniṃ trisvarabhūṣaṇam ।।

ṣaḍarṇṇapadamuddiṣṭaṃ sarvvasaṃdohalakṣaṇam ।
(77a)
(ṭha)kādyasyāntamuddhṛtya mahāmohasamanvitam ।।

paśuma - kṣayopetaṃ caturthaṃ dvyakṣaraṃ padam ।
puruṣaṃ kevalaṃ datvā haṃsaṃdāraṇayānvitam ।।

ā - masya padasyādyaṃ dvitīyaṃ gatabhūṣaṇam ।
kālādyaṃ mohanākrāntaṃ somādyaṃ kevalaṃ dadet ।।

asva trisvarasaṃbhinnaṃ saptārṇṇaṃ paṃcamaṃ padam ।
indraṃ kevalamuddhṛtyaṃ puruṣaṃ vakavāhanam ।
praṇavena samāyuktaṃ cāpādyaṃ kevalaṃ dadet ।।

devāsyaṃ trisvarāṅkasyācchaṣvatu(ryyā)kṣaraṃ padam ।
punarvvaruṇamuddhṛtya trisvarīkaṃ mahābalam ।।

varuṇāṃtaṃ panadruḍhaṃ mukhadāraṇayānvitam ।
niṣedhapaṃcamādisthaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ tribiṃduyuk ।।

saptamaṃ padameta(ddhi) caturakṣarasammitam ।
yonipūrvvadvisvarā(ḍkaṃ) śakraṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

gaṇeśaṃ vahnigaṃ rūḍhaṃ dvisvarākrāntamastakam ।
amṛtaṃ kevalaṃ dadyāni(ṣe)dhaṃ trisvarānvitam ।।

paṃcārṇṇamaṃṣṭamaṃ jñeyaṃ padametanmahārthadam ।
punarvvarṇṇadvayaṃ pūrvvaṃ padasyāsya samuddharet ।।

niṣedhaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ amṛtaṃ ṣaṣṭhasaṃsthitam ।
cāpādyaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ niṣedhaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।।

ṣaḍakṣaraṃ syānnavamaṃ paṃcametanmahābalam ।
caturddhā haṃsamu(ddhṛ)tya mukhadāraṇayānvitam ।।

amṛtaṃ ca niṣedhaṃ ca trisūryeṇa vicitritau ।
pūrvvārṇṇaṃ daśamaṃ jñeyaṃ padamatyuttamottamam ।।
(77b)
puruṣaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ haṃsaṃ dvisvarabhūṣaṇam ।
kālādyamaiśvarākrāntaṃ vahniṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

varuṇaṃ trisvaropetaṃ paṃcārṇṇapadamuttamam ।
ekādaśaṃ tavākhyātaṃ yavāvantanumadhyama ।।

(puṃ)ruṣaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ haṃsaṃ dvisvarasaṃyutam ।
varuṇāntaṃ kālarūḍhaṃ tameva dvisvarāṃ(kiṃ)tam ।।

ni(ṣaṃ)dhaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ kālādyaṃ paṃcabiṃduyuk ।
punaḥ kālāṃka va(rṇṇa)syādvaruṇaṃ dvisvarāṃkitam ।।

amṛtaṃ ca niṣedhaṃ ca dvāvapi trisvarā(ḍki)tauḥ ।
da(dvyā)kṣaraṃ dvādaśasyātpadametanmahārṣadam ।।

catuṣkalamato deyaṃ tṛtīyādyaṃ punardadet ।
aśvaṃ marmasamārūḍhaṃ kālaṃ śrītithisaṃyutam ।।

kāntaṃ trisva(ra)mūrddhānapaṃcārṇṇapadamuttamam ।
trayodaśamidaṃ siddhaṃ trailokyākarṣakārakam ।।

puruṣaṃ punaru(ddhṛ)tya prāṇaṃ dvisvarabhūṣitam ।
tṛtīyādyaṃ punadeyaṃ adhośūlaṃ samardakam ।।

vāyuṃ praṇavasaṃyuktaṃ gaṇeśaṃ vāgniveśayuk ।
varuṇāntaṃ ca varuṇaṃ piṃḍībhūto samu(ddha)ret ।।

vahniṃ trisvaramū(rddhā)naṃ (ḍasva)raṃ ca tato(ddha)ret ।
vahniṃ anantaṃ vahniṃ ca ḍambareṇa śirāhatam ।।

biṃdunā lāṃcchitaṃ kṛtvā cāpaṃ bhūyognisaṃpuṭam ।
pūrvvaprameyasahitaṃ bhīmaśaṃkuṃ ca paṃcadhā ।।

ṣoḍaśākṣarameta(ddhi) padaṃ sarvvottamottamam ।
caturdaśaṃ samākhyātaṃ trailokyātaṃkaśānanam ।।

padasyā - vayau pūrvvā tau dvāvabhrasamu(ddha)ret ।
(78a)
haṃsaṃ tu kevalaṃ deyaṃ cāṃdre svātmasthitaṃ dadet ।।

kālādyaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ vahniṃ śrītithisayutam ।
caṃdraṃ piṃdasthitaṃ deyaṃ trisvarākrāntamū(rddha)jam ।।

saptākṣa{ra}midaṃ deyaṃ padaṃ pañcadaśaṃ priye ।
asya pūrṇṇaṃ varṇṇayugaṃ punaravyatra dāpayet ।
vāhnaṃ nādā tu saṃvi(ddhaṃ) vāruṇaṃ ca niṣedhakam ।।

trisvarālaṃkṛtau tau tu paṃcārṇṇaṃ padamuddhṛtam ।
ṣoḍaśaṃ padametatsyādrāviṇīcakkrarāvaṇam ।।

prāṇaṃ biṃdusamāyuktaṃ amṛtaṃ ca niṣedhakam ।
trisvarālaṃkṛtau tau tu tryakṣaraṃ padamuttamam ।।

saptādaśaṃ devadevi madhyaprāṇaprakāśakam ।
gajeṃdraṃ deva va(ktra)sthaṃ mukhadāraṇayācitam ।।

haṃsaṃ niṣedhamevānya trisvarālaṃkṛtau kuru ।
pūrvvārṇṇamaṣṭādaśamaṃ padametatprakīrttitam ।।

paśuṃ dāraṇayā yuktaṃ vāhnaṃ kevalamu(ddha)ret ।
aśvaṃ trisvarasaṃyuktaṃ unaviṃśaṃ pado(tta)mam ।।

tryakṣaraṃ parameśāni sarvvaviśvakṣayākulam ।
punaḥ paśuṃ sapraṇavaṃ haṃsaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
ni(ṣedhaṃ) trisvarākārttapūrvvārṇṇaviṃśamaṃ padam ।।

catuṣkalaṃ samu(ddhṛ)tya dvijihvadīrghabhūṣitam ।
punavisargasaṃyuktaṃ tryakṣaraṃ padamuttamam ।
gaṇeśādyaṃ dīrghayuktaṃ haṃsaṃ trisvarabhūṣaṇam ।।

etatpadaṃ dvidhā deyaṃ caturarṇṇaikaviṃśamam ।
vāruṇaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ cāpādyaṃ vahniyojitam ।।

mukhadāraṇayā yuktaṃ vāruṇaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
(78b)
aśvaṃ trisūryamūrddhānaṃ caturarṇṇaṃ padottamam ।।

dvāviṃśatisamākhyātaṃ sarvvaduṣṭāntakārakam ।
dvijihvaṃ savisargaṃ ca dvidhā deyaṃ sulocane ।।

punardīrghasamāyuktaṃ haṃsaṃ trisvarabhāsuram ।
dvidhā kuryādvarṇṇavarau ṣaḍakṣaramidaṃ padam ।।

trayoviṃśatimaṃ jñeyaṃ śatruvaṃśanikṛntanam ।
anantaṃ vahnipuṭitaṃ biṃduḍaṃbarabhūṣitam ।।

puruṣaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ haṃsaṃ dvisvaracarcitam ।
kālādyamaṣṭamākāntaṃ vahniṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

varuṇaṃ praṇavākrāntaṃ pañcapādyaṃ sacaṃdrakam ।
śūlāntaṃ gajasaṃrūḍhavāruṇaṃ cāṃkuśāhatam ।।

amṛtaṃ ca niṣedhaṃ ca dvau trisvaravibhūṣitau ।
varṇṇaikādaśasaṃyuktaṃ caturvviṃśatimaṃ padam ।।

puruṣaṃ proddharedbhūyo haṃsaṃ dvimbarabhūṣaṇaṃ ।
dāraṇā biṃdusaṃyuktaṃ punaḥ puruṣamuddharet ।।

amṛtaṃ dāraṇākrāntaṃ varuṇāntaṃ ca kevalam ।
niṣedhaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ ṣaḍarṇṇaṃ paṃcaviṃśamam ।।

(pa)dametanmahāraudraṃ sadyo melāpasiddhidam ।
niṣedhaṃ paṃcamārūḍhaṃ cāpādyaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

dvidhā padamidaṃ kāryaṃ caturakṣarabhūṣitam ।
ṣaḍviṃśatimameta(ddhi) sarvvakāmaphalapradam ।।

paṃcamādyaṃ vahnirūḍhaṃ śrītithisthaṃ tataḥ kuru ।
caṃdrakevalamuddhṛtya dvidhāvarṇṇasvatāṃ kuru ।।

varṇṇasaṃkhyā pūrvvavacca saptāviṃśati me pade ।
dvidhā haṃsaṃ saptamāṃkaṃ puruṣaṃ kevalaṃ tataḥ ।।

mukhadāraṇayā yuktaṃ kevalaṃ haṃsamuddharet ।
(79a)
tadvadyonyādyamu(ddhṛ)tya śākraṃ trisvarabhūṣitam ।।

ṣaḍavarṇṇamatulaṃ jñeyaṃ aṣṭāviṃśatimaṃ padam ।
saśaraṃ cāpamu(ddhṛ)tya tadvīryapunaruddharet ।।

galāgantaṃ mahābhīmaṃ trayodumbarabhūṣitāḥ ।
vahnibiṃdusamāyuktā piṇḍāssūryāyutopamāḥ ।।

ṣaṣṭhādyā dvisvarākrāntaṃ varuṇāntaṃ ca kevalam ।
cāpādyaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ hayaṃ marmasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

cāpamaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ vahniṃ hayamatho(ddha)ret ।
trisvarālaṃkṛtau tau tu daśārṇṇaṃ padamuttamam ।।

ekontatriṃśa{ti}maṃ jñeyaṃ bahubhogabharāvaham ।
gaṇeśādyaṃ sapraṇavaṃ bāhuṃ varuṇasaṃsthitam ।।

dvisvarālaṃkṛtau mūrdhnī vahnitrisvarabhūṣitam ।
tryakṣaraṃ padametaddhi triṃśamaṃ parikī(tti)tam ।।

kālaṃ svarūpato deyaṃ prāṇaṃ dvisvaramaṃḍitam ।
tenaiva maṃḍitaṃ kālaṃ vahnitrisvaraśobhitam ।।

ekatriṃśatimaṃ jñeyaṃ caturarṇṇaṃ padottamam ।
kuṃḍalāntaṃ vahniyutaṃ prāṇaṃ kālasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

dvisvarālaṃkṛtaṃ kṛtvā hayaṃ trisvarabhūṣitam ।
dvātriṃśaṃ tryakṣaramidaṃ padamatyuttamottamam ।।

mukhadāraṇayā yuktaṃ kālahaṃsaṃ sasaptamam ।
varuṇāntaṃ ca tadrūḍhaṃ vahnitrisvaramaṃḍitam ।।

trayastriṃśatimaṃ varṇṇaiścaturbhiḥ padamuttamam ।
tripadena samākrāṃtaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ samuddharet ।।

mukhadāraṇayā yuktaṃ punaḥ kālaṃ maheśvari ।
kṛṣāṇḍaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ catustriṃśaṃ padottamam ।।

tryakṣaraṃ sarvvabālānāṃ śāṃtidaṃ parameśvari ।
(79b)
vāruṇāṃ cāṣṭamākrāntaṃ ūṣmādyaṃ hayasaṃsthitam ।।

trisūryabhūṣitaṃ cāsyaṃ paṃcatriṃśatimapadam ।
trivarṇṇacitritaṃ śreṣṭhasarvvālakṣmīnisūdanam ।।

varuṇaṃ caiva vāhnaṃ ca mukhadāruṇayā yutau ।
haṃsaṃ trisūryakhacitaṃ tryakṣaraṃ paramaṃ padam ।।

ṣaṭtriṃśattapadame (ddhi) paramaṃ tava kīrttitam ।
vāyavyaṃ dvisvarākrāntaṃ kālaṃ tasya sthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

saptamākrāntamūrddhānaṃ tṛtīyādyaṃ punardadet ।
aśvaṃ marmasthitaṃ bhūyo kalaṃ śrītithisaṃsthitam ।।

kāntaṃ trisūryakhacitaṃ ṣaḍarṇṇaṃ padamuttamam ।
saptatriṃśatimaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvvaśatrukṣayaṃkaram ।।

asyāntaṃ punaru(ddhṛ)tya gaṇeśaṃ ca niṣedhakam ।
saptamākrāntaśirasaṃ vāyavyaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।
aṣṭātriṃśatimaṃ jñeyaṃ tryakṣaraṃ padamuttamam ।।

āṃbhasaṃ dvisvarākrāṃtaṃ vāhnaṃ śrītithibhūṣitam ।
hayatrisvarasaṃyuktaṃ tryakṣaraṃ padamuttamam ।।

catvāriṃśamekahīnaṃ tava (samyakpra)kāśitam ।
vāruṇaṃ dvisvarākrāntaṃ vāyavyaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

vāruṇaṃ vāyusaṃrūḍhaṃ saptamākrāntamastakam ।
catvāriṃśatimaṃ jñeyaṃ tryarṇṇaṃ padamidaṃ mahat ।।

yonipūrvvadvisvarāṅkaṃ śakraṃ kevalamuddharet ।
kālaṃ śrītithisaṃrūḍhaṃ kāṃtaṃ trisvaraśobhitam ।।

catvāriṃśaikasahitaṃ caturarṇṇaṃ padottamam ।
tṛtīyādyaṃ punardeyaṃ (padyamarma)sthitaṃ kuru ।।

praṇavena samākrāntaṃ vāyavyaṃ parameśvari ।
saptamākrā(tta)mūrddhānaṃ gaṇeṃdraṃ punaruddharet ।।

varuṇāntaṃ tatsthitaṃ ca bāhuṃ trisvaramaṃḍitam ।
ṣaḍakṣaraṃ padamidaṃ dvācatvāriṃśamaṃ smṛtam ।।
(80a)
punaryamaṃ kevalaṃ syā(dva)śaṃ dvisvaraśobhitam ।
yonipūrvvaṃ ca ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ tenaiva pravilāṃcchitau ।।

śakraṃ niṣedhaṃ ca tato trisvarākrāṃtamaulitau ।
tricatvāriṃśamaṃ jñeyaṃ ṣaḍarṇṇaṃ padamuttamam ।।

vāyavyaṃ kālapuruṣaṃ śūlaṃ tritayamuddharet ।
medyaṃ cāmṛtasaṃrūḍhaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ ca kevalam ।।

bāhuṃ dvisvaramū(ddhā)naṃ śakraṃ caiva niṣedhakam ।
trisvarālaṃkṛtau tau tu vesvarṇṇapadamuttamam ।।

catuścatvāriṃśatimaṃ tavākhyātaṃ yathārthataḥ ।
kālādyamaṣṭamākrāntaṃ bāhuṃ kevalamu(ddha)ret ।।

vāruṇaṃ saptamākrāntaṃ tadaṃtaṃ taṃca piṃḍitam ।
bāhuṃ trisūryamūrddhānaṃ catvāriṃśaṃ sapaṃcakam ।।

pañcārṇṇaṃ padametaddhi mahābhairavasiddhidam ।
tṛtīyādyaṃ tayo medyaṃ marmasthaṃ parameśvari ।।

punastameva yugalaṃ kiṃtvatyaṃ saptamāṃkitam ।
varuṇasthaṃ nadādyaṃ ca kṛṣāṇḍaṃ ttṛsvarāṃkitam ।।

ṣaḍakṣaraṃ padaṃ jñeyaṃ ṣaṭcatvāriṃśamaṃ mayā ।
punaḥ kālaṃ tathā haṃsaṃ mukhadāraṇayānvitam ।।

kālādyaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo vāhnaṃ kālānalasthitam ।
caṃdraṃ trisūryamūrddhānaṃ catvāriṃśaṃ sasaptamam ।।

paṃcārṇṇaṃ padametaddhi sarvvasiddhipradaṃ mahat ।
kālaṃ kevalamu(ddhṛ)tya haṃsaṃ dvisvarayojitam ।।

punaretatpadaṃ datvā saptasthaṃ yonipūrvvakam ।
paṃcamādyaṃ dvisvarāṃkaṃ niṣedhaṃ tatsthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

kālādyaṃ bhuvaneśaṃ ca medyaṃ trisvaraśobhitam ।
daśākṣaraṃ vasvadhikaṃ catvāriṃśaṃ padottamam ।।

amṛtaṃ proddharedbhūyo varuṇasthaṃ kṛṣāṇḍajam ।
vāyuṃ praṇavasaṃyuktaṃ gaṇeśaṃ trisvarāhatam ।।
(80b)
sapaṃcabiṃdukaṃ medyaṃ haṃsaṃ saptasvaraṃ sthitam ।
cāpāṃdyakevalaṃ bhūyo vāyavyaṃ dvisvarānvitam ।।

niṣedhaṃ kevaladeyaṃ tadā pādyasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
yonipūrvvaṃ punardeyaṃ vāhnaṃ trisvarabhūṣitam ।।

dvādaśākṣarametaddhi sarvvasiddhiphalapradam ।
ekāntaṃ paṃcāśatimaṃ padametadudāhṛtam ।।

dvijihvamaṃkuśākrāntaṃ varuṇasthaṃ maheśvari ।
śakramaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ punarādyaṃ niraṃkuśam ।।

śakraṃ trisūryamūrddhānaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ ca kevalam ।
varuṇaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ gaṇedraṃ vahnisaṃsthitam ।।

haṃsaṃ saptamamūrddhānaṃ aṣṭārṇṇaṃ padamuttamam ।
paṃcāśamaṃ sadā jñeyaṃ sarvvasaṃpatmukhāvaham ।।

catuṣkālaṃ tridhā deyaṃ kṣayaṃ vahnipuṭaṃ tathā ।
biṃduḍaṃbarasaṃyuktaṃ paṃcadhā bhīmamaṃkuśam ।।

ekā{daśā}kṣaraṃ dīptaṃ ekapaṃcāśamaṃ padam ।
kālaṃ punaḥ kevalaṃ syā(draṃ) saṃdvisvaramāsuram ।।

niṣedhaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ vāhnaṃ dvisvaramaulinam ।
niṣedhaṃ paṃcamādyasthaṃ vahnyārūḍhaṃ mahābalam ।।

tṛtīyādyaṃ kevalinaṃ vāhnaṃ kālaṃ ca sāṃkuśam ।
varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo niṣedhaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

cāpādyaṃ caivavā paṃcapiḍaṃsthau saptamāṃkitau ।
daśārṇṇaṃ padame[dhaṃpaṃyaṃ]taddhi dvipaṃcāśamasaṃsthitam ।।

punaḥ kālaṃ kevalaṃ syādvaṃsaṃ dvisvaramaulinam ।
kuṇḍalaṃ saptamāṅkaṃ ca yonipūrvvaṃ svapiṇḍitam ।।

aṃkuśenāhataṃ mūrddhnā kevalaṃ vahnijaṃ punaḥ ।
tamaṃkuśena saṃyuktaṃ varuṇaṃ ca niṣedhanam ।।

trisvarākrāntamūrddhānau padamaṣṭākṣaraṃ śvabham ।
(81a)
tripañcāmametaddhi sarvvamelāpakādhipam ।।

haṃsaṃ niṣedhavarṇṇau ca dvidhā kuryānmaheśvari ।
caturarṇṇaṃ padaṃ caitaccatuṣpaṃcāśamaṃ priye ।।

mahākrodha tathā mandaṃ kālaśrītithisaṃyutam ।
kāntaṃ trisūryamūrddhānaṃ caturarṇṇaṃ padottamam ।।

paṃcapaṃcāśamaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvvasaṃghaṭṭasiddhidam ।
dvijihvaṃ cāṃkuśaṃ vāpyaṃ piṇḍībhūtaṃ samuccaret ।।

śakramaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ niṣedhaṃ kevalaṃ tathā ।
niṣedhaṃ trisūryamūrddhānaṃ caturarṇṇe padottamam ।।

ṣa(ṭpaṃ)cāśamametaddhi sarvvasaṃdohalakṣaṇam ।
yonipūrvvaṃ punardeyaṃ kālaṃvakasapaṃcamam ।।

gaṇeṃdraṃ vahnisaṃrūḍhaṃ ḍambareṇa śirāhatam ।
vāruṇaṃ saptamākrāntaṃ saptapaṃcāśamaṃ padam ।।

caturarṇṇaṃ mahādīptaṃ trailokyaiśvaryadāyakam ।
vāruṇaṃ vāyusaṃrūḍhaṃ śirasāṃkuśabheditam ।।

śakraṃ kevalamuddhṛtya yonipūrvvaṃ sasaptamam ।
paṃcamādyaṃ kevalinaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ sapaṃcamam ।।

meghaṃ marmasthitaṃ bhūyo śakraṃ saptamabhūṣitam ।
aṣṭapaṃcāśamaṃ jñeyaṃ saptārṇṇaṃ padamuttamam ।।

punaḥ kālaṃ samuddhṛtya haṃsaṃ dvisvarabhūṣitam ।
kālādyaṃ turyamūrddhānaṃ kālaṃ saptamaśobhitam ।।

{caturarṇṇaṃ padaṃ proktaṃ ṣaṣṭhamekāntasaṃjñitam ।
asyaiva padarājasya pūrvvavarṇṇatrayaṃ punaḥ ।।

kālaṃ sāṃkuśamuddhṛtya śūlāntaṃ guṇasaṃsthitam ।}
cāpādyaṃ saptamākrāṃtaṃ ṣaḍarṇṇaṃ ṣaṣṭhimaṃ padam ।।

punareva trayaṃ cādyaṃ punaḥ kālaṃ ca kevalam ।
yonipūrvvaṃ savahniṃ ca praṇavena śirāhatam ।।

dvīpaṃ kevalamu(ddhṛ)tya śrītithisthaṃ tathāntakam ।
kāṃtaṃ saptamamūrddhānaṃ aṣṭārṇṇaṃ padamuttamam ।।

ekaṣaṣṭitamaṃ devi navasamyakprakāśitam ।
dvijihvaṃ varuṇārūḍhaṃ śakraṃ trisvaraśobhitam ।।
(81b)
paṃcamādyaṃ kevalinaṃ varuṇāntaṃ trisūryayuk ।
bāhuṃ sapraṇavaṃ caiva taṃ ca śrītithisaṃyutam ।।

vāruṇaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo yonipūrvvaṃ sasaptamam ।
paṃcamādyaṃ sthitaṃ kṛtvā vahnisthaṃ kārayettataḥ ।।

dviṣaṣṭimaṃ padaṃ devi aṣṭārṇṇaṃ sarvvasiddhidam ।
punaḥ kālaṃ samuddhṛtya prāṇaṃ dvisvaraśobhitam ।।

tṛtīyādyaṃ kevalinaṃ meghaṃ marmasthitaṃ kuru ।
aṃkuśākrāṃtamūrddhānaṃ tṛtīyādyaṃ punardadet ।।

kālaṃ śrītithisaṃrūḍhaṃ hayaṃ marmasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
saptamākrāntamūrddhānasaptārṇṇaṃ padamuttamam ।।

triṣaṣṭimaṃ mahāraudramanekāśvaryaṃsiddhidam ।
asyaiva devi yatpūrvvaṃ varṇṇānāṃ ca catuṣṭayam ।।

tamuddhṛtya caturthaṃ tu mukhadāraṇayānvitam ।
śakraṃ trisūryamūrddhānaṃ pañcārṇṇaṃ padamuttamam ।।

catuṣṣaṣṭitamaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvvasā(nti)ṣvakārakam ।
yonipūrvvatrisūryāṅkaṃ vāhnamaṃkuśasaṃyutam ।।

pañcamādyaṃ sapraṇavaṃ tṛtīyādyau supiṃḍitau ।
śrītithisthau tataḥ kāryau kālasthamamṛtādimam ।।

yonipūrvvaṃ dvisvarāṅkaṃ vāhnaṃ meghaṃ tatoddharet ।
trisūryakhacitau (tau) tu paṃcaṣaṣṭitamaṃ padam ।।

aṣṭākṣaraṃ mahādīptaṃ sukhasaubhāgyasiddhidam ।
haṃsaṃ somaṃ punarhaṃsaṃ punaḥ somaṃ samu(ddha)ret ।।

ṣaḍuttaraṃ ṣaṣṭitamaṃ tuyārṇṇaṃ padamuttamam ।
niṣedhaṃ saptamārūḍhaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ svapiṃḍitam ।।

padametadvidhā kāryaṃ caturarṇṇaṃ tu pūrvvavat ।
saptaṣaṣṭhimametaddhi tava devi prakāśitam ।।

punaḥ kālaṃ kevalinaṃ prāṇamaṃkuśaśobhitam ।
(82a)
paṃcamādyaṃ vahnirūḍhaṃ praṇavādhyavibhūṣitam ।।

idraṃ sapraṇavaṃ bhūyo yonipūrvvaṃ savāyukam ।
paṃcamādyaṃ savahniñca mukhadāraṇayā yutam ।।

amṛtaṃ ca niṣedhena yonipūrvvaṃ tatoddharet ।
vahniṃ trisvaramūrddhānaṃ daśārṇṇaṃ cāṣṭaṣaṣṭimam ।।

padametanmahābhāge tathoktaṃ sarvvakāmadam ।
asya pūrvvaṃ varṇṇayugaṃ punardevi samuddharet ।।

vahniṃ śrīgṛhasaṃrūḍhaṃ cāpaṃ trisvarasaṃyutam ।
vahniṃ ca varuṇaṃ devi pṛthakkevalinaṃ punaḥ ।।

amṛtaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ bhūyo somaṃ saptamasaṃsthitam ।
kālādyasthaṃ gaṇeśānaṃ praṇavākrāntamastakam ।।

dvijihvaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ niṣedhaṃ trisvarāhatam ।
ekādaśārṇṇamapadaṃ padamekonnasaptatam ।।

ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ trisvarāyītaṃ varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
padametadvidhā kāryaṃ turyāṇāṃ saptataṃ śubham ।।

punarvvaruṇamuddhṛtya kālaṃ punarapi priye ।
etaddvidhā samu(ddhṛ)tya turyārṇṇaṃ raikasaptati ।।

triśūlamaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ tu kevalam ।
vāyuṃ kevalamuddhṛtya padametaddvidhā kuru ।।

dvāsaptatimametacca caturarṇṇaṃ padottamam ।
kālaṃ śrīgṛhasaṃrūḍhaṃ tenaivākrāntamūrddhajam ।।

tṛtīyādyaṃ kevalinaṃ padametaddvidhā kuru ।
caturakṣarametaddvicatussaptatimaṃ padam ।।

varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ deyamiṃdraṃ gaṇapatisthitam ।
dvidhāpadamidaṃ kāryaṃ paṃcasaptatimaṃ padam ।।

caturakṣarametatsyāttrailokyāṃta(ka)śātanam ।
amṛtaṃ praṇavākrāṃtaṃ kuṃḍalasthaṃ samuddharet ।।

kevalaṃ caṃdramuddhṛtya dvidhā padamidaṃ kuru ।
ṣaṭsaptatimametaddhi caturakṣarakaṃ padam ।।
(82b)
gaṇeṃdraṃ kevalaṃ datvā dvijihvasthaṃ kṛśānujam ।
padametaddvidhā kāryaṃ turyārṇṇaṃ saptasaptatim ।।

śūlaṃ ṣaṣṭhasvaropetaṃ meghaṃ vahniśiroṃkitam ।
padametaddvidhākāryaṃ turyārṇṇaṃ cāṣṭasaptatim ।।

kālaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya haṃsaṃ nādasamanvitam ।
punaḥ kevalinaṃ kālaṃ cāpādyaṃ praṇavāṃkitam ।।

niṣedhaṃ kālasaṃrūḍhaṃ dīrghena śirasānvitam ।
punaścāpādimaṃ deyaṃ niṣedhaṃ trisvarāhatam ।।

eko(nna)śītimaṃ jñeyaṃ saptārṇṇampadamuttamam ।
varuṇāntaṃ kālarūḍhaṃ tamevāṃkuśasaṃ(yu)tam ।।

graṃthīśaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo vāruṇaṃ cāṃkuśāhatam ।
amṛtaṃ ca niṣedhaṃ ca trisvarākrāṃtamaulinau ।।

aśītimaṃ padaṃ jñeyaṃ ṣaḍarṇṇaṃ sarvvasiddhidam ।
punaḥ kālaṃ samuddhṛtya prāṇamaṃkuśabhūṣitam ।।

ṣaṣṭhādyamagnisaṃrūḍhaṃ agnivāsaśiroṃkitam ।
paṃcamādyaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ syādamṛtavāyusaṃsthitam ।।

kākavācādi vahniṃ ca śūlāntaṃ kasya saṃsthitam ।
trisvarākrāntamūrddhānameghaṃ tenaiva bhūṣitam ।।

ekāśīti prasaṃkhyātaṃ navārṇṇaṃ śobhanaṃ padam ।
haṃsaṃ caṃdraṃ punarhaṃsaṃ punaścaṃdraṃ samuddharet ।।

dvāśiticaturṇṇaṃ syātpadamāveśakārakam ।
varuṇāntaṃ paṃcamasthaṃ kuṃbhaṃ khādyasthitaṃ kuru ।।

kālaśrītithisaṃrūḍhaṃ kāntaṃ saptamasaṃsthitam ।
tryāśītaṃ caturarṇṇaṃ syātpadametanmahārthadam ।।

amṛtaṃ punaruddhṛtya vahnimādhyaṃ ca sāṃkuśaṃ ।
śrītithisthaṃ mahāvānaṃ cāpaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

tamevāṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ vāhnaṃ trisvarabhūṣitam ।
(83a)
asvate naiva sahitaṃ saptārṇṇaṃ padamuttamam ।।

caturāśītimaṃ devi sarvvasaṃpatpravarttakam ।
kevalaṃ kālamuddhṛtya prāṇamaṃkuśamaṃḍitam ।।

marmaṃ tenaiva sahitaṃ kālaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
trisvarālaṃkṛtaṃ vāhnaṃ paṃcāśītitamaṃ padam ।।

paṃcārṇṇaṃ devadeveśi mahāḍāmarasiddhidam ।
śrītithikevalaṃ deyaṃ ṣaṣṭhasthaṃ śākramuddharet ।।

yonipūrvvaṃ kevalinaṃ tṛtīyādyā dvitīyakam ।
paṃcamādyaṃ varṇṇirūḍhaṃ saptamenāṃkitaṃ tataḥ ।।

ṣaḍāśītitamaṃ jñeyaṃ padaṃ kāmaśarārṇṇikam ।
kuṇḍalāntaṃ saptamasthaṃ prāṇakevalamuddharet ।।

cāpādyaṃ mṛtyurādisthaṃ śrītithisthaṃ tataḥ kuru ।
dvijihvaṃ saptamāṃkaṃ syātturyavarṇṇaṃ padottamam ।।

saptāśītitaṃmaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvvadigvyomabhāsakam ।
punaḥ kālaṃ mahāprāṇamaṃkuśāhatamastakam ।।

varuṇaṃ vāyusahitaṃ dvitīyasvaramaulitam ।
tenaivāṃkaṃ tathā śā(kraṃ) śrītithisthaṃ samīraṇam ।।

kevalaṃ cāpamuddhṛtya kālaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
meghaṃ marmasthitaṃ kṛtvā trisūryeṇa śirohatam ।।

paṃcamādyaṃ kevalinaṃ varuṇāṃtaṃ ca kevalam ।
vāhnaṃ dvidhā samuddhṛtya prathamaṃ turyadīpitam ।।

dvitīyaṃ saptamākrāṃtaṃ aṣṭāśītipadottamam ।
dvādaśārṇṇaṃ mahāraudraṃ kulanāgeṃdrabhakṣakam ।।

nārāyaṇaṃ samuddhṛtya niṣedhaṃ saptamoha{na}m ।
yonipūrvvaṃ punardeyaṃ varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

yonipūrvvaṃ puṇyavṛddhivahnirūḍhaṃ sasaptamam ।
paṃcārṇṇamekonnavataṃ padatyūttamottamam ।।

varuṇaṃ vāyucakkrasthaṃ praṇavena śirohatam ।
(83b)
puruṣaṃ dvisvarākrāntaṃ somaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

graṃthīśaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ turyārṇṇaṃ padamuttamam ।
amuṃ navatiṃmajñeyaṃ cidvyomapravikāsakam ।।

asya pūrvvākṣaraṃ jñeyo padasyaiva samuddharet ।
kālaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya varuṇāṃtaṃ ca kevalam ।।

vāhnaṃ turyāṅkitaṃ mūrddhnā punaḥ kevalamuddharet ।
tṛtīyādyaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ syādagnitrisvarabhāsuram ।।

meghaṃ tenāṃkitaṃ bhūyo aṣṭārṇṇaṃ padamuttamam ।
etattadekamavataṃ samyagvīreśi kīrttitam ।।

kālaṃ samuddharedbhūyo prāṇamaṃkuśaśobhitam ।
a(mṛṃ)taṃ biṃdusaṃ(yuṃ)ktaṃ tṛtīyasvarabhūṣitam ।।

asya pūrvvaṃ punardeyaṃ sudhāsārañca kevalam ।
graṃthīśaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ ṣaḍarṇṇaṃ padamuttamam ।।

etat dvānavatitamaṃ saṃghaṭṭodaramadhyagam ।
asyaiva padarājasya pūrvvavarṇṇadvayaṃ punaḥ ।।

cāpādyaṃ biṃdusahitaṃ kṛtvā cānya yathoddharet ।
somādyamaṃkuśā(krā)taṃ caṃdrasthaṃ vāyusaṃsthitam ।।

yogipūrvvaṃ kevalinaṃ vāhnaṃ trisvarabhāsuram ।
śākraṃ saptamamūrddhānaṃ saptārṇṇaṃ padamuddhṛtam ।।

tryadhikaṃ navataṃ devi cakkreśatvaprasiddhidam ।
dvijihvaṃ varuṇārūḍhaṃ śira(śāṃ)kuśabhūṣitam ।।

idraṃ tenaivasahitaṃ saumaṃ vāyusthitaṃ punaḥ ।
kevalaṃ varuṇaṃ bhūyo yonipūrvvamathoṃkuśam ।।

vahnirūḍhaṃ saptamāṃkacaturṇṇavatimaṃ padam ।
paṃcārṇṇaṃ subhage khyātaṃ śivāsiddhipradāyakam ।।

punaryonyādimaṃ deyaṃ punarvvahniṃ ca kevalam ।
punaḥ śūlāntimaṃ devi yonipūrvvasthitaṃ dadet ।।

punaḥ kālaṃ paṃcamasthaṃ kāntaṃ trisvarabhāsuram ।
(84a)
paṃcārṇṇaṃ paṃcanavataṃ padametadudāhṛtam ।।

gaṇeṃdraṃ paṃcamaṃ bhūyo tatrasthaṃ devi kārayet ।
cāpādyaṃtasthitaṃ kṛtvā punavahnisthitaṃ kuru ।।

vahniṃ sapraṇavaṃ datvādamṛtādyaṃ ca kevalam ।
meghaṃ trisvaramūrddhānaṃ padaṃ ṣaṇṇāvataṃ bhavet ।।

paṃcārṇṇaṃ ghoravapuṣaṃ trailokyotsādanakṣamam ।
haṃsaṃ saptamasaṃrūḍhaṃ cāpādyaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

vāyavyamaṃkuśākrāntaṃ mahākālavakaṃcaḍam ।
ekatra kṛtvā deveśi proddharedvarṇṇanāyakam ।।

dvijihvaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo tṛtīyādyaṃ ca sāṃkuśam ।
vahniṃ megho trisvarāṃko padamaṣṭārṇṇamuttamam ।।

saptānavatimaṃ devi hṛtpadmapravikāsakam ।
punaścāmṛtamuddhṛtya vahniṃ varuṇasaṃsthitam ।।

kālādyaṃ ṣaṣṭhasahitaṃ pañcamādyañca kevalam ।
cāpādyañca tathā kālaṃ graṃthīśaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।।

saptārṇṇamaṣṭanavataṃ padametatprakīrttitam ।
punaḥ prāṇañca granthīśaṃ dvidhā caitatpadaṃ kuru ।।

caturarṇṇamidaṃ ghoraṃ navānavatimaṃ padam ।
mahākuṇḍalakuṃḍeśaṃ tridhā devi samuddharet ।।

mahākṛśānupuṭitaṃ biṃduḍaṃbarabhūṣitam ।
catuṣkalaṃ tato bhūyo paṃcadhā bhīmaśaṃkukam ।।

navākṣaraṃ padamidaṃ śatamaṃ parikīrttitam ।
sarvvamaṃtrottamaṃ sāraṃ sakṛdāveśakārakam ।।

paśuṃ punaḥ samuddhṛtya prāṇamaṃkuśasaṃyutam ।
yonipūrvvaṃ punardeyaṃ ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ cāṃkuśāhatam ।।

idraṃ tenāṃkitaṃ bhūyo amṛtaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
(84b)
niṣadhaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ somaṃ biṃdusamanvitam ।।

taṃ śarāntarasaṃrūḍhaṃ trisvarākrāṃtamūrddhajam ।
puṇyavṛddhisaptamākaṃ devaṃ cānucatuṣkalam ।।

bhīmaśaṃkuniruddhaṃ taddvādaśārṇṇaṃ padottamam ।
ekādhikaṃ śatamidaṃ padānāṃ tava kīrttitam ।।

asyaiva padarājasya yo pūrvvau tau samuddharet ।
praṇavaṃ varuṇaṃ vāyuṃ piḍīṃbhūtāḥ samuddharet ।।

kālamaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ kālabaṃdhu sapaṃcamam ।
dvijihvamaṃkuśākrāntaṃ amṛtaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

niṣedhaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo sabiṃdumamṛtaṃ punaḥ ।
amṛtaṃ trisvarāṃkaṃ ca cāpaṃ tu saśare sthitam ।।

paṃcamādyaṃ ca saptāṃkaṃ punardeyaṃ catuṣkalam ।
bhīmaśaṃkusamāyuktaṃ daśatrīṇyakṣarāṇi ca ।।

dvyadhikaṃ ca śataṃ proktaṃ padānāṃ te varānane ।
punaḥ pūrvvaṃ varṇṇayugaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ ca sāṃkuśam ।।

śakraṃ kevalamuddhṛtya sāṃkuśaṃ vāhnamuddharet ।
taraṃḍiṃ trisvarākrāṃtaṃ vahnisthaṃ coddharettataḥ ।।

catuṣkalaṃ bhīmaśaṃkuṃ padasyāṃte samuddharet ।
aṣṭārṇṇaṃ tryadhikaṃ proktaṃ padānāṃ śatamuttamam ।।

varuṇāntaṃ trisvarāṃkaṃ varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
cāpādyaṃ saptamākrāntaṃ prāṇaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

kiṃ tvaṃkuśasamāyuktaṃ cāpasthaṃ vāhnamuddharet ।
cāpaṃ trisvaramūrddhānavahnimeghau trisūryagau ।।

pūrvvāntimāvasya devi paryatte yojayetsakṛt ।
daśārṇṇaṃ padametadvicaturbhiradhikaṃ śatam ।।

paṃcadhā nādamuddhṛtya saptamena śirāṃkitam ।
cāpādyaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ graṃthīśaṃ kevalaṃ dadet ।।
(85a)
yonipūrvvaṃ tathā vāhnaṃ haṃsaṃ sārddhaṃ pṛthaksthitāḥ ।
amṛtaṃ vahnisaṃrūḍhaṃ varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ śrītithisthaṃ syādamṛtādyaṃ sasaptamam ।
pūrvvāṃtau punarapyantau padasyāsya prakalpayet ।।

saptādaśārṇṇaṃ vikhyātaṃ padametanmahārthadam ।
paṃcādhikamidaṃ proktaṃ śatametatsamāsataḥ ।।

tṛtīyaṃ pūrvvadeveśi punarapyatra dāpayet ।
cāpādyasthaṃ niṣedhaṃ ca vahnyārūḍhaṃ punaḥ kuru ।।

yonipūrvvaṃ sapraṇavaṃ cāṃdraṃ vāyusthitaṃ punaḥ ।
śrītithisthaṃ mahāvātaṃ pañcamādyaṃ ca sāṃkuśam ।।

biṃdunālaṃkṛtaṃ kṛtvā varuṇāntaṃ sapañcamam ।
graṃthīśaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ vahniṃ kālasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

śakraṃ saptamasaṃbhinnaṃ pūrvvāntau punareva hi ।
dvādaśārṇṇaṃ padamidaṃ śatametacchadruttaram ।।

ākhyātaṃ tava deveśi sarvvāpyāyakaraṃ śubham ।
kālabījaṃ kevalinaṃ nādaṃ nādasamanvitam ।।

ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ vahnisaṃrūḍhaṃ śakraṃ kevalamuddharet ।
vāyumaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ gaṇedraṃ graṃthisaṃsthitam ।।

tṛtīyasvaramūrddhānaṃ kṛtvā varuṇamuddharet ।
ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ śrītithisthaṃ syādamṛtādyaṃ sasaptamam ।।

pūrvvāntau punarapyaṃte padasyāsya samuddharet ।
ekādaśārṇṇamuddiṣṭaṃ padaṃ saptādhikaṃ tam ।।

paṃcamasthaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ tatsthaṃ bāhuṃ samuddharet ।
dvidhā varṇṇadvayaṃ kṛtvā punarādyāntimau kuru ।।

padasyānte maheśāni ṣaḍarṇṇaṃ padamuttamam ।
aṣṭādhikaṃ śatamidaṃ tavākhyātaṃ yathārthataḥ ।।
(85b)
ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ vahnisahitaṃ amṛtaṃ muṇḍalasthitam ।
śrītithisthaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā vahniṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

dvidhā padamidaṃ kāryaṃ punarnādaṃ tridhā kuru ।
vahnisaṃpuṭitaṃ devi ṣaṣṭhārūḍhaṃ sabiṃdukam ।।

kuṇḍalaṃ vahnipuṭitaṃ savisargaṃ samuddharet ।
bhīmaśaṃkuṃ tridhā pro(ktaṃ) padamātyarthadāruṇam ।।

trayodaśākṣaradīptaṃ navādhikaśataṃ smṛtam ।
kevalaṃ kālamuddhṛtya nādaṃ nādasamanvitam ।।

amṛtaṃ paṃcamādyasthaṃ vahnirāśyopari sthitam ।
vāhnaṃ dvisvaramūrddhānaṃ dvijihvasaptamāṃkitam ।।

varuṇaṃ varuṇāntaṃ ca piṃḍitau tau samuddharet ।
vahniṃ trisvaramūrddhānaṃ bhīmaśaṃkuṃ dvidhā punaḥ ।।

navārṇṇapadameta(ddhi) daśottaraśataṃ smṛtam ।
punaḥ kālaṃ saptamāṅkaśulaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

kālaṃ dvisvaramūrddhānaṃ śrakaṃ saptamalāṃcchitam ।
punaḥ kālaṃ kevalaṃ syānnādannādasamanvitam ।।

punaḥ kālaṃ nādabhinnaṃ vāyuṃ saptamasaṃyutam ।
catuṣkalaṃ bhūya eva bhīmaśaṃkumathoddhare ।।

daśārṇṇaṃ padame(tadvi) śatamekādaśādhikam ।
tavākhyātaṃ mayā su्bhru meghavigrahakārakam ।।

punaḥ kālaṃ nādabhinnaṃ vāyusaptamabheditam ।
varuṇaṃ ca tadantaṃ ca piṇḍabhūtau tataḥ kuru ।।

vahniṃ ca varuṇaṃ caiva trisvarālaṃkṛtau punaḥ ।
cāpādyaṃ vāta saṃrū{ḍhaṃ} śrītithisthaṃ tathaiva ca ।।

paṃcamādyaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ piṇḍitau samudāhṛtau ।
amṛtaṃ dīrghasahitaṃ anantaṃ saptamāhatam ।।

pūrvvāṃtau punarapyaṃte padasyāsya tathā kuru ।
(86a)
ekādaśārṇṇamatulaṃ dvādaśābhyadhikaṃ śatam ।।

kīrttitaṃ tava tatvaṃgi padametanmahābalam ।
anantaṃ punaruddhṛtya ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

punarvvāyuṃ kevalaṃ syāccāpādyaṃ śrītithisthitam ।
trisvarālaṃkṛtaṃvahniṃ paṃcamādyaṃ ca sāṃkuśam ।।

biṃdubhinnaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā pūrvvāntau punaruddharet ।
trayodaśādhikaśataṃmaṣṭārṇṇaṃ padamuddhṛtam ।।

kālādyaṃ punarevaṃha turyāṃkaṃ devi dāpayet ।
saptamāṃkaṃ paśuṃ bhūyo nādaṃ vāyuṃ sasaptamam ।।

nādaṃ trisvarasaṃyuktaṃ asyāṃdyaṃ padaruddharet ।
punarnādaṃ trisvarāṃkaṃ devaṃ bhūyo catuṣkalam ।।

yonipūrvvaṃ vahnirūḍhaṃ punaḥ ṣaṣṭhasthitaṃ kuru ।
biṃdubhinnaṃ mahābījaṃ bhīmaśaṃku tridhā punaḥ ।।

ekādaśārṇṇamākhyātaṃ trayodaśayutaṃ śatam ।
padānāṃ devadeveṃdraṃ vaṃdate tava sāṃpratam ।।

anaṃnādyaṃ vahnirūḍhaṃ binduḍaṃbaralāñchitam ।
kālaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya nādaṃ nādasamanvitam ।।

tṛtīyapūrvvaṃ deveśi datvā meghaṃ samuddharet ।
marmārūḍhaṃ devadevi vāyuṃ praṇavaśobhitam ।।

gaṇeśaṃ vahniveśmāṅkaṃ varuṇādyaṃ ca tena yuk ।
vahniṃ tripurasaṃbhinnaṃ devaṃ bhūyo *tuṣkalam ।।

paṃcadhā bhīmaśaṃkuṃ ca punardevaṃ catuṣkalam ।
ṣoḍaśākṣarametaddhi padamatyuttamottamam ।।

catudaśādhikaśataṃ tavākhyātaṃ yathārthataḥ ।
punaḥ kālaṃ samuddhṛtya haṃsaṃ nādasamanvitam ।।

kālādyaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo somakālasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
praṇavākrāṃtamūrddhānaṃ kapādyaṃ cāpasaṃsthitam ।।

kālāgnirudraṃ saṃrūḍhaṃ śukraṃ dvisvarasaṃyutam ।
paṃcamādyaṃ kevalaṃ syādvaruṇāntaṃ ca kevalam ।।

vahniṃ turyasvarākrātaṃ punaraṃkuśasaṃyutam ।
śūlāntaṃ gaṇasaṃrūḍhaṃ saptamākrā - - - - m ।।
(86b)
ekādaśārṇṇamuddiṣṭaṃ śataṃ pañcadaśādhikam ।
padametatsamākhyātaṃ sarvvasaṃpatprakāśakam ।।

paṃcādyaṃ vahnisahitaṃ ekārākrāntamastakam ।
indraṃ praṇavasobhāḍhyaṃ yonipūrvvasavāyukam ।।

mamaṃmaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ kevalaṃ kālamu(ddha)ret ।
vahniṃ saptamasaṃyuktaṃ varuṇasthaṃ tadādimam ।।

trisvarālaṃkṛtaṃkāryaṃ vahniṃ suravarārcite ।
aṣṭākṣaraṃ padaṃ dīptaṃ śataṃ vai ṣoḍaśādhikam ।।

punaḥ kālaṃ kevalinaṃ nādaṃ nādasamanvitam ।
graṃthīśaṃ caiva vahni ca yonipūrvvaṃ ca kevalam ।।

ṣaṣṭhādyamaṃkuśākrāntaṃ tadvadiṃdrasamuddharet ।
niṣedhaṃ paṃcamādyasthaṃ vahnicakkroparisthitam ।।

ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ ṣaṣṭhasahitaṃ vahniṃ trisvaraśobhitam ।
kevalaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ syādanantaṃ tacca tadva(hi) ।।

dvijihvamaṃkuśākrāntaṃ somaṃ ca varuṇaṃ pṛthak ।
punaḥ ṣaṣṭhādimaṃ caiva saptamāruḍhamuddharet ।।

saptamāṃkaṃ mahāvātaṃ padamatyuntamu{tta}m ।
aṣṭādaśārṇṇaṃ matulaṃ saptādhikaśataṃśatam ।।

tasmātpadādvitīyaṃ syādādyaṃ tasmātrayaṃ punaḥ ।
uddhareddevadeveśi asmiṃ padavare śubhe ।।

gaṇendraṃ vahnisaṃrūḍhaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ devi proddharet ।
kevalaṃ cāmṛtaṃ bhūyo punaḥ śūlaṃ samuddharet ।।

amṛtaṃ kālasaṃrūḍhaṃ vahniṃ trisvarabhāsuram ।
aṣṭārṇṇapadametattacchatamaṣṭādaśottaram ।।

punaḥ kālaṃ kevalinaṃ nādaṃ trisvarabhāsuram ।
amṛtādyaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ syādamṛtaṃ ca niṣedhakam ।।

yonipūrvvaṃ śrītithisthaṃ kālaṃ tatpūrvvasthe sthitam ।
(87a)
turyāṃkitaṃ mahābījaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ vahnimuddharet ।।

śūlāntaṃ praṇavākrāṃtaṃ gaṇeśasyoparisthitam ।
ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo varuṇaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।।

amṛtādyaṃ candrarūḍhaṃ varuṇāntañca kevalam ।
vāhnaṃ turyāsvarākrāṃtaṃ tañca saptamasaṃyutam ।।

daśapaṃcākṣaramidaṃ śatamekonaviṃśamam ।
ākhyātampadarājānaṃ mahābalaparākramam ।।

punaḥ kālaṃ samuddhṛtya nādaṃ nādasamanvitam ।
nārāyaṇaṃ punardeyaṃ śūlaṃ praṇavasaṃyutam ।।

saptamā(ṅkaṃ) mahāvahniṃ varuṇaṃ cāntabhūṣitam ।
punarvvahnitṛtīyāṃkaṃ saptākṣaramidaṃ padam ।।

viṃśādhikaṃ śatamidaṃ tavākhyātaṃ yathārthataḥ ।
paṃcādyaṃ varuṇārūḍhaṃ biṃdunāhatamastakam ।।

viśeṣaṃ turyamūrddhānaṃ śakraṃ kevalamuddharet ।
varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ vāhnamaṃkuśabheditam ।।

haṃsaṃ saptamasaṃyuktaṃ ṣaṭvarṇṇapadamuddharet ।
ekaviṃśādhikaśataṃ padānāṃ tava kīrttitam ।।

paśuṃ samuddharedbhūyo nādaṃ nādenabheditam ।
śūlaṃ praṇavasaṃbhinnaṃ vahniṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

cāpādyaṃ biṃdusahitaṃ amṛtādyaṃ ca sāṃkuśam ।
caṃdrāgnirūḍhaṃ kurvvīta yonipūrvvañca kevalam ।।

śāṃkuśaṃ vahnimuddhṛtya śakraṃ kevalamuddharet ।
varuṇaṃ caiva cāpādyaṃ proddhare kevalaṃ tataḥ ।।

niṣedhaṃ saptamākrāntaṃ dvādaśārṇṇamidaṃ padam ।
dvāviṃśottarametatsyācchataṃ suravarārcite ।।
(87b)
punarnādaṃ kevalinaṃ vāyuṃ praṇavasaṃyutam ।
kevalaṃ gaṇarājānaṃ dvijihvaṃ kevalaṃ tathā ।।

vahniṃ sāṃkuśamuddhṛtya somaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
kālādyamaṃkuśākrāṃtanniṣedhaṃ ca dvidhoddharet ।।

antimaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ navārṇṇaṃ padamuddhṛtam ।
śataṃ trayoviṃśatibhiryuktametadudāhṛtam ।।

punaḥ kālaṃ samuddhṛtya nādaṃ nādasamanvitam ।
ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ tenāṃkaṃ varuṇāntimam ।।

sāṃkuśa paṃcamādyaṃ syādamṛtaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
punarvvaruṇamuddhṛtya kālaṃ kevalinaṃ punaḥ ।।

paṃcamādyaṃ piṇḍabhūtaṃ saptamasvaramaulinam ।
navārṇṇaṃ padametatsyāśccaturvviṃśadhikaṃ śatam ।।

haṃsaṃ niṣedhamuddhṛtya punareva dvidhā kuru ।
caturakṣarametaddhi paṃcaviṃśādhikaṃ śatam ।।

haṃsaṃ niṣedhamuddhṛtya punareva dvidhā kuru ।
caturakṣarametaddhi paṃcaviṃśādhikaṃ śatam ।।

padānāṃ devadeveśi tavākhyātaṃ yathārthataḥ ।
catuṣkalaṃ punardeyaṃ tṛtīyādyaṃ punastathā ।।

meghaṃ marmasthitaṃ kuryyātyāgaṃ paṃcamabhūṣitam ।
tṛtīyādyaṃ kharpareśaṃ paṃcārṇṇaṃ padamuttamam ।।

ṣaḍviṃśatimametaddhi śatottaramudāhṛtam ।
punaścadraṃ devadevi vahniṃ varuṇasaṃsthitam ।।

vāyuṃ sapraṇavaṃ deyaṃ (gaṇeṃdrogni)kṣapāntayuk ।
vāruṇāṃtaṃtatsthitaṃ syādvahniṃ trisvarabhāsuram ।।

ṣaḍakṣaramidaṃ jñeyaṃ saptāviṃśaṃśatottaram ।
padaṃ mahāsiddhi - ca bhogamokṣaphalapradam ।।
(88a)
punaḥ kālaṃ devadevi nādaṃ nādasamanvitam ।
kālaṃ tenaiva sahitaṃ tena yuktaṃ samīraṇam ।।

praṇavena yutaṃ śūlaṃ vahniṃ kevalamuddharet ।
taṃ ca ṣaṣṭhayutaṃ bhūyo ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ trisvarānvitam ।।

meghaṃ tenaiva sahitaṃ navārṇṇapadamuttamam ।
aṣṭāviṃśādhikaśataṃ tava devi prakāśitam ।।

ḍambaraṃ punarudvṛtya kālaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
nādaṃ nādena sahitaṃ tripūrvvaṃ punaruddharet ।।

meghaṃ marmasthitaṃ deyaṃ vāyuṃ praṇavabhūṣitam ।
gaṇeśama(gni)veśmāṃkaṃ varuṇaṃ svāntasaṃsthitam ।।

agniṃ tribiṃdukhacitaṃ kṛtvā naramathoddharet ।
sūryaṃ cāpaṃ tamevātra saśaraṃ tritayaṃ punaḥ ।।

biṃduḍaṃbaravahnībhirbhūṣitaṃ tatkuru priye ।
paṃcadhā bhīmaṃ kuṃ{śaṃ} ca deyaṃ paramapūjite ।।

ekāntatriṃśadadhikaṃ padānāṃ śatamuddhṛtam ।
saptādaśārṇṇaṃ paramaṃ pradhānaṃ padamuttamam ।।

somādyaṃ praṇavākrāṃtaṃ marmmaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
varuṇāṃtaṃ samuddhṛtya yonipūrvvaṃ ca kevalam ।।

indramaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ niṣedhaṃ paṃcamātritam ।
varuṇaṃ nādasahitaṃ somaṃ trisvarabhāsuram ।।

niṣedhaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ navārṇṇapadamuttamam ।।
triṃśādhikaṃ śatamidaṃ tava devi prakāśitam ।।

haṃsaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya yonipūrvvaṃ ca sāṃkuśam ।
vahniṃ tenaiva sahitaṃ cāpasthavahnimuddharet ।।

śirasāṃkuśasaṃbhinnakevalaṃ punaruddharet ।
tṛtīyādyaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ syādvahniṃ trisvarabhāsuram ।।
(88b)
aśvaṃ tenaiva saṃyuktaṃmaṣṭārṇṇaṃ padamuttamam ।
ekatriṃśādhikaśataṃ padānāṃ tava kīrttitam ।।

varuṇaṃ trisvarākrāṃntaṃ tatsthaṃ tasyāntamuddharet ।
niṣedhaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ śakraṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

saptamāṃkaṃ mahāvāyuṃ varṇṇapaṃca * bhūṣitam ।
dvātriṃśadadhikaṃ proktaṃ śatametatpadottamam ।।

punarvvaruṇamuddhṛtya trisvarākrāntamaulinam ।
varuṇaṃsthaṃ ca tasyāntaṃ * * * * varṇṇamuddharet ।।

gaṇeṃdraṃ vahnisahitaṃ akuśena śirāhatam ।
amṛtaṃ cāṣṭamākrāntaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ samuddharet ।।

triśūlaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ somaṃ kālasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
trisvarāṃkaṃ mahāvahniṃ aṣṭākṣaramidaṃ padam ।।

trayastriṃśādhikaśataṃ padānāmidamuddhṛtam ।
caturddhā marmamuddhṛtya kālaṃ vāhnaṃ ca kevalam ।।

mukhadāraṇayā yuktaṃ varuṇaṃ proddharettataḥ ।
cāpādyaṃ vāyusaṃrūḍhaṃ ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ saptamasthitam ।।

saptamāṃkaṃ mahāvātaṃ daśārṇṇaṃ padamuttamam ।
catustriṃśadhikaśataṃ sarvvontamamidaṃ śubham ।।

kevalaṃ kālamudvṛtya haṃsaṃ dvisvarabhūṣitam ।
yonipūrvvaṃ tathā śakraṃ tenaivāṃkaṃ samuddharet ।।

amṛtaṃ biṃdukhacitaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ ca kevalam ।
amṛtādyasthitavahniṃ meghaṃ trisvararāsuram ।।

aṣṭārṇṇapadametaddhi paṃcatriṃśādhikaṃ śatam ।
padānāṃ tava cākhyātaṃ sarvvasaṃpatphalapradam ।।

punaścaṃdraṃ samuddhṛtya varuṇasthaṃ kṛṣāṇukam ।
(89a)
varuṇaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ cāpādyaṃ vāyusaṃsthitam ।।

aṃkuśena śirākrāntaṃ niṣedhaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।
indraṃ kevalamuddhṛtya vā(yuṃ) saptamabhūṣitam ।।

saptākṣaraṃ padamidaṃ ṣaṭtriṃśadadhikaṃ śatam ।
sarvvavidyāgragaṃ proktaṃ padametanmahābalam ।।

sarvvādyaṃ punaruddhṛtya kālaṃ praṇavasaṃyutam ।
śūlaṃ saptamasaṃyuktaṃ tryakṣaraṃ padamuddharet ।।

saptatriṃśādhika * taṃ tavākhyātaṃ yathārthataḥ ।
sarvvādimaṃ punadeyaṃ ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

aṃkuśākrāṃtamūrddhānaṃ vahniṃ devi samuddharet ।
dvijihvaṃ trisvarākrāṃtaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ sasaptakam ।।

paṃcākṣaraṃ padamidaṃ aṣṭātriṃśādhikaṃ śatam ।
tavākhyāṃtaṃ sureśāni sarvvakāmaphalapradam ।।

amṛtaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo vahniṃ varuṇasaṃsthitam ।
kālamaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ paṃcādyaṃ saptamasthitam ।।

kālaṃ śrītithisaṃrūḍhaṃ kāṃtaṃ saptamabhūṣitam ।
ṣaḍakṣaraṃ padamidaṃ catvāriṃśaikahīnakam ।।

śatametatsamākhyātaṃ sarvvamātreśipūjitaṃ ।
kālaṃ kevalamudvṛtya haṃsamaṃkuśasaṃyutam ।।

niṣedhaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ taṃ ca cāpādyasaṃsthitam ।
dvijihvaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ niṣedhaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

taṃ tṛtīya svarākrāṃtaṃ saptākṣaramidaṃ padam ।
catvāriṃśāṃdhikaśataṃ sarvvasiddhiphalodayam ।।

sarvvapūrvvaṃ punarddeyaṃ kālaṃ saptamasaṃsthitam ।
paṃcamādyaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ syānniṣedhaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

taṃ cāpādyaṃ (sthi)te bhūyo somaṃ vahnisthitaṃ punaḥ ।
(89b)
varuṇaṃ saptamākrāṃtaṃ saptākṣaramidaṃ śubham ।।

catvāriṃśaikasaṃyuktaṃ śatametadudāhṛtam ।
niṣedhaṃ trisvarākrāṃtaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ savāyukam ।।

saptamena śi{rā}krāṃtaṃ dvyakṣaraṃ padamuddhṛtam ।
dvācatvāriṃśadadhikaṃ padametatsamuddhṛtam ।।

niṣedhaṃ trisvarāṅkaṃ syātpaṃcamādyaṃ savāyukam ।
kalādyaṃ praṇavāṃkaṃ ca gaṇeśaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

paṃcamādyaṃ saptamasthaṃ vāyuṃ saptamabhūṣitam ।
ṣaḍakṣaraṃ padamidaṃ tricatvāriṃśatiryutam ।।

śatametatsamākhyātaṃ sarvvakāmaphalapradam ।
ḍaṃbaraṃ punaruddhṛtya kāmeśaṃ punaruddharet ।।

dvijihvaṃ bhairavārūḍhaṃ tejasā saṃpuṭīkṛtam ।
biṃduḍaṃbarasaṃyuktaṃ piṃḍaṃ sūryyāyutopamam ।।

anantaṃ vahnipuṭitaṃ kālāgnisthaṃ sabiṃdukam ।
kālāgniṃ vahnipuṭitaṃ ajīvakaṭisaṃsthitam ।।

punastaṃ bhīmaśaṃkuṃ ca caturddhā devi dāpayet ।
amṛtaṃ varuṇārūḍhaṃmaṃkuśākrāṃtamastakam ।।

nādaṃ nādena saṃbhinnaṃ varṇṇametatsamuddharet ।
ekādaśārṇṇadeveśi padametanmahārthadam ।।

sarvvasiddhipradaṃ sāraṃ mahāmelāpasiddhidam ।
śatametatsamākhyātaṃ padānāṃ varavarṇṇini ।।

catvāriṃśatsamadhikaṃ caturbhicca maheśvari ।
eṣāṃ vidyā samākhyātā padānāṃ varavarṇṇini ।।

catvāriṃśatsamadhikaṃ paṃcabhiśca śataṃ matam ।
vidyādau devadeveśi dīpanārthaṃ padaṃ dadet ।।

namo rudrāya sahitaṃ praṇavādyaṃ mahābalam ।
(90a)
evaṃ vidyā samākhyātā akṣarāṇāṃ sahasrakam ।।

samaṃ suravareśāni nādhikaṃ naivajanakam ।
eṣā vidyā samākhyātā * * cakkreśvarī parā ।।

sarvvapāpapraśamanī sarvvaduṣkṛtanāśanī ।
sarvvāpadapraśamanī duritaughanikṛntanī ।।

sarvvamaṃtreśvareśānī sarvvamātrigaṇārcitā ।
sarvvabhairavacakkreśī sarvvarudragaṇeśvarī ।।

sarvvaduṣṭaprasamanī bhūtavetāla{ma}rdanī ।
sarvvamelāpacakkreśī sarvvasampatpradāyikā ।।

sarvvavighnaughadalanī sarvvanāgaprabhakṣaṇī ।
sarvvasaṃghātadarpaghnī sarvvacakkravikāsinī ।।

sarvvanāḍimukhāntasthā hṛtpadmapravikāsinī ।
sarvvavetālanamitā sarvvayoginivanditā ।।

hatvā brahmāṃḍamakhilaṃ brāhmaṇaiḥ paripūritaṃ ।
na sa pāpena lipyeta yasyaiṣā hṛdayasthitā ।।

guruhā mātrihā caiva bhrūṇahā pitṛghātakaḥ ।
sakṛdāvartya śuddhyeta vidyā ghoraparākramā ।।

liṃgotpāṭādikā(tpā)pātrāśayetsmaraṇena tu ।
sakṛdāvartya deveśī sarvvapāpervviśuddhyati ।।

adīkṣito dīkṣitaḥ syādasamayī samayītaṃ prā ।
anabhiṣiktobhiṣiktaḥ syātsarvvamaṃḍalamadhyataḥ ।।

sarvvacīrṇṇavrato devi sādhakeṃdro bhavatyasau ।
na tadasti na yatsiddhye vidyeśvaryāḥ prasādataḥ ।।

maṃtralakṣmī smṛtā seyaṃ vidyālakṣmīti śa(bdyā)te ।
cakkreśalakṣmī vijñeyā mudrālakṣmī smṛtā tathā ।।

maṃḍalākhyā tathā lakṣmī tathā bhairavalakṣmikā ।
(90b)
siddhalakṣmī devalakṣmī lakṣmīvidyādhareśvarī ।।

mahāsureṃdralakṣmī ca tathā rāvaṇalakṣmikā ।
matalakṣmī samākhyātā tatra lakṣmī prakīrttitā ।।

atimārgamahālakṣmī kulalakṣmī prakīrttitā ।
kauleśvarī kaulalakṣmī nityālakṣmī jayapradā ।।

viśvalakṣmī samākhyātā vidyā ghoraparākrama ।
ekavīrāṅgarahitā mahātaṃtravivarjitā ।।

nāsyāḥ śaktomi deveśi vaktuṃ guṇakadambakam ।
sādākhyorvvatsaraśatairvvaktrāṇāmayutairapi ।।

ityākhyātā vidyā varṇṇasahasreṇa sarvvagā siddhā ।
aṃgavrataparihīnā kima * ramihate vadāsyāśu ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe caturvviṃśatisāhasre śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
matacakkreśvarī vidhau maṃtroddhāraekādaśamaḥ paṭalaḥ ।।

devyuvāca ।।

kṛtakṛtyāsmi vīreṃdraṃ śrutvā vidyāṃ durāsadām ।
adhunā śrotumicchāmi dhyānamasyāḥ sureśvara ।।

yathā vā parivārosyāstathā me brūhi bhairava ।
yena niḥsaṃśayā jāyeddevadevyā vidho hara ।।

kathaṃ vā vyaktimāyāti dhyātā sādhakasattamaiḥ ।
vyaktā satī karotyeṣā vada (kiṃ) suranāyaka ।।

sarvvametada - ṣeṇa sarvvāsurasurārcita ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

nirdvaṃdvaṃ sthānamā{sā}dya dṛḍhaṃ cittassamāhitaḥ ।
sukhāsanopaviṣṭastu madirānandananditaḥ ।।
(91a)
dūtiyuktaḥ prasannātmā sarvvābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ ।
sudhūpitaḥ sutāṃbūlo vī(rā)cārarataḥ sadā ।।

kuṇḍagolau pramathaiva gṛhyānaṃdodbhavaṃ rasam ।
tatpaṃcaratnasaṃyuktaṃ kṛtvaiva tanumadhyame ।।

prāpyavīro mahābhogī śaktimacchaktivigraha ।
hṛtku(śa)śayamadhyasthā bodhyatāṃ pararūpiṇīm ।।

vyaktāṃ dhyāyettadā devīṃ jagadgrāsaikaghasmarām ।
kākakokilavaṇṇābhāṃ śrīkaṃṭhagalasannibhāṃ ।।

kuṃbhīramahiṣāruḍhāṃ bhujāṣṭādaśamaṃḍitām ।
paṃcavaktrāṃ virupākṣāṃ sarpagonāsamaṃḍitām ।।

ekaṃ vaktraṃ viśālākṣi kṛṣaṃ ghoraṃ karālinaṃ ।
hayavaktraṃ ūrddhavaktraṃ gajavaktraṃ ca dakṣiṇam ।।

rāsabhākhyaṃ smṛtaṃ vāmaṃ kroṣṭravaktraṃ ca paścimam ।
ghoranīradanihrādarāvinīṃ cintayetsadā ।।

siroruhorddhavikṣepakṣamitāśeṣadikkulām ।
sarvvāyudhakaravyagraṃ ghoradarśanabhāsurām ।।

khaḍgakheṭakakhaṭvāṃṅgaśūlapaṭṭisadhāriṇīm ।
pāśāṃkuśakapālograghaṃṭāvādanatatparām ।।

muṃḍapadmamahāvīṇāvādanaikavinoditām ।
jagadraktāsavonmattaghoratāṇḍavadussahām ।।

sarvvalokeśvareśānaśiroracitaśekharām ।
tatveśvaraśirohastacaraṇāṃtasragujjvalām ।।

kāraṇeśvarakaṃkālakṛtāpīḍāṃ bhayānakām ।
kulālīviṣamaprotakunapāpīṃḍabhūṣaṇām ।।

ghorarāvamahārāvacitrāsitabhavāṃḍakām ।
kalpakṣayamahāvahnisphutarāśīśatolvaṇām ।।
(91b)
brahmakaṃdalasa{taḥ} krīḍākaṃdukaikavinoditām ।
gaṃbhīradhānaṭāṃkāraviṭaṃkīkṛtadiggajām ।।

śeṣāhīṃdraphaṇasphāraviṣacarvvaṇalampaṭām ।
jaganmātaṃgasatkṛttivirājitakaṭītaṭām ।।

ghorolūkamahācchatradhāriṇīṃ ghoradaṃturām ।
bhūtavetālasaṃghātadantatālaśatākulām ।।

visphura{t}ghoranistriṃśanetrakuṃḍavirājitām ।
vasatkalpāntaghorāgnijvālājaṭilavigrahām ।।

surāsuramahāmāṃsavarvvaṇaikakṛtodyamām ।
sa(ṅka)rṣaṇamahāsiṃhasarvvakarṇṇāvalaṃbinīm ।।

kṣayamārttaṇḍalakṣaughamuṇḍabhāsuravigrahām ।
siṃhagonāsasadvaktraghorastanapi laṃbinīm ।।

narāṃtrāpūritamukhīṃ kuliśāśanimaṃḍitām ।
sitahāreṃduśubhrābhrarūpāmatha vicintayet ।।

sitapadmāsanagatāṃ sitasragdāmabhāsurām ।
viśvarūpāṃ viśālākṣīṃ sarvvābharaṇabhūṣitām ।।

mahāpretasamārūḍhāṃ anekabhujamaṃḍitām ।
anekavaktranayanāṃ anekacaranojvalām ।।

anekasurasiddhaughavaṃditāṃ vīramālitām ।
yathābhimatarūpāṃ vā cintayet parameśvarīm ।।

evaṃvidhāṃ śāntikarīṃ tathā puṣṭikarīṃ śubhām ।
jātihiṃgulakaprakhyāvaśyākarṣāṃ vicittayet ।।

māraṇe kṛṣṇeva puṃṣā ghoranīhārasaṃnibhāṃ ।
dhūmavarṇṇā maheśāni uccāṭe cintayet sadā ।।

stambhane drutahemābhāṃ stobhane raktakṛṣṇikām ।
(92a)
mohane śukapicchābhāṃ vidveṣe cāṣasannibhām ।।

antarddhāne pūrvvarūpā sarvvakarmakarī śivām ।
evaṃ dhyānaṃ samākhyātamekavīrā vidhau sadā ।।

yaṃ dhyātvā naiva śocaṃti sasāre jantavo bhṛṣam ।
atha devya imā bhadre tadrūpāḥ śṛṇu sāṃpratam ।।

yathā sūryasya raśmaughamavibhiktaṃ virājīte ।
tadvaccābhinnamevātra devatāvṛṃdamāsthitam ।।

rudrāṇī ca tathā caṇḍā tathānyā jvalitānanā ।
jvālājihvodarā cānyā bhīmānyā parikīrttitā ।।

mahābhīṣaṇasaṃjñānyā tathā laṃbodarīti ca ।
viśvāṃtakī tathā cānyā kālagrāsaratā'parī ।।

kālasūdanināmānyā hāhāhāsinīkāparā ।
mahābhairavanāmā ca śmaśānavasanā parā ।।

tathā caṃdramukhī cānyā caṃḍayogeśvarīparā ।
phaṭkāriṇī mahāghorā tathā phaṭṭabharūṭikā ।।

mahārāvinināmā ca haṃsinī ca tathāparā ।
grāhiṇī māraṇī cānyā mohanī ca tathāparā ।।

khādikā ca tathā cānyā vidrāvaṇi tathāparā ।
jīhikā cāparā proktā bhairavotsaṃgavāsinī ।।

mahāmāṃsāśinā cānyā tudanī ca tathāparā 12 ।
truṭanī ca tathā cānyā mahākālī tathāparā ।।

pāśadaṇḍadharī cānyā khorvvārī cāparā smṛtā ।
mahāmārī tathā cānyā brahmāṇītha maheśvarī ।।

kaumārī vaiṣṇavī caiva vārāhī yamadaṃḍinī ।
āgneyī vāruṇī caiva vāyavyā kālacakrikā ।।
(92b)
yogeśvarī tathā cānyā mahākāpālinī parā ।
yamaghaṃṭā bhairaveśī caṃḍeśītha bharūṭikā ।।

kṛtāntabhakṣaṇī cānyā hṛdayānaṃdinī parā ।
jvālājvalitadehānyā huṃkārī cāparā smṛtā ।।

narāṃtravalitā cānyā tathā phetkārarāviṇī ।
hananī kuṇḍava(ktrā) ca jvālānali tathā parā ।।

kaṃbugrīvā tathā cānyā vyālakuṇḍalamaṇḍitā ।
mahābhīmā tathā cānyā mahābhīmāṃgadāparā ।।

bhīmā krodhamukhā cānyā śirojvalitacandrikā ।
cāmuṃḍā caiva caṇḍālī kirītācchuṣmakāriṇī ।
hasanī bhṛttanī cānyā trailokyatrāsanī parā ।।

rudhirāsṛgvasābhojī pivanī vamanī tathā ।
ghātanī khecarī cānyā vallanī sphāṭanī parā ।।

[garjanī] ghūrṇṇanī cānyā madonmādanikāparā ।
śmaśānavāsinī cānyā mahīprītakaraṃkiṇī ।।

suhāsā kṛśavaktrā ca sarvvāyudhadharī tathā ।
mahāḍamarikā cānyā ulūkā(ya)jinīparā ।।

bṛhadbhujā mahāvyālā anekāmanikāparā ।
vyomāsanā vyomadehā mahāsiṃhānanī parā ।
mahādaṣṭrātha jvālābhyā karaṃkamukhikāparā ।।

gṛddharoṣaṇikā cānyā hṛdayāṃbujacāriṇī ।
sarvvabhūtadamā cānyā hanahaṃkāriṇīstathā ।।

kapālāsanasaṃsthānyā mahāvyomāṃbujāsanā ।
kālarātrī tathā cānyā śivadehārddhadhāriṇī ।।

sahasravapuṣā ।। 32 cānyā caṃdrakoṭyayutaprabhā ।
(93a)
praṇayāgnivapuścānyā(na)nurūpā tathāparā ।।

prasphurātha mahāghorā astrarājeśvarī parā ।
meghamālā mahāmāyā tathāvidyu(tha)yakṣikā ।।

duritakṣaparī cānyā tathā bhīmakaraṃkiṇī ।
cā{tre}śīlasmagātrā ca tathā trailokyaḍāmarā ।
raktāsavapriyā cānyā trailokyagrāsaghasmaraṃ ।।

mahiṣāsanasthitā cānyā mahāghoreśvarī parā ।
tathā nīlavarāhā ca karālavadanā parā ।
hayānanā gajāsyā ca tathānyā * satānanā ।।

kroṣṭacakrā mahāghorā piśitā sarvvamantrikā ।
huhuvaktrā yogamāyā mahāghorasvarūpiṇī ।।

caṇḍayogeśvarī cānyā ṣoḍaśāntakalāntagā ।
hakārārddhacarī cānyā viśvasya nilayāparā ।।

viśvagrāsaikarasikā tathā ḍamaruvādinī ।
kālasaṃkarṣaṇī ghorā sarvvavidyālayā parā ।।

amoghā aparākhyātā tathānyā cāparājitā ।
sarvvamātrimukhā cānyā mahānaṃdakarī parā ।।

sudhānaṃdasravā cānyā nityānityoditāparā ।
etā devyaḥ samakhyātāḥ sarvvāḥ sarvvārthasiddhidāḥ ।।

sarvvakarmakarāḥ sarvvāścakkrācāreṇa saṃsthitāḥ ।
caturbhujāścaikavaktrā muṇḍapadmakarānvitāṃ ।।

pātrakhaṭvāṃgadhāriṇyo ghorāḥ kālānalopamāḥ ।
devīrūpaparāḥ sarvvāḥ sarvvāścāmiṣalampaṭāḥ ।।

yathaivaikā tathā sarvvā yathā sarvvāstathaikikā ।
bhinnā{bhinnā svarūpeṇa vyayāḥ sarvvāḥ sadaiva hi ।।

evaṃ dhyānamidaṃ khyātaṃ devadevyā maheśvarī ।
yathābhimatasiddhyarthaṃ sādhakānāṃ hitāvaham ।।

sarvvasiddhipradaṃ sāraṃ sarvvapātakanāśanam ।
sarvvāpasmāraśamanamītyupadravanāśanam ।।}
(93b)
trailokyasādhanakaraṃ vepātālaprasādhanam ।
vadādhvanā devadevi kiṃ vakṣyāmi surārcite ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturvviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
matacakkreśvarīvikaithānapaṭalo dvādaśamaḥ ।।

devyuvāca ।।

idānīṃ śrotumicchāmi karṣayājyā mahābalā ।
kaṣaṃ nyāsa(sta)vādīkṣā abhiṣekaṃ ca sādhanā ।
etadvadaddhadeveśa yaccātyantanmaheśvara ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi yatvayoktamihādhunā ।
gatvā girivaraṃ ramyaṃ śmaśānaṃ vā susiddhidam ।।

udadhervvā taṭaṃ ramyaṃ gurorgṛhamathopi vā ।
mātrigṛhamatheśāni yatra vā rocate guroḥ ।।

vīrācārarata(mbha)tra sahadūtibhiruttamaḥ ।
palālitṛptaḥ subhago caṃdanāgurucarcitaḥ ।।

sudhūpitaḥ sutāṃbūlo prāśya paṃcāmṛtaṃ śubham ।
ekaṃ vīrāvidhau tantamaṇḍalaṃ kārayetsadā ।।

caturdvāraṃ samaṃ śubhraṃmuthacakkravibhūṣitam ।
rājopalamayaṃ cakkraṃ raktanemiṃ mahāprabham ।।

dvātriṃśadarakairyuktaṃ padmagarbhaṃ suśobhanam ।
taṃ ṣoḍaśadalopetaṃ raktena rajasā vṛtam ।।

evaṃ saṃlikhya subhage toraṇādarśanābhūṣitam ।
vinānoparisaṃ(cchṛṃ panā)kādhvajabhūṣitam ।।

pratidigdramaruṃ cātra laṃbayet sa samāhitaḥ ।
dikṣvaśrāsu mahābhāge kalaśānaktapūritām ।।

sahiraṇyā{n} sapuṣpāṃśca   paṭṭasrakkaṭhaveṣṭitām ।
(94a)
āgne(yyā)magnikuṇḍaṃ ca sarvvalakṣalakṣinam ।।

trimerelaṃ vartulaṃ ca yoniṃ cāśvatthapatravat ।
* ṣvamanta prakurvvīta samaparvvaṃ sadaiva hi ।।

evaṃ niṣpādya tatrastho nyāsādikamihārabhit ।
paryantapatarājena śuddhayaḥ paṃca kārayet ।।
sthānaśuddhiṃ dravyaśuddhiṃ tadhāparām ।

maṃtraśuddhiṃ bhūmiśuddhiṃ kārayeta vicakṣaṇaḥ ।
digbaṃdhamātrā sthānasya guṇṭhanāt siddhimeṣyati ।।

dravyamabhyukṣaṇācchuddhaṃ yogārdhaṃ yatprakalpit ।
ātmano śuddhiratulāṃ * śṛṇu padalakṣaṇe ।।

virecya mārutaṃ dehādaśuddhaṃ pāśaveṣṭitam ।
tyaktvā punastadā vyomni dvādaśāṃtagate tataḥ ।।

cintaye(cchatcchī)dreśa dalaṃ caṃdra kalpitakarṇṇikam ।
padmaṃ śivamayaṃ śubhraṃ sravattamamṛtaṃ bahuḥ ।।

kalākrameṇa tatthānāt punaretya hṛdaṃbujam ।
tatra hṛtsyaṃdamastha cātmānaṃ ci(ddha)rūpiṇam ।।

kalāvayavasaṃpūrṇṇaṃ vyaktaṃ śuddhakalevaram ।
divyākṣapadavīyuktaṃ divyasatkaraṇāvṛtam ।।

viciṃtya paścāddeveśī prākpadenā(nu)lomataḥ ।
vilomato punarnyasya paścāttāṃ sakalāṃ nyasen ।।

tato vicintayeddehaṃ devyākāramananyadhīḥ ।
ātmāśuddhiriyaṃ proktā sarvvā{ma}yativardaśā ।।

ataḥ paraṃ maṃtraśuddhiṃ śṛṇu tvaṃ vīravaṃdite ।
tyaktyā puṃbhāvamaṃtulaṃ tathā niṣkriyatāṃ parā ।।

tadrullāsavikāsābhyāṃmavyasyaṃdasamāśrayān ।
vidvyaktitāṃ tavecakrumālaṃvyonmeṣabhāgyadā ।।

tadā maṃtraṃ smareddevi maṃtraśuddhiriyaṃ parā ।
(94b)
aparāṃ ca pravakṣyāmi śṛṇu pārvvati tattvataḥ ।।

kaṃdakuṃḍalinī sthānādguruvaktrakrameṇa ca ।
utthāvyamavyamaṃ cāgni(nma)travidvyakiṃ saṃśrayāt ।।

paramānaṃdasaṃvitthyā maṃtrī matrama(nu)smaret ।
tadā sā jāpaneśuddhimaṃtracakkrasya bhairavi ।।

parāpareṇa bhedena punaḥ śuddhiṃ śṛṇuṣva me ।
hṛtpadmasaṃpuṭe tejo yastrikaṃ pravijṛṃbhate ।।

adhordvayahanājjīpecchuddhiragninmahābalaḥ ।
naraśaktiśivākhyāti bhaktyātiścaikyameti saḥ ।।

tatspandacakkramavyastho smarenmatraṃ mahādbhutam ।
iyaṃ sā devadeveśi maṃtraśuddhiḥ parāparā ।।

punaraṇyā pravakṣyāmi maṃtraśuddhiṃ maheśvari ।
prodite bhāṣkare vāre taccinmaṃtraikyayogataḥ ।।

dvādaśāṃtapadaṃ yāvattāvanmaṃtramanusmaret ।
anena khecarī vaktrā prabhunā bhavanecirāt ।।

punareva śṛṇuṣvānyanmaṃtraśuddhiṃ mahārthadām ।
tasthānādetya subhage yāvadākarakuṃdralīm ।।

caṃdrodayena subhage bhavetpātālanāyakaḥ ।
sṛṣṭiyogakrameneyaṃ maṃtraśuddhiḥ prakāśitā ।।

punaraṇyena bhedena maṃtraśuddhirvvadāmi te ।
yattaccaṃdrārkamavyasthaṃ biṃduṃ bhrūyugamaṃdire ।।

kalāvali na sarvvāṃgaṃ paṃcakāraṇanāyakam ।
tatsthaṃ cittaprabhedena smarenmatraṃ prabhāsvaram ।।

sarvvasiddhipradaṃ jāyenmaṃtramatra niyojitam ।
iyaṃ śuddhiḥ samākhyātā māṃtrī suravarārcite ।।

gūhanīyatamābhadre na deyā yasya kasyacit ।
(95a)
dānāntarakamāpnoti sādākhyaṃ vatsarāṣṭakaṃm ।।

ataḥ paraṃ bhūmiśuddhiṃ śṛṇu pārvvati sāpratam ।
antimena padenaiva yorajvārāvalīsucā ।।

dagdhā kālāgniparyantaṃ tata āpyāyayetpunaḥ ।
(pī)yūṣarasasaṃghātairantavākārameva hi ।।

ciṃtyādhārābhidhāśaktiṃ tadutthaṃ paṃkajaṃ mahat ।
tatropari tathātmānaṃ sthānaśuddhiriyaṃ priye ।।

paṃca evaṃ samākhyātāḥ śuddhayaḥ parvvatātmaje ।
evaṃ kṛtvā tato devi hṛtpadme yāgamārabhet ।।

tatra kaṃdaṃ tathā nālaṃ surodaṃpotameva ca ।
punaḥ padmaṃ maṇḍalāntaṃ kuṃbhīraṃ mahiṣaṃ tathā ।।

mūrtyaṃtaṃ vinyasitvā tu punardevī tathā priye ।
prāgvyānena samāpetā sarvvadraṣṭau prapūjayet ।।

yatkicidvidyate vastu jagatyasminsurārcite ।
tena tena mahābhāge pūjayet parameśvarīm ।।

nābhikuṇḍodave homaṃ kuryādbījairjamodbhavaiḥ ।
evaṃ kṛtvā tato devi maṇḍalentaḥ prapūjayet ।।

madhye niveśayeddevīṃ prāṇaprāntavirecitām ।
dadhyonā raśmipravāhena tārārūpānvicintayet ।।

tricaturbhedavāhena madhvāvaraṇayogataḥ ।
yogābhedavibhāgena paryantāntaṃ niveśayet ।।

kṣetreśagaṇanā(the)śau rakṣovāyu gaṇā{n}yajet ।
kalaśasthāśca diṅmātryo pūjayet parameśvari ।।

gaṃgā kāliṃdike dve tu dvāroddeśe prapūjayet ।
pūrvvadhyānasamāpetāṃ devīṃ devyaśca pūjayet ।।
(95b)
ekavīrā mahādevi devyātārānibhāḥ sadā ।
tarpayeta tato devīṃ surāmāṃsāsavādibhiḥ ।।

nānāvalyopahāraiśca lopikā dhūpakaiḥ śubhaiḥ ।
tilaśaṣkulikābhiśca śaṃkhavarttibhireva ca ।।

modakairvvividhaiścitrairdrākṣīkhaṃdrakṛtairapi ।
mudgamāṣabhavaiścānyairbhojanaiḥ pāyasaistathā ।।

gomāṃsairnaramāṃsaiśca gajāśvoṣṭrabhavaistathā ।
jalajaiḥ khecalaiścānyairmāṃsairnānāvidhaiḥ śivām ।।

santarpayetsvinnabhṛṣṭairdevadevīṃ karaṃkiṇīm ।
madyasurā tathā śīṃdhuṃ āraṇālombureva ca ।।

paṃcāmṛtamasṛtkaiva pānāni vividhāni ca ।
nivedyāni maheśāni devadevyā pratarpaṇe ।।

evaṃ pratarpayitvā ca bhaktānuktairmaheśvarīm ।
tataḥ praveśayecchiṣyaṃ vīraṃ vīraṃ dṛḍhavratam ।।

nadvanetraṃ sājjalīkaṃ prokṣitāladhvavigraham ।
saṃtāḍitaṃ tato devi śaktihastena śodhitam ।।

[praveśayecchiṣyaṃ * * vīraṃ vīraṃ dṛḍhavratam ।
nadvanetraṃ sājjalīkaṃ prokṣitā ladhvavigraham ।।

saṃtāḍitaṃ tato devi śaktihastena śodhinam ।]
praveśya kusumaiḥ pūrṇṇāmaṃjaliṃ prakṣipāpayet ।।

tata udghāṭayennetre maṇḍalaṃ saṃpradarśayet ।
tato gaccheta deveśi vahnikuṃḍasamīpataḥ ।।

tatra dakṣiṇadigbhāge (śaṣyaṃ) pakvaṃ ni(dhā)payet ।
tataḥ kuṇḍasya deveśi paryantena {padena} hi ।।

saṃskārāṇi prakurvvīta ādiṣaṭkavadeva hi ।
tadvadeva mahābhāge sruksruvau pariśodhayet ।।

tadvadagniṃ tathā śiṣyaṃ dīkṣaye(ttanu)madhyame ।
(96a)
mantrādhvānaṃ padādhvānaṃ tattvākhyaṃ bhuvanābhidham ।।

kalādhvānaṃ ca varṇṇākhyaṃ ṣaḍadhvapratibhāgaśaḥ ।
yena yenādhvanāmaṃ trīśiṣyasaṃskarttumicchati ।।

tamupasthāpya tatrasthaṃ tadantaḥ paṃca bhāvayet ।
sṛṣṭyādipaṃcakarmāṇi tatra tatra prakalpayet ।।

yathāpūrvvaṃ samākhyātaṃ ādiṣaṭkamaheśvari ।
tathā sarvvaṃ prakuvīta vistāro neha kīrtyate ।।

yojayecchaktisaṃsthānaṃ śiṣyaṃ sarvvātmanā guruḥ ।
mumukṣatvājñi ve tattve tatastamabhiṣedhayet ।।

kalaśena vicitreṇa sakṛdāmaṃtritena hi ।
abhiṣicya tataścāsya maṃtraṃ devi samarpayet ।।

ājñāmasyai dadeddevi maṃtrasādhanakarmmaṇi ।
evaṃprāpya naraśreṣṭho janmanyasminna paścime ।।

toṣayeta guruṃ paścādyena yena sa tuṣyati ।
tattaddeyaṃ mahābhāge nirvvikalpena dhīmatā ।।

* lanujño tadā vīrā maṃtrasādhanamārabhet ।
etatte sarvvamākhyātaṃ rahasyaṃ paramādbhutam ।
atastvavasaraprāptaṃ maṃtrasādhanamiṣyate ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturvviṃśatisāhasre
tṛtīyaṣaṭke matacakkreśvarīvidhau dīkṣābhiṣekapaṭalastrayodaśamaḥ ।।

athātassampravakṣyāmi kaṣṭasādhanavarjitam ।
devyāsādhanamevātra yanna kasyacidīritam ।।

gatvā girivaroddeśaṃ śmaśānaṃ vā dṛḍhavrataḥ ।
tatra vīravratadharo sādhakeṃdraḥ prasannadhīḥ ।।
(96b)
japeta pūrvvavidhinā maṃtravīryaikatatparaḥ ।
a(yu)taikaṃ devadevī sahasraṃ juhuyāttataḥ ।।

pūrvve tu naramāṃsasya jyājotthasyāthavā priye ।
guggulorgulikāccātha tryaktā devi juhottamaḥ ।।

evaṃ homāvasāne tu sākṣāddevī karaṃkiṇī ।
udeti vahnima(dhyā)tsā sādhakāya varapradā ।।

yatheṣṭaṃ tu varaṃ tasmai dadātyeṣā na saṃśayaḥ ।
cakracakkreśvaratvaṃ vā ātmasāyojyameva vā ।।

prayacchati na saṃdehaṃ sādehaṃ cāsya sarvvathā ।
sahasrapaṃcakājjāpāddevadevī kṛṣodarī ।।

tilagugguluhomācca pātālaṃ sādhayiṣyati ।
yatra yatra kvaciddeśe paścādvidyāṃ smaredgiriḥ ।।

tatra tatra vi(la)ddhālaṃ sādhakaṃsyottamaṃ bhavet ।
āyāṃti bhayabhītāstā kanyakāmadavihvalāḥ ।।

sādhakasya vaṃśe sarvvāstirṣvanyamitavarcasaḥ ।
tāsāṃ patirasau devi tārāṇāmiva caṃdramā ।।

bhavatyeva na saṃdeho vacastvavitathaṃ mama ।
mahākalpaṃ tatra jīvetsādhakeṃdro na saṃśayaḥ ।।

atha yaḥ sādhanāhīne yasya sādhanamucyate ।
ladhvā(nu)jñādīpaparvve japedvidyāṃ ahoṣitaḥ ।।

śrīmukhāgre mahābhāge yāvacchatamataṃdritaḥ ।
tatastu praviśettatra svagṛhe vahinirbhayaḥ ।।

pūrvvavatsiddhirabhasyādviśeṣo neha tanyate ।
śavamakṣatamānīya kṛtvā taṃ sarvvabhūṣitam ।।

vedisavyaṃ ca taṃ sthāpya tasya hastamavaṣṭanet ।
dakṣiṇaṃ devadeveśi dakṣiṇena mahāmatiḥ ।।
(97a)
āvarttayettato devī sahasrākṣaramālitām ।
trirovarttāddevadevi śavosau pracanniṣyati ।।

paṃcāvarttā (catta)hāsaṃ va(jñā)śaninibhe tadā ।
puṃvane nātrasaṃdeha jata utthāya nṛttati ।।

tasya skadhagataṃ hastaṃ kṛtvā vīravaraḥ svayam ।
nṛttena madirānaṃdanaṃditau tau parasparam ।।

palāṣṭaśanikaṃ tasya madhyaṃ pānārthamādade ।
taṃ pītvā tuṣṭa evāsau hyupaviśya vadettadā ।।

aho krīddhitametaddhi āvābhyāmiha sāṃpratam ।
vada kiṃ karavānye(vaṃ) vīranāthādyāmāciram ।।

rasaṃ rasāyanaṃ dhātuṃ nidhānamatha cottamam ।
vivaraṃ vā mahāsiddhaṃ gṛhāṇa tvaṃ yathesthitam ।।

evaṃ śrutvā tatastūṣṇaṃ vidyā cāvarttayettadā ।
tato vadatyasau tasya ehi matpṛṣṭhamāruha ।।

yāvadvrahmāṃdrakuhare yaṃ sthānaṃ tava rocate ।
tena yāmi mahāsattva kiṃkarohaṃ tava sthitaḥ ।।

vicarasthajagatsarvvamajaro hyamaraḥ sadā ।
aniṣiddhaḥ suraiḥ siddhairvvidyāsiddhastvameva hi ।।

evamākarṇya sahasā ttatpṛṣṭhamadhirohati ।
vicaretsarvvabhuvanāṃ yathā hariharau svayam ।।

mahābalo mahotsāho mahākalpāntarasthitiḥ ।
athavā matacakkreśyā vidhau maṃthānamārabhet ।।

dvātriṃśatiyutovīrairmahāsāhasikairvvanaiḥ ।
gacchadvanāntaraṃ ghoraṃ duṣṭadaṃṣṭriśanākulam ।।

parikhārthaṃ catuḥṣaṣṭihastācca caturaśrataḥ ।
prākāraṃ dāpayettatra yathā kaścinna paśyati ।।
(97b)
tatra madhya tato ve(dī) dvātriṃśatipaśūttamaiḥ ।
kalpaṣeddevadeveśi caturbhijātibhistataḥ ।।

aṣṭau pumāṃsau deveśi pratijātau dvayaṃ dvayam ।
aṣṭāvaśva{n} aṣṭakharāṃ aṣṭau mahiṣajātayaḥ ।।

etā deveśvarī yāgaṃ kṛtvā haṭhavidho haret ।
kuṭṭatkhaḍgakuṃtādyaistadraktaṃ grāhayettataḥ ।।

mahāvajrakaṭāhaṃ tastāvakṣīraṃ vinikṣipet ।
ratnāni tatra sarvvāṇi majjāmedovasāmiṣan ।।

paśumāṃsairmahāvediṃ kṛtvā mādha niveśayet ।
manthānamatramavyasthaṃ mahāśūlaṃ halācitam ।।

puṃśīrṣaṃ racitaṃ yoraṃ maṃtrasragdāmamaṇḍitam ।
kaṭakādisuvarddhanaṃ kṛtvā saṃpūjayenna hi ।।

devadevīṃ punarghorāṃ pūrvvoktadhyānamāsthitaḥ ।
tataḥ keśakṛtaṃ netraṃ srāṣṭaṃtra pariveṣṭitam ।।

tena saṃveṣṭayettaṃtu mathānaṃ saptakṛtpriye ।
tatorāvāṣṭakaṃ kurvvaṃ mānbhaṣāśca kharoditam ।।

mahiṣotthaṃ ca deveśi dakṣiṇaṃ pāśva{mā}śrayet ।
śvakūrmmakodrajaṃtūnāṃ rāvino vāmamāśrayet ।।

tato nirmathayedvegādyathā manthānabhairavam ।
trirāvarttā devadevi saśailavanakānanām ।।

kampate pṛ(thvi)vīṃ sarvvāṃ vidyunirghātasaṃkaṭām ।
ulkāśanasahasrāṇi pataṃti ca diśo daśam ।।

hāhārāvaṃ mahāghoraṃ mahāccaṭacaṭāravam ।
udeti sahasrā ttatra ghorarūpaṃ bhayānakam ।।

jvalanti ca diśassarvvāḥ śivārāvasamākulāḥ ।
udeti sahasā ttasmātkālakūṭaṃ mahāviṣam ।।
(98a)
ghoraṃ bhairavasakāśaṃ । trailokyakṣayakārakam ।
vajreṇa tāḍayettaṃ vai ghorāṃ vidyāmanusmaran ।।

tadā vinaśyate taṃ vai bhūyo manthānamārabhet ।
tata udgacchate devo sākṣādbhairavanāyakaḥ ।।

vadatyevaṃ tadā devi sādhakānāṃ mahātmanām ।
gṛhāṇadhvaṃ varāṃśceṣṭāṃ hāsyāsyeva na saṃśayaḥ ।।

brahmā tvaṃ atha viṣṇu tvaṃ - - - - - - - - ।
- - - - ca dāsyāmi gṛhāṇadhvaṃ narottamāḥ ।।

yasmānmahāghorataraṃ bhavadbhiḥ karmabhairavam ।
sādhu bhoḥ sādhu bhostasmādgṛhāṇadhvaṃ narottamāḥ ।।

evamākarṇya kharāḥ kekāravavirāvinaḥ ।
puṣpavṛṣṭīḥ kṣipantyū्ccairjaṃyaśabdaṃ muhurmuhuḥ ।।

vadaṃti sarvva vai ete sādhakāya mahātmane ।
dṛṣṭvā devaṃ pūjayeta mahābhairavavigraham ।।

tayā cetavaraṃ kiṃcinmanāgapi suma(dhya)me ।
tatontarddhānamāyāti deveśo bhairavaḥ svayam ।।

saptamāvṛtiyogena sākṣāddevī kṛṣodarī ।
samu(de)ti ca tanmadhyāttārahāreṃdunirmalā ।।

dvātriṃśatistanī devī kalaśātvibhratikavaiḥ ।
mahāmṛtena saṃpūrṇṇā dvātriṃśati sureśvarī ।।

tāṃ dṛṣṭvā devadeveśīṃ sahasātpraṇamedbudhaḥ ।
pūjyavāmāmṛtenaiva mātṛvatsāti sā tataḥ ।।

prayacchate sādhakānāṃ pratyekasyastanaṃstanam ।
kalaśaṃ hastagaṃsteṣāṃ dadātyeṣā na saṃśayaḥ ।।

pītvā stanavaraṃ devyā duṣprāpamakṛtātmabhiḥ ।
pragṛhya kalaśaṃ devi paramāmṛtanirbharam ।।
(98b)
tatputratvaṃ samāyāṃti sādhakā vigatāmayāḥ ।
yāvaddevī mahāraudrā tāvatsarvve dhṛyaṃti hi ।।

katṛtvaṃ caiva harttṛtvaṃ yathā devyāstathaiva hi ।
bhavatyeva na saṃdehaṃ sādhakānāṃ mahātmanāṃ ।।

brahmā viṣṇustathā ru * īśvaraśca sadāśivaḥ ।
mahābhairavadevaśca ye cānye bhairaveśvarāḥ ।।

teṣāṃ pūjyatvamāpro * sādhakeṃdrasvayūthayuk ।
kiṃ vā paraṃ pravakṣyāmi ataḥ parataraṃ na hi ।।

sādhanaṃ devadeveśi kutracitparikīrttitam ।
ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi yathākṛtyā prasiddhyati ।।

gatvā pitṛvaṇaṃ bhīmaṃ rātrau bhūtāhni bhairavi ।
prajvālya hutabhuktatra śūlakāṣṭhacitānalaiḥ ।।

tato nṛmāṃsaṃ juhuyānnaktaṃ suravarārcite ।
ghorāṃ vṛttisamālaṃvya sādhakedraḥ prabhannadhīḥ ।।

daśāhutyo yāvadeva juhvate sādhakeśvaraḥ ।
tāvatprakaṃpate bhūmiṃ saśailavanakānanām ।।

tata uttiṣṭhate vegādagnima(dhyāddurāsadā ।
vivṛtāsyāṃ mahāghorāṃ kṛtyā paramadāruṇāṃ ।।

vadatyevaṃ sādhakeṃdra kiṃ karomi tavādhunā ।
pātālaṃ dārayāmyeṣa sumeruṃ cūrṇṇayāmi kim ।।

pibāmi sāgarāṃ sarvvāṃ nāśayāmi yamālayam ।
aindraṃ vā bhuvanaṃ sarvvaṃ nāśayāmyathavā vada ।।

nairṛtaṃdraṃ tathā vahniṃ varuṇaṃ vāyumeva vā ।
kuberamatha īśānaṃ nāśayāmyathavā vada ।।

kūṣmāṇḍamatha kālāgniṃ vada nirnāśayāmi kim ।
brahmāṇamatha viṣṇuṃ vā brahmāṇḍaṃ cūrṇṇayāmi kim ।।
(99a)
vadasva śīghraṃ vīreṃdrapahaṃ manasirocitam ।
evaṃ śrutvā sādhakena vaktavyaṃ manasīpsitam ।।

tatsarvvaṃ kurute sā tu kiṃkaratve vyavasthitā ।
atha sādhayituṃ vāṃcche sthasthāveśanamuttamam ।।

tadā kanyāṃ samānīya sarvvalakṣaṇalakṣitām ।
āsane tāṃ pratiṣṭhāpya sugupte varamadire ।।

raktakṛṣṇāṃbaradharāṃ raktasrakkaṃṭhaśobhitām ।
śubhāsanasthāṃ tāṃ kuryātpalāliparipūritām ।।

avyucchinnaṃ daheddhūpaṃ vidyāmāvarttayettataḥ ।
tadā sā kampate kanyā ghūrṇṇaste hasate punaḥ ।।

ghaṃṭāṃ pravādayettatra mahāmaṃtravikaisthitaiḥ ।
tata āviśate tūrṇṇaṃ devadevī kṛṣodarī ।।

tyaktvā bhūmiṃ tiṣṭhate sā tadā sā praṇataḥ pumām ।
tarpayetparameśānīṃ nānāvalyopahārataḥ ।।

tadā sādhakamukhyāya vadā te manasīpsitam ।
bhūtaṃ bhavyaṃ bhaviṣyaṃ ca kālatrayamathākhilam ।।

brahmāṃḍodaragā vārttā sādhakāya vadatyasau ।
evaṃ saṃtarpyate devīṃ bhaktyā pra(thi)tamānasaḥ ।।

praṇamya tāṃ visarjyeta devadevīṃ kṛṣodarīm ।
atha vakṣyāmi suśroṇi karmaprāsenikaṃ śubham ।।

pūrvvasevārthamatulāṃ śataṃvidyāmudāharet ।
paścātkarmaṇi yuṃjīta prasenākhye suma(dhya)me ।।

(jala)dīpe tathā khaḍgacaṃdre sūryanabhontare ।
kanyānetre tathāṃguṣṭhe darpaṇeva sunirmmale ।।

mahāpātrethavā devi prasenāmavatārayet ।
āvatyaciti bhasmātra - vabhasmāthavā priye ।।
(99b)
tena saṃmārjya cāmaṃtryaṃ devadevīṃ kṛṣodarīṃ ।
sampūjayedvinyāsecca japeddevīṃ mahārthadām ।।

tadā sārdarśayettatra atītānāgataṃ priye ।
varttamānaṃ ca subhage kanyā paśyata saṃśayam ।।

sādhakeṃdraḥ prapaśyeta yadā sāhasrajāpakaḥ ।
etatprāsenikaṃ karma tavākhyātaṃ yathārthataḥ ।।

adhunā svapnakathane vidhānamidamu(cya)te ।
gocarmamātrāṃ tu mahīṃ lepayitvā suśobhanām ।।

alinā devadeveśi kṛtamaṃtraparicchadaḥ ।
śiroddeśe devadevīṃ kalaśasthāṃ prapūjayet ।।

nānāvidhopahāraiśca āsavaṃ bahubhistathā ।
saṃpūjya devadeveśīṃ vijñapedidamādarāt ।।

kalanātmātrikakālaḥ kathaṃ devi vyavasthitaḥ ।
kathaṃ mayā varttitavyaṃ kā siddhirme bhaviṣyati ।।

kaṃ kṣetramāśrayāmekaṃ kaṃ sahāyaṃ samāśraye ।
katikālena siddhirme kiṃ kṛtvā vā bhave(tsphu)ṭam ।।

kati varṣāṇi jīvāmi kativāme paritthadam ।
jīviṣyati mahādevi bhayaṃ vā kasya kīdṛśam ।।

lābhaṃ jayājayaṃ kīdṛkkasya devi vyavasthitam ।
subhikṣamatha durbhikṣaṃ vyādhirvvā kasya dāruṇam ।।

rājñorvvā kati varṣāṇi rājyaṃ jīvitameva vā ।
yaccānyannanmama svapne vada bhairava tattvataḥ ।।

i(tyukttvā) devadevyāgre svapedvidyāmudāharaṃ ।
tadā paśyatyasau svapne yadyadroceta tasya vai ।।

atha vaśyārthamatulāṃ yathādevīṃ niyojayet ।
(100a)
tathā te saṃpravakṣyāmi śṛṇu pārvvati tattvataḥ ।।

sādhyasya pādapāṃsuṃ vai samāhṛtya prayatnataḥ ।
raktarocanayāmiśrāṃ kṛtvā vidyāṃ samālikhet ।।

bhūrjapatre mahābhāge sādhyanāmasamanvitām ।
saṃlikhya pūjya subhage sarvvaraktopacārataḥ ।।

prakṛtiṃ kārayetpaścātmadanena maheśvarī ।
tāṃ ta(dhṛ)di niveśyeta cīrikāṃ raktaguṭitām ।।

tatorddharātrasamaye tāpayetkhadirānale ।
vidyāmāvarttayeddevi taddiśābhimukhasthitaḥ ।।

evaṃ saptāhamātreṇa yadi sākṣātpuraṃdaram ।
urvvaśī vā ahalyāṃ vā vaśayennātra saṃśayaḥ ।।

athavā (dhyā)nayogena pāśāṃkuśaniyojanāt ।
raktāruṇena (dhyā)nena cittāṃ cittaniyojayet ।।

paṃcakaṃ paṃcakenaiva samāhṛtya prayogataḥ ।
ekībhāvagataṃ dvābhyāṃ saptāhādvaśamānayet ।।

atha vidyāṃ japeddevi sādhyanāmasamanvitāṃ ।
tadā vaśayattasarvve ābrahmabhuvanāntikam ।।

athākarṣaṇamevānya chṛṇu vīreṃdravaṃdite ।
anenaiva vidhānena pratimāṃ kārayettataḥ ।।

svaraktalikhitāṃ tatra cīrikāṃ viniveśayet ।
tāpayetkhadirāgnau tāṃ pratimāṃ madanodbhavām ।।

yāvattāṃ pravilīyeta tāvaṭāpātyasau priye ।
āgatya śaravegena nipatetsādhakāgrataḥ ।।

āyojanaśatāddevi tamākarṣati sudrutam ।
evamākarṣaṇaṃ śreṣṭhaṃmasmitaṃtre prakāśitam ।।

mohanaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi yathāvatta(nu)madhyame ।
(100b)
śukavaktāṃ samādāya kapotamathavā priye ।।

tena nāmaṃ samālikhya sā(dhya)sya parikalpayet ।
vidyayā carinaṃ kṛtvā māṣā prakṛtimadhyataḥ ।।

kṣipetkaṃṭakavidvāṃtāṃ kāṃcinyāṃ surasuṃdari ।
yasyaivaṃ kriyate yaṃtraṃ samuhyaḥ kīṣṭhavadbhavet ।।

mohito nātijānāti deśajātikulaṃ(sdha)kam ।
atha vaibhītiṃkīṃ kṛtvā sādhyasya prakṛtiṃ tataḥ ।।

abhimaṃtryasaptavā(raṃ) jvalamānāṃ citiṃ vrajet ।
prakṣipettatramavyetāṃ paścākramaśataṃ vrajet ।।

punarāgatya deveśi grāhayenāsaśaṃkitaḥ ।
śatābhimaṃtritāṃ bhūyo tāṃ kṛtvā sādhakeśvaraḥ ।।

yaṃ tāḍayati saṃkruddhastaṃ mohayati kāṣṭhavat ।
mohito naiva jānāti kiṃcideva hyasau tadā ।।

tāmāghṛṣya priye samyakstatnivanasaṃyutām ।
tena yasyaiva tilakaṃ svaraktapravimiśritaṃm ।।

prakuryātsādhakeṃdro saumuṃgdhaḥ kiṃkaratāmiyān ।
ātmānaṃ ca dhanaṃ corāṃ sādhakāya prayacchati ।।

atha kṛtvā gadāṃ ghorāṃ citikāṣṭhasamudbhavām ।
tāṃ pratiṣṭhāvyatidhivanmṛtakarpaṭaguṃṭhitām ।।

rajasā strīsamutthena saṃliptaiva hi sādhakaḥ ।
hatvācchāgaṃ tadagre tu tasya koṣṇamasṛkyayan ।।

tena saṃsnāpayedbhūyo japeccāṣṭaśataṃ tataḥ ।
tataḥ prabhṛti sā siddhā mohayecchatrusainyakam ।।

pragṛhyaitāṃ gadāṃ ghorāṃ devadevīṃ smaretsakṛt ।
(101a)
gajāṃśca rathapṛṣṭhastho madā tīrāṃ nareśvaraḥ ।।

ādhānedṛpusenāgraṃ ghoramatyatradāntaṇam ।
cūrṇayedekaevāsau senāmiṃdrasamāṃ yadi ।।

saṃgrāmābhihatasyaiva śūrasyāhṛṃtya kaṃdarāt ।
tenaidhvajaṃ prakurvīta śatāṣṭaparimaṃtritam ।।

taṃ dṛṣṭvā śantavaḥ sarve nāśaṃyāṃti parāṅmukhāḥ ।
mohitā naiva jānanti svātmānamapi te bhṛśam ।।

evaṃ senāvināśāni samāsādupavallitam ।
staṃbhanaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi śṛṇu suṃdari tattvataḥ ।।

pītadravyena saṃlikhya bhūrjave śatrunāmakam ।
vidyayā caritaṃ kṛtvā śakramaṃḍalamavyagam ।।

evaṃ saṃlikhya subhage tacceṣṭāpuṭamavyagam ।
stabhayedgamanovyuktaṃ apisainyaṃ śatakratoḥ ।।

evaṃvidhena vidhinā vāra saṃstaṃbhayiṣyati ।
* * garbhaṃ vā deveśi staṃbhavennātra saṃśayaḥ ।।

evaṃ staṃbhassamātsyāto grahakarmma śriṇu priye ।
abhimaṃtrya śimīśākhāṃ latāvādrāmodbhavām ।।

pūrvanyāsena sannaddho grahadaṣṭaṃ vilokayet ।
cittajvalitaṃ sarvaṃ brahmāṇḍabhuvanodaram ।।

sādhyadehaṃ śītalaṃ ca ātmānaṃ devi saṃnibham ।
tama āyātyasau bhīto graho maṃtraprapīḍitaḥ ।।

kraṃdate vepane trasto āhuvellanayā bhṛśam ।
muṃcāmīti vadetsau vai śāpayitvā parityajet ।।

athāpasmāranāśārthaṃ vikanamidamucyate ।
tacchṛṇuṣva mahābhāge sarahasyaṃ mahādbhutam ।।
(101b)
ghorāt pāpāt samabhyeti taskarosau mahābalaḥ ।
tatrādau pāpanāśāya devīmaṇḍaladarśanam ।।

karttavyaṃ grahadaṣṭasya yena bhūyo na saṃsmaret ।
catuṣpāddevadeveśi pātraṃ vidyāvināśitaḥ ।।

athavā taṃtrayogena nāśayettanuma(dhya)me ।
śastrāhatanasya subhage gṛhyaraktaṃ mahāmatiḥ ।।

vidyayā maṃtritaṃ kṛtvā tena kuryāṃ tripuṃḍrakām ।
sarvagātreṣu vai tasya apasmārāhatasya ca ।।

tadā na smarate bhūpaścatuṣyāttaṃ kadācana ।
atha śāvaṃkaraṃ gṛhya purayuktaṃ sukuhitam ।।

tena dhūpaṃ pradātavyamapasmārayutasya ca ।
na smarettaṃ tataḥ pātraṃ catuṣpāddhūpamūrcchitaḥ ।।

kṛṣṇasya sārameyasya medomajjādisaṃbhavam ।
pragṛhya tailaṃ kādyasthamaṃjanaṃ sādhayettadā ।।

abhimatrya mahābhāge taskarāgamane sati ।
etenāṃjitanetrastu catuṣyāmnatitaṃ punaḥ ।।

atha śvānasya deveśi nalikānāṃ catuṣṭayam ।
saptakāsthiyutaṃ kṛtvā vastasūtreṇa pīśayat ।।

āgatā dhūpayettena dhūpena parameśvari ।
tadā saṃsmarate naiva taṃ pātraṃ sa kadācanaḥ ।।

adhodbaddhasya subhage pāśamāhṛtya yatnataḥ ।
saṃpūjya devadeveśīṃ maṃtrakaṃṭhe prabaṃdhayet ।।

sabhūyotyetyapasmāraṃ pāśasyāsya pra(bhā)vataḥ ।
atha saṃkrāmayeccainaṃ kasyacitpāpakāriṇaḥ ।।

tadāyaṃ vidhimātiṣṭhettacchṛṇu(tvaṃ) nagātmaje ।
vāra(tra)yena cāhṛtya mīnamekaṃ sajīvitam ।।
(102a)
na madhyaṃ jana me pātra saṃsādhya parameśvarī ।
tadrasena samāloḍya śālitaṃḍulapiṇḍikām ।।

taskarasyāgatasyaiva tāṃ piṃḍī mukhataḥ kṣipet ।
tallālāparisaṃsiktyo māṃ bhūyastu samāharet ।।

taṃ yasya dīpate devi bhojanena ca yena tu ।
tasya saṃkrīmayeddevi apasmāraṃ sudāruṇam ।।

eṣa saṃkrāmaṇaḥ khyāto apasmārasya suṃdari ।
athāta(ssa)mpravakṣyāmi sasyarakṣaṇamadbhutam ।।

vikanamidamatyugraṃ kriyācāravivarjitam ।
kṛtvāyasamayaṃ śūlaṃ śitāgramatidāruṇam ।।

dvādaśāṃgulamānena madhyamānā prakalpayet ।
tadaṃgulaukahāsena dvayamanyatprakalpayet ।।

catuṣkikā dyaṃgulā syātpadyenaiva vicitritā ।
caturviṃśāgulaṃ dadraṃ śitāgraṃ kārayettataḥ ।।

tadarddhamānavistāraṃ arāṇāmāyatattvatā ।
evaṃ niṣpādya subhage śūlametatsuśobhanam ।।

taṃ paṃcaratnasaṃsiktaṃ strīrajena vicarcitam ।
kṛtvā saṃpūjayettasmiṃ devadevīṃ kṛṣodarīṃ ।।

yathā vibhavavistāraiḥ sahasrākṣaramālitām ।
prāṇaśūlaśikhārūḍhāṃ ghātvā vidyāṃ sujājvalām ।।

yojaye(cchū)laṃ mūrttau tu paścāttāṃ paripūjayet ।
abhimaṃtryaṃ tataḥ śūlaṃ śatenāṣṭādhikena ca ।।

evaṃ pratiṣṭhitaṃ śūlaṃ meghāśaninivāraṇam ।
nirgatya maṇḍalaṃ devi bhrāmarātmani rakṣati ।।
(102b)
manasā caiva devesi vidyāsenāmanusmara(n) ।
yāvat prakalpayeddevi sīmābaṃdhaṃ tu sānasam ।।

paścāt prabhrāmaye sthūlaṃ bhāvatsaṃrakṣayiṣyati ।
dṛṣṭvā śūlabalaṃ ghoraṃ anaṃtādyāḥ phaṇīśvarāḥ ।।

sādhakeṃdreṇa bhrāmyaṃtaṃ hṛdaya(sphu)ṭanāturāḥ ।
palāyaṃti svaraktena mūrcchamānaḥ savihvalāḥ ।।

yatra vā rocate tasya grāme vā viṣaye pure ।
tadraṃjikāsamāyuktāṃ vidyāmeva smaredyadā ।।

tattataṃpānayenmeghamaśaniṃ vā durāsadām ।
athavā śimivṛkṣotthāṃ śākhāṃ samabhimaṃtritām ।।

kṛtvā meghāgame kāle rakṣayecchatayojanam ।
sikatāmabhimaṃtryaivaṃ sakṛtsādhakapuṃgavaḥ ।।

kruddhaḥ prakṣapaye(dvyo)mni rakṣayecchatayojanam ।
nāśayenmeghasaṃghānāṃ durdvārāṃ tridaśairapi ।।

śivāṃbumatha saṃgṛhya krodhāviṣṭasta sādhakaḥ ।
maṃtrayitvā kṣipe(dvyo)mni kuyānmeghavināśanam ।।

rājasarṣapamāmaṃtrya gagane nikṣipedyadā ।
tadā kuddhaḥ sādhakeṃdro nāśayanmeghasaṃcayā(n) ।

huṅkāmaṇāthaghoreṇa śūlamudrāprayogataḥ ।
smaredvidyāṃ mahāraudrāṃ nāśayanmeghasaṃcayān ।।

kāṣṭhaṃ tṛṇaṃ tathā loṣṭhaṃ śarkaraṃ vālimaṃtritām ।
kṛtvā kṣipenmeghakule tadā tāṃ nāśayiṣyati ।।

bherīṃ vā sudṛḍhāṃ kṛtvā abhimaṃtrya prahārayuk ।
dedetkasyacidevaināṃ gacchamaṃnāmatādritām ।।

kuru meghāgame kāle yāvadrakṣitu(mu)dyataḥ ।
(103a)
tāvat saṃrakṣayet samyak sādhako nātra saṃśayaḥ ।।

evaṃ saṃrakṣayeddevi sasyaṃ sādhakamuttamaḥ ।
athedānīṃ pravakṣyāmi nāganigrahamuttamam ।।

japtvā cāṣṭasahasraṃ tu pūrvasevāvikainataḥ ।
ādāya vainavaṃ divyaṃ dhanuḥ samyakpramaṃtritam ।।

ekaviṃśati vai ghorāṃ śarāccāśāviśopamām ।
gatvā tu nāgakuṇḍāgraṃ kruddhaḥ saṃraktalocanaḥ ।।

baṃdhayeddigvibhāgāni śaṃkubhiḥ sarṣapaistathā ।
tataḥ prajvālayettatra pradīptaṃ jātavedasām ।।

juhuyātkaṭutailāktī rājasarṣapa eva hi ।
ekāviṃśatirāhutya yāvadeva juhotyasau ।।

tāvattarkṣobhamāyāti hradaṃ sāgarasaṃnibham ।
tatra utthāya sahasā pragṛhya dhanu{ru}ttamam ।।

ekaikaṃ mattayitvā tu śaramatra vinikṣipet ।
tadā saṃpūjyate toyaṃ bhayādāyāti pannagam ।।

bhītaṃ vitrastavapuṣaṃ vepamānaṃ bhayākulam ।
sākṣīdananta subhage kiṃmutānye phaṇīśvarāḥ ।।

kiṃkaratvena varttatte sabhṛtyabalavāhanāḥ ।
rasaṃ rasāyanaṃ khaḍgaṃ pādukā kuṇḍalāni ca ।।

prayacchaṃti na saṃdehaṃ nāgeṃdrā bhaya(vi)hvalāḥ ।
preṣayedyatra vā roceddośataṃ pannageśvaram ।।

evamākhyātamanaghaṃ nāgānāṃ drāvidraṃ param ।
atha vakṣyāmi suśroṇi viṣanirnāśanaṃ mahat ।।

abhimaṃtryodakaṃ maṃtrī dṛṣṭakaṃ cāpi tāḍayet ।
anyatpānāya dātavyaṃ triṣṇatvā cābhimaṃtritam ।।
(103b)
tadāsau nirviṣo jāyetkāladaṣṭopi yo bhavet ।
bhuktaṃ vāyanadeveśi garito vahi yaḥ priyet ।।

sa kṣipraṃ nirviṣo yāti maṃtritāṃbuprapānataḥ ।
athavā devadeveśi vatsarātmadayo viṣāḥ ।।

pragṛhya karayugmāṃtaḥ pūrvanyāsena saṃskṛtāḥ ।
abhimaṃtrya harermātrā yathā garudrarāścayam ।।

haste viṣaṃ gṛhītvā tu pāśāṃkuśavicāritam ।
dattaṃ na bādhanetyarthaṃ mārayedvā na saṃvyayaḥ ।।

citsvarū(pa)svarūpīyo vyāpakatvapadasthitaḥ ।
kāyaśaṃkī viniyuktaḥ sasaṃkrāmayate viṣam ।।

jagatyasmiṃ na saddeho nāśayed vā na saṃśayaḥ ।
athavā jārayogena pragṛhya karagaṃ viṣam ।।

jālasaṃnyāsayogena vidyārājñābhimaṃtritam ।
tadā saṃkrāmayaṃ cūrllaṃ viṣaṃ yasya prarocate ।।

evaṃ krameṇa deveśi sarpaiḥ krīḍedyathecchayā ।
pāśāṃkuśaprayogena vidyāṃ saṃyojya bhāmini ।।

tadā saṃkarṣayet sarpaṃ preṣayecca vipaścitaḥ ।
mahākuṇḍalabaṃdhena dhāvaye śvāpayecchayā ।।

lohaliṃgādikaṃ devi yatproktaṃ viṣamaṃ viṣam ।
tadabhyukṣaṇamātreṇa sādhakeṃdraḥ praṇāśayan ।।

śaṃkākhyaṃ smaraṇādeva viṣaṃ nirnāśayiṣyati ।
sthāvaraṃ jaṃgamaṃ caiva kṛtrimaṃ lohaligajaṃ ।।

śaṃkākhyaṃ paṃcapāyacca tadviṣasya cikitsitam ।
mayā te kīrttitaṃ devi adhunā śṛṇu māraṇaṃ ।।

sāvyasya prakṛtiṃ kuryānmāṣāguktavimiśritām ।
(104a)
chāgaraktena cāloḍhya tuṣāṃgārasamīkṛtām ।।

mṛtakarṣaṭagaṃ nāma viṣā(sdṛ)gbhramaraistathā ।
sāvyasya saṃlikhitvā tu vidyayā varitaṃ tataḥ ।।

saṃlikhedasthirā tatra kākotthena mahātape ।
priti māyāṃ hṛdi nṛsya ghorāhni krūravārake ।।

evaṃ sā pratimā bhūyo snāpayettaptavāriṇā ।
gatvā pitṛvaṇaṃ tatra jvālayejjātavedasam ।।

ghorakāṣṭheṃdhane dīpte tāpayettāmakaimukhīm ।
tato niveśayettaptāṃ kruddho vahnimukhātnaro ।।

yāvattāvahyane devi tāvacchaṃtrarvinaśyati ।
yadi sākṣādbhaveddevi brahmalokapitāmahaḥ ।।

tadāsau mārayetsamyagdevi nāstyatra saṃśayaḥ ।
pratyānayananimuktaṃ māraṇaṃ saṃprakāśitam ।।

vidveṣaṇaṃ pravakṣyāmi śatrunāṃ kriyate yathā ।
dvikakauṇikapaṃkṣāṇi gṛhyadhūpaṃ prakalpayet ।।

pratimāyugalaṃ kṛtvā sādhyayorvīravaṃdite ।
mahiṣāśca śirau tau tu mahāviṣavinirmitau ।।

tābhyāṃ hṛdayamadhye tu tattāmāṃkitacīrike ।
niveśye devadeveśi tatastau dhūpayedbhṛṣam ।।

vimukhau tau prakṛtvā tu kruddhe vidyāmudāharet ।
vidveṣitau bhavatāṃ tāvanyonyau (ri)pusannidhau ।।

na tadasti na saṃddiṣṭo tau bhavatāṃ sadaiva hi ।
athoccāṭanamatphagraṃ śṛṇu śakrabhayaṃkaram ।।

vāyumaṇḍalagaṃ nāma kīrotthenāsṛjā likhet ।
kākāsṛjīthavā devi viṣamiśreṇa cālikhet ।।
(104b)
bhūrjapatre devadevi vidyayā pariveṣṭitam ।
taṃ śmaśānadrume baddhaṃ na kṣetre vāyudaivate ।।

vāyukoṇagataṃ maṃtrī proccāṭayati parvatān ।
athānyaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi purakṣobhamanuttamam ।।

yena vijñātamātreṇa sādhakaḥ pūjyatāmiyāt ।
ekāṃtaṃ nirjanaṃ gatvā vīrācārarataḥ sudhīḥ ।।

madirānaṃdacaitanyo vidyākaṃdodarāditām ।
mālayaṃtī jagatsarvaṃ siṃdūrābhaiḥ sphuraliṃgakaiḥ ।।

madirāsāravisarairdeśaṃ pavanameva vā ।
plāvayantāṃ smareddevīṃ māsamekamataṃtritaḥ ।।

tadā kṣubheti te sarve janāstatra nivāsinaḥ ।
sādhakasyāgramāyāṃti yathātīrthamanuttamam ।।

dhanadānāṃ tathātmānaṃ sādhakāya dadaṃti te ।
rājño maṃḍalamevāgryaṃ sādhakāya dadaṃti hi ।।

yasya yasya hi yadratnaṃ tattattasya dadātyasau ।
purakṣobhamidaṃ khyātaṃ nidhisādhanamucyate ।।

japtvāṣṭaśatikaṃ vidyāṃ paścātkarma samārabhet ।
sitarakṣoghnikāṃ gṛhya saptakṛtparimaṃtritām ।।

sāyāhnasamaye prāpte patraśaṃkā sumadhyame ।
tatra tāṃ vācayenmaṃtrī hyuttāne karapūrvadṛk ।।

tadā prabhātasamaye ekībhūtā bhave ghanaḥ ।
śaṃkhacakrādicihnena tattavirtta samādiśet ।।

varttivāmṛtavastrotthāṃ mahātailaplutāṃ priye ।
kṛtvā khaḍgāgragāṃ japtāṃ paryaṭedvitaśaṃkayā ।।

yatra sā patate varttistadrūpaṃ tatra vai dhanam ।
athavā khorikā kāryā tathā vidhirihocyate ।।
(105a)
ādāya lohasaṃbhūtāṃ khorikāṃ bhasmapūritām ।
tatra saṃpūjayeddevīṃ yathā vittānusārataḥ ।।

tadā tāṃ maṃtrayenmaṃtrī saptāviṃśatisaṃkhyayā ।
tadā viṃśati sā tatra muktā vrajati satvaram ।।

mahānidhānaṃ saṃsthānaṃ rasaṃ caiva rasāyanam ।
śrīmukhaṃ cottamaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ sādhakāya pradarśayet ।।

kṣetrapālai mahāghaurai vighnairvā cātidāruṇaiḥ ।
sā nivārayituṃ śakyā na kenacidiheśvarī ।।

evamālokya taṃ sthānaṃ sīmābaṃdhaprayogataḥ ।
baṃdhayitvā japettatra vidyāṃ ghoraparākramam ।।

trirātrākarṣayeddevi nikanaṃ nāgalokagam ।
svayamucchalane bhūmau devadevyā prabhāvataḥ ।।

yatheṣṭaviniyogotra karttavyaḥ sādhakena ca ।
dāridradamanaṃ devi tāvedaṃ saṃprakāśitam ।।

idānīṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi yathā śrīpatitāmiyāt ।
kṛtvā pūrvoktavadyāgaṃ kalaśaṃ tatra rājatam ।।

śatābhimaṃtritaṃ kṛtvā bhadrapīṭhopaveśitam ।
abhiṣiṃcettadātmānaṃ sarvarājopacārataḥ ।।

tataḥ prabhṛtyasau devi yathā lakṣmīpatistathā ।
bhavatyeva na saṃdeho vacastvavitathaṃ mama ।।

bhāgyāvarohametaddhi tavākhyātaṃ suśobhanam ।
yamavāpya narāḥ sarvadāridryānmahato bhayāt ।।

pramucyaṃti na saṃdehaṃ subhagāste bhavaṃti hi ।
atha saṃcārikaṃ karma samāsāttava ka(thya)te ।।
(105b)
mṛtavastumacchidraṃ yattatprāpya parameśvarīm ।
tatra cintāpayeddevīṃ pūrvoktadhyānasaṃsthitām ।।

mahāsṛjā sureśāni śrīgṛhe tāṃ pratiṣṭhayet ।
mahāvibhavasaṃbhārai bahuhomabhavaistathā ।।

tasyāgrataḥ pratiṣṭhāpyācchṛṇu bhāṇḍā yathāvidhi ।
vīvaktrayena deveśi śauṇḍikāmadyabhāṇḍakam ।।

paripūrṇaṃ samāhṛtya devyāgre saṃpratiṣṭhayet ।
tadvattaṃḍolabhāṇḍaikaṃ vīrakramasamāhṛtam ।।

pratiṣṭhayeddevadevi punaśca ghṛtabhāṇḍakam ।
takrabhāṇḍaṃ tathā devi tailabhāṇḍaṃ tathaiva tam ।।

pakvamāṃsamahābhāṇḍaṃ tadvadeva samāharet ।
ikṣubhāṇḍaṃ tadvadeva samāhṛtya nagātmaje ।।

devyāgre tānpratiṣṭhāpya yathā kaścinna paśyati ।
paścājjapettatra vidyāṃ saṃyojya vararaṃjikām ।।

dehi sarvāṇi me devi vyaṃjanānyakṣayāni ca ।
yenāhaṃ niyataṃ yāgatatparasyāṃ (ta)vāgrataḥ ।।

evaṃ māsavicchinnaṃ japaṃ kuryātsumadhyame ।
tataḥ prabhṛti sarvāṇi vyaṃjanāṃnyupatiṣṭhate ।।

devyāgre sādhakasyaiva deśaṣaḍbhāgajāni ca ।
vīrayāgaṃ sadā kāryaṃ tena nityaṃ maheśvari ।।

etattava samākhyāte vīrayāgamanuttamam ।
athārthamakṣayaṃ cecchettadāyaṃ vidhimācaret ।।

gatvā bhūstratāhni samaye haraveśmamataṃdritaḥ ।
tadrākṣataṃ samānīya yuvānaṃ ca śakottamam ।।

taṃ vedimavyagaṃ kṛtvā sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitam ।
(106a)
tasya vakṣasi saṃrūḍha urddhabāhu japennaraḥ ।।

tāvadyāvat prakaṃpeta taṃ śavaṃ ghoranisvanam ।
tadā vadatyasau lubdho dviraṇyāpuranāyakaḥ ।।

sohaṃ betālarājānaḥ kimāhūta(stva)yā vibhoḥ ।
evamākarṇya vīreṃdro tava deva avihvalaḥ ।।

akṣayastvaṃ hemamayī sadā saṅgraha eva hi ।
tiṣṭhanna devadeveśyā dattājñā tava sāṃpratam ।।

evamākarṇya betālo sauvarṇasau bhavettataḥ ।
vyayamatra prakarttavyaṃ chitvāgāni sadaiva hi ।।

punaravā * * niyataṃ bhavaṃtyasya na saṃśayaḥ ।
tena dravyena subhage dīnānāthānpratarpayet ।।

vāpīkūpataḍāgāni nānādevakulāni ca ।
kārayetsatataṃ devi yāgāni vividhāni ca ।।

sādhanāni vicitrāṇi kārayenāvicakṣaṇaḥ ।
saṃca{yaṃ} nātra karttavyaṃ kṛtaṃ vā naśyate tadā ।।

evamakṣayaniṣpattiṃ dravyasya tava kīrttitā ।
yāmavāpyanaraḥ sādhurbhavedvaiśravaṇopamaḥ ।।

vyavahāre tathā (dyū)te saṃgrāme kalahe jayam ।
smaraṇāddevadeveśi prakaroti na saṃśayaḥ ।।

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi śāntikaṃ paramaṃ priye ।
mumūrṣauryena śāntisyātathā śṛṇu sumadhyame ।।

kalaśaṃ ramyamānīya gaṇḍakālādivarjitam ।
kṣīrapūrṇaṃ ca taṃ kṛtvā tatra devīṃ kṛṣodarīm ।।

pūrvadhyānasamopetāṃ tārahārasamanvitām ।
pūjayitvā mahābhāge saptāviṃśatimaṃtritam ।।

kalaśaṃ dāpayenmūrddhni yasya yasya sumadhyame ।
(106b)
tasya tasya bhavecchāntiṃ mumūrṣorapi sarvadā ।।

yoṣṭikaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi yathāvattava sāṃprataṃm ।
kuṃkumaṃ rocanāmiśraṃ kuṃṇḍagolotthasaṃyutaṃm ।।

kṛtvā nāma likhedbhūrje vidyayā vauṣaḍantayā ।
āvaraṃ nāma taddevi āpyāya(na)padairyutam ।।

kṣīrabhāṇḍe vinikṣipya tarppayetkṣīrakarayā ।
tata āpyāyanaṃ devi bhavetsāvyasya sarvadā ।।

nirmalo puṣṭadehaśca gatamṛtyuśca nīrujaḥ ।
sadyo bhavatyasaṃdehāditi śāstrasya niścayaḥ ।।

etadāpoyanaṃ khyātaṃ taṃ ca rāje jayadrathe ।
mateśvarī mahācakkre yā devyo pūrvamuddhṛtāḥ ।।

sarvāsāṃ devatānāṃ ca karmakośaṃ yadīritam ।
tatsāmānyaṃ devadevi yatassarvāssamāstviha ।।

evaṃ vibhedato deve bahubhedā bhavaṃti hi ।
yāvaṃti padabhedāni kathitāniha sāṃpratam ।।

tāvaddhṛdayajānāni devadevyā smṛtāni tu ।
yathaikasyā vidhānaṃ tu sarvāsāṃ tadvadeva hi ।।

ekaikā mokṣadā jñeyā ekaikā sarvasiddhidā ।
ekā devī samākhyātā padabhedaprabhedataḥ ।।

jalakuṃbhesu sūryeva devadevī virājate ।

iti rahasyamidaṃ sakalaṃ mayā
nigaditaṃ tava pārvati suṃdaram ।
matavidhānamidaṃ pravaraṃ maha-
tkimaparaṃ pramadāmi tavādhunā ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃ{ntre} tṛtīyaṣaṭke
matacakkreśvarī sādhanaprakaraṇaṃ nāma caturdaśamaḥ paṭalaḥ ।। ।।
(107a)
samāpto matacakkreśvarīvidhiḥ ।। ।।

evaṃ devī śrutvā haravaktrātkālisarvasvam ।
punarapi rahasyakāmā(śro)tuṃ nijagāda deveśam ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

śrutaṃ mayā devadeva ratnasya paramādbhutaṃm ।
paritṛptāsmi deveśa nānyaṃ kicitprakāṃkṣayet ।।

kiṃtu kautūhalaṃ deva kathaṃ sā kuṇḍaleśvarī ।
yā sarvacakkraṃ kalanīyā kuṃdakuharāśrayā ।।

yā jagajjananī devī jājagatkālikā parā ।
yasyāḥ proccāramātreṇa stubhyate pāśapaṃjaram ।।

yasyā ghoratarā nānyā vidyate bhuvanodare ।
yā samākarṣayejjīvaṃ trailokye sacarācare ।।

nāmākhyāhi sureśāna prasādānmama sarvaga ।
e * mākarṇya deveṃdra uvāca parameśvaraḥ ।।
umāṃ samagrajaṃnanīṃ trailokya(trā)ṇatatparām ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

śṛṇu vīrendravīrendī vidhānamidamadbhutam ।
sarvasampatkaraṃ śreṣṭhaṃ sarvasādhanasiddhidam ।।

sarvasaṃkaradoṣaghnaṃ sarvapāpaharaṃ śubham ।
yasyā nāmagrahādeva kaṃmpate bhuvanodaram ।।

yaduccāraṇamātreṇa yoginīmelakaṃ labhet ।
yā parollāsinī śaktiḥ parāparavibhāgagā ।।

jñānakriyānilayanī icchāciccakkramadhyagān ।
spandodaragatā sūkṣmā susūkṣmāmṛtasaṃdhinī ।।

anaṃgadhenavī khyātā hṛccakkrodaramadhyagā ।
kaṃdakuṇḍalinī rūḍhā prasuptabhujagopamā ।।
(107b)
kalākalāpakalitā sakalākulabhakṣaṇī ।
jagadvitānaśobhāḍhyā jagatāṃ gatiruttamāṃ ।।

sāvyaktā maṃtrarūpeṇa kuladāmarabhairavī ।
tasyādvāramahaṃ vakṣye śṛṇu pārvati tattvataḥ ।।

gatvā vīrendranilayaṃ caṃdanāgurucarcitaḥ ।
madirānaṃdacaitanyo pañcaratnasamācitaḥ ।।

prastarenmātrikāṃ tatra sarvavāṅmayamātarām ।
vīradravyopaliptāyāṃ bhuvi vīrendravaṃditaḥ ।।

saṃpūjyavividhābhogaistato maṃtraṃ samuddharet ।
mahāśūnyaṃ tatpravāhaṃ triśaktiṃ parimaṃditam ।।

tato biṃdu tataścandraṃ tato yonyaṣṭamaṃ punaḥ ।
tadadhā yojayedvi - yonikuṃḍānmaheśvari ।।

aṣṭāviṃśatimaṃ bhadre nādātsaptamasaṃsthitaṃ ।
tadveśmaśirasābhinnaṃ natipraṇavavarjitam ।।

piṃḍametaṃnmahābhāge sarvamatrāraṇiṃ param ।
sarvamaṃtreśvaraṃ sāraṃ sarvamaṃtrapradīpakam ।।

sarvasānnidhyakaraṇaṃ sarvasiddhibharāvahaṃm ।
bhogamokṣapradaṃ sāraṃ devyāpiṃḍamanuttamam ।।

asya devi yadā samyaguccāraṃ kriyate sakṛt ।
tadā prakampate dehaṃ samanāttaṃ na saṃśayaḥ ।।

hṛtcchiraśca śikhāvarmma locanāstravivarjitām ।
dhyānadhyeyavinirmuktāṃ cidacityadamadhyagām ।।

spandamānāṃ pare vyāmni sarvaśaktikalālayām ।
ākālacakkrakuharāṃ cchadarātparakuṇḍalān ।।

prabodhyaguruvaktrottha yu - mīnavivarttavat ।
(108a)
ṣa(ṭmmī)nā saptame mīne vidyuduccaṇḍayogataḥ ।।

nilīnā jvalivaṃtaṃ ca raśmidvayasumaulinam ।
tanmūlaṃ ṣaṭca mīnāni yadāvarttaprayogataḥ ।।

pātajvālāprayogena yadā saṃjvālayejjagat ।
tadoccārenmahāpiṇḍaṃ mīnāvarttī * * * nāt ।।

ekadaṇḍaṃ vaikaliṃgamekamīnaṃ tadā bhavet ।
tadā sā devadeveśī āviśeddehapaṃjaram ।।

mahānaṃdamayo yogī śaktiṃ piṇḍaṃstadā bhavet ।
evaṃ kuṇḍalacakkreśī (piṃḍe)śī kālikā smṛtā ।।

tatpiṇḍaṃ piṇḍakaṃ kuryā(tta)kuṇḍaṃ kuṇḍalāntagam ।
kuṇḍalaṃ kuṇḍagaṃ kṛtvā piṇḍaṃ tanmadhyagaṃ kuru ।।

tanmadhyaprakṣīpenmīnaṃ mīnāvarttagataṃ ca tat ।
tanmīnaprasṛtā jvālā sā jvālā kuṇḍalāntagā ।।

tadantagaṃ golakaṃ syāccatuccāraprabhā(sma)ram ।
etattatpiṇḍavijñānaṃ kuṇḍaleśīmataṃ śubhaṃm ।।

evamāśritya subhage paraṃ nirvāṇabhāgbhavet ।
pātayetsiṃ * vṛṃdānāṃ ghātayetsuradānavām ।।

paṃcāmṛtasamākṛṣṭimprakuryātsādhako balāt ।
anaṃgadhenavīṃ mudrāṃ va - sādhakasattamaḥ ।।

ṣaḍrasāharaṇai śaktaḥ syādasau nātra saṃśayaḥ ।
tāṃ mudrāṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi {nā}mnā cānaṃgadhenavīm ।।

baddhapadmāsanā maṃtrī samakāyaśirodharaḥ ।
vitanārusthalo maṃtrī hastau jā - parikṣipet ।।
(108b)
dvātriṃśaddevatākośaṃ kiṃcidudghāṭya sādhakaḥ ।
tanma(dhye) paradeveśyā yā parābhairavī sthitā ।।

tāmunāmya svamaṃtreṇa aparā parivārataḥ ।
mūlabhūtāṃ prakurvīta vidhṛtaṃ mīnavāhakam ।।

pūrvoktayāgayogena viśantāṃ śivabhairave ।
paramāmṛtasaṃpūrṇa kalaśe śivarakṣite ।।

iyaṃ sā devadeveśi mudrā cānaṃgadhenavī ।
sarvamudrottamā hyeṣā drāvaṇī kṣobhanī parā ।।

etāṃ badhvā sureśāni ṣaḍrasānyāharetpaśoḥ ।
strīvṛṃdamadhye yadyenāṃ baṃdhayet parameśvari ।।

tadā dravanti tāḥ sarvā mudreśvaryāḥ prabhāvataḥ ।
triṃśa(kva)tyestu mudrāṇāṃ purā proktā mayā hi yā ।।

tāsāṃ pradhānabhūteyaṃ mahāmudrā khageśvarī ।
anarghā kṣobhamāyāṃti yogeśvaryassamatrataḥ ।।

āhṛtyajālayogena paśuṃ suravarārcite ।
tatra samyaṅnibadhnīyātsravattaṃ ṣaḍrasāsavam ।।

jvalanmaṃtrāraṇisthāne dhyātatāsyāṃ sumīnavam ।
bhāvyamaṃntiśvarīmehaṃ tenātmānaṃ prata * ryet ।।

evaṃ saptāhamātrāttu paśumāharate balāt ।
jvalajjvālāprayogena jālavaddheṣṭataṃ paśum ।।

mahākūṭena subhage tadā taṃ pādapiṣyati ।
yadā dhārāprayogena vāmācāreṇa suvrate ।।

bhakṣayeddakṣiṇāyāsairvāmadakṣaprabhedataḥ ।
tadā harenmahādevi paṃcamaṃ lavaṇaṃ sadā ।।

mahāśūlena subhage vajragraṃthividāraṇān ।
saptakaṃtu puṭāntasthamojamāharayatyasau ।।
(109a)
gatvā niśāmukhe rātrau harāvāṃsaṃ ma{he}śvari ।
madirānaṃdacaitanyo pūrvayogakṛtālayaḥ ।।

tatra mātreśvarī mudrāṃ baṃdhayed vedimadhyagaḥ ।
kṛtvārddhakuṃcitaṃ jānuṃ vāmāṃ dakṣāṃ prasāritām ।।

vidārya vaktraraṃndhrāni pūrvamudrāsthitastataḥ ।
viparītakṛtau hastau sṛkviṇyaḥ pravidārayet ।।

kiṃcitsaṃlālayejjihvāṃ kuṭeśāṃ ma(dha)sannadet ।
śatārddhaṃ (drā)vadevāsau tāvatsarvāśca devatāḥ ।।

nānārūpādhikāriṇyo mātryo rodanatatparāḥ ।
harṣānmahānaṃdamayāḥ samāgacchaṃti lakṣadhā ।।

ve(ṣṭya)taṃ sādhakaṃ vīraṃ tiṣṭhaṃnyamitavarcasaḥ ।
dadaṃti carukatasya sādhakasya mahātmanaḥ ।।

yena tāsāṃ patirbhūtvā yathāsau bhairaveśvaraḥ ।
tathā bhavaṃtyasaṃdeho vacastvavitaṃthaṃ mama ।।

athavā ghorarāvākhyāṃ mudrāṃ badhvā sureśvari ।
milaṃti mātaraḥ sarvāstāṃ śṛṇuṣva mama priye ।।

palālitṛptaḥ pūrṇātmā gacchet pitṛvanottamam ।
citāmāśritya deveśi sādhakeṃdraḥ prasannadhīḥ ।।

tatropaviśya vīreṃdro pūrvayogakrameṇa tu ।
dakṣiṇaṃ pādamākramya svagudasyādha eva tat ।।

tatropaviśya dhāmākhyāṃ pravisāryārddhakuṃcitam ।
dakṣiṇāvanataṃ gātraṃ dakṣiṇaṃ śrotrataṃ manājña ।।

kiṃcitpracālayettatra vāmenāsyaṃ vidārayet ।
dakṣiṇī koṭare kāryaṃ jihvāṃ saṃlālaye sakṛt ।।

ūrddhavaktraḥ proccareta kharaheṣāravena ca ।
(109b)
kuṭeśvarīṃ devadevīṃ aṣṭadhā hasitena ca ।।

ghorarāvaṃ punarmmadhye kārayeta nagātmaje ।
iyaṃ sā ghorarāvākhyā mudrāmelāpasiddhidā ।।

yāvatsaptasamuccārātprakarotīha sādhakaḥ ।
tāvadāyāṃti tā mātryo ḍāvyo ḍāmarikāstathā ।।

kṛtvā kalakalārāvaṃ sādhakasyāgrataḥ priye ।
vaṃdayitvā sādhakeṃdraṃ yathā devīṃ karaṃkiṇī ।।

vadanti sarva evaitā bho bhoḥ sādhakanāyaka ।
vicarasva sahāsmākaṃ yatra te rocate manaḥ ।।

bhava tvaṃ prabhurasmākaṃ yatāsau bhairaveśvaraḥ ।
evaṃ śrutvā tatastāsāṃ bhihvāvāsāṃ gamātmanaḥ ।।

deyameghe devadevi kūṭeśvaryābhimaṃtritam ।
datterghe bhavate tāsāṃ patireva hi sādhakaḥ ।।

cakkreśvaro mahātejā sarvadeveśvarārcitaḥ ।
atha vīro giripṛṣṭhe vidhānamidamācaret ।।

ba(dhvā)ghoraravāmudrāṃ sthitvā mīnakule (sva)payam ।
chitvā mohamahāpāśaṃ gṛhāvaktreṃcuruttamaṃm ।।

dukireddevadeveśi pavadrātrau gatavyathaḥ ।
tāvadāyāṃti yoginyo sādhakasyāgratastadā ।।

tāsāṃ patirasau bhūtvā modate bhairaveva hi ।
athānugratnakṛnmaṃntī vīrādānavikairataḥ ।।

saṃsārārṇavasanmagnāṃ dṛṣṭvā kāntaṇiko ya - ।
tadā teṣāṃ prakurvīta dīkṣāṃ pāśavināśanī ।।

nāmnā nirvāṇikīṃ siddhāṃ sadyaḥ pratyayakārikām ।
(110a)
vivartyaṣa - - mīnaṃ pṛṣṭhāghātena suṃdari ।।

tatra garbhasthitā bādhya kuṃḍalākāravigrahā ।
paṃcavaktrī mahāghorā bhoginī bhujagāśinī ।।

yāvadāghātayogena tāṃ svapnāmāhānennaraḥ ।
tāvatprabodhamāyāti ghorā viśvakṣayākulā ।।

vidārya vadanāḥ paṃca pañcanāthātsamāharan ।
udgacchati ca sā kruddhā bhoginī bhogalampaṭā ।।

niyojayetpare dehe śaktimūlasamāśritaḥ ।
tasmādraṃdhraviniṣkrāṃtā punaḥ śiṣyaśarīrato ।।

yāvattaddhṛdayaṃ devi tatkuśeṣayamavyagām ।
tatra taccittasahitāṃ prerayeddvādaśāntaram ।।

visargapadasaṃsthānaṃ yāvattatra niyojitām ।
ciccida (sva)ragā kṛtvā tadaikyaṃ yāvadeva hi ।।

tāvatsa vedhito devi kiṃcidākaṃpamāpnuyāt ।
romoḍgamayutaḥ sā suvepate kiṃcideva hi ।।

paścādānaṃdamatulaṃ svarūpavyaktihetukaṃ ।
cidekaṃtānatā jāye hutvakartṛtva lakṣaṇā ।।

tadā sā muktaḥ saṃsārādbhavatyeva kimadbhutam ।
evaṃ dīkṣā samākhyātā kuṇḍamaṇḍalavarjitā ।।

sarvasiddhipradāsārā durlabhā tridaśeṣvapi ।
evaṃ saṃdīkṣito yo vai sabhavedbhairavasvayam ।।

śāpānugrahakṛdvīro darśanātkalmaṣāpahaḥ ।
athānyaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi ghaṭṭanaṃ nāma bhairavi ।।

- - mavāvya susiddhaḥ syāt sādhakeṃdro maheśvari ।
(110b)
ākramya bhairavīmudrāṃ savaṃdrāṃvajñapaṃjaram ।।

saṃkocakena saṃpīḍya tiṣṭhettāvat suniścalaḥ ।
ākampayettataḥ kiṃcit spandanodaramavyagam ।।

tatra sacālanaṃ kṛtvā yuktyā tāvat prapīḍayet ।
tadā pāśāṃ vinaśyaṃti vyaktimāyāti tatra yam ।।

naraśaktiśivākhyaṃ yattripiṃḍasāmudāyikam ।
tena vyaktena subhage sarvasiddhyarhatā bhavet ।।

sarvamaṃtreśvarasvāmī sādhakeṃdro bhavettadā ।
etadghaṭṭanamuddiṣṭaṃ svasvarūpaprakāśakam ।।

adhunā saṃpravakṣyāmi nirodhaṃ parameśvarī ।
yena caṃdrāṃrkayorjāyenmanasaśca nirodhanam ।।

sthitvā kūṭeśvarīcakkre sarvavṛttisamanvitaḥ ।
staṃbhitau tau prakarttavyau caṃdrārkau yugayogataḥ ।।

īśadudghāṭitakośaṃ patratau sarvadā sthitau ।
citsvarūpasvarūpātmā śivasadbhāvabhāvitaḥ ।।

asaḍgrahagrahatyāgāṃmavyamudrāvalambakaḥ ।
yadārarastadā jāyennirodhaḥ paramātmani ।।

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi yathā saṃvittiruttamā ।
paramātmani jāyeta sādhakasya mahātmanaḥ ।।

sthitaḥ kūṭeśvarīcakkre graseccāṃdraṃ kalākulam ।
tāvadyāvaddhṛdhnacakkraṃ tadraśyaughaṃ samāpibet ।।

piṇḍasaṃkocayogena paramātmā prakāśate ।
tatsvarūpe svasaṃvittiḥ svātmanaḥ pratipatsyati ।।

paramātmani saṃvittistaveyaṃ saṃprakāśitā ।
mudrāmaṃtrapadavyaktiryena jāyeti sasphurā ।।
(111a)

sasphuraṃ kaulikāmnāyaṃ samāsāttava kīrttitam ।
śūnyatrayamato devi śṛṇu vakṣyāmi sāṃpratam ।।

śivaḥ svabhāvato bhāvairasaṃpṛktaśca bhāmini ।
nāsvādyate kadācicca tairmahāmohapūrvakaiḥ ।।

atastaṃ śūnyamityuktaṃ dīpanirvāṇavaṃ na hi ।
yadā svena svarūpeṇa paripūrṇena sarvadā ।।

triśaktiṃ vyaktikamātmātiṣvatyamitavarcasaḥ ।
tadā śūnyaḥ śivaḥ prokto na tu pāśā nava * nmṛt ।।

vīryaprasārasaṃkocā(tsthā)tmanyaiva layālaye ।
śaktimadrūpatāmeti yadā devaḥ śivo vyayaḥ ।।

tadā śūnyeti vijñeyaṃ sadasatyaṃdavarjavān ।
śaktiḥ prasarasaṃrūḍhā tenaivāsau vibhāvyate ।।

aṇḍamaṇḍalabhāvaiśca sarvadā sā na lipyate ।
atastadrahitatvātmā tacchūnyā śaktiriśyate ।।

śūnyaṃ citparamaṃ devi saṃvicchūnyeti gīyate ।
tadrūpā śaktiratulā yadā śūnyā tadā hi sā ।।

prakṛtyādiguṇairdevi tathāṃtaḥkaraṇe nava ।
viṣayairbhūtavargaiśca yatpalācchurirai sadā ।।

na lipyeta na hīyeta tanmahatpauruṣaṃ vapuḥ ।
ataḥ śūnyaṃ ca taddhamairnarameva {pra}kīrttitam ।।

evaṃ śūnyatrayaṃ devi naraśaktiśivātmakam ।
asmiṃ taṃtravare khyātaṃ prāptiratra śṛṇu priye ।।

hṛtpadmakuharāttasthaṃ citsvarūpamanāmayam ।
tatra cāṃdrakalājālāṃ pibadvṛttibahiṣṭatam ।।

saṃghaṭṭasaṃpuṭenaiva prayogena surārcite ।
tadā narākhyaśūnyasya bhavedyaktiḥ sumadhyame ।।
(111b)
tatsvarūpasamāpattyā sarvasiddhiguṇodayaḥ ।
bhavetsādhakamukhyasya māsamātrānna saṃśayaḥ ।।

nāḍicakkreśvaro devi yadā sūryātte saṃpuṭe ।
madhyamārgādayasthityā viśrāmaṃ yāti suṃdari ।।

tadā śaktiṃ hi yacchūnyaṃ prakaṭaṃ jāyate sadā ।
tatrārūḍhaḥ sādhakeṃdro devatāvṛṃdamuttamam ।।

nānārūpadharaṃ devi paśyatyevānivāritam ।
sarvamaṃtrakrame devi prabhutā cāsya jāyate ।।

vedhapātādi kurute līyate vā hi sādhakaḥ ।
paradehapraveśādi mṛtajīvaprabhedataḥ ।।

karoti līlayā maṃtrī śaktiśūnyaniṣevarāt ।
rūpādrūpasahasrāṇi kṣaṇādeva karotyasau ।।

maṃtracakkraṃ ca subhage vidyācakkraṃ samaṃḍalam ।
mudrācakkraṃ ca deveśi śakticakre dṛḍhīkṛte ।।

sarvaṃ kiṃkaratāṃ yāti sādhakasya mahātmanaḥ ।
athobhayātmakaṃ śūnyaṃ śivākhyaṃ yatprakīrttitam ।।

tasya svarūpasubhage śṛṇu vakṣyāmi yādṛśam ।
anantaṃ paripūrṇañca sarvatāditabhāsuram ।।

ādima - - rahitaṃ ākarāveyavarjitam ।
ūrddhamadhyādhanirmuktaṃ kriyāguṇavivarjitam ।।

kālavelāvinirmuktaṃ caṃdrasūryalayātigam ।
digdeśacārarahitaṃ vicāraguṇavarjitam ।।

vāgatītaṃ paraṃdhāma dhāmnāmapi sadaivatam ।
svasvarūpaṃ svabhāvākhyaṃ citparaṃ parameśvaram ।।

sarvaprapaṃcarahitaṃ pramāṇātītagocaram ।
(112a)
svasaṃvedyaṃ svaprakāśaṃ bodha(ni)rvāṇamavyagam ।।

guruvaktrāgamenaiva tatsvarūpaikatānatā ।
bhavatyeva susaṃsiddhaḥ sādhakeṃdro na saṃśayaḥ ।।

sarvasiddhisusaṃpūrṇaḥ sādhakeṃdro yathā śivaḥ ।
etattṛśūnyavijñānaṃ samāsātte prakīrttitam ।।

adhunā saṃpra * kṣyāmi nistaraṃgaṃ paraṃ priye ।
yena vijñātamātreṇa sarvasiddhiyuto bhavet ।।

taṃtrarājamidaṃ muktvā nānyatra pravicāritam ।
kramāgatamidaṃ jñānaṃ vaktrādvaktrapratiṣṭhitam ।।

sarvakriyāvirahitaṃ tistaraṃgamanāpamam ।
na kasyacinma(yā) proktaṃ tvaṃ muktvā parameśvari ।।

pañcametatsamākhyāta tristaraṃgārusāriṇam ।
atisū(kṣma)gururbhūtaṃmatihṛdyodayaṃ mahān ।।

kṣarākṣaravibhāgaṃ ca viśvasaṃtānabodhanam ।
prabhutvābhāvasaṃlakṣaṃ mahānaṃdaṃ mahāvyayam ।।

karmāttaṃ karmmabhavānta karmakāraṇasattamam ।
karmajāparasadrūpaṃ santānaṃ yatsadatpadam ।।

oṃ mityekākṣaraṃ padaṃ viśvabhūtaprabodhanam ।
caitanyamayamadvaitaṃ śaṃkaraṃ tamaniṃditam ।।

sohaṃ mayaiva sau nityaṃ tasyāhaṃ (so)hameva ca ।
icchādharmeṇa lokeyaṃ mamaiva parikalpitaṃm ।।

sarvāvasthāhamevaiṣāṃ viharāmyaprakāśitam ।
kalpayāmyātmanātmānaṃ svataṃtrenaiva hetunā ।।

kalpanākalpitaṃ cakkraṃ yatkiṃcit sacarācaram ।
sarvabhūtāntarāvasthaṃ bhūtātitamalepakam ।।
(112b)
cijyotirūpamātmānaṃ tadahaṃ sarvadṛksadā ।
amātronaṃtamātrākhyā mātrābhāvāntare sthitaḥ ।।

anādiravyayo draṣṭā nirguṇaḥ sarvapūrakaḥ ।
sattvādiguṇabhūteṣu śāntiṣu susamāhitaḥ ।।

nistaraṃgodadhiprakhyo tadahaṃ nityayuktadhīḥ ।
caitanyadhāmavitteṣu bhūteṣvapi vicārakaḥ ।।

saṃvitti yena yo jātaḥ sadbrahma iti sohyaham ।
yatkiṃcitsvasamādhistho buddhyādiguṇalakṣaṇaiḥ ।।

pralayo yena vindanti tasya yonirahaṃ prabhuḥ ।
dhāmārciṣāṃ tathā bhūto śāṃto hṛnmadhyamaṃdrāla ।।

brahmadhāmavihīnātmā śuddhabuddhiḥ sayogirāṭ ।
iṃdriyārtheṣu mūḍhātmā na virakto vicārakaḥ ।।

yo na yuktassanirvāṇe kṛtabuddhistadā viśet ।
anādi tena bhāvena nirvikalpena yatsukham ।।

yena yuñjjanti sadbrahma yuñjjanasya śivaḥ prabhuḥ ।
sārthābuddhimanaḥ sārthaṃ yadādicchaktimaṇḍale ।।

niṣvātenaivamārgeṇa śivatvaṃ pratipadyate ।
budvyudreke padānaṣṭo manohaṃkāra eva ca ।।

tadā paramayā śaktyā praviśecchivamaṇḍale ।
saṃvittiryā śivasārddhaṃ bhūtapralayage bhavet ।।

anādibodhasaṃbuddhasahamevāvicārakaḥ ।
spandanā yā samutpannā svayaṃbhūśaktimaṃḍale ।।

nispandane yadā līnā svapratiṣvastadā śivaḥ ।
amanīyo manīyastu mabuddhobuddhigocare ।।

aṃtīdriyama[yo]jovyaktaṃ svabhāvo bhāvavarjitaḥ ।
anādi tasya bhāvasya yo na bhāvena yatpadam ।।
(113a)
bhāvayeta sa ātmā vai tadahaṃ sarvadṛksadā ।
avyaktasya yadātmānāṃ vyaktībhūtaṃ yadā bhavet ।।

abhāvaṃ sarvabhāvānāṃ bhāvānāṃ puruṣaṃ prati ।
bhairavākhyā mahātaṃtu tayā protamidaṃ jagat ।।

bandhanī sarvabhūtānāṃ mohanī sa carācare ।
anayotthāpitaṃ cakkraṃ nānābhāvamayā yataḥ ।।

jāgrati svapite(bhā)ṣā devasyoccāraṇāhatā ।
bhairavākhyā mahāmāyā caturbhedena bhedavit ।।

prakṛti{puruṣa}syeyaṃ sūkṣmāṃ taddharmmacāriṇī ।
antasthā sarvabhūtānāṃ veto bhūtena lakṣitā ।।

rakṣitā kṣnīṇacittānāṃ brahmasadmasahāyinām ।
avijñātā tamokrāṃtaloke mūḍhatvamāgate ।।

brahmakramaviniṣkrāṃtā raśmireṣā mahojvalā ।
yoginaśca parābuddhiścakṣuḥ sarvārthadakṣiṇaṃ ।।

dṛṣṭau ṣā hyaparābrāhmī vāmadevamaye śive ।
śottā(sū)kṣmā parā(jyo)tiḥ parameśvaracāriṇī ।।

sarvadharmmāmparityajye yadā hyeṣā samāśritā ।
tadā khavidhinirmukto nirīho nispṛhaḥ suciḥ ।।

mahāharamayīśaktirbhavāmi paramārthataḥ ।
yasminvilīyate bhāve satvādiguṇasantate ।।

madābhavaḥ paro nāsti tacchaivaṃ paramaṃ padam ।
kṣaṇenaikena bhūtānāmutpādo bhogasatkṣayam ।।

tasyaiṣā viṃdate sarvaṃ tacchaivaṃ paramaṃ padam ।
yā kalā kālasaṃyuktā vikalā kālavarjitā ।।

sā kalā darśayetkālaṃ sā kalā kālameva ca ।
caṃdrārkādikalā yasyā grāseva patitā mukhe ।।
(113b)
sā kalā bhakṣitā yena niṣkalaḥ sa nigadyate ।
sarvabhūtamayo hyātmā kasyaikatvaṃ na lupyate ।।

bhogī karakaraḥ śāntaṃ turyā bhūtvā na muhyati ।
yadā na buddhyate buddhirviṣayārthena vit * * ।।

tadā patitvaṃ prāpnoti svānaṃdapratibodhitā ।
ānandakalpanājāle dharmādharmakṣayodaye ।।

nāśivaṃ kiṃcidastīti nistaraṃgeṣu niścayaḥ ।
vijñānasaṃpralīnānāṃ bhāvanā yā samutthitā ।।

spaṃdanā puṇyapāpebhyo yā yaiṣā na phalodaye ।
sā vidyamānā śarīresmin viśvato galayodayam ।।

yayā suniścitaṃ manye muktiḥ karatale sthitā ।
vāmamātrādviniṣkrāṃtā dhā(ma)dhāmnisamanvitā ।।

caitanyadhāma cātmānaṃ gaṃdhādīnāṃ muṇacati ।
na nirodhā na coccāro na vicāro vikalpanā ।।

kālapra * yamadvaitaṃ nistaraṃgeṣu niścayam ।
yathābhūtapṛthagbhāvamekasmiṃmekamāgatam ।।

viśvaṃ tadruditaṃ buddhyā na cāstyasyā vicitratā ।
tyaktadharmetha niḥsaṃge nirīhe buddhilakṣaṇe ।।

advaitapadasaṃlīne kā spṛhā sukhaduḥkhayoḥ ।
cittadharmakṣayadharme yā dharmasyāvalokanā ।।

suniścitapadecchāttaṃ dharmapaśyati yoginaḥ ।
prabuddhe kalpanājāle śaktyānandapariplute ।।

śivāditamahaṃmanye dharmādharmeṣu kā spṛhā ।
kalāvalayamadhyasthā vaivatye jyotirujjvalā ।।

mohanī sarvabhūtānāṃ śivasyaṃ sahadharmiṇīn ।
(114a)
bhūteṣu sarvabāheṣu yā cetāddhāmarūpiṇī ।।

ghaṭeṣvākāśavatsaukṣmyā sthitā sā karmasākṣiṇī ।
agrā(hyā) karmmabandhasya sarvabhogeṣu kā spṛhā ।।

svāṃmaprabodhasaṃbuddhā śivasyāvyabhicāriṇī ।
icchāmātreṇa yenedaṃ sarvakīḍātmakaṃ kṛtam ।।

advayaḥ sarvabhūtānāṃ svayaṃvīraḥ svayaṃprabhuḥ ।
sarvabhāvānvayenāve yadbhāvaṃ bhāvitaṃ mayā ।।

tadahaṃ nityasadbhāvaṃ nirvāṇekā vikalpanā ।
yadā satyānṛte śāṃte śāntirjātā hyadāntare ।।

tadā śāṃtyāsu śāṃtohaṃ krīḍaṃtaṃ dehināṃ sthitaṃm ।
sarvajñassarvagaḥ śāntaḥ kāmānāmapyakāṃkṣiṇaḥ ।।

sarvaśaktissadā tṛpto nirvāṇa iti tadviduḥ ।
śāntaviśvamidaṃ citraṃ cidrūpaṃ cittavarjitam ।।

ajena tu ajaṃ buddhyāmityeṣāḥ paramārthataḥ ।
śabdādiguṇasaṃvetti vyajyatāśakti gocaret ।।

gopitā sā padā yena taṃchivaṃ paramārthataḥ ।
nivṛttiḥ sarvaduḥkhānāṃ śaktivyāpyā na saṃśayaḥ ।।

anākhyānaṃdasaṃtṛpti śiva ityabhidhīyate ।
nānābhāvatvamadvaitā jātaṃ bhūteṣu sarvadā ।।

sarveṣāṃmadvaye śāṃtirityeṣāṃ paramārthataḥ ।
ānandakarṣaṇī sa(stā) yasya hyātmā niraṃtaraḥ ।।

sa muktassarvabandhebhyo dharmaḥ pūjyassamārthataḥ ।
advaite baṃdhanaṃ nāsti nityatṛptasya kā spṛhā ।।
(114b)
ahameva parajyotiḥ sarveṣāmupari sthitam ।
amanīyamabuddhohamadraṣṭavyohamaśrutam ।।

ātmānamātmanā draṣṭubhūtabhāvavivarjitam ।
māyāhaṃ sarvabhūtānāṃ pitaraṃ ca pitāmaham ।।

kāṃtā viśvasya saṃharttā niṣkaṃpaṃ supratiṣṭhitaḥ ।
yatroditamidaṃ citraṃ viśvaṃ yatrāstametpunaḥ ।।

sattāmātraṃ parohyātmā svayamevā tu bhūpate ।
pralaye sarvakāmānāṃ yatsukhenattarahyate ।।

samyaksunirastamitā sā samādhi samādhinām ।
buddhyādiguṇanirmukto nisyaṃgenāttarātmanā ।।

caitanyapadamāsādyassamādhissattvalakṣaṇaḥ ।
cetaḥ śarīranimuktā nistaraṃge hyakalpanān ।।

anādibodhaḥ saṃbuddhā sā samādhiḥ samādhinān ।
yasmiṃ viśvamidaṃcha te yo jāgrati sanātane ।।

tamānaṃdamajaṃ sūkṣmaṃ sarveṣāmapi durlabhaṃ ।
jāgre jāgrati bhāvānāṃ svapne svapnaṃ ca na svapet ।।

jāgrasvapnorvinimuktā suptā jāgrati yoginaḥ ।
jāgreṇa svapate yastu svapne nidrā na sevati ।।

ajo ca nidramasvapnamajasyāvidisettadā ।
saṃto na dṛśyate jāgre sattasvapnena dṛśyate ।।

sattaḥ paśyati sarvātmā jāgrasvapnasya yā spṛhā ।
vyastīkṛtaṃ yadā jāgraṃ svapne jāgravidutthite ।।

vicāresu prasāntānāṃ bhāvānāṃ hi vivekataḥ ।
vivekā bo(dhya)te jāgre svapne nidryavivarjite ।।

ajānandamajājāṃnāmajasyājaṃ vilīpate ।
(115a)
tatsvasuptasya taṃ svapnaṃ jāgraṃ tatparikīrttitam ।।

brahmaṇyā labdhalakṣāṇā nānābhāveṣu raṃjanām ।
jāgrasvapnāvṛtābuddhi na tu sūkṣmā tadarśani ।।

yasmiṃ jāga na ca svapnaṃ suṣuptaṃ nopapadyate ।
nānābhāvavira(ktasyā) tadantasthā śivāvyayaḥ ।।

svapne suṣuptatāyāte jāgrato nirvikārake ।
suṣupte jāgrasaṃsvapne jāgro jāgrati sarvadā ।।

{sarvvarūpasya sāmānyaṃ sarvvaceteṣu cetanaṃ ।।
svayamevātmanātmānaṃ paśyāmi parameśvaraṃ ।।

paśyatānye hato bhāva sarvabhāveṣu sarvvadā ।।}

vijñānaṃ paramātmānaṃ vijñāne saṃpralīyate ।
kāmaṃ kāmayataḥ kāmaṃ kāmaḥ kāmena kāmayet ।।

kāmaḥ kāmaṃ sa vai kāme kāmo brahmasanātanaḥ ।
advaitapadamāpannacitte tattvavivarjite ।।

satyāvṛtamaye vadhe baṃdhanaṃ nopajāyate ।
pṛthagkṛmniksusaṃghaṭṭasattatiryā vilīnatā ।।

antaḥ sukhī parānaṃde vaktā śrotā ca durlabhaḥ ।
buddhirvilīyate buddhāṃ manaṃ manasi tiṣṭhati ।।

prāṇapralīyate dhāmi tatsasarvakriyetsadā ।
cidāguṇamayī bhāsā bhūteṣvekā vyavasthitā ।।

nyastavyā stamayā bhāsā turyo bhūtā na śocati ।
buddhiprakāśitā yena niṣkrāmā tatsvarūpiṇī ।।

buddhiprakāśitā yastu svayaṃ buddho mahaddhayaḥ ।
buddhipralīyate buddhau buddhādbuddhiḥ prajāyate ।।

buddhyo saṃbodhitaṃ viśvaṃ buddhervādhāra vidyate ।
kāmeṣu śaṃgatābuddhindasyāṣṭādbhūtapaṃjarāt ।।

advaitaḥ paramānaṃde buddhirlīnā na (buddhya)ti ।
durbodhaḥ sarvabodhā * * * (buddhyā) nibodhakaḥ ।।
(115b)
ātmānamātmanā(buddhyā) (boddhyā)nmāhamaniṃditaḥ ।
viparyassarvabhūtānāṃ niṣkaṃpaḥ supratiṣṭhitaḥ ।।

advaitānmāparājyoti svayaṃ buddhaḥ parāparā ।
raviḥ pradīpako loke sūryamadhyā samutthitaḥ ।।

raveścaivetthitā bhānu bhāsayattyakhilaṃ jagat ।
sūryāmṛtaṃ sakṛṣya * somo bhūtāśca tarpayet ।।

bhūtāmṛtaṃ samākṛṣya somo sūryasya tarpayet ।
raveramṛtarasmisyādbhāvānāṃ yoniravyayaḥ ।।

anastamitasārūpā jagadākarṣaṇe kṣamān ।
sphuratyarkavatī nāḍī dravate sacarācaram ।।

candrakṣayakarī sā tu bhairavī mūrttiravyayāḥ ।
dravanā sarvabhūtānāṃ yathaivātmā vilokanam ।।

śaktispandanamātreṇa tathāpi parivigrahet ।
nṛsūtā jīvasaṃtṛptā vaktā bhairavatarpaṇe ।।

akāmā sarvakāmajñā satī niṣkāsakāminī ।
svarūpā bhūtacitrārttā līnā bhairavarakṣitāḥ ।।

bhūtaprabhūtā jāyaṃte līnā caitanyaṃ tatpade ।
śātte śāntimavāpnoti bhairave supratiṣṭhite ।।

ātmānamanyate spandaṃ nṛtaṃ paśyati sarvaśaḥ ।
akṛtaṃ kalpyanādharmmamamṛtaṃccaiva mātmanān ।।

acakṣuḥ sarvadṛkproktā nisrotaḥ paramātmanaḥ ।
amanyo manyate viśvaṃ abuddho buddhyate sadā ।।

prabhavaḥ sarvakāmānāṃ dharmāṇāṃmaspṛhaḥ sadā ।
satyānṛtatiraskāraṃ saṅkalpaprabhavaḥ prabhuḥ ।।
(116a)
nirīha jyotiradvaitaspaṃdānānandavarjitaḥ ।
cittabhāsādvinimuktau ccaitanyehamakalpitā ।।

viśvotsavanirāraṃbhakalpanārahite dvaye ।
hyatīṃdriye nirābhāseccaitanyasya svarūpataḥ ।।

sūtapadmāntare sūttaṃ bhṛṅgaṃ bhramati sarvadā ।
ānaṃndasya parāvasthā paramānaṃdamucyate ।।

(svā)naṃdamadhusaṃpanna śrāntaḥ svapati nirbhayaḥ ।
sarvāvasthādvinirmukta yadānaṃdaṃ pravarttate ।।

parānaṃdoditaḥ prāṇa prabhavaḥ sarvacetane ।
tatraivāyāpyatāṃ bhūyaḥ prāṇāyāma iti smṛtaḥ ।।

prāṇe dhyāne paraṃ prāṇaṃ prāṇinā prāṇamāhṛtam ।
(dhyā)no hyātmātmānātarkya prāṇena paramātmanaḥ ।।

same prāṇaṃ samaṃ prāṇaṃ prāṇe prāpyati taṃ prabhum ।
sa ca nāḍī pade prāpte mamādhisthe pravakṣyate ।।

svānaṃdanaṃditaṃ prāṇaṃ prāṇaṃ viśvaṃ carācaram ।
apāne viśvamākṛṣya prāṇasyaivāttare viśen ।।

uditasyaiva prāṇasya vaiśvarūpye prapadyate ।
asaṃkhyāmūrttayastasya niṣpataṃti śarīriṇaḥ ।।

sandhasomapadāgrasto bhāskarāgrasito rajaḥ ।
tamopāvakadharmasthāmavyajyotisanātanam ।।

jyotirniveśitā dhāmnā manobuddhirahaṃ kṛtau ।
tasmiṃ pralīyate prāṇaṃ tajyotiḥ paramātmanaḥ ।।

tatparaṃ cittaviśrāmaṃ citsatvāṃśuprakāśakam ।
cittāvabodhaṃ cittasthaṃ cinmayaṃ cittavarjitam ।।

sarvāraṃbhaviniṣkrāntaṃ cittaṃ yasmisuniścaram ।
(116b)
aliṃganamanābhāsaṃ brahmaiva paramārthataḥ ।।

kāmeṣvasaṃgataṃ cittaṃ caitanyā puṃ niśevitam ।
supratiṣṭhaṃ paraṃ haṃsaṃ brahmaiva paramārthataḥ ।।

yadā sarvamayaṃ cittaṃ svatatraṃ brahmaniśritam ।
anākhyānaṃdaviśrāmaṃ labdhā bhūyo na jāyate ।।

citta eva hi jāyante pūrve janani nispṛhaḥ ।
tataḥ sakalpajā dharmā sarve nānātvamāgatā ।।

cittā eva hi jāyantaṃ sarvabhavena sarvadā ।
saṃsaratyātmanā buddhyai yadātmānaṃ na paśyati ।।

saṃsārapādapasyāsya yāvadbījaṃ na naśyati ।
tāvatkarmaphalākrāntaṃ mṛtaśvetansajāyate ।।

cūḍasya dhānakā sūkṣmā vṛkṣaṃ jāye bṛhaṃ tadā ।
yāvanna dhānakādagnā tāvadāva iti sthitaḥ ।।

cittaṃ hi dhānakādharma caitanyāgrau yadāhutaṃ ।
saṃsārasya vaḍasyāsya na jātirjāyate punaḥ ।।

tāvatsaṃsāradharmoyaṃ yāvaccittamanekaka ।
svapratiṣṭhaṃ sthiraṃ cittaṃ tadeva paramaṃ padam ।।

anekacittavibhrāṃtościtte naivāpapadyate ।
antaḥ sukhamayīdrekā cittamityabhidhīyate ।।

tatprājyajāyate cittaṃ na kecit kasyacit kvacit ।
icchādharmapravṛttasya parataṃtratvamāgataḥ ।।

yathājātena jātāyaṃ pāśairātmani kalpitaḥ ।
baṃdhayatyātmanātmānaṃ kāśakāro kṛmiryathā ।।

abhyāsayogasaṃyukto nityayuktaḥ sacāṃtivat ।
daiśikādeśasaṃtuṣṭā svātmasantā samīhitaḥ ।।
(117a)

ekāntaśīlasādhuśca bhūtānāmabhayapradaḥ ।
sarveṃdriyāni saṃyamya manohṛdi niyamya ca ।।

manobuddhirahaṃkāro tapaścāścātmanastathā ।
atha sarvāṇi bhūtāni tasminneva niveśayet ।।

tasmātpravarttate sargaṃ tasminneva nivarttate ।
antaḥsukhamayī buddhiścaitanyajyotiravyayā ।।

ātmā sarvasya lokasya sāvasthātrāpavarjitaḥ ।
tāvadvikalpito bhāvaḥ sarvāvasthā svabhāvitaḥ ।।

yāvadātmani nātmānaṃ na viṃdati na paśyati ।
yadā sarvamayo hyātmā ekatvenātmani sthitaḥ ।।

ātmānamātmanā paśyenmeghayukto yathā raviḥ ।
dhvastamohotha niḥsaṃgo nirīhināntarātmanā ।।

vijñānānyāpare brahme niveśya paramātmani ।
yasmiṃ nivarttitaḥ pāśai tasmai duḥkhāni sarvaśaḥ ।।

sarvvadvaṃdvavinādārthaṃ pratyagātmani mokṣadaḥ ।
ādityacakṣurviśvātmā brahmaivātmāmṛtaṃ bhavet ।।

ityevaṃ yasvamūllāsaṃ biṃdaṃti svaniraṃtaram ।
advaitaṃ paramānaṃdaṃ niṣkaṃpaṃ supratiṣṭhitam ।।

na tatpaśyāmi yasyāhaṃ na tatpaśyāmi yanmama ।
ahamevoditaḥ śāṃtaḥ sarvajñaḥ sarvvakṛtprabhuḥ ।।

jagajjanetā {bha}rttāhaṃ pitaraṃ ca pitāmaham ।
ahaṃ sarvagataḥ prāṇaḥ prāṇahīnaḥ prabhuḥ paraḥ ।।

paraspararato nāsti mamaiva paramātmanaḥ ।
ekatvena bahutvena nistaraṃgohameva ca ।।

paraḥ saṃpūrṇarūpohaṃ trailokyabharaṇātmakaḥ ।
(117b)
bhairavaḥ sunirābādho paramānaṃdaṃ bṛhitaḥ ।
nistaraṃgamidaṃ khyātaṃ vijñānaṃ sūrapūjite ।।

dhyānadhyeyavinimuktaṃ ihākāmavivarjitam ।
etatsarvaṃ samākhyātaṃ rahasyaṃ cādbhutaṃ (pri)ye ।।

kuṃḍaleśāmanantā{bha}manābhaktāya pradāpayet ।
devī taṃtraratānāṃ ca dātavyāmiha sundari ।। ।।

।। iti bhairava(sto)tasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
kuṇḍaleśvarīvidhī । pañcadaśamaḥ paṭalaḥ ।। 988 ।।

devyuvāca ।।

bhagavaṃtvaṃ suraśreṣṭhaṃ śaśāṃkāṃkitaśekharam ।
vīraṃ vīreśvaraṃ deva bhairavaṃ bhāsurānanam ।।

yogagamyaṃ sureśānaṃ vidyādehamanāmayam ।
śrutā vidyā mahābhāgā kālarātrī mahābalā ।।

mahāmārī mahāghorā sarvapratyaṃgirā dvayam ।
matacakkreśvarī devī tathānyā kuṃḍaleśvarī ।।

yāmalesmiṃ mahāmukhye taṃtrarāje jayadrathe ।
mahāvidyeśvarī ghorā vidyāsārasamuccayam ।।

adyāpi saṃśayo mesti sādhakānāṃ hitāya vai ।
ekākṣarāṃ kathaṃ devī kālasaṃkarṣaṇīparā ।।

ka(thaṃ) vā vāgbhavāṃ deva vidyācakkravikaisthitam ।
etat sarvvaṃ maheśāna yadi tuṣṭomi meva ca ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

sādhu sādhu mahāprājñe jñānagarbha mama priye ।
brahmāviṣṇusureṃdrāṇāṃ somasūryāgnimārutām ।।

na mayā kasya vikhyātaṃ tatte vakṣyāmyanindite ।
(118a)
ekākṣarā mahāvidyā raudrakarmakarīparā ।।

aprakāśyā mahābhāgā vāgbhaveśī subhairavā ।
aṣṭānavatilakṣāṇi saptāsaptatikoṭayaḥ ।।

mama vidyā mahāghorā nisṛtā bhairavānanāt ।
tāḥ sarvāḥ svapatiryuktā asyā vidyā sureśvari ।।

koṭyaṃśena na tulyāsyā vāgbhaveśyā sadaiva hi ।
yattacchāntamajaṃ devaṃ kāraṇātītagocaram ।।

paripūrṇaṃ bhairaveśaṃ cidacityaratasthitam ।
tasyecchā paramā yā sā śaktirā(ḍhyā) manonmanī ।।

tasyāṣṭakaṃ paraṃ proktaṃ vāgvyaktaḥ kāraṇaṃ mahat ।
yoniruṣyā tathā nakvaṃ ṣaṭkoṇaṃ kuṇḍalīkulam ।।

māyā nārāyaṇaṃ haṃsamaṣṭaka vāgbhavaṃ smṛtam ।
citsvarūpapare dhāmni paraśaktudayākule ।।

yā bhāsā bhāsayetsarvaṃ caturddhā vāgvivarttinī ।
sā nityā sahajā sūkṣmā kulāṣṭapravijṛṃbhikā ।।

vāṃ kule vā krayātītā kriyājñānaprakāśinī ।
vidyeśvarīti sā proktā vāgbhaveśī tata smṛtā ।।

tasyoddhāramahaṃ vakṣye śṛṇu bhairavabhāmini ।
prastare mātrikāṃ tatra pitṛveśmanī bhairavi ।।

vabhavāṣṭakamavyasthāṃ prativargavibhedataḥ ।
pūjayettāpaṃ pareśāni vidyā vidyeśvarī kalām ।।

tataḥ samuddhareddevīṃ mahābhairavavigrahām ।
sāntāntamāditaḥ kṛtvā ṣaṭviṃśaṃ tu samuddharet ।।

adhorddhaṃ vahnisaṃruḍhaṃ mūrddhni guhya niyojitaṃm ।
ṣaṣṭhavargāttasaṃbhinnaṃ devī ekākṣarā smṛtā ।।
(118b)
japasādhyā parāśaktirnādamārganiyojitā ।
vāṅmaṃdirapadārūḍhā bhairavī rūpapṛ(ṣṭhata) ।।

tadā smaret mahovidyāmicchāviccakkramadhyagām ।
saptāviṃśatilakṣāṇi japtvā caiva tu siddhyati ।।

śmaśānādye mahāghore kṣetre hyāpatanethavā ।
laghvāśī dhyānasaṃyukto kṛṣṇāmbaravibhūṣitaḥ ।।

dhyāyedghorāṃ mahābhīmāṃ raktakṛṣṇāṃ bhayānakām ।
kṛṣṇāṃgīṃ pretasaṃrūḍhāṃ digvāsāṃ vikṛtānanām ।।

kapāloṣṇīṣasambaddhāṃ vabhruvarṇaśiroruhām ।
pretapreṃkhānusaṃruddhāṃ śiśukarṇāvalaṃvinīm ।।

kapālahastāṃ vikṛtāṃ raktapūrṇāsavodyatām ।
sarpābharaṇasaṃyuktāṃ vyālayajñopavītinīm ।।

aṣṭādaśabhujāraudrāṃ paṃcavaktrāṃ trilocanām ।
sarvāyudhadharāṃ devīṃ bhuktimuktiphalapradām ।।

evaṃvidhaṃ tu sakalaṃ devyā dhyāyet (sva)rūpakam ।
niṣkalaṃ pūrvamevoktaṃ kiciduddeśataḥ śṛṇu ।।

nādarūpā tu sā devī piṃgalorddhāntagāminī ।
nirdhūmāṃgārasadṛśāṃ * tāmūrddhni pratiṣṭhitā ।।

sūkṣmī dīpaśikhākārā bodharūpā tirāmayā ।
suṣusthaḍāntasaṃrūḍhā śivatejosamudbhavā ।।

nādayaṃtrasamārūḍhā divyakarmakarā śubhā ।
prativāgbhavasaṃrūḍhā sā kalā kālabhakṣaṇī ।।

yadā tasthastadgatasyāttadā vāgeśvaro bhavet ।
yoniḥ prasaramātrīśā śakteśī trisvarūpiṇī ।।
(119a)
va - rviṣāntare proktā trikoṇānaṃdarūpiṇī ।
taṃ vāgbhavaṃ syātprathamaṃ tatrasthā vākprasāriṇī ।।

devadevī samākhyātā ūṣmāmavyapathāṃtare ।
kuṇḍalāpīḍanenaiva dvitīyaṃ vāgbhavaṃ smṛtam ।।

ādivarṇasya yā vyaktirvikāsasthe tu sādhake ।
avikārātmakaṃ devi vāgbhavaṃ ca tṛtīyakam ।।

nābhirmeḍhrā(nta)re devi ṣaṭkoṇaṃ kandanāmakam ।
trikāsā kuṃcanairdevi tato vākpraṃsaraṃ mahat ।।

paravyomni caturthaṃtu vāgbhavaṃ taṃ prakāśitam ।
ā(dhā)re kuṇḍalā śakti tathā hṛnmaṃdirepi ca ।।

śaktisthāne parāproktā vāgbhavasya niketanam ।
vaiśvarūpyeṇa suśroṇi vikāsāt kuṃcanena tu ।।

caṃdragrāsena subhage vāgbhavaṃ paṃcamaṃ smṛtaṃm ।
maṃtrasvarūpaṃ cidrūpaṃ paravyomaniketanaṃm ।।

taṃ māyāmatragahanaṃ ṣaṣṭhaṃ vāgbhavamuttamam ।
yadā vikāsarūpeṇa biṃdunādavivarjitam ।।

visargādiparikṣīṇe svararūpaṃ svarūpataḥ ।
tatastatsaptamaṃ devi vāgbhavaṃ bhairavātmakam ।।

aṣṭātriṃśatkalājālamālitaṃ trigatisthitam ।
tridhāmasaṃgho - mayaṃ vāgbhavaṃ cāṣṭamaṃ priye ।।

evamaṣṭāvidhaṃ proktaṃ vāgbhavaṃ parameśvarī ।
etaccakkragatā devi paramā bhairavī kalā ।।

vidyāvidyeśvarī devī vāgbhaveśī prakīrttitā ।
etasmādvā bhavājjātaṃ vāgeśvaryāṣṭakaṃ param ।।

taddehakaṃ smṛ - davyātena tatra sadā smaret ।
(119b)
tadā sādhakamukhyasya vāṇī askhalitā bhavet ।।

sarvasāstrārthavettritvaṃ jāyate smaraṇena tu ।
īdṛśaṃ yogamāsādya * rma kuryādyathepsitaṃm ।।

anyathā naiva karttavyaṃ yāvadetattabhairavī ।
viditaṃ sādhakeṃdrasya vīrācāra ra * sya ca ।।

karoti sarvakarmāṇi yogenānena bhairavi ।
paśau paṃcasu deveśi ṣaṭsu saptasu yogavīt ।।

paṃcabhiḥ ṣaḍbhirokana saptabhiḥ paṃcameśvari ।
praviśeccāmṛte bhāge śaktyārūḍhastu maṃtravit ।।

mardayettasya kamalaṃ pūrvoktaṃ vā kulākulam ।
śūlena ghorarūpeṇa muhurmuhurathā haret ।।

bhakṣayitvā kalau divyāṃ kṛśarūpeṇa suvrate ।
gṛhītvā cāmṛtaṃ bhāgaṃ praviśedātmavigraham ।।

evaṃ kurvanvarārohamānaye tridaśānyapi ।
ajaro hyamarāścaiva viśokaḥ sādhakottamaḥ ।।

aṇimādiguṇaiśvaryaṃ bhuktvā śivapuraṃ vrajet ।
dhyātvā parāmṛtaivarṇaiḥ krokaviṣṭo muhurmuhuḥ ।।

khecarīcakkramārūḍhāṃ śūlasaṃsthāhane harim ।
dhvaṃsayetsakalāṃ bhūtāṃ sūkṣmayoge nilodbhavet ।।

saṃdevāsuragaṃdharvāṃ yakṣarakṣāṃ mahoragām ।
vaśyārthe dhyāyate raktāṃ siṃdūrādrisamaprabhām ।।

raktādyā kathayeddevi naranārīṣu kā kathā ।
deveśo padmagarbho vā devo vāthapuraṃdaraḥ ।।

mārayeta na saṃdehaṃ trisa(dhyaṃ) yojayedyadi ।
kapotānāṃ smareddevīṃ raktakṛṣṇā tu mohane ।।
(120a)
vidveṣe haritāṃ devīmuccāṭeṃgārasaṃnibhām ।
pītalā staṃbhane proktāṃ stobhaneṇḍakarpicchavan ।।

śāntike caṃdrabiṃbābhāṃ pauṣṭike sitaraktikām ।
nānākarmakarīṃ devīṃ bhuktimuktiphalapradām ।।

mudrāmasyāḥ pravakṣyāmi sarvabhūtabhayaṃkarīm ।
japādau tu smaredghorāṃ japāṃte tu punaḥ smaret ।।

uccāsanagato maṃtrī spaṣṭakāyo śirodharām ।
spaṣṭāṃ saṃkruddhavadanaḥ koṭarākṣaḥ subhīṣaṇaḥ ।।

aṃtrasūtrasamākṛṣṭau karau yādṛkprakalpitau ।
devadevyā tathā kuryātsṛkkiṇī pravidārayet ।।

jihvā muhurmuhurbhāmya haṭhotkāyaṃ viśoṣayet ।
hāhārāvaṃ vade ghoraṃ mudraiṣā vikṛtānanāṃ ।।

vivarāṃ bhaṃjayenkruddho yadi samyakprayojitā ।
ākarṣoccāṭavidveṣa mā{ra}ṇoccāṭapauṣṭike ।।

badhvaiṣasarvasiddhisyādvidyo(tkā)reṇa bhairavi ।
na cāsyā hyadayaṃ devi śiro nāsti śikhā na hi ।।

na varma nātrau deveśi astreṇā - pti suvrate ।
etasyā eva deveśyā sarvakāryānprasūyate ।।

samyagjñātvā gurumukhānmatraṃ sarvārthasādhakam ।
bhairavādyā mahāmaṃtrā dehāṃte mokṣadāyakāḥ ।।

dṛṣṭvādṛṣṭa ca yatkarmma prāpnuyāt sādhakottamaḥ ।
krūhakāñcājanādhūpā iṃdrajālādiśaṃvarāḥ ।।

sūkṣmāsthūlā tathā dīrghā bhuktvā śivapuraṃ vrajet ।
etattavasamākhyātaṃ vāgbhaveśyā vinirṇayam ।।
(120b)
kimanyatkathayiṣyāmi vada śaileṃdranaṃdani ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavastrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
vāgbhaveṣyāvidhīḥ ṣoḍaśamaḥ paṭalaḥ ।। ।।

evamākarṇāgirijā vāgbhavaprasaraṃ mahat ।
bhūyo saṃśayamāviṣṭā śrotukāmā sureśvarī ।
provāca praṇipatye(daṃ) jayadrathahitaiṣiṇī ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

tṛptāsmi jagadaṃśo na śāstroghaṃ pariśṛṇvatī ।
adhunā śrotumicchāmi rahasyaṃ paramādbhutam ।।

yanna kasyacidākhyātaṃ tvayā tripurasūdana ।
śāntogreṇa tathogreṇa sahasrākṣaramālitā ।।

dviprakārā śrutā deva vidyā ghorā karaṃkiṇī ।
idānīṃ ghoraghorā yā sahasrākṣaramālikā ।।

nāmākhyā hi sureśāna guhyādguhyatarā hi yā ।
yasyāḥ saṃsmaraṇādeva sarvapāpakṣayo bhavet ।।

yā smṛtajñānamabhyeti yoginīmukhasaṃsthitam ।
puroktāḥ siddhayaḥ sarvā yayā samyagbhavaṃti ca ।।

nāmākhyā hi sureśānaprasādāt parameśvara ।
evaṃ śrutvā devadevaḥ provāca bhavanāśanaḥ ।। ।।

bhaira * uvāca ।।

śṛṇuṣva kathayiṣyāmi rahasyamidamadbhutam ।
yā sahasrākṣarā devi ghoraghoratarātmikā ।।

tasyā vidhānamatulaṃ kulakaulapragopitam ।
jagadvināśabhītyā tu gopi(tā) sā mayā priye ।।
(121a)
asyāḥ saṃkathanādeva kālāgnirbhasmasādvrajet ।
kastāṃ saṃkīrttayeddevi jagatsaṃhārakārikām ।।

svastyastu sarvajagatāṃ chidraṃ mā kaścidastu naḥ ।
devadevyāḥ prasādena sarvarakṣāstu nābhṛśam ।।

gatvā pitṛvaṇaṃ bhīmaṃ gurorgṛhamathāpi vā ।
saṃśo(dhyaṃ) tatra tāṃ vedi paṃcaratnavilepitām ।।

kaṃkālaghṛṣṭāṃ vasudhīkṛtāraktacarcitām ।
prastaretmātrikāṃ tatra sarvavāṅmaya(mā)trikām ।।

vargāṣṭakasamāyukto vibhavenaiva pūjayet ।
saṃpūjya parayā bhaktyā tato vidyāṃ samuddharet ।।

ādau kuleśvarīṃ devīmaprameyāṃ samuddharet ।
krodheśvaraṃ dvi(dhā) bhūyo punarādyaṃ samuddharet ।।

sadāśivamatodeyaṃ bhīmaśaṃkunirodhitam ।
ṣaḍakṣaraṃ padamidaṃ prathamaṃ parikīrttitam ।।

anena padarājena sādhayenmanasepsitam ।
viśvarūpā maṃtradevīṃ cintayet sarvakarmakṛt ।।

na tadasti hi deveśi yannānena prasiddhyati ।
punaḥ krodheśvaraṃ deyaṃ dvi(dhāṃ) suravarārcite ।।

{kālaṃ dāraṇayā yuktaṃ vahniṃ trisvarabhūṣitaṃ ।।
catura(kṣa)rametaddhi dvitīyampadamuddhṛtaṃ ।।
anena mārayetsarvvaṃ viśvametaccarācaraṃ ।।}

kālāgni{śatasaṃkāsāṃ} (śatru)saṃhārakāriṇīm ।
cintayedatra deveśī khaḍgolmukadharāṃ mahaṃn ।।

vidyuvitpatitāṃ mūrddhni sā(dya)syenāṃ vicintayet ।
anantaṃ vahnisaṃrūḍhaṃ biṃduḍaṃbarabhūṣitam ।।

tathaiva bhairavādyaṃ syādbhairavaṃ haṃsasaṃsthitam ।
sakuṇḍalaṃ vahnirūḍhaṃ biṃdu(ḍaṃbara)bhūṣitam ।।
(121b)
(dvidhā) krodheśvaraṃ deyaṃ amṛtaṃ punaruddharet ।
cāpādyasaṃsthitaṃ kṛtvā kālānalakṛtāsanam ।।

vahnikṣayāṃkitaṃ śakraṃ ṣaṣṭhasthamamṛtaṃpunaḥ ।
anaṃtaṃ kālasaṃrūḍhaṃ vahnigehavibhūṣitaṃm ।।

nārāyaṇaṃ svarūpeṇa varūṇaṃ vāyusaṃsthitaṃm ।
yonipūrvaṃ paṃcamādya vahniveśmaṃ tathaikataḥ ।।

dvādaśākṣarametaddhi tṛtīyaṃ padamuttamam ।
jñānaṃ tridhāgataṃ yacca sthūlaṃ sūkṣmaṃ parābhidham ।।

tadasyopāsanāddevi ṣaṇmāsādvyaktimeṣyati ।
sarvakarmakaraścāyaṃ padarāṭ parikīrttitaḥ ।।

yathābhimatarūpātra devadevī vicintayet ।
vedādyamuddharedbhūyo vidyā pūrvaṃ punastataḥ ।।

sadāśivaṃ punardeyaṃ bhīmaśaṃkunirodhitam ।
varuṇāntaṃ kālarūḍhaṃ varuṇāntaṃ ca sāṃkuśam ।।

niṣedhaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ kālādyāṃ kevalaṃ tathā ।
amṛtaṃ kālasaṃrūḍhaṃ cāpaṣaṣṭhe samanvitam ।।

kevalaṃ somamuddhṛtya agniṃ takṣayabhūṣitam ।
tenāṃkitaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ vahnisthaṃ kuru bhairavi ।।

paṃcamādyaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ syād gaṇeṃdragraṃthisaṃsthitam ।
tṛtīyaṃ svaramūrddhānaṃ haṃsaṃ saptamasaṃsthitam ।।

cāpādyaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo vāyumagnikṣayāṃkitam ।
aṣṭādaśākṣaramidaṃ padametaccaturthakam ।।

pracaṃḍa pāvakākāraṃ vahnijvālāśatāvṛtam ।
melāpakaraṇaṃ devi cintitaṃ sarvasiddhidam ।।

tṛtīyādyaṃ tṛtīyāṃkaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ tadaṃkitam ।
(122a)
dvijihvamaṃkuśākrāṃtaṃ varuṇasthaṃ prakalpa - ।।

- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - ।
- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - ।
- - - - - - - - niṣedhaṃ tena śobhitam ।।

kevala cāmṛtaṃ deyaṃ varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ saptamārūḍhaṃ vāyuṃ saptamabhūṣitam ।।

trayodaśākṣaramidaṃ padaṃ paṃcamamuttamam ।
haḍamelāpasiddhyarthaṃ sahasrātsiddhidaṃ smṛtam ।।

mahāmāṃsā sarvadevipūjitaṃ sarvasiddhidam ।
kālakevalamuddhṛtyaṃ haṃsaṃ dvisvarasaṃyutam ।।

varuṇānta ca kālaṃ ca taṃ ca dvisvarabhūṣitam ।
niṣedhaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ varuṇaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ tataḥ ।।

tṛtīye svarasaṃyuktaṃ amṛtaṃ ca niṣedhakaṃm ।
yonipūrvaṃ tathā vahniṃ paṃcamasthaṃ prakalpayet ।।

dvikyapadamidaṃ kṛtvā amṛtaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ punaḥ ।
niṣedhaṃ svātmasaṃrūḍhaṃ vahnikṣayasamanvitam ।।

cāpaṃ vāyusthitaṃ kāryaṃ kalāvāsasamanvitam ।
daśapaṃcākṣaraṃ proktaṃ ṣaṣṭhaṃ padamanuttamam ।।

asyā tu smaraṇādeva devīṃ saṃnidhyatāmiyāt ।
sarvakarmakarī jāyet sādhakasya mahātmanaḥ ।।

kālādyaṃ punaruddhṛtya gaṇeśaṃ tadana(nta)ram ।
varuṇaṃ kevalaṃbhūyo paṃcamādyaṃ trisūryakam ।।

yonipūrvaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ syāttadaṃkaṃ śakramuddharet ।
gaṇeśaṃ saniṣedhaṃ ca trisūryeṇa śirāhatam ।।
(122b)
vahniṃ paṃcamasaṃrūḍhaṃ cāpādyaṃ vahnisaṃsthitam ।
karuṇāntaṃ kevalaṃ syāt paṃcamādyaṃ ca (ke)valaṃ ।।

cāpādyaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo trisūryāṃkaṃ samīraṇam ।
paṃcamādyaṃ yonicitraṃ krodharājā dvidhā tataḥ ।।

mo{hi}nī ca dvikadeyā kuṇḍalaṃ vahnisaṃsthitam ।
biṃduvahnikṣayopetaṃ bhīmaśaṃkunirodhitam ।।

saptamaṃ padametaddhi viṃśatyakṣaramaṃḍitam ।
sarvasiddhipadaṃ jñeyaṃ kālāgnikuharāntagam ।।

tatra yā paramā bhāsā anaṃtā citsvarūpiṇī ।
udeti sā mahādevi padasyāsya prabhāvataḥ ।।

punaḥ kālaṃ samuddhṛtya haṃsaṃ samukhadāraṇam ।
yonipūrvaṃ kevalaṃ syādamṛtākhyaṃ ca kevalam ।।

asya pūrvaṃ punardeyaṃ bāhuṃ kaivalamuddharet ।
śūlāntaṃ yonipūrvasthaṃ triśūryeṇa śirāhatam ।।

aśvaṃ tenāṃkitaṃ bhūyo haṃsaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
marmasvadehasaṃlagnaṃ bāhurvāsasamanvitam ।।

punarapyasya pūrvasyānmarmmaṃ svātmasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
aṃ(ku)śena śirākrāntaṃ punarvāyuṃ sapaṃcamam ।।

cāpaṃ savahnigehaṃ ca somaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
varuṇastha tathā bāhuṃ cāpādyaṃ paṃcama sthitam ।।

varuṇaṃ kharparārūḍhaṃ niṣedhaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।
kālāgnirūdrasahitaṃ somaṃ devi samuddharet ।।

cāpādyaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo niṣedhaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।
bhīmaśaṃkususaṃruddhaṃ aṣṭamaṃ padamuddhṛtam ।।

ekaviṃśati va(rllaṃ)syādbrahmāṃḍagrāsaghasmaram ।
(123a)
kālāgniru(ddha)to hīnāṃ līlayā kṣayakārakam ।।

kāraṇe svaracakkrasya maulau mūrddhni virājate ।
sarvakarmmakaraṃ jñeyaṃ ta{ta}sthaṃ tatra samīritam ।।

vahnibhairavasarūḍhaṃ kuḍalasthaṃ punaḥ kuru ।
punarvahnigataṃ kuryānmohanībiṃdulāṃcchitam ।।

haṃsaṃ paṃcamasaṃrūḍhaṃ tatsthamiṃdraṃ punaḥ kuru ।
padametadvidhā kārya yonipūrvaṃ puna dadet ।।

punarnādaṃ sureśāni padametadvidhā kuru ।
varuṇaṃ tristharākrāntaṃ yonipūrvasasaptamam ।।

paṃcamādyaṃ kevalinaṃ vahniṃ sāṃkuśamuddharet ।
varuṇaṃ yonisaṃbhinnaṃ kālaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

mukhadāraṇayā yuktaṃ haṃsadevi tathoddharet ।
kālādyaṃ mohanīyuktaṃ punaḥ kālaṃ ca kevalam ।।

punarasyādimaṃ deyaṃ somādyaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
mohanīsaṃyutaṃ cāśvaṃ vāyuṃ yonivibhūṣitam ।।

dvijihvamaṃkuśākrāntaṃ varuṇasyopari sthitam ।
śukamaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ kālaṃ tenaiva śobhitam ।।

dvijihvamaṃkuśākrāntaṃ varuṇasyoparisthitam ।
śakramaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ kālaṃ tenaiva śobhitam ।।

śakraṃ tribiṃdumūrddhānaṃ niṣedhaṃ tena bhūṣitam ।
saptāviṃśākṣaraṃ jñeyaṃ navamaṃ padamuttamam ।।

baddhā tu rāviṇāṃ mudrāṃ yadā pitṛvaśe sudhīḥ ।
sakṛduccarate maṃtrī tadā melāpamāpnuyāt ।।

tridhā yatparameśāni padasyāsya prabhāvataḥ ।
mahārāve vahniyute yonibiṃduvibhūṣitam ।।
(123b)
haṃsaṃ vahnipuṭaṃ bhūyo biṃdukālāgnibhūṣitaṃm ।
punarnādaṃ vahnirūḍhaṃ sṛṣṭisaṃyojitaṃ kuru ।।

amṛtaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ varuṇaṃ vahnibhūṣitam ।
kālādyaṃ praṇavākrāntaṃ gaṇeṃdraṃ vāyusaṃsthitam ।।

mukhadāruṇayā yuktaṃ varuṇaṃ yonisaṃyutaṃm ।
cāpādyaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo niṣedhaṃ trisvarāṃkitatam ।।

deśākṣaraṃ syāddaśamaṃ padametatsurārcite ।
sarvasaṃpatpradaṃ sāraṃ mahābhāgyāvarohaṇam ।।

hṛdayāṃbujamavyasthaṃ vṛttirājanirodhataḥ ।
yadā japet sahasraikaṃ tadā saubhāgyamāpnuyāt ।।

dhanadasya na yaddevi tatsaubhāgyamīhāvahet ।
varuṇaṃ ca tridhoddhṛtya mukhadāraṇayā yutam ।।

biṃdumastakasaṃbhinnaṃ ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ punaruddharet ।
vahnitrisvaṃramūrddhānaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ sasa(ptama)m ।।

ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ paṃcamādyasthaṃ dvijihvaṃ varuṇasthitam ।
aṃkuśena śirākrāṃntaṃ śakramaṃkuśabhūṣitam ।।

kālaṃ paṃcamasaṃrūḍhaṃ bhairavāntaṃ tatoddharet ।
tṛtīyādyaṃ sthitaṃ kāryaṃ anantaṃ vahnisaṃsthitam ।।

kālāgnirudrasaṃrūḍhaṃ biṃdumastakasaṃsthitam ।
dvādaśākṣarametacca padamekādaśaṃ smṛtam ।।

sarvāvyāpakaraṃ proktaṃ śāntipuṣṭikaraṃ śubhaṃm ।
dvādaśāntakalācakraṃ cādraṃ yatparikīrttitam ।।

tatra devī padenaivaṃ sravaṃtīmamṛtaṃ smaret ।
hṛtpadmakuhare devi puruṣaṃ plāvayettataḥ ।।

anena yogamārgeṇa jagadāpyāyaye(tkṣa)ṇāt ।
(124a)
punastārakamuddhṛtya paṃcamādyaṃ sasaptakam ।
cāpamaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ kālaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

asyādyaṃ punarevaṃ hi kālamaṃkuśasaṃyutam ।
niṣedhaṃ paṃcamādyasthaṃ vahniṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

varuṇaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ deyaṃ haṃsaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
tribiṃdusaṃyutaṃ deyaṃ yonipūrvaṃ surārcite ।।

ekādaśā * muddiṣṭaṃ dvādaśaṃ padamuttamam ।
prāṇapravāhādanu ca bhaved yatparamaṃ pa(dam) ।।

tenāyāmaprayogena tridhāmapadadaṃ padam ।
sarvasiddhipradaṃ sāraṃ ajarāmarakārakam ।।

padametad yadā japtaṃ tadā sarvajñatā bhavet ।
marmamagnisthitaṃ kṛtvā modanībiṃdulāṃcchitam ।।

punaśca bhūtamānena marmmarājā pradāpayet ।
haṃsaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya marmaṃ paṃcamasaṃsthitam ।।

haṃsamaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ punardeyaṃ ca kevalam ।
kālaṃ kuṇḍale yatnasaṃrūḍhaṃ kārayettataḥ ।।

kevalaṃ vahnibījaṃ ca aśvamaṃkuśasaṃyutaṃm ।
varuṇāntaṃ kevalaṃ syā(nni)ṣedhatrisvarāṃkitam ।
kālaṃ praṇavasaṃyuktaṃ anantaṃ kevalaṃ tataḥ ।।

śakraṃ kevalamuddhṛtya anantaṃ kālasaṃsthitam ।
trisvarākrāntaṃ mūrddhānaṃ varuṇaṃ ca {tathā} dvidhā ।।

tenaivālaṃkṛtaṃ mūrddhnā yonyādyaṃ paṃcamādigam ।
cāpādyaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo varuṇāṃtaṃ ca kevalam ।।

niṣedhamaṃkuśākrāntaṃ niṣedhapaṃcamādigam ।
(124b)
vahnisthitaṃ prakurvīta kālādyaṃ punaruddharet ।।

anantaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo aśvaṃ trisvarabhūṣitam ।
punaḥ kālādimaṃ deyaṃ bhāskaraṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

vāyuṃ kevalaṃ suhṛtya caṃdraṃ kevalamuddharet ।
vahniṃ gaṇeṃdrasaṃrūḍhaṃ vahniveśmāṃkitaṃ kuru ।।

kālamaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ bāhuṃ trisvaralā(cchi)tam ।
yoniṃ pūrvaṃ kevalaṃ syādbāhumaṃkuśabheditam ।।

śakraṃ trisvaramūrddhānaṃ sarvādyaṃ punaruddharet ।
ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo amṛtaṃ kālasaṃsthitam ।।

saptamasvaramūrddhnisthaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ trisūryakam ।
biṃduyuktaṃ sureśāni tṛtīyādyaṃ ca sāṃkuśam ।।

iṃdraṃ kevalamuddhṛtya vāyuṃ kevalamuddharet ।
tṛtīyādyaṃ tridhā deyaṃ savisargaṃ ca bhairavi ।।

nādaṃ vahnisthitaṃ kṛtvā aṃkuśena śirāhatam ।
biṃdumastakasaṃbhinnaṃ kuṃḍalaṃ vahnisaṃpuṭam ।।

patitaṃ cāṃdramasyāṃte padasya parikalpayet ।
trayodaśaṃ padamidaṃ sarvasiddhiphalapradam ।।

ekapaṃcāśatāvaṇṇaighorairetadudāhṛtam ।
sarvāpasmṛtidoṣaghnaṃ smaraṇānmanaseśvari ।।

tasya dhūpāṃjanābhyaṃgāda(pa)smāraṃ vyapohati ।
śmaśānasthasya subhage smaraṇātpadamuttamam ।।

bhavenmelāpamatulaṃ trividhaṃ parameśvarī ।
atha kiṃ bahunoktena padasyāsya vahattayā ।।

tannāsti yanna kurute padarāṭ sādhitassadā ।
punassadāśivaṃ devaṃ tridhā devi samuddhare(t) ।।
(125a)
punarmahāmohalakṣmī tridhā samyakpradāpayet ।
mahārāvaṃ vahnirūḍhaṃ yonibiṃduvibhūṣitam ।।

tridhā deyaṃ maheśāni dvijihvaṃ punaruddharet ।
mahāpaṃcasamaṃ rūḍhaṃ biṃdunādavibhūṣitam ।।

caṃdraṃ sṛṣṭiyutaṃ deyaṃ ṣaṣṭhādyāṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
vahniṃ ke(va)lamuddhṛtya kālamaṃkuśasaṃyutam ।।

- meva saptamārūḍhaṃ paṃñcamādyaṃ ca kevalam ।
vahniṃ kevalamuddhṛtya dvidhā caṃdraṃ samākuśam ।।

vahnimaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ yonipūrvaṃ ca kevalam ।
amṛtādyaṃ vahnidīptaṃ hayaṃ trisvarabhāsuram ।।

ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo * * kevalamuddharet ।
kālaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya yonipūrvaṃ ca kevalam ।।

indraṃ ca sāṃkuśaṃ deyaṃ niṣedhaṃ trisvarāṃkitaṃm ।
varuṇaṃ cāṃkuśayutaṃ somaṃ trisvarabhūṣitam ।।

niṣedhaṃ tena saṃyuktaṃ kālaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
nādaṃ(nā)dasamāyuktaṃ dvijihvaṃ mohanāṃkitam ।।

varuṇaṃ cāṃkuśayutaṃ ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ vāyusaṃsthitam ।
aṃkuśena śirākrāntaṃ vāyuṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

yonipūrvaṃ kevalaṃ syādvahnitrisvarabhāsuram ।
mahāmṛtaṃ vāru(ṇaṃstha) bidvaṃkuśaśairāhatam ।।

tridhā niyojayeddevi padasyāṃte maheśvari ।
punaḥ kālaṃ samuddhṛtya nādaṃ nādasamanvitaṃm ।।

varuṇaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ tṛtīyādyaṃ svarātmagam ।
vahnigehasamopetaṃ bhairavaṃ kevalaṃ tataḥ ।।

śūlāntaṃ yonipūrvaṃsthaṃ aṃkuśākrāntamastakam ।
(125b)
agnitrisvaramūrddhānaṃ aśve tenaiva bhūṣitam ।।

nādaṃ nādena saṃyuktaṃ dvidhā deyaṃ surārcite ।
vahnimaṃkuśamūrddhānaṃ varuṇaṃ trisvarāṅkitam ।।

aśvaṃ tenaiva sahitaṃ kālamaṃkuśasaṃyutam ।
biṃdumastakasaṃbhinnaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ ca vahnigam ।।

sāṃkuśaṃ devadeveśi haṃsaṃ trisvarabhūṣitam ।
punastridhā samuddhṛtya savisargaṃ maheśvari ।।

amṛtaṃ varuṇārūḍhaṃ dvitīyasvaramauli{na}m ।
nādaṃ nādena sahitaṃ padametanmahābalam ।।

catuḥṣaṣṭhyakṣarajñeyaṃ padametaccaturdaśam ।
sarvāpamṛtyudalanaṃ śāntipuṣṭikaraṃ śubham ।।

mahāsamayadoṣaghnaṃ sarvasaṃkaranāśanam ।
mudritonmudraṇe śreṣṭhaṃ sakṛtpāṭhena siddhidam ।।

mokṣadaṃ pāṭhamātreṇa brahmaghnasyāpi bhairavi ।
yathā tathā padamidaṃ sādhakaḥ sasmared yadi ।।

tathā tathā devadevi siddhiriddhipradaṃ smṛtam ।
hatvā brahmāṇḍamakhilaṃ brāhmaṇaiḥ paripūritam ।।

sakṛduccāramātreṇa kilviṣaṃ tadvinaśyati ।
māsamātraṃ yadā devaṃ hṛtpadmāntarjapedyadā ।।

tadā jñānaṃ svapnapadaṃ devadevyo dadanti ca ।
vasagāstasya tiṣṭhanti yoginyā bhūrbhuvaḥ svagāḥ ।।

mahāmelāpikā siddhi devasaukena jāyate ।
padasyāsya prabhāvena devi nāstyatra saṃśayaḥ ।।

na sā siddhirihāstīti yānenaiva na siddhyati ।
ataḥ sadāśivaṃ deyamuddhareta svarūpiṇam ।।
(126a)
mahāmāyā punardevi kevalaṃ varuṇāṃtimam ।
yonipūrvaṃ paṃcamasthaṃ tṛtīyādyaṃ ca kevalam ।।

anayormadhyagaṃ deyamaśvaṃ trisvarabhūṣitam ।
śūlāntaṃ yonipūrvaṃsthaṃ paṃcamasthaṃ punaḥ kuru ।।

aśvaṃ trisvaramūrddhānaṃ tṛtīyādyaṃ punardadet ।
aśvaṃ marmasthitaṃ deyaṃ aṃkuśākrāntamastakam ।।

trisvarākrāṃtamūrddhānamiṃdraṃ punarathoddharet ।
yonipūrvasā(ṅku)śaṃ syādasyāntaṃ punaruddharet ।।

kālaṃ punarathoddhṛtya nādaṃ nādasamanvitaṃm ।
yonipūrvaṃ punardeyaṃ amṛtādyaṃ ca kevalam ।।

asyādyaṃ punaruddhṛtya kevalaṃ vahnimuddharet ।
ghāntayonyādisaṃrūḍhaṃ trisvarākrāṃtamaulinam ।।

aśvaṃ tenaiva khacitaṃ cāpādyaṃ vahnisaṃsthitam ।
sabiṃdumaṃkuśākrāṃtaṃ tridhā devi pradāpayet ।।

marmamaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ kālaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
vahnitadgehasaṃyuktaṃ varuṇāntaṃ ca tasthitam ।।

vahnitrisvaramūrddhānaṃ dvijihvaṃ sāntasaṃsthitam ।
agnikṣayane saṃbhinnaṃ vāyuṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

ṣaṣṭhādyamagnisaṃrūḍhaṃ kālādyaṃ yonibhūṣitam ।
punastameva subhage kevalaṃ saṃpradāpayet ।।
(126b)
gaṇeṃdraṃ varuṇaṃ caiva pañcamādyaṃ trisūryakam ।
saptatridaśārṇamuddiṣṭaṃ padametanmahātape ।।

sarvālakṣmīpraśamanametatpaṃcadaśaṃ padam ।
tridhāmasaṃghāṭṭapade yadā maṃtramimaṃ smaret ।।

tadā sarvajñatā jāyet sādhakasya maheśvarī ।
aṇimādyaṣṭakaṃ cāsya purodhāvati nityasaḥ ।।

sāṃsārikāni bhogāni smaraṇādeva sādhakam ।
samāśrayanti subhage madhuvanmadhulehinaḥ ।।

vaśyākarṣaṇavidveṣamāraṇoccāṭanādikam ।
smaraṇāt siddhyate samyakpadasyāsya mahāmate ।।

ataḥ sadāśivaṃ devaṃ punareva surārcite ।
biṃdunādamadho vahniṃ kālāgniṃ ca supiṃḍitam ।।

anantaṃ vahnisahitaṃ kālāgnisthaṃ sabiṃdukam ।
paṃcamādyaṃ savaruṇaṃ biṃdusaṃbhinnamastakam ।।

amṛtaṃ paṃcamārūḍhaṃ vahnikevalamuddharet ।
ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ rudrasahitaṃ punarvahniṃ ca kevalam ।।

samīraṇaṃ kevalaṃ syānniṣedhaṃ paṃcamādigam ।
vahnisaṃsthitamevainaṃ kāryaṃ maṃtraprapūraṇam ।।

kevalaṃ kālamuddhṛtya sasaraṃ cāpamuttamam ।
(127a)
tribiṃdubhūṣitaṃ deyaṃ niṣedhaṃ (sura)surasuṃdari ।।

punaḥ kālaṃ kevalinaṃ nādaṃ nādasamanvitaṃm ।
punaḥ kālaṃ nādayutaṃ samīraṇamathoddharet ।।

yonyaṃkitaṃ maheśāni paṃcamādyaṃ savahnigam ।
trisūryakhacitaṃ mūrddhnā śakraṃ praṇavabhūṣitam ।।

yonipūrvaṃ kevalinaṃ dvijihvaṃ ca niṣedhakaṃ ।
trisvarākrāntamūrddhānaṃ niṣedhaṃ punaruddharet ।।

tadaṃkitaṃ syādvaruṇaṃ gaṇesaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
paṃcamādyaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ syāt kālaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

vāyuṃ yoniyutaṃ bhūyo mahākālaṃ samuddharet ।
nādaṃ nādasamāyuktaṃ kālamaṃkuśasaṃyutam ।।

paṃcamādyaṃ saptamasthaṃ kālādyaṃ cāṣṭamānvitam ।
kevalaṃ vahnimuddhṛtya saptamāṃkamapāṃ yatim ।।

varuṇaṃ ca tadanta ca piṇḍībhūtaṃ punaḥ kuru ।
vahnitribiṃdusahitaṃ tṛtīyādyaṃ punardadet ।।

aśvamarmasthitaṃ bhūyo yoniyuktaṃ samuddharet ।
asyādyaṃ punaruddhṛtya punaraśvaṃ samarmakam ।।

triśūlaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ hayaṃ caṃdrasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
yaṃ yaṃkitaṃ pra(dā)tavyaṃ tṛtīyāḍhyaṃ tṛtīyayuk ।।

cāpādyamaṃkuśākrāntaniṣedhaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
cāpādigatamuddhṛtyaṃ granthīśaṃ cakriṇā hatam ।।

asyādyaṃ punaruddhṛtya paramaṃkuśavarjitaṃm ।
punarniṣedhaṃ deveśi asyādyaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।।

niṣedhaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ nādāvahniṃ ca kevalau ।
nādaṃ paṃcamasaṃyuktaṃ ghāntaṃ yonyādisaṃsthitam ।।
(127b)
ākārabhūṣitaṃ bhūtvā vahniṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

trisvareṇa samopetaṃ hayaṃ tenaiva śobhitam ।
varuṇaṃ tena saṃbhinnaṃ taṃ tadantasthitaṃ kuru ।।

aṃkuśena samopetamagniṃ tenaiva dīpitam ।
varuṇaṃ trisvaropetaṃ hayaṃ tenaiva śobhitam ।।

dvijihvaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ kevalaṃ ca samīraṇam ।
paṃcamasthaṃ paṃcamādye tridhā deyaṃ dvijihvakaṃ ।।

savisarggaṃ mahābhāge tridhā praṇavamuddharet ।
nādamante nādayutaṃ padaṃścāṃḍaśamuddhṛtam ।।

trisaptatyakṣaropeta saptapātālabhedanam ।
yatra vādyoccare devi padametadyathā tathā ।।

tatra yaṃtrāṇi śīryante pātālasthāni bhairavi ।
yadā hāṭakacakkrasthā sādhako maṃtramuccaret ।।

yāvatsahasraṃ deveśi śrīmukhāgre samāhitaḥ ।
{dīpaparvaṇi saṃkruddhastāvadāṃyāti yoṣitaḥ ।।}
uttamā sādhakasyāgraṃ kṣudhā smaraṇarārditāḥ ।।

saṃpūjya sādhakaśreṣṭhaṃ nayanti puramuttamam ।
ākalpaṃ tatra jīveta sādhakaścaiva suṃdari ।।

asādhito maṃtrarājā sarvvakarmmakaraḥ smṛtaḥ ।
kiṃtu saṃsādhito devi tannāsti yanna sādhayet ।।

sarvvasaṃpatpradaṃ sāraṃ padametadudāhṛtam ।
punaśca mottanī deyā kālaṃ ca tadanaṃtaram ।।

nādaṃ nādasamāyuktaṃ kālaṃ nādavibhūṣitam ।
samīraṇaṃ yoniyutaṃ bhīmaśaṃkunirodhitam ।।
(128a)
saptādaśaṃ padamidaṃ ṣaḍakṣaramudāhṛtam ।
māyāgraṃthau * yāruḍhaḥ sādhako japate padam ।।

tadā sarvvāṇi karmmāṇi sakṛduktāṃ tu sādhayet ।
śakrajālānyanekāni mohajālaśatānyapi ।।

vedhayānaṃ stathā stobhaṃ kalaśādiṣu sādhayet ।
punarmahāmohanī syādvijihvaṃ cāṃkuśāhatam ।।

bhairavāntasthitaṃ deyaṃ niṣedhaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
varuṇāntaṃ kevalaṃ syād yonipūrvvaṃ sapuṇya(pa)m ।।

sadāśivaṃ tato deyaṃ bhīmaśaṃkunirodhitam ।
puṇyonārthaṃ yatra dantaṃ trisvaraṃ tatra dāpayet ।।

saptākṣaramidaṃ proktaṃ padamaṣṭādaśaṃ mayā ।
hṛtsaṃpuṭagataṃ samyakdveṣayuddhena yojayet ।।

tasya jñānapradaṃ devi satoccānāntasaṃśayaḥ ।
sarvvakarmmakaro devi yadoyaṃ parikīrttitaḥ ।।

rāvaṃ vahnisamāruḍhaṃ yonibinduvibhūṣitam ।
dvijihvaṃ bhairavāntastha yonilāṃcchitamastakaṃm ।।

kevalaṃ vāyumuddhṛtya ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ vahnibhūṣitam ।
kālādyaṃ yonisaṃbhinnaṃ rāvaṃ yonivibheditam ।।

biṃdumastakasaṃbhinnaṃ bhīma(śaṃ)kunirodhitam ।
saptārṇaṃ padametaddhi jñeyamekonaviṃśamam ।।

priyamelāpamanena sādhakeṃdro labhe(t)sadā ।
yadā kuṃḍalinīcakre maṃtrametadu{dā}haret ।।
(128b)
tadā saṃsādhayet sarvvaṃ trailokye yatpratiṣṭhitam ।
punarmahārmohanī ca dvijihvaṃ mohanāvṛtam ।।

varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ tṛtīyādyaṃ ca kevalam ।
yonipūrvvaṃ sva{kī}yasthaṃ vahniruḍhaṃ sayonikam ।।

varuṇaṃ varuṇāntaṃ ca piṇḍibhūtau sa{mu}ddharet ।
vahniṃ tribiṃdukhacitaṃ punardeyaṃ sadāśivaṃ ।।

bhīmaśaṃkuṃ tato deyaṃ navākṣaramidaṃ padam ।
etadviṃśati saṃproktaṃ jīvacakkrasthasiddhidam ।।

tatra cakkre yadā devi padametajjapedgiriḥ ।
tadāmaratvamāyāti sarvvajñaḥ sādhako bhavet ।।

rāvaṃ yoniṃ tathā biṃduṃ vahnimekatra coddharet ।
ṣaṣṭhādyamaṃkuśākrāntaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ ca kevalam ।।

yonipūrvvaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ syānniṣedhaṃ paṃcamādigam ।
sarvvādimaṃ punarbhūyo asyādyaṃ punaruddharet ।।

yonipūrvvaṃ sanādaṃ ca vahniṃ trisvarabhūṣitam ।
tadvadasvaṃ prakurvīta kālaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

nādaṃ nādena saṃyuktaṃ varuṇaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।
dvijihvaṃ saptamāruḍhaṃ kālaṃ kālādyasaṃsthitam ।।

aṃkuśena śirākrāntaṃ vāyuṃ trisvarabhūṣitam ।
niṣedhaṃ tena saṃbhinnaṃ sadāśivamathoddharet ।।

krodhaśaṃkuniruddhaṃ tatpadametanmahābalam ।
ekaviśatimaṃ proktaṃ varṇaidvāṃviṃśatiryutam ।।
(129a)
pāpabhakṣaṇanāmānaṃ sarvvapāpāpahaṃ subham ।
taṃ nāsti pātakaṃ devi yadanena na śodhayet ।।

smaraṇāddevadeveśi sucisthānagataṃ param ।
bhasmasātkurute pāpaṃ liṃgotpāṭādikaṃ mahat ।।

paramāmaṃkuśākrāntaṃ niṣedhaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
punastameva cāpādiyuktaṃ devi samuddharet ।।

cāpādyanaṃdadaṃ jñeyamasādhitamatheśvari ।
punardadanmahāmāyā kālaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

mahānādaṃ nādayuktaṃ tṛtī{yā}dyaṃ ca kevalam ।
aśvaṃ marmmasthitaṃ kāryaṃ praṇavaṃ sasamīraṇam ।।

gaṇeśaṃ yonisahitaṃ varuṇasthaṃ tadantimam ।
vahniṃ trisvaramūrddhānaṃ punarantakamuddharet ।।

nādaṃ nādayutaṃ bhūyo ṣaṣṭhāṃdyaṃ paṃcamānvitam ।
vahniṃ rudrasthitaṃ bhūyo amṛtādyaṃ ca kevalam ।।

antakādyaṃ sapraṇavaṃ dvijihvaṃ punaruddharet ।
niṣedhaṃ trisvarākrāṃtaṃ punarantakamuddharet ।।

nādaṃ nādayutaṃ bhūyo gaṇeṃdraṃ punaruddharet ।
vahniṃ rudrasthitaṃ deyaṃ musalaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

sāṃkuśaṃ kālamatulaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ sayonikam ।
niṣedhamaṃkuśākrāṃtaṃ tadvadagnisamuddharet ।।

vāyuṃ kevalamuddhṛtya hayaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
karṇalāṃtaṃ punarbhūyo śakraṃ kevalamuddharet ।।
(129b)
cāpamaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ vahniṃ trisvarabhūṣitam ।
tadvadasvaṃ prakurvvīta balaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

asva(ma)rmmasthitaṃ bhūyo yonipūrvvaṃ ca sāṃkuśam ।
paṃcamādyaṃ vāyugatamaṃkuśena śirāhatam ।।

kevalaṃ vāyumuddhṛtya aśvaṃ trisvarabhāsuram ।
kālādyaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo cāpādyaṃ vahnisaṃyutam ।।

cāpādyaṃ yonisaṃyuktaṃ kālādyaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
punaścāpādimaṃ deyaṃ vahnisthaṃ yonibhūṣitam ।।

varuṇaṃ trisvaropetaṃ tatsthaṃ tasyāntagaṃ punaḥ ।
gaṇeśaṃ vahnisaṃruḍhaṃ aṃkuśākrāntamastakam ।।

amṛtaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo niṣedhaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।
punargaṇeṃdraṃ vahnisthaṃ caṃdraṃ kevalinaṃ punaḥ ।।

niṣedhaṃ trisvarā{krā}ntaṃ somaṃ varuṇasaṃsthitam ।
tribiṃdvaṃkaṃ mahāvahniṃ kālādyaṃ cāsvasaṃsthitam ।।

vahniṃ kālādimaṃ rudraṃ piṇḍībhūtā samuddharet ।
varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ caṃdraṃ varuṇasaṃsthitam ।।

aṣṭamasvaramūrddhānayonipūrvvaṃ ca kevalam ।
dvijihvaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ niṣedhaṃ ke(va)laṃ punaḥ ।।

tameva trisvarākrāntaṃ punardeyaṃ dvijihvakam ।
sāṃkuśaṃ gajanāthaṃ syātkālasthaṃ paṃcamādisam ।।

yonipūrvvaṃ yonicitraṃ nādaṃ vahnisaṣaṣṭhakam ।
caturddaśasvaropetaṃ biṃdunāhatamastakam ।।
(130a)
haṃsaviṃsargasahitaṃ devī krodhaṃ tataḥ punaḥ ।
marmaṃ yonisanāyuktaṃ tato deyaṃ prabhākaram ।।

ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo samīraṇamathoddharet ।
vahniṃ paṃcādimaṃ bhūyo paṃcamasthaṃ visargayuk ।।

catuḥ saptativarṇaṃ syādvāviṃśatitamaṃ padam ।
mahāmaṃtrogramatulaṃ devadevyāḥ prakīrttitam ।।

mahābhayapramathanaṃ sarvvopadravanāśanam ।
kṛtyā khārkhodamathanaṃ duḥkhadaubhāgyayodyanam ।।

padarājānamatulaṃ nāgāsurabhayaṃkaram ।
japtaṃ puruṣacakrasthaṃ tripurākramanena ca ।।

tadā siddhipradaṃ jñeyaṃ śatāvarttotmahātape ।
yāḥ kāścitsiddhayastaṃtre tava devi prakīrttitāḥ ।।

tāssādhayati deveśi niyataṃ padarāḍbhṛṣam ।
tārakaṃ punaruddhṛtya vāyorādyaṃ ca kevalam ।।

mahānādaṃ nādayuktaṃ kālādyaṃ cāṣṭamānvitam ।
kṛṣāṇḍaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ varuṇaṃ yonibhūṣitam ।।

varuṇasthaṃ tadantaṃ syādvahniṃ trisvaramaulinam ।
varuṇaṃ tena khacitaṃ kuṇḍalāntaṃ sapaṃcamam ।।

vahnikālasthitaṃ bhūyo śakraṃ mohanasaṃyutam ।
paṃcamasthaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ tatsthaṃ bāhu samuddharet ।।

dvidhā padamidaṃ kāryaṃ nādaṃ devi dvidhoccaret ।
mahāyonivibhūṣaṃ tu ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ vahnisaṃsthitam ।।
(130b)
aṃkuśena śirākrāntaṃ hayaṃ tenaiva cāṃkitam ।
bindunā bhūṣitaṃ mūrddhnā sāṃkuśaṃ kāntamuddharet ।।

nādaṃ trisvaramūrddhānaṃ dvidhā kāryaṃ padottamam ।
saptadhā kharparaṃ deyaṃ tatrādyaṃ vahnigaṃ trayam ।।

kālāgnibindumūrddhānaṃ trayamanyacca vahnigam ।
bindupraṇavasaṃyuktaṃ punaraṃnya trayaṃ dadet ।।

caturddhā kevalaṃ caita jñātavyaṃ padamuttamam ।
paṃcamaṃ cāṃkuśākrāṃtaṃ nādaṃ trisvarabhūṣitam ।।

padametaddvidhā kāryaṃ varuṇaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।
tṛtīyādyaṃ piṇḍabhūtaṃ yonilāsthitavigraham ।।

devīkrodhaṃ tataḥ paścānnādaṃ sṛṣṭisamanvitam ।
paṃcāśārṇaṃ padamidaṃ trayoviṃśatimaṃ smṛtam ।।

anena padarājena dīkṣā sarvvā prakārayet ।
tattvadikṣā kalādīkṣā bhauvanī padasaṃkṣakā ।।

varṇadīkṣā maṃtradīkṣā śaktidīkṣā tathāparā ।
jīvadīkṣā vāradīkṣā sparśadīkṣā tathaiva ca ।।

vedhadīkṣā ṣaṭprakārā vāgdīkṣā cāparā smṛtā ।
dhaṭadīkṣā paṭadīkṣā ghaṭadīkṣā tathāparā ।।

sadyo nirvāṇadā cānyā tathā nirvvāṇikīti ca ।
arddhacaṃdranirodhānyā nādacārā parāsmṛtā ।।

vyāpinī nāma cānyā syā dīkṣānyā samanābhidhā ।
unmanākhyā tathā dīkṣā guruvaktrobhidhāparā ।।
(131a)
ajākhyā sparśaviṣu{tā} vā praśāṃttākhyā tathaiva ca ।
visargadīkṣā paramā dhruvadīkṣottamottamā ।।

ālokadīkṣā subhage jñānavijñānajāparā ।
tricatvāriṃśati proktā yā dīkṣāstatra madhyata ।।

tāssarvvā padarājena prakuryāllīlayā guruḥ ।
pāṭhānmokṣapradaṃ jñeyaṃ padametanmahādhipe ।।

śāṭhyena japate yastu tasya siddhikarasthitā ।
gaṇeśādyaṃ samuddhṛtya mahākuṃḍalibaṃdhagam ।।

devāsya pṛṣṭhasaṃrūḍhaṃ yonibiṃduṃ vibhūṣitam ।
piṇḍametatsamākhyātaṃ sadyo melakasiddhidam ।।

kālāgnirudraṃ vāyuṃ ca varuṇaṃ śakrameva ca ।
kālaṃ cānaṃtamuddhṛtya vahniṃ nādaṃ tathoddharet ।।

arddhacaṃdraṃ tathā biṃdu tathā śāṃtakalāparā ।
piṃṇḍībhūtamidaṃ piṃdaṃ sarvvamaṃtrogranāyakam ।।

kṣaṇādāveśakaraṇaṃ yadi samyaksamuccaret ।
bhairavaṃ vahnipuṭitaṃ mohanībiṃdulāṃcchitam ।।

yadā śivo punardeyaṃ kuṇḍalaṃ vahnisaṃsthitam ।
yonibiṃdusamāyuktaṃ kālaṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

nādaṃ nādasamāyuktaṃ tṛtīyādyaṃ ca kevalam ।
aśvamarmmasthitaṃ bhūyo yonipūrvvaṃ ca sāṃkuśam ।।

śakraṃ trisvaramurddhānaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ laśīṃkuśam ।
kevalaṃ śakramuddhṛtya śāṃkuśaṃ vahnimuddharet ।।

paṃcamādyaṃ vahnisaṃsthaṃ trisūryeṇa śirāhatam ।
(131b)
dvijihvaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ kālaṃ svādimasaṃsthitam ।।

kevalaṃ vāyumuddhṛtya padametaddvidhā kuru ।
sāṃkuśaṃ vahnimuddhṛtya varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ tataḥ ।।

samīraṇaṃ punardatvā padametadvidhā kuru ।
āṃbhasaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ cāpādyaṃ vahnisaṃsthitam ।।

sāṃkuśaṃ kārayedenaṃ varuṇaṃ coddharettataḥ ।
punarvvāyuṃ samuddhṛtya padametadvidhā kuru ।।

varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ caṃdraṃ trisvarabhūṣitam ।
amṛtādyaṃ sūryasaṃsthaṃ ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ vahnipṛṣṭhagam ।।

trisūryālaṃkṛtaṃ kṛtvā yonicitraṃ samīranam ।
kālaṃ rudrasamopetaṃ jhāntaṃ vyādisthitaṃ kuru ।।

paṃcādyaṃ paṃcamasthaṃ ca dvidhā nādavisargiṇam ।
punarnādaṃ nādayutaṃ dvidhā deyaṃ surārcite ।।

yonipūrvvaṃ sanādaṃ ca dvi{dhā} vahniṃ samuddharet ।
sāṃkuśaṃ varuṇaṃ deyaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ sapaṃcamam ।।

śakraṃ yoniyutaṃ deyaṃ kālādyaṃ mohanāvṛtam ।
amṛtādyaṃ kevalaṃ ca vāyuṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

varuṇaṃ trisvaropetaṃ tatsthaṃ tasyāṃtamuddharet ।।
biṃduyuktaṃ prakarttavyaṃ ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ cāṃkuśāhatam ।।

paṃcamādyaṃ kevalinaṃ vāyuṃ kevalamuddharet ।
cāpādyaṃ praṇavākrāṃtaṃ somādyaṃ biṃdusaṃyutam ।।

aṃkuśenāhataṃ mūrddhnā kālaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
vahniṃ cāpādisaṃruḍhaṃ vāyuṃ kevalamuddharet ।।
(132a)
dvijihvaṃ mohanīyuktaṃ varuṇaṃ biṃdulāsthitam ।
graṃthiśaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ cāpādyasthaṃ punaśca tam ।।

punarvvāyuṃ kevalaṃ ca dvitīyaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
punarniṣedhaṃ dātavyaṃ taṃ ca cāpādigaṃ punaḥ ।।

trikoṇabhūṣitaṃ mūrddhnāṃ somaṃ varuṇasaṃsthitam ।
mukhadāraṇayā yuktaṃ tadyuktaṃ nādamuddharet ।।

yonipūrvvaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ syādvahniṃ yonivibhūṣitam ।
kevalaṃ varuṇaṃ deyaṃ somādyaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

caṃdraṃ yonyādigaṃ deyaṃ mukhadāraṇayānvitam ।
vahniṃ {yo} - kitaṃ deyaṃ bhīmaśaṃkunirodhitam ।।

dvijihvaṃ mohanīyuktaṃ varuṇaṃ pranavāṃkitam ।
paṃca{mā}dyaṃ svātmagataṃ aṃkuśākrāntamastakam ।।

kevalaṃ vahnimuddhṛtya vāyuṃ keva*muddharet ।
nādaṃ nādayutaṃ kṛtvā biṃdubhinnaṃ maheśvarī ।।

padametatsamākhyātaṃ sarvvasārasamuccayam ।
e(konna)śīti varṇaṃ ca bhogamokṣaphalapradam ।।

yathā tathā prajaptavyaṃ caturvviṃśatimaṃ padam ।
kṣobhakṛtsarvvabhūtānāṃ smara(ṇā)nmokṣadaṃ smṛtam ।।

trailokye nāsti tatkarmma yadanena na siddhyati ।
śatāvarttena subhage padasyāsya mahātmanaḥ ।।

jñānamāvirbhavettasya svataṃtau nātra saṃśayaḥ ।
divyaṃ paṃcakasaṃśuddhirjapādeva karotyayam ।।

mahāmelāpasaṃsiddhi śmaśānasthasya jāyate ।
bhūtabetālakhārkhode kṛtyāya smāranāśanam ।।
(132b)
sakṛtsaṃprokṣaṇenaiva prakuryāt padarāṭ bhṛśam ।
meṣavātāśanīnāṃ ca smaraṇādeva nāśayet ।।

rājopadravajāṃ doṣāṃ daivotthānapi ye sadā ।
yena (ādhyā)tmikā doṣā smaraṇādeva nāśayet ।।

senāstaṃbhaṃ japādeva jāyate sādhakasya tu ।
vaśyākarṣaṇavidveṣamāraṇoccāṭanādikam ।।

līlayā kurute mantrī padasyāsya makhārccanāt ।
puroktāssarvvadīkṣā yāstā anenaiva kārayet ।।

cintāmaṇisamaprakhyaṃ padametanmayā tava ।
kīrttitaṃ devadeveśi samaṃ yasya na vidyate ।।

punardeyā mahāmāyā punaḥ kālaṃ ca kevalam ।
nādaṃ nādasamāyuktaṃ tena yuktaṃ tathāntakam ।।

trisvarālaṃkṛtaṃ kāryaṃ kṛṣā{ṇḍaṃ}parameśvari ।
rāvaṇaṃ vahnigaṃ kāryaṃ yonibiṃduvibhūṣitam ।।

kuṇḍalāntaṃ vahniruḍhaṃ haṃsaṃ kālaṃ sthitaṃ punaḥ ।
punaḥ kālaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ syādvahniṃ trisvarabhūṣitam ।।

padadvayamidaṃ proktaṃ mahāghoraṃ durāhadam ।
pratipaṃcārṇamuddiṣṭaṃ paṃcaviṃśaṃ padottamam ।।

ṣaḍviṃśamaṃ ca deveśi trailokyakṣayakārakau ।
smaraṇāt padarājānau jagadetaccarācaram ।।

prapātayaṃti niyataṃ - - viṣṇupurāgamam ।
punardvijihvamuddhṛtya mohanībiṃdulāṃcchitam ।।

vahnyāruḍhaṃ tata kṛtvā yonipūrvvaṃ ca sāṃkuśam ।
(133a)
śakraṃ kevalamuddhṛtya sāṃkuśaṃ vahnimuddharet ।।

paṃcamādyaṃ vahnirūḍhaṃ trisvarālaṃkṛ{taṃ} kuru ।
yonipūrvvaṃ punardeyaṃ aṃkuśākrāntamastakam ।।

śakraṃ kevalamuddhṛtya somaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
ghāntaṃ yonyādigaṃ deyaṃ amṛtādigataṃ priye ।।

aśvatrisvaramūrddhānaṃ punarvvāyasamuddharet ।
sāṃkuśaṃ parameśāni punariṃdraṃ ca kevalam ।।

yonicitraṃ mahākālaṃ dvijihvaṃ kevalaṃ tataḥ ।
kālaṃ kālādiśaṃruḍhaṃ niṣedhaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।।

kālaṃśapraṇavaṃ bhūyo nādaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
aśvaṃ kevalamūrddhānaṃ kālādyaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

kālamādisthitaṃ bhūyo pranavākrāntamastakam ।।
paṃcamādyaṃ ca saśaracāpasthaṃ yonibhūṣitam ।।

punaḥ kālaṃ dadeddevi nādaṃ nādasamanvitam ।
kuṇḍalāṃtaṃ tato śakraṃ yonibhūṣitaśekharam ।।

praṇavena samāyuktaṃ vāyuṃ devi samuddharet ।
gaṇeśaṃ yonisaṃyuktaṃ varuṇāntaṃ ca tatsthitam ।।

tribiṃdukhacitaṃ vahniṃ kharparaṃ vahnimuccaret ।
nādamagnikṣayopetaṃ sāmādyaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।।

kekaraṃ yonimūrddhānaṃ bhairavaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
tadrūḍhaṃ jhāntamuddhṛtya trisvarāṃkaṃ hayaṃ punaḥ ।।

pusalāntaṃ punardeyaṃ punararddhāṅkitaṃ dadet ।
(133b)
tribiṃduśirasā bhinnaṃ bāhuṃ paṃcamasaṃsthitam ।।

cāpādyaṃ vahnisaṃruḍhaṃ vahnimaṃkuśasaṃyutam ।
dvijihvaṃ yonimurddhānaṃ varuṇasthaṃ tadādimam ।।

vahniṃ tribiṃdukhacitaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ ca kevalam ।
vahniṃ kevalamuddhṛtya ghāṃtaṃ yonyādyasaṃsthitam ।।

kālaṃ paṃcamasaṃrūḍhaṃ kharparaṃ trisvarāhatam ।
nādaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya caṃdraṃ svātmasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

ṣarparaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ śakraṃ ṣaṣṭhasthitaṃ punaḥ ।
somādyaṃ tri{sva}rākrāntaṃ kālādyaṃ cāṣṭamānvitam ।।

kevalaṃ vahnimuddhṛtya yonyaṃkaṃ varuṇaṃ tataḥ ।
tatsthaṃ tadādimaṃ deyaṃ tribiṃdvaṃkaṃ kṛṣāṇḍakam ।।

kuṇḍalaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ yonyādyaṃ svā(nta) saṃsthitam ।
aṃkuśenāhataṃ mūrddhnā vahniṃ trisvarabhūṣitam ।।

tenāṃkitaṃ hayaṃ bhūyo cāpaṃ trisvarabhūṣitam ।
amṛtādyaṃ vāyasasthaṃ saptamasvarasaṃsthitam ।।

vahnimaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ jihvilaṃ yonirāhatam ।
varuṇaṃ ca tadantaṃ ca piṇḍībhūtau samuddharet ।।

trisvareṇa yutaṃ vahniṃ nādaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
candramātmagataṃ kuryā kālādyaṃ kevalaṃ tataḥ ।।

ṣaṣṭhasthaṃ vahnimuddhṛtya trisvarākaṃ kalādhvaram ।
vahnimaṃkuśamūrddhānaṃ bhāskaraṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।
(134a)

yonicitraṃ tataścadraṃ varuṇāntaṃ ca tatsthitam ।
tribiduyuktaṃ vahniṃśaṃ caṃdraṃ kevalameva ca ।।

vahniṃ varuṇasaṃruḍhaṃ praṇavāṃkitamūrddhajam ।
paṃcamādyaṃ svakāyasthaṃ kālaṃ saptamabhūṣitam ।।

punaḥ kālaṃ kevalaṃ ca nādaṃ nādahataṃ punaḥ ।
punarnnādahataṃ kālaṃ saptamāṅkaṃ samīraṇam ।।

mukhadāraṇayā yuktaṃ vāruṇaṃ ca gaṇeśvaraṃ ।
saptamākrāntamurddhānaṃ varuṇāntaṃ ca tatsthitam ।।

trisvarālaṃkṛtaṃ bāhuṃ vārunaṃ tena śobhitam ।
varuṇaṃ ca tadantaṃ ca aṃkuśaṃ caikataḥ kuru ।।

yonipūrvvaṃ kevalinaṃ kṛṣāṇḍamamṛtādigam ।
aśvaṃ trisvarasaṃyuktaṃ vāruṇaṃ tena yojitam ।।

varuṇaṃ ca tadantaṃ ca piṇḍībhūtau samuddharet ।
vahniṃ ṣaṣṭhasthitaṃ bhūyo ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ trisvarānvitam ।।

hayaṃ tenāṃkitaṃ kāryaṃ haṃsaṃ paṃcamasaṃsthitam ।
aśvaṃ marmmasthitaṃ bhūyo paṃcamasthamathāntakam ।।

kharpparaṃ trisvarākrāṃtaṃ caṃdraṃ praṇavabhūṣitam ।
paśuṃ kevalamuddhṛtya analaṃ sāṃkuśaṃ tathā ।।

dvijihvaṃ yonisaṃbhinnaṃ varuṇāntaṃ ca tasthitam ।
vahniṃ trisvaramūrddhānaṃ tri{tī}yādyaṃ ca sāṃkuśam ।।

kṛtāntaṃ paṃcamārūḍhaṃ marmmasthaṃ cāśvamuddharet ।
(134b)
mahāyonisamāyuktaṃ tritīyādyaṃ triṃbiduyuk ।।

niṣedhaṃ paṃcamādyasthaṃ mukhadāraṇayā yutam ।
punaḥ kṛtāntaṃ deveśi hayaṃ trisvaralāsthitam ।।

mukhadāraṇayā yuktaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ samuddharet ।
indramaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ niṣedhaṃ yatvamādigam ।।

yonipūrvvaṃ saptamasthaṃ asyādyaṃ proddharetpunaḥ ।
trisvareṇa samāyuktamuddhareta niṣedhinam ।।

paṃcamasthaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ śakraṃ kevalamuddharet ।
aṃkuśenāhataṃ bāhuṃ dvijihvaṃ yonibhūṣitam ।।

varuṇāṃtaṃ tatsthitaṃ ca devāsyaṃ trisvarāhatam ।
dvijihvaṃ mohanākrāṃntaṃ varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

tṛtīyādyaṃ tato deyaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ svakāyagam ।
yonivahnipuṭaṃ kāryaṃ varuṇāntaṃ tadādigam ।।

vahniṃ trisvarasaṃbhinnaṃ āṃbhasaṃ tena bheditam ।
varuṇāntaṃ tadādisthaṃ śākraṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

anantaṃ kālasaṃruḍhaṃ trisvarālaṃkṛtaṃ kuru ।
varuṇaṃ tena sahitaṃ varuṇaṃ ca tadādimam ।।

varuṇāntaṃ kevalinaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ trisūryakam ।
paṃcamādisthitaṃ kārya tṛtīyādyaṃ trisūryayuk ।।

paṃcamādyaṃ ca ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ vahnimekatra coddharet ।
yonipūrvvaṃ saptamasthaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ trisūryayuk ।।
(135a)
māhānādaṃ caturddhā syāttatrādyadvayasaṃyutam ।
visarggasaṃyutaṃ kāryaṃ dvayamanyunmaheśvari ।।

somaṃ varuṇasaṃruḍhaṃ mukhadāraṇayā yutam ।
nādaṃ nādayutaṃ kāryaṃ padamatyuttamottamam ।।

saptāviṃśatimaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvvasaubhāgyadāyakam ।
ekā - saptatyadhikaṃ varṇānāṃ satamuttamam ।।

sarvvasaukhyapradaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvvatrā dvipradaṃ smṛtam ।
sarvvasaṃkaradoṣaghnaṃ sarvvāla - vināśanam ।।

na ta{dva}stvasti deveśi yadanena na siddhyati ।
sarvvakarmmakaraṃ jñeyaṃ smaraṇādapi maṃtriṇaḥ ।।

sakṛtpāṭhena subhage bhagenmokṣapradaṃ nṛnām ।
prayānakāle yasyedaṃ mukhamālokya kīrttayat ।।

taṃ nayedbrahmasāyojyaṃ sādhako nātra saṃśayaḥ ।
sākṣādbhairavavadṛśyet smaraṇādasya bhairavi ।।

yasmiṃ deśe japedenaṃ padarājamanuttamam ।
taṃ deśaṃ sakalaṃ devi sthāvaraijaṅgamaissaha ।।

nayate śivasāyojyaṃ sahasrājñāya yogataḥ ।
mahāmelāpakaṃ devi smaraṇādeva jāyate ।।

sarvvadevīmayamidaṃ sarvvarudramayaṃ padam ।
sarvvarakṣākaramidaṃ trailokyagrasanākulam ।।
(135b)
śāṃtikaṃ pauṣṭikaṃ yetadrāyurārogyavarddhanam ।
yasmiṃnyesmiṃ japeccakkre ādhāre vā surārcite ।।

tasmiṃ tatsiddhidaṃ jñeyaṃ bahunā kathitena kiṃ ।
yathā tathā prajaptantu sarvvāpadvinivāraṇam ।।

sarvvasaṃpatpradaṃ jñeyaṃ sadā paṭhitasiddhidam ।
labdhesmin padarājāte tataḥ prabhṛti sādhakam ।।

vijñāyate śaktikule yathā bhairavanāyakam ।
yāvatsarvveṣu tantreṣu kriyākarmmavicāridam ।।

tāvatsarvvamatenaiva sādhayet smaraṇena tu ।
atha krodhaṃ mahāghoraṃ dvidhā deyaṃ mahādbhutam ।।

kālakevalamuddhṛtya paṃcamādyaṃ ca sāṣṭamam ।
varuṇaṃ ca tadantaṃ ca dvidhā bhūtau samuddharet ।।

piṇḍavaddevadeveśi tato vahniṃ samuddharet ।
trisvarālaṃkṛtaṃ kāryaṃ ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

agniṃ kevalamuddhṛtya tathaivāṃtakamuddharet ।
tribiṃdubhinnaṃ varuṇaṃ tṛtīyādyaṃ svadehagam ।।

yonibhūṣitamūrddhānaṃ caṃdraṃ varuṇasaṃsthitam ।
mukhadāraṇayā yuktaṃ nādaṃ nādahataṃ punaḥ ।।

trayodaśākṣaramidaṃ aṣṭāviṃśatimaṃ padam ।
mahāsamayadoṣaghnaṃ māhāpātakanāśanam ।।

avadhūtaṃ tanurbhūtvā nirācārastu sādhakaḥ ।
(136a)
smaraṇena samuccāryaṃ madametadanaṃdritaḥ ।।

paṃcaratnapavitrastu paṃcamudrāsumudritaḥ ।
melāpasiddhimāyāti mateśvaryāḥ prasādataḥ ।।

punastārakamuddhṛtya pañcamādyaṃ sasaptamam ।
tṛtīyādyaṃ kevalinaṃ yonyādyaṃ sāṅgasaṃsthitam ।।

jihvilaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ ādyaṃ yadva{hniṃ} saṃsthitam ।
niṣedhaṃ ca dvidhoddhṛtya antimaṃ trisvarāhatam ।।

ṣakāraṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ tṛtīyādyaṃ sacaṃḍakam ।
yonipūrvvaṃ svakāyasthamagnyaṃkuśavibheditam ।।

kevalaṃ vahnimuddhṛtya āsyādau cāpamuddharet ।
aṃkuśāhatamūrddhānaṃ kevalaṃ cāpamuddharet ।।

vahniṃ svakṣayasaṃyuktaṃ kūpavaktraṃ savahnikam ।
mohanībiṃdumūrddhānaṃ tadvannāntaṃ samuddharet ।।

tadvaccāpaṃ samuddhṛtya sarvvapūrvvampunardadet ।
ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo amṛtaṃ cāpi vahnikam ।।

paṃcamasthaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ padametatsamuddhṛtam ।
ekonatriṃśamaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvvabhogabharāvaham ।।

dvāviṃśatyakṣaraṃ subhru tathā khyātaṃ yathārthataḥ ।
anena padanāthena saptavāsarasevanāt ।।

sarvvādhāravikāsarvve sarvvacakkraprabhedanam ।
atulā ca mahāvyāptirjāyate sādhakasya tu ।।

na ta(tkiṃ)cijjagatyasti yadanena na siddhyati ।
(136b)
tasmādena japenmaṃtrī kṛtvā niścayamātmanaḥ ।।

punastridhā tārakaṃ syāt saprameyaṃ surārccite ।
kālādyaṃ vahnisaṃrūḍhaṃ ṣaṣṭhabiṃdupuṭīkṛtam ।।

tridhā samuddhareddevi dvijihvaṃ tadvadudharet ।
nādaṃ nādahataṃ kāryaṃ bindubhinnaṃ mahābalam ।।

triṃśatsaṃkhyākametaddhi daśārṇaṃ padamuttamam ।
etatpadavaraṃ devi bhogamokṣaprasiddhidam ।।

kaṃde syaṃde tathā vidau japtaṃ sarvvaprasiddhidam ।
vidyāpiṭhasya sarvvasya sārabhūtamudāhṛtam ।।

tannāsti yanna deveśi sādhayetpadarāḍ bhṛśam ।
punaḥ kuṇḍalamuddhṛtya vahniṃ saṃpuṭitaṃ priye ।।

yonibiṃdvaṃkitaṃ mūrddhnā piṃḍametanmahābalam ।
dvijihvaṃ bhairavāsīnaṃ vahnisaṃpuṭitaṃ kuru ।।

mohanībiṃdusaṃyuktaṃ piṃḍametanmahābalam ।
dvijihvaṃ paṃcamāruḍhaṃ biṃdubhinnaṃ niyojayet ।।

candraṃ sṛṣṭiyutaṃ kāryaṃ paṃcārṇaṃ padamuttamam ।
praṇavātaṃ prītidaṃ syāt sarvvāmayanivāraṇam ।।

ekatriṃśatimaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvālakṣmīnisūdanam ।
bhogamokṣapradaṃ jñeyaṃ kaṃdasyaṃdādarā yadā ।।

japtaṃ sādhakamukhyena sukhasaubhāgyasiddhidam ।
yadā prāptaṃ gurumukhāt padametadanuttamam ।।

tadaiva muktatā tasya sādhakasya udāhṛtā ।
(137a)
nāmnā mṛtyuṃjayamidaṃ padaṃ devi tavoditam ।।

śāṃtipuṣṭikaraṃ samyak mumurṣorapi bhairavi ।
mahāmelāpasaṃsiddhi(sma)raṇādeva jāyate ।।

vaṃdayaṃti hitaṃ nityaṃ yoginyaḥ pranatapriye ।
yasya hṛtsaṃsthitamidaṃ padarājānamuttamam ।।

punastārakamuddhṛtya niṣedhaṃ punareva hi ।
praṇavena samopetaṃ kṛtāṃtaṃ devi dāpayet ।।

kṛtāntaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo nādaṃ nādasamanvitam ।
punarnādayutaṃ kālaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ sasaptamam ।।

kālādyamaṣṭamākrāntaṃ vahniṃ kevalamuddharet ।
yonyaṃkitaṃ ca varuṇaṃ varuṇasthaṃ tadantimam ।।

trisvarāṃkaṃ tathā vāhnaṃ yamaṃ kevalamuddharet ।
nādaṃ nādayutaṃ kāryaṃ ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ vahnimuddharet ।।

kevalaṃ kālaṃ puruṣaṃ cāpamaṃkuśasaṃyutam ।
kālaṃ niṣedhaṃ saṃruḍhaṃ mukhadāraṇayānvitam ।।

varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ somāṃtāṃtasthitaṃ kuru ।
trisvarālaṃkṛtaṃ kāryaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ sayonikam ।।

etatpadaṃ mahāraudraṃ bhayasyāpi bhayapradam ।
ekaviṃśativarṇoyaṃ padarāṭ sarvvasiddhidaḥ ।।

dvātriṃśamo mahābhāge paratejo prakāśakaḥ ।
biṃdukuṃbhe japedevaṃ devyākārapradarśakam ।।

bhogamokṣapradaṃ sāraṃ trailokyamokṣadāyakam ।
labdhesmindevi boddhavyaṃ prasaktāḥ śaktayo mama ।।
(137b)
smṛtaṃ siddhipradaṃ proktaṃ yathā bhairavanāyakam ।
paṭhitaṃ sādhayeddevi sādhakasyābhilāpagam ।।

punarmarmmāntamuddhṛtya vahninādavibhūṣitam ।
biṃduyuktaṃ tridhā devi devyākrodhaṃ dvidhā punaḥ ।।

sanādaṃ yonipūrvvaṃ syādvāhnaṃ tenaiva śobhitam ।
niṣedhaṃ paṃcamādyasthaṃ devādyaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

sanādaṃ varuṇaṃ deyaṃ caṃdraṃ trisvaraśobhitam ।
niṣedhaṃ tena sahitaṃ puruṣaṃ kevalaṃ tataḥ ।।

nādaṃ nādasamāyuktaṃ caṃdraṃ paṃkādigaṃ punaḥ ।
rephāruḍhaṃ piṃḍitaṃ syādvāhnamaṃkuśabheditam ।।

dvijihvaṃ yonisahitaṃ nāṃtau piṃḍasthitau kuru ।
vāhnaṃ trisūryasaṃyuktaṃ dvijihvaṃ mohanānvitam ।।

varuṇāṃ ca tṛtīyādyaṃ kevalau varṇanāyakau ।
yonyādyaṃ piṃḍanāyuktaṃ vahniyonivibhūṣitam ।।

īṃdrāṃtau piṃḍitau deyau devāsyaṃ satribiṃdukam ।
nādaṃ nādasamaupetaṃ biṃduśobhitamastakam ।।

māhāmṛtaṃ sṛṣṭiyutaṃ dvidhā deyaṃ surārcite (ṭā) ।
aṣṭāviṃśākṣaramidaṃ trayastriśatimaṃ padam ।।

jagatyasmiṃ na tathāsti yadanena na sādhayet ।
punāti saptapāpāni liṃgotpāṭādikāni cā ।।

pāṭhātmokṣapradaṃ devi padametanmayoditam ।
kruddhasya muccare devi kuṃbhakena prayogataḥ ।।
(138a)
śatrunāmayutaṃ kṛtvā mārayasva padairyutam ।
śatoccārānmārayate yadi śākraṃ sutaṃ mahat ।।

dhyānayogena vā devī dhyāyet kālānalopamā ।
khaḍgena chedayaṃtītaṃ sādhyaṃ vitrasthalocanam ।।

tadā mālayate devi galovarnnā mahābalā ।
sarvvakāmapradamidaṃ padaṃta - - - - tam ।।

kākabhāṣā punardeyā śākraṃ kevalamuddharet ।
paṃcamasthaṃ mahākālaṃ kharparaṃ koṇabhūṣitam ।।

kākabhāṣā punardeyā - kraṃyonisamanvitam ।
varuṇaṃ caṇḍanāthaṃ ca piṃḍībhūtau samuddharet ।।

tribiṃdubhūṣitaṃ bāhuṃ kākabhāṣā punardadet ।
punariṃdraṃ pradātavyaṃ varuṇaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।।

praṇavena samopetaṃ kṛtāntaṃ saṃpradāpayet ।
tṛtīyādyaṃ kevalinaṃ niṣedhaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।।

bāhuṃ trisvaraparyaṃtāḥ dvitīyena samanvitam ।
cāpādyaṃ vahnisahitaṃ cāpādyaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

vāyuṃ trisvaramurddhānaṃ paṃcamādyaṃ sayonikam ।
bāhuṃ ca kevalaṃ deyaṃ hayaṃ marmmasthitaṃ punaḥ ।।

puruṣaṃ paṃcamāruḍhaṃ asyādyaṃ pu{na}ruddharet ।
mahānādaṃ rudraruḍhaṃ asyādyaṃ punareva hi ।।

kākabhāṣā punardeyā śakraṃ trisvaraśobhitam ।
mahāmāyā maheśāni nādaṃ vahnisamāyutam ।।

sṛṣṭiyuktaṃ prakarttavyaṃ devī krodhaṃ punardadet ।
(138b)
catustriṃśatimaṃ jñeyaṃ triṃśadarṇaṃ padottamam ।।

yadā nābhikulāruḍhaṃ paranṛtyavalaṃbakaḥ ।
(ja)petpadamidaṃ devi atītaṃ jāyate tadā ।।

spaṃdodaragataṃ devi yadā padamidaṃ japet ।
tadā devi prajānāti kālaṃ yaddhamānakam ।।

yadā biṃdukalāruḍhaṃ padametadudāharet ।
tadā sarvvaṃ prajānāti kālatrayamataṃdritaḥ ।।

svapne paśyati tatsarvvaṃ smaraṇād yadabhīṣṭakam ।
prasenā sarvvayāvartti khorikāṃ sādhayet kṣaṇāt ।।

kāṇḍaveśaṃ latāveśaṃ mū(sa)lāveśamuttamam ।
khaḍgāveśaṃ prakurute līlayaiva hi sādhakaḥ ।।

tannāsti yanna deveśi padenānena sādhayet ।
punastārakamuddhṛtya ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ vahnimuddharet ।।

puruṣaṃ yonimurddhānaṃ mohā krodhaṃ punastathā ।
paṃcārṇaṃ padametaddhi paṃcatriṃśatimaṃ padam ।।

padametanmahābhāge trailokyai(śva)ryadāyakam ।
hṛtpadmajagataṃ devi sādhayenmanasīpsitam ।।

sarvvādimaṃ punardeyaṃ śūlaṃ pranavasaṃyutam ।
vahnitatkṣayasaṃyuktaṃ mahākrodhaṃ punardadet ।।

caturakṣarametaddhi ṣaṭtrīṃśaṃ padamuttamam ।
sarvvasiddhipradaṃ sāraṃ kṣaṇādāveśakārakam ।।

sarvvagraṃthivibhedaṃ ca padenāśva prajāyate ।
paramaṃ svasvarūpaṃ yatsatprakāśatvameṣyati ।।

parāparādikā siddhiḥ kṣaṇādeśaprasādhayet ।
(139a)
ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ punaruddhṛtya vahnikevalamuddharet ।।

puruṣaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ śūlaṃ praṇavasaṃyutam ।
bāhuṃ yoniyutaṃ kāryaṃ nādaṃ sṛṣṭisamanvitam ।।

ṣaḍakṣaraṃ padamidaṃ saptātriṃśatimaṃ smṛtam ।
sarvvapāpaharaṃ proktaṃ mahāsamayadoṣabhuk ।।

janmakādyaṃ yutaiḥ pāpaṃ yaṃ naraiḥ samupārjitam ।
tadasya smaraṇādeva bhasmasādyāti bhairavi ।।

sakṛjjihvāgracalitaṃ nāśayetsarvvakilviṣam ।
prayacchati mahāmokṣaṃ siddhaya śroṇimodikāḥ ।।

laṃbikā kuharāntasthaṃ sarvvaṃ saṃsādhayetpalam ।
punarvviccādimaṃ varṇaṃ tejiśavaruṇasthitam ।।

praṇavāṃkitamūrddhānaṃ cāpādyaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
trisvarākrāntamūrddhānaṃ bāhūṃ devi samuddharet ।।

punaḥ krodhaṃ devadevyā samuddhāryaṃ surārcite ।
paṃcārṇaṃ padametaddhi aṣṭatriṃśatimaṃ priye ।।

paramaṃ padametaddhi viśvā vyāpakaraṃ smṛtam ।
ananodīritenaiva kampaṃte kulaparvvatāḥ ।।

jayaśabdaṃ prakurvvaṃti sādhaka(sya) divaukasaḥ ।
khecaryo niyataṃ cāsya pūjayaṃti surottame ।।

sarvvasiddhipradaṃ jñeyaṃ mahārudhirakarṣakam ।
paṃcāmṛtasamākṛṣṭiṃ padenānena sādhayet ।।

anena padarājena sarvve karmmāṇi sādhayet ।
mahānādaṃ tridhādeyaṃ biṃdubhinnaṃ maheśvari ।।
(139b)

prathamaṃ cāgninādasthaṃ dvitīyaṃ vahnimohagam ।
tṛtīyaṃ vahniṣaṣṭhasthaṃ kāryaṃ suravarārccite ।।

amṛtaṃ varuṇāruḍhaṃ mukhadāraṇayā yutam ।
nādaṃ nādahataṃ kāryaṃ paṃcārṇaṃ padamuddhṛtam ।।

catvāriṃśaṃ ekahīnaṃ samāsāttava varṇitam ।
mokṣapradaṃ padamidaṃ samāsāttava varṇitam ।।

amunā padarājena sādhayatsa carācaram ।
mahāmelāpakaraṇaṃ sakṛtsmṛtamidaṃ padam ।।

vedhaghaṭṭanirodhādi āveśaṃ bahuvistaram ।
karoti devadevesi triśūnye smaraṇena tu ।।

sarvvakarmmakaraṃ jñeyaṃ smaraṇādeva bhāmini ।
sarvvataṃtreṣu sāmānyaṃ padametadudāhṛtam ।।

kevalaṃ kālamuddhṛtya nādaṃ nādahataṃ punaḥ ।
kālādyaṃ pra{-}vakrāṃtaṃ gaṇeśaṃ vāyunādagam ।।

varuṇaṃ kevalaṃ deyaṃ caṃdraṃ sāṃkuśamuddharet ।
niṣedhaṃ trisvarākrāntaṃ yonyādyaṃ yonibhūṣitam ।।

dvijihvaṃ savisarggasyāt punareva hitaṃ dadet ।
catvāriṃśatimaṃ jñeyaṃ daśārṇaṃ padamuttamam ।।

smaraṇādbhogyadamidaṃ padaṃ suravarārcitam ।
yataḥ kālātpadavaraṃ prāptaṃ sādhakapuṃgavai ।।

tataḥ prabhṛti teṣā syāllakṣmī sā saptapauruṣī ।
yathā nārāyaṇe devi tathā syāt sādhakeśvara ।।

acalā niyataṃ lakṣmī dhanadhānyasamṛddhidā ।
punastārakamuddhṛtya niṣedhaṃ punaruddharet ।
praṇavena samākrāṃntaṃ kālaṃ deyaṃ vipaścitā ।।
(140a)
kākabhāṣā tato deyo śākraṃ trisvaraśobhitam ।
punaḥ kālaṃ kevalinaṃ nādaṃ nādasamanvitam ।।

kākabhāṣā punardeyā punariṃdraṃ tribhūṣitam ।
nādaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya vahniṃ kevalamuddharet ।।

aśvaṃ trisvarasaṃbhinnaṃ cāpādyaṃ paṃcamasthim ।
varuṇaṃ kharparāṃrūḍhaṃ varuṇāntaṃ ca kevalam ।।

kālaṃ kevalamuddhṛtya niṣedhaṃ trisvarāhatam ।
tṛtiyādyaṃ kevalinaṃ aśvamarmmasanādakam ।।

trisvarālaṃkṛtaṃ śakraṃ yonipūrvvaṃ samuddharet ।
sanādaṃ bāhumuddhṛtya śakraṃ trisvaraśobhitam ।।

kākabhāṣā punardeyā ṣaṣṭhādyaṃ nādasaṃyutam ।
indraṃ trisūryamūrddhānaṃ tenāṃkaṃ cāniṣedhakam ।।

īṃdraṃ kevalamuddhṛtya agniṃvaruṇasaṃsthitam ।
dvijihvaṃ varu{ṇā}ḍhaṃ asya paścāt samuddharet ।।

aṃkuśākrāntamūrddhānaṃ devāsyaṃ saṃpradāpayat ।
yonipūrvvaṃ samūddhṛtya amṛtādyaṃ savahnikam ।।

aśvaṃ tribiṃdusahitaṃ kuṃḍalāntaṃ savahnikam ।
haṃsaṃ kālasamārūḍhaṃ mukhadāraṇayā yutaṃ ।।

aśvamaṃkuśasaṃyuktaṃ samīraṇakṛtāsanam ।
cāpādyaṃ trisvarākrāṃtaṃ kālamaṃkuśasaṃyutam ।।

paṃcamādyaṃ saptamasthaṃ niṣedhaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।
cāpādiruḍhaṃ taṃ bhūyo niṣedhaṃ trisvarāṃkitam ।।
(140b)
niṣedhaṃ kevalaṃ bhūyo na cāpādisthitaṃ punaḥ ।
mukhadāraṇayā yuktaṃ niṣedhaṃ kevalaṃ punaḥ ।।

cāpādiruḍhaṃ graṃthiśaṃ cāpādyaṃ sāṃkuśaṃpunaḥ ।
samīraṇaṃ trisūryāṃkaṃ hayaṃ tenaiva bhūṣitam ।।

paṃcadhātāramuddhṛtya paṃcadhānyaṃ sadāśivam ।
mahāmādyaśvarī bhūyo paṃcadhā sā pradāpayat ।।

mahārāvaṃ tathā vahniṃ yonibiṃduvibhūṣitam ।
tridhā samuddhareddevi paścāccaṃdramathāharet ।।

varuṇasthaṃ sanādaṃ ca nādaṃ nādahataṃ punaḥ ।
saptatyarṇaṃ padamidaṃ tava devi prakāśitam ।।

catvāriṃśakasaṃyuktaṃ sarvvasaṃpatpradāyakam ।
sarvvaduḥkhapraśamanaṃ sarvvahiṃsaṃkasūdanam ।।

sarvvālakṣmī praśamanaṃ bhayadāridraghātakam ।
yadā smarecchakticakkre padametadanaṃdritaḥ ।।
tadā sarvvāṇi karmmāṇi padarāṭsādhayiṣyati ।।

yāvaṃti karmmāṇi purā proktā nyasmiṃ jayadrathe ।
tāvanti sarvāṇi sadā sādhayet padarāṭbhṛṣam ।।

kiṃ vā bahutareṇeha kīrttitena sumadhyame ।
evaṃ tava samākhyātā vidyāghoratarā priye ।
sahasramakṣarāṇāṃ ca catuḥṣaṣṭhi yutaṃ mayā ।।

padānyakī(hi)kinīha catvāriṃśati śuvrate ।
eṣā ghoratarā vidyā sarvvakarmakarī smṛtā ।।

yāvaṃti taṃtrarājāni vidyāpīṭhasthitāni tu ।
tāvat sutantrarājeṣu nedṛśāṃ vidyate kvacit ।
vīryamasyāḥ prabhāvaṃ ca vyaktiḥ pada vinirṇayam ।।

na samarthosmi deveśi cakkraṃ varṣāyutarapi ।
sādāśivairmaheśāni vaktrakoṭyayutāyutaiḥ ।।
(141a)
eṣā śā paramā śaktireṣā paramā kalā ।
eṣā sā trīśvarī devī eṣā cakkravareśvarī ।।

eṣā kulamukhā{nta}sthā eṣā maṃtrāraṇe smṛtā ।
eṣā kuṇḍalacakkreśī eṣā sarvvāyudhāntagā ।।

eṣā nāḍikulārūḍhā eṣā heṣāravāraṇī ।
eṣā sā nābhicakkreśī bhoginī bhogalālasā ।।

eṣā karmakulārūḍhā paramāghoravidyatā ।।
eṣā syaṃdodararatā tricaitanyaprakāśikā ।।

eṣā kālikuleśāni ghaṭākāraprabhedini ।।
eṣā trivikkramakule ghaṃṭā(dhā)re vijṛṃbhati ।।

eṣā mantramadaṃgābhā biṃdupadmavaneratā ।।
mayā na kalārūḍhā eṣāṃtargaśikhā smṛtā ।।

śaktipadmodaragatā yogeśī parameśvarī ।।
tannāstiryanna kurute tannāstiryanna sādhayet ।।

tannāstiryanna dahate devadevī karaṃkiṇī ।।
asyākhyā grahaṇādeva brahmāṇḍaṃ hūhukaiḥ saha ।।

kampate vepate tūrṇaṃ jvalate ca muhurmuhuḥ ।।
prastāraṃ pacyate yau vai devyāmantravicintitam ।।

dīkṣitaḥ sarvvatantreṣu sa bhavennātra saṃśayaḥ ।।
sarvvakhecaricakkrānāṃ pūjyomānyaśca jāyate ।।

saptāhaṃ smarate yāvat vidyāṃ ghoraparākramām ।।
tāvajñānaṃ svadehasthaṃ sādhakasyopajāyate ।।

apaścimena deveśi janmanā jñāyate bhṛṣam ।।
nānyeyā yugakoṭībhirdevī mantramavāpyate ।।

etattavauktaṃ (ti)rirā putri sarvva{sya} yadvarmyatamaṃ mahārgham ।।

vidyā sughorā paramārkkakālī sahasravarṇā hṛdayeśvarī yā ।
kimvā paraṃ vacmi tavā śuśīghraṃ kramāgataṃ bhairavī tadvadasya ।।
(141b)
rahasyamatyuttamasāramagryaṃ vadāmi tatte manasī hitaṃ yat ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathajāmale mahātantre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
ghoraghoratarācakkre sahasrākṣarāyā maṃtroddhāravidhiḥ ।। ।।

evaṃ śrutvā devadevi bhairavasya mukhāttataḥ ।
abhavatparamaprītā saṃtoṣāmṛtapūritā ।।

bhūyo saṃśayamāpannā uvāca jagatāṃ patiṃ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

tṛptāsmi parameśāna śāstrāmṛtamidaṃ mahat ।
carvvayaṃtī śrotrapeyaṃ rahasyaṃ paramādbhutam ।।

tvaṃ prabhuḥ sarvvajagatāṃ tvaṃ dhātā tvaṃ parāgatiḥ ।।

surārāti kṣayakaraṃ mamagrāmaravaṃditaḥ ।
tvaṃ hṛtpadmamahāhaṃ sastvaṃ caṇḍārccissuṣumnagaḥ ।
tvaṃ dehaparvvatapṛṣṭhe ciccaṃdraḥ pravijṛṃbhase ।।

tvāṃ bodhapadmaṣaṇḍeṣu sūrye ca pravirājase ।
tvaṃ tridhāmottasaṃghaṭṭe śaktivīryakalādharaḥ ।।

hṛ(tśma)śāna mahābhūmau tvaṃ vīravarabhūṣaṇaḥ ।
mahākarmmavarodyāna pramattasthaṃ madālasaḥ ।।

biṃdupuṣparasāhārī ṣaṭpadastvaṃ padolvaṇaḥ ।
ā(ṣā)hime padasyekā devyo nānyā maheśvara ।।

bhinnā vāpyatha vā bhinnā ekavīrā yathāthavā ।
pūjyābhinne svarupārddhā tathā me kiṃdhisaṃśayaṃ ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

sādhu pṛcchasi deveśi siṃdhurājahitaiṣiṇi ।
ekavīrā niraṃgā ca yadyapīyaṃ mahābalā ।।

tathāpi nāmato bhinnā ekaiva śṛṇu bhairavī ।
kāryabhedāṃ nāmabhedaṃ vastuto nāsti kiṃcana ।।

vidyeyaṃ mālayikhāyā sthitāstā śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ ।
(142a)
huṃkāriṇī mahāmārī sthulāvektrā tathāparā ।।

smaśānabhasmadigdhāṃgī tretāgnihṛdayāparā ।
citi jvālā kulā bhāvyā śmaśānāsavayāparā ।।

mahāśmaśānavasanā kālāgnidayitāparā ।
tathā kaṣakaraṃkī ca haṃ(ḍṭāhaḍṭā) yudhānaṣā ।।

sarvvaduḥ{kha}vināśā ca tathā vikṛtanāśinī ।
mahābhīmā bhīṣaṇī yā jvālāmālinīreva ca ।।

sarvvabhogapradā cānyā tṛptajvālā tathāparā ।
tridhāmāntaracāri ca mahāḍambaranāśinī ।।

mokṣalakṣmī tathā cānyā vivikte daśanāṃtrikā ।
sarvvānyā mārikā cānyā karālī cāparā smṛtā ।।

atha smṛti vināśānyā paramāmṛtakarṣaṇī ।
tathāparā kalāvāsā jīvādhyāyinikāparā ।।

māhāvidyā tathā devī mahāśāṃkāriṇī tathā ।
māhārāviṇi nāmā ca śakunī caṃkurī tathā ।
caṃḍālī kālikā caiva mahāsaṃkarṣaṇī tathā ।।

ḍāmareśī tathā cānyā tathā jñeyaprabhāparā ।
nāmnā bhagavatī cānyā tathā yaṃtrapramāthinī ।।

mahāmāyā trilokasya jananī vigatā mayā ।
māhāmātriśvarī cānyā bhairaveśī tathāparā ।।

caṃḍā ca caṃḍaghaṃṭā ca cidānaṃdā tathāparā ।
ānaṃda bharitā cānyā harahūṃkāriṇīparā ।।

viśvarāviṇikā cānyā mahāmāyā tathāparā ।
jñānaśaktistathā cānyā tathā jñaiyaprabhāparā ।।

mahāpuruṣabhojānyā pātakāntakarī tathā ।
mahāvijñaṃ(bhānandanyā) caṃdayogeśvarīparā ।।

mahāpuruṣabhojānyā mahāgarudamātrikā ।
nārāyanabalā cānyā caṃdakātyāyaṇīparā ।।

tathā rudrapadā cānyā viśvagrāsinikā tathā ।
bhūrbhuvaḥśva svarākārā sarvatra jananīparā ।।
(142b)

jagātmikā parādevi huṃḍānyā parameśvarī ।
mahābhairavanātheśī tathā budharjjanapriyā ।।

jīvanirdalakṛccānyā prāṇagrāsa tathāparā ।
khādanī naiva viccā ca tathānyā caṇḍakālikā ।।

kālarātrī jaṃbhanī ca rāviṇī drāviṇī tathā ।
vidrāvaṇī tathā cānyā vasiṣṭhapriyakāparā ।।

varākulā bhīṣaṇī yā doṣanirdalanāparā ।
jīvasammardanī cānyā ānaṃdajananīparā ।।

svāhākāravaṣaṭkārā jīvasyottāraṇī tathā ।
mahāmārī brahmamārī kālarātriśca karṣaṇī ।।

kālamekhalikā cānyā jambhanī mohanī tathā ।
bhaṃ bhontha devadeveśī yogeśī na mahābalā ।।

kharaheṣā tathā cānyā dhāṃjhārī ca tathāparā ।
ḍhaṇḍhā devi samākhyātā rudrarājeśvarī tathā ।।

karaṃkamukhikā devī tathā haṭṭakhalūpikā ।
bhairaveśvari phekkārī vidyārājeśvarī tathā ।।

tathā haṭṭabharūdrī ca rākṣaseśvarikāparā ।
sarvottamā mahāmāyā vāgeśī viśvakarmaṇī ।।

viśvarūpā huṃḍamukhī somarājeśvarī tathā ।
cāmuṃḍā ca tathā cānyā cintāmaṇikalāṃnakī ।।

kularājeśvarī caiva jīvacakkreśvarī tathā ।
viśvalakṣmī viśvaśaktistathā citprakṛtiḥ parā ।।

caṃḍeśī paramāviccā tricakkrajananīparā ।
ṣaṭcakkrādhāradharaṇī mātribhairavanāyakī ।।

tathā paramadhāmasthā huṃkārāṃtaravāriṇī ।
mahāstrarājacakkreśī yoginī jālaśaṃvarā ।।
(143a)
kālavaktrātadeśānī tathā kālavimocanī ।
rudrasya dayitā cānyā caṃḍāmuṇḍā ca huṃḍikā ।।

kālī ca paramā caiva aghorā cāparā smṛtā ।
tathā paramaghorānyā anyā viśvodarīti ca ।।

mahābhogyā vasānā ca kālī cānyā prakīrttitā ।
mahākālī ca haraṇī tathā duḥkhavināśanī ।।

caṇḍālī ca karālī ca kālikā mālinī tathā ।
sarvajvaraghnavikhyātā brahmāṇyādiṣu nandanī ।।

mahānaṃdapradā jñeyā paścimā parameśvarī ।
evaṃ devī svayaṃ klinnā sahasrākṣaramālinī ।।

devatā nāmabhedena yājyapūjyā sadaiva sā ।
tāvaṃti vara bhedāni devadevyā bhavaṃti hi ।।

svapadasthena sarvāsāṃ pūjanaṃ samudāhṛtam ।
tattakarmakarī jñeyā paṃcavīryaṃ hi yatpriye ।।

evaṃ deva sahasrāṇi bhavaṃtyasyā sadaiva hi ।
pūrvāvaraṇayogena ṣaḍaṣṭa dvādaśoditai ।।

ṣoḍaśārddhacaturviṃśa dvātriṃśaccārakeṣviha ।
catuḥṣaṣṭārakāṃteṣu svāsyāvaraṇabhedataḥ ।।

catvāriṃśatsamākhyātā padā ekādhikāśca ye ।
nāḍyāvaraṇayogena teṣāṃ bhedamanantakam ।।

evamekā maheśānī pṛthagbhedaiḥ prabhedayet ।
ekavīrā vidhānena pūjyā sevyā japedatha ।।

ekaikakaṃ padaṃ vātha javyaṃ sevyaṃ sadābudhaiḥ ।
bhedamaṃtra na caivāsti sadā suravarārcite ।।

evamadvaitacittasya avadhūtatano sadā ।
(143b)
nirācārasya subhage cintitaṃ siddhimeti hi ।।

padavyāptiriyaṃ proktā pūjādau sādhakātmanām ।
adhunā kiṃ pravakṣyāmi vacasvata tanumadhyame ।। ।।

iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātatre tṛtīyaṣaṭke caturviṃśatisāhasre
ghoraghoratarācakkre padadaivanāvyāptirnāma ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

adhunā śrotumicchāmi dhyānamasyā maheśvara ।
kathaṃ dhyeyā mahāmātrī sthūlasūkṣmakramoditā ।।

ekānekavibhāgena sahasrākṣaramālikā ।
etadākhyāhi bhagavaṃ sarahasyaṃ mahārthadam ।।

yena vijñātamātreṇa sarvasiddhyarhatā bhavet ।
sarvakarmakaro siddho bhavatyeva hi sādhakaḥ ।
tathākhyā hi sureśāna yena niḥsaṃśayo bhavet ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

śṛṇu samyak pravakṣyāmi rahasyaṃ surasattame ।
cidacitpadamadhyasthaṃ yattadrūpamanuttamam ।।

ullāsalakṣaṇaṃ sūkṣmaṃ svasaṃvedyamanāmayam ।
svānaṃdabharitaṃ śāṃtaṃ sarvamatraṃ kriyākulam ।।

sarvamaṃtrāraṇiṃ śāktaṃ prakāśānaṃdamadhyagam ।
vibhūti dhṛtisaṃśānti svollāsalaya saṃjñitam ।।

vicchintiśca pravāhaśca cārasaṃjñamathocyate ।
janmākhyaṃ navamaṃ devi vyaktaṃ kaulaprabhedataḥ ।।

navāgaṃ kramaśo vīryaṃ tacchāktaṃ piṃḍitaṃ yadā ।
tadā tatdaśamaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvavīryopabṛṃhitam ।।

pratyekaṃ śatadhā bhūyo varṇamaṃtraprabhedataḥ ।
(144a)
vyaktaṃ vibhavaṃ saṃsiddhau śaktyullāsasumantharam ।।

sahasradhā sphuradvarṇatejo vyaktivijṛṃbhitam ।
sarvamaṃtrālayaṃ dhāma mahākālikulakramam ।।

ghoraṃ ghorataraṃ jātaṃ kālayaṃtaṃ jagatsthitam ।
tadā sthūlatarā devī sahasrākṣaramālitā ।।

daśasaptapadārūḍhā vīrāghorakaraṃkiṇī ।
sahasravaktranayanā sahasrabhujabhāsurā ।।

sahasrodarasaṅgrīvā sahasracaraṇāvṛtā ।
sahasrāyudhasavyagrā sahasrāghātamocanī ।।

sahasrakālacaritā sahasrayamabhakṣaṇī ।
kākakokilabhṛṃgālī śaradvyomanibhā hi sā ।।

tāṃ dhyāyedviśvavibhava grāsodbhaṭabhayānakām ।
bhīmabhāṃkārahuṃkāraṭāṃkārā rāvarāviṇīm ।।

garjatpralayameghaugha ghaṭṭanodyatanisvanām ।
vamaḥ kalpahutāśogra grastacaṃdrāṃrkatārakām ।।

pīpīyamānāṃ sajvālā balibhirbhairave kṣaṇāt ।
ulkāsahasravikṣepa kṣatakṣoṇītaṭāvaṭām ।।

daśanaśroṇiniṣpeṣa jyūtakalpāntapāvakām ।
brahmāṃḍakuharākārakūpanetrāṃ subhairavām ।।

kalpakṣayahutāśogravāntasatkekare kṣaṇām ।
śiroruhaṃ jhaṇatkāravyastaṃ brahmāṇḍamaṇḍapām ।।

lokeśvaraśiro padmaracitāṃtasragujjvalām ।
tārkṣe pakṣamahābhogakapālakṛtaśekharām ।।

śatarudraśirasphīta mukuṭāvaṇirājitam ।
brahmakaṃdakalaṃkāladhāriṇī sukaraṃkiṇīm ।।

kāraṇeśvaramuṃḍaughakṛtaikā balibhāsurām ।
(144b)
viśvaniṣpīḍanoddāma raktacarcitavigrahāṃ ।।

vajrāśanisamasphārakṣeḍāravasubhairavām ।
viśālapādasaṃpātabhagnabrahmāṃḍamaṃḍapām ।।

brahmāṃḍalakṣasanmālā caṃḍitorustaṭāvaṭām ।
sadāśivamahāghorakaṃkālakaṭimekhalāṃ ।।

vajrasūcī samasparśanasvarā valibhāsurām ।
lakṣavṛkṣasamākīrṇa da(śyā)raṇyā bhavakṣasām ।।

vajraśaṃkuniśāṇugrakharasparśaśiroruhām ।
mahābhogikulāpīḍaghorayajñopavītinīm ।।

sarvasaṃhārasadyajñadīkṣitāṃ bhairavānanām ।
karaniṣyeṣavahnaugha prajvālita digaṃvarām ।।

vajraghaṃṭāsiśūlograkhaṭvāṃgakaraśobhitām ।
ṭaṃkacāpaśaraśṛṃgiśaktitomaradhāriṇīm ।।

mahāḍamarukoddāmadhvanani trāsitākhilām ।
śavakuṃtakamālābja muṃḍabhūṣitapāṇinīm ।।

ghoravīṇābhiṃḍipālakuṭhāralaguḍodyatām ।
mahāhaṭṭakuloddāmahāttāyudhadharolvaṇām ।।

samagraviśvasaṃhārakālarāvavinoditām ।
kālāgnirudrakālaughaghorapādatalācitām ।।

sarvāptattvajalaughena siktanābhya naṭodbhaṭām ।
bhīmabhairavabhāṃkārabhagnasarvādhvasantatim ।।

nṛsiṃhabhairavāpīḍakṛtakarṇāvataṃsakām ।
mārttaṃḍalakṣamuṃḍaughavirājitaśiroruhām ।।

mahāmataṃgasatkṛttakṛttirājitavigrahām ।
(145a)
śuṣkāṃtra snāyunirmāṃsa ghoradehāṃ bhayānakām ।।

aśeṣatejo saṃghaṭṭaghaṭṭanodbhaṭatejasām ।
truṭadaṃtra mahāmālā purapūritadurmukhām ।।

siṃhasūkaragonāsasarpavyāghrānanastanīm ।
rikṣagomāpasatsiṃhaścāśvasūkaravaktrakām ।।

cillolūkamahāgṛdhramārjārānanabhāsurām ।
vaktrakuṃḍodbhaṭajvālā jvalitākhilatattvapāt ।।

udagrameru - lakṣābha niryadvahnikaṇākulām ।
viśvarūpāṃ viśvamayāṃ viśvalakṣmīṃ vicintayet ।।

yathābhimatasaṃrūpāṃ yathābhimatavāhanām ।
cintayet paramāṃ kālīṃ sarvakāmaphalapradām ।।

{ekavīrāṃ mahodagrāṃ yathā varṇasvarūpiṇī ।
yathā vā padabhedena yathā vā devatākulam ।।

caikāṃ vātha anekāṃ vā cintitārthaphalapradām ।}
evaṃ dhyānavaraṃ proktaṃ sthūlasūkṣmā vibhāgataḥ ।।

sarvakāmānavāpnoti vyānādasmāṃ narottamaḥ ।
etatsarvaṃ samākhyātaṃ kimanyatparipṛcchasi ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre
tṛtīyaṣaṭke ghoratarācakkre dhyānavidhiḥ ।। ।।

evamākarṇya deveśī punaḥ provāca śaṃkaram ।
praṇipatyaprahṛṣṭā sā saṃśayāviṣṭacetasā ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

nānāvidhāstu yā dīkṣāstvayā proktā sureśvarā ।
karttavyatā kathaṃ tāsāṃ vibhāsāṃ vibhāgena maheśvara ।।

vibhaktyā na mayā jñānaṃ dīkṣā nirṇayamuttamam ।
kathaṃ kena prakāreṇa kasya kāryāśca kena vā ।।

kā vyāptiḥ kassamāmnāyaḥ ko vidhista(bbra)vīhi me ।
sarahasyaṃ maheśāna sarvvataṃtrapragopitam ।।
(145b)

sārātsārataraṃ brūhi sūcitaṃ yatpurādhunā ।
evamākarṇya sahasādbhairavo bhavanāśanaḥ ।
punaḥ provāca tāṃ devīṃ prabuddhakamale kṣaṇām ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

sādhu sādhu mahābhāge pṛṣṭohaṃ yattvayādhunā ।
rahasyametaṃ nākhyeyaṃ - vāpi prabravīmi te ।।

dīkṣāsamūhamatulaṃ sarvataṃtreṣu gopitam ।
siddhayo na guruṇā sarvaśāstrārthavedinā ।।

jñānavijñānapūrṇena dīkṣākāryā sadaiva hi ।
saṃsārabhayabhītānāṃ śivaikagane cetasām ।।

śaktipātapravidvānāṃ śucīnāṃ gurusevinām ।
karttavyā niyataṃ dīkṣā guruṇā tattvavedinā ।।

vṛddhānāṃ vyādhinānāṃ ca vālavāli{sa} bhoginām ।
strīṇāṃ paśumṛgādīnāṃ sthāvarāṇāṃ tathā priye ।।

paralokagatānāṃ ca tathā gajahayeṣvapi ।
vyālataskarasiṃhādi hateṣvapi sadaiva hi ।।

luptapiṃḍodakādīnāṃ dīkṣākāryā vipaścitaiḥ ।
mṛtānsamuddharetsamyaggurustaṃtrārthapāragaḥ ।।

yajyajjīvaṃ mayaṃ vastu jagatyasmiṃścarācare ।
tattatsaṃdīkṣayeddevi karuṇāviṣṭacetanaḥ ।।

nirvikalpena manasā guruṇā bhairavātmanā ।
samuddhāryajagatsarvaṃ yogajñānakriyākramaiḥ ।।

śivoditairdevadevi nānādīkṣā kramaiḥ sadā ।
atha vakṣyāmi saṃkṣepāddīkṣā nirṇayamadbhutam ।।

yanna kasya cidākhyātaṃ sarahasyaṃ nagātmaje ।
(146a)
tattvadīkṣāpamadhunā yathāvadupadiśyate ।।

ādau śivamanantaṃ ca paripūrṇamanāmayam ।
akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākāraṃ svasaṃvedyamanantakam ।।

tasya śaktirmaheśāni parākhyā samavāyinī ।
tadvarmadhamiṇī jñeyā khaḍgadhāreva bhairavī ।।

yathāṃbhaso dravatvaṃtavahnerūṣmā prabhā raveḥ ।
evaṃ vīryātmakaṃ tasya śāktaṃ vapuravasthitam ।।

icchājñānakriyārūpe yasmādvyaktaṃ sadāśivam ।
paṃcamaṃtratatuṃ devaṃ sarvādhvopari nāyakam ।।

tato iśvaratattvākhyaṃ tattvamatyadbhutopam ।
iṣṭe sarvamadhakṛtvā jagadetaccarācara ।।

tato vidyābhedhānaṃ syāntattvaṃ nityamaniṃditam ।
evaṃ tattvacatuṣkaṃ yatsuśuddhaṃ pārameśvaram ।।

pūrvaṣaṭke mayāproktaṃ vibhajye tatsuvistaram ।
vidagrahanibaṃdhāya saṃsāroddhamanāya ca ।।

māyā tattvamataudhamnādekaṃ tadvyāpakaṃ mahat ।
mohakaṃ cāṇusaṃghāte saṃsārāṃkurakāraṇam ।।

tataḥ kālābhidhaṃ tattva nadayodvalakaṃ smṛtam ।
kriyājñānātmakaṃ vastu vyaṃjñayantañca yaudgalam ।।

tataḥ kāle trirūpaṃ tadvyaktaṃ tattvamaniṃditam ।
eṣyotīto varttamānastridhākalanatatparaḥ ।।

aṣṭādaśātmā vijñeyastu dvyādipravicāritaḥ ।
tato niyāmakaṃ nāma tattvaṃ niyatisaṃjñakam ।।

niyāmayati cātmānaṃ svājitaṃ ca balādiva ।
vidyātṛkaṃ tatastattvaṃ karmaprati vivecanam ।।

vyaktaṃ samarjitānāṃ ca kāryakartṛtvavedakam ।
(146b)
rāgātmakamatodhastāntattvaṃ raṃjanatasparam ।।

śuddhāśuddheṣu bhogeṣu raṃjayatyeva pudgalam ।
evaṃ tattvavidaṃ jñeyaṃ bhāvābhāvāṃtarālagam ।।

tattvaṣaṭkamidaṃ jñeyaṃ māyādyaṃ rāgapaścimam ।
yutaṃttvātmani salīnaṃ māyeyaṃ bhargamucyate ।।

ataḥ prādhānikaṃ nāma bhaviṣyati sumadhyame ।
anayormadhyavarttī syāt pumāṃ bhogaikatatparaḥ ।।

na vijānāti cātmānaṃ yattasthobhijanaṃ śubham ।
ataḥ pradhānaṃ vijñayaṃ guṇasāmya{ka}svarūpiṇam ।।

gahanaṃ tatsamuddiṣṭaṃ mūlamavyaktasaṃjñakam ।
sattvarajastamaśceti guṇāstraya udāhṛtāḥ ।।

ekaṃ prakāśarūpaṃ syātsallāghavakaraṃ mahat ।
anyaṃ pravṛttirūpaṃ syāścalatvo dyotakaṃ sadā ।।

upastaṃbhakameva hi viśeṣālokalopakam ।
ataḥ paraṃ niyamakaṃ gurusaktamasolvaṇam ।।

ādhārakaṃ svabhāvasya tṛtīyaṃ parikīrttitam ।
anyonya janakāstveśi hyanyonyābhibhavātmakāḥ ।।

anyonyavṛttayo jñeyā mithunānyonyameva hi ।
abhāsvarādibhedena gauṇībuddhirataḥ smṛtāḥ ।।

triguṇā sāṣṭadhā jñeyā dharmādiguṇabhedataḥ ।
tatohaṃkāramutpannaṃ triguṇaṃ tattṛbhedayuk ।।

vaikārikaṃ taijasaṃ ca bhūtādiraparaṃ smṛtam ।
taijasānmanasotpanniḥ sa ca saṃkalpakātmakaḥ ।।

vaikārikādahaṃkārā dakṣāṇi prati jajñire ।
daśadhā tāni deveśi śṛṇu vakṣyāmi te dhunā ।।
(147a)
śravaṇaṃ tvaktathānetraṃ rasānānāsikā tathā ।
buddhīṃdriyāṇi caitāni svavyāpāraratāni ca ।।

vyaṃjayaṃti jñaśaktitāṃ puruṣāsyāṃtaraṃgiṇī ।
vākyāṇi śephapādaśca pāyupaṃcamakā smṛtāḥ ।।

vyaṃjayaṃti kriyāśakti puruṣādhiṣṭhitāṃ sadā ।
svavyāpāraratāstvete saṃjñā karmeṃdriyātmikā ।।

bhūtāderapyahaṃkārottanmātrāśyudgatāni ca ।
śabdasparśaśca rūpaśca bhasogaṃdhāśca te smṛtāḥ ।।

nirviśeṣasvakāryatvāttanmātrāḥ tena te smṛtāḥ ।
tebhyaḥ krameṇa saṃjātā bhūtāste saviśeṣakāḥ ।।

śabdekaguṇamākāśaṃ śabdasparśau samīraṇam ।
śabdasparśau tathārūpaṃ triguṇo vahniriṣyate ।।

traistribhiśca rase naiva caturbhiścāṃbhasodbhavaḥ ।
te catvārastathā gaṃdhaṃ paṃcabhiḥ pṛthivī gaṇaiḥ ।।

evaṃ ṣaṭviṃśatā tattvaistrikhaṃḍairjaga * dbhutam ।
saṃjātaṃ sthūlasūkṣmākhya parabheda{prabheda}taḥ ।।

śivamāyā pradhānākhya sargatṛtayagahvaram ।
nātaḥ parataraṃ kiṃcivvidyate bhuvanodare ।।

evaṃ tattvavibhāgaste yathāvat parikīrttitaḥ ।
vahnikuṇḍagataṃ sarvamupāsthāvyaṃ tu lomataḥ ।।

saṃgṛhya śiṣyacaitanyaṃ pāśāṃkuśagamāgamaiḥ ।
vilomatattvasaṃyogādvāgeśī garbhagahvare ।।

janmādhikāralayatā bhoganiṣkṛtyanugrahāḥ ।
karttavyāḥ padarājena yena yena prarocate ।।

tāvadyāvacchivaṃ tattvaṃ krameṇa guruṇā sadā ।
yojanīyaṃ ca sakale niṣkale vā śiśuṃ priye ।।
(147b)
evaṃ prathamaṣaṭke tu proktaṃ vistaraśo mayā ।
tattvadīkṣāvidhirdevi saṃkṣeyādiha kīrttitaḥ ।। ।।

tattvadīkṣāvidhiḥ prathamaḥ ।। ।।

adhunā varttayiṣyāmi kalādīkṣā samāsataḥ ।
nivṛttiśca pratiṣṭhā ca vidyāśāṃtistathāparā ।।

śāṃtyatītā paṃcamāsyādeva samyakprakīrttitam ।
ābhūmitaḥ pradhānāntaṃ tattvavrātamidaṃ hi yat ।।

nivṛttistāvatī jñeyā nivṛttā sṛṣṭiyogataḥ ।
tato māyāṃtamadhvānaṃ pratiṣṭhā vyāpyasaṃsthitā ।।

tatastadeśvaraṃ yāvaṃdvidyāvyāptivarānane ।
sādāśivaṃ tathā śāktaṃ śāṃtā vyāpyavyavasthitā ।।

śāṃtatītā śivaṃ tattvaṃ nayatyeva samīritā ।
janmādipaṃcadhākṛtyaṃ kalāvyāptyadhvabhāvanāt ।।

prakarttavyaṃ hi guruṇā yathā{śā}strapracoditam ।
yojanaṃ pūrvavatkāryaṃ śiṣyavittānurūpataḥ ।
saṃkṣepataḥ kalādīkṣā tavai śā saṃprakāśitā ।। ।।

kalādīkṣāvidhirdvitīyaḥ ।। ।।

ato bhuvanadīkṣānyā śṛṇu pārvati tattvataḥ ।
ādiṣaṭke purāproktāṃ metaṃnikhilato mayā ।।

tathāpi tava vakṣyāmi saṃkṣepādiha bhāmini ।
tattvavrātaṃ hi yatproktaṃ mayā tava sumadhyame ।।

tatrāntaraṃ gatāścaite bhuvanāḥ surasuṃdari ।
krameṇa te parijñeyā uttarottaratasthitāḥ ।।

bhuvaneśānasahitāstacchaktisamadhiṣṭhitāḥ ।
bahubhogabharairyuktā nānāśobhā samanvitāḥ ।।

nānāvinyāsaracitā nānāratnaśitācitāḥ ।
(148a)
nānāmātrisamopetā nānāsraggaṃdhicarcitāḥ ।।

teṣāṃ vibhāgamadhunā śṛṇu vīreṃdravaṃdite ।
brahmāṃḍamaṃḍapasyānta bhuvanāni viśodhayet ।।

ādāvanaṃtabhuvanaṃ kauṣmāṇḍaṃ hāṭakeśvaram ।
anantabhuvanasyānukālāgnibhuvanaṃ mahat ।।

śārvaṃ brāhmaṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ ca raudraṃ bhuvanamuttamam ।
brahmāṃḍodaramadhye tu aṣṭau hyete prakīrttitāḥ ।।

tatastu śatarudrāṇāṃ bhuvanāni śṛṇu priye ।
śakrādikāṣṭhāsu sadā daśasthamidaśakramāt ।।

saṃsthitāste krameṇaiva nāmatastvadhunā śṛṇu ।
kapālīśo hyajo budhno vajradeho pramardakaḥ ।।

vibhūtiravyayaḥ śāstā pinākī tridaśādhipaḥ ।
ādyaścaivāgni rudraśca hutabhukpiṃgalastathā ।।

khādakaśca haraścaiva jvalanodahanastathā ।
vabhrūrbhasmakṣayāṃtau ca yāmyo mṛtyurharistathā ।।

dhātāvidhātā karttā ca saṃyoktā ca niyoktikaḥ ।
dharmmādharmaścarau caiva nairṛto māraṇastathā ।।

hantā ca krūradṛṣṭiśca tathā cānyo bhayāntakaḥ ।
ūrddhaliṃgo rūpākṣo dhūmraścaivāparasmṛtaḥ ।।

tathā lohitadaṃṣṭrākhya rudro bala iti smṛtaḥ ।
tathā cāti balaścānyaḥ pāśahasto mahābalaḥ ।।

śvetaśca japabhadraśca dīrghabāhurjalāṃtakaḥ ।
meghanādaḥ sunādaśca śīghro laghutarastathā ।।

vāyuvegastathā sūkṣmastīkṣṇaścaiva kṣayāntakaḥ ।
paṃcāntakaḥ paṃcacūḍaḥ kapardī cāparaḥ smṛtaḥ ।।

meghavāho nidhīśaśca rūpabāṃdhanya eva ca ।
savyeśaśca jaṭādhārī lakṣmī bhṛdratnabhṛttathā ।।
(148b)
kāmī prasādanāmā ca tathā cānyaḥ prabhāsakaḥ ।
vidyādhipaśca sarvajña jñānabhugvedapāragaḥ ।।

sureśaścaiva śarvaśca jyeṣṭhonyo - - - lakaḥ ।
balipriyo vṛṣaścānyo tathā vṛṣadharoparaḥ ।।

anantaḥ krodhanaścaiva tathānyo mārutāśanaḥ ।
grasanaścāparaḥ prokto dumbareśastathāparaḥ ।।

phaṇīṃdro vajradaṃṣṭraśca śaṃbhuścaiva vibhustathā ।
dhanādhyakṣa tryakṣakau ca tathānyastridaśeśvaraḥ ।।

saṃvāhaśca vivāhaśca nabho lipsustrilocanaḥ ।
ekamaṣṭādhikaṃśataṃ bhuvanānāṃ varānane ।।

tattve tu pārthive śodhyaṃ karuṇā taṃtravedinā ।
ataḥ parataraṃ devi aptattvānmūlapaścimām ।।

paṃcāṣṭakādivijñeyā bhuvanāstepi bodha me ।
ṣaṭpaṃcāśatsureśāni vibhāgena śṛṇuṣvataḥ ।।

amareśaḥ prabhāsaśca naimiyāśca tripuṣkaraḥ ।
diṃḍyāṣāḍhī bhārabhūtistathānyonākuleśvaraḥ ।।

etadguhyāṣṭakaṃ proktaṃ atiguhyāṣṭakaṃ śṛṇu ।
śrīśailaśca hariścaṃdro jalpakaścāgnikastathā ।।

āmrātiko mahākālo madhye kedārabhairavaḥ ।
gayā caiva kurukṣetraṃ nākhalaṃ cāmaraṃ tathā ।।

tathā kaṇakhalaścānye aṭṭasāso maheṃdrakaḥ ।
bhīmeśvarastathā prokta etadguhyātiguhyakam ।।

vastrāpadārudrakoṭirmahābalavimuktakau ।
rudrakarṇaśca gokarṇo sthāṇu svarṇākṣa eva ca ।।

śūnyaṃ ca devi vikhyātaṃ pavitrāṣṭakamuttamam ।
chagalāṇḍaṃ durāṃḍaśca mākoṭīmaṃḍaleśvaraḥ ।।
(149a)
kālaṃjaraḥ śaṃkukarṇa sthūlasthūleśvarastathā ।
sthāṇvaṇḍakamidaṃ proktaṃ ahaṃkārāvadhau priye ।।

tanmātrākṣeṣu kartṛtvāt pṛthage taṃ na kīrttitam ।
karālaśca sunaṃdaśca subhadraścaiva rūpavān ।।

vibhūtiramṛtākṣaśca tathā cānyaḥ prajeśvaraḥ ।
anyo pitāmaho nāma devayonyaṣṭakaṃ smṛtam ।।

buddhitattvasthitaṃ śodhyaṃ guruṇātattvavedinā ।
guṇasāre tato devi śṛṇu yogāṣṭakaṃ pṛthak ।।

kṛtaṃ ca bhairavaṃ deva brāhmaṃ vaiṣṇavameva ca ।
kaumārasaumaṃ śrīkaṃṭhaṃ evametatprakīrttitam ।।

punastvādyāvamāyāntamatra ye bhuvanādhipāḥ ।
tāṃ śṛṇuṣva mahābhāge yathāvat pravadāmi te ।।

purāgasaṃpuṭe devi anantaṃ sūkṣmameva ca ।
śivottamastrimūrttiśca ekanetrastathaiva ca ।।

śrīkaṃṭha ekarudraśca tathā cākhyā śikhaṇḍakaḥ ।
kalā vidyā puṭaṃ vātrastatra ye bhuvanā śṛṇu ।।

vāmo jyeṣṭhastathā raudraḥ kālaścaiva tathāparaḥ ।
kalavikaraṇaścaiva balavikaraṇastathā ।।

balapramathanaścānyassarvabhūtadamastathā ।
manonmanastathā cānyo tava devi prakīrttitāḥ ।।

niyatau ca tathā kāle yattacchodhyaṃ tathā śṛṇu ।
śuddho buddhaḥ prabuddhaśca śāntadhvāmā bhavodbhavaḥ ।।

śarvaśca parameśāni saṃśodhyā guruṇā sadā ।
māyorddhe caiva tasyādho madhye caiva vibodhata ।।

viśvagopohyatantaśca tathā cānyo jagannidhiḥ ।
tato vidyādike devi yacchodhyaṃ taṃ niśāmaya ।।

brahmavetālikā nāstī triguṇā cāparā smṛtā ।
tathāmbikā sthānumatī naṃdinī maṃdinī tathā ।।
(149b)
jvālinī ca tathā cānyā ityetāḥ parikīrttitāḥ ।
navavidyeśvarāḥ pūrvaṃ ye proktāstepi tatra vai ।।

biṃdutattve bhogaparā dharmajñānādayopi ca ।
tecchājñānakriyākhyāni purāṇyapi maheśvari ।।

rudroṃkāraśceśvaraśca daśapaṃcaiva kīrttitāḥ ।
sādāśivamatastatvaṃ daśāṣṭādaśabhirvṛtam ।।

daśadhā śivabhedotra draṣṭavyo gurubhiḥ sadā ।
rudrabhedaśca daśadhā aṣṭottara udāhṛtaḥ ।।

śaktitattveśvarāścātra nibodha gadato mama ।
śāṃtyātīto paraścaiva sūkṣmaścātra sadāśivaḥ ।।

idhikā dīpikā caiva rocikā mocikorddhagā ।
kalāḥ paṃcaiva suśroṇi nādeśasya prakīrttitāḥ ।।

suṣumneṣamadaścorddhe brahmeśvara ataḥ prabhuḥ ।
vyomātmakastathānaṃto vyāpītha bhuvaneśvaraḥ ।।

anātho nāśritaścaiva śiva ityeva mādikāḥ ।
evaṃ bhuvanasaṃdohamākhyātaṃ varavarṇini ।
ete krameṇa saṃśodhyā guruṇā tattvavedinā ।। ।।

iti jayadrathayāmale bhuvanadīkṣāvidhistṛtīyaḥ ।। ।।

ataḥ paraṃ padānyatra jñātavyāni varānane ।
catvāriṃśati ye proktāḥ padā vidyodbhavāḥ priye ।।

sthūlasūkṣmakrameṇaiva pratyekaṃ tadvidhāyakaṃ ।
aśīti evaṃ boddhavyā hyekaṃ yanniṣkalaṃ ca tat ।।

ekāśīti padānyevaṃ jñātavyāni sumadhyame ।
pārthivasyaiva tattvasya sthūlasūkṣmavyavasthayā ।।

daśādyāni padānisyuḥ pradhānānte dvayaṃ dvayam ।
puṃsi ṣoḍaśa evasyurmāyāntena dvayaṃ matam ।।

tribhāgapadagatyā tu tridhā samyaṅniyojayet ।
(150a)
śeṣe pratipadaṃ jñeyaṃ śivāntaṃ yāvadeva hi ।।

evaṃ krameṇa subhage ekāśītipadāvalim ।
prakalpyadīkṣayejjantuṃ gurustaṃtrārthapāragaḥ ।।

ekena vā padenaiva purā proktena bhairavi ।
teneyaṃ kārayeddīkṣā yathā vā rocate guroḥ ।।

paṃcadhā janmapūrvāṇi sāmānyatra yathāvidhiḥ ।
karttavyāni varārohe pūrvaṣaṭkānusārataḥ ।। ।।

iti jayadrathayāmale ghoratarācakkre padadīkṣāvidhiścaturthaḥ ।। ।।

ato varṇamayī dīkṣā tava devi vadāmyaham ।
akārādikṣakārāntaṃ varṇavrātamidaṃ mahat ।।

navavargaprabhedotra draṣṭavyastattvadarśibhiḥ ।
avargaśca kavargaśca cavargaśca ṭavargakaḥ ।।

tapavargau tathā jñeyau yaśavargau tathāparau ।
kṣavarga eka evasyādvarṇasaṃkaradarśakaḥ ।।

kramenātra parijñeyā navatattvāḥ sumadhyame ।
śivattvaṃ ca sādākhyaṃ aiśvaraṃ ca tataḥ smṛtam ।।

vidyāmāyābhidhānau ca kālaśca niyatistathā ।
pauruṣaṃ prākṛte ceti kramaśo vyāptibhāvanāt ।।

jananādi ca sarvaṃ yatkarttavyaṃ vargabhedataḥ ।
evaṃ dīkṣā bhaveddevi varṇākhyā parameśvarī ।। ।।

jayadrathe varṇadīkṣā ।। ।।

maṃtradīkṣā kramāyātā śṛṇu pārvatanaṃdini ।
yā sahasrākṣarā devi catvāriṃśatibhiḥ padaiḥ ।।

ekādhikai varṇitā sā samastā tanu madhyame ।
ekaikarupadoccārā vyastānaikaṃ padaṃ tu vā ।।

proccāryakālacakkrā tu sauṣumṇādhvakrameṇa tu ।
tatra śiṣyaṃ samānīya pāśāṃkuśaviyojanaiḥ ।।

saṃropyamaṃtracakrāṃtaḥ svoccāreṇasumadhyame ।
(150b)
tāvantaṃ prerayecchiṣyaṃ yāvanta(ntrai)dhanaṃ padam ।।

tatra saṃyojayettaṃ vai sakale vātha suṃdari ।
ekāhrutipradānena sarvādhvavyāptibhāvataḥ ।।

ekoccāreṇa subhage dīkṣayet sthāvarāṇyapi ।
māṃtrī dīkṣā tava proktā sa rahasyā mayā priye ।। ।।

iti jayadrathayāmale ghoratarācakkre maṃtradīkṣāvidhiṣṣaṣṭha ।। ।।

ṣaḍvidheyamiyaṃ dīkṣā purāṣaṭko suvistarā ।
kīrttitā tava deveśi iha saṃkṣepataḥ sthitā ।।

adhunā śaktidīkṣāyā kramaṃ prāptā prakīrttyate ।
gatvā yāgagṛhaṃ ramyaṃ madirānaṃdanaṃditaḥ ।।

sudhūpita sutāṃbūlo puṣpasragdāmaguṃṭhitaḥ ।
tatra sthitvā guruḥ samyakcchiṣyātmānaṃ saśaktikam ।।

grāhayedaṃkuśenaiva śakticakkrogra saṃpuṭe ।
cicchaktiḥ prāṇaśaktiśca anyonya balite śubhe ।।

anyonya yojite kṛtvā śuddhāśuddhaprabhedataḥ ।
aśuddhe śuddhage kārye ṣuddhekāryasuṣuddhage ।।

mūlādhārāt samārabhya yāvattva * śikhāvadhim ।
tatastu yojayecchiṣyāṃ sakale niṣkalethavā ।
evaṃ saṃyojitaṃ śiṣyaṃ śivā eva bhaviṣyati ।। ।।

iti jayadrathe śaktidīkṣāvidhisaptamaḥ ।। ।।

ataḥ paraṃ biṃdudīkṣā kramāyātā śṛṇu priye ।
biṃduḥ sādāśivo devo śivaśaktisamāśrayaḥ ।।

catuḥkalaḥ paṃcakalo tricakkrakuharāntagaḥ ।
nivṛttiśca pratiṣṭhā ca vidyāśāṃtistathāparā ।।

śāṃtyatītā pañcamāsyātkramenātra vyavasthitāḥ ।
patayaḥ paṃcadeveśi brahmaviṣṇuhareśvarāḥ ।।
(151a)
sadāśivāṃtāḥ subhage tattvāḥ paṃcanibodha me ।
pṛthivyaptejavāyuśca vyomāṃtāḥ surasuṃdari ।।

evaṃ paṃcakramaṃṇaiva biṃdudevaṃ vyavasthitam ।
lalāṭādbrahmaraṃdhrāntaṃ yāvadeva sumadhyame ।।

kadaṃbakusumākāraṃ sphuratkiraṇabhāsuram ।
paṃcadhā devadeveśi saṃsthitaṃ cittayedguruḥ ।।

nimīlitākṣiyugalo kālikāstreṇa suṃdari ।
śiṣyātmānaṃ yojayetra gururaṃkuśayogataḥ ।।

saṃyojanāddīkṣitaṃ syādbhogamokṣasya bhājanam ।
sarvamaṃtrādhikāraṃ ca jāyate nātra saṃśayaḥ ।। ।।

iti jayadrathayāmale biṃdudīkṣāvidhiraṣṭamaḥ ।। ।।

athānyā saṃpravakṣyāmi dīkṣānādodbhavā hi yā ।
dvādaśāṃte mahācaṃdraṃ kalākalitavigraham ।।

sphuratkiraṇasaṃdīptaṃ ṣoḍaśāvayavaṃ śubham ।
tasmādvṛtpadmagagane yāvaṃ nādaṃ prakīrttitam ।।

tatra taṃ pauruṣe cakkre śiṣyātmānaṃ nidhāpayet ।
punarāvṛttiyogena yāvaddvādaśamaṃ padam ।।

saṃyojya śiṣyacaitanyaṃ kevalaṃ jāyate priye ।
nādodbhavena nādena yadā śiṣyaṃ niyojayet ।
tadā bhogeśvaro jāyet sādhako nātra saṃśayaḥ ।। ।।

iti jayadrathayāmale nādadīkṣāvidhinnavamaḥ ।। ।।

ataḥ paraṃ devadevi prāṇadīkṣā kramāgatā ।
śṛṇu samyakpravakṣyāmi yathāvadanupūrvaśaḥ ।।

prāṇaṃ jīvamayaṃ jīvaṃ prāṇāpānaṃ sadaivatam ।
sṛṣṭisaṃhārarūpaṃ ca caṃdrasūryātmakaṃ smṛtam ।।

tābhyāṃ madhye mahāvahnistridhāmākhya pade sthitam ।
sthito hṛdaṃbujāvāse saṃhārāṃkuśayogataḥ ।।
(151b)
ākṛṣya śiṣyacaitanyaṃ yāvadvṛnmaṃdiraṃ svakam ।
tridhāmamadhyagaṃ kṛtvā punaḥ preryaṃ tathorddhataḥ ।।

paṃcavyomāni saṃbhedya prāṇasūvyā mahātape ।
tenaiva madhyamārgeṇa ṣaṭbhyājyāḥ saptamelayam ।।

nītvā śiṣyasya caitanyaṃ punaḥ sakalaniṣkale ।
yojanīyaṃ tadā śiṣyaṃ muktaṃ saṃsārabaṃdhanāt ।।

bhavatyeva na saṃdeha guruṇā dīkṣito yadā ।
evaṃ prāṇamayā dīkṣā sa rahasyā tavoditā ।। ।।

jayadrathayāmale prāṇadīkṣāvidhirdaśamaḥ ।। ।।

kramāyātā jīvadīkṣā śṛṇu bhairavi tattvataḥ ।
naraśaktiśivaṃ piṃḍaṃ jīvamityabhiśaṃ(gha)te ।।

taddhṛtpadmapuṭāntasthaṃ vahnisūryasudhātmakam ।
vikāsayuktyā saṃkocya yāvatsyaṃdaguhāttaram ।।

śiṣyātmānaṃ mahābhāge yojyāyojya ca tatpathe ।
yuktaḥ samarasīkṛtya bhogamokṣaruho bhavet ।।

tataḥ prabhṛtyasau śiṣyaḥ paripūrṇaḥ śivopamaḥ ।
bhavatyeva mahābhāge jīvanairmalyahetutaḥ ।।

agnīṣoma mayo jīva kalāvalitavigrahaḥ ।
tasya dīkṣā samākhyātā tava devi yathārthataḥ ।। ।।

iti jayadrathayāmale jīvadīkṣāvidhirekādaśamaḥ ।। ।।

cāradīkṣā pravakṣyāmi kramāyātā nagātmaje ।
kārayeta gurussamyagyathāśiṣyasya tacchṛṇu ।।

prāṇacārasya yanmūlaṃ tamāśritya sumadhyame ।
ātmano sanmukhaṃ kṛtvā vāmadakṣiṇayogataḥ ।।

vāyutāraprayogena caitanyaṃ tasya cāharet ।
āhṛtaṃ yojayettattve paraśiṣyaṃ guruḥ priye ।।
(152a)
yojito mokṣabhāgīsyāddevi nāstyatra saṃśayaḥ ।। ।।

iti jayadrathayāmale cāradīkṣā dvādaśamaḥ ।। ।।

atha sparśavatī dīkṣā śṛṇu vīreṃdravaṃdite ।
yathākāryā guruvaraistathā samyagvravīmyaham ।।

nyastvā devī sahasrārṇāṃ svadehe gurusattamaḥ ।
anulomavilomena pātāpātaprayogataḥ ।।

kṛtāṃtaḥkaraṇo devi badhvā mudrāṃ karaṃkiṇīm ।
aṣṭadhā hasitaṃ kṛtvā paścādyaṃ sparśayetpriye ।।

taṃ taṃ saṃdīkṣayeddevi gāḍhāliṃganayogataḥ ।
nayate śaktisāyojya devi nāstyatra saṃśayaḥ ।।

kṛtvā rāvakramaṃ devi yasyevaṃ bhāmayedvacaḥ ।
dīkṣitastvaṃ mayā samyagiti bhairavabhāmini ।।

taṃ nayedbrahmasāyojyaṃ vāṅmātrā deva bhairavi ।
vāgdīkṣā sparśadīkṣā ca tava devi prakāśitāḥ ।। ।।

iti jayadrathayāmale ghoraghoratarācakre sparśadīkṣāvidhivāgdīkṣāvidhiśca ।। ।।

vedhadīkṣā pravakṣyāmi kramāyātā maheśvari ।
kāliṣaṭke purāproktaṃ vedhaṃ ṣoḍhā maheśvari ।।

tadeveha praboddhavyaṃ dīkṣākāle guruttamaiḥ ।
maṃtravedhastu prathamaḥ śānko devi dvitīyakaḥ ।।

paravedhastṛtīyaḥ syādbhaujaṃgaśca caturthakaḥ ।
nādātmakaḥ paṃcamasyā nādākhyaḥ ṣaṣṭha iṣyate ।।

eṣāṃ purā vibhāgena svarūpaṃ pratipāditaṃ ।
tata eva vicāryaṃ tu viśeṣo na vidhīyate ।
vedhādikāśca ṣaṭproktā dīkṣāstava sumadhyame ।। ।।

iti jayadrathayāmale ghoratarācakkre vedhadīkṣāṣaṣṭham ।। ।।
(152b)
dhaṭātmakāmato dīkṣāṃ śṛṇu parvatanaṃdini ।
saṃpūjya parameśānīṃ vakṣyamāna krameṇa tu ।।

tatrāgnikarma kṛtvā tu dhaṭaṃ samyakpratiṣṭhayet ।
sārddhahastatrayaṃ daṇḍaṃ mātraṃ hastapramāṇakam ।।

caturhastaṃ bhavetstaṃbhaṃ laṃbayettaṃ trihastakam ।
evaṃ dhaṭaṃ pratiṣṭhāpya sudṛḍhaṃ dṛḍharajjubhiḥ ।।

tatastatra prapūjyā sā sahasrākṣaramālitā ।
helādolā vihāreṇa pātrāyorubhayornyaset ।।

madhye daṃḍakalāśārvī śaktyāliṃganavaṃ nyaset ।
evaṃ vinyasya sampūjya paścācchiṣyaṃ praveśayet ।।

asamprokṣitamevādau dhaṭapṛṣṭhe samarpayet ।
tāvaṃtyaśmāni cārpyāṇi samīkṛtya tataḥ punaḥ ।।

avatārya prokṣayeśca tāḍayenmaṃtramuccaram ।
śaktimuṇḍākulārūḍho tīvranirghātayogataḥ ।।

dahedāmūlataḥ śiṣyaṃ paṃcādyāta prayogataḥ ।
āgnyāyyāropayetpaścāttulāmeva narottamaḥ ।।

tatorddhahāniraśmānāṃ jāyate nātra saṃśayaḥ ।
avatārya punardevi tāḍanābhyukṣaṇādikam ।।

kṛtvā punaḥ prakarttavyaṃ tasya cidgrahaṇaṃ sakṛt ।
pāśāṃkuśaprayogena hṛtsaṃpuṭagataṃ kuru ।।

āyojya vidyā kuhare punaḥ saṃropayettulām ।
tulāmānena cāsmānāṃ śataṃ śeṣaṃ bhavettadā ।।

palānāṃ devadeveśi punastasmādamāharet ।
pragrāhyaṃ pūrvavaddevi taccaitanyaṃ ca saṃpuṭe ।।

tridhāmadhāmni subhage saṃyojyā prerayecchanaiḥ ।
yāvacchāktaṃ kulaṃ devi kāliyogena yojayet ।।
(153a)
mahāvyāpti samālaṃvya sthitibaṃdhena bhairavi ।
kāraṇāvaliratyugrā saṃbhakṣyaiva gurūttamaḥ ।।

yojya śiṣyaṃ dīkṣitaṃ syāddagdhasaṃsārabaṃdhanam ।
ākāśatulyaṃ bhavate śiṣyaṃ saṃdīkṣitaṃ tadā ।।

bhairaveva bhavetsau vai dagdhasaṃsārabaṃdhanam ।
paścāttulāmarpayeta aśmānyeva apāsya tu ।।

saptaviṃśatipuṣpaiśca kṛtāmālāṃ samarpayet ।
tatsamaḥ sādhako jāyet prahīnā varaṇo yadā ।।

evaṃ śiva pade yukto mukto bhavati (nā)nyathā ।
ye saṃśayāviṣṭavittāḥ saṃsārabhayabhīravaḥ ।।

teṣāṃ dīkṣā dhaṭākhyā ca karttavyā mṛgalocane ।
tataḥ samāharet sarvaṃ yanyastaṃ guruṇā ta(nu) ।
evaṃ rahasyametaddhi tavākhyātaṃ yathārthataḥ ।। ।।

iti jayadrathayāmale ṣaṭdīkṣāvidhiḥ ।। ।।

ato vastrātmikā dīkṣā sarvapāpaviśodhanī ।
tava vakṣyāmi deveśi yathāvacchṛṇu sāṃpratam ।।

vīravastraṃ samāhṛtya kṛṣṇaṃ saṃraṃjayettataḥ ।
anantaraṃ devadevīṃ mahāvibhavato yajet ।।

śiṣyaṃ tatra praveśyaṃ vai kṛṣṇavastrāvaguṃṭhitam ।
prahvapuraḥ pratiṣṭhā - sta - netraṃ kṛtāṃjaliṃ ।।

kālāgnikuhare paścāt pateścaṃdraṃ vilāmayam ।
tata utthāpya ghoreśī jvalanajvalitāmbarām ।।

mahāsaptaśikhāṃ jvālya dhamejjvālāvalīkulam ।
tāsāṃ saṃpātayogena śodhayecchiṣyavigraham ।।

āgatā tu sahasrādvā taccidughātayogataḥ ।
siṃ(taṃ) paṭaṃ prapaśyeta pratyayārthaṃ gurūttamaḥ ।।

tadā saṃdīkṣayecchiṣyāṃ mahāpātakasaṃyutāṃ ।
(153b)
paṭadīkṣeyamākhyātā taṃtrarāje jayadrathe ।। ।।

iti jayadrathayāmale tṛtīyaṣaṭke vastradīkṣāvidhiḥ ।। ।।

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi kramāyātā varānane ।
ghaṭadīkṣyā samāsena śṛṇu pārvati tattvataḥ ।।

pūrvaṃvatpūjya deveśī sahasrākṣaramālitām ।
tataḥ kuṃbhaṃ samānīya śatākṣaṃ ca maheśvari ।।

prasthamāpa tadā tasminadhvānaika tu vinyaset ।
ālokya paramaṃ cakkraṃ rāvākhyaṃ rāvinīkulam ।।

saṃkocya kaumbakīcakkraṃ śiṣyātmānaṃ samāharet ।
daśadhā paṃcadhā caiva vasudhā vasudhāravat ।।

kuṃbhaṃ tatkaragaṃ sūryaṃ śiṣyātmānaṃ niyojayet ।
saṃyojya śaktiśakale śiṣyātmānaṃ haṭhādiva ।।

stutyate taṃ ghaṭaṃ tasya hastābhyāṃ sahitaṃ tadā ।
plavate śīrṣaparyantaṃ hastābhyāṃ sahitaṃ tataḥ ।।

ghaṭikāmātrasacchinnaṃ tadā snānaṃ prajāyate ।
pūrṇameva ghaṭaṃ jāyedaṛktaṃ cāgrataḥ sthitam ।।

namravetkiṃcidevaṃ tu yadā taṃ kalaśottamam ।
tadā ghaṭābhidhā dīkṣā saṃpannā sādhakasya sā ।
anayā śivasāyojyaṃ sādhakeṃdraḥ prayātyasau ।। ।।

iti jayadrathayāmale tṛtīyaṣaṭke ghaṭadīkṣāvidhiḥ ।। ।।

ataḥ parataraṃ bhadre kṣīṇapāpasya vā yathā ।
sapāpasyārthasubhage vyādhitasyāthavā priye ।।

vṛddhasyāpi yathā kāryā sadyo nirvāṇikā śubhā ।
dīkṣā śṛṇu samāsena yathāvattatu madhyame ।।

saṃpūjya subhage devīssamānāyatanādike ।
(154a)
mahāvibhavasaṃbhārairvakṣyamāṇakriyākramaiḥ ।।

tataḥ kālānalādhārāduditāṃ jagadaṃbikām ।
tīvrāṃ jvalanmahāghorakṣayapāvakasannibhām ।।

vicintayenmaṃtramātāṃ sahasrārṇāṃ bhayānakām ।
śiṣyaṃ saṃsthāpya cāgre tu prerayettasyā vigrahe ।।

sahasrotpā - paryaṃtaṃ mahāvidyā prayogataḥ ।
nirdagdhaṃ bhāvayetkāyaṃ sādhya śiṣyasya suṃdari ।।

taccaitanyaṃ ca saṃśuddhaṃ svajātī yatnataḥ priye ।
tasya svarūpasaṃpatti paripoṣayati priye ।।

pāśajālamanaṃtaṃ ca nirdahatyeva sā kalā ।
tatkṣaṇādeva patate bhuktabhogaṃ śarīrakam ।।

vyāpakatve mato jāye jāyedyantannityamakhaṃḍitaṃ ।
sadyo nirvāṇadā dīkṣā tavaivaṃ saṃprakāśitā ।। ।।

iti jayadrathayāmale tṛtīyaṣaṭke sadyo nirvāṇadīkṣāvidhiḥ ।। ।।

ataḥ kramāgatā vakṣye dīkṣā paramadurlabhā ।
madyapātre prapūjyaivaṃ devadevīṃ kṛṣodarīm ।।

tataḥ śiṣyasya caitanyaṃ padamaṃtrapuṭī kṛtam ।
cicchaktyā liṃgitaṃ kāryaṃ jñatvakartṛtva rūpayā ।।

tenaiva vidhimārgeṇa svakālādhāragaṃ kuru ।
tataḥ ṣaccakkramābhedya śiṣyacaitanyasaṃyutaḥ ।।

gaccheta tāṃ tava kulaṃ tatra līnaṃ vibhāvayet ।
yadā samarasaṃ jātaṃ tadā nirvāṇabhāgbhavet ।।

samayācāranirmuktaḥ padaṃ yāti anāmayam ।
iyaṃ nirvāṇikā dīkṣā tavādya prakaṭīkṛtā ।। ।।

iti jayadrathayāmale tṛtīyaṣaṭke nirvāṇadīkṣāvidhiḥ ।। ।।

athānyaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi yathāvadanupūrvaśaḥ ।
(154b)
dīkṣākramamidaṃ devi samāsāttanuvistarāt ।
rahasyatamamatyugraṃ yatnākhyātaṃ kadācana ।।

arddhacaṃdrā vidhā dīkṣā krameṇanyā vidāmi te ।
arddhacaṃdrā dhruvāṃte tadvādaśaite maheśvari ।।

prameya padasarvasvā krameṇopari saṃsthitāḥ ।
upārohakrameṇaiva jvālājanmakuloditā ।।

ālaṃvikāṃtaṃ nirbhidya biṃdvarddheṃdukulaṃ gatā ।
tatra dvādaśakaṃ sūkṣmaṃ cittavṛtyā samāruhet ।।

mahāvyāpti prayogena krameṇaite bravīmi te ।
arddhacaṃdro nirodhī ca nādovyāpinireva ca ।।

samanā unmatā caiva guruvaktramathāpi ca ।
ajasparśākhyaviṣuvaṃ praśāntaṃ ca visargajam ।।

dhruvadhāmāvadhiṃ yāvaddīkṣā dvādaśakaṃ bhavet ।
yatra yatra mahāsthāne śiṣyacaitanyasaṃyutaḥ ।।

gurussamarasī jātastatra tatra maheśvari ।
dīkṣā saṃjāyate divyā bhogamokṣaphalapradā ।।

taṃ taṃ kulaṃ parijñeyaṃ prottamaṃ sarvadhāmasu ।
evaṃ krameṇa sarvāsāṃ dīkṣāṇāṃ vidhiruttamam ।।

vijñātavyaṃ mahābhāge viśeṣo na vidhīyate ।
iyaṃ tanuvaraṃ muktvā nānyatraitadudāhṛtam ।। ।।

iti jayadrathayāmale tṛtīyaṣaṭke dīkṣādvādaśavidhiḥ ।। ।।

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi kramāyātā tanūdari ।
ālokadīkṣā subhage yasyā tulyo na vidyate ।।

nyastvā devīṃ svadehasthāṃ cāroccārakrameṇa hi ।
sṛṣṭisaṃhārabhedena paścādvidyāṃ samuddharet ।।

mahākālikulārūḍho sphuraddraśmaughabhāsuraḥ ।
yaṃ yamālokayaddevi taṃ taṃ nayati śāśvatam ।।
(155a)
sthāvarānapi deveśi krameṇānena dīkṣayet ।
atyantadeyadīkṣā syāt kuṃḍamaṃḍalavarjitāḥ ।। ।।

iti jayadrathayāmale tṛtīyaṣaṭke ālokadīkṣāvidhiḥ ।। ।।

jñānavijñānasaṃyuktā dīkṣā śṛṇu sumadhya me ।
ālocaye dadhvamārga yadvā manasi rocate ।।

tatrālocayitā yo sau krameṇa pravicārayet ।
tamādirbhāvabhedādvā bhūyatedvā bhavatyatha ।।

yāvaccidvapuṣāṃ tena pūritaṃ nikhilaṃ jagat ।
sumaṃthareṇa tenaiva cinmūtya jagadāvṛtam ।।

sarvā(su) syūtisattavai śivaṃ paramarūpiṇam ।
svarūpajyotinaṃ devaṃ sarvajñādiguṇāspadam ।।

tamadhiṣṭhātrirūpeṇa ṣaḍadhva sugataṃ sthitam ।
tatsvarūpaparijñānāntatsthau tanmayatāṃ vrajet ।।

tadrūḍhyā śiṣyacaitanyaṃ bodha{ya}dvākyaraśmibhiḥ ।
prabuddha paśutāṃ bhūyo na yāti surasundari ।।

jñānadīkṣā smṛtā hyevaṃ vijñānākhyā śṛṇuṣva me ।
yadā caṃdrārkayugalaṃ jñānenānena rodhayet ।।

vikāsana prayogena mahābhairavalīlayā ।
tadvarmamāviśeśśiṣyaṃ bhavatyeva hi dīkṣitam ।।

vijñānadīkṣāsaiveyaṃ samāsāvupavarṇitā ।
ābhyāṃ samāna cānyāsyāddīkṣā suravarārcite ।।

na cātramaṃḍale pūjyā devadevī karaṃkiṇī ।
na cāgnikāryamatrāsti na dhyānaṃ dhāraṇā na ca ।।

kevalaṃ svasvarūpastho dīkṣayetsthāvarāṇyapi ।
yadi pakva malānāṃ ca bhāvitānāṃ prakalpayet ।। ।।

iti jayadrathayāmale tṛtīyaṣaṭke jñānavijñā{na}dīkṣāvidhiḥ ।। ।।
(155b)
athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi kramāyātaṃ sumadhya me ।
śṛṇu dvārābhidhānā yā dīkṣā paramaśobhanā ।।

anāthaluptapiṇḍānāṃ tathā ḍimbahateṣvapi ।
kuvidhau ca mṛtānāṃ ca dīkṣāmṛtavatī bhavet ।।

pravakṣyāmi rahasyena yannākhyātaṃ mayā kvacit ।
saṃpūjye parameśānīṃ trailokyoddāmaḍāmarāt ।।

yathāvibhavasambhārairagnikarma samācaret ।
tatrāṭṭakamayaṃkāraṃ dārbhyaṃ vā parikalpate ।।

adhivāsya yathā samyaktatastu vidhimācaret ।
mahāyatanamākramya viśvākhyaṃ padayogataḥ ।।

yatra saṃgrathitaṃ viśvaṃ yatra līnaṃ carācaram ।
yatra kṣayamidaṃ yāti prāṇādyaṃ sarvameva hi ।।

yatodeti punarbhūyo prakāśānaṃdalakṣaṇam ।
cidvāmayatparaṃ sūkṣmaṃ kāraṇeṣvapi kāraṇam ।।

taṃ śivaṃ paramaṃ devaṃ svaśaktiparimaṃḍitam ।
tadullāsavikāsena mahājālabhidhena ca ।।

sarvā dvā lokane naiva mṛtacaitanyamāharet ।
krodhorgale gṛhītvaivaṃ prakṛtau viniveśayet ।।

pāśāṃkuśaprayogena yatra tatra sthitaṃ paśum ।
tadrūḍhiviniyogena calate prakṛtistataḥ ।।

tatra sa grathanaṃ kāryaṃ gūḍhavidyā puraḥsaram ।
yaccinmayaṃ tadunmeṣaṃ yadunmeṣakriyā hi sā ।।

yā kriyā cāra evāsau caturddhā pariniṣṭhitaḥ ।
śaktirūpeṇa cākarṣaṃ grahaṇajīvasaṃjñitā ।।

saudvalenamupālokaṃ haṃsākhyena viśodhanam ।
khecarīṃ vṛttimālaṃvya mudrākhecarasevanāt ।।

prakuryānmṛtacaitanye gururgrahaṇamādarāt ।
(156a)
jananādi kriyākarma kṛtvā tatsthasya sāṃpratam ।।

paścāt pragṛhya kālāgni vakkraṃ nītāḥ śanaiḥ śanaiḥ ।
yojaye nāḍimārgeṇa pare dhāmnyā nalodarāt ।।

bhyāsakrameṇa subhage viśrāmya yatane guruḥ ।
pūrṇāhutiprayogena juhedvahnau tu tāṃ kṛtim ।।

saṃyojya parame dhāmni citpare mṛtajīvitam ।
śuddhaṃ śivasvarūpaṃ tadbhavatyevaṃ na cādbhutam ।।

rahasyametadākhyātaṃ taṃtresmin pārameśvare ।
dīkṣāvidhānamatulaṃ yāvat saṃbhavati priye ।।

na caitaddevi dātavyamabhaktānāṃ kadācana ।
śiracchedamidaṃ muktvā nānyatra pravicāritam ।।

tvayā guptataraṃ kāryaṃ nākhyeyaṃ yasya kasyacit ।
etadvidhānamatulaṃ bhogamokṣaphalapradam ।।

catvāriṃśati dīkṣākhyaṃ caturbhiradhikaṃ mahat ।
ghoraghoratarā cakkre sarahasyamudāhṛtam ।।

itthaṃ rahasyatamametadalaṃ yathāvatsaṃkīrttitaṃ sakalasiddhasureṃdravaṃdye ।
anyatsamarcanamataḥ śṛṇu sārabhūtaṃ sarvatrasiddhidamanantaguṇābhirāmam ।। ।।

iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke ghoraghoratarā
cakkre catuścatvāriṃśati dīkṣāvidhipaṭalaḥ ।। ।।

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi devyārcanamanuttamam ।
gatvā pitṛvaṇaṃ bhīmaṃ parvatāgramathāpi vā ।।

udadhe vā taṭaṃ ramyaṃ yato vā ramate manaḥ ।
tatra śiṣyasamāyukto bhūmiśuddhiṃ prakalpayet ।।

mahākaṃkālasaṃghṛṣṭaṃ mahāsṛgupalepitām ।
(156b)
paṃcaratnayutāṃ vāthaṃ cadanāgurucarcitām ।।

sadhūpā modabahulāṃ vitāno pariśobhitam ।
madirānaṃdacaitanyaḥ sudhūpā modamaṃtharaḥ ।।

ullikhenmaṇḍalaṃ tatra navanāḍī suśobhanam ।
navapadmasamāyuktaṃ dvārāṣṭakasucarcitam ।।

pratipadyaṃ cāṣṭapatraṃ kesarālaṃ sakarṇikam ।
raktena rajasā kāryaṃ navahastamanuttamam ।।

yatābhimatamānavā sarvaśobhā samanvitam ।
pramāṇaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ cātra pūrvaṣaṭke prakāśitam ।।

tatra saṃbhṛtyasaṃbhāraṃ adhivāsya ca pūrvavat ।
yajenmadhyamapadmasthāṃ sahasrārṇaṃ kṛśodarīm ।।

dhyātvā puroktavidhinā paṃkajāntanniveśayet ।
parāpareṇayogena pādaṃ pratidaleṣu ca ।।

dikpadmeṣu punarnyaset padate tena bhairavīm ।
catvāriṃśat sadānyevaṃ parāparavibhedataḥ ।।

bhavaṃtyaśītirdeveśi ekamekaṃ vinirdiśet ।
evaṃ nyasya kramāddevi pūrvādīśānakoṇagam ।।

yāvatpadmaṃ varārohe ekāśītipadakramam ।
punaḥ samastā madhye syādraśmisaṃdhānayogataḥ ।।

evaṃ vinyasya subhage tarpayedvibhave nava ।
mahāghopyatramādāya vāmāmṛtasupūritam ।।

tenārghaṃ dāpayeddevyā pādyamācamanīyakaṃ ।
puṣpāṇi vividhānyeva mahādhūpaṃ pradāpayet ।।

mahādīpāni deyāni upahārāṇyanekaśaḥ ।
mahāpalaṃ kṣmāpalaṃ ca ajāvikamalaṃ tathā ।।

jāṃgalomatsyamāṃsaṃ ca khecaraṃ cāpi dāpayet ।
(157a)
nānākārāṇi māṃsāni deyānyatra yathāvidhiḥ ।।

madyaṃ surā tathā śīṃdhuṃ āsavaṃ vividhaṃ dadet ।
śaṣkulyo modakā deyā guḍakhaṃḍakṛtānyapi ।।

tathā mukuṭamāheśī devadevyā priyāṃ dadet ।
agramāpūrayettasyā vittaśāṭhyavivarjitaḥ ।।

pūrvagurūṃ prapūjyeta vāgeśīṃ siddhasantatim ।
gaṇeśaṃ vāyudigbhāge rākṣase kṣetranāyakam ।।

kārlidī ca jayā gaṃgā vārāhī dvāragā yajet ।
āsanaṃ pīṭhagaṃ pūjyaṃ kālāgnyādi śivāntagam ।।

evaṃ saṃpūjya subhage devadevīṃ kṛśodarīm ।
tataḥ praveśayecchiṣyaṃ ta(dvra)netraṃ kṛtāṃjalim ।।

prokṣaṇādividhiṃ kṛtvā daṇḍavat praṇipātayet ।
saṃpūjya parameśānīṃ kuṃḍasthānaṃ nayet kramāt ।।

tatra pūrvoktavidhinā dīkṣāmasya prakalpayet ।
abhiṣekaṃ tataḥ kāryaṃ bhadrapīṭhopaveśite ।।

evaṃ saṃdīkṣaṇaṃ kāryaṃ śiṣyasya tanumadhyame ।
tataḥ prabhṛtyasau devi sādhanatvaraho bhavet ।।

amunā vidhiyogena sāmudāyena vā yajet ।
ekapadme (hye)kavīrāṃ sahasrārṇaṃ sadā yajet ।।

padaikaikavibhāgena yajedvā parameśvarīm ।
na bhinnaṃ dhyānamapyatra yathāruci prakalpayet ।।

etadrahasyamākhyātaṃ devyāyāgaṃ suśobhanam ।
kimanyattava vakṣyāmi vada padmadale kṣaṇe ।। ।।

iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke ghoraghoratarā yāgapaṭala ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

idānīṃ śrotumicchāmi devyā sādhanamuttamam ।
(157b)
kathaṃ sādhyā mahādeva tato brūhi samāsataḥ ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

śṛṇuṣva kathayāmyeṣa sādhanaṃ varavarṇini ।
yathā sā siddhyate devī sādhakasya mahātmanaḥ ।।

gatvā girivarodyānaṃ sādhako sādhanai yutaḥ ।
tatra saṃsādhayeddevī japedayutamuttamam ।।

sahasraṃ juhuyānmaṃtrī mahākṣmā japalādikam ।
homāntādagnimadhyā sādyayamevo sthitā tadā ।।

dṛśyate sādhakeṃdrasya yatheṣṭaṃ saṃprayacchati ।
yatheṣṭanavarenaiva varayitvā ca sādhakam ।।   ?

prapātisvaṃ tadā sthānaṃ tena sārddhamathāpi vā ।
uttamā siddhi eṣā sā tava devi prakīrttitā ।।

japtvā ekha sahasrāṇi sādhakoṃdrā dṛḍhavrataḥ ।
hutvā daśāṃśato maṃtrī viladvāraṃ vrajettataḥ ।।

tatra rātrau vadā homaṃ karttavyaṃ sādhakena hi ।
mahākadukasaṃmiśrāṃ rājikāṃ māṃsamāśritāt ।।

śataṃ yāvajjuheddevi tāvat kaṃpati medinīm ।
nirgacchanti tataḥ kanyā madaghūrṇitalocanāḥ ।।

mattakuṃjaragāminyaḥ pīnoṃnatapayodharāḥ ।
tāmasaṃ pānamādāya tāmasāstā varāṃganāḥ ।।

vijñāpayaṃti ca tadā trāhi {trāhi} narottamā ।
gṛhāṇamānamatulaṃ duṣprāpamakṛtātmanām ।।

evaṃ śrutvā tatastāsāṃ naiva saṃbhāṣayedvacaḥ ।
tūṣṇīṃ bhūto juhettatra yāvat paṃcāśadāhutīḥ ।।

tata āyāṃti subhage rājasāḥ kanyakottamāḥ ।
rājasaṃ pānamādāya pūrvavat praṇamaṃtitāḥ ।।

tūṣṇīṃ bhūtvā devadevi tāsāṃ nābhāṣayedvacaḥ ।
punaḥ śataikaṃ juhuyāddṛḍhalakṣastu sādhakaḥ ।।

pūrvadhyānena sannaddhau dahet pātālavāsinaḥ ।
(158a)
tataḥ prajvalate sarvamābrahmabhuvanāṃtikam ।।

hāhārāvaṃ mahāghoraṃ kanyā muṃcanti pīḍitāḥ ।
nirgacchaṃtyuttamāḥ sarvā kāmabāṇavaśīkṛtāḥ ।।

mattakuṃjaragāminyaḥ surūpāḥ sthirayauvanāḥ ।
tāsāṃ rūpaṃ sureśāni nāsmiṃ varṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।।

sāttvikāstāḥ samākhyātāḥ sāttvikaṃ pānamuttam ।
sādhakāya prayacchanti praṇamya ca muhurmuhuḥ ।।

evaṃ tābhissaha tadā parivāreṇa saṃyutaḥ ।
praviśecchrīmukhaṃ vīraḥ sarvayaṃtrāṇi mardayat ।।

tatra saṃpūjya deveśaṃ hāṭakeśaṃ mahāprabhum ।
divyacakṣupradaṃ cādau tataḥ pānaṃ samāharet ।।

gururdeyaṃ svayaṃ peyaṃ sāttvikaṃ pānamuttamam ।
sakhīnāṃ rājasaṃ deyaṃ rājasyaśca varāṃganāḥ ।।

hīneṣu tāmasaṃ deyaṃ tāmasyo varayoṣitaḥ ।
evaṃ vibhajya suciraṃ mahākalpaṃ sajīvati ।
haṭha praveśamākhyātaṃ pātāle surasuṃdari ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

praveśā katidhāstatra pānāḥ katividhā vibho ।
yoṣitaḥ katidhāḥ proktāḥ purāṇi katidhā vadā ।।

yaṃtrāḥ kati vidhā deva vilāḥ kati vidhā smṛtāḥ ।
etatsarvaṃ maheśāna vada bhūta hitāya me ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

śṛṇuṣva kathayāmyeṣa pātālavidhiruttamam ।
yena samyaga dhītena sarvasiddhyaraho bhavet ।।

praveśastrividhastatra samāsādavadhāraya ।
haṭhapraveśaḥ prathamaḥ pradhāno maṃtrasiddhijaḥ ।।

sāmānyākhyo dvitīyaḥ syāt praveśaḥ suravaṃdite ।
yogāṃjanaistvasau sādhyo maṃtro hutvamupaiti hi ।।

vidhipraveśo deveśi tṛtīyaḥ paripaṭhyate ।
eṣāṃ krameṇa vakṣyāmi vibhāgamadhunā śṛṇu ।।
(158b)
mahāmaṃtraprasādāśca susiddhassādhakottamaḥ ।
tapovratajapakliṣṭaḥ sādhayeddhaṭhasādhanam ।।

pūrvasevāvidhiṃ kṛtvā maṃtrasya tanumadhyame ।
paścādaṃjanayogāni saṃsādhyaiva narottamaḥ ।।

sāmānyaṃ sādhayedvīro sādhako nātra saṃśayaḥ ।
atrāṃjanaṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇu caṃdrānane śubham ।।

stotoṃjanaṃ samāhṛtya maṃtritaṃ kārayet sakṛt ।
godhārudhirasaṃyuktaṃ brāhmīrasasamanvitam ।।

śatajaptaṃ śmaśānasthaṃ mahānarakasaṃpuṭe ।
anenāṃjita netrastu bhavatyantahṛto naraḥ ।।

pātāle sarvayaṃtrāṇāṃ mūrddhni tiṣṭhatyaśaṃkitaḥ ।
gatirniṣidhyatenāsya kenacidyaṃtrajātinā ।।

evaṃ prakārataḥ sādhya aṃjanaṃ srotajaṃ punaḥ ।
sūkarasyaiva deveśi vāmakarṇāt samāharet ।।

raktaṃ tenāśmani tadā maṃtraghṛṣyāṃ jayetpunaḥ ।
akṣiṇī devadeveśi tadāṃtahṛta eva saḥ ।।

viśate sarvavivarāṃ gatistasya na hanyate ।
pātālabhogabhuktāṃte padaṃ māheśvaraṃ vrajet ।।

atha kūrmasya hṛdayamāhṛtyāṃjanasaṃyutam ।
trilohaveṣṭitaṃ kṛtvā maṃtrayecchatamaṃtritam ।।

vaktretāṃ guḍikāṃ kṣipya pātālādhipati bhavet ।
antahṛtantu bhūtānāṃ vicaredyatra rocate ।।

samudramadhya viśatena jalenātra bādhyate ।
paśyate sarvaratnāni gṛhītā teṣu jāyate ।।

udakasthai ghorasattvairvāsau kenāpi bādhyate ।
evamaṃjanayogābhyāṃ pātālaṃ sidhyate nṛṇām ।।

vidhipraveśamadhunā tava vacmi sumadhya me ।
(159a)
pūrvasevāmato kṛtvā sādhakeṃdro vilaṃ vrajet ।।

dīpaparvaṇi deveśi nirghate gaganāṃtare ।
arddharātregnikāryaṃ ca aṃjanai rahito viśet ।।

atha tīvratamasyāpi svayamāyāṃti yoṣitaḥ ।
dīpikā cātra vakṣyāmi tamoyaṃtravighaṭṭanīm ।।

kāṃḍamāhṛtya subhage jatuguggulusaṃyutam ।
śrīvāsakaṃ sarjarasaṃ tailaṃ jyotiṣmatī bhavam ।।

gṛhītvā lepayet kāṇḍaṃ maṃtrayecca tataḥ priye ।
jvālayedagninā taṃtu śmaśānotthena bhairavi ।।

eṣā sā dīpikāghorā sarvayaṃtravighātanī ।
naiṣā nirvāpituṃ śakyā mārutairvegavattaraiḥ ।।

pādalepaṃ pravakṣyāmi vajrakardamanāśanam ।
aṃgārarāśiśamanaṃ jaleyaṃ ravināśanam ।।

apāmārgaṃ samāhṛtya gajasūttasamanvitam ।
viliṃpatena caraṇau niḥśaṃkastu vilaṃviśet ।।

stabhayet sarvayaṃtrāṇi viśānyugraviśāni ca ।
viṣakalkaṃ dadhighṛtaṃ madhusaṃmiśritaṃ kṛtam ।।

pādalepena pātāle gatistasya na hanyate ।
atha dine vakṣyenyeṣu nissādhano * * viśet ।।

bṛhaspatau svātidine kārttikasyāsitehani ।
amākhoyaṃtrarahitā vivarāstre bhavaṃti hi ।।

yāmyaṛkṣe pūrṇimāyāṃ tasminmāsi maheśvari ।
niryaṃtrāṇīha kṛtsnāni vivarāṇi bhavaṃti hi ।।

yasminyasminbhavenmāsi gururikṣaṃ gurordinam ।
tasminna harisarvāṇi vilāni kṣitimaṃḍale ।।

niryaṃtrāṇi bhavaṃtyeva saṃkrāntīṣu ca parvasu ।
grahoparāgakāle tu niryaṃtraṃ vivaraṃ bhavet ।।

evamādyairdevadevi praveśo yo bhave - ṇām ।
vidhisaṃjñassa ākhyātaḥ sādhakānāṃ sukhāvahaḥ ।।
(159b)
atha pānasya bhedāni vakṣyamāṇāni vai śṛṇu ।
amṛte pūrvamutpanne kṣīrodādvarasāgarāt ।।

yadā kṣobhamabhū(dyā)raṃ devadānavasaṃyugam ।
tadā śukrasya yā mātā uśanā nāmayoginī ।।

tayā nārāyaṇādyāye devāḥ śakrapurogamāḥ ।
saṃmohyārddhaṃ apahṛtaṃ tasmādeva kumaṇḍalāt ।।

tadā pātālamāśritya dadau śukrāya sā punaḥ ।
amṛtaṃ kiṃcidevātra pānārthaṃ tasya sā tadā ।।

tayā kevalamanyacca sthāpitaṃ sāttvikaṃ tu tat ।
kāraṇaṃ cādhikṛtyaiva śeṣamanya rasā ca yuk ।।

tadrājasamihākhyāta pānaṃ cāmṛtasaṃyutam ।
rasasyānyasya bhāgārddhaṃ sāmānyasyāṣṭadhā smṛtam ।।

uttamasya daśāṃśaṃ hi tattāmasamudāhṛtam ।
śatāṃśottamayogena tatsāmānyamudāhṛtam ।।

akṣayaṃ varadānācca madīyāttatra saṃsthitam ।
evaṃ caturddhā ākhyātaṃ vīryamatyādhunocyate ।।

sātvikena prapītena viṣṇutulyāvalo bhavet ।
sarvaśāstrārthakuśalo vedavedāṃgapāragaḥ ।।

mahākalpāpurevasyācchikṣāyuddhaviśāradaḥ ।
sarvapātālabhuktvāmī yathādevo janārdanaḥ ।।

caturdaśaiva bhuvanāṃ saṃcaredyatra rocate ।
sāttvikīnāṃ varastrīṇāṃ koṭiḥ kāmayate sadā ।।

yogeśvaraḥ pṛthakkuryādātmānaṃ koṭibhedataḥ ।
yāvaṃti yogaśāstrāṇi mahājñānayutāni ca ।।

saṃbhavaṃtīha deveśi śivādyavanigocare ।
tāvatsarvāṇi jānāti lakṣalakṣaṇayogataḥ ।।

ante nirvāṇamāyāti duṣprāpamakṛtātmabhiḥ ।
rājase nāthapītena bhavet kāmavapuḥ svayam ।।
(160a)
manvantaratrayaṃ jīven mahābhogabharālasaḥ ।
sarvaśāstrārthakuśalo vedavedāṃgapāragaḥ ।।

idrādhikabalopete lakṣaṃ kāmayate striyam ।
rājasīnā mahābhāge sarvājātīsma viṃdati ।।

bhuktvā bhogānatragatāṃ jāyate sa maheśvaraḥ ।
āsapta mekhalāṃśābhya līyate parame śive ।।

- mase naiva pītena mānuṣā(rvru)dasaptakam ।
jīvedasurarūposau sahasraṃ kāmayet sadā ।।

tāmasīnāṃ varastrīṇāṃ nānābhogasamanvitām ।
kiṃcijjānā - cātmānaṃ sadā durdāntamānasaḥ ।।

paryaṃte maṇḍalādhīśo bhavatyeva narottamaḥ ।
tatra yajñavarāniṣṭyā punaḥ prāptoti vāṃcchitam ।।

sāmānye nāthapītena sāmānyā surarūpadhṛt ।
arvudaikaṃ vatsarāṇāṃ dhriyatesau narottamaḥ ।।

śataṃ kāmayate nityaṃ sāmānyā surayoṣitām ।
na vijānāti cātmānaṃ smāritopi nagātmaje ।।

cakkravicchinnaśīrṣosau jāyate maṃḍalādhipaḥ ।
evaṃ pānavidhiḥ prokto vibhāgāttava suṃdari ।।

athāṃto yoṣitotpattiṃ tava vakṣyāmi bhairavi ।
purādevāsuraiḥ sarvaimamṛtaṃ sādhitaṃ yadā ।।

tasmiṃkāle samutpannā striyo hyamṛtasaṃbhavāḥ ।
triṃśatkoṭisahasrāṇi triṃśatkoṭiśatāni ca ।।

sarvāstā hyanavasyāṃgyai daityerevodbhitāḥ priye ।
(160b)
saṃsthāpitāśca pātāle ghorayaṃtraiḥ surakṣitāḥ ।।

yaṃtrāṇāṃ trividhā yoniḥ karmamāyā tamo mayā ।
dvātriṃśati sahasrāṇi tāni ghoratarāṇi ca ।।

teṣāmatyuttamaṃ ghoraṃ sahasraṃ triṃśaduttaram ।
ebhistā rakṣitāḥ sarvā uttamā varayoṣitaḥ ।।

na tādṛśya striyo devi vidyaṃte bhuvanodare ।
yāsāṃ caṃdro nakhāgrasya rasamaḥ parameśvari ।।

yāsāṃ saṃsparśamātreṇa yugalakṣaṃ sajī - te ।
sarvasya jagatassāraṃ rūpaiśvaryaṃ tava priye ।।

tvaṃ ca tāsāṃ śatāṃśena na samā parvatātmaje ।
atastāsāṃ rūpaguṇaṃ nāsmi varṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।।

tāsāṃ garbhapure vāsaḥ sarvasaṃpadgulojjvalau ।
tāsāṃ patitvaṃ kāṃkṣaṃbhinārāyaṇamukhāḥ surāḥ ।।

na prāpnuvaṃti deveśi mamecchā bhayapīḍitāḥ ।
nārāya(ṇa)syāvinayā te devāḥ śāpabhājanāḥ ।।

tavaiva varadānācca mānavāstatra bhājanāḥ ।
ye madbhaktāstaṃtraratā devī bhaktā dṛḍhavratāḥ ।।

apaścimaṃ janmayeṣāṃ teṣāṃ vāṃcchātra jāyate ।
na eva puruṣavyāghrāḥ śivaśaktyā nirīkṣitāḥ ।।

yeṣā maṃtra bhavedvāñchā prāpnuṃ suravarārcite ।
nūnaṃte dehino rudrāḥ sādhakā yetra bhairavi ।।

sūkṣmāmṛtakalotpannā rājasya sthāvarāṃganāḥ ।
tāsāṃ tācceṭikā jñeyā mukhyānāṃ - rayoṣitaḥ ।।

tāsāmapi hi rūpeṇa rājasī(nāṃ) sumadhyame ।
na hi paśyāmi brahmāṇḍe tādṛśye vā striyaḥ kvacit ।।

yāsāṃ lakṣmī tathātvaṃ hi lajjanti murataḥ sthitāḥ ।
(161a)
tāsāṃ kathaṃ rūpaguṇaṃ varṇayāmyeṣa suṃdari ।
āsāṃ kesaragā jñeyāḥ purāḥ padmapurottame ।।

ataśca tāmasānāṃ ca śṛṇvutpattiṃ nagātmaje ।
purā tapasi saṃsakte rasurairvarṣalakṣakām ।।

bahūnārādhito devo brahmālokapitāmahaḥ ।
yathā dehi varābhāryā yāsāṃ rūpaguṇaśriyam ।।

caturdaśasu deveśa veṣṭapeṣu samaṃ na hi ।
evaṃ śrutvā tadā tena brahmaṇā lokakartriṇā ।।

trailokya sāramāhṛtya lāvaṇyaṃ yadvyavasthitam ।
nirmime yoṣitānāṃ sa lakṣāṇi prayutānyapi ।।

tāsāṃ samādivaiśāsau gacchadhva daityasattamām ।
āsāṃ rūpaṃ tathā kāṃtiṃ nāsmi varṇayituṃ kṣamaḥ ।।

kesarastha purasthānāmetāstāḥ paricārikāḥ ।
āsāṃ daleṣu deveśi purāṇyeva bhavaṃti hi ।।

sāmānyānāṃ pravakṣyāmi vibhāgamadhunā priye ।
devānāmathasarverṣā yāstriyaścottamottamāḥ ।।

vidyādharāṇāṃ siddhānāṃ bhogināṃ kiṃ nareṣvapi ।
yakṣāṇāmathayāḥ kanyāstriyo vā rūpagarvitāḥ ।।

āhṛtyatāḥ samastāśca apsarādyāḥ svakepure ।
sthāpitā hyasurairdevi varotsiktairmahābalaiḥ ।।

jagatsārāṇi deveśi strīratnānyevameva hi ।
sāmānyānyatra tāni syuḥ strīratnāni sumadhyame ।।

āsāṃ purāṇi deveśi cakkrāreṣu bhavanti hi ।
etāḥ patra purasthānā vedyāśca paricārikā ।।

evaṃ krameṇa deveśi rūpamatyuttarottaram ।
vijñātavyaṃ sādhakeṃdrairāsurīṇāṃ sadaiva hi ।।

cakkrārabiṃdasadṛśā purāhyevaṃ prakīrttitā ।
cakramadhye vu(jā)syāntaḥ karṇikāyāṃ prakīrttitā ।।

tadgarbhapurayāṇaṃ vastrāṃ svāṃśako(ṣyā)yutaprabham ।
(161b)
mahāmaṇimayaṃ śubhraṃ sarvaratnamasāvṛtaḥ ।।

antaḥpuraṃ kesareṣu svargācchataguṇasmṛtam ।
puraṃ patragataṃ jñeyaṃ svargāddaśaguṇaṃ - - ।।

nānāmaṇiśatākīrṇaṃ sarvakāmārthasiddhidam ।
cakkrārakeṣu kupuraṃ sarvakāmārthasiddhidam ।।

haimaṃmaṇiśatākīrṇaṃ svargāttatriguṇaṃ smṛtam ।
caturdaśasu deveśi bhuvaneṣu yaduttamam ।।

tattatpātālatalagaṃ nirmitaṃ padmayoninā ।
akṣayyaṃ varadānācca sadā sarvaṃ pratiṣṭhitam ।।

evaṃ viravibhāgoktaṃ vilānāmadhunocyate ।
uttamaṃ śrīmukhaṃ jñeyaṃ bahugarbhapurācitam ।।

madhyamaṃ vilasaṃjñaṃ syādantaḥpuraśatairyutam ।
sāmānyavivaraṃ proktaṃ siddhadravyaśatāvṛtam ।।

evaṃ vilavibhāgaṃ syāddeśeṣvadhunamucyate ।
prayāge ca gayāyāṃ ca śrīśaile maṃḍaleśvare ।।

hariścaṃdranarmadāyāṃ tathā kāṃliṃjare girau ।
kaśmīrāyāṃ śūlabhedaṃ rotapūrṇavilottamam ।।

vijaye ca varāhe ca jyeṣṭhe cottaramānase ।
tuṃgasvāmi samīpe tu mahādeva girau tathā ।।

pātramūle padmasare mahāmāyūrake tathā ।
evamādiṣu deśeṣu śrīmukhāste prakīrttitāḥ ।।

koṭitrayaṃ samākhyātaṃ vivarāṇāṃ sumadhyame ।
bhūloke dve smṛte koṭī ākāśe koṭiriṣyate ।।

jaṃbudvīpe smṛtaṃ caiva samudre dviguṇaṃ smṛtam ।
uttarottaramānena dvīpe dvīpe prakīrttitāḥ ।।

evaṃ samācitaṃ jñeyaṃ vilairbhūmaṃḍalaṃ śubhaiḥ ।
tridhāte ca parijñeyā uttamādhamamadhyamāḥ ।।

evaṃ pātālasarvasvaṃ saṃkṣepāttava kīrttitam ।
kimanyat kathayiṣyāmi vada pārvati mā ciram ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
(162a)
ghoraghoratarā sādhane pātālasiddhipaṭalaḥ ।। ।।

(162b)
devyuvāca ।।

adhunā śrotumicchāmi sādhanāni pṛthakpṛthak ।
sāmānyamadhyamānīha sāṃprataṃ vai vadasva tat ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

śṛṇu saṃkṣepato vacmi sādhanaṃ pārameśvari ।
padānāṃ pūrvamevoktaṃ punarneha pratanyate ।।

samastāyā punarvacmi kiṃciduddeśatodhunā ।
gatvā pitṛvaṇaṃ bhīmaṃ śavasaṃgṛhya vā kṣatam ।।

vedimadhyagataṃ kṛtvā tatpṛṣṭhe sādhakā japet ।
ghorāvṛttiṃ samālaṃvya sahasrākṣaramālitām ।।

- vatprasyaṃdagaṃ vegācchavaṃ pādatalasthitam ।
sphurattasya tadā māṃsaṃ khaḍgenāhṛtya bhakṣayet ।।

phukirecca diśāsvalyadrāvaṃ muṃcedbhayānakam ।
tata āyānti yoginyastrivaktre yā pratiṣṭhitāḥ ।।

vadanti sādhakasyaivaṃ sādhu bhoḥ vīranāthaka ।
dehi kiṃciccarorbhāgaṃ asmākaṃ parimaṃtritam ।।

evamākarṇya tāsāṃ vai datvā vāmāṃgasaṃbhavam ।
paścāttanmāṃsamutkṛtya dātavyaṃ nāsubhairavi ।।

bhakṣayitvā pranṛtyanti yoginyo cakkravattataḥ ।
nābhissārddhaṃ narttamāna plavane gaganāntaram ।।

bhairaveva bhavettatra sādhako nātra saṃśayaḥ ।
evaṃvidhena vidhinā vetālaṃ sādhayedgiriḥ ।।

yāvatprasyaṃdata devi tāvadvighnā samuccaret ।
kṛtvāṭṭahāsaṃ sumahadvadatyeva tu sādhakam ।।

siddhosmi tava vīredra kiṃ karohaṃ tava sthitaḥ ।
evamākarṇya tasyaiva vaktavyaṃ sādhakena ca ।।
(163a)
bho vetāla mahāsattva naya mā devatālayam ।
yatra sākṣādbhagavatī kālaṃ sakarṣaṇī sthitā ।।

evaṃ śrutvā sa vetālo na patyeva hi sādhakam ।
yatra sākṣānmahākālī taṃ sthānaṃ sādhakeśvaram ।।

taṃ prāpyena punardevi śocane sādhakeśvaraḥ ।
athāntarddhānamanvicchettadāyaṃ vidhimācaret ।।

mahātailaṃ samādāyaṃ suśuddhe narakaṃ dale ।
mṛtatailamayīṃ varttiṃ puṣpayoge purohite ।।

kalpayitvā śmaśānasthā sādhayedaṃjanottamaṃ ।
kapālasthaṃ gṛhītvaivaṃ śatajaptaṃ ca kārayet ।।

etenāṃjita netrastu naṣṭacchāyo bhavennaraḥ ।
jīvedvarṣasahasrāṇi daśayeva hi sādhakaḥ ।।

sadā yauvanasaṃpanno daśanāgavalo yuvā ।
dhūmāyite nāṃjanena etadbhavati lakṣanaṃ ।।

jvalite nātha deveśi bhavedvidyā dhareśvaraḥ ।
atha śūlodbhavaṃ kāṣṭhaṃ gṛhītvā pāduke kuru ।।

śmaśānamāśritya tadā japet samyak sahasrakam ।
juhuyānnṛmalaṃ devi jvalaṃtyeva hi pāduke ।।

tadā siddhā parijñeyā lakṣaṇena sumadhyame ।
prāvṛtyapādayostāṃ vai bhavedvidyā dhareśvaraḥ ।।

dvisaptabhuvanākrāmī trailokyaiśvarya saṃyutaḥ ।
pūrvoktaṃ kāṣṭhamānīya bhinnakaṃdharameva hi ।।

tena śūlaṃ prakarttavyaṃ paṃcāśāṃgulamucchṛtam ।
pratiṣṭhāpya ca taṃ śūlaṃ parvatāgre tanūdari ।।

puṣpitamrīrajoliptaṃ vīrā sṛgupalepitaṃ ।
kṛtvā japet sahasrāṇi trīṇi sādhakapuṃgavaḥ ।।
(163b)
uṣmāyati kramācchūlaṃ tato dhūmā{ya}ti priye ।
jvalatyeva tadā bhūyo lakṣaṇaistaṃ vicārayet ।।

prathamena sureśāni saptadvīpeśvaro bhavet ।
jīvane varṣasāhasraṃ mahābalaparākramaḥ ।।

dvitīyena mahābhāge khagatirdaśayojanam ।
tṛtīyena bhaveddevi śūlavidyādhareśvaraḥ ।।

mahākalpaṃ taṃtrabhogāṃ bhuktvā śivapuraṃ vrajet ।
athānyaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi bhūtānāṃ sādhanaṃ mahat ।।

gatvā śmaśānaṃ vīredro vedimadhyercayecchivām ।
tadbhasmāṃdūlitaṃ gātraṃ kṛtvā bhikṣāśano japet ।।

tatrainaṃ daṃḍakaṃ devi japedrātrau digaṃbaraḥ ।
na vākyaṃ kasyacidyacchedbhikṣāparyaṭamānakam ।।

svareṇa puṣṭanādena daṇḍakaṃ samudāharet ।

oṃ ho he mahākula bhairava auṃ ।। ṇadūihiṃḍaimajhriṭhiauṃ । mahikhaṃdhicadāvi asattisā ।
ghorīmajhrimasāṇisā । mahiṃṇadūgnīghaṇḍaghasmasī । khaṇḍaghorarāvabhairavamullantī । tahiṃu-gnī-hiṃcakkhagnīta
hiagnijālubhīsaṇumellattī । bhūasamūhaihiuphoḍattī । marccīudvakesavikarāliṇi । hāhāaduhāsumella - ।
mahahiyasmā ṛṇimellagnī । āṇignībhūāiṛḍagni ।। ।।

evaṃ daṇḍakamuccārya bhikṣāmāhṛtyasādhakaḥ ।
yato yataḥ prāpyate sā tatra tatra prabhakṣayet ।।
(164a)
paścāt prāpya svakaṃ sthānaṃ bhūtānāma yuto japet ।
āyāṃtu sarvabhūtāni vidyādarpahatāni tu ।।

padamevaṃ mavyagaṃ syāttamo devīṃ samuccaret ।
māsaikamevamābhiṣyedvrataṃ bhairavavallabham ।।

tata āyāṃtite tūrṇa bhūtāḥ sarve na saṃśayaḥ ।
rākṣasāśca piśācāśca yakṣāḥ kuṃbhāṇḍakāstathā ।।

betālāḥ kiṃkarā bhūtā ye cānyenānukīrttitāḥ ।
sarve te vaśagāstasya kiṃkarāḥ sādhakasya hi ।।

bhavatyeva hi saṃdehaṃ sarvakarmakarāḥ sadā ।
parvatāścūrṇayaṃtyete sāgarā śoṣayattyapi ।।

nadyaḥ pibaṃti sarvāste nāgānsaṃbhakṣayaṃtyapi ।
nirbhedayaṃti pātālāṃ yāvatkālāgnimaṃdiram ।।

idrādayo lokakālā balādākarṣayaṃti te ।
rājānaścūrṇayaṃtyete yoṣayaṃti kulācalām ।।

preryaṃte yatra yatraite tattatkurvaṃtya vyaṃkitāḥ ।
evaṃ bhūtādisaṃsiddhiṃ taṃtresmiṃ tava kīrttitā ।।

adhunā yakṣiṇī siddhiṃ tava vakṣyāmi bhāmini ।
mṛtakarpaṭagāṃ likhya nāma jñātvā tu yakṣiṇīm ।।

tāṃ pratiṣṭhāpya vidhivadvaṭāvastājjapettataḥ ।
sahasraṃ devadeveśī tataḥ puṣpaiśca tāḍanam ।।

śavodbhavaiḥ prakarttavyaṃ kuṇḍaṃ jñātvā samuccaram ।
bhāryākulaṃ bhagasthānāttāḍayeta sumadhyame ।।

mātuḥ kula pādatalānsakhī hṛdayato hanat ।
kulāni pūrvamuktāni kāliṣaṭke mayā tava ।।

evaṃ saptāhamātraṃ tu yāvadā tāḍayedbhṛṣam ।
tāvadāyāti sā yakṣī bhītabhītā suvihvalā ।।
(164b)
sarvvārthadā bhavatyeṣā yathā pūrvaṃ navoditam ।
athānya saṃpravakṣyāmi ceṭakānāṃ tu sādhanam ।।

vappilaḥ kaṃpilaścaiva puṣpahāso madotkaṭaḥ ।
eteṣāṃ caiva nāmāni vidyayā puṭitāni ca ।।

japaḥ parvata mūrddhnistho sahasrattayamādarān ।
tata āyāṃti te śīghraṃ vidyādarpeṇa mohitāḥ ।।

yatheṣṭhaṃ saṃprakurvaṃti kiṃkaratne vyavasthitāḥ ।
śoṣayanti nadīssarvā parvatāṃ cūrṇayaṃtyapi ।।

ākālikaṃ puṣpaphalaṃ kṣaṇādeva phalaṃti te ।
nāmayaṃtīha vṛkṣāṇi karṣayaṃti vasāmiṣam ।।

parvatāṃ devadeveśi vyomni saṃprerayaṃtyapi ।
devā indrādayaḥ sarve kṣaṇenākarṣayaṃti ta ।।

yadyatprarocate tasya tattatsarva sadaiva te ।
kurvaṃti devadeveśi sādhakājñā tu varttitaḥ ।।

evaṃ ceṭaka saṃsiddhiḥ kathitā te nagātmaje ।
atha dravya samākṛṣṭiṃ saṃhārākhyaṃ bravīmi te ।।

citrāpayetpaṭe devīṃ pūrvadhyānena yādṛśīm ।
mṛtakarpaṭagāṃ devi sarvāvayavaśobhitām ।।

tāṃ pratiṣṭhāpya deveśīṃ jyeṣṭhā sthāne maheśvari ।
tasyāgrataḥ pratiṣṭhāpyaṃ bhāṃḍānāṃ daśakaṃ priye ।।

madyabhāṇḍaṃ kṣīrabhāṇḍaṃ ghṛtabhāṃḍaṃ tathaiva ca ।
tailabhāṃḍaṃ bhaktabhāṃḍaṃ vyaṃjanasya tathā trayaḥ ।।

dhānya sasyādibhāṃḍe dve samāsādvaravarṇini ।
ucchuṣmānyeva sarvāṇi pratiṣṭhāpya vidhānataḥ ।।

vidhānānyava deyāni sacchidrānyaṣu sarvadā ।
paścādvīrakupakrītairdravyerdevī prapūjayet ।।

tathaivānītya dravyāṇi tāni bhāṃḍāni pūrayet ।
māsamekaṃ japedevaṃ dṛḍhacintastu sādhakaḥ ।।
(165a)
karṣayaṃtī sadā bhāvyā dravyānyeva sureśvarī ।
ahorātramavicchinnaṃ vratamevaṃvidhaṃ caret ।।

māsāṃte devatā nityaṃ sarvadravyāṇi cāharet ।
ātmā sahasramātrasya bhogāṃśca vividhāṃ dadet ।।

evametansamākhyātaṃ vyaṃjanākarṣaṇaṃ mahat ।
yamavāpya naraḥ śīghraṃ sādhayenmanasepsitam ।।

adhunā saṃpravakṣyāmi vidhiṃ prāsenikaṃ śubham ।
yena sarvaṃ prajānāti trailokye yatpratiṣṭhitam ।।

pūrvasevāvidhau japtvā śatamekaṃ tataḥ priye ।
khaḍge ca darpaṇe śaṃkhe jale caṃdre (na)bhottare ।।

dīpeṃguṣṭhe bhasmapātre kanyānetre tathaiva ca ।
prasunā dṛśyate devi svayaṃ sāmaṃtriṇaḥ śubhāḥ ।।

saṃpūjya vidhisaṃbhārairyathā vibhavavistaraiḥ ।
avicchinnaṃ daheddhūpaṃ tadā sarvaṃ {pra}dṛśyate ।।

bhūtaṃ bhavyaṃ bhaviṣyaṃ ca kālaṃ yadvarttamānakām ।
tatsarvaṃ dṛśyate satyaṃ maṃtriṇo kanyayāthavā ।।

sahasrasevāmānena ślokāṃ paśyati lekhitām ।
śabdaṃ ca śṛṇuyādantastatra devi na savyayaḥ ।।

evaṃ prasenā ākhyātā svasthāveśamathocyate ।
śubhalakṣaṇasampannā kanyāmāhṛtya śobhanām ।।

tatsthā saṃpūjayeddevīṃ sahasrākṣaramālitāt ।
nānāvalyopahāraiśca sudhūpaiḥ kusumaiḥ śubhaiḥ ।।

tālakena mukhaṃ tasyā abhyaṃjyaṃ japamārabhet ।
avicchinnaṃ daheddhūpaṃ bhakṣāṇyagne prakalpayet ।।

madya bhāṃḍānyanekāni saṃsthāpyāni maheśvari ।
tata āviśate tūrṇāṃ tatsthāṃ devīṃ kṛṣodarīm ।।
(165b)
vyomni saṃtiṣṭhate sā tu hastamātre subhairavām ।
netrestatra prakurute pibate madyaśoṇitam ।।

tataḥ sarvaṃ pravadate brahmāṃḍodaragaṃ hi yat ।
atīnānāgataṃ devī nātra kāryā vicāraṇā ।।

praṇataḥ pūjayettāṃ vai bahupuṣpopacārataḥ ।
evaṃ kṣamāpyate devīṃ paścāttāṃ tu visarjayet ।।

svasthāveśena devaṃ syātsvapnamānavakocyate ।
śubhrāṃ śayyāṃ samāśritya śiroṃte pūjayecchivām ।।

siddhārtho sunisaṃjaptāṃ kṛtvā vaktre vinikṣipet ।
śayyāyāṃ vikireccānyāṃ tataścottāna mā svapet ।।

bhūtaṃ bhavyaṃ bhaviṣyaṃ ca yatkiṃcinmanaso gatam ।
tatsarvaṃ paśyate svapne satyaṃ sādhakasattamaḥ ।।

evaṃ svapnavidhiṃ prokto khorikāveśamucyate ।
kṛtvā kāṃsagayīṃ ramyāṃ khorikāṃ bha - pūritām ।।

saṃpūjayettatra devīṃ vātacakkragatāṃ śubhāṃ ।
calamānāṃ mahāghorāṃ trailokyagrāsaghasmarām ।।

mahāvibhavasaṃbhāraiḥ pūjayeta kṛṣodarīm ।
avicchinnaṃ daheddhūpaṃ maṃtramāvarttaye  - - ।।

tata āvi - te tūrṇaṃ khorikā varavarṇini ।
śarava - cchate vegādyatra vittaṃ pratiṣṭhitam ।।

rasaṃ rasāyanaṃ devī śrīmukhaṃ vā susiddhidam ।
naiṣā samaya te kaścitkṣetrapālo maheśvari ।।

evaṃ saṃsādhayet sarvaṃ nidhivātharasāyanam ।
athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi purakṣobhamanuttamam ।।

mātrigṛhaṃ samāsādya saṃpūjya parameśvarīm ।
tatra sthitvā sādhakendro kālāgni kuharodarāt ।।
(166a)
uditāṃ ciṃtayecchakti taḍitkoṭyayutaprabhām ।
siṃdūrapuṃjasadṛśāṃ dāḍimī kusumopamām ।।

sarvamārgaviniryātāṃ sphuliṃgānekasaṃkulām ।
tayā samagrabhuvanānānṛtāṃ meghavatsmamat ।।

varṣantī madirāpūraṃ pūre vā pa(ttane) smaren ।
pṛthivyāṃ vā mahābhāge savatraiva kilatsmaret ।।

punarāvṛttiyogena vyāpyatāṃ bhuvanābalim ।
svamārgamāviśaṃtī tāṃ smaretsādhakasattamaḥ ।।

māsārddhameva mā tiṣṭhedavicchinnanarottamaḥ ।
dhyānaṃ yāvat sureśāni tāvaṃtaṃ kṣobhayetpuram ।।

yāvaṃti tatra deveśi yoṣito puruṣaiḥ saha ।
bālavṛddhāśca paśavo ye ca maṃḍalavāsinaḥ ।।

āgacchaṃti samantāntu vidyādarpaṇamohitāḥ ।
ātmanā ca dhane{nai}va dāsatāṃ yāṃti - sadā ।।

maṇḍalīkā nareṃdro ye nānākṣipatilīlayā ।
evaṃ kṣobhaḥ samākhyāto bhuva tasya samāsataḥ ।।

māsadhyānānmahābhāge bhūcaryo yāṃti vaśyatām ।
svakadadaṃti vijñānaṃ sādhakāya mahātmane ।।

māsadvayena deveśi khecaryo yāṃti vaśyatām ।
brahmāṇḍodaravarttinyo śatarudrāṃtikāścayāḥ ।।

vijñānaṃ svaṃ dadetyetāḥ sādhakasya na saṃśayaḥ ।
evaṃ kṣobhaḥ samākhyāto vijñānākṛṣṭikārakaḥ ।।

athānyaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi vaśyākarṣavidhiṃ śubhām ।
saṃpuṭena prayogena yadā hṛnmaṃdirodare ।।

japedenāṃ mahādevīṃ sādhya nāmārṇamadhyagām ।
saptāhāddeva deveśi vaśayetsa carācaram ।।

pāśāṃkuśaprayogena devi nāstyatra saṃśayaḥ ।
(166b)
evaṃvidhena vidhinā hṛdayāṃbujayogataḥ ।।

mahāpāśaprayogena karṣaye tridaśādhipām ।
na tadastīha jagati yartta karṣayate balān ।।

atha vidveṣaṇe dhyeyā dhūmalā ghoranisvanā ।
padayogājjapedenāṃ tadā{pi} viṣayejjagat ।।

viruddhavadano vyomni vajrahasto parasparam ।
praharaṃtau nirādhārau vimukhau - parasparam ।।

evaṃ dhyānaprayogena dveṣayet sa carācaram ।
athoccāṭanamevānyadvakṣyāmi tanumadhyame ।।

likhedvidyāṃ kṛṣṇapaṭe chāgaraktena sādhakaḥ ।
kākapakṣeṇa ghoreśīṃ sādhya nāma samanvitām ।।

saṃsthavyā laṃbamānosau piśācadrumapṛṣṭhataḥ ।
uccāṭayati deveśi api sākṣāddhimācalam ।।

māraṇaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi śatrūṇāṃ kriyate yathā ।
likhenmṛtapaṭenāmaṃ viṣāṃgārā sṛjā tathā ।।

vidyayā saṃpuṭaṃ devi māraya svapadairyutam ।
evaṃ saṃlikhya tulyādho śmaśāne nikhanettataḥ ।।

vahniṃ prajvālya pṛṣṭhe tu huhuyādviṣamāsurīm ।
ekāhlānmārayeddevi yadi śatruḥ puraṃdaraḥ ।।

atha staṃbhanamatyugraṃ śṛṇu vīreṃdravaṃdite ।
likhedbhūjā paṭeddevīṃ pītadravyaṃ na kenacit ।।

sādhyanāmākṣarairyuktā saśmānyādho vinikṣipet ।
staṃbhayeddeva deveśi sainyaṃ garbha tathā gatim ।।

vācaṃ vidyāni sarvāṇi yaccānyatkāmayennaraḥ ।
evaṃ stastaḥ samākhyātastobhanaṃ śṛṇu bhairavi ।।

sakṛjjālamathāmaṃtrya yaṃ tāḍayati sādhakaḥ ।
(167a)
taṃ taṃ saṃstobhayeddevi bhūtagrastestu kā kathā ।।

viśanirnāśayeddevi tāḍanā devanānyathā ।
grahabhūtajvarāṃ lūtāṃ prokṣaṇe naiva nāśayen ।।

meghavātāśanīnāṃ ca dhyānādeva vināśayet ।
apasmāragrahasyātha nāśaṃ naḍā bravīmi te ।।

ekapadya gatāṃ devīṃ pūjayitvā tataḥ priye ।
mahāvibhavasaṃbhāyairvi(ta)śādhya vivarjitaḥ ।।

grahadaṣṭaṃ tatastatra praveśyaṃ na dvanetrakam ।
puroktavattato dīkṣā tasya devi prakāśayet ।।

dīkṣayā eva tasyāśu nacyate dāruṇo grahaḥ ।
abhiṣekena śuśroṇi na smaret punareva saḥ ।।

evaṃ vasiṣṭhasya purā naranārāyaṇaiḥ priye ।
nāṣṭitaṃ taṃ grahaṃ ghoraṃ mahāpāpo sthitaṃ mahat ।।

duścikitsyāni yānīha tāni naśyaṃtyanena vai ।
vidhinā parameśāni nātrakāryā vicāraṇā ।।

evaṃ tava samākhyātamapasmāracikitsitam ।
anayā kuṃbhakenaiva dhūlikṣepānmaheśvarī ।।

staṃbhayecchakaṭaṃnāvāṃ yaṃtrā na ścāṅgajottamām ।
asarpāṃ viladvāreṇa baṃdhaye līlayā naraḥ ।।

atha nāgālayaṃ gatvā anaṃtādikamādarān ।
tatra śūla karo maṃtrī nāganāma samanvitām ।।

śoṣaye svapadairyuktāṃ vidyāmuccairudāharet ।
saptāhāddeva deveśi hradaṃ sāgarasannibham ।।

śoṣayennātrasaṃdeho mahāmaṃtraprabhāvataḥ ।
āyāni bhītabhītosau nāgo vitrastalocanaḥ ।।

trāhimāmiti jalpantaṃ parivāre{ṇa} saṃyutam ।
rasaṃ rasāyanaṃ ratnā siddhadravyāṇi yāni ca ।।
(167b)
tāni prayacchute tasya sādhakasya na saṃśayaḥ ।
athavā tadgṛhe samyagrasitavyaṃ yathecchayā ।।

preṣayedyatra roceta taṃ nāgaṃ puruṣarṣabhaḥ ।
evaṃ nāgāśrayaṃ karma tavāsyātamavistarān ।।

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi rahasyamidamuttamam ।
yanna kutra cidākhyātaṃ sādhakānāṃ hitāvaham ।।

mahāpaśu samākṛṣṭiṃ līlayā siddhyate yathā ।
sthānamekāṃtamāsādya tatra devī kṛṣodarī ।।

pūjayitvāgratastasyā aṃjanaṃ saṃprasādhayet ।
ahṛtya naranevedve mārjāroccha tathaiva ca ।।

vibhāgena samādāya vāmadakṣiṇabhedataḥ ।
kāpilaṃ ghṛtamāhṛtya mahāsnehasamanvitam ।।

saṃkrāmya tena te netre sādhayedaṃ janottamam ।
samyakyapālagaṃ devi sakṛdāvartya siddhyati ।।

tato vijñāpayeddevī maṃjanaṃ tvatprasādataḥ ।
siddhaṃ me devadeveśi yena niḥsaṃśayo hyaham ।।

idānīṃ tava deveśi caruṃ dāsyāpi śobhanam ।
no vedātmānamevāgryemaparādhahataṃ yadi ।।

evaṃ muktvā prabhāte tu yāvadduddhānapakṣiṇaḥ ।
tāvadgṛhādvinirgartya aṃjitākṣo vicārayet ।।

yamatra puruṣaṃ dṛśye striyaṃ vā śubhalakṣaṇam ।
tasya pādānsamāhṛtya pāsuṃ saptamakāṃ tataḥ ।।

mudrābaṃdhaprayogena mahājālaprayogataḥ ।
mudrayitvā tato devi evaṃ pāṃsuṃ samāharet ।।

ucchūṣma saṃpuṭe devi dhyānāgre saṃsthite kṣipet ।
prāpya paṃcāmṛtaṃ devi devyāgre rāvamācaret ।।

tāṃ mudrāṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi śivārāvāṃ durāsadām ।
(168a)
upaviśyāgratastatra dakṣiṇaṃ jānumaṃḍalam ।।

kiṃcitprasāpamākuṃcya vāmapārṇiṃ gude kṣipet ।
parāvṛttaṃ vāmahastaṃ vāmajā tvagragaṃ kuru ।।

bhūmilagnaṃ mahābhāge dakṣiṇaṃ procchritaṃ tataḥ ।
vikṛte locane kārye urddhavaktraḥ subhīṣaṇaḥ ।।

hṛccakkrakuharā pītvā dūrddharāvaṃ virāvayet ।
saptadhā hasite naiva kṣobhayedyoginī kulam ।।

enāṃ ghoratarāṃ mudrāṃ badhvā sādhakasattamaḥ ।
sakṛnmelāpamāyāti devī tuṣṭā prasīdati ।।

paścātpidhāpayecchidramūrddhasaṃpuṭagaṃ naraḥ ।
mahāsthinā śaṃkunā vā tato dhyānarataḥ priye ।।

tatra tiṣṭheva(tudvi)gno tacca dhyānamihocyate ।
āhṛtya pāśayogena lambayeccāṃkuśāhatam ।।

sravantaṃ śūlasaṃviddhaṃ ciṃtayet paśuvigraham ।
helā dolā vihāreṇa prāṇaprekhanapāśanaiḥ ।।

āhāradojasarvvasvaṃ tasyāvāṅmukhagamya ca ।
evaṃ dhyānaratasyāsmatryahāttakalalaṃ bhavet ।।

saptāhātsusugaṃdhi syādānaṃdajanakaṃ param ।
dvisaptāhādhvaniṃ cātra ṣaṭpado jāyate bhṛṣam ।।

trisaptāhādbhavedūṣmā tadā siddhavinirdiśet ।
atra krameṇa subhage śṛṇu vakṣyāmi yo vidhiḥ ।।

vibhavena tato devīṃ pūjayitvā ca sādhakaḥ ।
nivedya bhakṣayet paścāt sakalīkṛtavigrahaḥ ।।

evaṃ paśūnāṃ saptānāṃ bhakṣaṇādamṛtaṃ priye ।
plavate gaganābhogāṃ yatra devī kṛṣodarī ।।

athavā carumādāya rātrau paryaṭanerataḥ ।
(168b)
gatvā śmaśānamevāgryaṃ tatra devīṃ prapūjya ca ।
gṛhītvā carukaṃ haste pūrvāṃ mudrāṃ prabaṃdhayet ।।

tata āyāṃti khecaryo mahānaṃdā madākulāḥ ।
prārthayaṃti caruṃ devi sādhakasya mahātmanaḥ ।।

tatastāsāṃ mahābhāge mārgitavyaṃ samīhitam ।
aṇimādyaṣṭakaṃ vātha khecaraṃ vā padottamam ।।

pātālamathavā devi yathā vā tasya rocate ।
tattadvadaṃtitāstasya sādhakasya na saṃśayam ।।

tataścaruṃ svayaṃ prāpya cakkrācchiṣṭaṃ hi sādhakaḥ ।
samīhitaṃ prāpnuyāśca devināstyatra saṃśayat ।।

evaṃ naṃdanti tā devyo yoginyo ḍāmarāstathā ।
ḍāginyaścaiva lāmāśca mahācchuṣmācca mā naraḥ ।।

ūrddhaniścāsikāścānyā hyadhoniścāsikāparaḥ ।
nakracūṣyastathā cānyā yoginyo yāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ।।

yāvaṃtyaḥ śaṃvare taṃtre purāproktāḥ suvistare ।
daśadvādaśasāhasre tāvatyastasya cāgragāḥ ।।

bhavaṃti sādhakasyaiva susiddhāḥ parameśvari ।
carusiddhiriyaṃ proktā sādhakānāṃ susiddhidā ।।

ityevaṃ tava devi * proktaṃ ghoreśvarī cakkram ।
adhunā vada svapatre manasi gataṃ tacca vakṣyāmi ।। ।।

iti bhairavastrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
ghoraghoratarā cakkravidhiḥ paṭalaḥ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

purā tu śaṃvare taṃtre yaduktaṃ parameśvara ।
tatra jñātaṃ mayā deva guhyataṃtrasya vistarāt ।।

kathaṃ sa bhairavo dehastvayi deva mahābalaḥ ।
(169a)
kathaṃ devyo yajantyenaṃ kulāstāsāṃ kati smṛtāḥ ।।

kathaṃ kramaṃ mahāgūḍhaṃ cāraṃ tāsāṃ kathaṃ vibho ।
carusiddhiḥ kathaṃ tāsāmetanme brūhi vistaram ।।

evamākarṇya deveśyā vadanāṃburuhacyutam ।
vavomṛtaṃ mahādevo bhūyo vacanamavravīt ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

sādhu sādhu mahābhāge sarvajñānārthabhājane ।
mahārahasyamatulaṃ yoginī cāramuttamam ।।

pravakṣyāmi samāsena śṛṇuṣvekāgramānasā ।
guhyacakkratrayopetaṃ mahāyāgatrayānvitam ।।

bahusiddhisamāyuktaṃ rahasyānekasaṃkulam ।
kāśyapā mīnacakkrasya yaśca siddhatayā sthitam ।।

yogaṣaṭkapadaprāpti yatra nityaṃ pratiṣṭhitā ।
paṃcasarvarahasyogramātṛmaṃḍalasaṃkulam ।।

gaṇadūtinikāyānāmarantakulasaṃkulam ।
bahuyogabharāvāpaṃ bahvāścarya śatākulam ।।

siddhamaṃtrapadopetaṃ kulamaṃtravibhūṣitam ।
samayācārasaṃsiddhaṃ dignimittavibhūṣitam ।।

japavratavinirmuktaṃ siddhidaṃ yogasiddhidam ।
sarahasyopacāraṃ ca śṛṇuṣvekāgramānasā ।।

purā yajyamitāsamyaṅmāyā tatpratipāditam ।
tathāpi tatra deveśi rahasyaṃ na prakāśitam ।।

yoginīnāṃ pracāraṃ tu mahāguptataraṃ yataḥ ।
asmiṃ taṃtravare samyaṅgirākāṃkṣaṃ śṛṇuṣva tat ।।

yosau parāparo devaḥ paramotyeti viśrutaḥ ।
vyāpakaścādhyayo dhātā paripūrṇaśca citparaḥ ।।

yaḥ śiveti samāmnātaḥ śaktimadvigraho vibhuḥ ।
(169b)
tasya yatsamudāyasthaṃ śāktaṃ vīryamakhaṃḍitam ।
tattejāṃśasamudbhūtāḥ sarve maṃtrā mahābalāḥ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

nīrūpa eva bhagavaṃ ākāraparivarjitaḥ ।
asya maṃtrāḥ kathaṃ jātāstanme brūhi maheśvara ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

saṃvidrupatvato devi cidrūpatvamakhaṃḍitam ।
tadullāsaśca sumahānvyaktimāyāti tattvataḥ ।।

varṇonmukhī pravṛttiśca sa evālaṃbate punaḥ ।
mahānādamayo deha ālaṃvya parameśvaraḥ ।।

maṃtrataṃtratvamabhyeti svayameva sa aiśvaraḥ ।
vyaktaḥ surāsurādhīśo nigrahānugraheśvaraḥ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

nigrahānugraho devo bhairavaḥ prakaroti cet ।
tadā dvetreśca rāgaśca tasya syāt puruṣe yathā ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

na tasya subhage rāgo na dviṣe vā vidhīyate ।
yathā vivasvānsubhage padmaṣaṃḍavikāsanam ।।

prakaroti svaraśmītiḥ kānicitpravipācayet ।
na tatra rāgadveṣosya tathā devasya bhairavi ।।

dhvastaṃ yeṣāṃ kramāddevi malaṃ teṣāṃ sunirmalam ।
sampādayati taśceto śivavat parameśvari ।।

nigṛhnāti sapāśaughaṃ malakarmā dhṛtirbhavam ।
teṣāṃ nigrahakṛtprokto bhairavo bhavanāśanaḥ ।।

anugrahaṃ svasvarūpa prakāśātprakarotyasau ।
nigrahānugraho devi tavaivaṃ saṃprakāśitau ।।

varṇānāṃ mātrikā yāmā sā ca maṃtrāraṇi smṛtā ।
(170a)
sā ca kuṃḍalinī śaktiḥ sā jñeyā paramākalā ।।

tato maṃtrāṇi jātāni kulāni ca pṛthakpṛthak ।
taṃtrāṇi devadeveśi tāni samyakpurā mayā ।।

kīrttitāni sureśāni pūrvaṣaṭke suvistaram ।
iha sa kṣeyato khyāsye śṛṇu vīreṃdravaṃdite ।।

mūlataṃtraṃ kubjikā ca yoginī jālaśambaram ।
adūśasvaranāgānaṃ hahūdhūlistathāparā ।।

calākṣara mahātaṃtraṃ viśvakrīḍāvatārakam ।
mahāmāyontaraṃ nāma sarvavīramataṃ tathā ।।

alaṃgrāsaṃ mahātaṃtraṃ kruṃcikodghāṭameva ca ।
siddhacakraṃ prakāśaṃ ca paṭaṃ tūraṃ yathāparam ।।

siddhakaulaṃ mahājālaṃ tathā bhairavagahvaram ।
kulagahvaranāmānaṃ kulaḍāmarabhairavam ।।

jhāṃkārakulamatyugraṃ tathā siddhāmataṃ śubham ।
kācanāmatamevānyat kusumālikasaṃjñitam ।।

siddhayogeśvarī taṃtraṃ trikasārottaraṃ tathā ।
picūtaṃtraṃ mahāraudraṃ vimalocchuṣmasaṃjñitam ।।

khaḍgarāvaṇanāmānaṃ tathānyaṃṭakamaṇḍanam ।
karoṭī muṇḍamālākhyaṃ śiracchedaṃ bhayānakam ।।

hā hā ravontaraṃ tantraṃ krodhamunmattabhairavam ।
ruruyāmalamatyugraṃ tathānyaṃ rudrayāmalam ।।

umāyāmalamevānyaṅgaurīyāmalameva ca ।
skaṃdayāmalamevānyaṃ tathā bhairavayāmalam ।।

viṣṇuyāmalamevasyānnaṃdiyāmalameva ca ।
śukkrayāmalamevānyaccakkrayāmalameva ca ।।
(170b)
kapālīśamataṃ nāma meghanādīśvaraṃ tathā ।
haṃsayāmalanāmānaṃ caṃḍograṃ hāṭakeśvaram ।।

mahāvāmeśvarī taṃtraṃ laṃkeśī matamuttamam ।
laṃpaṭādyaṃ ca - - dyaṃ tathā haḍḍāṣataṃ paraṃ ।।

durvāsamatamevānyamevamādyāhyanekaśaḥ ।
ete taṃtravarāḥ proktā yoginī cakkravaṃditāḥ ।।

eṣu taṃtravareṣveva tāsāṃ cāravicāritam ।
eteṣāmaviyaṃ noktaṃ rahasyaṃ devatā bhavam ।।

śiracchede mahātaṃtre na vādya prakaṭīkṛtam ।
yāvadvicāraṃ deveśi yoginīnāṃ vyavasthitam ।।

saṃcāraṃ ca prakāśaṃ ca śaṃvarāṇi yathaiva hi ।
yathācarūṇi citrāṇi yathācārasya bhedataḥ ।।

yathā paśuvicāraṃ ca rūpādi parivarttanam ।
yathā mudraṇamevātra mohaṃ melakameva ca ।।

tatsarvamiha deveśi nipunaṃ varṇitaṃ mayā ।
evamasya vibhoḥ śaktiḥ prasṛtā bhairaveśvarī ।।

asya sthūlasya devasya yathā vyaktastu śāṃbaraḥ ।
tathāṃgakramabhedena sthānavyakto yathocyate ।।

tasya devāti devasya bhairavasyāmi tadyuteḥ ।
śṛṇu samyakpravakṣyāmi sthāno sthānaṃ surārcite ।।

tasya tejoṃśaṃ saṃbhūtā sarvamaṃtrā mahābalāḥ ।
mahāsaṃvarttake bhīme lalāṭāttasya nisṛtau ।।

tilakorakhaviccaiśca (bhru)vo devi manoharau ।
caṃdrareśā śikhāḥ paṃca devī caṃḍā nilāvṛtāḥ ।।

bhṛkuṭī bhagamāle ca lokavāmā sukeśinī ।
tārā kṣiti jayā rūpā śauṃḍī naṃdini gominī ।।

tṛguṇī caiva satyā ca tathā dākṣāyanī satī ।
(171a)
umāhvayāmahākālācaṃḍālā ca jayāśriyāḥ ।।

bhadrakālī sumedhā ca arkinī subhagā tathā ।
tārakā bharaṇī raudrī jvālāmālā samākulā ।।

keśebhyo nirgatāraudrāsarvasattvabhayāvahāḥ ।
lalāṭatilakāścitrāsarvabhūtamanoharāḥ ।।

jihvāyā jvalitā jvālā pūrayaṃtyo diśo diśaḥ ।
hemadaṃḍadharī caiva tathā vāgeśvarī dhruvā ।।

mahāgaurī mahāmāyā mahābetālireva ca ।
nirgatāḥ kāmarūpiṇyo lokadhātryo mahābalāḥ ।।

mahāmātrībhinetrābhyāṃ sahasrairdaśabhirvṛtāḥ ।
nādakrodho kūhā{sa}śca krodhīśaśca mahābalaḥ ।।

mahogrāsaśca daṃṣṭrābhyāṃ daśakoṭiparivṛtāḥ ।
gaṃḍavo bhairavaṃ jajñe kālarātri bhayaṃkarī ।।

hasitā caṃdrahāsāṃ tu cibukāt kulinī tathā ।
śrīsaṃpuṭā tatheṣṭābhyāṃ kaṃkārudrāśca nirgatāḥ ।।

vāriṇyaḥ karṇayo jātā sevā sāvitrireva ca ।
nāsāyāṃ sarvato bhadrā mahāvidyā ca kāritāḥ ।।

bāhubhyāṃ śūlapatrāśca piṃgalaśca sahasraśaḥ ।
tathā kāpālikāḥ sarve dikpālāśca mahaujasaḥ ।।

aṃgulibhyo mahākāyāḥ kālādyaśca mahāgaṇāḥ ।
vakṣa deśādviniṣkrāṃtā rudraścakkraprahāriṇaḥ ।।

urastanābhyāṃ vijñeyā gaṇā hālāhalāni ca ।
hālāhāla tathā jānai bhaveścākarmako mahān ।।

vidyāmatāstanābhyāṃ tu sarvasatvasukhapradāḥ ।
jayā ca vijayā caiva jaṃghayoḥ pārśvayostathā ।।
(171b)
pṛṣṭhadeśe virūpiṇyo mahākālyaśca nirgatāḥ ।
guhyakāguhyadeśe tu tripuraghnaśca liṃgatā ।।

mahālayaḥ kalaścaiva muṣkebhyo gaṇasattamau ।
ūrūdeśe tathocchuṣmāścaṃḍālau karṇayā vahāḥ ।।

jaṃghābhyāṃ lohapāścaiva vajrajaṃghāśca sarvaśaḥ ।
vādhā kālocanāścaiva dārakā vijanastathā ।।

śavirāśca tathā caṃḍā mātaṅgā sarvakāmadāḥ ।
- - ca tārasaṃbhūtā kāmaśceṃdriyasaṃbhavaḥ ।।

itayo romakūpebhyo vīrabhadraśca nirmitāḥ ।
prasvedā nirgato bhīmo devaḥ kāmāṃganāśanaḥ ।।

evaṃ tejādviniṣkrāṃtā sarve maṃtrāmahābalāḥ ।
svavīryābalayogena sarve sarvajñayā nayāḥ ।।

sarvaprajāviśvasṛjatsarvagāḥ prabhaviṣṇavaḥ ।
brahmāṇḍasya sa dātā ca bahiraṃ narasaṃsthitā ।।

teṣāṃ tejaṃ samādāya śivena paramātmanā ।
nirmito hyeṣa bhagavāṃsarvasattvavaśaṃkaraḥ ।।

trimātrastaccatuṣpādastadvidviḥ parigīyate ।
tasya prathamamātrāṃto aghoraḥ samajāyate ।।

mahāghoro dvitīyāṃto mātrāttatpramṛtāḥ prabhuḥ ।
ghoroghoratarastasya krūrā - krūra karmakṛt ।।

mṛtastṛtīyamātrāttatkṣayasaṃhārarūpavān ।
aghorāṃ tu samutpannāṃ raudre yogeśvarī trayam ।।

aghorā aṃbikā jyeṣṭhā yogaridghi balānvitāḥ ।
maṃtrāṇāṃ yonirūpāstu prabhūtānāṃ mahātmanām ।।

mahāghorasamutpannaṃ śākinīnāṃ kulatrayam ।
(172a)
catuṣkaṃ cūṃbikānāṃ tu mūṣikānāṃ tu paṃcakam ।।

patralehyā kulānyaṣṭau ucchuṣmāṇāṃ caturdaśaḥ ।
daśakaṃ nakracūṣīnāṃ ūrddhaniśvāsikā trayam ।।

adho niśvāsikāsakapūtanāstu sahasraśaḥ ।
kulairūpakulairyuktāryairvyāptamakhilaṃ jagat ।।

ghoraghorataro yastu tasyotpannāstu mātaraḥ ।
triṣaṣṭhikulasadbhinnā dūtī kiṃkarasaṃyutāḥ ।।

mahāṃbikā sasaṃbhinnaṃ navakaṃ navadhā sthitam ।
mahograṃ bhīṣaṇaṃ raudraṃ yatrāyaṃ nāyako vibhuḥ ।।

ṣaṭvibhinnaṃ tathā ṣaṭka samutpannaṃ varānane ।
ṣaṭpatradalasaṃsiddhairyoginīnāṃ mahojasaḥ ।।

ityevaṃ yoganiyamaṃ yoginījālasaṃcare ।
yathotpannastu kathitaṃ niryogaṃ śṛṇu sāṃpratam ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre
tṛtīyaṣaṭke yoginīcakkreśasvarotparttirnāma ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

deva nirṇītarūpāṇāṃ ke maṃtrāḥ koparo vidhiḥ ।
yataḥ kathaṃ samārādhyāḥ phalaṃ vā kīdṛśaṃ bhavet ।।

sāmānyarūpāṇi tathā hṛdayāni maheśvaraḥ ।
kati vā bhinnarūpāṇi yathā {yā}jyaṃti yogibhiḥ ।।

kīdṛśo vā samuccāro matrāṇāṃ vā parākramam ।
yogastu kīdṛśaṃ tāsāṃ samayāścaiva kīdṛśāḥ ।।

caryā ca kīdṛśā deva ācāraścaiva kīdṛśaḥ ।
bahubhedavibhinnāni kiṃ kulāni maheśvaraḥ ।
etatsarvaṃ yathātattvaṃ bhagavaṃ vaktumarhasi ।। ।।
(172b)
bhairava uvāca ।।

guhyacakkrasya vinyāsaṃ maṃtrotpattiniyojanam ।
vicitrāṇi ca karmāṇi kathayāmi tapodhane ।।

vidyālayasya - vasya lakṣaṇaṃ tṛtīyaṃ priye ।
nā(dau) biṃdu kalā caiva yai spṛṣṭaṃ sa carācaram ।।

nādasphoṭastathā śānta śāṃtāyā biṃdusaṃbhavaḥ ।
ghaṃṭātha ciṃcinī caiva ghoṣiṇī tadanaṃtaram ।।

nādātmikā sṛṣṭiriyaṃ viṃdvākāramataḥ śṛṇu ।
yathākṣarasvaro varṇa śabdo rāvastathā dhvaniḥ ।।

kūṭastathā visargaśca raṃjikā biṃdusaṃbhavaḥ ।
vyaktī karoti rūpāṇi vyaktireṣā parasparam ।।

munisvarāsṛjatyete puruṣaiḥ paṃcaviṃśakaṃ ।
yena vyāptamidaṃ sarvaṃ bhuvanaṃ viśvarūpiṇam ।।

brahmādyavīciparyantaṃ tasya rūpaṃ śṛṇuṣvatha ।
māyātmakeṣu deheṣu māyārūpo vyavasthitaḥ ।।

vidyātmakeṣu vidyasthaḥ śaktisthaḥ śaktirūpiṇaḥ ।
sakale sakalasthosau niṣkalo niṣkālasthitaḥ ।।

maṃtraniṣpādako devi guhyacakkravyavasthitaḥ ।
yoginīnāṃ yathā devastathāhaṃ kathayāmi te ।।

caturviṃśati tattvāni digvibhāgena suvrate ।
vinyasya puruṣaṃ madhye vargabhūtagaṇānvitam ।।

sūryacakkratato bāhye kalaiḥ somasya cāvṛtam ।
avyaktaṃ pṛthivī āpa khaṃ vāyusteja eva ca ।।

anulomavilomāni pūrvāgneyāśca vinyaset ।
nāsikā va(jra)jihvā ca śrotrapādau ca madhyamā ।।

pāvanottara yo devi viṃśatattvāni yojayet ।
(173a)
śabdasparśaśca rūpaṃ ca vikhirāhaṃmarastathā ।।

vilomānyatra vinyasya uttareśā na digdale ।
evaṃ vinyasya patreṣu trīṇi trīṇi yathākramam ।।

kakārādibhakārā{ntai}rvarṇairdevi kuśeṣayet ।
marīcī jvālinī dhūmrā tapanī tāpanī tathā ।।

pāvakī havyavāhā ca tathā tejovatī punaḥ ।
śatadhāmā ca dhāmā ca tathā padmaprabodhanī ।।

tamopahā tathā caiva sūryasyaiva tu nāḍayaḥ ।
akārādivisargāntairnapuṃsakavivarjitaiḥ ।।

svaraiḥ vinyasya patrāgre māyādīni vukaiḥ saraiḥ ।
saṃhāraṃ kālasaṃyuktaṃ karṇikāyāṃ prakalpayet ।।

māyā kalā tathā kālo niyati vidyā tathaiśvaraḥ ।
devi sādāśivaścaiva śivaścotkālasaṃ punaḥ ।।

kuśeṣayasya madhyaṃte yaśavargaistu vinyaset ।
evaṃ vinyasya cakkraṃ vai tato maṃtrāṃ samuddharet ।।

manobidusamākrāntaṃ havyavāhā vibheditam ।
yoginī hṛdayaṃ devi sāmānyaṃ mātriroṃdanam ।।

jvālinī jvalato haṃsaḥ puruṣeṇa samanvitaḥ ।
dvitīyaṃ hṛdayaṃ kruraṃ mātrīṇāṃ tu paraṃ matam ।।

saive haṃsaḥ kalāyukto dhāmamālā vimūṣitam ।
nikāya sahitānāṃ tu tṛtīyaṃ parikīrttitam ।।

niyati dhūmrā samākrāṃtā havyavāhārcite nabhaḥ ।
gurusyānmātri hṛdayaṃ triṣaṣṭiṃ kulanaṃdanam ।।

jvālinī pīḍitaḥ pāyuravyaktaṃ dhūmrabheditāṃ ।
sparśastapanī * taptaḥ paṃcamaṃ hṛdayaṃ śubham ।।
(173b)
nāmā śākini dūtīnāṃ kiṃkarīṇāṃ ca suvrataḥ ।
patralehā kulānāṃ ca sarvakarmakaraṃ smṛtam ।।

ādhūpitaṃstu dhūmrāyā śabdavyomastathaiva ca ।
vidyā prajvalitā madhye ṣaṣṭhaṃ tu hṛdayaṃ priye ।।

cuṃbikā cūṣikānāṃ tu pūtanānāṃ saguhyakam ।
ucchuṣmā nakracūṣīnāṃ niśvāsorddhodhajīvinām ।।

sadhūmrā nāsikā devi tamoghnācchadabhūṣitā ।
sarvayogini kāyānāṃ sāmānya hṛdayaṃ smṛtam ।।

nṛyoginīnāṃ hṛdayaṃ devadevi sadāśivaḥ ।
vāmamālāvalaṃbitvā padmabodhā vibhūṣitaḥ ।।

devi vidyālayaḥ padmā vikāsi tanu - - taḥ ।
sarvayoginikā yasya nāyakaḥ sakalaḥ smṛtaḥ ।।

dvitīyo niṣkalo devi niṣkalānāṃ tu nāyakaḥ ।
śivaḥ puruṣasaṃyuktasnāpinī tapitaḥ prabhuḥ ।।

śivaḥ kalostho deveśe jvālāmālivibhūṣitaḥ ।
mālā śākinicakkrānāṃ sarveṣāṃ nāyako vibhuḥ ।।

kalā jvālā vimuktosau tamotsāreṇa saṃyutaḥ ।
kāśyapījanacakkrāṇāṃ aśeṣāṇāṃ vibhuḥ smṛtaḥ ।।

sāmānyāni tu deveśi hṛdayāni tapodhane ।
kathitāni viśiṣṭāni sāṃprataṃ śṛṇu suvrate ।।

vidyālayaśivaścaiva iśvaraśca sadāśivaḥ ।
ādyo jvālinisaṃyuktaḥ śatadhāmānvitoparaḥ ।।

tamopaho tamokrāṃtau catuṣkasya mahā - - ।
bhairavāntapradīptasya sarvakarmakarāḥ smṛtāḥ ।।
(174a)
samparedyāstu śākinyo rudrāṇāṃ kausale tathā ।
catuṣpatheṣu raktāyāṃ vīrasthāne tu sarva te ।।

sarvakarmakarābījā tāḥ svapiḥ śākinī vrate ।
rasarūpo kalā māyā ūrdvādhaḥ paripīḍitau ।।

tamoghnā tāḍitau dīptau ūnmanyau tārakādikau ।
vidyālayamukhopetau kāśyapījanapūjitau ।।

gaganāṃgakacārīṇāṃ devi sāṃnidhyakārakau ।
etat paṃcakalaṃ dīptaṃ śivasya paramātmanaḥ ।।

hṛdayaṃ paramaṃ siddhaṃ guhyakarmmapravarttakam ।
anākhye (yā)stu yoginyo ārākhyā yāstu {su}vrate ।।

sarvāsto smaraṇāddevi vase tiṣṭhaṃti dāsavat ।
nipatiḥ puruṣau tu yadā dveṣu jvalitadīpitau ।
dvitīye pade tu kurvīta kalāsu dhūmrā krūrapadaṃ ।।

bhairavādyayutam ।

etaddhṛdaye siddhaṃ jayādi ṣaṭkasya vidhiyuktam ।
smaraṇādeva hi kṛte hyacintanīyāni karmāṇi ।

ūṣmāṇaṃ kalayā bhinnaṃ tapanī biṃdusaṃyutam ।
tārakāduttamaṃ devi vinyasya prathame pade ।।

avyaktavidhireśānā rasanāntarasaṃsthitā ।
rudraśaktikalāyuktā padmabodhā vibhūṣitā ।।

smayamānā maheśāni bhuktimuktiphalapradā ।
jvālādiśaktiṣaṭkasya ete bījā mahātape ।।

nyāsadhyānavidhānena amoghā bhīmavikramā ।
dhāmontarā havyavahā śatadhā vahnicāriṇī ।।

tejovatī śatadhāmā uttarakalayā prabhedi ।
(174b)
tālāntaḥ puruṣārūḍhaḥ kurute - ta - - rudrādi
kasyā karmāṇi yogasiddhā sānnidhyaṃ varavarṇini ।

mātrīṇāṃ rodanaṃ pūrvaṃ havyavāhānvitaṃ śivaḥ ।
tatastejastṛtīyastu tāpane kālavāhanaḥ ।।

avyaktaṃ kalayāyuktaṃ śatadhāmā vibhūṣitam ।
mātrirodanamālāyāḥ puruṣastu samanvitaḥ ।।

tvacā hṛdayasaṃyuktā kalārūḍho rasottamaḥ ।
śikhārūḍhastataścakṣu vācāmālā vibhūṣitāḥ ।।

kalāsaṃpuṭagādeyaṃ cī - - padasaṃsthitam ।
etaddhṛdayepi devi khamātrīṇāṃ sabiṃdukam ।।

sarvakarmakaraṃ dīptaṃ yāgavratavivarjitam ।
pumāṃ hṛdayasaṃyukto viyuktastu sa - va tu ।।

avyaktaṃ nyasya deveśi tato - mātrirodanam ।
iśānastāpanī tapto gaṃdhe vyakta punaḥ kriyām ।।

hū̃ phaṭkārātasaṃyuktaṃ bhairavaṃ bhīmavikramam ।
hṛdayaṃ kapālamātrīṇāṃ sarvakam * * * * ।।

ādau sadāśivo deva śatadhāmavibhūṣitaḥ ।
paṃcamaṃ ca tataḥ ṣaṣṭhā pṛthivī rajikānvitā ।।

dvitīyaṃ ca caturthaṃ ca karttavyaṃ mātrirodanam ।
tṛtīyastu śirodevi havyavāhavibhūṣitam ।।

etaṃ tu guhyamātrīṇāṃ hṛdayaṃ hṛdayodbhavam ।
guhyādguhyataraṃ devi gopanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ ।।

anena siddhā deveśi naṃdīśapramukhāstathā ।
mahākālastu yogīnāṃ vīreśatvamupāgatāḥ ।।

carmamuṇḍeti yo maṃtraḥ kāpālini padottaraḥ ।
tastho ye uddharedvidyā samubījavivarjitam ।।
(175a)
mahocchuṣmapadasthena caṃḍādikulamādhikām ।
tārādidānaparyaṃtāṃ aśeṣa * padāyikām ।।

āmardakatathā hyagni piṃgalākṣastataḥ punaḥ ।
mahākālī ca {kālī ca} tathānyā bhūtamātarāḥ ।।

śmaśānapatayaḥ sarvā siddhavidyānayā śubhe ।
adhunā saṃpravakṣyāmi sāmānyaṃ tava suvrate ।।

hṛdbījānāṃ samullāpā kulakkrameva yā sthitāḥ ।
nāyakādyastu karttavyā aṃte kiṃkarabījitaḥ ।।

mātrīṇāṃ maṃtrabhedena maṃtrāḥ sarvārthasādhakāḥ ।
anyathā kulamaṃtrāṇāṃ pavitrapadabhūṣitaḥ ।।

ante hṛdbījadīptastu karttavyo nāmabheditaḥ ।
tritattvabhedito nāntaryadbījeśastu dīpitaḥ ।।

anantamadhyagottasthaḥ pāvakī vāhanaḥ prabhuḥ ।
nāyakaḥ sarvaśaktīnāṃ yoginīnāṃ mahodaraḥ ।।

tapanī tāpanaḥ śabda nādavau biṃdubhūṣitaḥ ।
avyaktanāsikā caiva vilomāmi svarūpataḥ ।।

rūpaprajvalitaṃ (da)tvā kalāhastau tataḥ kramān ।
dhūmāyo parisaṃcchanto nāsikā raṃjikānvitāḥ ।।

kiṃkarī bījametaddhi mahāntaḥ siddhidamparam ।

calahṛdayadyo praṇavo vidyānte tau vīpadadīptanāpikā padādi vīraṃ kulamaṃtrāṇāṃ samullāpa iti ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
yoginīcakkre sāmānyahṛdayoddhāranāma ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

uktaṃ deva tvayā taṃtraṃ yogadhyānaparāyaṇam ।
(175b)
niyamācārasaṃbaddhaṃ dussādhyaṃ sarvadehinām ।।

alpasārastrayo devā niyamavratavarjitāḥ ।
dhyānacintā paribhraṣṭā dūrddharo hyalpamedhasā ।।

gaṇamaṃtravihīnāśca parāyantā sadāstu tāḥ ।
tāsāmeva hitārthāya prasādaṃ va(ktu)marhasi ।।

sthūlasūṣmavibhāgena tvayā pūrvamudāhṛtam ।
sarvasattvahitārthāya dvividhaṃ maṃtrasādhanam ।।

taṃtramaṃtrātmakaṃ sthūlaṃ * * * sūṣmakaṃ vibhoḥ ।
calaṃ cintāḥ kathaṃ deva hṛdaye tatpratiṣṭhitam ।।

maṃtramārgopi deveśo upaspṛṣṭo vināyakaiḥ ।
nānāprakāraiḥ krūraiśca yogamārgo ci - karaḥ ।।

kriyāṃśakakalākīrṇā devatātithiyojanaiḥ ।
vijñānānukathaṃ tāsāṃ ārūḍhaṃ kalpacetasām ।।

ye maṃtrā smṛtimātreṇa sarvakarmapravarttakaḥ ।
guhyācārapravṛttānāṃ te maṃtrāḥ kathaya prabhoḥ ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

vidyālayasya devasya vidyācakkraṃ varānane ।
siddhamaṃtrapadopetaṃ tvatprītyā kathayāmi te ।।

devatācāraceṣṭānāṃ samayānāṃ viḍaṃbakāḥ ।
na prakāśyamidaṃ devi teṣāṃ maṃtramanāgapi ।।

siddhitā nirgurukṣipraṃ teṣāṃ taṃtra prakāśitam ।
gṛhe kṣetre śarīre ca teṣāmeva hi śakti yaḥ ।।

aparījya prayatnena jñātvā janmāsikāśakaḥ ।
yadā lakṣaṇasaṃyuktastadā jñānaṃ prakāśayet ।।

putrasyāpi na dātavyaṃ uktadoṣaguṇesya tu ।
śuśruṣave praśāntāya gurubhaktāya bhārave ।।
(176a)
anyathā naiva dātavyaṃ yadi prāṇāṃ parityajet ।
guhyacakrasya karmāṇi maṃtrotpatti niyojanam ।।

kathayāmi śucirbhūtvā śṛṇuṣvekamanādhunā ।
likhet pūrvoditaṃ cakraṃ siddhamaṃtrā samuddharet ।।

rasotāpi na saṃtapto havyavāhānvitā kalā ।
prathamaṃ padaṃ dvitīyaṃ tu tadaivā dhūmrayā yutam ।।

ante te kāradīptāya kalayā sarvasiddhidam ।
śabdaḥ kalābhirūḍhastu sparśāntā tu ca nāsikā ।।

punaḥ śābdastvacāṃ te ca havyavāhā vibhūṣitaḥ ।
tṛtīyaṃ tu padaṃ hyetadrūpasya parivarttanam ।।

avyaktaṃ pāvakī bhinnaṃ vyomavyomakalānvitam ।
dhūmrārcitanataḥ kāla kalopi hi tathaiva ca ।।

ante havyavahāsante avyaktaṃ sarvasiddhidam ।
caturthaṃ tu padaṃ guhyaṃ sāraṃgajanapūjitam ।।

paṃcame tu pade devi bhairavastu (svayaṃ) sthitaḥ ।
snehadaḥ sarvaśaktīnāṃ amṛtākarṣaṇe hitaḥ ।।

dhṛtistapani santānāṃ dhūmrā bhinnā puraśca sā ।
karo dhūmrāpamānastu sadāntaṃ saptamī sthitaḥ ।।

jaṃtūnāṃ rakṣaṇe yojyaṃ karṣitānāṃ ca tarpaṇe ।
bhedane sarvaduṣṭānāṃ amṛtākarṣaṇe hitam ।।

anena smaryamānena rakṣarākṣasaguhyakāḥ ।
vighnāśca vividhākārā yāṃti nāśaṃ diśo daśaḥ ।।

vācādho pāvakīyuktā anaṃtā kāmamasragāḥ ।
sparśaśca kalayāyuktastapanī pādabhūṣitaḥ ।।

sphoṭastataḥ svarūpasthattvacānta anivāhayoḥ ।
(176b)
aṣṭamaṃ padamuddiṣṭaṃ sadā ciṃtāmaṇipradam ।।

māraṇaṃ staṃbhanaṃ caiva nityaṃ saṃkrāmanaṃ hitam ।
ādau mu(drā)ni deveśi chiḥkārāṃtāni suvrate ।।

padāni sarvaśaktīnāmamoghāni samuddharet ।
navamī sadāśivasyāṃ tu dvyantirantā ṣaḍakṣarāḥ ।।

viśeṣahṛdayaṃ devi pūrvameva mayoditam ।
anayā sarvakarmāṇi {sādhyā}sādhyāni kārayet ।।

smaraṇādeva siddhyaṃti vidhidṛṣṭasya maṃtriṇaḥ ।
evametāḥ samutpannāḥ śaktayo guhyasaṃmatāḥ ।।

maṃtrapramāṇaṃ vakṣyāmi vidhiyogaṃ tatacchṛṇu ।
prathamātryakṣarāśaktirdevi pūrvadalasthitāḥ ।।

caturakṣarā dvitīyā tu āgneyaṃ daśasaṃsthitā ।
ṣaḍakṣarā tathā cānyā yāmyapatrasamāśritā ।।

caturthīpyevamevaṃ syā - ṛte tu dale sthitāḥ ।
(dvya)kṣarā caiva vāruṇyāṃ tryakṣarā caiva vāyave ।।

caturakṣarā tu saumyā yāṃ paṃca iśānadigdale ।
madhye ṣaḍakṣaro maṃtraḥ pūrvameva mayāvṛtaḥ ।।

prathamā karṣayedraktaṃ dvitīyā snehameva tu ।
tṛtīyā tu mahāśaktirajogre śamane hitāḥ ।।

caturthī majjahā proktā paṃcamī snehadā smṛtāḥ ।
staṃbhanī sarvajaṃtūnāṃ ṣaṣṭhī caiva mahātape ।।

saptamī tu mahāśakti nityamāpyāyane hitāḥ ।
rūpasya parivarttantu aṣṭamī kurute priye ।।

- kaścaiva prakurute sarvakarmāṇi suvrate ।
tathāpi te mayā khyātaṃ niyogamatidurlabham ।।

moṅkāraka - ṇe kuryāt paṃcānāmatitatkṣaṇāt ।
(177a)
dvitīyaṃ mudraṇāyojya trāsane bhedane tathā ।।

mohane mudraṇe caiva paśugrāhaṇamokṣaṇe ।
tṛtīyastveṣa deveśa sarvakarmakaraḥ prabhuḥ ।।

śoṣaṇe ca samudrāṇāṃ nadīnāṃ staṃbhanaṃ tathā ।
grahaṇe sarvasattvānāṃ vācayā manasā tathā ।।

karotyeṣa maheśāni yatheṣṭakarmasādhake ।
prayojye japahomābhyāṃ manasāṃ ca mahāprabho ।।

rūpādi parivartte ca caturthaṃ saṃprayojayet ।
paṃcamaṃ mokṣakāmāstu ṣaṣṭhaḥ krūreṣu karmasu ।।

vaicitrya karaṇe mohe phalānāṃ caiva pātane ।
dahane śoṣaṇe caiva karmaścaiteṣu yojayet ।।

evaṃ deśa niyogastu diṅmātryaḥ kathito mayā ।
upariṣṭā tu vakṣyāmi prayogaṃ yogapūrvakam ।। ।।

prathamaṃ cakkranyāsaḥ ।। ।।

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi dvitīyamatidurlabham ।
cakkraṃ siddhapadairyuktāṃ śaktibhiśca varānane ।।

uddhāraṃ tava vakṣyāmi maṃtrāṇāṃ mamitaujasām ।
yeṣāṃ smaraṇamātreṇa kaṃpate kāśyapījanaḥ ।।

paṃcāśaṃ paṃcaviśaṃ ca saptaviṃśopari sthitam ।
ṣaḍviṃśakamadhastā tu pāvakyā sahitaṃ bhavet ।।

ūrddhanādakṛtāṭṭopaṃ biṃduśekharabhūṣitam ।
bhairavaḥ kathito hyeṣa asya cakkrasya nāyakaḥ ।।

anena sahitā hyetā śaktayaścakkrasaṃsthitāḥ ।
sarvakarmāṇi kurvaṃti amoghānyapi suvrate ।।

uddhāraṃ sarvaśaktīnāṃ tava devi vadāmyahaṃ ।
vīreśasahitānāṃ tu krameṇa śṛṇu suvrate ।।

tamopahā parikṣipta āpaḥ krūra padāntagaḥ ।
(177b)
madhye bhairava saṃdīpto vīreśo gaṇanāyakaḥ ।।

ādau saṃsthāpayeddevi havyavāhānvitā dhṛtiḥ ।
sadhūmrā nāsikāmadhye bhairavena vibhūṣitāḥ ।।

prathamā śaktiruddiṣṭā aĩdrī pūrvagaṇodbhavāḥ ।
cakṣuḥ kalānvitaṃ devi praṇavena vibhūṣitam ।।

vārāhī śaktimuddiṣṭā pūrvaśaktyāṃta dīpitā ।
tejo (vyo)masamāyukto tejavāhānvitā tvacā ।।

pūrvavasthāpayeccheṣa śaktirmāheśvarī smṛtā ।
tāpanī raṃjikā vācā sabiṃduṃ pariśo guruḥ ।।

vahnivāhātmako devi haṃso vai raṃjikānvibhuḥ ।
vaiṣṇavī śaktiruddiṣṭā saumyaṃ diśi samāśritāḥ ।।

matiḥ prajvalitā dīptā adhasthā kalayānvitāḥ ।
puruṣadhūmrapāṇyasto mātrirodanabhūṣitaḥ ।।

bhairave nāvavijñeyā kaumārī agnije dale ।
māyā kalānvitā devi śivatattvasamanvitāḥ ।।

biṃdunā parisaṃcchannā huṃphaḍa(nta) nirodhitāḥ ।
brahmāṇī śaktiruddiṣṭā vāyavī diśi māśritāḥ ।।

iśānagaṇapatirdevi karttavyaṃ śaktināyakaḥ ।
ikārabheditaḥ śabdo biṃdunādavibheditaḥ ।।

nāsārūpoktanā devi rūpaṃ prajvalitaṃ priye ।
kalāhastau samūsrā tu savisargaśvaṣaṭpaṭaḥ ।।

bhairavī śaktirudiṣṭā naiṛtī diśimāśritāḥ ।
mitraiḥ samunnatiṃ nīto bhūtavargo varānane ।।

sabiṃduḥ pāvakīyuktaścatuṣkamidamuttamam ।
dūtīnāṃ saptamo vargo vijñeyo biṃdubhūṣitaḥ ।।
(178a)
kavargo bhūtavargastu sūkṣmīnīvadvitīyake ।
idriyāṇi tṛtīye tu caturṇyeṃdriyagocarāt ।।

manohaṃkārabuddhiśca avyaktaḥ puruṣastathā ।
paṃcame paṃcatattvāni kathitāni varānane ।।

evaṃ śaktigaṇo devi dvitīyaṃ cakkramāśritaḥ ।
eteṣāṃ viniyogaṃ tu pravakṣyāmi yathākramam ।।

vividhāni ca karmmāṇi śaktīnāṃ varavarṇini ।
jayādyāni prasiddhyaṃti sādhakānāṃ phalaiṣiṇām ।।

kṛtvā yathocitaṃ yogaṃ japatosya mahābalāḥ ।
aiṃdrī ca kurute puṣṭi ārogyaṃ balamuttamam ।।

saṃgrāmeṣvatha rājitvāṃ sainyastaṃbhanameva ca ।
ākāśagamanaṃ caiva rūpasya parivarttanam ।।

kaumārī japamānasya {bha}vettejo hi varddhanam ।
mahājavo mahāvīryo mahābalaparākramaḥ ।।

avadhyaścāpravadhyaśca aprameya balastathā ।
parasainyavimardī ca surānyapi hi pātayet ।।

vārāhī japamānyasya icchāsiddhiḥ prajāyate ।
vācayā mārayitpāśu jīvāpayati vācayā ।।

vācayā karṣayedvṛkṣān vācayā staṃbhayet paśum ।
majjape vāsthisaṃghātaṃ manasā karṣayedvratam ।।

bhairavī japamānastu sarvakarmāṇyavāpnuyāt ।
āruhya śakaṭaṃ vṛkṣaṃ patreṣṭaṃ tatra gacchati ।।

ājojanaśataṃ gatvā punarāgacchate drutam ।
adṛśya sarvabhūtānāṃ abadhyo daityadānavām ।।

japyamānaḥ prakurute brahmāṇī vākyavarttanam ।
(178b)
janaye yogasiddhiṃ ca iśvaryāṣṭaguṇāṃ priyen ।।

vaiṣṇavī kurute karma manasā yassamīhitam ।
māheṃdrajālakuhakāṃ sainyānāṃ staṃbhanāni ca ।।

śatrūṇāṃ nidhanaṃ caiva raktākarṣaṇameva ca ।
antarddhānaṃ prakurute rūpasya parivarttanam ।।

maheśvarī mahāśaktirjapyamānāpi līlayā ।
trailokyaṃ vaśamānīte athavā nāśayeddraṇān ।।

pātayet parvatavarā{n} staṃbhayet sāgarāṇyapi ।
utpatya ca svayaṃ gaccheyadaṣṭaṃ tatra sādhakaḥ ।।

pātayeta mahāvṛṣṭiṃ patantī ca nivārayet ।
kurute ca mahācārapravṛttaṃ ca niruṃdhati ।।

sarveṣāṃ caiva karmāṇi bhairavaṃ kurute svayam ।
navakaṃ ca mahābhāge vidhidṛṣṭaṃ na karmaṇā ।।

dvitīyaṃ kathitaṃ cakkraṃ tṛtīyaṃ śṛṇu sāṃpratam ।
māyārūḍho raso madhye gaṃdho te jvālinī putaḥ ।।

vācādiprathamaṃ devi dvitīyaṃ karālī padam ।
prathamāśaktiruddiṣṭā devicakkre tṛtīyake ।।

anaṃtajvālinī yuktaṃ kalā māyāntadīpitāḥ ।
bhairavādyastu deveśi dvitīyā yoginī smṛtāḥ ।।

kalā saptamasaṃpannā suvyaktopasthabhūṣitāḥ ।
vaktre niyati saṃyuktā tṛtīyā śaktiruttamāḥ ।।

āpaḥ papādau deveśiḥ śatadhāmā vibhūṣitāḥ ।
madhyenāntasadhūmrastu tadanaṃte sparśastathā ।।

caturthī śaktiruddiṣṭā amoghā bhīmavikramāḥ ।
paṃcamī sarvadeveśi sarvabhūtasukhapradāḥ ।।
(179a)
havyavāhā samāyuktā ugreśa padadāyikāḥ ।
ādo resastu saṃsthāpya tāpanī saṃpradīpitāḥ ।।

buddhiḥ kalā(nvi)tā madhyestayātte tu vibhūṣitā ।
ṣaṣṭhāśaktiḥ samākhyātā ugrakarmaprasādhikāḥ ।।

niyatiḥ kālāntasaṃsthā(pya) rajasastu samanvitāḥ ।
rajikā raṃjitaṃ caiva ṣaṭpadantu varānane ।।

saptamī śaktiruddiṣṭā antarddhānapradāyikāḥ ।
ādau śabdakalārūḍho vidyā caiva svarūpataḥ ।।

hũphaḍantasthito madhye vāgbhaktastu sadāśivaḥ ।
saptamasvarasaṃbhinnaṃ aṣṭamī ta(tpra)kīrttitāḥ ।।

navamī vijñāya deveśi madhye cakkrasya nāyikā ।
ādyaṃtāḥ praṇavādyāstu sarvamaṃtrā samuddhare{t} ।।

asya cakkrasya śaktīnāṃ niyogaṃ śṛṇu sāṃpratam ।
viccā nāmena yā devī sā vai ākarṣaṇe hitāḥ ।।

madyamāṃsaṃ tathā raktaṃ striyā yā puruṣopi vā ।
sarvamākarṣayettūrṇaṃ sarvakarmapravarttikā ।।

mudrāṇāṃ mudraṇe caiva mohane staṃbhane tathā ।
hrabījena samāyuktā sarvakarmakarī smṛtā ।।

yathāyāme(na) yā devī kāmāri ta(nu)varttinī ।
raktāktāṃ rocanāṃ guhyāṃ śilayā vyatimiśritām ।।

samālabhya tatonmātaṃ āpādatalamastakam ।
adṛśyo bhavate devi sarvadvaṃdvavivarjitaḥ ।।

agniśastrajalavyālacaurarājakulādiṣu ।
na bhayaṃ jāyate tasya sarvavādeṣu cottaraḥ ।।

mārayā nāma yā devī vārāhī tanuvarttinī ।
sadhvā vārā tathā grāmā nagarādvā sudūrataḥ ।।
(179b)
svargapātālavārttā vā vijñāyāga(cchu)te śrutām ।
abhimaṃtrya tu puṣpāṇi nagaradvāre vinikṣipet ।।

śākinyāstatra yāḥ kaścit kiṃ kurvāṇā bhavaṃti tu ।
varadā nāma yā vidyā jalāgnistaṃbhane tu sā ।।

gominī gomayedrūpaṃ ākāśagamanaṃ tadā ।
rocanā śataśo japtvā śivaṃ dhyātvā dhrūvottare ।।

gacchate tilakaṃ kṛtvādākāśena tu tatkṣaṇāt ।
sarvabhūtā ca yā devī aĩdrī tu tanuvarttinīm ।।

śapastaṃbhe prayoktavyā mukhabaṃdhe ca nityadāḥ ।
durbhagānāṃ mayā devī vaiṣṇavī sā mahābalā ।।

raktamākarṣayettūrṇaṃ śivadhyānasamanvitāḥ ।
varadānāṃ mayādevī cāmuṃḍā sā mahābalāḥ ।।

mudritā karṣaṇaṃ kuryādrakṣitānāṃ yathaipsayā ।
sroṃkāraḥ karṣaṇā kuryāt paṃcānāmapi tatkṣaṇāt ।।

saṃkrāmaṇaṃ tathā yuryādreśyatvaṃ phalasiddhayaḥ ।
asya cakkrasya yā devī sarvakarmakarī tathā ।
amoghā kathitā bījā yoginī yogasiddhidā ।। ।।

tṛtīyaṃ cakkram ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
yoginīsaṃcāre tricakkroddhāraṃ nāma ।। ।।

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi maṃtrāṇāṃ siddhimaṃḍalam ।
yenāṣṭaguṇamaiśvaryaṃ prāpnuvaṃtīha sādhakāḥ ।।

gatvā pitṛvaṇoddeśaṃ kṣetrasya grahaṇaṃ kutaḥ ।
ādau saṃśodhayet pānaṃ prāṇāyāmaissamāhitaḥ ।।
(180a)
bhairavasya tu maṃtreṇa ṣaṭkoṇa na vā kena tu ।
bhairavaṃ svatanuṃ dhyātvā diśābaṃdhaṃ tu kārayet ।।

paṃcabhūtāstrajālena śaṃkāstreṇa tapodhane ।
krūrāṇāṃ bhairavāstreṇa nārīśahṛdayena vā ।।

mātrīṇāṃ hṛdaye naiva ādau saṃśodhayet karau ।
āvāmakaratarjanyā kaniṣṭhāntāni vinyaset ।।

dakṣiṇasevamevaṃ syā(tpaṃ)cānyaṣṭau pṛthakpṛthak ।
aĩdrādyā vinyasedvāme vāruṇyādyāni dakṣiṇe ।।

tenaiva kramayogena ṣaṭkamaṃguṣṭhayornyaset ।
parvāntareṣu deveśi śarīre kalpayet tataḥ ।।

paṃcaviṃśatitattvāni śarīre saṃniveśayet ।
pādayo vinyaset pūrvaṃ vṛṣṭhādyaṃ bhūtapaṃcakam ।।

paṃcasūkṣmāṇi jaṃghe dve ūrūbhyāmidriyāni tu ।
karmeṃdriyā * gṛhye tu śarīre tu tataḥ punaḥ ।।

manobuddhirahaṃkāro avyaktaḥ puruṣastathā ।
evaṃ vinyasya vidhivattataḥ śaktigaṇaṃ nyaset ।।

prathamā jānupādāntāḥ dvitīyā jānutaḥ kaṭī ।
tṛtīyā * guhyaśe tu caturthā nābhimaṃḍale ।।

vāmadakṣiṇapārśvena vāme dakṣiṇapāṇinā ।
paṃcamaṃ jānupādānte ṣaṣṭhaṃ caiva tatopari ।।

saptamaṃ nābhyataścorddha aṣṭamaṃ hṛdayaṃ nyaset ।
hṛccakkrakaṃrtu vāmena devi ṣaḍbījakaṃ nyaset ।।

tatorddhaṃ tu tadevasyānyāsoyaṃ yogasiddhidaḥ ।
bhairavākṣaraviṇḍaṃ tu śarīraṃ sakalaṃ tataḥ ।।

tatopari ṣaḍaṃgastu yathāsthāne niyojayet ।
evaṃ vinyasya bhūteśaṃ bhairavaṃ bījavigraham ।।
(180b)
tato mātrigaṇā devi vinyasen maṃḍalasthitam ।
tṛtīyaṃ nābhicakkre tu dvitīyaṃ hṛdayaṃ nyaset ।।

prasādaṃ prathamaṃ nyasya tato vaktrāṇi kalpayet ।
catuṣkale nānupūrve uttarāṃ tāṃ prakalpayet ।।

śākhāsu vinyasedūtyā tato vidyālayā nyaset ।
tārādicakkradeśe tu nyaset paṃcakalā sthitam ।।

tamopahā parikṣiptaṣaṭpadaścakkramadhyamāt ।
ai e au o vibhinnāstu vāruṇādyāstu yojayet ।।

evaṃ vinyasya vaktrāṇi dhyātvāmbāṃ bhairavīṃ tanum ।
ālikhet maṇḍalavaraṃ tato raudreṇa bhasmanā ।।

prathamaṃ sūtrayitvā tu śavamūrddhajarajjunā ।
trirekhaṃ ālikheddevi śuklaraktādivarṇakaiḥ ।।

ekahastaṃ caturdvāramadhye padmavibhūṣitam ।
aṣṭapatraṃ bhavetpadmaṃ karṇikālaṃkṛtaṃ śubham ।।

karṇikā tatra karttavyā ṣaḍbhiḥ patrairalaṃkṛtā ।
kṛtvaivaṃ maṃḍalavaraṃ tataḥ pūjāṃ prakalpayet ।।

tattvāni vinyaset pūrvaṃ ṣaṭpatreṣu tu sarvataḥ ।
pūrvoktena vibhāgena dakṣiṇāmnā suyogataḥ ।।

bhūtavargastu deveśi caturthaḥ svarabhedataḥ ।
vāyavyāgneyanairṛtyā iśānyāstāsu yojayet ।।

aiṃdrāgneyādipātreṣu nyasedbhūtādipaṃcakam ।
yāmyā nairṛtapātreṣu paṃcasūkṣmāṇi vinyaset ।।

pātre vāruṇavāyavya paṃcabuddhīṃdriyāṇi tu ।
uttare tu tathaiśāne nyaset karmedriyāṇi tu ।।

manobuddhirahaṃkāramavyaktaṃ puruṣaṃ tathā ।
(181a)
tattvapaṃcakamevedaṃ vinyaset karṇikopari ।।

aiśānāgneyanairṛtyavāyavyādi daleṣviha ।
vinyaseta tata svasminapuṃsakacatuṣṭayam ।।

apūrvvādi dale yojye sarvāstā paripādyataḥ ।
apūrvādi dalārabhyā kramādeyaṃ yathāsthitam ।।

nāḍībhūtaṃ nyaseddevi ddhau ddhau saṃpuṭasaṃsthitau ।
vinyasya pūjayanmaṃtrī pūrvacakkrayathāsthitam ।।

aĩdrādārabhyaktamaśo yāvadīśānadigdale ।
madhye ṣaḍakṣarāddevi tasya madhya tu bhairavam ।।

vinyasettatra medhānī pūrvamuktaṃ padakṣaram ।
sakalaṃ kārayetaṃtu vaktrāṃgairyogapīṭhagam ।।

yatrāṃte mātaro devi dvitīyā varaṇe nyaset ।
aĩdrī pūrvadare yojya vārāhī cāpi dakṣiṇe ।।

māheśī vāruṇe patrai uttare vaiṣṇavī tathā ।
āgneye caiva kaumārī bhairavī naiṛte dale ।।

brahmāṇī vāyavī caiva aiśāne nāyakaṃ nyaset ।
tatastṛtīyāvaraṇe vinyaset kālamātaraḥ ।।

tadyathā mārayeddevi naragopi yathākramam ।
pūrvādi naiṛtānte ca patraiṣu caturo nyaset ।।

praśastaṃ varade devi durbhage sukhasaṃbhave ।
vāruṇeśānadiṣpatre vilomāni padānyaset ।।

evaṃ cakkratrayaṃ nyasya tato bhūtapatiṃ nyaset ।
vidikṣu dikṣu deveśe nāmamaṃtre yathākramam ।।

naṃdiskaṃdo mahākālo bhṛṃgirīṭī haravyayaḥ ।
āmardakastathā hyagniḥ piṃgalākṣastataḥ punaḥ ।।

mahākālī ca vijñeyā aṣṭamaṃ bhūtamātarāt ।
(181b)
lokapālaśca idrādyāsteṣāṃ maṃtrāṇi cānyataḥ ।।

kṛtvevaṃ sakalaṃ nyāsaṃ tataḥ pūjāṃ prakalpayet ।
svamaṃtraireva kurvīta yajane sakalo vidhiḥ ।।

gaṃdhapuṣpaistathā dhūpairanumānaiḥ susaṃskṛtaiḥ ।
matsyairmāṃsaiśca vividhairmadhusīdhusurāsavaiḥ ।।

darśayedbhairavīmudrāṃ haṃkārakṛtalālikām ।
aṃguṣṭhena samākramya vāmahastā kaniṣṭhikam ।।

tisrastu prasṛtā kāryā mudreyaṃ yogapūjitam ।
anayā pūjayennityaṃ gaṃdhādyāścaiva dāpayet ।।

sarvāṇyeva hi karmāṇi anayaiva tu kārayet ।
sarvaṃ hi kuru deveśe raktapūrvasthasiddhayaḥ ।।

arghamācamanīyādi mahāśaṃkhena dāpayet ।
mātrālaṃkṛtadehastu śaktibhiḥ parivāritaḥ ।।

kārapītārcanī nityaṃ triṣaṣṭhivrataśodhitaḥ ।
evaṃ saṃpūjya vidhinā sādhayī ca tataśvanam ।।

ākarṣeta talāprājño mahāpaśusamudbhavam ।
gṛhya paṃcāmṛtaṃ devi kulācārakrameṇa tu ।।

caruṃ susaṃskṛtaṃ kṛtvā mahāsiddhipradāyakam ।
tatastu sādhayitvā tu devatā nāṃtivedayet ।।

yāgabhūmau yadirgatvā prakṣipe tu baliṃ tataḥ ।
lāmānāṃ cuṃbikānāṃ ca cūṣikā pūtanastathā ।।

mahāmṛtasamāyukto bhūtānāṃ ca yathākramam ।
prakṣipeta baliṃ vīro madyamāṃsa samanvitaṃ ।।

mahātaila mahāmāṃsairddhūpadīpau prakalpayet ।
sannidhānaṃ prakurvaṃti japato vā kaṭaṃ kaṭāḥ ।।

sampūjya vidhivat paścānmarghadatvā samāhitaḥ ।
uttarābhimukhaḥ sthitvā anujñāṃ prārthayettataḥ ।।
(182a)
tato jape svamaṃtraṃ tu kulajaṃ vā samāhitaḥ ।
nṛttagītaistathā vādyaiḥ hāsyaharṣaṇarodanaḥ ।।

japapūjāgnikāryeṇa dhyānena ca niśāṃ kṣipet ।
paścānnivedayetmānaṃ devasya ca hitā priye ।।

śaktiṃ - stu kavorūḍhai tadyaktai kalaputrakaiḥ ।
paścādvisarjayeddevi svadehe pūrakona tu ।।

āvāhanaṃ svadehāstu recakenaiva kārayet ।
ṣaṭkacakkratrayārūḍho dūtī sā yojyatāṃ gataḥ ।।

yo vīrevyo mahābhoge kramāmudrā vibhūṣitaḥ ।
yoginī siddhimāpnoti kālikābhyāṃ krameditaḥ ।
tasya yogedhikārosmi tasya caiva phalapradaḥ ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
yoginīsaṃcāre siddhayogaḥ paṃcamaḥ paṭalaḥ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

ye pūrvoktā tvayā deva bhedā saptakulodbhavāḥ ।
pūsanā cuṃbikā caiva mūṣikānāṃ tathāparāḥ ।।

lāmā ca śākinī caiva yoginī mātarāstathā ।
eteṣāṃ kramaśo bhedā lakṣaṇaṃ coditaṃ mama ।।

patiraṃ - rasaptānye janmāṃtaravicāriṇāḥ ।
nākhyātā tepi deveśa saṃjñāmātreṇa vā vinā ।।

rūpikāpiṃgalābhīmāparāvṛttā ca bālikā ।
ativṛttā ca hṛdvedhīkālikā siddhimāśritāḥ ।।

yogikī siddhi deveśastatra janma paśūdbhavā ।
kālikā kīdṛśī siddhiryayā siddhāstu tāḥ punaḥ ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।
(182b)
śṛṇu devi paraṃ guhyaṃ nākhyātaṃ kasyacinmayā ।
rahasya yogitaṃtrasya ṣa(ṭvi)dhaṃ siddhidāyakam ।।

aparīkṣitā śakavidheṃ kāśyapījanasammataḥ ।
dīkṣitasyābhiṣiktasya anujñātasya yo vidhiḥ ।
guruṃ saṃpūjya vidhivacchākinī vratamāśritam ।। ।।

tatsaṃpradāyasaṃpanno maṃtravido * * nyaset ।
dvividhastu smṛtobhyāso yogikaḥ kalakastathā ।।

yogikaḥ paṃcayogena kramāsiddhistu yogikāḥ ।
yogikaḥ paṃcagavyena caruṃ saṃskṛtya sādhayet ।।

jīvaṃ caruṃ tathānyāsātsiddhirbhavati nānyathā ।
śramaśca dvividhaḥ prokto śāstrikobhyāsiko tathā ।।

śāstriko vyayanaḥ prāyo bhyāsiko bhyāsate punaḥ ।
kālastu trividhaḥ prokto nityanaimittikāmikaḥ ।।

yogikī siddhimārūḍhāṃ nityayukto phalapradaḥ ।
kāmikīci tathā siddhiradhamāmadhyamottamā ।।

vaiśākha paurṇamāsyāyāṃ madhamā madhyamā priye ।
uttare tvayane proktā uttamā śṛṇu sāmpratam ।।

kārttikasya caturdaśyāṃ asiddhā yāstu suvrate ।
yāgakāle samākhyāto guṇottatarapūjitaḥ ।।

śabderddhistriścaturbhiśca siddhiratropajāyate ।
raktākarṣaṇasāmarthyamanyeṣāṃ vatsarottarām ।।

amṛtānāṃ tu deveśe paṃcānāmapya tu kramāt ।
ṣaṇmāsādvatsarādvāpi kṣudrasiddhiḥ prajāyate ।।

śabderdvādaśabhirdevi jīvaṃ carusamāśritam ।
abhiyuktobhikālikyā śākinī vratamāśritaḥ ।।
(183a)
saṃtyaktalobhasaṃdoha rāgadveṣavivarjitaḥ ।
kṣipramāpnoti deveśi siddhayo hyatu ṣaṃgikāḥ ।।

ādyaṃ jīva ca taḥ kā(śva)dyadikarma na sādhayet ।
pratibaṃdhātha vai guṇyādadyāṃrghanagare tataḥ ।।

tato yāstatra śākinya karmāṃstat sādhayaṃti tāḥ ।
vighnaṃ kathayaṃti sarvatra vaiguṇyaṃ vyāharaṃti ca ।।

saṃpradāyaprayacchaṃti gurubhaktasya nityaśaḥ ।
anyathā samayabhraṃśastāsāṃ samupajāyate ।।

dvādaśābdā na sidhyaṃti maṃtrakarmaṃ ca suvrate ।
saṃśayaṃ pratimuktasya gurupādopasevanāḥ ।।

maṃtrāḥ siddhyaṃti deveśi karmaṃ cātra pravarttate ।
avrataḥ śaucahīnopi gurupādopasevanaḥ ।।

śivabhaktaśca satataṃ samayānāṃ ca pālakaḥ ।
saṃsādhya karmāṇyetāni mahācarumavāpnuyāt ।।

evaṃ hi kālikī siddhi tathā khyātā mayā naghe ।
yoginī vāpi deveśi kimanyaṃ kathayāmi te ।।

etadguhyaṃ paraṃ devi yo (go)panīyaṃ prayatnataḥ ।
na kasyacidihākhyātaṃ dṛṣṭadoṣaviśeṣataḥ ।।

gurubhaktāya * śāntādeyaṃ samyakparīkṣite ।
sādhakenāpi deveśi gopanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ ।
pravarttate siddhirevaṃ anyathā prāṇasaṃśayaḥ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

kulajā siddhi deveśa raktākarṣaparāsmṛtāḥ ।
ugreśa gamanaprāya yogikī jñānadāyikā ।।

itarāṇi tu karmāṇi kiṃ kalaṣṭā bhavanti tu ।
mahātvārotvaṃ rūpasya tathā nānāprakāratā ।।

staṃbhanaṃ mohanaṃ caiva māraṇaṃ śoṣaṇaṃ tathā ।
agniśastrajalastambhaṃ paṃcāsvataniṣevanam ।।
(183b)
kālasya ca parijñānaṃ paradehāpraveśanam ।
saṃśayo me samutpannaṃ kataraṃ siddhimāśritaḥ ।
prayogā deveśa tato siddhikaraṃ * * prabhoḥ ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

jñānaṃ kriyā tathā dhyānaṃ skaṃdhatrayamudāhṛt ।
bhairave tu bahuskaṃdhe trayaskaṃdhā sunirmalāḥ ।।

sṛṣṭiṃ maṃtrātmikā cādyā yoginīnāṃ tu lakṣaṇam ।
samayācāraceṣṭānāṃ kramaśaḥ paripālanam ।।

jñānaskaṃdheti vijñeyaṃ praśmodayaparigrahaḥ ।
kriyāṣkaṃdheti śaktīnāṃ prayogaṃ vividhāśayāḥ ।।

rakṣāvikalpanaṃ yāge śaktyārghyārcanavistaraḥ ।
dhyāne tu nāḍibījānāṃ saṃyogajñānapūrvakaḥ ।।

jyoti dhyānā vikalpāśca vidhirāsanajāstathā ।
tribhiskāṃdhai parārthaistu ete devirudāhṛtam ।।

etāṃ vijñāya deveśi kṣiprasiddhimavāpnuyāt ।
trayaskaṃdhaṃ pravakṣyāmi nānārūpaṃ mahodayam ।।

amṛtākarṣamātreṇa sarvakarmaphalaṃ bhavet ।
yasmātra karmaṇo siddhiraktākarṣaṇapūrvikāḥ ।।

tarpaṇaṃ devatānāṃ ca tasya karmaprasiddhaye ।
ato devi pravakṣyāmi prayogamamṛtasya ca ।।

pūrvaṃ vinyasya deveśi sakalaṃ bhairavaṃ tanum ।
ugracakratrayopetaṃ sarvakarmapradāyakam ।।

paśumālabhya yatnena tataḥ karmasamārabhet ।
abhimaṃtrya triṇaikāṣṭhaṃ loṣṭhakaṃ pāṇireva ca ।।

navabhirmmaṃtrapadaiḥ samyak pṛṣṭhatvāladhva ucyate ।
tataḥ kuta mahābhāge nādyādāpasamāśrayat ।।

karmāṇi guhyaśaktīnāṃ guhyāni vividhāni ca ।
(184a)
nāḍīcakrasya udayaṃ sūryacakrodayānugam ।।

ghaṭikādvayaṃ bhavetsārddhaṃ udayaṃ nāḍiṣu kramāt ।
ghaṭikāṃ prāṇatāni syu{ḥ} trīṇi ṣaṣṭhyantarāṇi tu ।।

kālacakraṃ tu taṃ jñeyaṃ durlabhaṃ vāmakarmaṇām ।
cittayetpatramadhye tu yāgavacca kuśeṣayet ।।

tatra padmasya madhye tu vinyaset paṃcaviṃśakam ।
manobuddhirahaṃkāramadhastā tasya vinyaset ।।

upariṣṭādbhairavaṃ devaṃ sāṃgaṃ taścoparinyathet ।
pūrvādi kramayogena dalānyaṣṭau prakalpayet ।।

tattvanāḍivibhinnāni pūrvoktakramayogataḥ ।
avyaktaṃ pṛthivī āpa pūrvamaṃtre tu vinyaset ।।

tasya madhye nyase devi huṃkārāntā tu saṃsthitam ।
bhairavena viruddhānnāṃ jāṃnanāṃ paridīpitā ।।

adhastā pṛṣṭhayuktena biṃdunā sahitena tu ।
staṃbhayet kuṃbhayitvā tu diśibaṃdhaṃ tataḥ kuru ।।

dvitīyepyevamevaṃ syācchvāsaṃ kṛtvā vidhānataḥ ।
ghaṭṭaye prathamaṃ pātraṃ tataḥ karmasamārabhet ।।

sādhya hi purato dhyātvā vidyā mūrddhani sādhakaḥ ।
phaṭkāre guṇivasthena soṅkaraṃ yojayettataḥ ।।

asitaṃ chidrarūpaṃ tu karṣayante mivāmṛtam ।
soṅkāraṃ karṣayedraktapūrakena samīritaḥ ।।

viciṃtya vacanaṃ pātraṃ vāyūbhūto mahābalaḥ ।
ānaye śvāsayogena ūrddhanāḍiṣu yojitam ।।

āpūrya vadanaṃ deva tataḥ pātraṃ nirīkṣayet ।
anenaiva vidhānena paṃcānāmapi tatkṣaṇān ।।

svanāḍīkarmayogena kuryādākarṣaṇe budhaḥ ।
aṃbhaye pātayedvātha mudrāyā pīḍitaṃ * nut ।।
(184b)

aṃguṣṭhena samākramya vāmahastasya madhyagām ।
śeṣābhistu tathāṃguścaṃ mudreyaṃ pīḍane hitāḥ ।।

anayāt pīḍayet sarvaṃ māraye vāruṣānvitaḥ ।
kuṃbhakaṃ tu samādhāya mūrddhnā vihvalavetasam ।।

karoti sādhyaṃ deveśi rudhiraṃ vāpi vāmayet ।
muhuntā vāṇayogena āśvāsayati tāṃ punaḥ ।।

āvyāpane tvaṣṭa mātrā prasādenopari kṣipet ।
yojayestu prasannartta amṛtasyaṃdinīparāḥ ।।

evaṃ viditvā deveśi icchayā karmasādhayet ।
asyeva śaktyā karmāṇi yanmaṃtraṃ śṛṇu sūvrate ।।

sādhyasya nāmaraktena likhedrocanayā saha ।
karamadhyahastaśākhā nyasedevyā sabhairavān ।।

sarvaśaktyābhinārabhya sthāpayet karasaṃpuṭe ।
jāpena cātmakaṃ cakkraṃ śatamaṣṭottare tataḥ ।।

saṃbaṃdhaṃ nidhanaṃ yāti karmaṇānena tatkṣaṇāt ।
śakto śāṃti vimuktena dagdhena mriyate dhruvam ।।

jāṃtastu seṃdrayuktātmā kakārāntaṃ yadā bhavet ।
tadā karmāṇi siddhāṃti anuktānyapi maṃtriṇām ।।

dvitīyāyāṃ pravakṣyāmi karmadevi tavānaghe ।
tejavāyustathākāśaṃ āgneye digdale nyaset ।।

dvitīyāyāṃ jānumadhyasthāṃ saptamena prabodhitām ।
dvāviṃśenāhatā mūrddhni nāḍīmadhye vyavasthitā ।।

kupyamākarṣaye tūrṇaṃ svabījena prabodhiti ।
paśūnāṃ sarvayogena maṃtrajāpasamanvitā ।।

ādāya khādiraṃ kīlaṃ pramāṇe dvādaśāṃgulam ।
abhimaṃtrya svamaṃtreṇa tena khātaṃ tu khātayet ।।

mahiṣīmūtraṃ tu saṃgṛhya tasyai vā loḍitaṃ kṣipet ।
(185a)
manasā nāma sādhyasya śatamuccārya buddhimām ।।

tatastu sa paśocchāyāṃ tatrasthāṃ paśyate dhruvam ।
tocchāyāṃ tīkṣṇaśastreṇa cchidyādvidyāṃ japaṃ niśi ।।

tataḥ patatyasau sādhyo yatra paravyavasthitaḥ ।
raktaṃ caṃda * cūrṇena svaraktāktena sādhakaḥ ।।

kārayet pratimāṃ bhūrje sādhyanāmāṃkitaṃ budhaḥ ।
dvitīyamaṃtre śaktiṃ tu likhetvakṣaravigraham ।।

gavāṃ rocanayā tatra tasyopari vikaṃpayet ।
vinyasya khāte prajvālya pāvakaṃ khādiraṃ dhamān ।।

dahyate muhyate sādhya prāṇereva viyujyate ।
sā ca ye kṣīramiśreṇa vāriṇā śāṃtikarmaṇi ।।

tṛtīyā śaktikarmāṇi śṛṇu kīrttayate mama ।
prāṇaṃ rasavahā caiva cakṣuścaiva krameṇa tu ।।

vinyasedyāmyapatre tu ukāropari saṃsthitam ।
soṅkārādyaṃtasaṃruddhā kakārātujabodhitām ।।

āhatā saptamātrena tena caiva prapūritam ।
paṃcaviṃśakabhūtasthāṃ devatā tatra vinyaset ।।

pūrvanāḍiprayogena tvacāmākarṣaye kṣaṇāt ।
śoṣayetpīḍanatte tu sphuṭitāyāṃ viraśyati ।।

rocanā sa citābhasmaraktāṃ ktāṃ saptasaṃskṛtām ।
kṛtvā lalāṭe tilakaṃ hṛttābhau galake tathā ।।

bhujapā(śvau) tathā ūrvorjānunī gulphasaṃdhiṣu ।
śarīre bhairavaṃ nyasya nagaradevatāṃ nyaset ।।

evaṃ kṛtvā tatonmānaṃ nagarā bhuvi niṣkramet ।
paśyate devatāstatra dṛṣṭvā saṃbhāṣayanti ca ।।

siddhi cāsya prayacchaṃti kāśyapī samatā bhavet ।
caturthī śaktikarmāṇi amoghāṃ śṛṇu saṃpratam ।।
(185b)
śrotraṃ tvakcaiva pādau ca naiṛte digdale nyaset ।
nāḍī nyastvā tataḥ ṣaṣṭhaṃ caturthī devatāṃ nyaset ।।

pūrvamuktena cāṃtena phaṭkārāṃtayutena tu ।
niru(vyā)nāḍivaktrāṇi tenaivodghāṭya pūrayet ।।

janayedviṣūcikāśūlaṃ mūkāṃdhaḥ pathitena tu ।
kṛtvā hastau viparyastau [viparyastau] nāḍī bījaistu dūlanam ।।

devatāmapi * * * * * * * * * hastau ।
pāyurupasthaṃ ca vāruṇaṃ * * digdale nyaset ।।

paṃcamī devatā tatra aikārāsanasaṃsthitā ।
pūrayedbhyantabījena prāṇamākṛṣya yogavit ।।

recayitvā tatotmānaṃ hakāraṃ pūrayenmukhe ।
smaraṇā pūrvamaṃtrasya raktākarṣaṇakaṃ param ।।

anulomairvimucye tataḥ sādhyā śūlamāhavet ।
ālikhya nāma maṃtreṇa śaktibhistu tadā labhet ।।

pravāhayenmahānadyā uccāṭanavidhiḥ paraḥ ।
vāgīṃdri paragaṃdhaṃ ca rasaṃ sūkṣmāṇi vinyaset ।।

vāyavye nāḍimārge tu kalaraudrī tu vinyaset ।
ṣaṣṭhī tu devatāṃ tatra phaṭkārādyantarodhitām ।।

kuṃbhena kuṃbhayitvā tu vāpunā recayet punaḥ ।
adṛśya kurute sarvaṃ japantaḥ sādhakottamaḥ ।।

jāntastu kālayuktātmā prakṣivyākarṣayet punaḥ ।
hṛdiśūlaṃ bhavettasya jīvitaṃ te karammahat ।।

ālabhya vṛkṣaśakaṭaṃ āruhe tatra sādhakaḥ ।
nyasya pūrvoditaṃ cakkraṃ śaktibhiḥ parivāritam ।।

japet ṣaḍakṣaraṃ devaṃ tataścotpatate dhruvam ।
sthānaṃ caivapsitaṃ gatvā kṣaṇādāgacchate punaḥ ।।
(186a)
vāyaveti ca yā vidyā sā sontādi pradīpitāḥ ।
ālabheta tayātmānaṃ yadi gaṃtusamīhite ।।

ānayitvā karṣayitvā trailokyaṃ sa carācaram ।
rūpasparśaśca śabdaśca sūkṣmaṇyottarato nyaset ।।

ekāraṃ tu tato datvā vinyaset saptamaṃ budhaḥ ।
pūrvanāḍīprayogena nāde nāḍyāṃtarodhitām ।।

recayet purayeddevimoṃkārādyantadīpitām ।
paṃcaiva cāmṛtāṃ kṣipraṃ sādhyasyākarṣayeddrūtam ।।

kubhakaṃ kuṃbhayitvā tu svamaṃtreṇa tu pūrayet ।
mūkaṃ vā kurute sādhyaṃ (ṣuṃ)stvaṃ vā vahate drutam ।।

manobuddhirahaṃkāramaṣṭame tu dale nyaset ।
ukārādyantasaṃruddhā aṣṭamī devatā nyaset ।।

nāḍīmughādya deveśi pūrayedvāyuvidyayā ।
sadyaṃ viśūcikā śūlaṃ sādhyasya kurute kṣaṇāt ।।

sarvānyeva hi karmāṇi ṣaṭpadaṃ kurute prabhuḥ ।
manobuddhirahaṃkāramavyakto paripūjitam ।।

cakkramadhye sthito deva sarvanāḍimukhojvalaḥ ।
yāṃ yāṃ nāḍiṃ samākramya prabuddhaścarate prabhuḥ ।।

tasya tasyā hi karmāṇi karoti prabhurīśvaraḥ ।
vinyase vajjayeddeva dharmādharmaviśuddhaye ।।

amoghadevi yatkarma guhyaṃ yoginipūjitam ।
yantakasya cidākhyātaṃ prītyā tatkathayāmi te ।।

dhyātvā hṛdi mahācakkraṃ karṇikādhinvitasitam ।
karṇikāyāṃ sthito iśa puruṣastadadhiṣitaḥ ।।

kalātattva tu tāṃ jñeyaṃ durlabhaṃ pāpakarmaṇām ।
caturviṃśati{ta}ttvādi daleṣu viniyojayet ।।
(186b)
kakārādi hakārāntervarṇairdevi yathākramam ।
navanāḍisahasrāṇi aiṃḍe patre tu suvrate ।।

tribhistribhiḥ sahasraistu cakkraṃ cakkraṃ prakalpayet ।
avyaktādi tathā kṛtvā cakkre cakkre tu nāḍikā ।।

śūnya bījānvito hyātyā yasmiṃ cakkre pravarttite ।
sā nāḍīṃ hṛdaye tasya sadā vai karmasādhikā ।।

triṣaṭkanavamaṃ bījaṃ calabījopari sthitam ।
nāḍyā tu kramayogena sarvakarmaprasādhakam ।।

atīta varttamāne ca bhaviṣye cakkramasthitām ।
yatra yatra vraje cātmā matacchaktisamīritaḥ ।।

tatra tatrodayaṃ vidyā chaktīnāṃ sarvakarmasu ।
atītaṃ vetti nābhistho varttamānahṛdi sthitaḥ ।।

netrāṃtasthitayogīśo sarvaṃ paśyati sarvataḥ ।
anena kramayogena caturviṃśatināḍayaḥ ।।

vināḍināḍibhedena sahasrodayasaṃsthitaḥ ।
dvāsaptatisahasrāṇi tāṃnyeva hi varānane ।।

tribhiḥ karmakarairbījaiḥ nāḍītraya samanvitaiḥ ।
yaiḥ karmaṇi prakurute yoginyo yogamārgagāḥ ।।

dvidaśaikādaśā yogo calabījena suvrate ।
ghaṭṭanāḍī mukhāṃ sarvāṃ udānapathavarttinaḥ ।।

vāyunāḍī śikhārūḍho iśe dhyātvā tapodhana ।
tatotpatati deveśi yatheṣṭaṃ tatra gacchati ।।

atītastho yadā maṃtrī bhaviṣye saṃsthitasvare ।
sarvanāḍi viruddhātmā tadā parapuraṃ vrajet ।।

bhaviṣyaṃ parapure yojya atītaṃ cātmani svaram ।
ekī karoti hi yadā icchā kāmī yadā bhavet ।।
(187a)
ṣaṣṭhiḥ prāṇakalā proktā ahorātraṃ taducyate ।
tatra vṛddhikṣaye vidyā devi sarvakṣayaṃ tataḥ ।।

udayo vṛddhimadhyāhnaṃ kṣayo vṛddhistataḥ kṣayaḥ ।
kṣayo vṛddhiḥ prakurvīta vṛddhau tu kṣayamāruhet ।।

kṣayo vṛddhau tu karmāṇi kuryāt sādhāraṇāni tuḥ ।
mitrādi ripu bhāvaṃ ca devi jñātvā parasparam ।।

parasparavirodhe ca kuryākarmmayathepsitam ।
armmaṇya kalāḥ kṣīṇa karmmaṇyo * * udasthitā ।।

sādhāraṇāśca deveśi sādhāraṇapadāśritā ।
kṣīṇāya yaugikaḥ kāryo jīvaṃ carusupuṣṭayoḥ ।।

sādhāraṇastu devaśi ākṛṣyākṛṣya tarpayet ।
evaṃ hi ubhayaṃ jñātvā nāḍīsaṃcārameva ca ।।

kuryā karmāṇi deveśa śaktibhiḥ siddhimārgagaiḥ ।
- - ro mudraṇe yojya nyāsāt kuṃbhakayogataḥ ।।

nāḍaye ca prayoktavya kuṃbhakenaiva saṃnidhā ।
unmudraṇe recakena vaicitrya karaṇe hṛdi ।।

vāyunā saṃprayoktavyastrāsane bhedane tathā ।
uccāraṇe viśeṣosya vijñeyo guruvaktrataḥ ।।

loṣṭakasthāpanaṃ tena tṛtīyā nāḍiyogataḥ ।
kīlanaṃ vedhanaṃ caiva sarvakarmāṇi kāraṇam ।।

uccāraṇaviśeṣeṇa karotyeṣa na saṃśayaḥ ।
iśopi kurute sarvaṃ jīvanāḍivibhāgaśaḥ ।।

vicitro padasaṃyukto manasā yatsamīhitam ।
caturthaḥ paṃcamasyādau prayuktaḥ ṣaṭpadādyutaḥ ।।

nivarttanaṃ tu rūpasya kurute manasepsitam ।
paṃcamasya prayoginyo recakena samīritaḥ ।।
(187b)
raṃjikāṃtaprayogena nayatyamṛtasaṃhitam ।
sarvakarmavimokṣaṃ tu kurutetra tathaiva saḥ ।।

ṣaṣṭhastutyā sayogena kurute sa mahārujām ।
phaṭkāmā yojitaścāṃte tāḍitaḥ kaṃkaṭena tu ।।

soṃkārayojitaścādau agnimārutarūpadhṛk ।
sarvaṃ hi kurute karmastapanādivivarjitaḥ ।।

evaṃ maṃtraprayogena maṃtratattvaṃ suniścitam ।
vijñāya guruvaktrā tu karmaṃ kuryā yathepsitam ।।

trailokya nāsti taddevi yathatena na siddhyati ।
guruprasādā dāveśi gururatra hi daivatam ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
yoginīsaṃcāre ṣaṣṭhaḥ paṭalaḥ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

yadā na prāpyate yogo gururvā na ca labhyate ।
kulakramo vā vicchinna pramādādeva yogavām ।।

tadā kathaṃ prasiddhyaṃti deveśa khamanotsukāḥ ।
kathaṃ vā deva jānaṃti mṛtyukālamupasthitam ।।

ariṣṭāni ca deveśa apamṛtyuvaśasthitām ।
kati vā devadeveśa paśavaḥ siddhadā smṛtā ।।

ke vā siddhivipātāya ke vā gukhamanapradāḥ ।
kiyaṃte dhyānayogena paśu gṛhnanti mātarāḥ ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

yadā na prāpyate yogo nā tu grahamano guruḥ ।
saptānāṃ cātra bhedānāṃ kālīśena mahātmanā ।।
(188a)
maṃtro yo vihato devi pūrvoktānāṃ svasiddhidaḥ ।
nokte ca lakṣaṇaṃ teṣāṃ bhedānāṃ tacchṛṇuṣvatha ।।

kulajā pūtanā jñeyā najñā vai cuṃbi{kā} smṛtāḥ ।
mūṣikā tripadārūḍhā lāmāṣṭasamayāvṛtā ।।

śākinyāḥ kālacakkrasthā kālamadhyamacakkragāḥ ।
prāptāṣṭaguṇamaiśvarya yoginyo devi pūjitāḥ ।।

svacchandamaṃda gāminyo sṛṣṭisaṃhārakārakaḥ ।
ajarā amarā bhīmā mātarā stāḥ prakīrttitāḥ ।।

etadgṛhnaṃti deveśi saptajanmasamudbhavam ।
viśiṣṭakulasaṃbhūtaṃ mānavaṃ tridiva cyutam ।।

maṃtriṇāṃ maṃḍalaiḥ ṣaḍbhiryogeśānāṃ śatena tu ।
saptajanmapaśurnaiva mucyate jīvitāṃtagaḥ ।।

hūyategnau yadā tasya lomanyapi hi kevalā ।
kulānāmapi saptānāṃ dadaṃte kāmikaṃ phalam ।।

yadā tu prāpyate raktaṃ vasāmāṃsaṃ ca meva vā ।
(sne)hotvacothamarjjā vā taḍākrīḍaṃti mātarāḥ ।।

{pa}ñcagavyasamāyuktaṃ devi tasya caruṃ yadi ।
prāpyate tatkimanyena maṃtrena vā punaḥ * * ।।

yaḥ spṛśettasya cāṃgāni devi saṃbhāṣayaṃti tam ।
tepyanenaiva dehena jñātvā siddhyati tatkṣaṇāt ।।

patitaḥ samasraṣṭo kāśyapījanavarjitaḥ ।
saptajanyapaśoḥ kāyaṃ spṛṣṭvā sopi prasiddhyati ।।

yatrāyaṃ priyate deśe bhasmī bhavati yatra tu ।
krīḍaṃte mātarāstatra māyārūpāstvanityaśaḥ ।।

nātaḥ parataraṃ pūtaṃ nātaḥ parataraṃ mahat ।
nātaḥ paratarā siddhi nātaḥ parataraṃ phalam ।।

nātaḥ parataraṃ kiṃcidevairapi sudurlabham ।
(188b)
samaṃtā tiṣṭhate nityaṃ hasato tiṣṭhatāvapi ।।

nityajāpī bhavetsohi mātribhimātrimodakaḥ ।
kulakṣetrapuliṃdreṣu jātujāmajane tathā ।।

- ḍahale koṃkaṇe caiva jāyaṃte karmayogataḥ ।
dūrasthāpi samīpastharekagrāmyekaveśmani ।।

kālaprāptena siddhyaṃti te bhayasteha varjitāḥ ।
pitā vā yadi vā bhrātā putro vā yadi vā suhṛt ।।

bālovṛddhastapasvī vā satyasiddhipradāyakaḥ ।
ekajanmodbhavo vāpi yadi prāpyena suvrate ।।

ugreśa manaso sopi svacchaṃdagatidāyakaḥ ।
kṣudrasiddhipradā yopi tepi vakṣyāmyatacchṛṇu ।।

strīnaroṣṭrastathālūka viḍāla śunakaḥ śivā ।
bhāsaḥ śukaśca vijñeyaḥ paśavoṣṭau prakīrttitāḥ ।।

sarvayogīśvarī siddhi mā{nu}śā{sṛ}ṇunādbhavetra ।
aśvasuksarvanāsthāpya ulūkādrākṣasaṃ padam ।।

viḍālā jālaśākinyo śanavī tu paśācanām ।
bhāsā ca kāmagāmitvaṃ śukāt sarveśvaraṃ padam ।
saptabhiḥ sāmasaṃsthau tu kṣudrasiddhipradāyikāḥ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

kathaṃ jñāyaṃti deveśa anyajanmasamudbhavaḥ ।
paśavaḥ kṣudrasiddhīnāṃ dāyakāśca kathaṃ vibhoḥ ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।

ekajanmāstarotthasya trijanmotthasya suvrate ।
lakṣaṇaṃ tava vakṣyāmi prakāśaṃ guhyameva ca ।।

sāmrayaḥ piśunaḥ krodha kṣīṇaste hī kṣaṇoddhataḥ ।
matsaro muktalajjāśca sabhayo śāṃtacetanaḥ ।।

veṣṭite yasya dṛśyaṃti lakṣaṇāni varānane ।
te parīkṣaṇamaṃtreṇa paśuṃ karmaprasiddhaye ।।
(189a)
trimātrārddhānta niṣpannaṃ paṃcalakṣaṇabhūṣitam ।
bījaṃ paśumivādyaśca devi nyastaṃ mukhodaraṃ ।।

jvalattadhyānamārgeṇa āveśayati tatkṣaṇāt ।
ekajanmabhavoddevi sapaśustat prakīrttitaḥ ।।

śakticakkrabhavo madhye vinyastaṃ ṣaṭpadāntagam ।
śikhāgre biṃdumīśānaṃ somuccāryakatāṃ nayet ।।

yastena glānimāpāti svatrijanmo varānane ।
ṣaḍaṃgabhairavārūḍhaṃ aṃgairvinyasya suvrate ।।

bhrūmadhye raṃjikāśceto biṃdunādau śikhopari ।
kalārūḍho kalāvaktre pūrakāntarasaṃsthitaḥ ।।

vinyasya sādhya dehe tu miśrakāle nirīkṣayet ।
kālamadhyamasaṃyuktai svanetrā darśanena tu ।।

aṃgāni yasya dṛśyaṃte jihvā dantā nakhāstathā ।
romānyaṃgeṣu sarvatra mukhe lālā pravarttate ।।

sapaśuḥ saptajanmā tu nāṃgahīno yadā bhavet ।
yasya nātmā vratenāpi sarvataṃtravarasya tu ।।

āhlā tu gacchate cittaṃ sontamastu varānane ।
ye sāmānyā paśurdevi teṣāṃ lakṣaṇamucyate ।।

yasya yasyā dṛśaṃ rūpaṃ mayā pūrvamudāhṛtam ।
tārā na dṛśyate nyāsānmiśyāmiśralikhopari ।।

sapaśustādṛśo jñeyo tatkarmaphalasādhakaḥ ।
eteṣāṃ kathitā devi paśulakṣaṇamātrikā ।।

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi maṃtraṃ sarvārthasādhakam ।
parāṅmukhaṃ guro devi paśucaruvivarjitāḥ ।।

yasmābhyāsena siddhyaṃte arcanena tu sādhakaḥ ।
tasya prayogaṃ vakṣyāmi mahāpotaṃ tavānaghe ।।
(189b)
yasya smaraṇamātreṇa viṣayairapi mohitāḥ ।
nirācārāpi deveśi khecarī samatāṃ gatā ।।

śṛṇu devi mahāprājñe jñānate kathayāmyaham ।
nārīṇāṃ ca viśeṣeṇa narāṇāṃ yuktacetasām ।।

na te dhastā yatkarmaṃ pravālakasamadyutim ।
tasmiṃ nivasate nityaṃ śāṃto devi sadāśivaḥ ।।

ṣaṣṭhasvarasamāyuktastasyaiva hi vaśānugaḥ ।
mātrādvayaṃ tu yattasya hrasvadīrghasvarūpataḥ ।।

taddevi tasya devasya śaktidvayamūdāhṛtam ।
aṃgulī tu suṣumṇā vai ūrddha gacchati mā sadā ।।

daṇḍakārā iḍā jñeyā saptapātālagāminī ।
ūrddharo mukhasaṃcāro yo yasya māruteritaḥ ।।

ataścorddhaṃ ca nīyeta satena parameśvaraḥ ।
ātmānaṃ tasya mūrddhasthaṃ kharūpaṃ vyāpyā diṅmukham ।।

prāṇāyāmaviśuddhātmā dhyāye nityaṃ varānane ।
evaṃ saṃyojya yogīśo tato yogaṃ prakalpayet ।।

adhastāttasya devasya sāntaṃ cakkraṃ varānane ।
soṃkārādyantaṃ saṃyuktacintayedvāyūrūpiṇam ।।

vakṣyamāne * maṃtreṇa padāṃtaṃ ca pradīpitam ।
pūrayennāḍiraṃdhrāṇi cakkre kumbhakavāyunām ।।

hṛccakkramadhyamātmānaṃ dhyātmaḥ śivasamaprabham ।
bi - bhūtaṃ tu biṃdvagre biṃduśāṃtamajaṃ nyaset ।।

iḍāṃ bhitvā suṣumṇāṃ tu udānena prapūrayet ।
nāḍī mukhā samughāṭya e(kā)reṇaiva maṃtravit ।।

tataḥ sa tu tamorāśi bhittvā vidyutsamaprabham ।
(190a)
soṃkāroccāraṇe gacche yatrāsthākāśamātaraḥ ।।

kāśyapījanasāmānyo vīrāṣṭakapadasthitaḥ ।
tataḥ prabhṛti yogeṃdro icchāyā vicaredbhuvi ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

yathaivātmekatāṃ yāti prasāde kathita prabhoḥ ।
kīdṛśaṃ hṛdayaṃ tasya devadevasya kathyatām ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

hṛdaye devadevasya śṛṇu devi ṣaḍakṣaram ।
netrasya madhyamaṃ bījaṃ praṇavādyaṃ varānane ।।

hakāraṃ tu tato nyasya avyaktaṃ jvalanīputam ।
sthāpayitvā tato māyāṃ tejorāśivibhūṣitaḥ ।।

śaktireṣāparādevi ṣaṭpadā sarvasiddhidā ।
anayā japyamānā yā sarvāvasthopi mānavaḥ ।।

priyo bhavati devīnāṃ pādai na * spṛśetagām ।
dvādaśānāṃ dvitīyena saptamāntaṃ sthitena ca ।।

niruddhanti sa te prāṇā prāsādatanusādhakaḥ ।
prasādaṃ vigrahaṃ kṛtvā taṃ prasādhayate punaḥ ।।

acirenaiva kālena prasādī bhavate hi saḥ ।
anena maṃtrarājena preritā śaktivigrahaḥ ।।

sadyaḥ siddhikarā maṃtrāḥ karmakarme niyojitāḥ ।
pratyekaṃ cakkrasiddhau tu paśunākarṣaṇe tathā ।।

vedhaghaṭṭavidhānena paśoḥ saṃśodhane tathā ।
ādyantayuktaṃ bījena padaṃ balavatā tu yā ।।

biṃdumityucyate tadvisvaniyogapadādyutam ।
bījamaṃtrapadopeta ghaṭṭane saṃprayojayet ।।

ghaṭṭanaṃ rakṣaṇaṃ jñeyaṃ svamantrasya tu yogibhiḥ ।
vidve vedhaḥ prakurvīta rakṣite rakṣaṇe tathā ।।

vedhaghaṭṭavidhānajño evaṃ bhavati sādhakaḥ ।
(190b)
śmaśānabhūmyaṃ cakkraṃ tu caturhastaṃ samālikhet ।।

tatra tattvāni vinyasya devyaścaiva yathākramam ।
ātmānaṃ bhairavaṃ dhyātvā cakkramāruhya maṃtravit ।।

pūrvoktena vidhānena khenayāti samāhitaḥ ।
pratyeka siddhau vinyāsa dravyaṃ dhātu ca yāgavit ।।

soṃkāratadṛdho nyastvā cuṃbikāye ca tasya ca ।
soṃkārādyantasaṃruddhaṃ kṛtvā gaṃdhā na mātmānaḥ ।।

khena gacchatyasaṃdeho pūrvadhyānasamanvitaḥ ।
pādapaṃ pāduke khaṭvā viṣṭanaṃ pīṭhikāstathā ।।

manovāyujavo maṃtrī paṃcāmṛtaniṣevanāt ।
muṃjanapratigṛhnaṃ vā vādyāya jalpaṃ bhajetsvayam ।।

yathā vyomena paṃkena tathā lipyati naiva sa ।
svecchā vihārī yatraiva svecchate tatra gacchati ।।

krīḍate tatra vīreśo yathā devo maheśvaraḥ ।
siddhārthakena deveśi ālikhedbhuvanaṃ budhaḥ ।।

nyastvā cakkraṃ sudigbhāge śaktibhiḥ parivāritam ।
pūjāṃ kṛtvā yathāśaktyā japenmaṃtrā krameṇa tu ।।

cuṃbakāṃtaṃ śivaṃ dhyātvā śaktibhiḥ parivāritam ।
nādāntebhyastacittasya pratyakṣī bhavate kṣaṇāt ।।

bhuvanaṃ kāṃcanaṃ divyaṃ nānāratnojvalaṃ śubham ।
staṃbhairmaṇimayairdivyai kiṃkiṇījālabhūṣitaiḥ ।।

prāsādaistu vicitrāḍhyairdivyastrījanasaṃkulaiḥ ।
sarvakāmasamṛddhyarthaṃ bhavanaṃ bhavate kṣaṇāt ।।

rātrau krīḍā smṛtā hyeṣā kāśyapīnāṃ mahītale ।
nāmena mṛttikāṃ gṛhya saptavālmīkasaṃbhavām ।।
(191a)
paśorpūragatasyāpi tayā kuryātpumākṛtim ।
tattvādi dvai padairdevimoṃkārāṃtarasaṃyutaḥ ।।

vīreśe navamaṃ samyannyāsaṃ kṛtvā varānane ।
dhyāyadbiṃduṃ japenmaṃtrāṃ nādāntagatacetanaḥ ।।

kṣaṇādākarṣayetsādhyaṃ pūrakena vidhānataḥ ।
ānītasya prakurvīta maṃtraiḥ tasyā vivecanam ।।

susaṃskṛtaiḥ svanāḍyutthā phaṭkārāṃtasaṃyutaiḥ ।
tatastu naidhanāstreṇa mūrddhni bhiṃdyādvarānane ।।

athavā kāśagaṃ kṛtvā athavā bhūtale sthitaḥ ।
śodhayitvā mṛtāṃ tasya bhairavenāgnirūpiṇā ।।

pātanaṃ pātitaṃ vyomādvṛtyānābhigataṃ śubham ।
caruṃ saṃsādhayettena praṇavena susaṃskṛtam ।।

paṃcadaiva(ga)saṃyuktaṃ mātrā trātu visarpiṇā ।
tamāsādya varārohe saptavāyu yathā vrajet ।।

icchā pradā rojitamṛtyuraṣṭāṃgaiśvaryasaṃyutaḥ ।
icchayātān - bhoktā ca iśataḥ saṃprajāyate ।।

evaṃ vedhavidhānajño līlayā karmmakurvatā ।
anulomavilomaistu vilomepyanulomataḥ ।।

vedhanaṃ ghaṭṭanaṃ vāpi kuryādeva hi maṃtravit ।
guhyātiguhyametaṃ tu ākhyātaṃ guruyo bhagam ।।

prāpye taddīkṣaye lokāṃ bhūsthā śailāgrago yathā ।
idaṃ samayino śrāvyaṃ vīreśaṃ kuru bhaktake ।
vyākhyeyamātmaśiṣyāya viplavāṃ narakonyathā ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

paśuvatsiddhidā ye tu te viśeṣeṇa kīrttitāḥ ।
(191b)
yeṣu nārodhakā proktā nākhyātā te manāgapi ।।

śākinīvratasaṃsthāpi kulajāpi maheśvaraḥ ।
na prāpnuvaṃti tai vighnai rodhakai siddhimuttamām ।।

tāṃ bravīhi suraśreṣṭha ya{thā}jñānena sādhakāḥ ।
siddhyaṃti kāśyapī lokā sammatāśca bhavaṃti hi ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

vidhānaṃ pūrvamuddiṣṭaṃ yatpaśūnāṃ varānane ।
tena te siddhidā devi viparītena rodhakāḥ ।।

strīpaśutveti yuktā tu mahāsiddhivighātakāḥ ।
tathā na dadyādanyatra varjayitvāṃgasaṃbhavam ।।

śrotrasaṃcaraṇe devi saṃpradāyena yadvinā ।
mahāhiraṇyadānena kṛtaṃ tava vibodhakam ।।

parasiddhāntamaṃtraistu rakṣitaṃ yadvarānane ।
tadgṛhṇīyā balādevi śeṣaṃ siddhivighātanam ।।

svayaṃ mṛtaṃ varārohe triṣaṣṭhi kulasaṃbhavam ।
mahāmṛtapaśurvāpi anyaṃ tu phalarodhakam ।।

aṣṭairdivasairyo yāti paṃcatvaṃ tu varānane ।
tadgṛhnīyā{t}svakairmaṃtrairanyathā na phalapradam ।।

māsādiśā priyo devi ajñānatamamohitāḥ ।
paśutve viniyuṃjanti teṣāṃ siddhistadaṃtikāḥ ।।

svasiddhiphalasaṃpannaḥ parasyoktaṃ varānane ।
karoti pīḍā deveśi acirātpatite tu saḥ ।।

vyādhi prapīḍitaṃ bālaṃ vyaṃge vātakasaṃyutam ।
napuṃsakaṃ ca deveśi paśuṃ kṛtvā na siddhyati ।।

lobhamohāmṛtāmpītvā kurvaṃte ye narottamāḥ ।
siddhavīrārcayenāpi teṣāṃ sā siddhirodhikāḥ ।।

yādagnāguruṇā devi śaktayo devatāṃtike ।
(192a)
tāmuktānyatra gamanaṃ sadyasiddhiharaṃ nṛṇām ।।

śaktināṃ cakkrasaṃsthānāṃ etadevādhikānapi ।
vāṅmanairapi yadrohaḥ sopi siddhivighātakaḥ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

aṣṭābhirdivasairdeva tvayokto {yo} vinaśyati ।
sasiddhado nāḍikayā yodhikaḥ sodhyasiddhidaḥ ।।

kathaṃ tajjāyate deva paramaṃ siddhikāraṇam ।
vijñānamāyuṣo bhrāṃtaṃ ātmanastu parasya vā ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

nābherūrddhaṃśagākhyo vā yuktasiddhiṣu sarvataḥ ।
muhurmuhu nadatesau sphurate ca varānane ।।

ṛtutrayā yadā hyasya kālobhyeti paraṃ kṣayam ।
apakramya tadā saṃdhī nadatyurasighargharaḥ ।।

na śṛṇoti tadā ghoṣāṃ karṇayorubhayo sthitam ।
durgaṃdhiśoṇitaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ tailavadrūpavarjitam ।।

jāyate pīḍanā dṛṣṭai caṃdrasturyo na paśyati ।
jihvāmūlatale śūlaṃ keśānāṃ tvaci saṃśritām ।।

lopānāmapi vṛddhitvaṃ pāṇimarmāṇi vadatā ।
ṣaṇmāsābhimukho mṛtyuryasyai tasya ca lakṣaṇam ।।

aṣṭāmṛtyupade prāptorabhiraścā vyavasthitaḥ ।
apānākhyo paro vāyu svasaṃdhi vyāpya tiṣṭhati ।।

saṃspṛṣṭau tu tadā pādau niḥśabdo raktavarjitau ।
saśoṇitaṃ bhavedretasoṣmā tasya gireśca yaḥ ।।

nāḍīcchidreṣu viśato rātrau digdāhito bhavet ।
jāgratyeva tadā paśyet svapnavat paribhāṣitam ।।

varṣāṣaṇmāsakalpe ca ṣaṇmāsā mṛtyulakṣaṇam ।
aprajñātamidaṃ brahma tasyopāyaṃ nibodhataḥ ।।

vāyumaṃḍalamadhyasthaṃ śikhibījaṃ nije pure ।
(192b)
dhāntadīptaṃ tribhiḥ sthāne ṣaṭpadeṣu ca vinyaset ।।

talānyaṃguṣṭhamūleṣu svavaktreṣu stanāṃtare ।
maṃdavidbhiḥ suraiḥ ṣaḍbhirākārādyaḥ sabiṃdubhiḥ ।।

niruṃdhya vinyasedbījaṃ maṃḍalaṃ cānalātmakam ।
dhāntāya saṃcayeddīptaṃ sphuliṃgā vikare ghanam ।।

anena tu prayogena paśye{n}mṛtyu supasthitam ।
atonyaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi prayogaṃ śṛṇu suvrate ।।

kṛtvā tricakravinyāsaṃ arddhārddhārddhena sādhake ।
śarīre vinyaset paścāt prāsādaṃ vyāpinaṃ param ।।

ādityaṃ pṛṣṭhataḥ kṛtvā āyuśeṃṣa vicārayet ।
yadā karṇau na paśyeta dvādaśābdāni naśyati ।।

athau tu saptabhirvarṣaiḥ hastau daśabhireva ca ।
aṣṭabhistu karāṃgulyāṃ tribhiḥ pārśva na paśyati ।।

keṣāṃ dvirvarṣāyuṣaśca nāsikāvatsarāddhruvam ।
ṣaṇmāsāt savinaśyeta śiraṃ yastu na paśyati ।।

grīvāyāṃ māsamekaṃ tu cibukaṃ cārddhamāsikam ।
navaikādaśadivasāni yadā cakṣurna paśyati ।।

hṛdaye paśyate chidraṃ saptāhāt svavinaśyati ।
dve śarīre yaḥ paśyet sadya (e)va vinaśyati ।।

kāla evaṃ vijānāti ātmanaḥ samupasthitam ।
bahunātra kimuktena nādo viṣṇukalāṃ tathā ।।

śrotrekṣau mukharaṃdhre ca yadeva hi na paśyate ।
tadā caiva varārohe prayāti yamasādanam ।।

parasya tu vijānāti yadā tacchṛṇu sāṃpratam ।
upaspṛśya śucirbhūtvā nyāsaṃ graṃtheśvareṇa tu ।।

kare kuryāccharīre tu tritattvaparibodhitaḥ ।
(193a)
sūryadakṣiṇamadhyasthaṃ somaṃ vāso niyojayet ।
īśabījakalālāṭe vyāpakena samanvitam ।।

śivatejaṃ hṛdi kṛtvā bhuvanāstraṃ tu saṃviṣaḥ ।
kṛtvā cātmani cātmānaṃ tato bījaṃ prakalpayet ।।

kaṃ śikhāyāṃ tu vinyasya nyāsaṃ sādhye tataḥ kuru ।
bījabīje vibhinnāni caturbhiścaturaḥ kramāt ।।

vāyavyādīni vinyasya varṇānānukrameṣu ca ।
akhajeṣu varārohe nyasettāreṇa mā kramāt ।।

catuṣpādeṣu bhūtāni chāyā lakṣasya madhyataḥ ।
ṭaṭhaḍaḍhaṇyasthā pare gṛhadevakuleṣu ca ।।

lalāṭe vinyaseddevi bījaṃ paramamuttamam ।
viśeṣanyāsayogastu kathayāmi tataḥ śṛṇu ।।

jaṃgamasthāvarāṇāṃ ca mṛgapakṣisarīsṛpām ।
viparītaṃ yathā nyāsaṃ bījeṣu kathayāmi te ।।

vāyubījaṃ śikhāgre tu āgneyaṃ śirasi nyaset ।
nābhau ākāśabījaṃ tu nyāsaṃ sarvatra yojitam ।।

māheṃdraṃ vinyasedvakre vāruṇaṃ hṛdaye nyaset ।
nābhau ākāśabījaṃ tu nyāsaṃ sarvatra yojitam ।।

chā(gra)lakṣaṇamadhyasthā śubhāśubhanivedakāḥ ।
abhimaṃtrya paśucchāyāṃ svanetrāṇi ca suvrate ।।

maṃtrairetaiḥ śucirbhūtvā miśrakāle mirīkṣayet ।
sṛjayā yeti padaṃ prathamaṃ śūlapāṇidvitīyakam ।।

haraharā yeti tṛtīyaṃ dahadaheti caturthakam ।
svarūpaṃ darśayeti ca paṃcamaṃ hūṃ phaḍantagam ।।

paśubījasamāyuktaṃ ṣaṣṭhaḥ ṣadamudīritam ।
õkārapūrvako maṃtraṃ prathamaṃ (tu) varānane ।।
(193b)
rudrāya jaṭiletyuktvā vilomāni padaṃ nyaset ।
turu suru yathā huṃ hrī dviruktāni tathā ca ha ।।

duritāni svarūpaṃ ca darśayaṃ huṃ phaḍantagaḥ ।
vāpīkūpeṣu vinyasya chāyā lakṣasya sādhakaḥ ।।

saptābhimaṃtritaṃ kṛtvā ebhiḥ chāyā nirīkṣayet ।
tryavdāṃ pādavihīnā(ya) dvejaṃghe parivarjitaḥ ।।

jānubhyāṃ varṣamekaṃ tu ūrūbhyāṃ daśamā(si)kām ।
kaṭihīnena vāṣṭau vā sapta vā jīvate dhruvam ।।

ṣaṭpaṃcamāsā dhripate udare hīyamānake ।
trīṇi dve hyekacaturo grīvāyāṃ hīyamānakaḥ ।।

karayoḥ pakṣamekaṃ tu daśāhaṃ bāhuvarjitaḥ ।
aṃgahīna - horātraṃ hṛdaye sphuṭate dhruvam ।।

caturyāmena deveśi prayāti yamasādanam ।
śire nipatitaṃ dṛṣṭvā dinārddhena vinaśyati ।।

chāyāṃ na dṛśyate yasya tatkṣaṇāt sa vinaśyati ।
evaṃ devi śudhicchāyāṃ miśrakāle vicārayet ।।

paśyate hyavicāreṇa ātmano vā parasya vā ।
ataḥ sūkṣmataraṃ vakṣye āyurjñānaṃ varānane ।।

yanna kasyacidākhyātaṃ tvat prītyā kathayāmi te ।
deśāntaragataṃ syāpi dūrasthasyāpi suvrate ।।

jānaṃti gotramātreṇa yathākālaṃ tathā śṛṇu ।
kṛtvā vāmākṣare nyāsaṃ a-te śeṣatvaṃgikam ।।

svacchāyānvīkṣya niṣkampastatokāśaṃ nirīkṣayet ।
tatra lakṣe yadaṃgaṃtu hīyate tadvinaśyati ।।

sakṛddṛṣṭe viparyāso syāntaditi vikalpayet ।
tathaiva yadi bhūyopi tadavaśyaṃ tathaiva ca ।।
(194a)
kavacaṃ vatamānaṃ vā adhaḥśāyinameva vā ।
yadā bhavati lakṣe tu tadāriṣṭā vinirdiśet ।।

ṣaḍṛtu prathame yāme aṣṭau māsā dvitīyake ।
tṛtīye tu caturviṃdyāccaturthekaṃ tu kalpayet ।।

sārddhena tu paṃcamake ṛtuśeṣaṃ tu ṣaṣṭhake ।
māsamekaṃ varārohe saptame parikīrttitam ।।

yāmānāṃ kramayogena anenaiva vicārayet ।
paṃcapaṃcakahrāsena yāvat paṃcāvaśeṣakam ।।

tato vai dinahrāsena aṃte yāvaddinaṃ bhavet ।
ahorātre gatiṃ kṛtvā evamāyurvicārayet ।।

tryabdāvasānaṃ divasaṃ yāvattaṃ ca nirīkṣayet ।
velāṃ parīkṣya ca tataḥ saṃdhyākāleṣvavasthitaḥ ।।

caturbhiścaturo jñeyā saṃdhyābhirvidhivattathā ।
sitā raktā tathā pītā kṛṣṇā cāpya tu pūrvaśaḥ ।।

vicāryakālaṃ gṛhṇīyāt paśukarmaprasiddhayet ।
evaṃ vṛkṣa nagālikhya prasāda pratisaṃdhiṣu ।।

sarvalakṣaiḥ prayoktavyaṃ sumoghaṃ śivabhāṣitam ।
nātaḥ parataraṃ devi kālajñānaṃ pravarttate ।
saviśeṣaṃ tavākhyātaṃ kiṃ bhūyaḥ kathayāmi te ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
yoginīsaṃcārakālajñānapaṭalaṃ samāptam ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

yattvayābhihitaṃ deva kālaṃ kālodayākulam ।
nāḍīsuśirasaṃcāraṃ dhyānamaṃḍalasaṃkulam ।।

striya ete kathaṃ karma kariṣyaṃtyalpamedhasaḥ ।
(194b)
kathaṃ vā calacintānāṃ siddhisvayamite sate ।

yasya smaraṇamātreṇa sarvakarmāṇi śaṃkaraḥ ।
striyaḥ kurvaṃtya yatnena bhacakkraṃ kathaya prabho ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

vidyādhipasya devasya vidyācakkraṃ bravīmi te ।
dhyātvā hṛdi mahācakkraṃ likhedvā bhūtale śubhe ।।

karṇikāyāṃ nyasettatra śivaṃ paṃcakalānvitam ।
ta(ta) hemaprabhaṃ divyaṃ mahābhairavarūpiṇam ।।

kṛtvā śaśīravinyāsaṃ tatra pūjāṃ prakalpayet ।
anantapuṭamadhyastho varṇāntasakalaṃ tanum ।।

saṃcaṃtya devadeveśi vyāpakaṃ hṛdayaṃ nyaset ।
māyā kalāntaraśataṃ sthāpayeddakṣiṇe bhuje ।।

aṣṭādaśāparā yoni raṃjikāraṃjikā śubhā ।
pṛṣṭhatastu nyasecchāṃtaṃ paṃcamaśca sayojitam ।।

vyāpayattaṃ varārohe anaṃtākrāntamastakam ।
ūrddhādho raṃjikāṃtasthā kalā māyā vibhūṣitā ।।

ekonaviṃśakāyonirvā māse saṃni{vi}veśayet ।
vidyālayaṃ śire nyasya varṇāntasaka{laṃ} tanum ।।

evaṃ śivaparo bhūtvā tato pūjāṃ prakalpayet ।
nānyatra satataṃ jāpaṃ krāṃta ākarṣaṇe hitaḥ ।।

bhairavāṃtastu vidveṣo uṃkārāṃto vaśe śubhaḥ ।
ṣaḍaṃto maraṇe yojya uccāṭe - sphaḍantagaḥ ।।

vaśitve rājarājānāṃ prathamaṃ viniyojayet ।
kalā dvitīyā deveśi rājamadhye niveśayet ।।

tṛtīyā vyāharaṇe caiva ātmanaḥ śāṃtikarmaṇi ।
yaṃ yaṃ saṃciṃtya deveśi śivaṃ japati sādhakaḥ ।।
(195a)
tattatkarmakarotyeṣā nyāsaṃ pūjā vidhānataḥ ।
pūrve kalā dvitīyā tu tavargapariveṣṭitām ।।

tṛtīyā uttare patre tavargeṇa samanvitāḥ ।
caturthī dakṣiṇe devi cavargaśca yathā śivam ।।

paṃcamī paścime patre ṭavargapariveṣṭitāḥ ।
karṇikāyāṃ tu nārīśaṃ nyaseddevi yathākramam ।।

rudrā agnidale yojya suprabhā iśadigdale ।
bhīmārudrā tu vāyavyāṃ naiṛtī bhīmatī tathā ।।

dakṣiṇe karṇikāmūle bhadrakālī niyojayet ।
uttare karṇikābhāge bhīmā yogī niyojayet ।।

evaṃ gaṃdhaiśca puṣpaiśca bhakṣaiśca vividhaistathā ।
arcayitvā yathānyāyaṃ tataḥ karmasamārabhet ।।

śivaṃ paṃcakalopetaṃ sarvakarmaniyojayet ।
sarvakarmasusiddhyarthaṃ japedarceta nityaśaḥ ।।

nivṛtti praṇavādyā tu kalā khagamanohitāḥ ।
dvitīyā devadeveśi pūrvvacakkrasthitasya tu ।।

tṛtīyā ca caturthī ca adṛśyakaraṇe śubhe ।
yojayet pūrvavat tasya uccārapadadīpitā ।।

caturthī paṃcamī caiva raktākarṣakarāparāḥ ।
pūrvanyāse tu bhāṃḍānāṃ śaivapaṃcāmṛte hitāḥ ।।

jāpena sarvamaṃtrasya sthānāsthānaṃ krame naraḥ ।
devatvamamṛtaṃ lebhe japādasmā(nna) saṃśayaḥ ।।

asyaiva devadevasya yogiyuktasya suvrate ।
śṛṇu karmāṇyanekāni prasādena yutasya tu ।।

kṛtvā śarīravinyāsaṃ pūrvavacchaktidīpitam ।
ṣa(dyu)dāṃtena cakkreṇa kare nyāsaṃ tataḥ kuru ।।
(195b)
śṛṇu devi paraṃ guhyaṃ lokānāṃ hitakāmyayā ।
nākhyātaṃ kasyacit karmma guhyasyāpi nigūhanam ।।

pūśāpaśāsumanasā prītistuṣṭirdhṛtistathā ।
amṛtirddhṛtikābhīsau vyāpārīmītvaśumā tithi ।।

śaśinī jvalinī caiva chāyā sampūrṇamaṇḍalā ।
paṃcatrikakalā hyetā amṛtā ṣoḍaśī smṛtā ।।

ebhiḥ karmāṇi siddhyaṃti kālodayavaśānugā ।
etā vahi kurvaṃti sarvakarmāḥ śive sthitā ।।

jyotiṣāṃ tithayo hyetā yoginīnāṃ jayāparā ।
caṃdre caṃdrakalā devi trirūpaḥ saṃpratiṣṭhitāḥ ।।

kurvaṃti sarvakarmāṇi saṃpūrṇavidhiyojitāḥ ।
viparītākṣīyamānastu tāṃ tu karme niyojayet ।।

pūrveṣu tarpaye kṣīṇā pūrṇā kṣīṇe vivarddhayet ।
kṣīṇāṃ bhuktā kalā yā tu yadi karmaniyojayetḥ ।।

* sādhyena tu bījai bījabījaiḥ saṃprajojayet ।
iṃdro vṛddhikṣayaṃ dṛṣṭvā bījanaṃ devi kārayet ।।

akārādi visargāntaiḥ sve cakkre tu yathāsthitaiḥ ।
kṛtvā cakkrāramadhyasthaṃ puruṣaṃ paṃcaviṃśakam ।।

karanyāsena deveśi tasya karma prasādhayet ।
śivaṃ śaśini saṃyukta aṃguṣṭhe viniyojayet ।।

bharjanyāsaṃśumāyuktaṃ pūrṇamaṇḍalayā tathā ।
madhyamāyāṃ nyaseddevi chāyāyuktaṃ hyanāmike ।।

pūrṇāyuktaṃ kaniṣṭhāyāṃ karamadhye mṛtāyutam ।
maṇibaṃdhe yaśāyuktaṃ veṣṭhane prītisaṃyutaṃ ।।

tato mātrigaṇe madhye karayorviniyojayet ।
(196a)
aṃguṣṭhā bījavāruṇyā pūrvāyāṃ tarjanī sthitaḥ ।।

anāmikāyāṃ sudīcyāyāṃ madhyamā dakṣiṇā diśi ।
vāyavyānteya naiṛtyāmaiśānyācca yathākramam ।।

pratiyuktāṃ nyaseddevi bhūtavargaṃ yathākramam ।
evaṃ kṛtvā karanyāsaṃ tataḥ karmaprasādhayet ।।

jātamaṃguṣṭhabījena yajitadyojayecchatam ।
prāmayatye sthitaṃ dravyaṃ yadiddhyāne sumaṃtritaḥ ।।

jāṃte tarjanibījena yojitaṃ yojayet sadā ।
hastaprāptā bhavet siddhi ugreśatvaṃ ca jāyate ।।

ṣaṭpadaḥ prathame bīje yadi yukto japet sadā ।
acirāt paśyate sākṣādyoginyo mātarāstathā ।।

upatiṣṭhanti karmeṣu tasya pathyaṃ dadanti ca ।
darśayanti paśuṃ tasya karmasiddhidadaṃti ca ।।

aṇimādiguṇaiśvaryaṃ ṣaḍbhirmāsairdadaṃti ca ।
parābhibhavakāryeṣu saṃgrāme ca mahātape ।।

japato juhvataścaiva jayo bhavati sarvataḥ ।
iśikhācca pravartteta labhedyo - śvaraṃ padam ।।

yeṣāṃ prīti samāyuktaṃ śūnyaṃ kālasamanvitam ।
nārīśena samākhyātaṃ hṛdayaṃ yogasiddhidam ।।

cakkramadhyākṣarā devi nāḍīnāṃ bhedanaṃ param ।
śatrūṇāṃ śoṣaṇe caiva chedane ca prayujyate ।।

hastena saṃspṛśe tena staṃbhitaḥ so na saṃśayaḥ ।
yo hyadyutayutho devi sopi dṛṣṭā karatraset ।।

vṛkṣeśa pāśanādīni narastrīśakaṭāni ca ।
ālabhya nyastahastena gacchedyogī yathāsukham ।।

cakkrasya dakṣiṇe bījaṃ mudraṇe saṃprayojayet ।
tanmudraṇe vāruṇaṃ bījaṃ dhyāna japya samanvitam ।।
(196b)
citāgnibhasmanā yojyaṃ ko vīraṃ tu mahā tapet ।
cakṣuṣāṃ vadhvane caiva vṛkṣāṇāṃ tu vināśane ।।

paścimaṃ śirasi nyasya dakṣiṇaṃ hṛdaye nyaset ।
prācyā nābhyāṃ udīcyāṃ tu padayoḥ saṃniveśayet ।।

sādhyasyākramaṇe nyāso mudrāśuddhasya nityaśaḥ ।
prācyodīcyāni deveśi viparītagatāni tu ।।

yaḥ śāntāni prakurvīta mudritākarṣaṇe kṣaṇā ।
saṃpūrṇamaṃḍalā yuktācchāyādevi trirāhatā ।।

dānāntā praṇavādyā tu mudrito mudraṇe bhavet ।
madhyamāṃgulivinyastā mudraṇaṃ saṃprakīrttitāḥ ।।

unmudraṇaṃ karotyeṣā gāyatrī tarjani sthitā ।
kusumeti pade devi raktākarṣakaraṃ param ।।

praṇavādyā tu sāvitrī uṃkāratritayānvitā ।
paramaṃtravāraṇī caiva hastayorubhayoḥ sthitaḥ ।।

vicceti yatpadaṃ devi dānāntaṃ praṇavādikam ।
satataṃ dadate siddhiṃ sādhakasya na saṃśayaḥ ।।

prathamo nyāsayogastu cakkrasya kathitastava ।
cakkrānyāsī tṛtīyaṃ tu kathayāmi tavānaghe ।।

kalāsthāyāṃtago devi śivastuṃburuvinyaset ।
sarvakarmaprasiddhyarthaṃ maṃtre dehe ca vinyaset ।।

hṛdaye yaśayā bhinna śire pūṣasamanviteḥ ।
śikhāyāṃ tvaṃśumālī tu kavacaṃ śaśinī putam ।।

astraṃ mahāmṛtāyuktaṃ cakkranyāsastu pūrvavat ।
madhye cakkrasya yadbījaṃ sarvanāḍimukhodbhavam ।।

mukhe sādhyasya vinyastaṃ svaravarjyaṃ tathātmani ।
paśurāla - pūrvasya nābhimadhye kalā nyaset ।।
(197a)
amṛtākarṣaṇe proktaḥ prayogo bhīmavikramaḥ ।
mukhabaṃdhe nareṃdrāṇāṃ pūrvapatrādhipaṃ nyaset ।।

mudraṇe tu paśūnāṃ tu dvitīyasvarabhedataḥ ।
anāmikā sthito maṃtro vidyātattvena bheditaḥ ।।

stambhayet sarvabhūtāni athavā karṣayet kṣaṇā{t} ।
ākṛṣṭāvaśamāyāṃti arthadā ca bhavanti hi ।।

sadāśivāṃśumālinyāṃ mahāmukuṭabhūṣitaḥ ।
utkrāmaṇiprayoktavyāccitāgnirbhasmane tathā ।।

kalāpraṇavasaṃyuktā mahāsiddhiḥ pradā smṛtā ।
trijaptā kṣudrajātīnāṃ māraṇaṃśo vidarbhaṇām ।।

cakkraḥ paścimabījena phaṭkārasahitena tu ।
mudritonmudramāyāti bhairavenāpi yatsvayam ।।

cakkrosyāntarabījena chāyāyuktena suvrate ।
adṛśyakalaṇaṃ proktaṃ khegatiśca yathepsayā ।।

cakkradakṣiṇabījena sānusvāreṇa suvrate ।
jalāgnistaṃbhanaṃ kuryādyaṃtrāṇāṃ ca nivāraṇam ।।

praṇavaścaturobhyasto anantāṃntena bhūṣitaḥ ।
amṛtāyāhatastambhaścintārūḍhe pada smṛtaḥ ।।

saptābhimaṃtritaṃ kṛtvā vahni nāma vidarbhitam ।
udake prakṣipeddevi śavastaṃbhe paro vidhiḥ ।।

kalārūḍhaśivo devi amṛtāṃtavibhūṣitaḥ ।
āsannakasya hṛdayaṃ sarvakarmmakaraṃ śubham ।।

paśugotraṃ varārohe mātrī hṛdayadarbhitam ।
paritokṣarasaṃbaddha krūradṛṣṭyā nirīkṣitam ।।

saṃjīvitaṃ samāṃsaṃ ca raktamākarṣayet striyaḥ ।
chāyākrāṃtā kalā devi māyāntena vibhūṣitā ।।
(197b)
grāsasyāsya vimokṣaṃ tu gotradarcanayā sthitā ।
aṃguṣṭhamadhyamāyāṃ ca kanīyasyātṛtīyakam ।।

vinyasoccāraye{t}kṣipraṃ ādyaṃ ca praṇavāṃtikam ।
chāyā taṃ puruṣaṃ devi tato muṣṭati pīḍayet ।।

kṛtvā sādhyaṃ varārohe dṛṣṭibaṃdhaparaḥ smṛtaḥ ।
śaśinī mohitaṃ kṛtvā raṃjikāṃtavibhūṣitā ।।

mātṝṇāṃ ca yathā ruddhaṃ praṇavādya ṣaḍantagam ।
ayutā kalayā yuktaṃ oṃkāro paribhinnayā ।।

śastrāṇi maṃtraṇāddevi tejachāyā nikṛntanam ।
dūrasthaṃ calate puṃsāṃ sādhyaṃ hi kurute kṣaṇāt ।।

purīṣaṃ māhiṣaṃ gṛhya gomūtreṇa dravīkṛtam ।
pūrvoktavidhināyaṃ tu śivadhyānasamanvitam ।।

prayogā devadeveśi amoghā bhīmavikramaḥ ।
vaśamānahataṃ kṛtvā ukārapraṇavādikam ।।

darbhābhimaṃtraṇācchedaśākinī nigrahaṃ hitam ।
hṛdayena dale nādāṃ amoghaḥ śivabhāṣitaḥ ।।

urvītayā susaṃyuktadhṛtiyuktā sadāśivaḥ ।
anaṃtena samākrātaṃ pratyavādivibhūṣitam ।।

ākāśagaganaśasto maṃtro vṛkṣādi maṃtraṇam ।
śatamaṣṭottaraṃ yuktasarvadravyeṣu saṃkhyayā ।।

pratiyuktaḥ paro devi kalārūḍho namontagaḥ ।
madhye nārīśasaṃyuktaṃ rūpasya parivarttane ।।

praṇavādyo hi yo maṃtraḥ svāsthānā prāṇināparaḥ ।
mārjārajaṃbuko ṛkṣavṛkṣabhogo kharoṣṭravām ।।

sāsthāni yāni jīvāni teṣāṃ śirasi vāpayet ।
(198a)
pītasarṣaparājīni raktodakaniṣecitām ।
haste tatoṃ kuruṃ badhvā tadrūpī bhavate kṣaṇāt ।।

uṃkāraṃ saṃpuṭe kṛtvā balabījavarānane ।
tenābhimaṃtrayedbhasma tena spṛṣṭapranṛtyati ।।

gacchate nyatra vā deśaṃ paṃcavācā prayojitam ।
aṃkuśo bhairavāṃtastha praṇavādyo diśāntagaḥ ।।

diśābaṃdhe ca kurute dvaśvaṃdhaṃ prāṇināṃ tathā ।
praṇavaṃ śirasi vinyasya svamaṃtraṃ hṛdi vastanā ।।

vidyālayaṃ śarīre tu vyāpinaṃ devi cintayet ।
saṃpūrṇamaṃḍalāyuktaṃ aṃte devaṃ sadāśivaṃ ।।

vṛttisthaṃ dehasaṃkrāmaṃ karotyekaṃ tu ciṃtitam ।
tattvotthena dvitīyena tattvatastattvayojitam ।
śivenādhiṣṭhitaṃ kṛtvā kramate yā dadicchati ।।

aṃkuśaḥ praṇavādyastu yaḥ śāṃto karṣaṇe hitaḥ ।
mudritānāṃ varārohe anyatra yonimudrayā ।।

śaṃkhapatrā samāyuktaṃ trailokyavaśakārakaḥ ।
kapālapāśamudrābhiryuktorthasya tu sādhakaḥ ।।

sa eva puruṣāṃtastu raṃjikāṃ raṃjito kuśaḥ ।
ālikhya śastramadhyānte likhito stambhayedvratam ।।

śmaśānāṃgāracūrṇena yaṃ yaṃ manasi rocate ।
paraḥ śivomṛtāyuktaḥ kṣurikādyaḥ kalopari ।।

sthināvigaḍapāśānāṃ chedanaṃ praṇavādikam ।
citābhasmena saṃyukto rocanāṃ maṃtrapūjitām ।।

tayā spṛśati yalloko tatsarvaṃ vaśago bhavet ।
praṇavādyaṃ varārohe hṛdayaṃ mātrirodanam ।।
(198b)
caturoṃkārasaṃyuktaṃ puruṣeṇa vibhūṣitam ।
visargāṃtena hastābhyāṃ kṛtvā saptābhimaṃtritam ।।

lāmāśabdena hiṃsānāṃ lāmānāṃ caiva mudraṇam ।
ahividyunmahāvāta mahājvālā nirodhakam ।।

ityopalāśinīnāṃ ca staṃbhanaṃ paramaṃ matam ।
kalādviruccārayuktā tanurūḍhā mṛtāṃtagā ।।

tṛtīyā raṃjikāṃtasthā kevalā praṇavādikā ।
paśūnāṃ vyādhijananī yatra yatra prapūjyate ।।

gotrasaṃdarbhaṇāddevi amoghā tatra tatra tu ।
mahāguhyontaraṃ vakṣye paraṃ maṃtracatuṣṭayam ।।

kaṃṭakairāvṛtaṃ divyaiḥ sadyaḥ siddhipradāyakaiḥ ।
atattveti padaṃ pūrvaṃmatyaṃtaṃ praṇavādikam ।।

ālabheddhṛdayaṃ tena saptavārā vratasthitaḥ ।
saṃpūjya vidhivaccakkraṃ sthaṃḍilaṃ dakṣiṇāmukhaṃḥ ।।

rātrau supte vijānāti sarvaṃ svapne śubhāśubham ।
tattvātmanaṃ padecchṛkṣapadenānena pūrvavat ।।

samādhistho vijānāti yadyanmanasi rocate ।
abhimaṃtryakaraṃ vāmaṃ yaṃ spṛśentena mastake ।।

taṃ mudrayati deveśi dakṣiṇonmudraṇe hitam ।
bhavātmakaṃ chakārāntaṃ padaṃ tārakabhūṣitam ।।

tena bāladhvamātrastu paśyate biṃdumīśvaram ।
hṛdi kṛtvākṣaraṃ divyaṃ vijānāti śubhāśubham ।।

parasya cātmano vāpi {yadi} yogena muhyati ।
prathamasya padasyāṃte phaṭkārāṇāṃ catuṣṭayam ।।

tārakāṇāṃ catuṣkaṃ tu kṛkacchṛkārantathaiva ca ।
tenāhāva tato bhūtāṃ padāni viniyojayet ।।
(199a)
praṇavoṃtaḥ paraṃ vyoma vyāpinīti tataḥ param ।
svāhāntayāla(ṣva)tanurāpādatalamastakāḥ ।।

khena gacchatyasaṃdehaḥ pūrvacakkrasya yogataḥ ।
niraṃjanā yeti padaṃ bhairavādyaṃ varānane ।।

nirākāśāya deveśi vidmaheti padāṃtagam ।
tathāte dhīmahī tyuktvā tanno sūkṣmapracodayāt ।।

prasādāntājjapeddevi vyādhimṛtyuvināśanam ।
padbhyāṃ bhāva padāṃ nyasya ātmotkrāṃte paro vidhiḥ ।।

thaṃ thaṃ thaṃ

etāni viparītāni paśukrāṃtauti yojayet ।
catuṣkābhyāsayogena kṛcchrastaṃbhena yojayet ।।

phaṭkārāntaṃ vilomaṃtrarūpasya ca vivarttane ।
druk kaṃcakastathā druk sruk kṣyuk jruk hruk tataḥ kramāt ।।

hrutathāṣṭakarmmavi * mātrīṇāṃ hṛdayaṃ param ।
anena japyamānena sādhakasya phalapradāḥ ।।

bhavaṃti mātaro devi saṃpradāyaṃ dadaṃti ca ।
satataṃ smaraṇaṃ yāstu sapāśairnābhi bhūpate ।।

paśuṃ nāmākṣaraṃ devi kaṃcākākṣaramiśritam ।
mukhaṃ sanmīlya japato raktākarṣe paro vidhiḥ ।।

uktāni yāni karmmāṇi yoginī jālaśaṃvare ।
ayutaṃ japtvā tu sarvāṇi karotyeva hi līlayā ।।

anāvṛṣṭau tathā vṛṣṭiṃ tathā vṛṣṭivirodhanam ।
karoti līlayā devi yadanyadapi rocate ।।

kruddho mārayate sarvāṃ jīvāpayati sarvadā ।
aśanīpatamānaṃ tu kṣiyate yatra rocane ।।

yāni yāni tu karmāṇi śrūyaṃte pṛthivītale ।
dṛśyaṃte vākyayantevāruṃ cākāṃteṣu yojayet ।। ।।
(199b)
।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
yoginīsaṃcāre paramacakkravidhānapaṭalam ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

devadeva viśiṣṭānāṃ yāgānāṃ kathito vidhiḥ ।
adhunā śrotumicchāmi sāmānyaṃ tu mahādhvaram ।।

tasya darśanamātreṇa śaktayo bhīmavikramāḥ ।
bhavaṃte devadeveśa paśavo paśahā tapāḥ ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

girigahvaraguhyeṣu mahodadhitaṭeṣu ca ।
ādisiddhaiśmaśānairvā ālikhenmaṃḍalaṃ śubham ।।

śmaśānabhasmanā miśraṃ kapilā gomayaṃ śubham ।
raktodakaṃpi miśreṇa tena bhūmiṃ pralepayet ।।

śmaśānabhasmaṃ saṃgṛhya śmaśāneṣṭadalaṃ śubham ।
śmaśānāṃgāracūrṇa tu trirekhaṃ maṃḍalaṃ likhet ।।

ekahastaṃ dvihastaṃ vā caturaṣṭakaraṃ tathā ।
sūtrayedrudhirāktena śavasūtreṇa sūtradhṛk ।।

śakrodhano śucirdakṣo ācāryo jñānapāragaḥ ।
kapālamālābharaṇo raudrabhasmāvaguṃṭhitaḥ ।।

paṃcamudrāvratadharā bhairavāṃgairvibhūṣitaḥ ।
mahābhūtā - jālena sagantāt pariveṣṭitam ।।

ālikhenmaṃḍalavaraṃ ghorasiddhipradāyakam ।
caturaśraṃ caturdvāraṃ madhye padmavibhūṣitam ।।

aṣṭapatraṃ tu tatpadmaṃ karṇikādhiṣṭhitaṃ śubham ।
tasya madhye nyase devi bhairavī bhīmavikramam ।।

dakṣiṇābhimukhaṃ dīptaṃ bhīmarūpaṃ bhayāvaham ।
(200a)
tasyāgratasthitā devi aghorāghoravikramāt ।।

bhairavābhisukhāṃ kruddhāṃ raudrarūpā nyaset tataḥ ।
paścime karṇamoḍhī tu uttareṇa umāṃ śubhām ।।

naṃdiṃ ca gaṇapati caiva pūrvāyo ghaṭapaṭṭisām ।
āgneyyā ghoravacanāṃ naiṛtyāṃ krodhamūrttijām ।।

vāyavyāṃ krodharaudrākhyā aiśānyāṃ yogasaṃbhavān ।
caturviṃśatiyoginyo kesarāgre tu vinyaset ।।

pretarākṣagabhūtāṃ vyadvitīyāvaraṇaṃ bhavet ।
tṛtīyogāṃni vinyasya nyaseddevyaścaturthake ।।

paṃcame sarvadevāstu ṣaṣṭhiśākiniguhyakāḥ ।
saptame tu graho nyasya nakṣatrāṃścāṣṭame tathā ।।

navame sāgarāṃ nyasya yathāśaktyā prapūjayet ।
gaṃdhapuṣpaistathā dhūpairbhakṣabhojyaiḥ susaṃskṛtaiḥ ।।

toraṇaiḥ sapatākaiśca ghaṃṭākiṃkiṇināditaiḥ ।
ḍamarakā rāvamukharaṃ ghaṭahikā śabdasaṃkulam ।।

saṃpūjya maṇḍalavaraṃ tataḥ śiṣyāṃ praveśayet ।
sopavāsāṃ śucīstātāṃ arcayeduttarāṃ mukham ।।

kapālena śiraspṛṣṭvā saṃpuṭā hṛdaye nyaset ।
khaṭvāṃgena tu sarvāṅgā ālabhe putrakasya tu ।।

agrato vādaye ghaṃṭāṃ paṭaho ḍamarastathā ।
vastracchannamukhaṃ devi puṣpāṃjalivaraṃ tathā ।।

pradakṣiṇīkṛtya puradakṣiṇāmūrttimāśritāḥ ।
tato dāvāpayet puṣpāṃ devasyopari putrakaḥ ।।

yasmiṃ tatpatate puṣpaṃ tattasya kulamādiśet ।
hṛnmaṃtraparijaptena tilakāṃteṣu kārayet ।।

raktena darśayettasya mukhamudghāṭyamaṇḍalam ।
(200b)
yadyasya devatā sthānaṃ tatsarvaṃ tasya darśayet ।।

samayaṃ śrāvayitvāstu praṇipatya puraṃ guroḥ ।
suśrāvya pūrvavidhinā saṃsiddhaṃ putrakāṃcitam ।।

guruṃ saṃpūjya vidhivadvittaśāṭhyaṃ vivarjitaḥ ।
pragṛhya kulajānmaṃtrāṃ vratāṃ ca samayāṃ tathā ।।

tāvadārādhayeddevi yoginyo mātaro gurum ।
mātṛdutyo vratāṃścaiva yāvadantaṃ krameṇa tu ।।

aropanākramaprāptitriṣaṣṭhicaruśodhitaḥ ।
bhairavībhuvanā devi sādhaḥ śaktibhirāvṛtaḥ ।।

etaṃ tu maṃḍalavaraṃ māyākhyātaṃ tavānaghe ।
dvitīyavratasiddhyarthaṃ maṃḍalaṃ kathayāmi te ।।

ekahastaṃ caturdvāraṃ madhye padmavibhūṣitam ।
karṇikāyāṃ nyaseddevi aghorā rudrasaṃbhavā ।।

dalena yoginī nyasya pūrvoktena krameṇa tu ।
caturviṃśati pūrvoktāṃ vinyasedgarbhamaṃḍale ।।

pūrveṇa vāgbhavāṃ devīṃ āgneye tu manobhavām ।
dakṣiṇe yogajā nyasya paścime pūtanā nyaset ।।

nairṛtyākāśajaṃ devyā diḍmātryāstu tathottare ।
pātālamātarā devi iśadikpatrayojitā ।।

sauvarṇakalaśāṃ devi madhye udakapūritām ।
phalākṣatā samāyuktāṃ kaṃṭhe sūtreṇa veṣṭitam ।।

sahasrajaptaṃ kalaśaṃ devyā upahṛdena tu ।
tenābhiṣekaṃ kurvīta yadicchetsiddhimuttamām ।।

ladhvānujñaibhiṣiktaśca kāśyapījanasammataḥ ।
tataścare vratavaraṃ triṣaṣṭikulasaṃbhavam ।।

bhairavaṃ vāmabhāge tu cāmuṃḍā vratameva ca ।
kṛṣṇāṃvaradharo nityaṃ kṛṣṇagaṃdhānulepanam ।।

kṛṣṇamālāvalaṃvī ca karṇālaṃkārabhūṣitaḥ ।
(201a)
valayā bharaṇopetaṃ nūpuradhvanibhūṣitam ।।

raktāṃvaro raktapādo divyastrīrūpadhāriṇaḥ ।
pracchante nirjane deśe maunī vidyā vrataṃcaret ।।

māsamekaṃ carenmaṃtrī dvādaśāṃ vā mahāvratām ।
māsena tu mahāyogī yoginyāḥ paśyatecchayā ।।

tairvṛtastu caruṃ kṛtvā trailokye vicaret kṣaṇāt ।
sarvajñaḥ sarvakarttā ca sṛṣṭisaṃhārakārakaḥ ।।

yoginīnāṃ pade devi harttākarttā ca jāyate ।
dvitīyaṃ tu vrataṃ vakṣye ghorakāpālarūpiṇa ।।

śire kapālamukuṭaṃ śiramālāvibhūṣitam ।
kare karṇau tathā pādau asthikhaḍairvibhūṣitam ।।

vāme kapālaṃ khaṭvāṃgaṃ tathā vai dakṣiṇe kare ।
śmaśāne vicarenmaunī triṣaṣṭidivasāni tu ।।

vratāṃte tu varārohe śarīre mātaro dhruvam ।
viśaṃte devadeveśi dadaṃte siddhimuttamām ।।

ajarāścāmarāścaiva śāpānugrahakārakaḥ ।
trailokyasyāpi sarvasya bhavate sādhakottamaḥ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

pretālayamahābhīmaṃ bhūtasaṃhagaṇākulam ।
alpasattvāḥ kathaṃ tatra deva prāptaśivādhare ।।

śaktayaḥ kulajā rātrau parāvīrā mahātapāḥ ।
tāsāṃ na sannidhānena nokto yogastvayā vibhoḥ ।।

siddhā susiddhā bhūtena siddhasārasya śaktayaḥ ।
sannidhānaṃ prakurvanti yatra tatraiva vā vibhoḥ ।।

yathā bhavaṃti pratyakṣā śmaśāne maṃtravigrahe ।
mudrācāravratairdivyaistathā kathaya śaṃkara ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

raudra bhasma mahādhūpo mahādīpo varānane ।
(201b)
yatraiva devi sānnidhyaṃ bhairavī tatra tiṣṭhati ।।

mahāmudrā karodyā ca kāle cālāsthiśṛṃkhalā ।
{vikaṭā karaṅkiṇī caiva kabandhā kroṣṭrakī tathā ।।

kapālañca samuddiṣṭaṃ bhairavasya parāṃ tanuṃ ।
yatraitā devi baṃdhyate tatra bhūtapatiḥ svayaṃ ।।}

śaktayo yatra dṛśyante paṃcamudrā vibhūṣitā ।
pheṃkārapūrṇavadanā bhūteśāstatra tatra tu ।।

upahāro mṛtaṃ yatra mahāśaṃkhe pratiṣṭhitam ।
dakṣiṇābhimukhopātastatra mātrigaṇaṃ svayam ।।

mahābhairavanirghoṣaṃ bhairavīmukhanisṛtam ।
gīyate yatra ta{t}stotraṃ ijyākāle varānane ।।

yoginyo mātarā lāmā śākinyo guhyakastathā ।
tatra tatra tu sānnidhyaṃ kurvate varavarṇini ।।

svadharmmapūtanādyānāṃ gotrāṇāṃ yatra dṛśyate ।
vīreśa śāsanasthānaṃ tatra siddhirna dūrataḥ ।।

yatra lekhyepi tiṣṭhaṃti kaṃkarudramahātape ।
tatra śmaśānapratyakṣā kimatoccāraṇena tu ।।

śarabhānā suvīrā ca vajribhārāsabhā tathā ।
cakravartti ca pauṇḍī ca khaḍbhakarṇā mahātapā ।।

cakkravegā mahāyāmyā subhadrā gajakarṇikā ।
carā vai somadevī ca gavākṣī vāyuvegagā ।।

airāvatī mahānāsā daṃṣṭrālī ca sukarkaśā ।
vedhanī ca tathā bhaṭṭā droṇā kākenakā tathā ।।

yatra nāmāni yogīnāṃ uccāryaṃte mahātape ।
tatra śmaśānabhūtāśca sānnidhyaṃ yāti tatkṣaṇāt ।।

vinyāsaṃ tu śmaśānānāṃ yoge devi śṛṇuṣvatha ।
kṛtvā śivoktamārgeṇa yoge nyāsaṃ varānane ।।

ṣaṭke catuṣke ca tathā saptake navakepi vā ।
tataḥ kuru mahābhāge pretālayasya veśmani ।।

vikīrṇaraudrabhasmaṃ tu kālaṣaḍkābhimaṃtritam ।
(202a)
śmaśānādhipatirdevi apasavyāṃ tato nyaset ।।

dakṣiṇena mahākālaṃ āgneye caiva vinyaset ।
pīṭheśa parvato nyasya naṃdimīśānadigdale ।।

uttare bhairavaṃ nyasya vāyavye marmakaṃ tathā ।
āgneye kṣetrapālaṃ tu paścimena bhayāvaham ।।

aṭṭahāsena tu nairṛtye betālā nityato nyaset ।
chagalaṃ kuṃbhavarṇaṃ ca hetukaṃ ca mahābalam ।।

piṃgalaṃ gajakarṇaṃ ca dantikaṃ bhṛkuṭīmukham ।
kailāsaṃ nāḍijaṃghaṃ ca gokarṇaṃ ca kapālinam ।।

daṃtikaṃ lohajaṃghaṃ tu ūrddhakeśaṃ mahāmukham ।
mahodaraṃ ca bhūteśaṃ bhṛṃgiṃ ca gaṇanāyakam ।।

jvālāmukhaṃ ca droṇaṃ ca nāmamaṃtrairniveśayet ।
aiti vṛkṣāṃ karajjaṃ ca paṭāśvatthastathaiva ca ।।

asti vṛkṣaṃ ca nisvaṃ ca tamālaṃ dhāribhadrakam ।
yāmyādyairnaiṛtāṃ taistu diśairvṛkṣāṃ samālikhet ।।

udvadhvanarapracchannāṃ kaṃkaṃ gṛddhasamākulam ।
ci{tā}bhirjvālyamānābhiḥ paritaḥ pariveṣṭitām ।।

dakṣiṇāgneyadikpatre vinyaset karavīrakam ।
hrī̃ bījena tu deveśi betālagaṇasaṃkulam ।।

prātyeśānadale sthāpya visargasahitena tu ।
śivenekā prakāndeva yogi yogamahākulaṃ ।।

udīcyāṃ vāyave patre kovīryaṃ ca niveśayet ।
kaśyapī naṃdanaṃ devi calabījena suvrate ।।

vāruṇe ca tadaṃtena bhairavena niveśayet ।
adhaśmaśānaṃ raudraṃ tu bhūtakoṭibhirāvṛtam ।।

yamaghaṃṭā karālā ca mahāvaktrā bhayānakā ।
bhīmakī kroṣṭrakī caiva ghaṃṭā prajvalitānanā ।।
(202b)

bhṛkuṭī vidyujihvā ca gokarṇī kuṃbhakarṇikā ।
viḍālī pūtanā caiva kramaṇī krāmaṇī tathā ।।

garjanī bhadrakālī ca vāyuvegā patadvalā ।
bhīmā ca kroṣṭakī caiva sumanā devakī tathā ।।

manovegā mahārāvā bhīmakī citrakānanā ।
parito maṃḍalaṃ atra mālāsragdāmabhūṣitām ।।

kapālai raktapūrṇaistu pibatryo rudhiraṃ bahuḥ ।
evaṃ śmaśānavinyāsaṃ maṃtrairvā dhyānajopi vā ।।

ekena vā ṣaḍaṃgānāṃ ekena varavarṇini ।
upahṛnmaṃtrabīje * sānedhyaṃ bhavate kṣaṇāt ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

siddhamaṃtrāstvayā deva noktā pūrvaṃ mamānaghe ।
yeṣāṃ smaraṇamātreṇa aiśvaryamupajāyate ।
yogo bhogaṃ ca deveśa tanmamācakṣva sāṃpratam ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

śṛṇu maṃtrapadāṃ devi aghoryāṃgavinisṛtā ।
aiśvaryaṃ bhavate devi yeṣāṃ saṃsmaraṇādapi ।।

dhṛtiyuktaḥ kulārūḍhaḥ śivaḥ praṇavapūrvakaḥ ।
ghoreśvari akārādyā kalā pūrvaśivastathā ।।

dviruccāre vilomaṃ tu tathaivoccārasaṃyutaḥ ।
hahahũ dahahũ caiva hũ phaḍantākṣarāṇi tu ।।

caturviṃśati maṃtrāyaṃ lakṣajāpā tu śaṃkari ।
yogikāyoktamaṃtrāṇi sarvāṇi kurute prabhuḥ ।।

haha praṇavapūrvaṃstu raṃjikāṃtaḥ sa eva tu ।
dviruccārā hakārāstu aṃde krurapadānvitaḥ ।।

amogha hṛdayaṃ devyā etadaṣṭākṣaraṃ param ।
hṛtsaṃkhyākṣaramatraistu sarvakarmakaraṃ param ।।

dvirabhyasta śivasyaiva bhairavānto varānane ।
(203a)
amṛtāṃto hakāraśca dviruccārastataḥ punaḥ ।।

phaḍantastārakā nyasya śire maṃtravarānane ।
pūrvoktena vibhāgena amoghaḥ sarvakarmakṛt ।।

haṃ he ha ha padaṃ pūrvaṃ hū̃ hrī̃ hū̃ haḥ dvitīyakam ।
ha ha phaḍantasaṃyuktaṃ tṛtīyaṃ tu padaṃ smṛtam ।।

daśaikākṣarasaṃyuktaṃ śikhāmaṃtravarānane ।
kathito yo vicitrāṇi karmāṇi kurute bhṛśam ।।

plīdliślīhaḥ padaṃ devi dānāṃtaṃ varavarṇini ।
devyā netraṃ mahābhāge sarvakarmakaraṃ smṛtam ।।

caturguṇakasya lasya hṛte * * khabhūṣito ।
aṃte ca bhairavo * * daiśikaśca dvirāhataḥ ।।

saivahe tena yuktastu kavacaṃ tu navākṣaram ।
rakṣāvidhāne sarvatra niyoktavyaṃ tu suvrate ।।

haraṃ hrī * visargāntapadaṃ praṇavapūrvakam ।
dvitīyāṃtavikalpābhimivasva tadanaṃtaram ।।

ha ha hũ phaṭcaturthaṃ tu ha hrī krūrapadānugam ।
krūrānta - padaṃ devi astramaṃtrasya sādhakam ।।

tadastraṃmaparaṃ devyā amoghaṃ śivabhāṣitam ।
ekaviṃśākṣaraṃ divyaṃ sarvakarmapravarttakam ।।

uṃ hũ durbharaṃ kuru jrū̃ drū kuṃ dhrūkkari sirjini jihi ha haḥ upahṛdaṃ padevyā sarvakarmakaram ।

ete maṃtrā mahādevi amoghā bhīmavikramā ।
tvayokto devadeveśi kiṃ bhūyaḥ paripṛcchasi ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
yoginīsaṃcāre sāmānyaviśeṣapaṭalaḥ ।। ।।
(203b)
devyuvāca ।।

tve yoktā devadeveśa ceṣṭāsamayapālane ।
ācāre{śa} tu yogīnāṃ jāyate siddhiruttamāḥ ।।

samayā kīdṛśā deva ācāraścaiva kīdṛśaḥ ।
kīdṛśā vā bhavecceṣṭā etadākhyā tu marhasi ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

samayāntāva vakṣyāmi yasmiṃ taṃtreṣu durlabhāḥ ।
śivāpanā paro devā ācāryo yaḥ sa eva tuḥ ।।

ye taṃtre guruvo devi sādhakāye mahāmate ।
yāni śāstrāṇi siddhāśca yoginyo yā divaṃgamaḥ ।।

na niṃdyā nāṣya vikṣipyāḥ pūjayettāṃ tu nityaśaḥ ।
trayasyā nyasya bhedasya etacchikṣetpadatrayam ।।

anyasmiṃ devatā saṃgo hāsyenāpi na kārayet ।
taṃtroktaṃ guru vā(cyaṃ)va vikalpairvāvatārayet ।।

viṣayeṣu lolupastiṣṭhe{nti} yamersnyapavāhinīm ।
samayācāraceṣṭāsu aprasādī sadā bhavet ।।

ātmānaṃ sarvataḥ paśyedadvetaparibhāvitaḥ ।
nārīcaryā samutthena saṃyamo vratapālanam ।।

tithau tithaivatakuyānniyamaiḥ paribhūṣitam ।
svavikalpena lāmānāṃ saṃpradāyati varttate ।।

śrotrasaṃcaraṇe caiva nityamakrodhano bhavet ।
ityaṣṭau samayā proktā lāmāvargasya siddhidā ।।

śākinīnāṃ maheśāni samayāṃ śṛṇu sāṃpratam ।
maprakāśe tu maṃtrāstu taṃtraṃ ca parivarjayet ।।

sarvajāpī samādhistho yajanaṃ caiva kārayet ।
nityameva smarennādaṃ raktabhojī śiverataḥ ।।

dakṣiṇāyanakāle tu samayā na vyatikramet ।
(204a)
- (pa)harenmaṃtrapūte tu paśukarmma aniṃdite ।।

svayonipīḍane caiva citto dvegaṃ na kārayet ।
svakulaṃ yatnato rakṣet kulasaṃcārasaṃkaram ।।

kramollaṃghitabhūteṣu padasthenāpi maṃtriṇā ।
yatnotsvacaryā karttavyā catvareṣu yaśasvini ।।

chidre kṣāṃtirna karttavyā bhairavācāradarśane ।
svakule paragotre vā śāntacittassadā bhavet ।।

kāśyapījanavargasya vāṅmanaḥ kāyakarmabhiḥ ।
dadyāt svāgatacādyargha prajāṃ sarvatra kārayet ।।

bhakṣayedyogibhissārddhaṃ triṣaṣṭikulanaṃdanam ।
naivedyaṃ yadviśiṣṭaṃ tu tadviśeṣeṇa dāpayet ।।

svacakkrepi varārohe bhairavī yatnadāpayet ।
atha dadyā tu nānyatra deyaṃ bhīmavarādṛte ।।

naivedyaṃ saṃkaro devi mahāsiddhivighātajam ।
tasmādyatnena rakṣeta yogeśī phalakāṃkṣibhiḥ ।।

vṛthā na prāṇināṃ hanyācchākinī vratamāśritaiḥ ।
anyatra upahārādi vṛthā vā karṣaye tṛtam ।।

dūtyarthena niyukto vā yoge prāptā vasuṃdharāṃ ।
tāṃ saṃpradāpalobhena ullaṃghya patate dhruvam ।।

ityeta samayāṃ devi kāliṣaṭke mahātape ।
āropitānāṃ bhūteśi śākinīnāṃ mayoditā ।।

adhunā saṃpravakṣyāmi yogīnāṃ yogasiddhidā ।
prātarutthāya nityaṃ hi upaspṛśya prayatnataḥ ।।

guruṃ pūjyaṃ natiṃ kṛtvā pūjānyatra tataḥ kuru ।
parokṣepi pare cakkre dhyātvā pūjyaṃ ca suvrate ।।

karoti yāni karmāṇi siddhyaṃte tasya tāni tu ।
ācārya dehamāśritya yasmājjñānaṃ varānane ।।
(204b)
śivo dadāti bhūteśa tasmāntaṃ pūjayetsadā ।
bhrātaropi sadā pūjyaṃ yannādyai cakkravarttinaḥ ।।

yathākulānudhena * śeṣānāmapi kārayet ।
bhaginyoryā svagotrasthāḥ paragotropi yā sthitā ।।

āpatsu nanyetāṃstu svacaryā ca sa sadā kuru ।
āpadasthe samevante saṃpadāsu tathaiva ca ।।

* * * sarvāvasthāsu samaduḥkhasukhī bhavet ।
tatra yo dviṣate nityaṃ svasantānāparo bhuvi ।।

yaḥ palāyati taṃ cārtho sa kaṃbaṃdhu varānane ।
avrataghno sadā vaṃdye śaṃkhapūkho yaśasvini ।।

triṣaṣṭhike pade svaśi vrataṃ teṣāṃ nirodhanam ।
na niṃdyanmadyamāṃsāni catvareṣu balikṣipet ।।

mattonmattaṃ vivastraṃ ca pramattanmūḍhacetasām ।
vijragupsedvarārohe pathikaṃ pathipūjayet ।।

ātithyaṃ raṇaputreṣu vratineṣu ca kārayet ।
ātithistaṃ mahābhāge śeṣādravyāpahārakāḥ ।।

abhiyutkassadā devi varedraudrāsu bhūmiṣu ।
nityanaimittikaṃ karmasavāntāṃścaiva kārayet ।।

gṛhodarepi deveśi jāgraṃ tiṣṭhaṃ svapaṃ bhramam ।
kalpayitvā śmaśānena sarvakāryeṣu varttayet ।।

chidraghātyatsasaṃbaṃdhā mahākālī surakṣitaḥ ।
viśvarūpadharo devi nādabiṃdumayaḥ sadā ।।

paśyannapi mahābhāge ātmānaṃ sarvayogiṣu ।
tathāpi gūḍhayekṣmasnādyāgādanyatra śāṃkarāt ।।

maṃtragūḍhavratācāra ātmaśaktiprakāśaret ।
nākhyāpayedvivāde ca taṃtrārthenna ca kārayet ।।

digvāsā devatā pūjāṃ kārayecchaktinā saha ।
(205a)
yadi pramādā kṣubhyeta nadābrahmamatu smaret ।।

arcayeta śivolūkāṃ na dviṣennaktajīvikām ।
hṛṣṭātmā kātako sarvā nityamevābhivaṃdayet ।।

vratalopo na karttavyaṃ gotrādanyatra suvrate ।
mahākṛṣṭivirodhopi devīnāṃ śāsane sthitaḥ ।।

mahāpātakasaṃyogaśivavākyekadarśanāt ।
laṃghavaṃ samayānāṃ ca cāryā ceṣṭā vyatikramāt ।।

vāmācāreṇa vartteta sarvakarmasu suvrate ।
devatājyopahāreṇa mālānāṃ saṃgame tathā ।।

madhyamārūḍhacakkrāṇāṃ samayāste mayoditāḥ ।
gotracāraḥ kulaceṣṭāṃ kathayāmi tavādhunā ।।

mahāyoge mahādevi sarvagotra samāgame ।
vaiguṇyaṃ caiva ceṣṭāsu ālāpena na kārayet ।।

caryāceṣṭā paśubhraṣṭa paśudānena sivyati ।
paṃcāmṛte mahāyogi bhraṣṭavāgvā viśudhyati ।।

vāci yatnastu karttavya tasmānnityaṃ varānane ।
ācare ca mahābhāge siddhikāmastu sādhakaiḥ ।।

yogeśānāṃ mahātāte gocarāḥ saptakīrttitāḥ ।
brahmā rudrakumāraśca viṣṇu pretāpatistathā ।।

idrasya iśvaraścaiva sraṣṭāmātrigaṇasya tu ।
kamaṃḍalu triśūlaṃ ca cakkraṃ śaktistathaiva ca ।।

daṇḍaṃ vajraṃ kapālaṃ ca gotramudrā prakīrttitā ।
etā mudrā maheśāni vīreśasya samāgame ।।

haṃso vṛtrau mayūraśca yakṣarājo mahāmate ।
mahiṣau kulasiṃhaśca mātrīṇāṃ kulajā imā ।।

yoginīnāṃ kulānīha dvātriṃśadi varānane ।
teṣāṃ saptapradhānāni mahāṃti varavarṇini ।।
(205b)
padmā manoramā caiva namaskāraḥ saraṃjikā ।
kapālaṃ caiva khaṭvāṃgaṃ triśūlaṃ daṃḍameva ca ।।

yogī kulānāṃ sarveṣāṃ etanmudrāṣṭakaṃ bhavet ।
yogī kulāni taireva pradhānairgaṇitāni tu ।।

saṃkhyā tapakulānāṃ tu tāsāṃ mudrā śṛṇuṣṭathā ।
śaṃkhaṃ cakkraṃ gadā śūlaṃ khaḍbhaṃ pāśaṃ kkrameṇa tu ।।

karttarī śṛṃkhalā śakti vajrakheṭakatomaram ।
etāssamīpagotrāṇāṃ kulamudrāḥ prakīrttityaḥ ।।

saṃkīrṇānāṃ mahābhāge kulamudrā śṛṇuṣvatha ।
hariṇā nāsikā śakti patākā kalaśā śilā ।।

karṇāmoṭī śikhā caiva jaṭī kuṃḍalinī tathā ।
calato karṇamudrā ca saṃkīrṇa kulanāyikā ।।

prakāśayaṃti deveśi mudraitā gotrajāṃ gaṇām ।
prabuddhacakkrasaṃsthasya dvidvibhāgo mahātape ।।

mātrīṇāṃ kramayogena pūrvādyāḥ parikīrttitāḥ ।
vīreśo iśadigbhāge cakkranyāsaṃ prakalpayet ।।

anena kramayogena kulānyapakulāni ca ।
saṃkīrṇāni vibhinnāni sthāpaye yonipīḍane ।।

bhairaveśasya cakkrasya vinyase karṇikodare ।
jñātvā kramaṃ tataḥ pūjāṃ kuru māhātmyaṃ yogataḥ ।।

nābhicakkraṃ tu kālasya hṛdayaṃ madhyamasya ca ।
prasādasya bhruvormadhya śrīkaṃṭhasya tathaiva ca ।।

lalāṭāṃntaṃ smṛtaṃ sthānaṃ vyomamārge sadāśivam ।
tārādi cakkramadhe tu bhairaveyaṃ paraṃ smṛtam ।।

mahābhairavadevasya tatorddhaṃ yogasiddhitam ।
ālayaḥ sarvasidvīnāṃ brahmādīnāṃ sureśvari ।।
(206a)
kulacakkrasya vinyāso gotraputrastathaiva ca ।
ṣa(ṭkrai)stu gotrabhedā(ni) kathayaṃti yaśasvini ।।

anābheruntarāgāṇāṃ saṃsparśātsiddhiruttamām ।
kathayaṃti mahābhāge adhoṅgo adharastathā ।।

niruddhāṃganirodhaṃ tu maitremekāṃgadarśanai ।
sāmasāmyaṃ mahāvairaṃ ūrddhādhobhāgadarśane ।।

vāyvagniyonijairvākyairmaṃtrī vāruṇapārthivaiḥ ।
tathaiva nirdiśeddevi amaitrairvaṃ parītajaiḥ ।।

asevaddhairasaṃbaddhaṃ arthahīnaiḥ nirarthakam ।
svārthake svārthakavidvirdūrā yāmena kiṃcana ।।

abhidhūmitapadaiḥ pīḍā jvalitaistu mahādbhayam ।
ālikheccaiva saṃbaddhaṃ yeṣāṃ bhāṣā viceṣṭitaiḥ ।।

nṛtyataistu namaskāraṃ svāhāṃtermānamādiśet ।
huṃkārāṃtaiḥ padaṃ bhedaṃ phaḍantasmaraṇādikam ।।

tuṣṭiśāṃtistathā puṣṭistārakāṃtaiḥ samādiśet ।
praśnabhedodayaṃ caiva nirghaṭapadapaddhatim ।।

yoginī kāśyapīnāṃ ca jñāpakā śṛṇu sāṃpratam ।
rāmehīracalāḥ śroti praśnoyaṃ prathamo mataḥ ।।

śayayogo mayā adya dvitīyaḥ parikīrttitaḥ ।
dravyaṃ idraṃ nilapitte tilāmāce tṛtīyakam ।।

caturthopanaye bhīme calane girate vilaḥ ।
paṣimā saptamā jāntaṃ jaṃbhastaṃ bhakṣvakāmi ca ।।

cūrbhedyo paṃcamaṃ praśnaṃ kathitastava suvrate ।
ete prāsāruhā tvāniṣadyastu parikīrttitaḥ ।।

iti kīlaruhā yogaṃ yogāni saptamaḥ param ।
eta vyādhiprasuptiśca phenemene dvimīmati ।।

aṣṭame devi durbhedyaḥ praśno yogeśvarairapi ।
(206b)
timīdivitalāṃgāni * vīvimīnamīnalā ।।

gamaneti mahāpraśno navamo durgamaḥ paraḥ ।
kinī mahāsunī mahā nārāsine narāsakṛt ।।
karākṣariṇi daśamo mātrīṇāmapi ca tathā ।

durbhedyoyaṃ mahāpraśnaḥ ।

yoni saśeṣataruhadeśe mapūraptanaṃdurudaham ।
nāhatamāneti tathā ekadaśamo mahāpraśna ।
adhvākāmā mahāghore paiśācaṃ saṃskṛtaṃ vadet ।।

voḍhayāpyadya bhedoyaṃ prathamasya varānane ।
nāstaṃbhito mayāmasyā dvitīyasya prabhedane ।।

pibāmyadyastrabhaṃgi vā tṛtīyasya vibhedanam ।
avakāragatā lāmā ebhikhicchāti suvrate ।।

caturthasya tu deveśi bhedanaṃ parikīrttitam ।
janmasaptakasapnukto eṣa nāmatra modakaḥ ।।

bhakṣayāmyadya etyeti paṃcamasya varānane ।
prasādaśikharārūḍhavilaṃghyaṃ cutivikṣaṇam ।।

maṃtrāṃ manoramā lakṣāṃ āgamiṣyatya tatparaḥ ।
mahāsiddhimahāghoraṃ gaganena mahātape ।।

gatvā tu mātuṣārūḍhā agamiṣyati saptame ।
prāṇa jaṃtu nareṃdrasya pivāmīdyaṣṭame smṛtaḥ ।।

surālaye nagārūḍhā gaṃdhogā navamasya tu ।
mahānāsā caraśate mṛto tasya tu rocanam ।।

gṛhītvā tasya kāṣṭhasya āgacchāmo parasya tu ।
iti praśnāśca bhedāśca yoginīnāṃ samāgame ।।

kathitāṃ tava deveśi guhyādguhyatarāḥ parāḥ ।
atiguhyatarā devi śṛṇu bhāṣāvikalpanam ।।

abhivādana viśeti nārisīteti svāgatam ।
(207a)
lāsabhā iti mātā tu bhāminī bhāginī smṛtā ।।

duhinī duhitetpāśuḥ śvaśrūbhiḥ samanī viduḥ ।
nīminīmiti bhrātṛjyā patnī tu sunaye tathā ।।

mātṛjye mātulaḥ prokto pīḍimistho vitā tathā ।
triminīti tathā taptā naptā vīlusīti pītā mahat ।।

manāmahepi lapite tu noniḥ parikīrttitāḥ ।
āperīśaṃ surabhaktā āpīsīṣa kṣīrā mucyate ।।

divī dadhilimaṃ ājyaṃ drekaraṃ bhojanaṃ tathā ।
dumagūḍhastu vijñeyo japamītīti svāminī ।।

pibāmīti etire ceti āgata * * * * ḥ ।
nigānineṣī gacchāmi suraktaṃ suptamucyate ।।

uptavijyemīvinakā bhāṣā nilīnītigī tathā ।
adhvakāyo samudrasya anānī pṛthivī smṛtā ।।

ūrūkā parvatā devi saptaddhepāsinī tathā ।
adhenāsu surā jñeyā nagarāstridaśā smṛtāḥ ।।

piśitāla tathā sādhyā subhujāstu paśāvarā ।
urthanogā tathā pakṣī ḍhiḍhilā hastimastathā ।।

nukaṃjavā tathā aśvā anīḍastu ajaṃ viduḥ ।
gardabho khagaraḥ proktā gāvaḥ srote javāntathā ।।

mahiṣa atu japā devi uṣṭromīne dvirastathā ।
puranmāsāstathā vyāghraṃ śīrakolo mṛgastathā ।।

sahinītā tathā sarpakahi śeṣavijātayaḥ ।
yajñikānāṃ varārohe dravyasaṃgrahaṇaṃ smṛtam ।।

parasparavirodhena eṣāṃ caiva mahānagha ।
utpadyaṃte sahasrāṇi svabhāvācāragāṇi tu ।।

yoginī rūpiṇī lāmā śākinī hīṇālinī khagī ।
(207b)
cūlivilātrī khagagāpeśi dohinījalā ।
revatī vedhanī lūkī paḍabhī raktinīhiṣā ।।

karoṭī kāluśī bhadrā duṃdubhī mukharā turā ।
caturviṃśati nāmāni lāmānāṃ paribhāṣaṇe ।।

piśitaṃ phalguṣaṃ māṃsaṃ ye śāvaṃ rākṣasāśanam ।
ṛrvaṃ pavitraṃ sarvasva prāṇijaṃ dehavāriṇam ।।

dravaṃ picchilakaṃ prāṇaṃ jasauraja maṃtrakam ।
karaṃ pītaṃ tathā śvetaṃ daśamaṃ rudhiraṃ smṛtam ।।

kāṣṭhaṃ śapaṃ mṛtaṃ suptaṃ asaṃskāraṃ citātmajam ।
śataprāṇamanāmaṃ ca vimuktaṃ pretalakṣaṇam ।।

śūnyaṃ samānasaṃsthānaṃ kledāvāsaṃ mṛtasya tu ।
bhakṣa kṣuṣa khadaṃ pibaṃ bhukṣaṃ * * aśehradam ।।

prāṣyaṃ voḍhaṃ ca etāni daśanāmāni bhakṣaṇe ।
pretālayaṃ mahāghoraṃ śmaśānaṃ niśibhūṣaṇam ।।

sarvojā śeṣaṇaṃ bhīṣaṃ caṇḍarākṣasadhāmakam ।
dīpanaṃ caiva bhāṣaṃ ca aṃdhākāraṃ tamotkaṭam ।।

lāmāvāsaṃ mahāsiddhiṃ śatajyoti śatajvalam ।
śivālayaṃ tu deveśi śmaśānaṃ parikīrttitam ।।

guhyādguhyataraṃ manyaṃ siddhikhātā śṛṇuṣvatha ।
nāpumāsīstriyā devi pustaṃ bhukṣva ca bhakṣaṇam ।।

samātājīśvasma pheti patnī * * śikhaṃ dvṛtaṃḥ ।
lasaṃtaplī tathā raktaṃ bhīmāṃsaṃ pheco kuryām ।।

dāśritaṃcī tathā yogī nāmālāsmīti rūpiṇī ।
kuru śākinī dureti alpāṃ cullī mahāṣutham ।।

kṣāṃ yāgāṃrṇaṃ tathā devi vijñeyamabhivādanam ।
ekākṣarā samullāpā ete mātrigaṇasya tu ।।

bhāvinī dadhibhāvīnāṃ strīṇāṃ rūpāṇi suvrate ।
(208a)
yāni tāni pravakṣyāmi śṛṇuṣveka manādhunā ।।

mṛṇāla saurā yā nārī padmapattrāyate kṣaṇā ।
sitavastrapriyā nityaṃ navacaṃdana(naṃ)dhinī ।।

śivagoṣṭhīratā caiva sā jñeyā śivagotrajā ।
taptahemasamābhāsā raktapītāmbarapriyā ।।

jātī calpakagaṃdhāḍhyā sā jñeyā brahmagocarā ।
yā caiveṃdīvaraśyāmā nīlagaṃdhāṃvarapriyā ।।

nīlotpalasugaṃdhā ca vaiṣṇavī gotrajā tu sā ।
yā caṃdrabhāryā gaurābhā yoṇḍakarī kadalācchavi ।।

mṛṇālagaṃdhā satataṃ aitrī gotrā tu sā smṛtā ।
raktagorā tu yā nārī raktavastrāstu rūpiṇī ।।

mallikotpalagaṃdhā ca kaumārī gotrajā hi sā ।
pītaśyāmā ca yā nārī śubhavarṇāmbarapriyā ।।

śirīṣapuṣpā gaṃdhā ca vārāhī gotrajā tu sā ।
āpītā pītavarṇābhā pītavarṇāṃbarapriyā ।।

karpūragaṃdhā satataṃ bhairavī gotrajā hi sā ।
saptaitāni mayoktāni yogīṇānāṃ kulāni tu ।।

adhunā saṃpravakṣyāmi samayī jñāyate yathā ।
vācavedhena kathaye svamudrā varṇasaṃkathā ।।

kulavidyākṣaraṃ cāsyo saṃkarā tu careti yaḥ ।
badhnāti ca svako mudrāṃ nāma vaktisvagotrajām ।।

vāmena yāti nārīṇāṃ vāmānāṃ dakṣiṇena tu ।
vāmahastaprabhāṣī ca vāmadṛṣṭyāvalokataḥ ।।

ālave hṛṣṭasaṃtuṣṭasamayī sobhidhīyate ।
kulabījairvadetkiṃcicālaṃ ca kulaputrake ।।

kulakriyāṃ na tyajeta svakīyāṃ codaye kṣirām ।
(208b)
japate kulajāṃ vidyāṃ samayī cuṃbakastu saḥ ।।

vāmārūḍhanamaskāraṃ badhvā vā kastvasannatām ।
praṇāmaṃ saṃgame yāṃti tāḥ savīḥ susthitāḥ khagāḥ ।।

vāmāṃguṣṭhaṃ nikhanyāśu kurute dhṛtilekhanam ।
śiraḥ kaṃḍūyanaṃ cāpi tiryadṛgvāmapāṇinā ।।

veṣṭitācārasamayaiḥ svāvidyāṃ tu parasparam ।
kathayaṃti svakairbhāvairbhāvaśeṣā sthitāḥ khagāḥ ।।

gaṃḍe vāci(tu)ke vāpi nāsāgne vāpi suvrate ।
dantāṃgulitiryadṛṣṭi japaṃ vidyāṃ nirīkṣayem ।।

sadbhāvatā maheśāni kathayaṃti parasparam ।
durlabhā kāśyapī varge paṃcāmṛtaviva(rddhi)tā ।।

rūpikā cūṃbikā lāmā parāvṛttāthapālikā ।
anivarttā ca hṛdvedhī janmāṃtarasamudbhavā ।।

etāstu saṃgame naiva parāṃ siddhiṃ dadaṃti ca ।
vikhyāti raktamādau tu srūbhaṃgaḥ kurute tataḥ ।।

saṃhṛtyarthayamādāya paścācca punanmarśayet ।
iṣṭa vā yadi vā tiṣṭhaṃ ālāpe nāpi cuṃbati ।।

cuṃbikā sānuvijñeyā yoginī baladarpitā ।
tiryadṛgbhṛkuṭī vaktrā bhrūkṣepaistarjayedyatha ।।

niśvasairbhairavaistāntu lāmā tāṃstadvinirdiśet ।
vividhāni tu rūpāṇi saṃgame kurute hi yā ।।

savyājaṃ trāpayetrastrāṃ parāvṛttā hi saṃskṛtā ।
protphullanayanānityaṃ vra - ṣṭā gūḍhasatkriyā ।।

gatā gatiṃ prakurute sāśaṃkaṃ varttate cadyā ।
caṃcalā corddhadṛṣṭiśca bālikāṃ tāṃ vinidiśet ।।

manodṛṣṭyā ca bharaṇā loṣṭakā caraṇena vā ।
(209a)
paṭāṃte nāthakāṣṭhena yayā dṛṣṭo na jīvati ।।

anivattīṃ vijānīyādasādhyā sā hi kīrttitā ।
anyāvyādhisamutthena videśena pāpaśum ।।

yajñe sayājyaṃ kurute vedhinī tāṃ vinirdiśet ।
ācāraṃ samayāṃ ceṣṭāṃ yogeśānāṃ tu lakṣaṇam ।।

kathitaṃ sarahasyaṃ te siddhācāraṃ śṛṇuṣvatha ।
nādabiṃdukalādhyāyī viśvarūpamayāḥ sava ।।

nirācārapade līto avadhūvatanusthitaḥ ।
paṃcagavyāśino mūko vadhirāṃdha iva sthitaḥ ।।

aniruddho niruddhātmā muṃḍadhārīti yāmalī ।
sagaḥ sarveṣu bhūteṣu viḍālī vratamāśritaḥ ।।

paṃcaviṃśakalādhāraḥ ṣaṭpadaḥ ṣaṭpadekṣaṇaḥ ।
sarvopahārasaṃpanno daśamārgāvalokakaḥ ।।

triṣaṣṭivratasaṃcācī na vaktrālayaḥ sadā * ।
supte jāgraṃ svayaṃ jāgre sauṣupte ubhayātmakaḥ ।।

mahāmṛtyujayāntastha amṛteḥ śaktibhirvinā ।
sarvatra paśyanenmāna sarvamātmani paśyati ।।

sarvatra bhojya bhoktā ca sarvacakkrāntadīpakaḥ ।
kāle paṃcakalākālaṃ prabuddhapadasaṃsthitaḥ ।।

devatā tithi ṣaṭkeṣu buddhyamāno mahātape ।
aprabuddhāviviṣaye vijñānapaśupālane ।।

pratyāhāreṣvasaṃmūḍhā nāḍī cakkrādayātmake ।
ādidevamaye cakṣu śrotraṃ rudrātmakaṃ sadā ।।

mukhodaraṃ kalāvyāptaṃ śarīraṃ viśvaceṣṭayā ।
kalayā teja saddhāraṃ nityaṃ pathe mahātape ।।

mahāvratatarasyāpi somahā bhairavasvayam ।
svargakriyātmako yastu jñānātmā svarganāśane ।।
(209b)
sthitāvagūḍho deveśi bhairavassa tu nāyakaḥ ।
śaktīnāmuparodhena yakkaroti śubhāśubham ।।

svatatropi mahābhāge vīreśaḥ sa sadāśivaḥ ।
jñānavijñānasaṃpūrṇo mahāmāyā vimohitaḥ ।।

ātmānaṃ na vijānāti śrīkaṃṭhassa tu nāyakaḥ ।
raudryaśaktaikarūpasthaḥ saṃhārātmā mahātmane ।।

tamasaṃ nāśayet sarva trailokya sa hṛdastu saḥ ।
śaktīnāṃ vaśago nityaṃ śaktimārgāvalaṃbakaḥ ।।

śaktyādayena karute karmayaḥ satu madhyamaḥ ।
yastu kālakalāṃ taṃtrattejasī tanumāśritaḥ ।।

harate prāptakālepi prāṇaṃ sakala ucyate ।
svacakkroskaṃ kulācāraṃ yo vijā{nā}ti kevalam ।।

bhakti māṃ kulapūtaśca daiśakassa tu nāyakaḥ ।
balādākramyamaṃtraistu tatkālaṃ śaktibhistrayaḥ ।।

kriyate nāyakā bhāve punarbhūnāyakastu saḥ ।
ajñānakhyāpakastaṃtrai gūḍhācāraṃ nigūhyati ।।

traimārgasya praśaṃsīta siddhācāraḥ sa daiśikaḥ ।
mudrāśaṃkhasusantaddho aṣṭabhiḥ parivāritaḥ ।।

vicaraidraudrabhūmistha siddhācāraḥ parastu saḥ ।
kapālī netramudrā ca kha(ddhā)ḍbhaṃ ca mahātape ।।

daṃṣṭrā jaṭā tathā vaktraṃ mudrā saṃrakṣaṇe hatāḥ ।
triśūlaṃ paṃkajaṃ cakkraṃ śaktivajraṃ tathaiva ca ।।

daṇḍaṃ śūlaṃ kṣurīṃ caiva dūtimudrāgaṇasmṛtaḥ ।
eteṣāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ devi karmmakhapravadāmyaham ।।

arddhāṃguli karāṃ kṛtvā nigvamaṃdhyaṃ varānane ।
ekahastapālasya dvihastaṃ yāmalasmṛtāḥ ।।

rudhirākarṣaṇā yojya staṃbhane māraṇe tathā ।
(210a)
pada pracārikābhaiva ākāśagamane hitā ।।

muṣṭibaddhā tu nāmena uddhamaṃguṣṭhakaṃ sthitam ।
adhomukho lalāṭastho netramudrāḥ prakīrttitāḥ ।।

anayā baddhayā yogī divyadriṣṭiḥ prajāyate ।
yaśvate sarvasiddhāstu yogināṃ vaśamānayet ।।

aṃgapradeśavinyastaḥ suśirāntaṃ sa eva tu ।
arddhāguṣṭhasthito nityaṃ mudrā khaṭvāṃgasaṃbhavā ।।

eṣā tu sarvabhūtānāṃ staṃbhane viniyojayet ।
parivarttane ca rūpasya yogaridvau catuvrate ।।

daṃṣṭrābhāge sthitau ddhautu tarjanyau kuṃcitau mukhe ।
daṃṣṭrāmudreti vikhyātā sarvasattvajighāṃsanī ।।

saṃhāre sarvajaṃtūnāṃ devadānavamānuṣām ।
staṃbhane caiva sainyānāṃ yojayeṣā mahātape ।।

aṃguṣṭhena tarjanī yukto śeṣaiḥ sarvairnikuṃcitaiḥ ।
ssvaśirehākeretaustu jaṭāmudretivaśrutā ।।

yadi krodhena saṃdīpto jaṭāmudrāṃ sabaṃdhati ।
trailokyaṃ saṃharet sarvaṃ kiṃ punamaṃnujā bhuvi ।।

parasparāgrasaṃliṣṭau tarjanya sa kaniṣṭhikau ।
nivarttitakarau patre kṛtvā jihvāviloḍayet ।।

śeṣāṃguṣṭhamamātrātā hāhākārantataḥ kuru ।
samākhyātā vaktramudrā mahāsaṃhārakārikā ।।

mudrāṣaḍaṃgadeveśi kathitaṃ rakṣaṇāhitam ।
śaktimudrāṣṭakā devi lakṣaṇe saṃti bodhataḥ ।।

daṇḍavattiścalo bhūtvā karṇamūle karasthitau ।
śūlaṃ - drudrarūpasyādalaye huṃkṛtastrayam ।।

karāvabhimukho bhūtvā maṇibaṃdhanipīḍitau ।
aṃgulyasahitā sarvā namāgrā padma ucyate ।।

vāmāṃguṣṭhasthitā bhūtvā dakṣiṇasya karasya tu ।
(210b)
vinyāse tarjanī recya śarīraṃ cakkra ucyate ।।

śarīrasyorddhena tau syātāṃ bhujāvānyonya pīḍitāg ।
sarvavighnahārī hyeṣā śaktimudrāḥ prakīrttitāḥ ।।

pāśyo kaniṣṭhikāṃguṣṭhā niyojyā nyāsasaṃsthitāḥ ।
aṃgulyāgreṣu saṃdhisthā vajramūrddhā paraṃti ca ।।

jānupārśve karau sthāpya pādau cānyonya saṃhitau ।
śiraḥ kampa mukhasphoṭe daṃḍe * sarvakarmadhṛt ।।

muṣṭiḥ karābhyāṃ saṃpīḍya pāṇimekaṃtaracyutam ।
anya dṛṣṭinyathākrāntaṃ pyūlaṃ sadyatareṇa tu ।।

karamadhyenuyāṃgulya stadhvauṅgulya varānane ।
saṃhātavarjanī caiva kṣuro ghorīśvarī priyaḥ ।।

etā mudrā mahābhāge nityaṃ sānedyaṃ kārikā ।
baṃdhamaṃtreṇa deveśi śaktīnāṃ tu mahātape ।।

ityeṣa kathito devi tavācāro mahātape ।
sarahasyopacārastu kiṃ bhūyaḥ kathayāmi te ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
yoginīsaṃcāre samayācāraceṣṭāvidhānaḥ paṭalaḥ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

aṣṭake navakaṃ deva saviśeṣaṃ tvayoditaṃ ।
aṣṭakaṃ ca maheśāna yathācakkrakramā sthitam ।।

yāni ṣaṭkāni deveśa yoginīnāṃ tvayoditā ।
utpattisthitināśeṣu te mayā nāvadhāritāḥ ।।

mātarassaptadeveśa aṣṭavīrasamanvitāḥ ।
navabhairavasaṃyuktā ādisūtre pracoditā ।।

(211a)
etāstu yā sthitā ṣaṭke yoginyo baladarpitāḥ ।
kiṃ devatā stutā deva vividhā tāsu kīdṛśaḥ ।।

kathamutpannāḥ kathaṃ yojyā ke matrāḥ koparovidhiḥ ।
kathaṃ vā karmmaṃ kurvaṃti vīreśasteṣu ko bhavet ।।

digvigāne cakkrasthāḥ kathaṃ nāḍyodaye sthitā ।
karmāṇi sādhayaṃtyetā etadākhyā tu marhasi ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

yathā devāsure yuddhe dānavā nirjitā suraiḥ ।
mātarotyāditā devi viditaṃ tattvayā purā ।।

yoṣidatto varastāsāṃ nihataistairmahāsuraiḥ ।
rudreṇa bhīmarūpeṇa pratyakṣaṃ devi tattava ।।

tatastā asurā hatvā varadānaṃ pradarpitāḥ ।
tāṃ tiraskṛtya deveśi kumāre haṃtumudyatā ।।

tato mayā niyuktasya paśutve ṣaṇmukhasya tu ।
rakṣāṃ kṛtvā mahāvīryairvidyāṃgairvaravarṇini ।।

agaṇitvā tu tāṃ rakṣāṃ vidyāṃgakulasaṃbhavān ।
kārttiko yasya deveśi balitā vadarā balāt ।।

ṣaṭsuteṣu mahābhāge mukheṣu baladarpitāḥ ।
ṣaḍyoginyo padāṃgānāṃ utpannāḥ kālacakkragāḥ ।।

tatastai stambhayitvā vrataccakkraṃ ghorarūpiṇam ।
mātarāṇāṃ mahābhāge tāḥ sarvā vaśagāḥ kṛtāḥ ।।

tato arcā kṛtā tāsāṃ balavīryaparākramāt ।
hṛtavīryā tatastāsu mamaiva śaraṇaṃ gatāḥ ।।

puraḥkṛto mayā tāsāṃ mātarāṇāmanugraham ।
mamaiva sannidhānena yatkarmmaḥ sādhayiṣyatha ।।

tatsarvameva yuṣmākaṃ sadāsiddhiṃ prayāsyati ।
(211b)
tadā prabhṛti vīreśo aṣṭamohaṃ tu saptake ।।

navama ṣaḍyogisaṃbaddha cakkramadhya tu bhairavaḥ ।
evaṃ devi samutpannā ṣaḍyoginyo mahābalā ।।

ṣaḍaṃgasya madīyasya kumārāṃga sthitasya tu ।
raudraṃ somyaṃ kalājālaṃ tāṃ tiraskṛtya suvrate ।।

sadāśivākhyaṃ ca padaṃ trailokyaṃ haṃtumudyatāḥ ।
tato mayā vibhūtena taiḥ kumārasya śaktibhiḥ ।।

mahābhairava devasya saṃsmṛtā pośaśaktayaḥ ।
upasthitā tatastāstu susaumyā divyarūpiṇaḥ ।।

vīṇāhastā mahābhāgā pāśāṃkuśapuraḥsarāḥ ।
sakiṃkarā {sa}dūtyastu divyairmadhuranisvanaiḥ ।।

mohayaṃti tu taṃ cakkraṃ yoginīnāṃ mahābalam ।
śāstādyaiḥ saukhyarūpastu caturbhiḥ ṣaḍvaśīkṛtāḥ ।।

u{pa}sarjya kumāreṇa mahatābhivaśīkṛtā ।
evamukto maheśāni yoginībhistadāmyaham ।।

sāṃprataṃ kathayāmāsa deva vārttā bhaviṣyati ।
yadā tvayaiva lokāni tiṣidvānātha varvate ।।

upasaṃhṛtya vīryāṇi tadā tva{t} śaraṇaṃ gatāḥ ।
avanīyā tatomanyastāsāṃ devi yathākramam ।।

kathitāni rahasyāni yoginīnāṃ mahātape ।
śaktyā bhedastu parayā krīḍante śaktayottamāḥ ।।

jñānakriyārūpagatā tāsāṃ devaḥ sadāśivaḥ ।
biṃdunādakalāmūlaṃ paracakre tu saṃsthitam ।।

śaktitrayaṃ tejarūpaṃ tannetra traya * mayā ।
tvanme hi śāṃtyādyai śaktibhiryai mahābalāḥ ।।

digvibhāgodayasthāni samavaktrāṇi tāni tu ।
(212a)
vidyādhipo brahmaśiraṃ rudrāṇī sapuru(ṣṭra)tam ।।

mahāpāśupataṃ netra ṣaṇāmāṃgāni yāni tu ।
śakticakkraṃ samutpannaṃ saṃhārākṣararūpadhṛt ।।

mamāṣṭau mūrttaye yastu mātarāstāṃ parāparā ।
mayaivadhiṣṭhitāḥ sarvā krīḍaṃte bhuvanecchayā ।।

uttarottarabhāvena balamevāparāparam ।
siddhiśca vividhākārā śaktayo karmakheva hi ।।

kimatramatyunākāyaṃ ahamevātra kāraṇam ।
evaṃ saṃcodayitvā saṃrvātāṃ matyunirbharām ।।

svaśaktijñānasadbhāvā karmeṣu viniyojitā ।
evamevā samutpannā ṣaḍyoginyo mahātape ।
nāḍīcakkravibhāgena āsāṃ karmaṃ śṛṇuṣvatha ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
yoginīsaṃcāre kālaca(kkra)ṣaṭkotpattiḥ - - - - - paṭalaḥ ।। ।।

।। - - - - ।।

yadādekāṃgasaṃbhūtā mātarāḥ surapūjitāḥ ।
ṣaḍyoginīnāṃ deveśa kathitā cāsane sthitā ।।

va(ktre)bhyaḥ kārttikeyasya nirgatā(stā)stu yoditāḥ ।
brahmādīnāṃ sureśānāṃ utpannā mātarā vibhoḥ ।।

aiśvaryayogasiddhaṃ ca calaṃ ca surapūjitaḥ ।
mātrīṇāṃ muttaraṃ tāsāṃ saṃśayaṃ me katha prabho ।।

ekākṣarā viniṣkrāṃtā ṣaṭprakārā kathaṃ vibhoḥ ।
maṃtrastāsāṃ samutpannā nāḍī caiva anekadhā ।
diśāsu vasusaṃkhyāsu etadākhyātumarhasi ।। ।।
(212b)
bhairava uvāca ।।

tejorāśirmamavapurjñānaśaktimayo paraḥ ।
yo dhruvastasya saṃbhūtaḥ kārttikeyo mahābalaḥ ।।

mamāpi rakṣite devi yāḥ kurvaṃti mahātape ।
aṃgaṣaṭkasya saṃbhūtā tasyaitā yogamātarāḥ ।।

yogāṃgasya ca saṃbhūtāstathaiva varavarṇini ।
yasmāttasmāt maheśāni ṣaḍyoginyaḥ prakīrttitāḥ ।।

ākṣṇā nimiṣamātreṇa bhuvanāni caturdaśaḥ ।
adhaścorddha vibhaktāni kramametā mahābalāḥ ।।

aparo dānasaṃyogo nāḍītraya vivarttane ।
prāṇasaṃrodhane caiva kaṃṭhadeśādvinirgataḥ ।।

yo varṇastasya saṃbhūtāścakkrabhedairmahātapaiḥ ।
digvibhāgairvinikṣiptāstāṃ bījaṃ kathayāmi te ।।

prathamā buddhisaṃyuktā dvitīyā yonibhedatā ।
caturthītyevamevaṃ syā tṛtīyā puruṣānvitā ।।

paṃcamī ai samāyogā ṣaṣṭhī ca triguṇānvitā ।
saṃhāratattvarūpasthā ṣaḍyoginyo mahābalā ।।

subhadrā bhīmabhadrā ca {bhadrā cai}va tṛtīyakā ।
bhīmabhīmavatī caiva bhadrakālī ca ṣaṣṭhikā ।।

kārttikeyasya va(ktre) tu yathotpannāstathā śṛṇu ।
pūrvavaktrā subhadrā tu bhīmabhadrā tu dakṣiṇā ।।

bhadrā paścimasaṃbhūtā bhīmā caiva tu uttarā ।
bhadrakālī tu āgneyyā aiśī bhīmavatī tathā ।।

yathāvaktraṃ tu saṃbhūtā vāme yojyā tathaiva tu ।
saumyacakkrasthitā nityaṃ pūjanīyā mahātape ।।

saumyacakkraṃ tu vinyāsaṃ carācaravyavasthitaḥ ।
kalaiḥ ṣoḍaśabhirbhinnaḥ pūṣādyaiḥ varavarṇini ।।
(213a)
samastayāgakāle tu vyastā karmamahātape ।
śaṃkhaśūlendragopābhā śuddhā muktā phalaprabhā ।।

vāntacāmīkarākārā nāḍayo vaktrasaṃbhavā ।
pūrvādikramayogena vyastānāṃ śṛṇu sāṃpratam ।।

śakracāpanibhārukṣā calanaprāyaśasvinī ।
nīlotpalanibhā caiva sphuritāgnisamaprabhā ।।

iśādyāgneyaparyante diśairaṃgavikalpanā ।
kathitaṃ te maheśāni śeṣāṇāṃ śṛṇu sāṃpratam ।।

sitāraktā śoṇitābhā nīlaraktamahātape ।
nīlamuktaphalābhānu valaśubhrā tathaiva ca ।।

ratnapītā tadaṃtasthā sitapītā tathāparā ।
haritā parāstathā devi yāgoktā tu krameṇa tu ।।

teṣāṃ varṇakramo noktā yogeśī karmasiddhidā ।
svaranyāsavidhiścakkre pravakṣyāmi tathānaghe ।।

ye svarā vaktrasaṃbhūtā ṣaṇmukhasya yaśasvini ।
tāmuktvā śakra digbhāge ārabhyā vinyaset kramāt ।।

svarā śeṣāṃ mahābhāge tatastattvāni vinyaset ।
catvāriṃśati patrāgre nāḍīdvaya mukhe sthitā ।।

kakārādi hakārāntaṃ nāḍibījai vibheditām ।
abhyastayogayogīṃdre tataḥ karmāṇi sādhayet ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

saṃhārākṣarajā maṃtrā yadā ṣaḍbhogiśāsane ।
nānāprakāradeveśa ke maṃtrābhihitāḥ svayā ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

tattatparatare sūkṣmaṃ śivaṃ śāṃtamanāmayam ।
tasmātnādaṃ samutpannaṃ nādādbiṃdurajāyata ।।

biṃdossakāśādutpannaṃ trailokyaṃcca carācaram ।
(213b)
vāyavāṣṣoḍaśastasmāt kalāṃ ṣoḍaśa eva ca ।।

akārādivisargāntā svarāḥ ṣoḍaśa eva tu ।
prapadā jvālinī dhūmrā kāmado vijayāstathā ।।

amṛtā bahulā pakṣī ūrddhabāhyāhyalaṃbusā ।
tālujihvoparihvā ca tathā jīvavahā ca yā ।।

jīvavāhā prāṇavāhā amṛtā ṣoḍaśī smṛtā ।
etāstu mātaro devi visargāttaiḥ suraistathā ।।

kālaikālasthitā devi tatkālaṃ śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ ।
pūṣāyaṣā sumanasā prītistuṣṭi dhṛtistathā ।।

dhṛtirdhṛtikarī saumyā marīcī tvakṣṇamālinī ।
śaśinī jvālinī caiva chāyā saṃpūrṇamaṃḍalā ।।

amṛtā caiva deveśi kalāṃgodayasaṃsthitaḥ ।
kṛkaro devadattaśca pauṇḍarīko dhanaṃjayaḥ ।।

vepathuśca bhramaścaiva vibhramo bhrama eva ca ।
prāṇopāna samānaśca udāno vyāna eva ca ।।

nāgaśca kūrmakṛkaro ṣoḍaśaite mahānilāḥ ।
jvālinyantā mṛtāṃtaśca pūrvāntā svarasaṃyutāḥ ।।

kṛkarādyaṃganaṃ kṛtsnaṃ nāḍī vāyukalānvitam ।
khavameva sṛjaṃ bhyādau tasmāt sarva hi vāṅmayam ।।

ākāro ātmatattvantu vidyātattvaṃ tu i tathā ।
ukāraśivatattvaṃ tu hrasvasvarasamanvitam ।।

ekāro rāga ityuktaaiśvarya ai prakīrttitaḥ ।
okāraḥ puruṣo jñeyo (au)kāraḥ prakṛtistathā ।।

aṃ buddhiriti vijñeyaṃ aḥ ahaṃkāra ucyate ।
napuṃsakacatuṣkaṃ tu buddhibhaidairvyavasthitam ।।
(214a)
varṇabhedavibhāgena nāḍīrūpaṃ svarātmakam ।
yonayasvararūpāstu nāḍī vaktre vyavasthitāḥ ।।

maṃtrāmutpādayaṃtyetā yogamālātmakaṃ vibhum ।
svanāḍyo sahamaṃtreṣu devyāssa parivārikā ।।

vīreśa karṇikā dhārā sarvavarṇeti bhāsurāḥ ।
anantapuṭamadhyastho varṇāntaṣṣaṣṭhake sthitaḥ ।।

ṣaṭpatrakamalādhāraṃ devadevīganaṃdanam ।
ādyantamadhyanāḍīnāṃ cakkrānyetāni uddharet ।।

bījayoni samāyuktā maṃtrā bahuvidhā śubhāḥ ।
nāḍī śoḍaśa bhāgonthā kramāvarṇāṃ samuddharet ।।

ukāra pūrvakāra sarve namo madhyaniyojitāḥ ।
huṃ phaṭsvāhā vasānā syāramalā sarvakāmikā ।।

bījayoni svarūpāsya na kiṃciḥ sādhakāstute ।
śāntarūpāstu boddhavyā maṃtravidyārthavedibhiḥ ।।

aṣṭānāṃ śivamūrttīnāṃ yatraivā tu mate manaḥ ।
tatra cakkrastha mātmānaṃ smṛtvā dhyānādinārcayet ।।

yathoktagamagaṃ vāpi bhogairvā kāmamānasaiḥ ।
śaktitaśca sahaṃsātmā guruvahniṣu pūjyate ।।

evaṃ yo maṃtra vinmantrī vidyāṃgakṛtadhīmṛgaḥ ।
sarvakarmasu saṃsiddhistatprayoktāśu siddhyati ।।

yā antantiṣu yo vāṣu sthitastaṃ pravadāmyaham ।
kṛkaraḥ pramadā bhuṃkte devadattantu jvālinī ।।

puṇḍarīkastathā dhūmrā kāmadā maṃjanastathā ।
vijayaṃ vepadyuścaiva amṛtaṃ saṃbhavastathā ।।

bahulaṃ vibhrame bhuṃkte prāṇa ūrddha vahāśritaḥ ।
pakṣī hyapāno deveśi hyapāno laṃbusā tathā ।।

śivaśakti samutpanno saṃhārākṣararūpadhṛt ।
(214b)
mamāṣṭau mūrttayo yāstu mātarāstāḥ parāparāḥ ।।

mayaivādhiṣṭhitāḥ sarvāḥ krīḍante bhuvanasthitāḥ ।
uttarottarabhāgena balaśaktiviśeṣataḥ ।।

mamāṃgeṣu samutpannā ṣaḍyoginyo mahātape ।
nāḍīcakkre vicāreṇa parāḥ siddhyaṃ tu biṃdave ।।

siddhayo vividhākārāḥ śaktayaḥ karma eva hi ।
kimatramatphalākārya ahamevotrakāraṇam ।।

evaṃ saṃcodayitvā tu sarvāstāṃ manyatirbharām ।
svaśaktijñānasadbhāvāṃ svakarmasu niyojayet ।।

evameva samutpannāḥ ṣaḍyoginyomajñātaye ।
tadā devi samākhyātā yoginījālaśaṃvare ।।

laṃpaṭādyaitha raktādyai sarvavīraviśeṣataḥ ।
asmiṃ taṃtravare bhadre bhadrasiddhiṣu dāyake ।।

evaṃ saṃcāramākhyātamāditaḥ samanukramāt ।
mahārahasyamatulaṃ sārātsārataraṃ śubham ।
ataḥ parataraṃ devi vada kiṃ karayāmyaham ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi(vidyā)pīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
caturviṃśatisāhasre yoginīsaṃcāraprakaraṇanāmā ।। ।।

evamākarṇya sā devī varavīredravaṃdita ।
paraṃsaṃtoṣamāṣannā punaḥ provāca śaṃkaram ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

tṛptāsmi parameśāna prasādāntava sāṃpratam ।
ādinaḥ sakalaṃ jñānaṃ taṃtrarājānamuttamam ।।

adhunā śrotu micchāmi kathaṃ sā parameśvarī ।
maṃtra maṃtreśvarī suṣkā siddhayogeśvareśvarī ।।

siddhidā riddhidā yā sā mokṣadā pāpanāśanī ।
(215a)
āsahasrākṣarā raṃbhādyā vatsaptādaśākṣarā ।।

ekākṣarāṃtikā deva kathaṃ sā paramā kalā ।
ekāsatī anekā sā bahurūpā kathaṃ sthitā ।।

athavā bahubhedaiva tavākhyā hi maheśvara ।
yena saṃśayanirmuktā bhavāmi parameśvara ।।

evamākarṇya sahasātsā dūhāsamuvāca ha ।
bhairavo bhīmasaṃsāraśamanaika taraḥ paraḥ ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

śṛṇuṣva kathayiṣyāmi yathāhaṃ coditastvayā ।
mahārahasyamatulaṃ durlabhaṃ tridaśeśvaraiḥ ।।

yā sā sarvagatā sūkṣmā śaktirbhairavakāraṇam ।
rasā varṇātmikā devī na svarairaparaṃjitā ।।

na parā na ca paśyaṃtī madhyamā vaikharī na ca ।
makūṭasphoṭabhedākhyā vacasaṃ tu svarūpiṇī ।।

navavidyātmikā devī na ca nāda mayā hi sā ।
na ca biṃdu kalā saiva na vyāptrī na nirarthakā ।।

na cakkrādhārasaṃrūḍhā na ca nāḍimukhāraṇī ।
na ca śūnyatrayādhārā navadhā maṃtrayo mayī ।।

na sitā nāpyasau raktā na pītā na ca kṛṣṇikā ।
na kāmotā na kapilā na ca karvuritā hi sā ।।

śavalā naiva sā devī na ca tejaḥ kalākulā ।
na śabdaṃ na ca sā sparśaṃ naiva rūpaṃ rasaṃ na hi ।।

na ca gaṃdhaṃ neṃdriyāṇi karaṇāni na sā parā ।
nāparā parameśānī parātparatarā na hi ।।

na sā bhāsā na sā vīryaṃ na sādhyantiḥ kalā na sā ।
na pradhānaṃ na pū(kṣna)stvaṃ na vidyā nāgameva sā ।।

kālaṃ na sā kalānaiva nipatirna niyāmikā ।
(215b)
na sā māyā mahāmāyā na vidyā śuddhasaṃjñikā ।।

neśvaraṃ sā na sā dākhyaṃ na śaktirna śivaṃ ca sā ।
na suptā notthitā devī na jaḍā na ca mantharā ।।

na di - mūrttirnābhāsā na bhūtā na vināyakāḥ ।
na sā jātirna sā deśaṃ na sā dehaṃ na bhāsurā ।।

na kāmakrodharūpā sā na mṛtā na ca jīvati ।
na sā jāgranna sā svapnaṃ suṣuptaṃ naiva sā priye ।।

na sā turyaṃ na dantaṃ vā piṇḍasthaṃ naiva sā sadā ।
padasthaṃ na ca rūpasthaṃ na rūpātītameva sā ।।

buddhā prabuddhā saṃbuddhā na kadācidiheśvarī ।
pracayā naiva devī sā na mayā pracayā hi sā ।।

paranivṛtiniṣpannā na bāhyajñānarūpiṇī ।
na śūnyā nāmisā hautrī na vāgeśī trayīmapī ।।

na sā bhargaśikhā proktā na khaśolkā maheśvarī ।
na cāhaṃsī na cānaṃdā nirānaṃdā na caiva hi ।।

na yoginī na devī sā na śakti na karaṃkiṇī ।
na kālī naiva kaṃkālī na ca saptādaśākṣarā ।।

naikārṇā nāpyanekārṇā na sā jālasvarūpiṇī ।
na dhāvaṃtī na tiṣṭhaṃtī na rodaṃtī na lāpinī ।।

nonmantā nāpi saccintā dīpanirvāṇavā na hi ।
na brahmā na ca sā viṣṇurna rudraṃ na ca iśvaram ।।

sadāśivaṃ na sā devi na sā nāśritarūpiṇī ।
suṣumṇe sā na sā devī siddhayogeśvarī na sā ।।

na cāmuṃḍā mahocchuṣmā na karālā na daṃturā ।
na raktā nāpi caṃḍākṣī na viccāṃ vā na bhairavī ।।

na ghoreśī na viśveśī na viśvā ghoranāyikā ।
(216a)
na hā raudrī na bhaṃbhotthī harṭāhaṭṭāyudhā na sā ।।

na ṛkṣakarṇī caṃḍeśī na ca naṣṭeśvarī hi sā ।
brāhmī māheśvarī nāsau na kaumārī na vaiṣṇavī ।।

na vārāhī na sā(śāṃkrī) na viccā na ca carvikā ।
na ṣāmyā na ca kauverī vāruṇī na samīraṇī ।।

nāgneyī naiva caiśānī naiṛtī naiva sūrpajā ।
na somajanakāpālī gāruḍī na bharūṭikā ।।

na nārasaihī rudrāṇī na ca bhairavavallabhā ।
na sāhyekatarā jñeyā na ca jvālāmukhī hi sā ।।

na khiṃkhinī vīramātā na śivādūtiravasā ।
na hyastrarūpiṇī devī na ca ḍāmarikā hi sā ।।

na jayā vijayā caiva jayaṃtī cāparājitā ।
na dūtī kiṃkaraṃ saiva na ca sāṃkuśarūpiṇī ।।

vāgeśvarī na sā devī na ca sā kuṃḍalābhidhā ।
na maṃgalā na sā nityā na ca ratnaiśvarī hi sā ।।

na dakṣiṇaṃ na vā vāmaṃ pūrvaṃ paścimameva vā ।
norddhampātālikaṃ naiva na nayaṃ vinayaṃ na ca ।।

kulakaulaṃ na cātaṃtraṃ atimārgaṃ nalākulam ।
na siddhāntaṃ navātītaṃ kārukaṃ vaimalaṃ na sā ।।

vedāntaṃ naiva sāvedaṃ tadaṃgāni na caiva sā ।
nirnāmā sā samākhyātā nistaraṃgā nirākulā ।।

ciccintadhāgnivipure vyaṃjyate svasvarūpiṇī ।
sā svarūpaṃ tatsvarūpaṃ sā tattatsā tadeva sā ।।

acitparaharatvena svollasatsaṃvideva sā ।
tayā saṃcitritaṃ sarvaṃ yadetatprākya kīrttitam ।।

na sā saṃcittritā devi kenacidvastunā sadā ।
tayā virahitaṃ nāsti yasmādasmi iśvarā bhare ।।
(216b)
jagatyeva maheśāni bhinnābhinnasvarūpake ।
asyāḥ svarūpaṃ yatproktaṃ guruvaktrāṃ tadeva hi ।।

niścayī kṛtyavartteta yaḥ sa bhairava ucyate ।
anyathā paśutā tasya na nivarttati bhāmini ।।

etasmāt kāraṇāddevi mudreyaṃ parikīrttitā ।
anayā mudritaṃ sarvaṃ śivādyavanigocaram ।।

nirvikārā maheśānī nistaraṃgā manonmanī ।
nirvibhāgā nirāsthānā niradhānasvarūpiṇī ।।

akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākārā paripūrṇārṇavopamā ।
yatprāgudīritaṃ devi sarvamasyādvijaṃbhate ।।

kaṃcāvastvaṃtaraṃ subhru vidyate bhuvanodare ।
yantavyāptaṃ tayā devi tasyāntannāsni yaśca vā ।।

viśvarūpā viśvagatāṃ viśveśī viśvamālinī ।
sadāsantā hyadūre sā svasvabhāvā hyarūpiṇī ।।

tāṃ jñātvā jīvato muktimanyathā tu nirarthakam ।
anayā jñātamātrā yā śivādyavanigocare ।।

yadvastu vidyate devi haṭhāntatsādhayet sadā ।
necchate sādhakasyāsya balādāyāṃti sampadaḥ ।।

brahmādiṣu durācāpā yā nityaṃ parameśvari ।
yatrāsau vasate martyo deśe vā pattane pure ।।

taṃ taṃ mokṣaṃ nayatpāśu darśanāt sparśanādapi ।
sthāvarānapi te naiva spṛṣṭāni parameśvari ।।

gacchaṃti śivasāyojyaṃ nātrakāryā vicāraṇā ।
tamāya tavamevāgryaṃ taṃ maṃtrādhāramuttamam ।।

taṃ vidyā yoniratulāṃ taṃ yāpeṃdhanayāvakam ।
taṃ raśmayorvaṃdayaṃti siddhayotitaṃ sadā ।।
(217a)
mokṣalakṣmī tamāśritya satataṃ pravijṛṃbhate ।
yasya jñānamidaṃ dehe guruvaktraprasādataḥ ।।

sarvasiddhisamāyuktaṃ taṃ naraṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ ।
etadvarlasamāśritya nānāvidyā svarūpiṇī ।।

nānārūpakasaṃyuktā nānāsiddhiphalapradā ।
mudrāmaṇḍalasaṃyuktā ekā sā viśvarūpiṇī ।।

visarpitā tu saiveyaṃ bhāvabhedādaroṣvataḥ ।
avyapadeśyaṃ caitattavākhyātaṃ yathā gamātsāram ।

vaktrādvaktragataṃ tatpustakalekhyaṃ na jātu deveśi ।
vividhaphalākulatatsāraṃ guruvaktrato labhyam ।

maṃtrādi sarvahīnaṃ nityo dṛktaṃ suśāṃtamatidīptam ।
sarvarahasyaṃ girije nipataṃ syādyatraṇā hīnam ।
va - dhunā kiṃ tubhyaṃ vadamaddhṛdayāṃvarāntasthe ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
a - - - - - - - - (vidhipaṭalaḥ) ।। ।।

evamākarṇya girijā romāṃcitaśarīriṇī ।
bhairavaṃ praṇipatyoccai stotrametadravīrayat ।। ।।

de(vyūvāca) ।।

aho rahasyamatulaṃ tvayākhyātaṃ sureśvara ।
vidyeśvarādayo yena rahitā cāṃdhyamāgatā ।।

adya deva vimuktāsmi gatamohāsmi sāṃ vratan ।
sthitāsmi parameśāna tvatprasādāt kimadbhutam ।।

namaste dhāmavīrāya nistaraṃgāya śūline ।
vyāpakāya namo nityaṃ namaḥ saṃhāramūrttaye ।।

aṣṭavidyeśvarā yāstu namo nityaṃ vṛṣadhvaja ।
(217b)
namostu mīḍhraṣe goptre namostu bahurūpiṇe ।।

namaḥ kaṃkālaveśāya namo nādyaiśvarāya te ।
namaḥ paramaśuddhāya namo * janmahāya ca ।।

namaścidrūparūpāya namaścitparamaujase ।
tamo moha mahātaṃka dhvaṃsine te namo namaḥ ।।

namaḥ kāmāya kāṃtāya namaḥ kāṃtārddhadhāriṇe ।
namo dhīrāya vīrāya namo halahalāyate ।।

namaḥ phaṇīdrahārāya kapālamukuṭāya ca ।
namo laṃpaṭaveśāya namaścintabhacāriṇe ।।

hiraṇyaretase tubhyaṃ namastvaparamūrtta * ।
biṃdunādāntarasthāya svarddhunī dayitāya ca ।।

ṣaḍgraṃthātītaveśāya ślāghanīyāya te namaḥ ।
jvālāpiṃgāya līnāya haṃsāpatrikarūpiṇe ।।

lālasāya sulālpāya namo maṃtharamūrttaye ।
śāstrārṇavodaranamo namaḥ kuliśa pāṇaye ।।

namaḥ ṣaṇmārgasaṃsthāya namo rudrāya śūline ।
smarāṃtakanamastubhyaṃ kālāntakanamo namaḥ ।।

tṛptāsmi parameśāna tvat prasādāt kimadbhutam ।
adyāpi saṃśayo mesti kathaṃ sā padabhedagā ।।

kathaṃ tatsiddhidā deva kathaṃ bheda tirohitā ।
etadicchāmi deveśa vidituṃ surasattama ।।

evamākarṇya sahasāt priyāvaktrāṃbujacyutam ।
stotraṃ tuṣṭamanā devo vākyametaduvāca ha ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

śṛṇuṣva devadeveśi yathāhaṃ coditastvayā ।
tathā tatkathayiṣyāmi sarahasyaṃ yadadbhutaṃḥ ।।

sahastārṇā padairbhintā ekāntātprabhṛti priye ।
tato biṃduguhāruḍhā śivārnirvāṇasuṃdarī ।।
(218a)
dharmmatvena sthitā śaṃbhoḥ saśaktiḥ pārameśvarī ।
samavāyaprasūtyeva vyaktivyaktyāde hetuviḥ ।।

ullāsocchūnatā rūpaiḥ padairyāvatavaidavam ।
padaṃ visarpitā devī tataḥ kāraṇaṃ cakkragā ।।

tato hyādhārabhūyiṣṭā tataḥ śūnyapadābhidhā ।
tataḥ saptatisāhasra śirāṇāṃ dvyadhikaṃ hi yat ।।

tatra kramātpadavarairvyaktābhābhirvibhāsayat ।
padabhedai devadevī varṇavāgvṛtti bhe{dataḥ) ।।

tadā pādairvibhinnā sā sahasrākṣaramālitā ।
sārūpyena virūpyena śaktivyaktā tu sādaram ।।

siddhibhedena bhāvātmā pratyayopādhibhāvataḥ ।
na bhinnā parameśānī vibhinnā siddhibhedataḥ ।।

yāvatprasarasaṃkocau viditau na priye nare ।
vyaktijñānavibhedena tāvatsiddhiḥ kutaḥ sthitā ।।

yadā svabhāsā vīryeṇa nānādhārādibhedataḥ ।
viditā yogicakkreśī tadā siddhiḥ karasthitā ।।

yadāśyūnya trayāṃtastho dhāmasaṃghaṭṭamavyagaḥ ।
sādhakaścakkranāthosau bhavatyeva na cādbhutam ।।

yadā kaṃdodare devi ṣaḍraśmi pravare śubhe ।
vyajyate maṃtra vidyaśī tadā vīreśvaro bhavet ।।

yadā vajrakulāṃtastho padabhāsāvalokakaḥ ।
padātpadavirāmāṃtre tadā vyajyati sā kalā ।।

yadā kuṇḍali caṃkrāntaḥ sphuradūrmivisarpiṇi ।
śivaśaktyātmake vyaktā tadā vyajyati sā kalā ।।

yadā svabhāvaśivire buddhitalpavilāsinī ।
svollāsapatisaṃyuktā tu svanāliṃgahetubhiḥ ।।
(218b)
cālanā vaśato buddhā tadā vyajyati sakalā ।
yadā laṃbakacakkrastho kiṃjalkaṃ lālayedgiriḥ ।।

kiṃjalkena surānaṃdaṃ tadā vyajyati sā kalā ।
yadā guru - - ruvareṇyeva *(ra)lālasaḥ ।।

vīraspandasamācaṣṭe tadā vyajyati sā kalā ।
viṣuva(sppa)rśanā{kṣe} * cidbhāvānalasaṃyutaḥ ।।

kuṃcikodyāṭanaratastadā vyajyati sā kalā ।
yadā cinicinīcakkre daśarūpe daśātmakaḥ ।।

tadvisarpaṇaśīlastu tadā vyajyati sā kalā ।
yadā rūpīśvarī cakkre tridhādhāsni vijṛṃbhite ।।

vyālālasparśanāsatkastadā vyajyati sā kalā ।
yadā līlā gṛhe biṃdo kalāmālini bhāsure ।।

kamalāṃkavikāsyeta tadā vyajyati sā kalā ।
yadā śukravahemāne brahmahā hemamujvale ।।

vikāsākuṃcanāsaktastadā vyajyati sā kalā ।
yadā kaṃkālarahito padakastholakāśrayaḥ ।।

karūpī koṭisaṃrūḍho tadā vyajyati sā kalā ।
yadā hṛtkamalālīno tripiṃḍe trivisarpiṇi ।।

tridhāgni tridaśākṣepe tadā vyajyati sā kalā ।
akale vikale kāle kālāṃte kālaveśmani ।।

vipulaḥ kālakālosau yadā vyajyettadā hi kā ।
kālasaṃkarṣaṇī cakkre ṣoḍaśaśaṃduvirājite ।।

trayodaśārka saṃdīpte vahnitrayasamanvitaḥ ।
tāsure bhāsurādhāro tyāgagrāsakramākulaḥ ।।

sthitikālikramārūḍho sṛṣṭidāsni vijṛṃbhite ।
avatīrṇastathā rūpastadāvyajyati sā kalā ।।
(219a)
trāsahāsabhayasparśakrodhaśokagṛhāntare ।
sānaṃdetha nirānaṃde vyaktastiṣṭhati susthiraḥ ।।

yadā tadā mahābhāge vyajyate sāparā kalā ।
[yato jānāti yadve- sahāsabhayasparśakrodhaśokagṛhāntare ।

sānaṃdetha tirānaṃde vyaktastiṣṭhati susthiraḥ ।
yadā tadā mahābhāge vyajyate sāparā kalā ।।]

yato jānāti {ya}dvetti yena jānāti tadvapuḥ ।
tatrārūḍho yadā samyaktadā vyajyati sā kalā ।

janmāṃkula samutthānaṃ yato jātaṃ pralīyate ।
yatra yāti ca tadrūḍho yadā vyajyettadā kalā ।।

yadā bhāsā kule bhānau bhāsā bhānukulāṃtakaḥ ।
jvalajvalanasaṃsthityā tadā vyajyati sā kalā ।।

yadā kālānalādhāre kālavahniprabhakṣakaḥ ।
sopi grasati vīreṃdrastadā vyajyati sā kalā ।।

yadā caṃḍakulāvāse sahasrārṇavisarpite ।
vicitrakālakaṃkāle tadā vyajyati sā kalā ।।

yadā sarvakṣayakara jāti nāma kulāntakṛt ।
tadgarbhaparame rūḍhastadā vyajyati sā kalā ।।

thaghaghathaghathaghathatha
evamevajagadyasya kṣayameti hyadeti ca ।।

sotivṛntā kulāntastho tasya vyajyati sā kalā ।
yā bhāsā viśvabhāsākhyā yasyāṃ kālaḥ pragīyate ।।

yasya mattasthitaṃ sarvaṃ sā sahasrākṣarā matā ।
yayedamuṃbhitaṃ sarvaṃ metragrāsaṃ samaṃḍalam ।।

mudrā vidyā gaṇākīrṇaṃ sā sahasrākṣarā matā ।
nakṣaratyakṣaraṃ yasmākṣarākṣaravivarjitā ।।

sarvākṣaramayī yasmāttadā varṇasahasrikā ।
pratipādavibhedena pratiyogavibhedataḥ ।।
(219b)
ākhyāteyaṃ sureśānī durjñeyā yā surottamaiḥ ।
kimanyat kathayiṣyāmi vada sarveśvareśvari ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
devisvarūpanirūpaṇavidhirnāmapaṭalaḥ ।। ।।

evamākarṇya sā devī saṃtoṣāmṛtanirvṛtā ।
praṇipatyasurādhīśaṃ maulilālitaśāsanam ।
uvāca vacanaṃ devī gaṃbhīrārthamidaṃ punaḥ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

evametatsureśāna yadrahasyaṃ tvayoditam ।
tathā jñātaṃ mayā samyagadhunā brūhi me vibho ।।

kathaṃ sā paramākālī jagatsaṃhārakārikā ।
avatīrṇā kathaṃ bhadrā kathaṃ sṛṣṭiṃ karoti sā ।।

kathaṃ sthiti karī kālī kathaṃ saṃhārakārikā ।
kathaṃ bhāsākule rūḍhā etadicchāmi veditum ।।

sūcitaṃ asakṛddeva na sphuṭaṃ pratipāditam ।
nikhilaṃ śrotumicchāmi prasādādvada bhairava ।।

evamākarṇya sahasātsāṭṭahāsamuvāca ha ।
sureṃdravṛṃdacūḍālīlāṃ libhāṃdbhiyugoharaḥ ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

śṛṇu samyakyavakṣyāmi yadbhūṭaṃ jñānamuttamam ।
purā yaduktaṃ subhage śāstresmiṃ bahuvistaram ।।

saṃkṣepe nābhidhāsyāmi śṛṇu padmadale kṣaṇe ।
gopanīyamidaṃ bhadre prāṇānte jñāpayedguruḥ ।।

anyāyatastu kathanā bhairavo vyutkramedbhṛṣam ।
tasmāddvitaṃ samicchedyogopayetsarvathākramam ।।

dviprakāramidaṃ bhadre yatpṛcchasi śubhe kṣaṇe ।
(220a)
nistaraṃgaṃ kulātītaṃ mekaṃ pravarasiddhidam ।।

pūjya pūjakanirmuktaṃ hetudṛṣṭāttavarjitam ।
etadavyapadeśyaṃ tatkramasarvasvamuttamam ।।

aparastu mahānbhedaḥ pūjyapūjakasaṃyutaḥ ।
prāyaśoktamanekaiśca bhedairbhinnaśubhānane ।।

adbhutaṃ kathayiṣyāmi sarahasyaṃ mahādbhutam ।
sarvabhāvavinirmuktaṃ sadasatpakṣavarjitam ।।

bhāvābhāvavinirmuktaṃ pramāṇātītagocaram ।
vāgātītaṃ nistaraṃgaṃ vikalpātītamaṃtharam ।।

paripūrṇaṃ nityatṛptaṃ sunirvāṇaṃ suśāntakam ।
akhaṃḍamaṃḍalākāraṃ paramānaṃdanirbharam ।।

śivaṃ sarvagataṃ vyāpi kāraṇā nāmatītavat ।
cidrūpaṃ paramaṃ brahma bhairavaṃ dhāmacādbhutam ।।

sarvajñasarvakarttāri vyapadeśavivarjitam ।
tasya tadvarmiṇī bhāsā svaspaṃdodayamaṃtharā ।।

sā bhāsā bhāsurā dhārā bhairavī bhāsvarūpiṇī ।
vyaktihetuḥ samastasya śakticakkrasya bhairavi ।।

anayā bhāsate bhāsyā paramākakalāntakām ।
paramārkaśikhākārā suprabhā bhāsurā prabhā ।।

paramā pararāristhā tayā rārivirājate ।
tatra bhāsā vinirmukto rārirājati bhāsuraḥ ।।

tatra rāristattabhāstāḥ śāktaśāṃbhava āṇavāḥ ।
ataḥ sūryasamunthānamato bhāsā kalodayam ।।

rephacakkraṃ vāricakkraṃ hlādacakkraṃ prakāśakam ।
eṣāṃ prakāśakā bhāsā śivasya samavāyajā ।।
(220b)
cidbhāsā sā samākhyātā yataścakkraṃ virājate ।
na tatra bhāsate kaścidvāmnāyuktaḥ sureśvari ।।

sā bhāsā bhāsatāṃ bhāsā bhāsākuṃḍali ma - gā ।
sārkavīryaṃ dṛṣṭivīryaṃ sāsvavīryaśca dhāmatat ।।

tatrāraṇigataṃ bhānu tasya bhāsā svarūpiṇī ।
tatsvarūpasvarūpeṇa svarūpaṃ bhāsate yadā ।।

tadā bhāsā kramajñānī sādhakeṃdro virājate ।
tatrāntare catuṣkaṃ syā catuṣkasyāntare ca tan ।।

abhinnametadvijñeyaṃ yuktyā gurumukhonthayā ।
etatpūrvakramaṃ devi bhāsākhyamupavarṇitam ।।

aprakāśyamidaṃ samya(ddha)re maṃdaparīkṣite ।
bhāsā bhāgī mahāvīro yaḥ svabhāvena suṃdari ।
tasya raśmikramaṃ deyamityājñā pārameśvarī ।। ।।

bhāsākramavidhi ।। ।।

athānyaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi rahasyamidamuttamam ।
guhyādguhyataraṃ guhyaṃ suguptaṃ pāpanāśanam ।।

jñā(na)mātreṇa yeneha bhairavena virājate ।
yā bhāsā pūrvamākhyātā śivasadbhāvarūpiṇī ।।

ullasadrūpa - cakkrāsā sphuratsmaraṇarūpiṇī ।
sāvatīrṇā svarūpeṇa eka dvi tri krameṇa tu ।।

caturddhā paṃcadhā sā tu ṣoḍhā saptaprakārataḥ ।
aṣṭadhā navadhā devī daśavaikādaśātmikā ।।

ekādaśasvarūpeṇa rudraraudrīśvarī hi sā ।
dvādaśārkamayī kālī punarjñeyā trayodaśī ।।

daśapaṃcātmikā samyakchoḍaśī ca punaḥ priye ।
saptādaśātmikā bhūyo hyavatīrṇā svarūpanaḥ ।।
(221a)
puroktā bhāsā cakkrātmacidrūpapravijṛṃbhanam ।
sphuradvastu svarūpeṇa tadbhāsātmakavṛttima(t) ।।

paripūrṇasvarūpatva sthitivyaktivyavasthitiḥ ।
akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākārā avatārakramoṇvaṇā ।।

tena vīryeṇa sārūpya svarūpeṇāvatārakṛt ।
krameṇānena deveśi sthūlasūkṣmakramasthitiḥ ।।

sūkṣmoktā sthūlabhedaṃ ca bhairavādirudāhṛtam ।
śakticakkraṃ samastaṃ yadā dhārāntaṃ maheśvari ।।

tena krameṇa sā jñeyā hyavatārasvarūpiṇī ।
tasyāttarbhāsayedbhānurbhānorantastadudbhatam ।।

tena dṛṣṭistadā dṛṣṭi dṛṣṭidṛṣṭeḥ parā hi sā ।
sā vṛtti vīrya sā vṛttistadvyaktiḥ saiva suṃdari ।।

evaṃ svarūpasadbhāsā hyavatīrṇā sumadhyame ।
tidānādānayormadhye prakāśānaṃdamadhyagā ।।

vilolakuṇḍalākārā caṃdrārkāgnyantagā hi sā ।
prāpyakramamidaṃ devi bhairaveva bhavettadā ।।

etatkramā(nu)sāreṇa yoginīnāṃ mukhasthitam ।
guruparvakramāyātaṃ tavādya prakaṭīkṛtam ।।

mahāsamayavarddhaṃ ca na deyaṃ yasya kasyacit ।
prāṇādhikaṃ sadārakṣyaṃ na deyaṃ paśu dīkṣite ।
mahārahasya madhyosthaṃ mahābhairavavallabham ।। ।।

avatārakramavidhiḥ ।। ।।

athānyaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi rahasyaṃ paramādbhutam ।
yanna kasya cidākhyātaṃ sṛṣṭikramamanuttamam ।।

yamavāpya mahāvīro vaṃdyate khecarīgaṇaiḥ ।
rahasyametamatulaṃ mahābhairavabhāṣitam ।।

yamavāpyamahāvīro vaṃdyate khecarīgaṇaiḥ ।
(221b)
rahasyametamatulaṃ mahābhairavabhāṣitam ।।

pūrvamuktaṃ ca yaddevi bhāsācakkramakhaṃḍitam ।
tatra svarūpavasanavyakti bhāsā vyavasthitiḥ ।।

cidālokavyavasthānāt samyakparivirājanāt ।
tenaiva vapuṣā samyakparipūyoṇḍamaṇḍalam ।।

varttanaṃ yantu dhādhāre bījavadvāntasankriyaḥ ।
mahāvinodaparamo paripūrṇaḥ sa bhāsuraḥ ।।

sthirarkerkavatī kālī * lālāsya vilāsinī ।
kamalāntakalārūḍhā bhairavī bhairaveśvarī ।।

sanmārgarūḍhā sanmārge saptasṛjati līlayā ।
aṣṭau navaikādaśa ca bhūyo dvādaśa eva sā ।।

trayodaśasamāsena ṣoḍaśaiva kulāraṇī ।
saptādaśa ca deveśi ṣadyatva trikamekataḥ ।।

vidadhāti vigṛhṇāti bhāsurā bhavamālinī ।
tadā sā lalitā bhāsā sṛṣṭisthitikarī smṛtā ।।

khaṇḍitaṃ khaṇḍitaṃ yena khaṃḍitaṃ tena khaṇḍitam ।
na khaṃḍi na vilārūḍhā yadā kālī hyakhaṇḍitā ।।

tadā sā khaṇḍanā naiva khaṇḍanānyatra vicyutiḥ ।
akhaṇḍamaṇḍa{lā}rūḍho sarvatrākhaṇḍito yadā ।।

tadā (nithyū)rūṣī kālī sṛṣṭilīlā vilāsinī ।
akale kāladhāmnisthe kāleyaṃtī sukālikā ।।

kālanātsṛjate sarvaṃ brahmāṇḍaṃ hūhūkaiḥ saha ।
anāśritapadārūḍhā tadvṛtyūllāsinī yadā ।।

tadā kacati bhāsāhya pratyayopādhivarjitā ।
sṛṣṭvā tameti deveśī vṛtyulāsasvarūpiṇī ।।

mahābhairavasadvāma vamate tadgatā satī ।
(222a)
ṣaḍaṃśraṃ ṣaṭkalaṃ ṣoḍhā bhairavaṃ sṛjate tadā ।।

ṣaṭkanāthaṃ tamatyugraṃ bhāsuraṃ bhairavākarat ।
stadvṛttirūpā sāvantaraudrasvarūpiṇī ।।

vamatte khattvanāthaṃ taṃ mahāpretaṃ sadāśivaṃ ।
sphuratyastva mahāratna tadarthā pūraṇodyatam ।।

tadvṛtyā vibhavaṃ sarvaṃ māṃtraṃ vamati līlaṃyā ।
punarvāttāsatīraudraṃ bhāvamāśritya bhāsvaram ।।

iśvaraṃ vamate raudrā sarvamaṃtrogranāyikā ।
tadvṛtyūddāmatāreṇa bhāsureṇa sphuraṇṇapi ।।

punarvamati sā raudrā rudraṃ kalaśasaṃsthitam ।
tridhāmadhāmnā vā māsa rudramā triśatāni ca ।।

tadvṛtyūllāsayogena pūrayedakhilaṃ jagat ।
bhāramevaṃ vinirmucya sṛṣṭo sā kṣubhitā satī ।।

punarvamati sā viṣṇuṃ pracaṇḍākulapāvakam ।
mahāsudhā geharataṃ vṛtyullāsavighūrṇitam ।।

punaḥ kṣudhā yadā kālī tadā vamati vegataḥ ।
brahmacakkraṃ mahāraudraṃ vedollāsavirāviṇam ।।

tadā nādaparākṣu - vamate hāṭakeśvaram ।
mahālīlālasaṃ devaṃ ratināthaṃ mahābalam ।।

kāmārūḍhaṃ kāmasaktaṃ ṣaṭkoṇodaramadhyagam ।
ṣaśaktimadhyagaṃ bhīmaṃ ṣaḍraśmipravicāritam ।।

tasya raśmivikāsaṃ ca kṛtvā raudratarā hi sā ।
kālāgnirudramakhilaṃ vāntaṃ svena svarūpataḥ ।।

tadvṛttivisarāmodakṣobhamīnavivarttavat ।
punareva tayāvaṃtaṃ dvādaśārkagaṇaṃ mahat ।।

trayodaśaṃ punarghoraṃ mārttaṇḍaṃ nāma nāmataḥ ।
evaṃ vāṃtaṃ sūrpakulaṃ vṛtyudgāraprayogataḥ ।।

punaścādraṃ kalācakkraṃ ṣoḍaśā{dhā}rabhāsuram ।
(222b)
vāntaṃ tayā mahākālyā viśvalakṣmyā sudhāmayam ।।

punaragnitrayaṃ ghoraṃ saptajihvaṃ bhayānakam ।
tadvṛttipūraṇaparaṃ vāḍavāgnistato paraḥ ।।

tayāvantaḥsvarūpeṇa svakālikulasaṃyutam ।
evamāvṛttidhāmnikhe bhāsācakkroditā satī ।।

punarvasati sā ghorā śabdacakkraṃ durāsadam ।
tanmātryodaśaviśveśi cakkranāthasamanvitāḥ ।।

tadā mahānilapade yadā carati bhairavī ।
tadā tayā devadevyā sparśacakkramanuttamam ।।

vāntaṃ svaraśmisahitaṃ cakkranāthasamanvitam ।
bhatā kṣubdhā trivāmnisve bhārūpe nāsurānanā ।।

yadā rūpakulaṃ vāntaṃ tayā raśmiśatā citam ।
raśmināthasamaupetaṃ tridaśa dvādaśātmakam ।।

vālgataṃ naiva vira * sṛnikalonta * * * ।
vedā jātā tadāvante rasacakkraṃ bhayāpaham ।।

kharaśmināthasahitaṃ ṣaḍrasā hāralaṃpaṭam ।
punaḥ kṣubdhā bhīmakālā yadā sumṛtarā mahat ।।

tadā tayā gaṃdhacakraṃ dhāraraśmiśatākulam ।
svacakranā{tha}sahitaṃ svacakrādhārabhairavam ।।

mahāmātriśatākīrṇaṃ punaḥ kṣubdhā sudhāmaye ।
tadā samodbhavaṃ cakkraṃ tayā vāntaṃ sumadhyame ।।

svaraśmiśatasaṃyuktaṃ saṃkalpakulamanthanam ।
punarghotarājātā yadā devī karaṅkiṇī ।।

samuvāntaṃ yathā devyā cakramāha kṛtīśvaram ।
bahuraśmisahasrāḍhyaṃ svacakkreśasamanvitam ।।
(223a)
vāṃtvā samagramakhilaṃ buddhicakkreśvagaraṇīm ।
punarvāntā buddhicakraṃ mahāraśmiśatānvitam ।।

bahumātrigaṇākīrṇaśvacakkreṇa samanvitam ।
evaṃ sṛṣṭivatī kālī tridhāvṛttiprakāśitā ।।

bhāsādhāra * * * * tadā tiṣṭhatyayaṃtritā ।
tayā vāntajagatsarvaṃ sā tatrā bhedavarttinī ।।

pūraṇī karaṇī dhātrī sthitirūpā nigadyate ।
evaṃ sphurati cillakṣmī bhāsācakkrāntaroditā ।।

evaṃ sṛṣṭikramaṃ proktaṃ saṃkṣeyānta tu vistarāt ।
guruparvakramāyātaṃ yoginī hṛdayābjagam ।।

na deyaṃ devadeveśi prāṇāṃtepi kadācana ।
dānāntarakamāpnoti muṣṭibhedī narādhamaḥ ।।

yāvantā jñāpitaṃ devi svapne vā samyageva hi ।
tāva - - śayetraiva ityājñā pārameśvarī ।। ।।

।। iti jayadrathatṛtīyaṣaṭke sṛṣṭikramavidhiḥ ।। ।।

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi kālikā kramamuttamam ।
yamavāpya mahābhāse sādha{ka}sya vego bhavet ।।

guruparvakramāntā * * * * * nimadyate ।
yadā pūrvatayā proktapūrṇaṃ śivamanuttamam ।।

bhāsākramasamopetaṃ srollāsāṃnaṃdanirbharam ।
tadvyakti sṛṣṭikālī yā vyaktāraśmikulāraṇī ।।

mṛṣṭvā sarvamidaṃ prāgvantanmavyasthā kṛṣodarī ।
jagadbhāvamrāsagarva yadā jātaṃ maholvaṇam ।।

tasyā yadā tadā samyaktayā kālisvarūpataḥ ।
pūrvasṛṣṭeṣu sarveṣu pretībhūteṣu teṣvalam ।।

ārūḍhā bhairaveśānī raśmicakkravijṛṃbhitā ।
(223b)
tābhirā ca mate sarvaṃ jagadetaccarācaram ।।

hāṭakeśvaraṃ muṃḍasthā kālī kālakulāraṇī ।
tadraśmibhiḥ samānītā bhāvābhuṃjati bhairavīṃ ।।

ṣoḍhā ṣaḍraśmiracitā vikasadvīryasaṃkulā ।
vijṛṃbhate mahāvīryā kulakālī maholvaṇā ।।

punarbrahmamahāmuṇḍarūḍhā tadraśmirāhṛtam ।
bhuṃjate brahmakālī sā evaṃ viṣṇukulasthitā ।।

rudreśvarakulepyevaṃ kālī kālaratatparā ।
evaṃ bhairavacakkrasthā kālikā grāsamaṃtharā ।।

evaṃ ca vikulārūḍhā jagadgrasati līlayā ।
evaṃ vahnitrayārūḍhā taccchaktyāhṛtamaṃjasā ।।

bhuṃktā pramantā deveśī paramānaṃdabhairavī ।
evaṃ mādhāracakkrepi ṣoḍaśādhāradhāriṇi ।।

dhīrāṃdhuraṃ samālaṃpya sudhācakkraṃ sa maśnute ।
evaṃ śabdābhicakkrānāṃ sthitā grasati līlayā ।।

sarvaṃ sarveṇa sarvajñā grasatyetatsamāvilam ।
mahāmātri kuleśānī paramānaṃdasuṃdarā ।।

sphuradūrmmimahācakkrakramasaṃhāratatparā ।
svalīlayāsyalolā sā samyagācamatyakhilam ।।

evaṃ vaktrāgamaṃ khyātaṃ tṛtīyakramasaṃgatam ।
guruparvakramā yātaṃ mahāmātrī mataṃ śubham ।
na kathya samareśāni śiṣye maṃdaparīkṣite ।। ।।

kālikramādhikāraḥ ।। ।।

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇu padmadale kṣaṇe ।
idaṃ rahasyamatulaṃ sarvasaṃhāranirvṛtam ।।
(224a)
tvayā guptataraṃ kāryaṃ nākhyeyaṃ yasya kasyacit ।
svadhāsti bhāsā cakkrotthe svaraśmipravijṛmbhite ।।

kālayantī svakaṃ bhāvaṃ yadā tṛptinna yāti sā ।
tadā punaratikṣubdhā sukṛṣā ghorakālikā ।।

hāṭakākhyaṃ mahācakkre sarvaraśmisamanvitam ।
ghorāṃ vṛttiṃ samālaṃvya tayā grastaṃ samastakam ।।

tadā sā jvalitā raudrā punargrastaṃ tayā sakṛt ।
brahmacakkraṃ svaraśmībhirvalitaṃ viśvaghasmaram ।।

yadā grastaṃ tayā devyāṃ tadā sā jvalitā punaḥ ।
viṣṇucakkraṃ svaraśmīkaṃ punargrastaṃ tayā priye ।।

tadā koṭṭiguṇā kṣubdhā kālikā kālikālinī ।
rudracakkraṃ tayā grastaṃ sarvaraśmisamanvitam ।।

evaṃ sā jvalitā bhūyo devadevī kṛṣodarīm ।
tadā vidyeśvaraṃ cakkraṃ grastaṃ svapatisaṃyutam ।।

punaḥ kṣubdhā mahākālī paṃcamaṃtramahātanum ।
bhakṣitaṃ devadeveśyā maṃtrakoṭyayutāvṛtam ।।

tadā lakṣaguṇā kṣubdhā lelehyaṃtī mahāravā ।
ṛgityeva tayā grastaṃ bhairavānāṃ kulaṃ mahat ।।

evaṃ grastvā punaḥ kṣubdhā svaryacakkraṃ svaraśmikam ।
grastaṃ tayā mahākālyā jvalajjvalanabhāsuram ।।

trayodaśaṃ punaḥ prāpya kṣubdhā ghorārkakālikā ।
mahāmārttaṃḍalakṣāṇi grastāni ca tayā priye ।।

punarghoratarā kṣubdhā tadā ṣoḍaśacakkrapāt ।
grasate bhīmavegā sā punarjvalati vegataḥ ।।

tadā ghorā mahākālī kṣubdhā koṭṭiguṇā tadā ।
mahāvahnikulaṃ ghoraṃ tayā grastaṃ sughorakam ।।
(224b)
evaṃ prajvalitā raudrā kulasaptakṣayaṃkarī ।
kālī kālīpi kālī sā kālī kalakṣapākulā ।।

sukālī kulakāpāli vikālī kṣayakālikā ।
saṃkṣubdhā ghoravadanā raudrākṣī krodhaghasmarā ।।

śabdacakkreśvaraṃ ghoraṃ tayā grastaṃtavigraham ।
svamātribhiḥ samāyuktaṃ svaraśmipravirājitam ।।

punarghoratarā kṣubdhā tadā sparśakulaṃ sakṛt ।
tayā grastaṃ samastaṃ ca pūrvavatkālakālanam ।।

rāricakkre rūpacakkre rarirārisamanvite ।
yaścakkranātho ghorātmā jagadgrasatalampaṭaḥ ।।

svamātriraśmisaṃyukto tayā grastaṃ svamāyayā ।
tadā punarasi kṣubdhā rūpakālī kulāntakī ।।

ṣaḍrasā hāracakkraṃ yaśca nābhisvanāthayuk ।
svaraśmisahitaṃ devaṃ tayā saṃgrastavigraham ।।

tadā ghoratarā devī kṣubdhā ghorā karaṃkiṇī ।
ādhāvaṃti pradhāvaṃtī bhakṣayaṃtī carācaram ।।

gaṃdhacakkreśvaraṃ nāthaṃ tayā grastaṃ svalīlayā ।
punarmanogataṃ cakkraṃ grastaṃ devyā tayā bhṛṣam ।।

ahaṃkāramayaṃ bhūyo svamātrisahitaṃ mahat ।
grastaṃ tayā devadevyā ghorakālyā maholvaṇam ।।

tato buddhipathārūḍhaṃ cakkreśaṃ raśmisaṃyutam ।
grastadehaṃ tayā samyakkruddhayā svasvarūpataḥ ।।

evaṃ sarvādhvasaṃdhānaṃ līlayā grastavigraham ।
kṛte tayā mahākālyā kṣayakālyā kṣayāya ca ।।

kṣayaṃ kālaṃ tayā grastaṃ samastaṃ ghoravikramam ।
(225a)
mahākṣayaṃ tato kṛtvā svadhāmni kṣayakarvurā ।।

kharvīkṛtaṃ tayā vīryaṃ svasvarūpe svabhāsake ।
pradhānāstu samāyogāntayā sarvaṃ prakāśitam ।।

tato virati satyeti mahāṃte kṣayamaṃdire ।
evaṃ tatra sthitā bhāsā tatra tatra vijṛṃbhate ।।

pītvā jagadidaṃ kālī mahāsaṃhārakārakī ।
evaṃ tava samākhyātaṃ saṃhārakramamuttamam ।।

vaktrādvaktragataṃ gauri na jñātaṃ kenacittathā ।
anyāyātkathanātsadyo hyakāle maraṇaṃ bhavet ।।

mṛto vīcyau vipacyeta sādākhyaṃ vatsarāṣṭakam ।
hitaṃ jñātvā svātmano kiṃ yadābhīṣṭaṃ tadācaret ।।

naitadakramato gauriṭyākhyaṃ jātuṃ kvacinmṛyā ।
evatparaṃparāyātaṃ tavādya kathitaṃ mayā ।।

na deyaṃ bhinnadṛṣṭīnāṃ nāstikānāṃ tathaiva ca ।
pūjya devī kramaṃ paścānmahāguhyaṃ prakāśayet ।।

vīrācāraratatyātya sarvāvasthasya siddhyati ।
stuśyaṃti raśmayastasya sādhakasya mahāmate ।।

yāvanna śāṃkarī śaktiḥ patitā parameśvarī ।
tāvanna cāpnayādetatkramajñānaṃ sumadhyame ।।

siddhānte gāruḍe saure bhūtataṃtrasakaṃṭake ।
taṃtre kule tathā kaule hyatimārge tathaiva ca ।।

na kutra cinmayā khyātaṃ kramajñānaṃ yathā sthitam ।
yasmādguptataraṃ devi tena saṃgopitaṃ mayā ।।

asmi taṃtravare khyātaṃ sarahasyaṃ mayā tava ।
pūjya pūjākramaṃ yattatkramacakkrasamanvitam ।।

caturthaṣaṭke vakṣyāmi haḍḍā(ccakkravi)nirṇaye ।
(225b)
yatastu tatra vaktavyaṃ tasmānneha vicāritam ।।

etantavāgamarahasyaṃmalaṃ mayoktaṃ,
taṃtre jayadrathavare tava devadevi ।
devī kramānugati saṃkramasārabhūtaṃ,
vakṣyāmi kiṃ tava punaḥ puna jalpasubhru ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃ(śatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
devakra)mapaṭalaḥ ।। ।।

evaṃ vadati deveśe patitaḥ puṣpavṛṣṭayaḥ ।
śivārāvāḥ samudbhūtya dattatālāśca khecarāḥ ।।

akaṃpata jagatsarvaṃ brahmāṇḍaṃ hūhukaissaha ।
vadhurvātāḥ sugaṃdhāśca prahṛṣṭa sabhavajjagat ।।

sphuraṃtau khegatau bhāṃti caṃdrārkau dīptatejasau ।
tadā devī hṛṣṭatuṣṭā praṇipatya vṛṣadhvajam ।
stotreṇānena deveśaṃ tutoṣa jagadīśvaram ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

tṛptāsmi paritṛptāsmi paripūrṇāsmi śaṃkara ।
nayanonmīlanaṃ cādya vyantaṃ mama maheśvara ।।

tvat prasādāt kimaparaṃ sarvajñaparameśvara ।
namastestu trinetrāya mahābhairavamūrttaya ।।

mahācaṃḍograveśāya kapālīśāya te namaḥ ।
namo mārttaṃḍavapuṣe tatkaleśāya te namaḥ ।।

namo bhāsā svarūpāya cidacidrūpadhāriṇe ।
anaṃtabhuvanā bhogapurakāya purāraye ।।

mahābhāsāntarasthāya taccakkreśāya te namaḥ ।
nama sphuraṇarūpāya sudhāsūtilakāśine ।।

sūryāhārāya devāya namognikṣayakāriṇe ।
namaḥ kālānalādhāraghaṭṭanodyatamūrttaye ।।
(226a)
namo brahmavilādhīśa grāsikakaraṇāya te ।
vidyāsihāya dīptāya viṣveśa pravilāpine ।।

namaḥ kanakapiṃgāya vasuvakrāya mīḍhuṣe ।
namaḥ prāṇanterasthāya biṃdunādāṃtakāya ca ।।

namaḥ ṣoḍaśanāthāya tadgrāsaniratāya ca ।
namaḥ ṣaṭ kuṃḍale śāma grāsaghorārkamūrttaye ।।

namaḥ paramahotyāya juṭkaśe jagadadbhutam ।
tvaṃ hotā tvaṃ gatiḥ śuvrāstvaṃ haṃsastvaṃ parāparaḥ ।।

tvaṃ mahāmohaharaṇastvaṃ samagrajagadgatiḥ ।
tvaṃ harttā tvaṃ ca saṃharttā tvaṃ sarvaṃ tastvaṃmuttamaḥ ।।

tvaṃ yogī tvaṃ mahāsattvaṃ stvaṃ mahāmohanāśakaḥ ।
kṛtakṛtyāsmi bhagavaṃ tvatprasādānmaheśvara ।।

adhunā śrotumicchāmi kathaṃ devyo vyavasthitāḥ ।
kathaṃ tāsāṃ mahādeva vyavahāro vyavasthitaḥ ।।

kathaṃ tāsāṃ kulajñānaṃ kathaṃ tāsāṃ svarūpakam ।
kathaṃ melāpadā devyo kathaṃ mohapraṇāśikā ।।

etadicchāmi bhagavaṃ śrotuṃ suravarārcita ।
evamārṇya bhagavān prasphuraccaṃdraśekharaḥ ।
sāṭṭahāsamuvācedaṃ devadevyā maheśvaraḥ ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

sādhu sādhu mahābhāge guḍhajñānārthapārage ।
śṛṇuṣva kathayiṣyāmi yattvayā paricoditam ।।

mahārahasyamatulaṃ sarvade(veśi) marmavat ।
mahāmarmamidaṃ devi kathyamānaṃ niśāmaye ।।

pīṭhakṣetropapīṭhasthā hyupakṣetre tathāparāḥ ।
saṃdohatamasaṃdohe saṃsthitāptā mahābalāḥ ।।
(226b)
- dmanā vicaraṃtyetāścillārūpādikaiḥ priye ।
guptācārā guptamaṃtrā guptavīryāstu devatāḥ ।।

ko hi jānāti tacceṣṭā caritaṃ tattamadhyame ।
yāvattāsāṃ prasāde ca svayamutthaṃ tu sādhake ।।

tāvaṃ na jñāyate tāsāṃ ceṣṭāmarmavidhikriyā ।
śāstrajñānārtha vā guhyādguruvaktrāgamādatha ।।

tāsā navaiva yāgāti - yataṃ marmavaṃti ca ।
tatpūjā vaṃdanaṃ nityaṃ kurvati mṛgalocane ।।

prāṇāṃtepi sureśāni samayāṃ pālayaṃti tāḥ ।
pādādisparśanaṃ deśe yāgākhyenaiva tāḥ kvacit ।।

deśakṣobhe samutpanne hasaṃti ca lalanti ca ।
mahāmarakavelāyāṃ rudaṃti ca hasaṃti ca ।।

vyādhite vikale traste kṛtetīte savihvale ।
kṣīve kāmininiḥsatye mahāśucirate sadā ।।

devatā nindake mūḍho gurvācāravikalpini ।
praharaṃti sadārasyo haraṃti ca vasāmiśam ।।

śoṣayaṃti śarīraṃ tājīvitaṃ ca haraṃti hi ।
mahākāmaratānityaṃ sarvāścāmiṣalampaṭāḥ ।।

bhartuḥ śuśruṣaṇaratā dambhamāyā śatācitāḥ ।
nirghṛṇā vīravistāstā devatākāralampaṭāḥ ।।

chidrā viṣaratā nityaṃ ratnāharaṇabhāsurāḥ ।
kalahe gātrabhaṃge ca cācike bālabhāvataḥ ।।

ramaṃti niyataṃmantā devatāḥ kāmacāriṇīḥ ।
tāsāṃ kulāni mukhyāni vasusaṃkhyā sthitāni ca ।।

purāvistaraśotkāni kiṃciduddeśataḥ śṛṇu ।
brāhmī māheśvarī caiva kārttikeyī ca viṣṇujā ।।

vārāhī caiva śākrī ca cāmuṃḍā ca tathāparā ।
(227a)
yogeśvarī cāṣṭamī syāt kulamātryau mahābalāḥ ।।

akulātkulamutpannaṃ tacca śāktaṃ tu paṃcadhā ।
aṣṭadhā punareva syāt punaḥ samyaganaṃtatām ।।

layajanmapravāhākhya cāravicchinti saṃjñitam ।
paṃcadhā yajñamākhyātaṃ tadevāṣṭaprakārakam ।।

tatkulotthā mahāmātryo sarvakaulasya kāraṇam ।
āsāṃ kulotthitāḥ sarvā yāḥ proktā bhuvanodare ।।

ḍākhyo ḍāmarikādyāśca śākinyo mātarastathā ।
deśajā pīṭhakāścānyā adhoccchāsaratāḥ parāḥ ।।

ūrddhaniśvāsikāścānyā tathānyā nakracūṣikā ।
patralekhyaḥ parāścānyā jātahāriṇya eva ca ।।

etāścānyāśca bahavo yāsāṃ saṃkhyā na vidyate ।
paripūrṇasvarūpāstāścihnaiśca samayairyutaḥ ।।

bahugatyo bahuvidhā bahumāyā śatānvitāḥ ।
bahurūpā bahubhāṣāścitrāścaryakarāssadā ।।

karāmalakavatsarvaṃ jagadbrahmāṇḍamaṇḍalam ।
paśyaṃti devadeveśi atītānāṃ gataṃ tathā ।।

varttamānaṃ ca yatsarvaṃ tadvi{danti} yathārthataḥ ।
karastha bilvavaddevi parahṛtsthaṃ vidaṃti tāḥ ।।

saṃdhikuḍyaṃ parvataṃ vā tāsāṃ nāvaraṇaṃ priye ।
kṣaṇādvilvanti deśeṣu nīraṃ sūryaprabhā yathā ।।

yadyanmatasi roceta tāsāṃ rūpaṃ bhavettataṃ ।
rūpādrūpasahasrāṇi prakurvaṃti hi līlayā ।।

samayebhyo na naśyaṃti prāṇāṃ tepi kadācana ।
gavāṃ goṣṭhe ratirnityaṃ tatpūjā rajabhakṣaṇam ।।

prajā pūjā tatpriyatvaṃ brāhmyā samayamuttamam ।
(227b)
śivastu me catvare ca śmaśāne pūjanaṃ sadā ।।

māheśī samayaṃ bhadre śivāṃvuprāśanaṃ sadā ।
pustikā pūjanaratā niyataṃ śiśutatparā ।।

kaumaryā samayaṃ jñeyaṃ brahmabhakṣaṇatatparā ।
māyāmayī yuddhapūjyā yātrā suramate sadā ।।

caṃdanaṃ prāśayennityaṃ vaiṣṇavyā samaṃ yasmṛtam ।
viṣṭhāśanisāhasikā bhūmivīkṣaṇatatparā ।।

miśrakaṃ cāśate nityaṃ vārāhī samaye smṛtam ।
vibhavaṃ mānayennityaṃ raktaprāśanatatparā ।।

aiṃḍyā samayametaddhi sṛṣṭitrayamaśetsadā ।
varddhamānapriyā nityaṃ cāmuṇḍā samayaṃ smṛtam ।।

śmaśānamṛtanirmālya vandane niratā sadā ।
navakaṃ bhakṣayennityaṃ carcikā samayaṃ sadā ।।

evaṃ samayarudvīptā punarbhedaṃ śṛṇu priye ।
tāsāṃ tu rūpakaṃ śubhraṃ durvijñeyaṃ surāsuraiḥ ।।

vedapriyā śuciratā prajotpādanatatparā ।
viśālanetrā susnātā bimboṣṭhī cārudarśanā ।।

tathā jñeyaṃ vīravaraistridhā samyaḍmaheśvari ।
padmagaurā padmamukhā suśīlā brahmavādinī ।।

trayī kathā suramate taddharā ramate sadā ।
padmaṃ likhati sā nityaṃ gṛhe parvaṇi parvaṇi ।।

hāsāddharati sājīvaṃ * geyāptā nātra saṃśayaḥ ।
brahmāṇi kulajā sāmyānnityaṃ daṇḍāsanapriyā ।।

surūpā pītagaurāṃgī patranetrā suhāsinī ।
(228a)
nityaṃ harṣasamāviṣṭā sadā gāyanatatparā ।।

mahārahasya tiratā mahāmaṃgalatatparā ।
sarvābharaṇasampannā vīṇāvādyaratā sadā ।।

svaparvaṇi vasā nityaṃ triśūlaṃ likhati gṛhe ।
māheśvarīkule jātā sā jñeyā sarvalampaṭā ।।

vasāmiṣādiharaṇī sā śaktā nityameva ca ।
raktāṃgī raktagau * ca vidyāśilpā kṛtaśramā ।।

sarvapakṣipriyā nityaṃ gītavādyaratā bhṛṣam ।
ṣadyo svaveśmati sadā śaktiṃ likhati sā gṛhe ।।

lampaṭā kusumāmode vācā jīvaṃ haratyasau ।
kaumārī kulajā sā tu jñeyā āmiśagṛddhinī ।।

bahumāyā śataratā śyāmā vai cāruhāsinī ।
mahāhavakathā saktā cārvaṅgī sumanoharā ।।

raktapānapriyā nityaṃ sparśājjīvaṃ haratyasau ।
svaparvaṇi sadācakkraṃ ṇikhate gṛhamaṃdire ।।

lalāṭaṃ svidyate tasyā vaiṣṇavī sā na saṃśayaḥ ।
dīrghavaktrā sthūlagaṇḍā piṃgākṣī dīrgharoṣiṇī ।।

daṃturā rūkṣakeśā ca dīrgharoṣā mahābalā ।
chidrairāharate sā tu vyādhyādibhiranekadhā ।।

sthavikāparṇaṇi sadā likhate sā gṛhottame ।
vārāhī kulasaṃbhūtā sadāraṇyapriyā sadā ।।

subhagā cāruvadanā mahālakṣmīsamanvitā ।
raktagaurā raktanetrā rājyāraṃbhakathākulā ।।

mahe bhagamanāsāntanityaṃ yuddhapriyā hi sā ।
svaparvaṇi gṛhe vajraṃ likhete sā sadaiva hi ।।

āghrāṇāddharate jīvaṃ krūrādyā nirghṛṇā hi sā ।
aiṃdrī kuloditā sā syātsatataṃ māṃsalampaṭā ।।
(228b)
krūrā krūrāśayā bhīmā kṛṣṇā sarvatra lomaśā ।
mṛte kṣate tathā vraste ramate sā sadaiva hi ।।

yatra yatra rudaṃtyeva tatra tatra rase tathā ।
sadā mṛtikathāsveva saktomadyāsiśapriyā ।।

śākhātrayaṃ lalāṭe syāddaṇḍaṃ parvaṇi cālikhen ।
dṛṣṭipātāddharejjīvaṃ paśūnāṃ sā bhayānakā ।।

yāmyāṃśakulasaṃbhūtā yoginī sā mahābalā ।
sthūlagātrā sthūlagaṃḍā laṃboṣṭhī cipiṭānanā ।।

laṃbodarī svalpabhujā raktavarṇā mahaujasā ।
piṃgākṣī piṃgakeśā ca cūṃcanājjīvamāharet ।।

mahāyuddhakathāsaktā saktā sā raktapānake ।
kapālaṃ likhate veśme saṃdhyāsu hasate sadā ।।

cāmuṃḍā kulajā sā tu jñeyā sarvakulottamā ।
kṛṣāṃgā kapilā kṛṣṇā sthūlagaṃḍā kṛṣodarī ।।

dīrghajihvā dīrghadaṃtā sadā roṣasamākulā ।
sadāmṛtakathāsveva ramate sā kṛtavyathe ।।

sirālā rūkṣavadanā sarvatra kulanaṃdanā ।
sadrā parvasu sveveśme dravakaṃ pūjayedbhṛṣam ।।

utthitā prasravenmūtraṃ viṣvā caiva sumadhyame ।
evaṃ lakṣaṇasaṃyuktā yogeśī kulanaṃdanī ।।

evamevāvadhā paṃcakulabhedaṃ kuleśvari ।
jñāte kulakrame devi melāpī kleśavarjitaḥ ।।

bhavatyeva na saṃdehaṃ sādhakaḥ sarvavallabhaḥ ।
miśriteścihnasaṃghātainmiśrāṃśā bhavati priye ।।

āsāṃ svarūpabhedārthaṃ chommakā śṛṇu sāṃpratam ।
yadyapi prāksamuddiṣṭāstathāpi kathayāmyaham ।।
(229a)
ā i ū ai tathā o ca rṛ ro aśca kulāṣṭakam ।
krameṇa devadeveśi vijñātavyaṃ hi sādhakau ।।

śuklapakṣe caṃdracāre evamatrodayaṃ smṛtam ।
krameṇa kulajānāṃ ca bhāṣayet sādhakeśvaraḥ ।।

tadā tuṣṭā bhaviṣyaṃti yoginyaḥ sādhakātmanām ।
evaṃ śukle samākhyātaṃ kṛṣṇapakṣedhunā śṛṇu ।।

akāraśca ikāraśca uekārau tathaiva ca ।
okāraśca ṛkāraśca okārā aṃ tathā priye ।।

etadaṣṭakamākhyātaṃ kṛṣṇapakṣe sadaiva hi ।
sūryasyodayakāle ca krameṇa kulabhedataḥ ।।

anena kramabhedena vācyo bhāṣāviniścayaḥ ।
devatānāṃ kulācāre vargabhedastathaiva ca ।।

vargakramādivarṇārṇaṃ pratijñeyaṃ tathā kramāt ।
yasyā vācyaṃ yasya vācyaṃ striyā vā puruṣasya vā ।।

tatkulaṃ tasya vijñeyaṃ sācchusmā tasya kīrttitā ।
tadāsau prīyate devi aṃgacchusmā śṛṇu priye ।।

śirovaktraṃ ca kaṃṭaṃ ca hṛdguhyaṃ ligameva ca ।
pādau hastau ca subhage kramādaṣṭau kulā smṛtāḥ ।।

yasyāḥ kulaṃ yaduddiṣṭaṃ tasyāstaṃ darśayennaraḥ ।
sā prīṇāti tadā devi chusmakā sādhakasya hi ।।

evamatra vicāraṃ syāt kramabhedaṃ vijānataḥ ।
mānasyaścātrayocchummāmanabhaiva hitā smṛtāḥ ।।

yasyayaṃ kulamuddiṣṭaṃ tanmanormmaṇahetutaḥ ।
tajñāstadevajānagnitatkulācāramānataḥ ।।

śabdasparśastathārūpaṃ rasau gaṃ{dha}śca paṃcamaḥ ।
manobuddhirahaṃkāraṃ kulāṣṭakamidaṃ kramāt ।।
(229b)
mānasaṃ tatparijñāyaṃ chommakā kramabhedataḥ ।
evaṃ padānāṃ deveśyā prasaṣṭakavibhedataḥ ।।

chommakādikramaṃ jñeyaṃ tridhā triguṇameva ca ।
sādhayet priyamelāpasiddhaye sādhakassadā ।।

yathā padavibhāgena sādhanānantavigraham ।
tathā sāptaramevātra varṇitaṃ te nagātmaje ।।

adhunā melake karmma yathāvat pravravīmi te ।
laṃkevyaryā mahādevi padaṃ prati vibhāgataḥ ।।

mahāmelāpayāgaiśca rāvaṇena purā priye ।
ārādhitā maheśānī kuṃbhakarṇena dhīmatā ।।

vibhīṣaṇena ca tathā tathānyairvīrarājabhiḥ ।
tathārādhyā sādhakeṃdrermahāmāyā vivarjitaiḥ ।।

ye kalaṃkavinirmuktā madamohavivarjitāḥ ।
nirmalā gaganaprakhyāste melāpasya bhājanāḥ ।।

śarīraśaṃkā yeṣāṃ vai jātiśaṃkā na vidyate ।
dravyaśaṃkā nayeṣāṃ vai te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

maṃtraśaṃkā sthānaśaṃkā kriyāśaṃkā nayeṣu vai ।
sarvaśaṃkā vinirmuktāsteṣu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

nirddhaṃddhā nirghṛṇā krurā nityonmantā madākulāḥ ।
koṭarākṣīśca ye devi te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

yairadhītaṃ mahātaṃtraṃ sarahasyaṃ suvistaram ।
tatkramācāraniratāste tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

yeṣāṃ tṛṇasamaṃvittaṃ {cintaṃ} śailanatopamam ।
sarvācāraratā ye tu te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

yeṣāṃ tridhāmasaṃghaṭṭe nityameva gamāgamam ।
bhavatyeva hi vārāṇāṃ te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।
(230a)

biṃdunādakalājālaṃ bhakṣayaṃti ca ye sadā ।
sarvabhakṣā mahāsattvāḥ te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

yeṣāṃ nāḍikulaṃ sarvaṃ vitataṃ mārgavatsthitam ।
taṃtra saṃvedanaparāste tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

ṣaṭkāraṇakulaṃ sarvaṃ vyutkramādbhakṣite tu yaiḥ ।
asaṃkuṃcitacidrūpāste tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

caṃdrasūryalayotthāne satataṃ ye vivārakāḥ ।
śakticaṃdrasamāviṣṭāste tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

yeṣāṃ lakṣatraye lakṣaṃ nipataṃ pravijṛṃbhate ।
nivikalpena manasā te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

ye svaśaktivilāsāḍhyā tanmaithunaratāśca ye ।
tatpuṣpāhāraniratāste tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

yeṣāṃ rajolvaṇāśaktirmadaghūrmitamekhalā ।
sphura osabhagātyarthaṃ te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

yairāhṛtaṃ gurorvaktrā cāmṛtaṃ lampaṭai naraiḥ ।
samadā nityatṛptāśca te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

yaiśca dūtī kulaṃ dṛṣṭaṃ yaiśca pītaṃ ca tadrasam ।
ye sadaiva mahābālāste tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

āhṛtaṃ brahmasadanādbrahmaviccāntakaṃ ca yaiḥ ।
yaiḥ prapītaṃ jagadbimbaṃ te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

ṣoḍaśādhāraparyaṃte yeṣāṃ nityoditā sthitiḥ ।
atastamitabhārūpāste tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

bharitākāranā yeṣāṃ svasvarūpodgatā bhṛṣam ।
bhairavā vīrarājānaste tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

nāḍimārgeṣu ye nityaṃ vicaraṃti yathāsukham ।
kramātkramaparikṣīṇāste tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।
(230b)
paṃcāmṛtagrāsaratāṣṣa(ḍra)sā haraṇodyatāḥ ।
te vīravīrarājānassadā melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

ye pibanti sadā{vi}ṣṇuṃ bhagaṃ cuṃbaṃti ye sadā ।
sṛṣṭitrayaṃ samaśnaṃti te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

brahmāmbubhakṣaṇaratā vukabhakṣā hutāśanāḥ ।
madhyamottamaharttārāste tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

sevaṃti yena lājyaṃ ca puṣpaṃ kuṃḍodbhavaṃ tathā ।
miśrakaṃ vāpyamiśraṃ ca te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

ye sadā paramavyogni gamāgamaratā narāḥ ।
caṃdrasūryeva tatrasthāste tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

kalāśino kalāntasthāḥ kalanā kālavarjitāḥ ।
kṛkarāmattabhṛgāṃśca te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

mahatkaṃkālino ye ca mahābhasmāṃgahā jaṭāḥ ।
mahāsūtradharā ye tu te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

ye saṃhāranti duritaṃ dṛṣṭvādṛṣṭaṃ haraṃti ye ।
ye dhārayaṃti kādyaśaṃ te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

ye mahāmohahantāro sadā samayapālakāḥ ।
sadā sūtradharā ye ca te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

ye śūnyacakkrakrahare viharaṃti narottamāḥ ।
prabuddhapadmaṣaṃḍeṣu te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

ye ca cakkrakule nityaṃ gamāga{ma}vicārakāḥ ।
pratinābhigatā ye ca te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

yeṣāmādhāracakkreṣu ciraṃ carvaṇalampaṭam ।
cetaścāmarasaṃcārī te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

ye prabodhakulāntasthā gamāgamamathojjhitāḥ ।
caraṃti viṣuvanmadhye te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।
(231a)
maṃtrataṃtraparijñānajñānajñeyavicārakāḥ ।
kuśalāstatpathe nityaṃ te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

cakkracaṇḍaratā ye ca ye ca kuṃḍalimadhyagāḥ ।
citsuspandaratā ye ca te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

ye ca vā kritayāntasthā ye ca vāktritayojjhitāḥ ।
parityaktā mahāmārgaṃ te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

yeṣāṃ jāgradivasvapnaṃ yeṣāṃ svapnaṃ suṣuptavat ।
yeṣāṃ turyāyate sarvaṃ te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

ye bhakṣayaṃti caṃdrārkau ye pibanti jalārṇavam ।
ye krīḍanti jagallakṣmyā te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

ye pibaṃti bhagaṃ vīrā liṃgamevālihaṃti ye ।
tadānaṃdarasonmattāḥ te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

puṣpodayātsamārabhya yāvatpuṣpāntamāgatam ।
tāvadbhagavilāntasthāste tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

picuvaktraratānityaṃ picuvaktrāntaraṃ gatāḥ ।
tadgamāṃtarasaṃbuddhāste tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

nityapādāraniratā nityaṃ ṣaḍrasalaṃpatauḥ ।
ye parākrarṣaṇavyagrāṃste tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

jīvavadyena jīvaṃti * vaṃti śivavacca ye ।
nityotsavāḥ prajīvaṃti te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

mahāyānāvasānasthā udayasthāśca ye sadā ।
kramodaragatā ye ca te tu melāpabhājanāḥ ।।

evaṃ samāsataḥ proktaṃ vicārya tanumadhyame ।
paścāt melāpakaṃ karmma kāryaṃ sādhakasattamaiḥ ।।

ekaikena kramenaiva puroddiṣṭena bhairavi ।
melāpabhājano jāyennānyathā varavarṇini ।।
(231b)
ādau melāpasaṃsiddhau vratametatsamācaret ।
cīllavratastato devi paścānmelāpamācaret ।।

vratametat pravakṣyāmi nāmnā kaṃkālabhāsuraṃ ।
paṃcīrtvā piṃḍasiddhiḥ syāt sādhakasya mahātmanaḥ ।।

kādyakhaṃḍāṣṭake naiva muṃḍamālāṃ {su}carcitām ।
pratikhaṃḍaṃ karaṃkāṃkaṃ {taṃ} kṛtvā mūrddhni dhārayet ।।

khaṭvāṃgaṃ chidrasaṃpūrṇaṃ mahācāmaraśobhitam ।
cīrākiṃkanisaṃyuktaṃ sudaṃḍaṃ dṛḍhamavraṇam ।।

dhārayedvāmakaragaṃ nānāśobhā samanvitam ।
karṇābhyāṃ mudrike kārye narāsthighaṭite śubhe ।।

kaṃṭhe mālāmasthimayāṃ latāsaptakabhūṣitām ।
pralamvantaṃ mahāhāraṃ tadvadevadharaṃ naraḥ ।।

kādyaṃ dakṣiṇahastasthaṃ surāmadyādipūritam ।
mekhalāsthi na yā kāryā muṇḍakhaṃḍavibhūṣitā ।।

kiṃkaṇībhiḥ samāyuktā narakeśasamanvitā ।
madhye naramaṇiṃ tasyāḥ karttavyaṃ kuliśodari ।।

nūpurāvasthiracitau sūkṣmakiṃkarici{tri}trau ।
vīrabhasmasamālipto sopavītassamāhitaḥ ।।

madirānaṃdacaitanyo sugaṃdhakusumānvitaḥ ।
tāṃbūlavaktrasaṃpaṃno madaghūrṇitalocanaḥ ।।

hasedvāhāragaṃ raudraṃ paryaṭena samantataḥ ।
kāpālikosmi kaṃkālī raśmimelāpalolupaḥ ।।

sarvabhakṣopi paṃcāśī vīracakkreśvaro hyaham ।
evaṃ vādī bhavennityaṃ vicareddhīrarāṭsadā ।।

mahāvīrya kalārūḍho bhairavācārapālakaḥ ।
māsatrayamidaṃ kurvaṃ plavate gaganāṅganam ।।
(232a)
ṣaṇmāsāddeva deveśyāssadṛśosau bhaviṣyati ।
māsamekaṃ vratamidaṃ kṛtvā melāpabhājanaḥ ।।

bhavatyeva mahāvīro sarvakhecarivaṃditaḥ ।
vratottamamidaṃ devi duṣprāpamakṛtātmanām ।।

atha conmattakaṃ kāryaṃ vrataṃ paramaśobhanam ।
asatyūlāpalāpīsyādyena * ketacidātaḥ ।।

digaṃbarā muktakeśo sarvabhakṣo hyalolupaḥ ।
kṣaṇaṃ hase kṣaṇaṃ gāye kṣaṇaṃ rode kṣaṇaṃ raṭet ।।

kṣaṇaṃ plavet kṣaṇaṃ nartte kṣaṇaṃ dhāve kṣaṇaṃ lalet ।
kṣaṇaṃ śāntaṃ kṣaṇaṃ vīraṃ kṣaṇaṃ bhītatsavadbhavet ।।

kṣaṇaṃ raudrarasāvastho kṣaṇameva bhayānakam ।
kṣaṇaṃ śṛṃgāriṇaṃ devi kṣaṇaṃ hāsyaikatatparaḥ ।।

kṣaṇamadbhutasaṃrūḍho kṣaṇaṃ kāruṇyamāsthitaḥ ।
nānārasasamāviṣṭo nānābhāvasamāsthitaḥ ।।

nānāvilāsasaṃyukto nānāgītaravākulaḥ ।
rathyāpatitanirmālyaṃ śavarnirmālyameva vā ।।

dhārayetsatataṃ dehe sphuṭecca bahubhāṣayā ।
kṣaṇaṃ kroṣṭukarāvīsyā kṣaṇaṃ cillā ravākulaḥ ।।

haye heṣā ravamapi kṣaṇaṃ gajaravaṃ vadet ।
kṣaṇaṃ mārjārarāvī syāt kṣaṇaṃ sārasavaṃ nadet ।।

garvabhākhyaṃ kṣaṇaṃ rāvaṃ nadennādaṃ {ca} kesaraṃ ।
kṣaṇaṃ maṃgacatuṣkeṇa valvajātyaśvavaṃ naraḥ ।।

kāpālikohaṃ ca vadeścaṃḍālohaṃ vadetpunaḥ ।
raśmināthotmi mattosmi kṣudhosmi pralapāmyaham ।।

evamādīni vākyāni viṣamānyapi bhāṣayet ।
sphuradrāviṇicakkrestho kalākulavi(lā)savam ।।

cidvāmni parame rūḍho sarvāyatanagahvare ।
(232b)
tadbalena samāyuktaṃ vratametaccaretsadā ।।

māsamātraṃ śmaśānādau rātrāvapi hi paryaṭen ।
tadā saptāhamātreṇa devīnāṃ darśanaṃ bhavet ।।

nānārūpaiḥ kurūpaiśca yuktāyuktaṃ vadaṃtitāḥ ।
tataḥ paraṃ prayacchaṃti siddhadravyāṇi yāni ca ।।

khaḍbhājanaśilābhasma rocanālopavītikāḥ ।
na spṛśeta sureśāni sadā paṃcasudhāmaśet ।।

tenaivordvarttayadgātraṃ bahiḥ kiṃcitna cotsṛjet ।
sādhakeṃdro mahāvīro māsamevaṃ samācaret ।।

tadā saplavate vyogni śaktyantaṃ yāvadeva hi ।
mahābhairavanāthena pūjyate sarvakālikam ।।

yathā sā parameśānī kālikā bhairaveśvarī ।
tadvadeva bhaveddevi sādhako bahunātra kim ।।

evaṃ vratottamaṃ devi duścaraṃ bhairaveṣvapi ।
kiṃtu sattvavihīnaiśca bhīrubhiśca narādhamaiḥ ।।

vratasyāsya vidhijñeyo sapūjya syādyathā vayam ।
sarvayogini cakkrāṇāṃ pūjyāṃ mānyasya jāyate ।।

jñātamātrodvratasyāsya bhairaveśca bhavennaraḥ ।
yaścaivaṃ vadane nityaṃ kariṣyāmi vratottamam ।।

sa ca ṣaṇmāsamātreṇa devadevīṃ prapaśyati ।
sarvottamamidaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ vratametattavoditam ।।

evaṃ vratadvayamidaṃ divā nikaticiccaret ।
paścānmelāpabhāgī syādanyathā niṣphalā kriyā ।
etatsamāsataḥ khyātaṃ kimanyat kathayāmi te ।। ।।

(233a)
।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
vratavidhirnāmapaṭalaḥ ।। ।।

devyuvāca ।।

evaṃ metanmahādeva yathā khyātaṃ tvayā mama ।
tava jñānaṃ mayā deva āditassamanukramāt ।।

tatra metanmahāguhyaṃ rahasyānekasaṃkulam ।
tvat prasādāt suraśreṣṭha paritṛptāsmi śaṃkara ।।

adhunā śrotumicchāmi mukhopāyamahādbhutam ।
kaṣṭasādhananirmuktaṃ vratacaryā vivarjitam ।।

yo vidhi devatānāṃ ca melāpe vṛṣalāṃcchana ।
tamākhyā hi mahādeva kāruṇyānmedayo para ।।

evamākarṇya deveṃdraḥ prahasya suciraṃ haraḥ ।
uvāca parameśānyā melāpavidhivistaram ।
bahucakkrasamākīrṇaṃ sarahasyaṃ mahādbhutam ।। ।।

bhairava uvāca ।।

śṛṇuṣva kathayiṣyāmi sādhuyaścodito hyaham ।
kālicakkrakrame yacca rahasyamupavarṇitam ।।

tamāpya ca gurorvaktrādabhyasya ca sumadhyame ।
iṣanmaṃtrajapaṃ kṛtvā paścātparyaṭanaṃ kuru ।।

vidyācakkrapadai devi mahāmelāpamāharet ।
madirānaṃdavittosau siṃdūrāktatanuryadā ।।

mahāpaṃcāmṛtāsakto kalpapālakulaṃ vrajet ।
madyādhārāttato madyaṃ krīḍavyaṃ vīravat priye ।।

no(co)dbhakṣedidaṃ jalpaṃ raśyo me tṛṣitā tṛṣam ।
tāsāṃ tṛptyai dīyatāṃ me madyādhārāntu bhairavān ।।

mahānaṃdakalākoṭi yena tṛpyanti mātaraḥ ।
evamuktvā prayacchanti madyaṃ te parameśvari ।।
(233b)
taṃ gṛhītvā prapūryevaṃ ghaṭamāḍhakasasmitam ।
saṃtarpyātmānamevātra madaghūrṇitalocanaḥ ।।

vrajedvīragṛhaṃ maṃtrī śūnyaveśmamathāpi vā ।
tatrāpūryamukhaṃ tvevaṃ padamekaṃ samuddharet ।।

phūkiredyāvadevāsau tāvadāyānti devatāḥ ।
śvānamārjārarūpādyairnānārūpairmadotkaṭā ।।

nānābhāṣāvadaṃtyetāḥ sādhakāgreṇa saṃśayaḥ ।
tābhissārddhaṃ tattvateśca plavate gaganāṃgaṇam ।।

sādhako devadeveśi bhairaveva bhavedataḥ ।
athavā tena madyena pītenaiva hi mā satāḥ ।।

yoginī melakaṃ jāyet priyākhyaṃ sarvakāmadam ।
athavā pītamadyastu paryaṭe dāpanāṃ bahūm ।।

yatra rocaṃti bhāsaṃti rudaṃtistrā kadaṃbakāḥ ।
narttanti vā mahābhāge tatra tadvatsamācaret ।।

paravīryasamāyukto paramamāvalokakaḥ ।
evaṃ vai kurvatastasya tatra yā yoginī priye ।।

sopasaryati tasyāśu prīyamānā mudānvitā ।
yad rahasyaṃ ca tantasya kathayenmithunena sā ।।

tasya jñānaiva laṃghyā syāt sādhakena vijānatā ।
bhavenmelāpamatulaṃ yatsureṃdreṣu durlabham ।।

atha tailikagehaṃ vā melāpārthī vrajettataḥ ।
tatra gatvā mahābhāge pūrvamasya samannitaḥ ।।

udāharatyadavarānmanasā sādhakeśvaraḥ ।
taccakkrārūḍhapavāsau khecarī baṃdhamāsthitaḥ ।।

svarūpānaṃdago yogī sahasraṃ parivarttayet ।
niyataṃ padarājānaṃ saptāhaṃ yāvadeva hi ।।
(234a)
tāvadeva bhaventasya cakkravadgramaṇaṃ mahat ।
yoganidrāṃ tato yāti sādhakosau mahābalaḥ ।।

nidrāgatastadā so vai vīro paśyan mahāmatiḥ ।
devatā vṛṃdamakhilaṃ nānārūpamanekaśaḥ ।।

tābhissārddhaṃ māsamātrāt plavate gaganāṃtaram ।
tatra tābhiḥ pūjyateso yathā bhairavanāyakaḥ ।।

sarvajñaḥ sarvakarttā ca mahāyogeśvareśvaraḥ ।
athānyaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi melāpaṃ vāhanānugam ।।

kārayedvīrakāṣṭhotthaṃ tripādaṃ dravakaṃ śubham ।
aṣṭāṃgulaparīṇāhaṃ mukhamasya ṣaḍaṃgulam ।।

ṣaṭtriṃśāṃgulamānena daighyo deva bhavatyasau ।
tatkāṣṭhajau budhnakīlau tasya raupyau supādavat ।।

pūrvāparagato devi evaṃ vāhanamuttamam ।
kṛtvā saṃsnāpayedenaṃ alinā surayā tathā ।।

punarvāmāmṛte naiva punareva śivāṃbhasā ।
punaścandananāthena brahmaṇā punareva tat ।।

nālājyena punardevi punareva tu kena ca ।
gṛheśvarasya jāyāyā tayā snāpyaṃ padottamaiḥ ।।

rāmā puṣpeṇa tadanu snāpyaṃ taṃ vāhanottamam ।
sṛṣṭitrayena taṃ paścāt snāpyaṃ ca parameśvari ।।

evaṃ kāyo vidhirdevi siddhasthānaṃ suśobhanaṃ ।
bhramatprāṇapravāhena mahābhāvāvalaṃbakaḥ ।।

khecakkrastho mahābhāgo devadevīṃ prapūjayet ।
matsyamāṃsāsavairdivyaiḥ surāśīdhādibhistathā ।।

matsyatailādibhirdīpairmahātailavimiśritaiḥ ।
dravakasthāṃ madhyatosau devadevīṃ prapūjayet ।।

saptāhaṃ yāvadevaṃ hi tadā dhūmāyate nu tat ।
(234b)
ūṣmāyate kramāccainaṃ jvalate ca tatopyanu ।।

tadā siddhaṃ vijānīyādvāhanaṃ taṃ mahottamam ।
śṛṇu krameṇa vakṣyāmi siddhasyāsyaiva lakṣaṇam ।।

dhūmāyitena subhage śmaśānasthasya tasya ca ।
gudadeśavyavasthasya khagati striṃśayojanān ।।

yaṃ yaṃ sthānaṃ viciṃttyataṃ taṃ taṃ yāti kṣaṇāntarāt ।
tatrasthaṃ dravyamādāya kṣaṇādāyāti vegataḥ ।।

tatrasthā yoginī yā tu bhūcarī khecarīthavā ।
ḍāvyā ḍāmarikā siddhi milatesānaṃ saṃśayaḥ ।।

kramā jñānapradā sā tu sādhakasya na saṃśayaḥ ।
ūṣmāyitena vai tena śṛṇu yat sicyate priye ।।

mahāvīragṛhāttasthe khagatirdaśayojanāt ।
tintiraṃdhraiḥ prayātyeṣa sādhako nātra saṃśayaḥ ।।

bhūcarīṇāṃ ca lāmānāṃ sahamelāpabhāgbhavet ।
yena melāpake naiva sādhakassarvavidbhavet ।।

harttā karttā yathā rudro bhavatyeva hi sādhakaḥ ।
antarddhānaṃ prayātyeṣa mānuṣāṇāṃ sadā priye ।।

mahāśambaravijñānaṃ dehe cāsya prajāyate ।
adhunā jvalitasyāsya śṛṇu vakṣyāmi vai bhavat ।।

etadvidulabhataraṃ vāhanedrasya sādhanam ।
tatrāpi jvalitaṃ prāpya janmanā paścimena tu ।।

yāti brahmāṇḍamakhilaṃ gatiścāsya nirudhyate ।
taṃ vāhanī kṛtaṃ yena sādhakena mahātmanā ।।

sabhavedbhairavaḥ sākṣāt sarvayogeśvarārcitaṃḥ ।
śāpānugrahakṛdvīro sarvamelāpako dhepaḥ ।।
(235a)
sarvanātho sarvagatirmahātejā mahābalaḥ ।
rūpādrūpasahasrāṇi kṣaṇādeva karotyasau ।।

lakṣeṇa yoginīnāṃ ca sevyatesau mahābalaḥ ।
mahācarubhujo nityaṃ nityaṃ siddhiphalānvitaḥ ।।

śivaśaktiyutaścāsau bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ ।
evaṃ vā harajā siddhistavākhyātā yathārthataḥ ।।

adhunā melake karma kathayāmi taveśvari ।
pūrvamadyena saṃtṛpto madayukto mahābalaḥ ।।

citibhasmasamālipto mahāsṛgupalepitaḥ ।
araghaṭṭaṃ vrajedvīro padānyeva udāharam ।।

tadyaṃtrārūḍha evāsau pūrṇāṃ vṛttiṃ samākṣipet ।
tadā saptāhamātreṇa sādhako melakaṃ labhet ।।

yamavāpya na śocanti punareva narottamāḥ ।
adhunā śṛṇu devīnāṃ navayāgā purā hi ye ।।

siṃdhukhaṃḍe mayoktāni taistu melāpa uttamaḥ ।
peśanīpṛṣṭhasaṃrūḍho mudrāṃ baddhā karaṃkiṇīm ।।

pūrvamadyena sānaṃdasaptāhaṃ maṃtramuccaram ।
yāvadātiṣṭhate vīro tāvanmelāpabhāgasau ।।

evaṃ vidhena vidhinā khaṇḍanīrūḍha eva hi ।
pheratāṃ baṃdhayenmudrāṃ tadā melāpamāpnuyāt ।।

pūrvoktenaiva kālena devināmnyatra saṃśayaḥ ।
kāṃcityāmapi deveśi puroktavidhimācaret ।।

puroktamadyasaṃtṛpto divyamudrāṃ prabaṃdhayet ।
tadā saptāhamātreṇa vīro melāpa bhāgbhavet ।।

musale vāhanānyeva vidhimātra samāharet ।
pūrvavatsiddhipavasyādviśeṣo na vidhīyate ।।
(235b)
mārjinyā madhurā vacmi yathāvanmelakaṃ labhet ।
jyeṣṭhāgre tāṃ pratiṣṭhāpya sahasrārṇā padaṃ yajet ।।

yathābhimatamevātra pūrvamadyādinā priye ।
tatastatpṛṣṭhasaṃrūḍho lelihānāṃ prabaṃdhayen ।।

tadā saptāhamātreṇa sādhako melakaṃ labhet ।
eṣa eva vidhirjñeyo culliyāge mahottame ।।

tatreṣṭikā yajedagre saptāhānmelakaṃ labhet ।
śūrpamānīya nīraṃdhraṃ tāṃ jyeṣṭhāgre prapūjayet ।।

cravake sādhayitvā tu carumātra nivedayet ।
tadvaddarvī prapūjyeta pūrvamadya sunanditaḥ ।।

evaṃ pragṛhya gantavyaṃ mahāvīryagṛhaṃ priye ।
tatrasthaḥ prauddharedvidyāṃ padaṃ vā ca tadekakam ।।

tadā melāpabhāgī syāt sādhako ghaṭikādvayāt ।
jalakuṃbhe tadevaṃ syādvidhānaṃ melako vidho ।।

vardvamāne pravakṣyāmi yathā melāpasaṃgatiḥ ।
gatvā vai varddhamānākhyaṃ tatra saṃkarṣaṇīṃ yajet ।।

paṃcaratnotthitairdravyai punaḥ khecaribaṃdhanāt ।
melāpabhāgvīravaro bhavatyeva mahābalaḥ ।।

sarvakāmatamṛdvārtho yāti khecaratāṃ naraḥ ।
susiddhaḥ paramānaṃdayuktosau mokṣamarcchati ।।

evametanmayātaṃ * taṃtra metadanuttamam ।
vasiṣṭhena purādhītaṃ naranārāyanairapi ।।

brahmaṇāmatsamīpe tu śiracchedaṃ mahābalam ।
bahumaṃtragaṇākīrṇaṃ tavādya prakaṭīkṛtam ।।

yathā na kasyacitkhyātaṃ yathā kena vinaśrutam ।
(p.236)
tathā rahasyasaṃyuktaṃ tṛtīyaṃ ṣaṭkamuttamam ।।

grathataśca sahasrāṇi ṣaṭca devi prakīrttitam ।
vācanātmokṣadaṃ jñeyaṃ dhāraṇāllakṣmivarddhanam ।।

tadā hyapaścime janma jñātarvya narasattamaiḥ ।
yadā karagataṃ tantraṃ śiracchedamanuttamam ।
ṣaṇmāsādvāraṇādasya svayaṃ jñānaṃ pravarttate ।। ।।

itthaṃ samagravibudhontamasāravaṃdyaṃ
taṃtraṃ tava prabhṛtisāramanantaguhyam ।
uktaṃ mayā vividhavīravilāsasāraṃ
turyaṃ kramāgatamataḥ parameva vacmi ।। ।।

।। iti bhairavasrotasi vidyāpīṭhe śiracchede jayadrathayāmale mahātaṃtre caturviṃśatisāhasre tṛtīyaṣaṭke
mahāmelāpasiddhipaṭalaḥ ।। ।।

।। samāptoyaṃ vāsiṣṭhastṛtīyaḥ paṭalaḥ ।। ।।

oṃ namassarvvasiddhayoginībhyo namaḥ ।। ।।

samvat 807 māghasudi ।। ।।



     

